<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<TEXT>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_april.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Pierrot who has been preparing the event for the students of RAN has turned into a Joker due to the stress from the constant night shift and overwork!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Letting this Joker go free will bring the ill spirit to schools and to entire Ran. Please bring back the gifts which the Joker had prepared for the students at the first place.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pierrot yang sedang membuat event untuk para pelajar tiba - tiba berubah menjadi Joker karena stress yang disebabkan lembur siang dan malam demi menyelesaikannya!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Membiarkan Joker ini bebas akan berdampak buruk bagi kampus karena dia akan membuat seluruh</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">Pierrot过渡忙于RAN学生的活动，结果竟然变身为Joker了。若不赶紧抓到Joker的话，校园秩序会大乱的。请将Joker一开始要给学生们准备的礼物带过来唷。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_april.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Where can I find this Joker?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Di mana saya bisa menemukan Joker tersebut?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我可以在哪儿找到Joker？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_april.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Where can I get the Admission Ticket to dungeon?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Di mana saya bisa mendapatkan Admission Ticket untuk masuk ke dungeon?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我可以在哪里拿到副本的入场卷呢？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_april.ntk_1_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Where can I get the gift?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Di mana saya bisa mendapatkan hadiahnya?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">取得礼盒的位置？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_april.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Joker is hiding alone in the hidden dungeon. That place is filled with various traps so it won't be easy to meet him. One more thing, you will need an Admission Ticket to enter the dungeon.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Joker bersembunyi senditi di dalam dungeon tersembunyi.Tempat tersebut dipenuhi dengan berbagai macam perangkap jadi tidak akan mudah untuk bertemu dengannya. Jangan lupa kamu membutuhkan Admission Ticket untuk masuk ke dungeon tersebut.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">Joker 正躲在封闭的副本里。那边有许多危险的陷阱，您要找到他是很不容易的。记得，要有入场卷，才能进去唷。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_april.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_april.ntk_2_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Where can I get the Admission Ticket?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Di mana saya bisa mendapatkan Admission Ticket?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">取得入场卷的方法？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_april.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Monsters of Ran has been affected by the Joker's ill spirit and they are dropping the Matryoshka Boxes!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">No one knows the structure of that box but you will be able to find the Admission Ticket hid by Joker so go open them as many as you can.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Monster di RAN sudah terinfeksi oleh penyakit yang dibawa oleh Joker and ketika dibunuh, mereka akan menjatuhkan  Matryoshka Boxes!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tidak ada yang tahu terbuat dari bahan apa box tersebut tapi kamu bisa menemukan Admission Ticket yang disembunyikan oleh</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">Ran的怪物都被 Joker的邪恶心灵给污染了。它们现在会掉落Matryoshka Boxes！</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">没有人知道开启礼盒之后，会拿到什么物品。但您一定可以找到被Joker给藏起来的入场卷。请努力获得更多礼盒，并开启它们吧。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_april.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_april.ntk_3_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Where can I get the gift?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Di mana saya bisa mendapatkan hadiahnya?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">取得礼物的方法？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_april.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">There should be a person inside the dungeon who has been chasing the joker. You will be able to receive the gift from that person AKA Joker Hunter. I can also help you exchange the item but I recommend you to meet Joker Hunter inside the dungeone because more material is needed when I create the present. Are you sure to exchange it to me?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Akan ada orang yang sedang mengejar Joker di dalam dungeon. Kamu bisa mendapatkan hadiah dari orang tersebut (Joker Hunter). Saya bisa membantumu menukarkan hadiahnya tetapi akan lebih baik jika kamu bisa menemuinya sendiri. Apakah kamu masih mau menukarn</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">追寻副本内怪物的脚步，就可找到Boss的踪迹。消灭怪物，就有机会获得礼盒唷。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_april.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_april.ntk_4_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Please exchange it.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tolong ditukar</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">请兑换。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_april.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">This is what you need to get the present here.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">--</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Pierrot Badge 100ea + Joker Badge 80ea</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">= Jester King's Hat</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Pierrot Badge 150ea + Joker Badge 100ea +</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Joker Card 100ea</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">= Joker Look Box (7D)</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Pierrot Badge 200ea + Joker Badge 150ea +</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Joker Card 150ea</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">= Joker Bike (7D)</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">--</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Hmm...You'll need less items if you go exchange it to Joker Hunter..but well, if you need then I'll help you. What present do you need?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ini yang kamu perlukan untuk menukar hadiah di sini.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">--</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pierrot Badge 100 buah + Joker Badge 80 buah</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">= Jester King's Hat</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pierrot Badge 150 buah + Joker Badge 100 buah +</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Joker Card 100 buah</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">= Joker Look Box (7D)</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pierrot Badge 200 buah + Joker</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">为了取得礼物，您需要准备以下内容：</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">--</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">Pierrot Badge 100ea + Joker Badge 80ea</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">= Jester King's Hat</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">Pierrot Badge 150ea + Joker Badge 100ea +</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">Joker Card 100ea</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">= Joker Look Box (7D)</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">Pierrot Badge 200ea + Joker Badge 150ea +</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">Joker Card 150ea</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">= Jo</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_april.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I want the Jester King's Hat!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pilih Jester King's Hat!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我要Jester King's Hat！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_april.ntk_5_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I want the Joker Look Box!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pilih Joker Look Box!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我要Joker Look Box！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_april.ntk_5_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I want the Joker Bike!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pilih Joker Bike!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我要Joker Bike！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_event_club.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I'm Super Robot who sells necessary item for CW.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya adalah Super Robot yang menjual spesial item untuk CW.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我是Super Robot，专门卖ClubWar重要的补给品。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_event_club.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Exchange candies.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tukar permen</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">兑换糖果</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_gs4th01.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Woof! Woof! Bark! Bark! Woof! Woof! Bark! Bark!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Woof! Woof! Bark! Bark! Woof! Woof! Bark! Bark!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Woof! Woof! Bark! Bark! Woof! Woof! Bark! Bark!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Woof! Woof! Bark! Bark! Woof! Woof! Bark! Bark!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">呜呜！呜呜！汪汪！汪汪！呜呜！呜呜！汪汪！汪汪！</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">呜呜！呜呜！汪汪！汪汪！呜呜！呜呜！汪汪！汪汪！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_gs4th01.ntk_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Woof! Woof! Bark! Bark!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Woof! Woof! Bark! Bark!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">呜呜！呜呜！汪汪！汪汪！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_gs4th01.ntk_1_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It seems we need to make him sleep to pass.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sepertinya kita memerlukan obat tidur untuknya agar bisa lewat.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我们好像应该要哄他入睡才能通过。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_gs4th01.ntk_1_1_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Feed sleeping pill.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Memberikan sleeping pill.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">喂吃安眠药</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_gs4th01.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Zzz...Zzz...Zzz....Zzz</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Zzz...Zzz...Zzz....Zzz</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">Zzz...Zzz...Zzz....Zzz</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_gs4th02.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Hahahaha. Welcome. I have some magical items~~</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Hahahaha. Saya mempunyai beberapa item antik dan ajaib~~</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">哈哈哈！欢迎！我有一些魔法物品哟。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_gs4th02.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Item Sale</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jual beli item</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">贩卖物品</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_gs4th03.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ran World celebrates the 4th anniversary. Please congratulate us.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ran World merayakan Ulang Tahun yang ke 4.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">Ran World正举办Ran的4周年庆典。请给我们一些掌声与祝贺吧。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_gs4th03.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Receive 4h Anniversary Gift Box</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menerima 4h Anniversary Gift Box</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">领取4周年礼盒</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_halloween01.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Don’t you want to meet a Prince Charming from fairy tales?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kamu tidak ingin bertemu dengan Pangeran Tampan dari negeri dongeng?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">不想和童话故事中的白马王子见面吗？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_halloween01.ntk_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Did you ever ride it before? It is really exciting!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Apakah kamu pernah naik sebelumnya? Ini benar-benar menarik!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">您有搭过吗？这真的很棒！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_halloween01.ntk_1_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">They love pretty girls~</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mereka menyukai wanita-wanita cantik~</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">他们只爱正妹~</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_halloween01.ntk_1_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Peekaboo~! Did you get startled? Hmm… you didn’t get startled.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Peekaboo~! Apakah kamu kaget? Hmm… kamu tidak kaget.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">哔哔哔~！吓到了吗？哦…您没有被吓到啊？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_halloween01.ntk_1_3_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Trick or treat!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Trick or treat!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">不给糖就捣蛋。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_halloween01.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I’ll give you a candy tomorrow too so please come~!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Aku akan memberikan kamu candy besok, jadi datang kembali~!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我还会再给您一颗Candy，请明天再过来一趟。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_halloween01.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask whether there is something else rather than candy</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tanyakan apakah ada sesuatu yang lain selain candy</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问除了Candy之外，还有其他东西吗?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_halloween02.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It might be real hero of Halloween day.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mungkin pahlawan sejati hari Halloween.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">或许他才是Halloween day真正的主角。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_halloween02.ntk_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It is vulnerable to fire.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ini mudah terbakar.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这个很容易着火。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_halloween02.ntk_1_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Their beds are very dark so no one can notice sunrise.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tempat tidur mereka sangat gelap sehingga tidak ada yang bisa melihat matahari terbit.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">他们的床非常地黑暗，即使是天亮，也不会有人知道。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_halloween02.ntk_1_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Peekaboo~! Surprise?! Umm.. you are not surprised?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Peekaboo ~! Surprise?! Umm .. Kamu tidak terkejut?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">哔哔哔~！吓到了吗？哦…您没有被吓到啊？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_halloween02.ntk_1_3_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Trick or treat!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Trick or treat!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">不给糖就捣蛋。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_halloween02.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I’ll give you a candy tomorrow too so please come~!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Aku akan memberikan kamu candy besok, jadi datang kembali~!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我还会再给您一颗Candy，请明天再过来一趟。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_halloween02.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask whether there is something else rather than candy</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tanyakan apakah ada sesuatu yang lain selain candy</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问除了Candy之外，还有其他东西吗?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_halloween03.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I can’t understand why that ugly one is so popular.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Aku tidak mengerti mengapa sesuatu yang jelek sangat populer.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我无法理解，为何那个丑八怪人缘那么好。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_halloween03.ntk_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">He is really busy when guest visits his house.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Dia benar-benar sibuk ketika tamu berkunjung ke rumahnya.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">每当家里有客人来时，他就会变得很忙。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_halloween03.ntk_1_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">They always compete with mosquito.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mereka selalu bersaing dengan nyamuk.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">他们总是和蚊子进行战斗。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_halloween03.ntk_1_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Peekaboo~! Did you get startled? Hmm… you didn’t get startled.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Peekaboo~! Apakah kamu kaget? Hmm… kamu tidak kaget.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">哔哔哔~！吓到了吗？哦…您没有被吓到啊？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_halloween03.ntk_1_3_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Trick or treat!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Trick or treat!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">不给糖就捣蛋。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_halloween03.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I’ll give you a candy tomorrow too so please come~!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Aku akan memberikan kamu candy besok, jadi datang kembali~!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我还会再给您一颗Candy，请明天再过来一趟。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_halloween03.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask whether there is something else rather than candy</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tanyakan apakah ada sesuatu yang lain selain candy</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问除了Candy之外，还有其他东西吗?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_halloween04.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Do you know what π means? According to what I heard, 3.14..something…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Apakah kamu tahu apa artinya π? Menurut apa yang saya dengar, 3.14 .. sesuatu ...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">您知道 π 是什么意思吗？据我所知，好像是 3，14….什么的….</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_halloween04.ntk_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It hurts my heart when I see he gets losing his hair.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sungguh menyakitkan hati ketika aku melihat dia akan kehilangan rambutnya.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">看到他们的人头落地，我的心情好难受。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_halloween04.ntk_1_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">They grew up in Romania.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mereka dibesarkan di Rumania.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">他们出生于Romania。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_halloween04.ntk_1_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Peekaboo~! Surprise?! Umm.. you are not surprised?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Peekaboo ~! Surprise?! Umm .. Kamu tidak terkejut?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">哔哔哔~！吓到了吗？哦…您没有被吓到啊？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_halloween04.ntk_1_3_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Trick or treat!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Trick or treat!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">不给糖就捣蛋。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_halloween04.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I’ll give you a candy tomorrow too so please come~!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Aku akan memberikan kamu candy besok, jadi datang kembali~!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我还会再给您一颗Candy，请明天再过来一趟。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_halloween04.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask whether there is something else rather than candy</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tanyakan apakah ada sesuatu yang lain selain candy</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问除了Candy之外，还有其他东西吗?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_halloween05.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">My head is especially itches today.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kepalaku sangat gatal hari ini.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">今天我的头特别痒。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_halloween05.ntk_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">He is really good at standing on his hands.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Dia benar-benar baik berdiri ditangannya.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">听说他很擅长倒立唷。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_halloween05.ntk_1_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">They can only be seen at night.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mereka hanya dapat dilihat pada malam hari.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">只有在深夜时，才能看见他们的存在。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_halloween05.ntk_1_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Peekaboo~! Did you get startled? Hmm… you didn’t get startled.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Peekaboo~! Apakah kamu kaget? Hmm… kamu tidak kaget.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">哔哔哔~！吓到了吗？哦…您没有被吓到啊？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_halloween05.ntk_1_3_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Trick or treat!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Trick or treat!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">不给糖就捣蛋。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_halloween05.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I’ll give you a candy tomorrow too so please come~!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya akan memberikan kamu candy besok, jadi datang kembali~!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我还会再给您一颗Candy，请明天再过来一趟。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_halloween05.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask whether there is something else rather than candy</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tanyakan apakah ada sesuatu yang lain selain candy</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问除了Candy之外，还有其他东西吗?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_halloween06.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">This is a Pumpkin box which looks just like my head! This precious box is resented only once a day!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ini adalah Pumpkin Box yang terlihat seperti kepala saya! Box ini berharga diberikan hanya sekali sehari!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这是Pumpkin box，长得就像我的头！由于非常珍贵，所以一天只能领取一次唷。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_halloween06.ntk_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">This is a Pumpkin box which looks just like my head! This precious box is resented only once a day!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ini adalah Pumpkin Box yang terlihat seperti kepala saya! Box ini berharga diberikan hanya sekali sehari!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这是Pumpkin box，长得就像我的头！由于非常珍贵，所以一天只能领取一次唷。</VALUE>
