  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_halloween08.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Uh-oh, I can’t believe you use shallow tricks!, Carry out your penalty and then come back. Meet Werewolf is your penalty. I think you don’t need explanation where it is?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Uh-oh, aku tidak percaya kamu menggunakan trik dangkal!, Laksanakan hukuman kamu dan kemudian kembali lagi.Temui Werewolf adalah hukuman kamu. Aku pikir kamu tidak perlu penjelasan dimana itu?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">噢！不敢相信您竟用了鸡鸣狗盗的招数！先接受惩罚，再来重新挑战吧！惩罚的内容是- “拜访Werewolf”。我想不用我的提示，您应该知道他在那里吧？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_halloween08.ntk_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Wow~ You came back without eaten by Werewolf! Then take your test again.</VALUE>
