    <VALUE Lang="id">5 candies + 1 Silver Lollipop = Test Paper II</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">5 颗糖果 1 个大银色棒棒糖 兑换 谜题试卷 II.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_halloween08.ntk_9_0_6">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Exchange 5 candies and 1 big gold lollipop to Test Paper III.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">5 candies + 1 Gold Lollipop = Test Paper III</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">5 颗糖果 1 个大金色棒棒糖 兑换 谜题试卷 III</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_halloween09.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Hi~ Do you like candy? If you don't, would you give candy to me?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">2 Halloween candies = Pet skin card [Jack-o’-Lantern] (15days)</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">1 Big Halloween silver lollipop = 1 Pumpkin box</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">1 Big Halloween gold lollipop = Death bike (30days)</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Hi ~ Apakah kamu suka permen? Jika tidak, kamu akan memberikan permen kepadaku? 2 Halloween candies = Pet skin card [Jack-o’-Lantern] (15days) 1 Big Halloween silver lollipop = 1 Pumpkin box 1 Big Halloween gold lollipop = Death bike (30days) Saya akan me</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">哈喽！您喜欢吃糖吗？不喜欢的话，可以把它给我吗？</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">2颗Halloween 糖果 = Pet skin card [Jack-o’-Lantern] (15D)</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">1个大的Halloween银色棒棒糖 = 1 南瓜礼盒</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">1个大的 Halloween金色棒棒糖 = Death bike (30D)</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_halloween09.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Exchange 2 candies to Pet skin card.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menukarkan 2 candy dengan Pet skin card.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">2颗糖果 兑换 Pet skin card</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_halloween09.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Exchange Big silver lollipop to Pumpkin box.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menukarkan Big silver lollipop dengan Pumpkin box</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">Big silver lollipop 兑换 Pumpkin box</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_halloween09.ntk_1_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Exchange Big gold lollipop to Death bike(30days)</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menukarkan Big gold lollipop dengan Death bike(30days)</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">Big gold lollipop 兑换 Death bike(30D)</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_halloween09.ntk_1_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Exchange candies.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menukarkan candy.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">交换糖果</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_joker_trade.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You did well getting here. It was really hard to find me huh?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Now, let me show you the magic crafting an special item with the badges and cards~!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pekerjaan bagus bisa sampai di sini. Sangat mudah kan?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Akan kuperlihatkan cara membuat item menggunakan badges dan kartu~!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">看你费尽千辛万苦终于来到这里。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">现在总算知道要找到我是多么不容易的吧！</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">现在就让你瞧瞧利用勋章跟卡片变成其它道具的魔法！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_joker_trade.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">What ingredients do you need to make the special item?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Apa yang diperlukan untuk membuat item tersebut?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">兑换特别物品需要什么样的材料呢？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_joker_trade.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I get the ingredients, just make me the item!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sudah kudapatkan, tolong buatkan saya segera!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我拿到材料了！给我特别物品吧！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_joker_trade.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Pierrot Badge 50ea + Joker Badge 40ea</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">= Jester King's Hat</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Pierrot Badge 75ea + Joker Badge 50ea +</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Joker Card 50ea</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">= Joker Look Box (7D)</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Pierrot Badge 100ea + Joker Badge 75ea +</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Joker Card 75ea</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">= Joker Bike (7D)</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pierrot Badge 50ea + Joker Badge 40ea</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">= Jester King's Hat</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pierrot Badge 75ea + Joker Badge 50ea +</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Joker Card 50ea</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">= Joker Look Box (7D)</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pierrot Badge 100ea + Joker Badge 75ea +</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Joker Card 75ea</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">= Joker Bike (7D)</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">Pierrot Badge 50个 + Joker Badge 40个</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">= Jester King's Hat</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">Pierrot Badge 75个 + Joker Badge 50个 +</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">Joker Card 50个</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">= Joker Look Box (7D)</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">Pierrot Badge 100个 + Joker Badge 75个 +</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">Joker Card 7个</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">= Joker Bike (7D)</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_joker_trade.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Okay! Now, make me the item!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Okay! Mari membuatnya!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">好！现在给我物品吧！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_joker_trade.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Which item do you want me to make you?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Item apa yang kamu inginkan?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">您想要那种道具呢？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_joker_trade.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I want the Jester King's Hat!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jester King's Hat!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我要Jester King的帽子。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_joker_trade.ntk_3_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I want the Joker Look Box!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Joker Look Box!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我想要Joker Look Box！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_joker_trade.ntk_3_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I want the Joker Bike!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Joker Bike!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我想要Joker Bike！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_newyear.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Wow, you have defeated Medusa! Go and collect the trophies.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I will compound them for you!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">________________________________________________________</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">[Recipes]</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Hair of Medusa (30ea) + Snake Scale (30ea)</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">+ Piece of Snake Stone (30ea) + Vitality of Medusa (10ea)</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">+ 100,000 Gold = Medusa Trophy A</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">/</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Hair of Medusa (30ea) + Snake Scale (30ea)</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">+ Piece of Snake Stone (30ea) + Vitality of Medusa (10ea)</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">+ Goggle of Protection (7D)(1ea) = Medusa Trophy B</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">________________________________________________________</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Compound may fail but the Goggle of Protection lowers the fail percentage.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Wow, kamu berhasil mengalahkan Medusa! Pergi dan kumpulkanlah Trophy. Saya akan membantu kamu dalam proses pencampurannya!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Resep</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Hair of Medusa (30) + Snake Scale (30) + Piece of Snake Stone (30) + Vitality of Medusa (10) + 100,000 Gold = Medusa Tr</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">哇！您打败了 Medusa了！ 去收集奖杯吧！</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我会帮您合成的。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">________________________________________________________</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">[选单]</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">Hair of Medusa (30ea) + Snake Scale (30ea)</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">+ Piece of Snake Stone (30ea) + Vitality of Medusa (10ea)</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">+ 100,000 Gold = Medusa Trophy A\r\</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_newyear.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Compound the Trophies.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Proses Trophy</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">合成奖杯</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_newyear.ntk_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Do you know that the year 2013 is the year of the Snake?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Due to the forces of snake has gotten too strong, Medusa has appeared in the world of Ran and corrupting it. We need you students to save the world of Ran.I won't be a much help since I am not a fighting type but I can always give you advice.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Apakah kamu tahu bahwa tahun 2013 adalah tahun ular ? Karena hal inilah, para ular menjadi semakin kuat. Medusa telah terlihat dan memiliki rencana untuk menganggu keamanan kita semua. Kami membutuhkan kamu untuk tetap menjaga dunia RAN tetap aman.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">S</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">您知道2013年是蛇年吗？</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">现在校园充斥着Medusa蛇妖的气息，牠不停地在Ran世界里制造破坏。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我们需要各位同学帮忙，一起消灭Medusa，拯救校园。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我是一个伤兵，没办法跟你一起去。有什么其它问题再来问我吧！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_newyear.ntk_1_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">How can I summon Medusa?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bagaimana caranya summon Medusa?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我该如何召唤Medusa呢？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_newyear.ntk_1_1_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Please advice me how to defeat Medusa.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tolong berikan saya saran untuk mengalahkan Medusa</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">请提示我该如何消灭 Medusa。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_newyear.ntk_1_1_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I have defeated Medusa!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya telah mengalahkan Medusa!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我已经消灭了Medusa！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_newyear.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You need get flute first to summon Medusa. You will be able to get it easily, just wander around in the world of Ran.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">But, according to the level of students, different flutes are required and different Medusas will be summoned from different flutes.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Each Medusa will give different reward.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kamu perlu memiliki Seruling dulu untuk memanggil Medusa. Kamu bisa mendapatkannya dengan mudah, Cukup dengan memburu para monster yang ada di RAN.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Namun tergantung pada level pemain, Setiap seruling dapat memanggil Medusa yang berbeda beda.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Setiap med</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">想要找到 Medusa必须使用Flute！</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">学校的怪物身上有机会可找到这些笛子Flute！</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">记得使用不同的笛子可以召唤不同的Medusa奖励也会有差异</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_newyear.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Oh, I see! Can you give me some advice, how to defeat Medusa?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ah! Dapatkah kamu memberikan saya masukkan? Bagaimana cara mengalahkan Medusa?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">噢！我了解！</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">您能提示我关于如何能打败Medusa吗？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_newyear.ntk_2_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I have defeated Medusa. Can I get the reward?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya telah mengalahkan Medusa! Dapatkah kamu memberikan hadiahnya?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我已经消灭了Medusa！我可以拿奖励了吗？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_newyear.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Medusa is powerful and she will turn all the onlookers of her eyes into stones so please be extra careful. If you have a Goggle of Protection then you will be able to defeat her much easier. Plus, such goggle will be useful when you get the reward.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Medusa adalah ular yang sangat kuat. Dia akan merubah siapapun yang menatapnya menjadi batu. Jadi berhati hatilah. Jika kamu memiliki Google of Protection, kamu bisa mengalahkannya dengan lebih mudah. Google of Protection juga memberikanmu kemungkinan men</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">Medusa拥有石化的技能效果大家要小心</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">如果使用抗石化头盔就可以有防护效果</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">合成时还可有其他效果</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_newyear.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Please tell me how to summon Medusa once more.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Beritahukan saya 1 kali lagi. Bagaimana cara memanggil Medusa?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">请再告诉我一次召唤Medusa的方法。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_newyear.ntk_3_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I have defeated Medusa. Can I get the reward?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya telah mengalahkan Medusa! Dapatkah kamu memberikan hadiahnya?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我已经消灭了Medusa！我可以拿奖励了吗？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_newyear.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Wow, you have defeated Medusa! Go and collect the trophies.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I will compound them for you!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">________________________________________________________</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">[Recipes]</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Hair of Medusa (30ea) + Snake Scale (30ea)</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">+ Piece of Snake Stone (30ea) + Vitality of Medusa (10ea)</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">+ 100,000 Gold = Medusa Trophy A</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">/</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Hair of Medusa (30ea) + Snake Scale (30ea)</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">+ Piece of Snake Stone (30ea) + Vitality of Medusa (10ea)</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">+ Goggle of Protection (7D)(1ea) = Medusa Trophy B</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">________________________________________________________</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Compound may fail but the Goggle of Protection lowers the fail percentage.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Wow, Kamu mengalahkan Medusa! Pergi dan kumpulkanlah Trophy. Saya akan membantumu mencampurkannya!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Resep</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Material 1 (30) + Material 2 (30) + Material 3 (30) + Material 4 (10) + 100,000 Gold = Reward 1</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Material 1 (30) + Material 2 (30) + Material</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">哇！您已经歼灭了Medusa！</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">快快收集奖杯吧！成后把战利品带来使用合成可以获得奖励!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">合成有失败的机率!Hair of Medusa (30ea) + Snake Scale (30个) + Piece of Snake Stone (30个) + Vitality of Medusa (10个)+ 100,000 Gold = Medusa Trophy A</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">/</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">Hair of Medusa (30ea) + Snake Scale (30ea)</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">+ Piece of Snake St</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_newyear.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Compound the Trophies.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Proses Trophy</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">合成奖杯</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_summer.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Event map for level 30~130 is opened.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Purchase bus card to move to the event map.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">*</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">[Start Time Of Event Lv. 30~130]</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">[1:00], [5:00], [9:00], [13:00], [17:00], [21:00]</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Event map untuk level 30~130 sudah dibuka.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Gunakan bus card untuk menuju ke map event.</VALUE>
