  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_summer.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Move to event map</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pindah ke event map</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">移动至活动地图</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_summer.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Trade Items</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jual beli item</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">交易物品</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_summer_help.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Some elements has stimulated in Saint Power Plant No.2. There are so many mobs but they are week and easy to kill. Please kill them fast! The more you kill the better reward you can receive~ You can enter event map from Elemental Shaman NPC which located in each campus</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">*</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">--- Open Time ---</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">[Lv30~130]</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">1:00, 5:00, 9:00, 13:00, 17:00, 21:00</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">[Lv131~195]</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">1:40, 5:45, 9:45, 13:45, 17:45, 21:45</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">[Lv196 or higher]</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">2:30, 6:30, 10:30, 14:30, 18:30, 22:30</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Beberapa macam element muncul di Saint Power Plant No.2. Mereka muncul dalam jumlah sangat banyak tetapi sangat lemah dan mudah dibunuh. Makin banyak jumlah yang kamu bunuh, makin besar hadiah yang bisa kamu dapatkan~ Kamu dapat memasuki event map dari El</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">有些元素激发了Saint Power Plant No.2.。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">有许多怪物，但他们不是很强。请快消灭他们！</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">歼灭越多，可拿到越好的奖励。 您可透过位在各个学院的Elemental Shaman NPC来进入活动地图。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">*</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">---开放时间---</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">[LV30〜130]</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">1:00，5:00，9:00，13:00，17:00，21:00</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">[Lv131〜195]</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">1:40，5:45，9:45，13:45，17:45，21:45</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">[Lv196以上] \</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_summer_help.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">How to go to Saint Power Plant No.2?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">How to go to Saint Power Plant No.2?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">该如何去 Saint Power Plant No.2？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_summer_help.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">How can I get the reward?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">How can I get the reward?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">奖励如何哪？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
