  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_valentine_boy.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Oh… you have brought me the Cupid Chocolate! Here, let's exchange it with the box which I made for my girlfriend!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Oh.. Kamu membawakanku Cupid Chocolate! Ayo kita bertukar dengan Box yang saya buat untuk kekasih saya!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">噢…您呈上的Cupid Chocolate我已经收到了！来！让我们一起去兑换盒子吧。这盒子是我做给女友的礼物唷。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_valentine_boy.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Exchange</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tukar</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">兑换奖励</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_valentine_boy.ntk_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I have fled to school with my girlfriend to avoid the powerful force of Medusa but on the way we have lost each other. I need to give this present to my girlfriend since it is the Valentine's Day, would you please help me?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya telah melarikan diri bersama pacar saya untuk menghindari kekuatan Medusa.. Namun di tengah pelarian, kami terpisah. Saya ingin memberikan hadiah ini untuk kekasih saya berhubung ini adalah hari Valentine. Maukah kamu membantu?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">为了远离Medusa的强悍势力，我和女友一起逃出学校了。但逃亡的路上，我们被拆散了！今天是情人节，我想要把礼物交给女友。 您愿意帮我吗?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_valentine_boy.ntk_1_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Okay… How can I help?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">OK.. Bagaimana cara saya membantu?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">好啊，我该怎么帮？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_valentine_boy.ntk_1_1_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Sorry… I am a bit busy at the moment.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sorry.. Saya sedang sibuk.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">抱歉….. 我现在的状况也不太好。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_valentine_boy.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">There is a Cupid at MP campus and I heard that the Cupid Chocolate has very powerful effect.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I would like to give it to my girlfriend as a Valentine's day present… would you please get it for me?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Collect 50 Valentine Chocolates which you will be able to get easily in the world of Ran and bring them to Cupid to exchange it for 1 Cupid Chocolate!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ada seorang Cupid di MP School dan saya dengar dia memiliki Cupid Chocolate yang memiliki efek yang kuat.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya ingin memberikannya kepada kekasih saya di hari spesial ini.. Maukah kamu membantuku mendapatkannya?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kumpulkan 50 Valentine Chocolate dar</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">Cupid现正住在MP学院里。我听说丘比特的巧克力具有非常大的神奇力量。所以我想要送Cupid Chocolate给我女朋友，作为情人节的礼物。您可以帮我拿到这份礼物吗？</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">您可以在RanWorld里面轻易地收集到 50颗 Valentine Chocolate。之后，只要把它交给Cupid，就可以交换拿到1颗 Cupid Chocolate唷！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_valentine_boy.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Okay.. Let’s do that.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ok.. Mari kita lakukan!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">好的！让我试试看。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_valentine_boy.ntk_2_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Umm.. I am busy right now but I will get'em when I have time.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Umm.. Saya sedang sibuk sekarang.. Namun saya akan coba untuk membantumu.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">嗯….抱歉，我现在刚好在忙。请您下次再来，我有空一定会帮您的。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_valentine_boy.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You are heartless!.. Gee.. What should I get her…?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kamu tidak memiliki perasaan! Hmm</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">您真无情….. 唉，我该怎么对她呢？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_valentine_boy.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Thank you! I am counting on you!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Terima kasih ! Saya berhutang padamu..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">谢谢您！我就指望您一位了！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_valentine_cupid.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Wow, you have brought the Chocolate I told you about~</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Wow, kamu membawa cokelat yang saya maksud~</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">哇！您带来了！是我跟您提过的巧克力呢！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_valentine_cupid.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Exchange</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tukar</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">兑换</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_valentine_cupid.ntk_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Hello! I am Cupid.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I have specially summoned myself here to make couples in Valentine's Day!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Hello! Saya adalah Cupid.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya sengaja datang ke sini untuk membuat pasangan di hari Valentine ini!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">嗨！我是丘比特！我的特别现身，是为了帮助大家找到如意情人，好过个愉快的情人节。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_valentine_cupid.ntk_1_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Please get me a girlfriend!!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tolong carikan saya pacar!!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我需要女朋友！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_valentine_cupid.ntk_1_1_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I heard there is a couple who needs your help!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya mendengar ada beberapa pasangan yang memerlukan bantuanmu!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我听说这边有对情侣需要您的帮忙。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_valentine_cupid.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I don't just make a partner for anyone! Besides, I am very busy because of the Zombie couple who have fled to school!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya tidak hanya membuat pacar untuk semua orang! Selain itu, saya sangat sibuk dikarenakan oleh pasangan zombie yang menguasai kampus!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我不会随便帮大家乱凑对的。还有，我现在很忙，因为僵尸情侣给我乱跳，竟然跳到学校里面去了！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_valentine_cupid.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ah ha! You mean the Zombie couple, right? HaHaHa! I have expected and prepared something! Go and collect Valentine Chocolates! You will be able to get them easily in the Ran. Um.. 50 would be enough!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ah ha! Maksudmu Pasangan Zombie itu bukan? HaHaHa! Saya sudah menduganya! Pergi dan kumulkan Valentine Chocolate! Sangat mudah mendapatkannya dari para monster. Um.. 50 sudah cukup!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">噢！哈！僵尸情侣吗？我懂了。哈哈哈！我其实很期待，也早已经准备好了某些东西唷！快去收集情人节巧克力吧！对您来说这可是轻而易举的事情。嗯… 50个巧克力应该就够了唷。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_valentine_girl.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Great.. You have brought me the Cupid Chocolate! Here, please exchange it with the box which I made for my boyfriend!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Oh.. Kamu membawakanku Cupid Chocolate! Ayo kita bertukar dengan Box yang saya buat untuk kekasih saya!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">看来你已经找到Cupid的巧克力了!可以兑换情侣套装礼盒喔!</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_valentine_girl.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Exchange</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tukar</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">进行兑换</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_valentine_girl.ntk_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I have fled to school with my boyfriend to avoid the powerful force of Medusa but on the way we have lost each other. I need to give this present to my boyfriend since it is the Valentine's Day, would you please help me?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya telah melarikan diri bersama pacar saya untuk menghindari kekuatan Medusa.. Namun di tengah pelarian, kami terpisah. Saya ingin memberikan hadiah ini untuk kekasih saya berhubung ini adalah hari Valentine. Maukah kamu membantu?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">因为Medusa这两个恋人被拆散了。今天是情人节想要送礼给她的另一伴，可以请你帮忙吗?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_valentine_girl.ntk_1_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Okay… How can I help?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">OK.. Bagaimana cara saya membantu?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">嘿！需要帮忙吗？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_valentine_girl.ntk_1_1_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Sorry… I am a bit busy at the moment.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sorry.. Saya sedang sibuk.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">抱歉，我现在有点小忙。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_valentine_girl.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">There is a Cupid at MP campus and I heard that the Cupid Chocolate has very powerful effect.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I would like to give it to my boyfriend as a Valentine's day present… would you please get it for me?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Collect 50 Valentine Chocolates which you will be able to get easily in the world of Ran and bring them to Cupid to exchange it for 1 Cupid Chocolate!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ada seorang Cupid di MP School dan saya dengar dia memiliki Cupid Chocolate yang memiliki efek yang kuat.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya ingin memberikannya kepada kekasih saya di hari spesial ini.. Maukah kamu membantuku mendapatkannya?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kumpulkan 50 Valentine Chocolate dar</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">听说MPcampus有Cupid出现。邱比特巧克力有某种神奇功效，我想把邱比特巧克力送给我的另一伴。可以帮我找到它吗？搜集到50个巧克力就可以兑换1个邱比特巧克力!</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_valentine_girl.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Okay.. Let’s do that.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ok.. Mari kita lakukan!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">好的！来试试吧！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_valentine_girl.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You are heartless!.. Gee.. What should I get him…?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kamu tidak memiliki perasaan! Hmm &gt;_&lt;</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">看你好像不太想要帮我......</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_valentine_girl.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Thank you! I am counting on you!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Terima kasih ! Saya berhutang padamu..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">谢谢！我就靠您了！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2014_august_event.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">My plan is to make a Snowman that cannot melt during Summer Season!! Everybody call me Crazy but in order to show it to them, I need "Eternal Snow Crystal". Can you please find it for me? Do not worry, I'll trade it with another item just for you ^__^</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">50 Eternal Snow Crystal = Adoniechus Bracelet C (5H)</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">100 Eternal Snow Crystal = Snowman (3H)</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">200 Eternal Snow Crystal = EXP Rudolf Costume Set (3H) Box</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">250 Eternal Snow Crystal = Snowman Hat Random Box</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">300 Eternal Snow Crystal = Oblivion Potion E (7D)</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我的计划是制作一个在夏天无法融化的雪人！大家都说我疯了才会有这个念头，为了证明我是对的，我需要先拿到"Eternal Snow Crystal"。您能帮我找到吧？放心~我不会空手向您讨的！我会拿好货来跟您交易的 ^__^</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">50个Eternal Snow Crystal = Adoniechus Bracelet C (5H)</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">100个Eternal Snow Crystal = Snowman (3H)</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">200个Eternal Snow Crystal = EXP Rudolf</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Rencana saya adalah membuat boneka salju yang tidak dapat meleleh selama musim panas! Semua orang memanggil saya Gila tapi saya akan membuktikan kepada mereka. Saya membutuhkan "Eternal Snow Crystal". Bisakah kamu membantu saya mengumpulkannya? Jangan khawatir, akan ada hadiah sebagai balasannya ^__^</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">50 Eternal Snow Crystal = Adoniechus Bracelet C (5H)</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">100 Eternal Snow Crystal = Snowman (3H)</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">200 Eternal Snow Crystal = EXP Rudolf Costume Set (3H) Box</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">250 Eternal Snow Crystal = Snowman Hat Random Box</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">300 Eternal Snow Crystal = Oblivion Potion E (7D)</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2014_august_event.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Change 50 Eternal Snow Crystal to Adoniechus Bracelet C (5H)</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">将 50 Eternal Snow Crystal 兑换成 Adoniechus Bracelet C (5H)</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tukar 50 Eternal Snow Crystal dengan Adoniechus Bracelet C (5H)</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2014_august_event.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Change 100 Eternal Snow Crystal to Snowman (3H)</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">将 100 Eternal Snow Crystal 兑换成 Snowman (3H)</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tukar 100 Eternal Snow Crystal dengan Snowman (3H)</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2014_august_event.ntk_1_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Change 200 Eternal Snow Crystal to EXP Rudolf Costume Set (3H) Box</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">将 200 Eternal Snow Crystal 兑换成 EXP Rudolf Costume Set (3H) Box</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tukar 200 Eternal Snow Crystal dengan EXP Rudolf Costume Set (3H) Box</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2014_august_event.ntk_1_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Change 250 Eternal Snow Crystal to Snowman Hat Random Box</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">将 250 Eternal Snow Crystal 兑换成 Snowman Hat Random Box</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tukar 250 Eternal Snow Crystal dengan Snowman Hat Random Box</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2014_august_event.ntk_1_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Change 300 Eternal Snow Crystal to Oblivion Potion E (7D)</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">将 300 Eternal Snow Crystal 兑换成 Oblivion Potion E (7D)</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tukar 300 Eternal Snow Crystal dengan Oblivion Potion E (7D)</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2014_ballan01.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I heard that someone took my chocolate away!!! I should make another one and give it for him tomorrow again…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Seseorang telah mengambil cokelat buatan saya!!! Saya harus segera membuat yang baru untuk diberikan kepadanya besok…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我听说有人偷走了我的巧克力！看来我得赶紧制作新的巧克力，否则明天就无法送到他的手上了……</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2014_ballan01.ntk_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I gave chocolate to a man I love. Hope that he accepts my confession~~~!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya memberikan cokelat kepada lelaki yang saya cintai. Semoga dia menerima lamaran saya~~~!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我把我的巧克力给了我爱慕的男生了。希望他会接受我的爱！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2014_ballan01.ntk_1_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask who the man is.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tanya siapa lelaki beruntung tersebut.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">问问谁是那位幸运男孩？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2014_ballan01.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">He is just amazing~♡ You will find him at a glance!^^</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Dia sangatlah tampan~♡ Kamu akan segera menemukannya!^^</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">他在我眼里是最帅的~♡某天您会遇到他的。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2014_ballan02.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I lost my chocolate! Someone took my chocolate from me!!! …Ah, stupid.. It's my fault...What can I do now?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Aku kehilangan coklatku! Seseorang mengambil coklatku!!! Ah bodoh.. Ini kesalahanku… Apa yang dapat aku lakukan sekarang?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我的巧克力不见了。有人偷走它了！噢！都是我的错！我这个笨蛋！！现在我该怎么办呢？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2014_ballan02.ntk_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">She said that she likes being with me! I feel like flying in the Sky!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Dia mengatakan bahwa dia suka berada bersamaku! Aku merasa seperti terbang di langit!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">她说她很喜欢和我在一起！我感觉好像快飞起来了。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2014_ballan02.ntk_1_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask who the man is.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mencuri coklat dari dia.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问那位男人是谁？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2014_ballan02.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Huh? Didn't you call my name?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Huh? Kamu tidak memanggil namaku?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">嗯？您没有叫我的名字吗？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2014_ballan03.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Dark damp atmosphere is around you.. Why don't we change this world for singles together with me?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Take chocolate from the Boy in Love and bring it to me. I will give a present for you as a reward.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">5 Sweet Love Chocolate Boxes = Low Valentine's Day Box</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">15 Sweet Love Chocolate Boxes = Fine Valentine's Day Box</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">25 Sweet Love Chocolate Boxes = Luxury Valentine's Day Box</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Suasana lembab gelap di sekitar kamu .. Mengapa kita tidak mengubah dunia jomblo ini untuk bersama-sama denganku?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ambil cokelat dari Boy in Love dan membawanya kepadaku.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Aku akan memberikan sesuatu untukmu sebagai hadiah.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">5 Sweet Love Chocolate Box</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">阴暗潮湿的大气包围着您.... 我们何不改变这个单身生涯的世界呢？ 您只要从Boy in Love身上取得巧克力，并交给我，就可以得到奖励唷。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">5个Sweet Love Chocolate Boxes = 初级 Valentine's Day Box</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">15个Sweet Love Chocolate Boxes = 中级 Valentine's Day Box</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">25个Sweet Love Chocolate Boxes = 高级 Valentine's Day Box</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2014_ballan03.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Exchange 5 Sweet Love Chocolate Boxes to Low Valentine's Day Box.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">5 Sweet Love Chocolate Box =&gt; Low Valentine's Day Box</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">拿 5个Sweet Love Chocolate Boxes 兑换 Low Valentine's Day Box</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2014_ballan03.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Exchange 15 Sweet Love Chocolate Boxes to Fine Valentine's Day Box.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">15 Sweet Love Chocolate Box =&gt; Fine Valentine's Day Box</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">拿 15个 Sweet Love Chocolate Boxes兑换 Fine Valentine's Day Box.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2014_ballan03.ntk_1_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Exchange 25 Sweet Love Chocolate Boxes to Luxury Valentine's Day Box.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">25 Sweet Love Chocolate Box =&gt; Luxury Valentine's Day Box</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">拿 25个 Sweet Love Chocolate Boxes 兑换 Luxury Valentine's Day Box</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2014_ballan03.ntk_1_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Exchange the items.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menukarkan item.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">兑换物品</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2014_event_cleanup.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">What happened to the roads? Trashes and debris are all around! I can't stand anymore!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Hey, friend! Let's clean up and get items as a reward!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Garbage &amp; Debris (100P) = Low Recycling Box</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Garbage &amp; Debris (300P) = Fine Recycling Box</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Apa yang terjadi? Sampah di mana - mana! Saya sudah tidak tahan!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bisakah kamu bantu bersihkan? Akan kuberi hadiah sebagai imbalan!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Garbage &amp; Debris (100P) = Low Recycling Box</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Garbage &amp; Debris (300P) = Fine Recycling Box</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">奇怪? 校园怎么变的这么脏?我有洁癖最讨厌脏~!!!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">赶快帮忙清扫垃圾，把垃圾交给我就可以领取奖励。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">Garbage &amp; Debris 100个 = Low Recycling箱, Garbage &amp; Debris 300个 = Fine Recycling箱</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2014_event_cleanup.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Exchange Garbage &amp; Debris (100P) to Low Recycling Box.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tukar Garbage &amp; Debris (100P) dengan Low Recycling Box.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">请将Garbage &amp; Debris (100P) 拿去兑换Low Recycling Box。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2014_event_cleanup.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Exchange Garbage &amp; Debris (300P) to Fine Recycling Box.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tukar Garbage &amp; Debris (300P) dengan Fine Recycling Box.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">请将Garbage &amp; Debris (300P) 拿去兑换Fine Recycling Box。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2014_event_reformcard.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Hi~ Hi~ I bring some items from other countries.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">There is not many for now but if you need it, do not be shy to buy it.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Hi~ Hi~ Saya membawa sesuatu dari luar sana.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tidak banyak sih yang tersedia, tidak usah malu - malu untuk membelinya.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">嗨！嗨！我有些异国风味的物品道具。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">数量不是很多，但如果您需要，请尽管购买，不要害羞。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2014_event_reformcard.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Trade</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Trade</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">进行交易</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2014_extreme_event.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You are not prepared......</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kamu belum siap...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">您还没准备好要......</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2014_extreme_event.ntk_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I can't help anymore</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya tidak bisa membantumu lagi</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我只能帮到这儿了。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2014_extreme_event.ntk_1_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Now we are going through many change so I got something for you. Well... Are you Ready for New challenge?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saat ini kita melalui banyak perubahan. Emm... Siap untuk menerima tantangan baru?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我们经历了很多事情，现在我想给您一样东西。嗯，您准备好要接受新挑战了吗？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2014_extreme_event.ntk_1_2_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">We are up for that challenge</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kita siap untuk tantangan tersebut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我们要开始进行挑战了。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2014_extreme_event.ntk_1_2_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Quest Complete</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Quest Selesai</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">完成任务</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2014_extreme_event.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Please talk to me once again then you can get the present.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bicaralah sekali lagi dengan saya untuk mengambil hadiahmu.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">请再告诉我一次，您就能拿到礼物。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2014_extreme_event.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I hope this is of some help to you.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Semoga ini bermanfaat untukmu.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我希望这能帮助到您。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2014_gs5th.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Yeah~~ RAN GS has reached 5 years~!!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Come to Receive Reward from us every week ^__^</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">耶~~ RAN GS已经有5年的历史了！！</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">快来跟我们领取每周一次的奖励纪念品吧 ^__^</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Yeah~~ RAN GS mencapai 5 tahun~!!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Datang dan terima hadiah dari kami setiap minggu ^__^</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2014_gs5th.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Receive the 5th Anniversary Package</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">领取5周年纪念包</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Terima 5th Anniversary Package</VALUE>
