    <VALUE Lang="id">Tukar 5th Anniversary Certificate dengan Badge Box</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2014_gs5th.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Come again next week and I will give you another one~ ^__^</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下周再来吧！我会再给您的 ^__^</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Datang lagi minggu depan dan akan saya berikan lagi~ ^__^</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2014_halloween_01.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I am lacking energy…I need more sugar...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">How about I give you the invitation to Pumpkin Graveyard and you get me candies from the Pumpkin Witch?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">If you bring me a lot, I'll give you something good in return!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">18 Big Halloween Candies = Premium Halloween Attendance Box</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">10 Big Halloween Candies= Halloween Attendance Box</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">30 Special Halloween Candies = Grim Reaper's Wing Costume Box</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我的能量不够了…我需要更多的糖..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">如果我给您Pumpkin Graveyard的邀请函，那么您就会给我Pumpkin女巫的糖果对吧？！！！</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">您给我的糖果越多，我就会给您更好的奖励哟。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">18 Big Halloween Candies = Premium Halloween Attendance Box</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">10 Big Halloween Candies= Halloween Attendance Box</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">30 Special Halloween Candies = Gri</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya kekurangan energi… Saya butuh gula...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya akan berikan undangan ke Pumpkin Graveyard dan tolong bawakan saya permen dari Pumpkin Witch!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Makin banyak kamu bawakan akan saya berikan hadiah sebagai gantinya!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">18 Big Halloween Candies = Premium Halloween Attendance Box</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">10 Big Halloween Candies= Halloween Attendance Box</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">30 Special Halloween Candies = Grim Reaper's Wing Costume Box</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
