  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2014_worldcup01.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">World Cup is one of the huge parties across the world.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Let's cheer for together</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">World Cup adalah event yang disambut oleh seluruh dunia.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mari meriahkan!!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">World Cup世界上大型的活动之一。让我们一同庆祝吧！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2014_worldcup01.ntk_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The long-awaited day has come! Which country do you think that will win this Brazil World Cup?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Hari yang dinanti - nanti telah tiba! Negara mana yang menurut kamu akan memenangi Brazil World Cup?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">等待已久的好日子终于来临了！您认为哪个国家会赢得Brazil世界盃呢？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2014_worldcup01.ntk_1_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">My prophecy goes beyond the foul.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Perkiraan saya meleset.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我的预言超越了真理。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2014_worldcup02.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Are you good at guessing the winner?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Then give it a shot! If you pick up a winning team right, I will give you special presents after this World Cup ends.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Apakah kamu cukup mahir dalam tebak - tebakan?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Klo iya, mari dicoba! Kalau pilihanmu benar, Saya akan memberikan sesuatu setelah Piala Dunia ini berakhir.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">您通常猜优胜者都猜得很准吗？</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">来试试看吧！如果您选对了优胜组，在世界盃结束之后，我就会给您一个特别的礼物。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2014_worldcup02.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Sell item</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jual beli item</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">贩卖物品</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2014_worldcup02.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Receive Lottery Ticket</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menerima Tiket Lottery</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">领取 Lottery Ticket</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2014_worldcup02.ntk_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Which country will win this Brazil World Cup ?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Give a try! But, make sure that there's only one chance for you! Please choose it carefully.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Negara manakah yang akan memenangkan Piala Dunia di Brazil?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Coba saja! Tapi pilih hati - hati ya karena cuman bisa menebak sekali saja.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">哪个国家会获得巴西的World Cup奖盃呢？</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">试试手气！但，请记住您只有一次的机会。请谨慎决择。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2014_worldcup02.ntk_1_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Sell item</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jual beli item</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">贩卖物品</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2014_worldcup02.ntk_1_1_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Select winner country</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Memilih Negara Pemenang</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">选择优胜国家</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2014_worldcup02.ntk_1_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Some places are haunted by the Astray Soccer Ball. They will make messy around the World Cup season.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Please prevent festive atmosphere of World Cup not to be damaged by monsters!!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">[Event time]</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">1st half : 13:00 ~ 13:45</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">2nd half : 16:00 ~ 16:45</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Beberapa tempat sudah dikuasai oleh Astray Soccer Ball. Mereka akan membuat kerusuhan selama Piala Dunia berlangsung.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tolong jaga supaya Piala Dunia dapat berjalan lancar - lancar saja!!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">[Waktu Event]</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Babak 1 : 13:00 ~ 13:45</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Babak 2 : 16:00 ~ 16:45</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">某些地区被Astray Soccer Ball闹得鸡犬不宁，且它们正准备在World Cup 季里大闹一场。.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">请您去保护World Cup的欢乐节气，不要被怪物们破坏了！！！</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">[活动时间]</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">上半场 : 13:00 ~ 13:45</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下半场 : 16:00 ~ 16:45</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2014_worldcup02.ntk_1_2_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Sell item</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jual beli item</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">贩卖物品</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2014_worldcup02.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">There's only one Lottery Ticket for you. Please choose one carefully.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Setiap orang hanya mendapat 1 kali menebak. Pilih hati - hati ya.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">您只有一张Lottery Ticket。请谨慎作决定。机会只有一次。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
