  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="201410_event_magic.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I heard that our Shaman Class got renewal. To help all of you my junior, I will give item that can help you reset it so please distribute it carefully.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我听说气功部已经改版了。为了帮助像您一样的新手，我会给您一个道具，好让您进行重制。请小心分配哟。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya dengar kelas Shaman diperbaharui. Untuk menolong semua junior, saya akan memberikan item untuk mereset skill kamu. Hati - hati menggunakannya.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="201410_event_magic.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Help me please?!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">可以帮我吗？</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tolong bantu saya?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="201410_event_magic.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Receive Oblivion Potion E (Reward)</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">领取 Oblivion Potion E (奖励)</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menerima Oblivion Potion E (Reward)</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="201410_event_magic.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Speak to once again, i will help you.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">请再说一次，我会帮你的！</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Katakan sekali lagi dan aku akan menolongmu.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="201410_event_magic.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="201410_event_magic.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">please distribute it carefully.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">请小心分配。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Harap didistribusikan secara berhati - hati.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="201410_event_magic.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="201410_event_npc.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">In order to protect the Campus, I was sent here!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Want to help me protect it?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我来这里是为了保护校园。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">要加入我的行列吗？</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Dalam rangka melindungi kampus, saya dikirim ke sini!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mau bantu saya untuk melindunginya?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="201410_event_npc.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Trade Item.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">交易物品</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tukar Item.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="201410event_robot.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Super~ Super~ Let's Prepare Quickly, we have no time left again!!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">超棒~ 超棒~ 我们快快准备吧！没时间了！</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Super~ Super~ Mari bersiap, kita tidak mempunyai waktu lagi!!</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="201410event_robot.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Trade Item</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">交易物品</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tukar Item</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2015_cupid.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">This! love! has! taken its toll on me! She said good bye, too many times b4~~~</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Oh, hem, hem...were you listening?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Anyway, love is all about effort. Is there anything that can be earned without an effort?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You also make an effort to collect the love and bring it to me! Then I'll give you something in return.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">If you want to, you can exchange your heart pieces to a higher one! See you then!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">---------------------------------------------------------------------</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">*65 Yellow Heart Pieces = Yellow Random Box</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">*65 Blue Heart Pieces = Blue Random Box</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">*65 Red Heart Pieces = Red Random Box</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">---------------------------------------------------------------------</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">*10 Yellow Heart Pieces = 1 Blue Heart Piece</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">*10 Blue Heart Pieces = 1 Red Heart Piece</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">This! love! has! taken its toll on me! She said good bye, too many times b4~~~</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Oh, hem, hem…apakah kamu mendengarkan?\r\Pokoknya, Cinta adalah tentang usaha. Memangnya ada yang bisa didapatkan tanpa berusaha?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kamu juga harus berusaha untuk mengump</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这个！爱！让我付出了很大代价！她说了很多次再见 b4~~~</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">奥，哼哼，哼哼…你听见了吗？/r/n不管怎么说，爱是努力的结束. 有什么可以不用努力就能成功的吗？/r/n你也努力的去搜集爱.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2015_cupid.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Trade Item</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tukar Item</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">交易物品</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2015_cupid.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Exchange the heart pieces to random box.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tukarkan Heart Piece - Heart Piece menjadi sebuah Random Box</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">将 Heart pieces 换成 Random box.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2015_cupid.ntk_1_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Exchange the heart pieces to a higher grade piece.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tukarkan Heart Piece - Heart Piece menjadi sebuah Heart Piece dengan kelas yang lebih tinggi</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">将 Heart pieces 换成更高等级的 pieces.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2015_cupid.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Well? How'd it go? What? A piece of cake? Then show me your effort at any time!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lalu? Bagaimana? Apa? Terlalu mudah? Kalau begitu tunjukkan kerja kerasmu setiap saat!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">啊？什么？小事一桩？那么让我看看你所付出的努力！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2015_cupid.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Exchange 65 Yellow Heart Pieces to Yellow Random Box.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tukarkan 65 Yellow Heart Pieces menjadi Yellow Random Box</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">将65个 Yellow Heart Pieces 换成 1个 Yellow Random Box.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2015_cupid.ntk_2_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Exchange 65 Blue Heart Pieces to Blue Random Box.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tukarkan 65 Blue Heart Pieces menjadi Blue Random Box</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">将65个 Blue Heart Pieces 换成 1个 Blue Random Box.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2015_cupid.ntk_2_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Exchange 65 Red Heart Pieces to Red Random Box.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tukarkan 65 Red Heart Pieces menjadi Red Random Box</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">将65个 Red Heart Pieces 换成 1个 Red Random Box.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2015_cupid.ntk_2_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2015_cupid.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ah~you want to 'upgrade' it? Looks like you're aiming for a big fish.? Or is it just your greed? Hehe.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ah~ kamu ingin meng 'upgrade' nya? Sepertinya kamu mengincar ikan yang lebih besar? Atau kamu memang hanya serakah? Hehe</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">啊~ 你想要“提升”这个物品的等级吗？看起来你的目标是一条大鱼.？ 或者这只是你的贪心？ 呵呵.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2015_cupid.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Exchange 10 Yellow Heart Pieces to 1 Blue Heart Piece.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tukarkan 10 Yellow Heart Pieces menjadi 1 Blue Heart Piece</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">将一个 Yellow Heart Piece 换成 1个 Blue Heart Piece</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2015_cupid.ntk_3_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Exchange 10 Blue Heart Pieces to 1 Red Heart Piece.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tukarkan 10 Blue Heart Pieces menjadi 1 Red Heart Piece</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">将一个 Blue Heart Piece 换成 1个 Red Heart Piece</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2015_cupid.ntk_3_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2015_event_minigame01.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Hello~</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">My job is to trade your Plain Sphere with some items.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Hello~</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tugas saya adalah menukarkan Plain Sphere milikmu dengan item-item.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">你好~ 你想要交换Plain Sphere吗？~</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2015_event_minigame01.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Shop</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Toko</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">出售道具</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2015_event_minigame02.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ho Ho Ho Ho, Welcome~~</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Bring your Lucky, Copper, Silver and Gold Sphere to me, to trade it with some items.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ho Ho Ho Ho, Selamat Datang~~</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bawa Lucky, Copper, Silver dan Gold Sphere kamu kepada saya dan tukarkan dengan item-item.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">哈哈哈哈，欢迎光临~ 要使用Lucky Sphere(Copper , Sliver, Gold Sphere)交换好运道具吗？ 哈哈哈哈</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2015_event_minigame02.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Shop</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Toko</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">出售道具</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2015_family1.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="id">Apakah kamu melihat putri saya..? Dia telah pergi dengan membawa uang tetapi dia tidak kembali meski berjam-jam telah berlalu…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Have you seen my daughter?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">She went out with the allowance but I don't see her coming back for hours…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">你看见我女儿了吗?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">她出去很久了可是到现在还没见她回来…</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2015_family1.ntk_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="id">Apakah kamu melihat putri saya..? Dia telah pergi dengan membawa uang tetapi dia tidak kembali meski berjam-jam telah berlalu…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Have you seen my daughter?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">She went out with the allowance but I don't see her coming back for hours…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">你看见我女儿了吗?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">她出去很久了可是到现在还没见她回来…</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2015_family1.ntk_1_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="id">Berikan Carnation</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Give the Carnation.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">交给 Carnation.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2015_family1.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya tidak menyangka putri saya dapat memikirkan ide ini!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya sangat senang!!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Terimakasih untuk karangan bunganya. Ini untukmu!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">-----------------------------------------------------</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">5 Carnations = "Dad's Random Box"</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I never imagined my daughter could come up with such idea!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I am more than happy!!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Thank you for the carnation. This is for you!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">-----------------------------------------------------</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">5 Carnations = "Dad's Random Box"</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我从来没想到我的女儿会想到这些!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我感到非常高兴!!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">谢谢你的 carnation. 这些是我的一些新意!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">-----------------------------------------------------</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">5 Carnations = "Dad's Random Box"</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2015_family1.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="id">Terima Dad's Random Box</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Receive Dad's Random Box</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">收到 Dad's Random Box</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2015_family2.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="id">Apakah kamu melihat putri saya..? Sudah hampir waktunya makan malam, tetapi dia pergi entah kemana..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Have you seen my daughter..?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It's almost time for dinner, but where did she go…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">你看见我女儿了吗..?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">差不多到晚饭时间了, 但是不知道她去哪里了…</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2015_family2.ntk_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="id">Apakah kamu melihat putri saya..? Sudah hampir waktunya makan malam, tetapi dia pergi entah kemana..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Have you seen my daughter..?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It's almost time for dinner, but where did she go…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">你看见我女儿了吗..?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">差不多到晚饭时间了, 但是不知道她去哪里了…</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2015_family2.ntk_1_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="id">Berikan Carnation</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Give the Carnation.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">交给 Carnation.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2015_family2.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya sangat terharu… Saya akan buatkan makan malam spesial untuk putri saya!!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Terimakasih banyak karena telah menerima permintaan anak saya.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Terimalah ini sebagai tanda terimakasih.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">--------------------------------------------------------</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">5 Carnations = "Mom's Random Box"</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I feel so touched… I should make a special dinner for her!!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Thank you so much for accepting my kid's request.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">This is my gratitude to you.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">--------------------------------------------------------</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">5 Carnations = "Mom's Random Box"</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我觉得很感动… 我要为她做一个他别晚餐!!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">谢谢你接受我孩子的请求.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这是我对你的感激之情.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">--------------------------------------------------------</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">5 Carnations = "Mom's Random Box"</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2015_family2.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="id">Terima Mom's Random Box</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Receive Mom's Random Box</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">收到 Mom's Random Box</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2015_family3.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我饿了…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I'm hungry…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya lapar…</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2015_family3.ntk_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="id">Dapatkah kamu membantu saya?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya ingin memberikan hadiah karangan bunga untuk ayah dan ibu saya.. Saya dapat memberikan kamu Carnation Box, dapatkah kamu berikan kepada mereka menggantikan saya? Mereka menyukai bunga jadi mereka pasti akan gembira jika menerimanya apalagi jika saya memberikan banyak!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Umm...apakah kamu mempunyai coklat? Saya sangat lapar...Jika kamu memiliki satu, saya dapat menukarkannya dengan salah satu barang milik saya.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">---------------------------------------------------------</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">70 Chocolate = "Kid's Random Box"</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Could you do me a favor?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I want to give a carnation gift to my mom and dad, but I feel so shy... I can give you the carnation box, so could you hand it to them for me please? They both like flowers so they will be so happy if I can give them a lot!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Umm...do you have a chocolate by chance? I'm so hungry...If you have one, I can exchange it with some of my stuff.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">---------------------------------------------------------</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">70 Chocolate = "Kid's Random Box"</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">你能帮我一个忙吗?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我想给我的爸爸和妈妈送件礼物, 但我很害羞... 我将给你一个 carnation box, 你能把这个礼物帮我交给给他们吗? 他们都非常喜欢花，所以如果给他们很多的话他们会很高兴!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">嗯…你现在有chocolate吗? 我很饿…如果你有的话, 我可以拿一些东西作为交换.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">---------------------------------------------------------</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">70 Chocolate = "Kid's Random Box"</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2015_family3.ntk_1_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menerima Carnation Box</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Receive the Carnation Box</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">收到 Carnation Box</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2015_family3.ntk_1_1_2">
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menukar Chocolate dengan Kid's Random Box</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Exchange the Chocolate to Kid's Random Box</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">用 Chocolate 交换 Kid's Random Box</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2015_family3.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya harap ayah dan ibu saya menyukai hadiah ini!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I hope my mom and dad are happy receiving this!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我希望我的爸爸和妈妈会很高兴收到这些!</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2015_newyear.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">In celebration of New Year, my friends went out to celebrate and are now in danger.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Please find them and send them back. I'll give you a present in return.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">ketika merayakan Tahun Baru, teman-temanku keluar dan sekarang sedang dalam bahaya. Tolong temukan mereka dan kirim mereka kembali. Saya akan memberikan hadiah sebagai imbalannya.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">在新年庆祝活动中, 我的朋友们离开了庆典, 现在正面临着危险.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">请找到他们,并把他们带回来.作为回报我会给你礼物.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2015_newyear.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">[Daily Quest] Sending the Sheeps Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">[Quest Harian] Kirimkan Sheeps Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">[日常任务] 把羊送回来</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2015_newyear.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Please......</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tolong….</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">拜托….</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2015_sheep.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ah, a student. Good to see you. As you may have felt it, recently students are having a nightmare. Perhaps an expert like you can solve the situation.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I want you to move into their dream and bring the sheep madness to an end.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ah, seorang pelajar. Senang bertemu denganmu. Seperti yang mungkin telah kamu rasakan, baru-baru ini para pelajar mengalami mimpi buruk. Mungkin seorang ahli sepertimu dapat menyelesaikan masalah ini.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">I  ingin kamu untuk masuk ke dalam mimpi mereka da</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">啊，你好学生，很高兴见到你. 正如你感受到的，最近学生们在做一场噩梦，也许想你这样的专家能解决这个问题.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我想让你进入他们的梦境，将 Sheep madness 带来，结束这场噩梦.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2015_sheep.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Receive the Dream Invitation</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Terima Dream Invitation</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">获得 Dream Invitation</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2015_sheep.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Travel to Dream Hills(190~)</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Berangkat ke Dream Hills (190~)</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">移动至 Dream Hills ( 190 ~ )</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2015_sheep.ntk_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ah, a student. Good to see you. As you may have felt it, recently students are having a nightmare. Perhaps an expert like you can solve the situation.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I want you to move into their dream and bring the sheep madness to an end.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ah, seorang pelajar. Senang bertemu denganmu. Seperti yang mungkin telah kamu rasakan, baru-baru ini para pelajar mengalami mimpi buruk. Mungkin seorang ahli sepertimu dapat menyelesaikan masalah ini.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">I  ingin kamu untuk masuk ke dalam mimpi mereka da</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">啊，你好学生，很高兴见到你. 正如你感受到的，最近学生们在做一场噩梦，也许想你这样的专家能解决这个问题.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我想让你进入他们的梦境，将 Sheep madness 带来，结束这场噩梦.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2015_sheep.ntk_1_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Receive the Dream Invitation</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Terima Dream Invitation</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">获得 Dream Invitation</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2015_sheep.ntk_1_1_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Travel to Dream Hills(131~189)</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Berangkat ke Dream Hills (131~189)</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">移动至 Dream Hills ( 131 ~ 189 )</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2015_sheep.ntk_1_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ah, a student. Good to see you. As you may have felt it, recently students are having a nightmare. Perhaps an expert like you can solve the situation.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I want you to move into their dream and bring the sheep madness to an end.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ah, seorang pelajar. Senang bertemu denganmu. Seperti yang mungkin telah kamu rasakan, baru-baru ini para pelajar mengalami mimpi buruk. Mungkin seorang ahli sepertimu dapat menyelesaikan masalah ini.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">I  ingin kamu untuk masuk ke dalam mimpi mereka da</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">啊，你好学生，很高兴见到你. 正如你感受到的，最近学生们在做一场噩梦，也许想你这样的专家能解决这个问题.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我想让你进入他们的梦境，将 Sheep madness 带来，结束这场噩梦.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2015_sheep.ntk_1_2_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Receive the Dream Invitation</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Terima Dream Invitation</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">获得 Dream Invitation</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2015_sheep.ntk_1_2_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Travel to Dream Hills(30~130)</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Berangkat ke Dream Hills (30~130)</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">移动至 Dream Hills ( 30 ~ 130 )</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2015_sheep.ntk_1_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">…</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2015_sheep.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Good luck, student! Although I can't really guarantee that the students will be back on track shortly after they are relieved from the nightmare…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Semoga berhasil, pelajar! Meskipun saya tidak dapat menjamin bahwa para belajar dapat kembali ke jalur yang benar setelah mereka dibebaskan dari mimpi buruk.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">祝你好运, 学生! 虽然我不能保证，学生们会重新走上正轨，但是不久之后他们会从噩梦中解脱出来…</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="event_npc_0806.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Hello…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Cart Shop is Opened~~</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Only some items are available for now, more will be update future~</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Please don’t say its expensive, I don’t have so many left~</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Hello…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Toko Kart sudah dibuka~~</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Hanya beberapa item yang tersedia saat ini, ke depannya akan lebih banyak lagi~</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tolong dibeli dan jangan bilang mahal~ T__T</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">你好...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">手推车开张~</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">现在只有某些物品可选择，未来将更新其他品项〜</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">请不要说价格昂贵，我拥有的东西不多〜</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="event_npc_0806.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Shop</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Shop</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">商店</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="kr_exchange_weapon.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="cn">如果你有武器交换卷… 以后我们还会在见面的. 请好好参观.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">If you have the Weapon Exchange Ticket.. Then you will be seeing a lot of me. Feel free to look around.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jika kamu memiliki Weapon Exchange Ticket. Maka kamu akan sering bertemu dengan saya. Silahkan lihat-lihat.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="kr_exchange_weapon.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="cn">打开商店</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Open Store</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Buka Toko</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_adminps.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Hmm.. This is not good..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Hmm..nggak bagus…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">嗯….这似乎有点不好……..</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_adminps.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask who he is</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya siapa</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问他是谁？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_adminps.ntk_1_0_10">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Deliver the machine parts</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menyerahkan parts mesin</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">转交机器零件</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_adminps.ntk_1_0_11">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Defeat Mutant Guard Dog (Elite)</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pembasmian Anjing penjaga (Elit)</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">击败 Mutant Guard Dog (Elite)</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_adminps.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Survivor Recon</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pengintaian korban yang selamat</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">生还者搜救兵</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_adminps.ntk_1_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Report Survivor Recon</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pengintaian korban yang selamat</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">报告生还者的搜救情况</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_adminps.ntk_1_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Gather Info on Hydropower Facility</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pengumpulan data Pembangkit Listrik Tenaga Air</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">搜集 Hydropower Facility 的情报</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_adminps.ntk_1_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Gather Info on Nuclear Power Facility</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pengumpulan data Pembangkit Listrik Tenaga Nuklir</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">搜集 Nuclear Power Facility 的情报</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_adminps.ntk_1_0_6">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Gather Info on Solar Power Facility</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pengumpulan data Pembangkit Listrik Tenaga Surya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">搜集 Solar Power Facility 的情报</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_adminps.ntk_1_0_7">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Gather Info on Thermal Power Facility</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pengumpulan data Pembangkit Listrik Tenaga Api</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">搜集 Thermal Power Facility 的情报</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_adminps.ntk_1_0_8">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Gather Info on Wind Power Facility</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pengumpulan data Pembangkit Listrik Tenaga Angin</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">搜集 Wind Power Facility 的情报</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_adminps.ntk_1_0_9">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Useful Guard Robot</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Robot penjaga yang cukup berguna</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">实用的 Guard Robot</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_adminps.ntk_10_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">While I still worked here, there was a Guard Robot built with newest technology. It was 100% robot and was not controlled by humans. I am shocked because it is now half human and half robot because of a virus. I am making a simple machine with Power Researcher P to get inside of a power plant and we need a part that is used to make Guard Robot. Please go defeat them and get me some useful parts.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Dulu waktu aku atur tempat ini, ada robot penjaga yang dibuat dengan menggunakan tekhnologi terbaru. Saat itu mereka adalah robot asli yang tidak dikendalikan manusia tapi virus telah menanamkan jiwa manusia kedalam tubuhnya. Aku sedang membuat mesin sede</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">当我在做管理员时，有一个以最新科技研发出的Guard Robot 。它们是100%纯正的机器人，所以不受人类控制。但我很惊讶的是，由于病毒的感染，它们竟然突变为半人半机器。我为了与Power Researcher P一起进入 Power plant，正努力制作一项简单的机器，但我们缺少了一项零件。此项零件可在Guard Robot身上找到。请帮我们打倒 Guard Robot，并给我们这些零件好吗？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_adminps.ntk_10_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_adminps.ntk_11_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It seems to be the right parts. It shall be well used. Thanks! I will inform you when I get close to the basement of a power plant.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ini parts yang sangat berguna. Kayaknya sudah cukup. Makasih. Kalau aku sudah bisa masuk ke bawah tanah nanti aku kasih tahu.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这些零件应该是正确的。我们会妥善使用的。谢谢您！等我快要到达 Basement of power plant时，我会再跟您说的。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_adminps.ntk_11_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_adminps.ntk_12_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Just like the guard robot, the canines which were guarding this place also got infected to virus. Please defeat the Guard Dog (Elite) which is stronger than the regular ones. It shall buy us some time here.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kayaknya Anjing penjaga yang dulu menjaga tempat ini dengan robot penjaga sudah terkena virus. Tolong bunuh Anjing penjaga (Elit) yang sedikit lebih kuat daripada anjing biasa. Dengan begitu kamu bisa tinggal disini lebih lama.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">跟Guard robot一样，狼狗儿也被病毒感染了。请驱逐Guard Dog (Elite)，牠门比一般狼狗更强悍些。若您可以帮忙，那我们就可以在这儿多待一些了。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_adminps.ntk_12_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_adminps.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I used to be the manager who used to run this place. Back then, I was pitying myself too much did not do my job. I mean I did not want to devote my whole life here at this place. Why? Um.. My dream was not this. I was having hard time getting hold of myself and the high officials have gave me a few months vacation. When I cam back, this place had changed a lot as if time had went fast only in this place.. Something bad must had been done. It was only a few years..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Aku Penjaga Pembangkit Tenaga Listrik yang mengatur tempat ini. Saat itu aku terlalu sibuk dengan urusan pribadi jadi tidak peduli dengan pekerjaan. Kenapa? Hmm dulu mimpiku bukan kayak gini. Dulu aku tiba-tiba dapat cuti, eh pas balik udah kayak gini..ad</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我曾是这里的管理者。但当时的我过度优柔寡断，导致工作出现懈怠。我确实不想为这里做贡献。因为这不是我的梦想。我很痛苦且努力想要稳定自己，长官察觉到我的不对劲，就赶紧让我暂时休息数月。当我度假回来后，发现这块地变得很不一样，似乎这里已经过了好几年似的。我想这里一定是出了什么大事了……..</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_adminps.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_adminps.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">A few years ago I used to run this place. Power equipment? I recently check the place in hope to find my precious CD. CD? It is not something used in the computers. I will be here until I find it.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Aku Penjaga Pembangkit Tenaga Listrik yang mengatur tempat ini. Peralatan listrik? Aku sudah kesana untuk mencari CD yang hilang. CD? Nggak bukan CD untuk komputer. Aku akan terus disini sampai menemukannya.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">几年前这块地是我在负责的。动力装置？我前几天才来这里的，是为了拿回我之前没带走的宝贝CD。这个CD不能用电脑来开启唷。反正，我会一直待在这里，直到我找到CD为止。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_adminps.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_adminps.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The top priority is to understand current situation so in order to communicate better, would you please go tell the Student Director (Dispatched) about my being here.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Yang paling penting sekarang adalah untuk mengumpulkan informasi sebanyak-banyaknya. Sampaikan tentang keberadaanku ke Student Director (Agen).</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">为了有更圆满的交流，一定要先了解详细的现况。可以请您告诉 Student Director (Dispatched) 我现在的所在位置吗？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_adminps.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_adminps.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Go down East, you will be able to find a big building. It used to be the place where hydropower plant was.. I think you will be able to find a clue if you investigate the building condition and the various information..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ada gedung besar di bagian timur. Disana ada pembangkit listrik tenaga air. Coba periksa tempat itu untuk mencari petunjuk yang lain…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">往东边去，可见到一座大楼。那里曾是 Hydropower plant 。我想您可以调查一下大楼的状态与其他的情报来寻找线索。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_adminps.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_adminps.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Check the Nuclear power Plant located at the end of Northeast from the Control Tower. It is the main power source of all the other power plants here.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Coba periksa daerah sekitar Pembangkit Listrik Tenaga Nuklir. Itu adalah tempat dimana energi untuk semua tempat di sini disalurkan.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">请您确认一下位在Control Tower东北边最远的Nuclear power Plant的状态吗？因为它是所有发电厂的能量生产总中心。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_adminps.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_adminps.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">There is a very high-tech Solar power Plant at Northwest. I have seen a very powerful mutant. It is almost impossible to get it.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Di bagian utara ada Pembangkit Listrik Tenaga Surya yang mengeluarkan energi tinggi. Aku pernah melihat makhluk hidup yang sangat kuat disana. Aku nggak berani mendekat.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">东北边有座高科技Solar power Plant。我有在那儿看到一些能量极大的突变物种。也许这会是一件不可能的任务。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_adminps.ntk_7_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_adminps.ntk_8_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Behind you, there is a thermal power plant very near. We just came from that side. I could not find anything particular but it looked less aged than other facilities.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Di belakang kita, di tempat yang sangat dekat ada Pembangkit Listrik Tenaga Api. Tadi kita sudah lewati tempat itu. Nggak ada yang aneh disana hanya saja tempat itu kondisinya masih sedikit bagus dibandingkan tempat lain.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">在您后方的不远之处，有作 Thermal power plan。我们刚从那边过来。虽然我没能找到特别的东西，但它似乎看起来比其他设备还要新唷。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_adminps.ntk_8_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_adminps.ntk_9_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">There was a wind power plant on the way back. It did not work when I was still the manager here but it must be getting its energy from deep down underground.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tadi di jalan aku lihat ada Pembangkit Listrik Tenaga Angin, dulu tempat itu tidak dioperasikan tapi sekarang kayaknya ada energi yang sangat kuat di ruangan bawah tanahnya.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">以前，来这里的路上曾有一座 Wind power plant。当我在做管理员时，它是故障的。不过，这边现在似乎有能源不停地从地下涌出的感觉…</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_adminps.ntk_9_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Helping out a student in a trouble is the joy of my life! What can I do for you today? Just tell me..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Aku senang kalau membantu pelajar yang sedang kesusahan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Apa yang bisa ku bantu. Ngomong saja…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">平常我最喜欢帮助有困难的学生.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">希望我帮你什么忙呢? 你说说看吧</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask for help to find the goods</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Minta bantuan mencarikan item</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">帮忙搜寻道具</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_1_0_10">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about the attendance book</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Memberitahukan hasil kegiatan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问签到簿</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_1_0_11">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Report the accomplishment</VALUE>
