    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_10_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Exchange Excellent Student Badge</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menukarkan Badge</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">兑换优良学生徽章</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_10_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Exchange Achievement Award</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menukarkan Certificate of Merit</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">兑换基本奖励</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_10_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Exchange Exemplary Award</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menukarkan Exemplary Certificate</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">兑换模范奖励</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_10_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Exchange Specialty Award</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menukarkan Specialty Certificate</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">兑换独特奖励</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_11_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">School has informed me that there are assailants threatening the students with daggers in front of the main gate. Higher grade students would not have any problem but those who just got out there must be in trouble . Go help the fellow students.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pengumuman dari sekolah bahwa di depan gerbang utama sekolah ada orang-orang membawa pisau mengganggu lingkungan sekolah. Para pelajar senior tidak terganggu sedikitpun tetapi para junior sangat terganggu. Oleh karena itu bantulah mereka.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">刚收到学院的通报，说近来在学院门口附近有拿着短剑威胁着学生们的家伙。高年级的学生应该是不会有太太的问题。但对于刚出校门的学生而言，应该是很需要帮助的。请你去帮助他们吧。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_11_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_12_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Drunk Drunkard can also be a dangerous factor for students. I am worried that our students would follow such behavior. Get out there and eliminate them.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Banyak Drunkard yang mabuk sangat mengganggu para pelajar. Pelajar yang melihat Drunkard dikhawatirkan meniru kelakuanya. Pergilah ke daerah perkotaan dan hancurkan mereka.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">Drunk Drunkard可能会成为超级危险分子。我很担心学生们会被他们影响。请您去消灭他们。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_12_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_13_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">All these repeated tasks may make you bored but I believe that purifying this corrupted world can be the true duty of the students. Get out through the school main gate to get to the city. There are many dogs gone mad and Cleaners without consciousness are out there so go eliminate them.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mungkin tugas yang sama sangat membosankan, tetapi menjaga tempat tinggal kita adalah tugas pelajar juga. Baru-baru ini banyak anjing gila dan Cleaner yang setres mengganggu. Pergilah ke daerah perkotaan dan bereskan mereka semua.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这些重复性任务可能让您感到无聊，但我相信，这个邪恶世界的净化工程才是你们学生们真正的责任。快穿过学校大门到城市看看吧。有许多狗都疯了，清洁工则是失去了神志。请您消除它们吧。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_13_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_14_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I am worried about the new students who just came into the school. I believe that you are strong enough to dominate an assailant called Biranne Jr. so go eliminate him.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Aku khawatir para pelajar baru akan terluka karena ulah Dark Swordsman Jr. Tolonglah mereka dengan menghancurkan Dark Swordsman Jr.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我很担心那些刚入学的学生，我想以你目前的能力应该足以胜任。请打倒在校园内出没的Biranne Jr.。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_14_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_15_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Great Job! Now, all the students will be able to move around more safely.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sekarang para pelajar sudah bisa tenang. Kerja yang bagus!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这样以来学生们就可以无忧无虑了,多谢你的帮忙</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_15_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_16_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Recently, a SG school student has given me a design full of weird symbols. I studied it really hard but could not understand it. As a Scientist, you must be able to find out something about it, so take this to Suna Jo.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Beberapa hari lalu ada seorang pelajar Sacred Gate School yang memberikan lembaran desain bergambar tato aneh. Kemungkinan pelajar dari Science Club tahu arti tato tersebut. Pergi dan tanyakanlah kepada Suna jo.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">前阵子有个SG学院的学生将一个画有奇特纹样的图案拿给我。但我看了许久仍然看不出个所以然。我想身为科学部的Suna Jo可能会知道些什么，请你将这个拿去给Suna Jo看看吧！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_16_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_17_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Oh, you've got it decoded, great job! I will write you a recommendation. Show this to Suna and receive what you need.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kamu sudah berhasil memecahkan rahasia yang sulit. Terimalah Recommendation Letter ini dan tukarkan dengan apa yang kamu butuhkan kepada Suna Jo</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">完成解读了啊.既然帮我完成了这么困难的事情,我就写一张推荐书给你吧.你可以拿着它去跟赵善亚换取适当的东西</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_17_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_18_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You will be able to meet Technology Teacher of Phoenix School at Phoenix Hole</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Di Phoenix Town ada Technical Teacher. Temuilah dia dan dapatkan informasi tentang Taxi</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">请你到Phoenix Hole找Technology Teacher[Phoenix]听取有关计程车的事情吧。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_18_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_19_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Guess you already got enough explanation, just ride it first and if you need more explanation then come talk to me again.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kelihatanya kamu sudah cukup tahu tentang Taxi itu. Coba gunakanlah terlebih dahulu, apabila butuh sesuatu langsung saja tanyakan lagi</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">看来你已都了解了啊.先使用看看后,如果还需要的话再跟我说吧</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_19_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You might be able to find out while carrying out the missions I give then you might also be able to improve your ability.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Would you like to give it a try?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau kamu mengerjakan tugas yang aku kasih kamu akan mengerti sendiri…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau dilakukan terus-menerus skill kamu akan meningkat</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mau mencoba?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">您也许可以透过我给的任务来提升能力。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">想试一试？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_2_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Start Step 1</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Memulai tahap pertama</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">启动步骤1</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_2_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Start Step 2</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Memulai tahap ke dua</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">启动步骤 2</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_2_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Start Step 3</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Memulai tahap ke tiga</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">启动步骤 3</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_2_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Start Step 4</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Memulai tahap ke empat</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">启动步骤 4</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_2_0_6">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Start Step 5</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Memulai tahap ke lima</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">启动步骤 5</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_20_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It is not students' fault that as they become higher grades, they tend not to wear the uniforms anymore. Fighting, just wearing the uniforms has limit. Therefore, I would like to hand out uniforms with strong durability to help them…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Apabila level pelajar sudah semakin tinggi, pelajar tidak harus mengganti seragam. Tetapi tiap seragam ada batas fungsinya. Aku akan membagikan seragam yang kuat dan sangat berguna untuk pelajar...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">等级变得越高学生们越不会去穿制服,也不能说是学生们的错.因为只穿着制服进行战斗是有些免强的.所以我想要提供一套不错的制服给学生..</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_20_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Tell him you want one too</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya mau…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">想要领取</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_21_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I've always wanted to take care of those used and old books unattended. If you gather enough of them I will give you the uniform. You didn't think you can just receive the uniform for free, did you?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau ingin mendapatkan seragam, pelajar harus mengumpulkan Old Book dan Ancient Book yang berada di Dormitory secukupnya. Mau mencoba?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我一直以来都很想把宿舍里的旧书籍和古书籍都整理一下.如果你能收集一定的量拿给我,我就把它当作奖励给你吧.你该不会是想要不劳而获吧</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_22_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You have gathered as much as I wanted. Great job. Here take this, keep up the good work.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kerja yang bagus! Kamu sudah mengumpulkan banyak. Nah… ini diterima! Digunakan untuk kegiatan sekolah dengan rajin ya!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">都收集好了啊.辛苦你了.来… 这是希望你能继续努力才给你的制服,要珍惜啊</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_22_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_23_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">In order to use the taxi, go collect me 10 used books from the trash piles in the dorm then I will issue a Taxi Card.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Apabila ingin menggunakan Taxi, kumpulkanlah 10 Old Book yang berada di tumpukan sampah di Dormitory. Setelah itu aku beri Taxi Card</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">如果想要使用计程车的话，先到宿舍从垃圾堆中收集10本旧书籍。我会给你计程车卡Taxi Card作交换的。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_23_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_24_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You are a very realistic student. One of my old friend had mentioned about "Material Transform". Go find that friend for the details.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Teman lamaku pernah memberitahu tentang Material Conversion yang mungkin berguna untukmu. Temui dan tanyakanlah kepada General Merchandiser di School Plaza</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">你还真够现实。我的一位旧友似乎有跟我提过""物质转换Material Transform""。你去找他问问看吧。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_24_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_25_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">아이런맨 슈트는 그야말로 현대 과학 기술의 정수가 모두 담겨진 걸작품이지. 아직 실험 단계라 출력이 완전하지 않다는 것은 명심해.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">아이런맨 슈트는 그야말로 현대 과학 기술의 정수가 모두 담겨진 걸작품이지. 아직 실험 단계라 출력이 완전하지 않다는 것은 명심해.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">아이런맨 슈트는 그야말로 현대 과학 기술의 정수가 모두 담겨진 걸작품이지. 아직 실험 단계라 출력이 완전하지 않다는 것은 명심해.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_25_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">아이런맨 슈트 교환권을 스페셜 슈트(5피스)로 교환한다.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">아이런맨 슈트 교환권을 스페셜 슈트(5피스)로 교환한다.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">아이런맨 슈트 교환권을 스페셜 슈트(5피스)로 교환한다.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_25_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">아이런맨 슈트 교환권을 울트라 슈트(5피스)로 교환한다.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">아이런맨 슈트 교환권을 울트라 슈트(5피스)로 교환한다.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">아이런맨 슈트 교환권을 울트라 슈트(5피스)로 교환한다.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_25_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">처음으로</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">처음으로</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">처음으로</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_26_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Click shortcut icon of Extra Activity to confirm the goal and carry out the instructed task then you will be rewarded with Title which you can put above your name and the Activity Point. Complete enough activities to acquire activity points and go see "Extra Activity Teacher' and buy special item it.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ada extra activity point dan badge yang disediakan sebagai hadiah kalau kamu bisa menyelesaikan misi yang ada, coba buka Extra activitynya. Kumpulkan point lalu temui Guru ekstrakulikuler untuk membeli beragam item.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">请点击特殊活动Extra Activity的快捷键图标，确认目标并执行指令的任务，你将能得到‘标题‘奖励。上面将写有您的姓名和活动点数。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">完成足够的活动来获得活动积分后，您就可以去找“Extra Activity Teacher’购买特别的物品道具咯！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_26_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_27_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Many number of students are performing investigation, research and given missions in Power Plant after its discovery. However, they have gotten competitive because there is a rumor saying that whoever dominates the area will be able to find a clue to get to the Another World.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Para siswa sedang melakukan penelitian dan investigasi tentang Saint Power Plant. Sepertinya mereka ingin berkompetisi untuk menyelesaikan tugas itu dengan baik. Kabar mengatakan bahwa siswa yang menguasai tempat itu bisa menemukan petunjuk untuk masuk ke</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">有许多学生们在发现Power Plant之后，已经开始着手调查Power Plant了。但是他们之间也展开了竞争。传言说，谁占领此区，谁就能找到通往异世界的线索！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_27_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_28_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Carrying out a very special mission is called Extra Activity. Extra Activity would be collecting particular item or eliminating particular monster and when you are done, you will be rewarded with the Title which is to put above your name and activity points. With enough activity points, you can buy very special items.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Extra activity adalah tugas tambahan yang harus dilaksanakan. Tugas ini bisa diselesaikan kalau kamu mempunyai item khusus atau berhasil membunuh mobs yang diperintahkan. Badge dan activity points disediakan sebagai hadiah, kumpulkan point yang diberikan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">圣财团本洞后面转角有一座发电厂。学校师长在发电厂召开紧急会议，派遣老师也正在那里执行任务。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">现在掌握的资讯只有这些，需要像你一样优秀学生的协助。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_28_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_29_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">A very special Power Plant has been discovered which is connected through the tunnel behind Saint HQ. Currently, teachers are dispatched to carry out special mission given after the discussion of the deans of each school. There are not enough information gathered yet but I hope a excellent student like yourself can borrow them hands.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Area khusus bernama Saint Power Plant telah ditemukan di belakang Saint Research. Pihak sekolah sudah mengirimkan beberapa guru untuk bertugas di tempat itu. Tapi informasi yang terkumpul masih kurang, aku harap kalian bisa membantu.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">一个非常特殊的Power Plant已经被发现是通过Saint HQ后面的隧道做连接的。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">目前学校师长在发电厂召开紧急会议，派遣老师也正在那里执行任务。现在掌握的资讯只有这些，需要像你一样优秀学生的协助。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_29_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Put your efforts into the given mission</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kerjakan dengan sungguh-sungguh tugas yang aku berikan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">努力完成任务</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_30_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">From what I have heard so far, all the life forms such as the trees and plants are sick. In order to figure out what the host is, it requires help from many students. Please go there and find dispatched Extra Activity Teacher.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kabarnya pohon-pohon dan makhluk hidup yang ada disana sudah sakit. Kita butuh bantuan banyak siswa untuk mengetahui apa yang terjadi. Coba temui Guru ekstrakulikuler (Agen) yang ada disana.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">听你这么说这里种植的树、草、生命体曾发生突变。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">为了找出主谋者需要其它学生的协助。请去找dispatched Extra Activity Teacher。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_30_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_31_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The energy generated from Power Plant to Research Complex?.. Hmm.. Why?... It would lead me somewhere..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tenaga listrik yang ada di Saint Power Plant mau dipindah ke Saint research? Hmm… kenapa yah, kayaknya ini bisa dijadikan petunjuk.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">Power Plant产生的​​能源是要给Research Complex 财团研究所的？</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">....咦..不管怎样先找到线索应该会有帮助。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_31_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_32_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Once, I had investigated all the places hit by the meteoric shower. But I could not find anything special. Oh! Saint HQ had covered up the meteoric shower. I didn't know why then but I think I can put the pieces together now.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya pernah meneliti semua daerah yang kejatuhan hujan meteor tapi tidak ada yang aneh dengan itu semua.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">过去曾下过流星雨的地方全部都调查过了。应该没有什么异常吧。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">对了！当时圣财团Saint HQ隐瞒了流星雨事件。虽然不知道原因，不过现在终于有一些线索了。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_32_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_33_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Police in Root Hole wants to help you earn new power. Go meet him and ask for help.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Polisi di Root Hole ingin membantumu mendapatkan tenaga baru. Pergi dan temuilah dia.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">位在Root Hole 的Police希望您能够获得新力量。请去拜访他。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_33_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_34_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Machinator in Prison wants to help you earn new power. Go meet him and ask for help.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Machinator di Prison ingin membantumu mendapatkan tenaga baru. Pergi dan temuilah dia.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">位在Prison 的Machinator希望您能够获得新力量。请去拜访他。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_34_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_35_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Seung Hee Yoon in Head.B U-ground wants to help you earn new power. Go meet him and ask for help.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Seung Hee Yoon di Head.B U-ground ingin membantumu mendapatkan tenaga baru. Pergi dan temuilah dia.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">位在Head.B U-ground的Seung Hee Yoon希望您能够获得新力量。请去拜访他。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
