    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_36_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Student Director (Dispatched) in St.Power Plant wants to help you earn new power. Go meet him and ask for help.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Student Director (Dispatched) di St.Power Plant ingin membantumu mendapatkan tenaga baru. Pergi dan temuilah dia.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">位在St.Power Plant 的Student Director (Dispatched) 希望您能够获得新力量。请去拜访他。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_36_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_37_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It's the time to break the limit. Good luck!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ini waktunya untuk menghentikan batas. Semoga berhasil!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">加油！打破纪录吧！！！！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_37_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_38_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Urga in St. Research Cplx wants to help you earn new power. Go meet him and ask for help.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Urga di St. Research Cplx ingin membantumu mendapatkan tenaga baru. Pergi dan temuilah dia.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">位在St. Research Cplx 的Urga(Dispatched) 希望您能够获得新力量。请去拜访他。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_38_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">继续</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_39_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Student Director at Saint Power Plant is collecting participants who want to go to Lost City. Many students are applying for that. Why don't you go there and find him?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Student Director di Saint Power Plant sedang menerima pendaftaran untuk para pelajar yang ingin ke Lost City. Banyak yang sudah mendaftar, apakah kamu sudah mendaftar?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">位在Saint Power Plant的Student Director 希望您能够获得新力量。请去拜访他。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_39_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Great job!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">If you are worried about your journey again, come find me..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kerja yang bagus!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Nanti jika ada masalah datang saja kesini untuk konsultasi</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">太棒了！</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">如果您又担心您的修炼成果不佳，请再来找我唷。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_40_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">There is it. In order to accept the Extreme's power and become more powerful, you have to rearrange your skills.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Itu dia. Dalam rangka untuk menerima tenaga Extreme dan bertambah kuat, kamu harus mengatur ulang semua skill kamu.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这个给你。要变成更强的终极部必须重新学习技能。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I haven't seen you in a while…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">In order to check how many students have made it back, I need to record it otherwise I wouldn't be able to remember.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sudah lama sekali kamu tidak kelihatan…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Karena banyak sekali pelajar disini,</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">sudah untuk mengingat semua pelajar</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">terpaksa harus dicatat.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我有一阵子没见到您了…..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">为了确认有多少学生回来，我需要其他更好的方式来记录，我无法一下子记住啊。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Get attendance checked</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menerima konfirmasi kehadiran</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">确认出席</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">……..</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It can be dangerous for newbies to use so please be careful. It would be nice to use your ability for something different.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Skill yang sudah kamu dapat cukup berbahaya kalau digunakan disini, sebaiknya skill itu digunakan di tempat lain saja.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">新入学的学生要使用这个或许会有点危险，要多加小心啊！把累积的能力拿去做别的事情应该也不错。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_7_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_8_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I wasn't able to know what was going on outside of the school. Hard working students must be compensated for their efforts. Eliminate Blood Drinkers in front of school and collect the tokens.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pelajar harus bisa mengetahui situasi di luar sekolah. Pelajar yang rajin dan giat akan diberikan kompensasi yang sesuai. Hancurkanlah Black Belt dan kumpulkanlah token</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">也要知道学院外的面的事情啊。对于那些努力的学生们，应该要有些报酬才可以。请打倒在学院附近游荡的Blood Drinker，并收集完成任务可以取得的徽章吧。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_8_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_9_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Very well. I will compensate you with a small reward which can help you carrying out missions.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kerja yang bagus! Aku beri sedikit kompensasi yang sangat berguna</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">已经完成任务了啊…真是了不起.这是奖励,你拿去吧</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_checkit.ntk_9_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_drbio.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Growl~ My body needs nutriments.. Kekeke</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Grr.. Aku lapar! Ha.. ha.. ha..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">（咆哮）！我的身体需要补品！嘿嘿嘿！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_drbio.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask who he is</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya siapa anda</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问他是谁</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_drbio.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Warn him about the danger</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Memberitahu tanda bahaya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">警告他要小心</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_drbio.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I'm a researcher.. growl.. You would make a fine ingredients.. Kekeke.. Would like to do a research with me someday?.. Kekeke..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Aku adalah Researcher haha… sepertinya kamu pelajar yang cerdas hm… Mau bergabung melakukan penelitian bersamaku? He… he.. He.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我是科学家..呵呵让人眼红的材料..有机会的话跟我一起研究吧..</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_drbio.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">No, thanks</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tidak mau</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">不了~谢谢。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_drbio.ntk_2_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ok</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Oke saya tunggu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">好的！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_drbio.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I will guide you to the squashy world. Kekeke..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tunggu sebentar... aku antar kamu ke dunia penuh lumpur dan penuh air.. Gha.. gh.. g.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我会引导您至破碎的世界。嘿嘿嘿！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_drbio.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_drbio.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Dangerous? Kekeke.. After all, it won't be too bad to be an offering. I do have to have some responsibility for what happened to those Priests.. Guess, this is the end of my humanity.. Now, you'd better get going. Kekeke..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Berbahaya? Gha.. gh.. g. tidak ada salahnya berkorban. Disini aku juga memikul tangungjawab nasib para wanita… tapi batas kemanusiaanku hanya sampai disini Gha.. gh.. g. sudah kamu pergi saja sana Gha.. gh.. g.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">危险吗?你也变的像我同伴一样。到那个时候变成部属的财物也不错。我手上也掌握着那个女生的命运，这里是我最后的生命</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_drbio.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_event01.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Hey, may I help you?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Hey, ada yang bisa saya bantu?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">嘿！需要帮忙吗？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_event01.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Exchange Astral Gravel(15D)</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tukar dengan Astral Gravel(15D)</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">兑换 Astral Gravel(15D)</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_event02.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Hey, may I help you?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Hey, ada yang bisa saya bantu?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">嘿~有什么需要我帮的吗？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_event02.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Exchange Astral Fragment(15D)</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tukar Astral Fragment(15D)</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">交换Astral Fragment(15D)</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_extraacti.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">May I help you with anything?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mau dibantu apa?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">需要什么帮忙吗？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_extraacti.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Trade Items</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jual-beli item</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">交易物品</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_extraacti.ntk_1_0_10">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Eliminate Labor Robot II</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bunuh Labor Robot II</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">歼灭Labor Robot II</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_extraacti.ntk_1_0_11">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">A task requires courage</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pekerjaan yang membutuhkan keberanian</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">此任务要求非凡的勇气</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_extraacti.ntk_1_0_12">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Jealusy and Alienation</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Cemburu dan adu domba</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">嫉妒与挑拨</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_extraacti.ntk_1_0_13">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">[Limited a day] Creepy Screaming From Forbidden Tower</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">[Per Hari] Teriakan Mengerikan dari Forbidden Tower</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">[每日极限] 从Forbidden Tower传来的尖叫声</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_extraacti.ntk_1_0_14">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">[Limited a day] Alluring Venom</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">[Per Hari] Alluring Venom</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">[每日极限] 诱人的毒液</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_extraacti.ntk_1_0_15">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">[Limited a day] Horrible Mutants</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">[Per Hari] Horrible Mutants</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">[每日极限] 可怕的突变体</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_extraacti.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about Power Plant</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang Saint Power Plant</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">詢問關於Power Plant</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_extraacti.ntk_1_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Power Plant Status Report I</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Power Plant Status Report I</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">報告Power Plant的狀況 I</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_extraacti.ntk_1_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Power Plant Status Report II</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Power Plant Status Report II</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">報告Power Plant的狀況 II</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_extraacti.ntk_1_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Eliminate Tech Researcher (Elite) I</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bunuh Tech Researcher (Elite) I</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">歼灭Tech ResearcherI</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_extraacti.ntk_1_0_6">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Eliminate Guard Robot I</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bunuh Guard Robot I</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">歼灭Guard Robot I</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_extraacti.ntk_1_0_7">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Eliminate Labor Robot I</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bunuh Labor Robot I</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">歼灭Labor Robot I</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_extraacti.ntk_1_0_8">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Eliminate Tech Researcher (Elite) II</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bunuh Tech Researcher (Elite) II</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">歼灭Tech Researcher II</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_extraacti.ntk_1_0_9">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Eliminate Guard Robot II</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bunuh Guard Robot II</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">歼灭Guard Robot II</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_extraacti.ntk_10_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Fierce battles keep occurring in Lost Island.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">They are having a hard time recently as Mutant Citizens suddenly appears too much. So can you help them to overcome this situation?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sangat sulit untuk mencari cara menyerang di Lost Island karena serangan dari Mutant Citizen. Tolong bantu bunuh mereka sehingga populasinya berkurang dan kami dapat mencoba lagi.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">Lost Island上不停地发生激战，甚至还出现了许多突变的市民。您能帮帮他们度过这次的难关吗？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_extraacti.ntk_10_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_extraacti.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I have been investigating this area for a few days and I found out this place was hit by meteoric shower. Plus, I have an intel saying that there is a meteorite outputing powerful energy had fell here but could not be able to find it. I still need more clues.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Seteleh menyelidiki tempat ini selama beberapa hari, aku baru tahu kalau peristiwa hujan meteor itu dulu terjadi disini. Kabarnya batu yang berenergi tinggi juga jatuh di sekitar sini, tapi aku belum bisa menemukannya. Kita harus mengumpulkan petunjuk lai</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我这几天一直在调查这个区域，发现陨石雨曾降临于此地，且某颗拥有强大能量的陨石也跟着一起坠落在地面。但不管我怎么找就是找不到它。请给我点线索吧！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_extraacti.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_extraacti.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I found confidential documents about Research Complex and Power Plant. According to the documents, Dr. TK has constructed power plant to source the power for research complex. It may be a obvious info but please do convey it to 'Student Director (Dispatched)</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Dokumen rahasia tentang Saint power plant dan Saint research aku temukan disini. Menurut dokumen itu Professor Choi sudah membangun Pembangkit Tenaga Listrik di Saint reseach. Coba sampaikan informasi pendek ini kepada Student Director (Agen).</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我找到了关于Research Complex和Power Plant的机密文件。文件里头写着，Dr. TK创立power plant的目的是为了要供给能量给Research Complex。虽然这似乎不是什么很机密的消息，但还是得请您把这信息报告给Student Director (Dispatched)。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_extraacti.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_extraacti.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I found confidential documents about Research Complex and Power Plant. According to the documents, Dr. TK has constructed power plant to source the power for research complex. It may be a obvious info but please do convey it to 'Student Counselor</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Dokumen rahasia tentang Saint power plant dan Saint research aku temukan disini. Menurut dokumen itu Professor Choi sudah membangun Pembangkit Tenaga Listrik di Saint reseach. Coba sampaikan informasi pendek ini kepada School Life Guidance di School Plaza</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我找到了关于Research Complex和Power Plant的机密文件。文件里头写着，Dr. TK创立power plant的目的是为了要供给能量给Research Complex。虽然这似乎不是什么很机密的消息，但还是得请您把这信息报告给 Student Counselor。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_extraacti.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_extraacti.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Creatures mutated by virus are getting out of hands. It would cause a catastrophe if they manage to get out from Power Plant. Please take care of them before they get out. It would make the research of teachers and students here whole lot easier.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Makhluk hidup yang berubah karena virus semakin membahayakan. Hal yang tidak bisa kita bayangkan mungkin saja terjadi kalau mereka keluar dari Saint Power Plant. Tolong bunuh mereka sebelum mereka keluar dari sini. Dengan begitu investigasi yang kita laku</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">受病毒感染而突变的生命体越来越不受控制了。如果牠们从Power Plant逃脱的话，将会发生前所未有的大灾难。请好好看住他们，千万不要让它们逃走了。我们必须这么做，才能使师生们的研究生活变得更顺利。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_extraacti.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_extraacti.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Discovered very powerful human type creatures near Solar Power Facility. You must defeat them first in order to find a very important clue. I expect very strong resistance... I am worried because the student who went out to do this mission is not still back yet.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ada spesies yang mirip manusia di sekitar Pembangkit Listrik Tenaga Surya. Kita harus membunuh mereka untuk menemukan petunjuk yang sangat penting. Pastilah tidak mudah untuk melawan mereka…aku jadi khawatir karena orang yang bisa membantu belum muncul.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我们发现在Solar Power Facility附近，居住着一群异形超人族。您必须先击败他们，才能寻找我们需要的重要线索。我想他们的防御力一定很强大，因为之前接过这个任务的学生们，到现在都还没回来……我真的很担心。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_extraacti.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_extraacti.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Long time ago, Dr. TK has forced an experiment on live bodies of the workers and people here soley for his ambition. Many people showed side effects but some had managed to escape and went back to their formal lives... Who is Nurse Trainee (Dispatched)??</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Professor Choi melakukan percobaan kepada orang-orang yang bekerja disini untuk memenuhi keinginan pribadinya. Banyak orang yang merasa dirugikan oleh kejadian ini, beberapa dari para korban juga berhasil melarikan diri. Mereka kembali ke tempat asal masi</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">很久很久以前，Dr. TK为了满足他的野心，曾强行把员工和平民抓来进行活人体实验。不少人出现了可怕的并发症，而有些人则是幸运地逃出来，现正过着正常生活呢。话说回来，谁是Nurse Trainee (Dispatched)呢？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_extraacti.ntk_7_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_extraacti.ntk_8_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Creepy sound is coming from the top of the Forbidden Tower.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Due to the sound, many students can’t sleep well and suffer from nightmare.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Can you find what happens there?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Murid - murid tersiksa sekali dari teriakan di Forbidden Tower.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pergi ke Forbidden Tower dan cari tahu apa penyebabnya lalu selesaikan lah.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">毛骨悚然的声音是从Forbidden Tower顶楼传来的。因为这可怕的声音，有很多学生都睡不好觉，每晚作噩梦。你可以找出里面的问题吗？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_extraacti.ntk_8_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_extraacti.ntk_9_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Assassins dispatched to Lost City and Industry Complex have a passionate discussion about deadly venom which it put on enemy’s weapon.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I can’t understand why they are so obsessed about it, but can you collect venom samples for them?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Para Assassin sangat tertarik dengan Lost City karena racun yang ada di senjata para musuh. Kalahkan Scouter di Lost City dan Industry Complex lalu koleksi venom nya untuk diserahkan ke mereka.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">忍者被派到Lost City和Industry Complex，反映了敌人武器上方竟沾有剧毒的液体。 我不懂为何大家都这么喜欢毒液。可以请您帮忍者们收集这些毒液的样本吗？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_extraacti.ntk_9_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_gainun.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ugh.. Surprised to see somebody who can beat me. Tell me what you want.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ada yang bisa mengalahkanku?? Apa sih mau kamu…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">嗯…..很惊讶竟然有人打败我。说说您要什么吧！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_gainun.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Talk to her</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Berbicara</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">与她对话</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_gainun.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Trade Items</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jual beli item</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">交易物品</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_gainun.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">What is there to talk about? I await your order.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mau bicara apa? Terserah kamu sajalah…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">还要多说什么呢？我正在等您的指令呢！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_gainun.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Tell her about Lucian and Liz</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Berbicara tentang Lucian dan Ace</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">和她聊聊Lucian和Liz。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_gainun.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">What the.. I should teach him a lesson!!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Dasar!! Nih anak…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">吼！我得好好教训一下他！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_gainun.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Tell her to join Garansanoa</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menyuruh bergabung dengan Garansanoa</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">告诉她和Garansanoa合作吧。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_gainun.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Wrong.. This is the point where this world and the other world is linked.. If anybody stays here too long he or she will become the guardian.. Left with just one thought, protecting this door..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bukan… tempat ini adalah gabungan dunia kamu dan dunia kami.. Kalau lama disni, bisa jadi guardian penjaga tempat ini..untuk menjaga pintu ini selama satu tahun..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">错了.. 这个地方是异族世界与我们世界的接点。待太久的话，就会成为维护这个地方的守门者，只能</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">一心守门….</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_gainun.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask if she needs any help</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya apakah butuh bantuan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">问她是否需要帮忙</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_gainun.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">In case you are able to acquire stronger power.. You must stop the Lucian's Ambition.. And, don't forget to tell it to our world also..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Misalkan bisa menemukan orang yang lebih kuat…tolong hentikan amarah Lucian…dan tolong jaga juga dunia kami</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">如果想要拥有比你现在更强大的力量，一定要阻止 Lucian的野心… 别忘记告诉他，我们的世界…..</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_gainun.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Tell her, you promise</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sanggup berjanji!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">告诉她，您会做到！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_gainun.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I won't be able to remember the conversation we have made today when you come visit me next time.. Good bye..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lain kali kalau datang kesini lagi aku ngga akan mengingat pembicaraan ini.. dadah</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下次再来这里的时候，现在说过的话都不会记得了…拜拜。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_gainun.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_garan.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">What are you looking for?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ada perlu apa?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">您在找什么？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_garan.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Set as Starting Point</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menentukan start point</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">设为开始起点</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_garan.ntk_1_0_10">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Listen to conversation</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mendengarkan cerita</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">听取对话</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_garan.ntk_1_0_11">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Deliver Liz' message</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menyampaikan pesan Liz</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">转达Liz的讯息</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_garan.ntk_1_0_12">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">암흑의 목걸이에 대해 묻는다.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">암흑의 목걸이에 대해 묻는다.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">암흑의 목걸이에 대해 묻는다.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_garan.ntk_1_0_13">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">네 번째 파편을 보여준다.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">네 번째 파편을 보여준다.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">네 번째 파편을 보여준다.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_garan.ntk_1_0_14">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Message of Obinine</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pesan dari Obinine</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">来自Obinine的信息</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_garan.ntk_1_0_15">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Inform Obinine</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Beritahukan kepada Obinine</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">通知Obinine</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_garan.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Trade Items</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jual beli item</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">交易物品</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_garan.ntk_1_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask who he is</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya siapa anda</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问他是谁？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_garan.ntk_1_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask if he needs help</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya apakah butuh bantuan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问他是否需要帮忙</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_garan.ntk_1_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Get Confirmation</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mendapatkan konfirmasi</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">收到确认</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_garan.ntk_1_0_6">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask if he needs help</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya adakah yang bisa dibantu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问他是否需要帮忙</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_garan.ntk_1_0_7">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Deliver Urga's Message</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menyampaikan pesan dari Urga</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">传达 Urga的讯息</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_garan.ntk_1_0_8">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Meet Urga</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Temuilah Urga</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">拜访 Urga</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_garan.ntk_1_0_9">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about the condition of this place</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang situasi tempat ini</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问此地的状况</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_garan.ntk_10_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Oh.. You mean around here? Well, I've heard that there is an old man down at the South-east from here, saying he is guarding a warehouse or something. I once had gave him a Spiritual sphere but it didn't help him much. I think it would be a good idea for you to pay him a visit when you have chance.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ah..maksudnya di daerah sekitar sini…kayaknya ada Oldman di daerah tenggara sana…katanya dia menjaga Warehouse. Aku sudah kasih sebuah spiritual sphere tapi tidak membantu. Kalau ada waktu lebih baik kamu coba temui dia</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">阿...你是说这里四周。听说在东南方有一位老人...好像负责看守仓库。我会给你精灵灵珠，但我没办法帮助你。有时间的话去看看也好呀</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_garan.ntk_10_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_garan.ntk_11_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">풋내기인줄 알았는데 제법이군. 자네 혹시 암흑의 목걸이에 대해 알고 있나? 강력한 암흑의 힘이 담긴 이 목걸이는 착용하는 이에게 무한한 힘을 제공하지. 하지만 이계가 뒤틀리는 과정에서 부서져 이 세상 어딘가에 그 파편들이 흩어져 버렸지. 만일 파편들을 모아 가져온다면 암흑의 목걸이를 제작해 주도록 하지. 자넨 그럴만한 자격이 충분하니까… 물론 그걸 찾기는 굉장히 어려울꺼야. 최근에 본사, 큐브랩스, 세인트연구단지, 연구단지 지하에서 파편을 보았다는 소문이 있긴 하지만 아직 확인되지는 않았지. …어쩌면 야생종들이 파편을 주워 다닐 수도 있겠군. 파편을 찾아보겠다면 본사 건물부터 시작하는게 좋을꺼야.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">풋내기인줄 알았는데 제법이군. 자네 혹시 암흑의 목걸이에 대해 알고 있나? 강력한 암흑의 힘이 담긴 이 목걸이는 착용하는 이에게 무한한 힘을 제공하지. 하지만 이계가 뒤틀리는 과정에서 부서져 이 세상 어딘가에 그 파편들이 흩어져 버렸지. 만일 파편들을 모아 가져온다면 암흑의 목걸이를 제작해 주도록 하지. 자넨 그럴만한 자격이 충분하니까… 물론 그걸 찾기는 굉장히 어려울꺼야. 최근에 본사, 큐브랩스, 세인트연구단지, 연구단지 지하에서 파편을 보았다는 소문</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">풋내기인줄 알았는데 제법이군. 자네 혹시 암흑의 목걸이에 대해 알고 있나? 강력한 암흑의 힘이 담긴 이 목걸이는 착용하는 이에게 무한한 힘을 제공하지. 하지만 이계가 뒤틀리는 과정에서 부서져 이 세상 어딘가에 그 파편들이 흩어져 버렸지. 만일 파편들을 모아 가져온다면 암흑의 목걸이를 제작해 주도록 하지. 자넨 그럴만한 자격이 충분하니까… 물론 그걸 찾기는 굉장히 어려울꺼야. 최근에 본사, 큐브랩스, 세인트연구단지, 연구단지 지하에서 파편을 보았다는 소문</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_garan.ntk_11_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">제게 왜 그런 호의를 베푸시는 겁니까?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">제게 왜 그런 호의를 베푸시는 겁니까?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">제게 왜 그런 호의를 베푸시는 겁니까?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_garan.ntk_12_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">‘암흑의 목걸이’는 주인을 선택한다고 알려져 있네. 자네가 그 목걸이의 주인이라면 어차피 자네에게 갈 운명인 것이지. 솔직히 자네가 그 목걸이 파편을 찾아오리라고는 생각하지 않아. 이만큼 전사 티가 풍기도록 성장한 것이 대견해서 해 준 말이니까 너무 신경쓰지는 않아도 돼.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">‘암흑의 목걸이’는 주인을 선택한다고 알려져 있네. 자네가 그 목걸이의 주인이라면 어차피 자네에게 갈 운명인 것이지. 솔직히 자네가 그 목걸이 파편을 찾아오리라고는 생각하지 않아. 이만큼 전사 티가 풍기도록 성장한 것이 대견해서 해 준 말이니까 너무 신경쓰지는 않아도 돼.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">‘암흑의 목걸이’는 주인을 선택한다고 알려져 있네. 자네가 그 목걸이의 주인이라면 어차피 자네에게 갈 운명인 것이지. 솔직히 자네가 그 목걸이 파편을 찾아오리라고는 생각하지 않아. 이만큼 전사 티가 풍기도록 성장한 것이 대견해서 해 준 말이니까 너무 신경쓰지는 않아도 돼.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_garan.ntk_12_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">그렇다면 어떻게 파편으로 목걸이를 제작하시는 거죠?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">그렇다면 어떻게 파편으로 목걸이를 제작하시는 거죠?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">그렇다면 어떻게 파편으로 목걸이를 제작하시는 거죠?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_garan.ntk_13_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">후훗. ‘암흑의 목걸이’가 왜 그토록 대단한 물건이겠나? 파편만 있으면 이계의 마나를 약간만 불어넣어도 저절로 원 상태로 돌아간다고 알려져 있어. 물론 이계의 뒤틀림 정도의 강한 힘이 작용하지 않으면 부서질 일도 거의 없겠지만 말일세. 이계의 사람이 아닌 자네는 결코 불가능한 일이지만 우리들은 누구나 가능한 일이지.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">후훗. ‘암흑의 목걸이’가 왜 그토록 대단한 물건이겠나? 파편만 있으면 이계의 마나를 약간만 불어넣어도 저절로 원 상태로 돌아간다고 알려져 있어. 물론 이계의 뒤틀림 정도의 강한 힘이 작용하지 않으면 부서질 일도 거의 없겠지만 말일세. 이계의 사람이 아닌 자네는 결코 불가능한 일이지만 우리들은 누구나 가능한 일이지.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">후훗. ‘암흑의 목걸이’가 왜 그토록 대단한 물건이겠나? 파편만 있으면 이계의 마나를 약간만 불어넣어도 저절로 원 상태로 돌아간다고 알려져 있어. 물론 이계의 뒤틀림 정도의 강한 힘이 작용하지 않으면 부서질 일도 거의 없겠지만 말일세. 이계의 사람이 아닌 자네는 결코 불가능한 일이지만 우리들은 누구나 가능한 일이지.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
