  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_garan.ntk_14_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">이제 미완성된 암흑의 목걸이와 이계의 마나를 가지고 사제에게로 가서 암흑의 목걸이의 힘을 부활시키게나. 드디어 암흑의 목걸이의 부활된 힘을 보게 되겠군. 하지만 반드시 미완성된 암흑의 목걸이를 벗은 후 부탁을 해야 하네. 착용 상태에서는 이계의 마나의 힘이 작동되지 않으니….</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">이제 미완성된 암흑의 목걸이와 이계의 마나를 가지고 사제에게로 가서 암흑의 목걸이의 힘을 부활시키게나. 드디어 암흑의 목걸이의 부활된 힘을 보게 되겠군. 하지만 반드시 미완성된 암흑의 목걸이를 벗은 후 부탁을 해야 하네. 착용 상태에서는 이계의 마나의 힘이 작동되지 않으니….</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">이제 미완성된 암흑의 목걸이와 이계의 마나를 가지고 사제에게로 가서 암흑의 목걸이의 힘을 부활시키게나. 드디어 암흑의 목걸이의 부활된 힘을 보게 되겠군. 하지만 반드시 미완성된 암흑의 목걸이를 벗은 후 부탁을 해야 하네. 착용 상태에서는 이계의 마나의 힘이 작동되지 않으니….</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_garan.ntk_14_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">처음으로</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">처음으로</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">처음으로</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_garan.ntk_15_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">We've had very high pride until that betrayal Lucian showed up. Obinine? You met Obinine? Awe.. I see.. I will go see him soon.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kita mempunyai kebanggaan tersendiri. Sebelum pengkhianat Lucian itu hadir di hadapan kita. Obinine? Kamu bertemu Obinine? Ah..begitu좰aku akan segera kesana.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我们有非常好的成绩，一直到叛者Lucian出现。 Obinine？你见过Obinine？ .喔..我会尽快去看看他的。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_garan.ntk_15_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_garan.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I am a man who lives in the darkness. I envy someone like yourself who lives in this sunlight.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Orang yang tinggal dalam kegelapan. Aku iri padamu yang hidup normal</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我是个活在黑暗中的人，真羡慕你这种能活在阳光里的人</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_garan.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_garan.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I have eliminated many of them but it is not easy eliminating the wild ones. I would like you to eliminate the animal which walks the earth and its tamer.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sudah banyak hewan yang dibereskan, namun yang liar sangat susat. Tolong bereskan hewan yang berkeliaran dan pemiliknya.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我已经处理掉很多了，但要消灭那些野生种的不容易，真希望有人能去处理出没在周围地区的禽兽和她们的主人..</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_garan.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_garan.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Your good deed will be compensated someday.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Suatu saat kabaikan kamu pasti ada balasannya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">您的善行会给您带来好运的！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_garan.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_garan.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">If you go further south, you will be able to see a tower which beams the light to the sky. There will be a artificially made small stream to the south of that tower. Not like other animals, this one will not attack humans. It will be able to speak human language so go talk to him.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pergilah ke arah selatan, disana ada menara yang mearah ke langit. Disebelah selatan menara itu ada sungai buatan, disana ada hewan yang berbeda dengan yang lain dan bisa berbicara dengan manusia. Cari dan bicaralah dengan hewan itu.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">往南走后有一座发出光芒的塔，塔的南方有一条人工溪，那里有跟附近其他动物不同，不会攻击人的动物，他们听得懂人说的话，去跟他说话看看</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_garan.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_garan.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Hmm.. South?!..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Hmm…ke arah selatan ya…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">嗯…... 南边？？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_garan.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_garan.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Would you please go ask Urga that where did the man and women went exactly? Please, I have to know where they have went to.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Coba tanya lagi kepada Urga. Aku tidak tahu laki-laki dan perempuan pergi kemana. Tolong ya..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">你能去向Urga问看看吗？我要知道男生和女生两人去哪里了，麻烦你了</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_garan.ntk_7_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_garan.ntk_8_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">There was a message from Priest. It seems like my friends are at the basement of the tower.. First go talk to Priest for details.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ada kabar dari Priest bahwa teman-temanya berada di basement di bawah menara… Coba temui Priest untuk mencari informasi yang lebih akurat</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">Priest那边有来消息。同伴们好像是在塔的地下… 请你先去找Priest详细了解一下。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_garan.ntk_8_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_garan.ntk_9_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">As expected, he is moving as his ambition.. Gainun.. Please go tell Liz that I will go save him as soon as I make contact with others.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sesuai yang diperkirakannya semua ini terjadi…Tolong sampaikan pesan Gainun kepada Ace bahwa setalah dia menerima kabar, dia dan teman-temannya akan langsung pergi menyelamatkannya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">结果他还是照着他野心走.. Gainun他...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">请你帮我去转达 Liz 说只要我一取得同伴的联系，就会去救他了。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_garan.ntk_9_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_helper.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">May I ask what you're looking for?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Apa yang bisa ku bantu. Ngomong saja…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我可以知道您在寻找什么吗？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
