    <VALUE Lang="GS">Take Dual Spear</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pilih Dual Spear</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">选择Dual Spear</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_60_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Take Scythe</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pilih Scythe</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">选择Scythe</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_60_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Take Shuriken</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pilih Shuriken</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">选择Shuriken</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_61_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Select item type.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pilih jenis item</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">选择物品类型</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_61_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Take a Cube</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ambil sebuah Cube</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">获得一个Cube</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_61_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Take a Whip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ambil sebuah Whip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">获得一个Whip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_61_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Take a Magic Wand</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ambil sebuah Magic Wand</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">获得一个Magic Wand</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">No problem!!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">But, if you can help me, I'll help you, too.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Now, I can't believe anyone?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kamu harusnya perhatikan sekitar</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">jangan sampai melupakan teman-teman sekolah…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tunjukkan bahwa kamu adalah junior yang baik….</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">mau aku bantu?? Hahaha….</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">所以以后表现好一点!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">你不知道部门的人都去哪里了吗?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">你让我觉得你是很善良的学弟的话...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">帮你一点吧? 嘿嘿</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_7_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_8_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">……..</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_9_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Have you seen the things that fly around with whooshing sound? Huh?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Do you know the name of it? Guess you know something too.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Smarter than the looks</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Wow, great!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Baru-baru ini kamu melihat sesuatu yang berterbangan kan??</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kamu tahu apa itu?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Aku kira kamu ngga tahu…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ternyata cukup cerdas juga kamu…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">keren!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">您有看见那个东西飞出去还发出呼噜噜的声音吗？咦？</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">你知道它的名字吗？我想您知道不少情报。看不来您其实是个很聪明的人唷。哇，太棒了！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_jsa.ntk_9_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Feels offended but ask her more</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Walau sudah sakit hati, tetap bertanya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">感到被冒犯，但还是询问她更多细节。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_lresearcher.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Things are getting worse around here everyday…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Situasi di sini semakin memburuk...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这里的情况逐渐恶化…</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_lresearcher.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Set Starting Point</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Merubah save point</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">设定开始位置</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_lresearcher.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Trade Items</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jual-beli item</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">物品买卖</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_lresearcher.ntk_1_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Find someone who can help</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Carilah orang yang bisa membantu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">寻求帮手</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_lresearcher.ntk_1_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">A Chance Discovery</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Penemuan secara kebetulan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">不经意的发现</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_lresearcher.ntk_1_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Deliver Unidentified Necklace</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sampaikan kalung yang tidak dikenal</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">交付Unidentified Necklace</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_lresearcher.ntk_1_0_6">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Suspicious Relationship</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Hubungan yang mencurigakan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">问题的关联性</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_lresearcher.ntk_1_0_7">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Sacrifice for other people</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pengorbanan untuk orang lain</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">自我牺牲</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_lresearcher.ntk_1_0_8">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Purification of Power Facility</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pemurnian fasilitas Power Plant</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">净化Power Facility</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_lresearcher.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I am in no better situation. It makes me shiver, you asking me a favor even though we do not know each other. But, if you do me a favor first then I might rethink this through..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Posisiku sekarang juga sangat buruk. Padahal kita tidak saling kenal, tapi aku malah meminta bantuanmu. Kalau kamu menerima tawaranku semuanya bisa dibicarakan lagi…..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">现在我的处境也不好。你和我不认识的情况下还厚着脸皮拜托你也是不得已的。不过还是要看你愿不愿你接受我的提议</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_lresearcher.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_lresearcher.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">All of my co-workers are mutated. It is a very sad story. However, if the Toxicant they possess gets into school then it would cause catastrophy. So, please do defeat those researchers. If you come across a necklace while defeating them then please bring it to me.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Semua peneliti yang dulu bekerja denganku sudah berubah.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Benar-benar hal yang menyedihkan. Tapi kalau racun mereka masuk ke area kampus kerugian yang sangat besar pasti akan kita alami. Ini sangat berbahaya karena itu tolong bunuh Peneliti teknis.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau k</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">以前一起在这里工作的突变技术研究员同事被感染了。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">真的很难过。如果这些病毒传至学院将会发生不可预料的灾害。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">请帮忙清除这些危险的突变技术研究员。如果过程中有发现研究员的项链请交给我</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_lresearcher.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_lresearcher.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Hu Hu Hu.. As I thought.. I had expected it but I am happy to confirm it. Thanks!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ak…sudah kuduga….makasih sudah membantuku mengeceknya.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">唉...虽然已在预料之中...不过还是要谢谢你帮忙确认</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_lresearcher.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_lresearcher.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I was born a twin and had a younger brother. We used to work together at this place. He was very talented. Maybe that is why he was chosen to be experimented. However, I came back to find my brother after that incident. Please find my brother!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Aku punya adik kembar. Yang lebih mengagetkan dulu kami bekerja bersama disini. Dia sangat pintar dan berbakat. Mungkin karena itu dia dijadikan bahan percobaan. Aku kembali kesini untuk mencari adikku itu. Tolong bantu yah.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我有一个双胞胎弟弟。再说个让你更惊讶的事情，以前和弟弟一起在这里工作。他有杰出的才能，所以被拿来当作实验的对象。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">事件爆发后为了寻找弟弟才会再回来这里。可以帮忙协助搜寻吗</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_lresearcher.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_lresearcher.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Are you sure it is my brother? Well, it sure sounds like him. It will take much more time to recover his identity. Please take care of him as much as you can! Please!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ini benar adikku? Sepertinya benar. Kita masih butuh banyak waktu untuk mencari tahu identitasnya. Tolong jaga adikku yah.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">确定是我弟弟吗?听你这么一说好像没错。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">不过还需要花时间进行更详细的确认</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">在完成确认之前请帮忙照顾我的弟弟</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_lresearcher.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_lresearcher.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I found the mutant supplying toxicant to them! Tech Researcher (Elite) has been giving secretion to others. It is the cause. Go get rid of him.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Aku sudah menemukan makhluk yang mengeluarkan racun itu! Peneliti teknis (Elit) adalah mereka yang menciptakan racun dan menyebarkannya kepada yang lain. Itulah sebabnya, kita harus mencabut akar masalahnya.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">找到散播病毒的突变生命体！</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">Tech Researcher (Elite)分泌有毒物质传给技术研究员。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">发现原因了！必须斩草除根！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_lresearcher.ntk_7_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Oh, the nature is…..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Yang namanya alam…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">噢，所谓的自然是...…..</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about this place</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang tempat ini</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问此地的背景</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_1_0_10">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Produce Virus</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Produksi virus</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">制造病毒</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
