    <VALUE Lang="GS">Jealousy and Mischief</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Cemburu dan adu domba</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">妒忌和挑拨</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_1_0_12">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Produce Aspirin I</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Produksi aspirin I</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">制作阿司匹林 I</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_1_0_13">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Produce Aspirin II</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Produksi aspirin II</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">制作阿司匹林 II</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_1_0_14">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Deliver Herb of World Tree</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Serahkan tanaman dari Taman dunia</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">交付世界树的药草</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_1_0_15">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Produce Aspirin III</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Produksi aspirin III</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">制作阿司匹林 III</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_1_0_16">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Collecting Parts I</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pengumpulan parts I</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">搜集零件 I</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_1_0_17">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Collecting Parts II</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pengumpulan parts II</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">搜集零件 II</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_1_0_18">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Fabricate Satellite Signal</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pemalsuan sinyal satelit</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">操控卫星讯号</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_1_0_19">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Report Satellite Signal Fabrication</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Memberitahukan proses pemalsuan sinyal satelit</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">报告有关卫星讯号的操控</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask for Healing Treatment</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tolong diobati</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">请求治疗</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_1_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Extract Virus Sample</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pengumpulan contoh virus</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">摘取病毒样本</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_1_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Deliver Virus Sample</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Penyampaian contoh virus</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">传达病毒样本</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_1_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Extract Normal Blood Sample</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pengumpulan contoh darah normal</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">摘取正常血液样本</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_1_0_6">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Deliver Normal Blood Sample</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Penyampaian contoh darah normal</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">传达正常血液样本</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_1_0_7">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Request of Nurse Trainee (Dispatched) I</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Request dari Nurse Trainee (Dispatched) I</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">Nurse Trainee (Dispatched)的请求 I</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_1_0_8">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Request of Nurse Trainee (Dispatched) II</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Request dari Nurse Trainee (Dispatched) II</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">Nurse Trainee (Dispatched)的请求 II</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_1_0_9">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Unknown Secret</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Rahasia tak diketahui</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">不为人知的秘密</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_10_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Thank you so much for doing this!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I have found out that the Tech Reseacher (Elite) has more deadly virus than the Guard Dog. Please get their virus samples, I need them to make new antibiotics.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Makasih sudah mau membantuku. Aku jadi tahu kalau virus yang disebarkan oleh anjing penjaga telah menyebabkan racun Peneliti teknis (Elit) semakin kuat. Tolong kumpulkan contoh virus dari mereka agar aku bisa membuat obat penawar baru.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">谢谢你协助我。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">听说Tech Reseacher (Elite) 身上的病菌的毒性比Guard Dog更强。为了制作新的抗生素请帮忙萃取Tech Reseacher (Elite) 身上的超级病菌样本。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_10_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_11_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Extra Activity Teacher who I met while I was studying nursing was very mysterious man wrapped behind a veil. He was hiding many things and plus he knew the Power Researcher P...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Guru ekstrakulikuler yang aku temui saat menerima pelatihan perawat adalah orang yang sangat misterius. Dia punya banyak rahasia. Ditambah lagi dengan fakta kalau dia tahu Peneliti Tenaga Listrik P.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">维修课堂上遇到的Extra Activity Teacher荣誉指导老师像是蒙上一层面纱的神秘人物。应该有很多不可告人的秘密。特别是有关于彼德Power Researcher P</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_11_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_12_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">controller is ready. Get to the "Satellite Dish' which you can find it in minimap then it will automatically control the satellite signal for better communication.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Dulu aku pernah melakukan penelitian tentang penyakit jiwa. Aku gagal berkali-kali tapi akhirnya aku bisa menemukan cara terbaik untuk menggabungkannya.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">之前曾经进行精神分裂症的研究。虽然失败很多次不过却找到可以测出高效能的操作方法。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_12_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_13_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">World Tree is legendary tree which can survive from the Evil Spirits and unpleasant mutants. There is a rumor that the scent of Herb of World Tree can call spirits.. Adding this herb into a medicine will maximize the effect of such medicine. Just bring me the ingredients then I will make it for you.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Taman dunia adalah taman dimana pohon yang tidak terpengaruh oleh roh jahat tetap tumbuh. Ada kabar yang mengatakan kalau wangi dari pohon disana bisa memanggil jiwa. Kita bisa membuat obat yang sangat berguna bila menggunakan tanaman disana sebagai bahan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">世界之树从曾和邪恶灵魂有过不愉快经验的突变生命体平安存活的传说之树有个传说世界之树草药的香气可以唤醒灵魂。利用这种草药和各种药制作会非常有效果。把搜集到的材料交给我就可以制作。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_13_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_14_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Yes, correct. This is the 'Herb of World Tree'. It has been really long since I have last seen it.. It feels weird..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Combine processed saliculic acid of World Tree and bark of willow with acetylsalicylic acid to make a very special medicine.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Iya. Benar. Ini tanaman yang tumbuh di Taman dunia…Obat yang sangat bagus bisa kita buat dengan menggabungkan tanaman ini dan kulit pohon yang ada.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">没错，这就是'Herb of World Tree世界树草药'。已经好久都没看过...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">世界树和柳树皮的酸加工过后，和阿斯匹林混合可制作出超强特效药。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_14_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_15_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It is done! Please inform the Student Director (Dispatched)</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Selesai! Beritahukan hal ini kepada Student Director (Agen).</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">成功完成了! 请向Student Director (Dispatched)报告。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_15_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_16_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I am trying to connect this place and the schools to communicate by adjusting signal. But there is not enough parts to make the controller. Guard Robots must be using some electrical parts I need.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Aku berniat untuk mengontrol sinyal dan berkomunikasi dengan pihak sekolah. Tapi parts yang dibutuhkan untuk membuat alatnya kurang. Parts yang ada di Robot penjaga bisa kita pakai untuk membuat alat ini.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">要调整电波马上将这里的资讯传送到学院。不过用来制作调整装置的零件不够。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">或许Guard Robot身上使用的电子零件会有这些零件。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_16_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_17_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I am trying to connect this place and the schools to communicate by adjusting signal. But there is not enough parts to make the controller. Labor Robots must be using some electrical parts I need.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Aku berniat untuk mengontrol sinyal dan berkomunikasi dengan pihak sekolah. Tapi parts yang dibutuhkan untuk membuat alatnya kurang. Kita butuh part dari robot pekerja.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">想要调整电波马上将这里的资讯传送到学院。不过用来制作调整装置的零件不够。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">或许Labor Robot身上使用的电子零件会有这些零件。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_17_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_18_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Controller is ready. Get to the "Satellite Dish' which you can find it in minimap then it will automatically control the satellite signal for better communication.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Alatnya sudah selesai dibuat. Alat ini bisa otomatis digunakan kalau kamu pergi ke daerah sekitar Satelit Antena.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">调整装置已经完成。请前往小地图上'Satellite Dish`的所在位置，使用自动调整卫星电波即可顺利接收或传送资讯。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_18_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_19_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Oh Great! Please keep this secret in case anyone asks about this!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Oh baiklah! Ini rahasia, jangan bilang siapa-siapa.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">哇,太棒了! 这件事是秘密任何人问都不能说</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_19_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">This is the new heaven of virus. Thanks to that the medical professions are living a very busy lives. The mutants have separate organ for poison and virus and they can belch whichever whenever they like. There is no cure or antidote yet. Please take care of yourself.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tempat ini dipenuhi dengan berbagai virus baru. Karena itu dunia kedokteranpun jadi semakin sibuk. Makhluk-makhluk itu punya sistem tersendiri untuk mengeluarkan racun dan virus saat diperlukan. Masih belum ada obat penawarnya jan? Hati-hati yah.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这里是新种病毒的新天堂。幸好现在医学发达。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这些突变的生命体另外形成会分泌毒、病菌的器官，有需要时即可从器官中萃取。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">不过现在还没有治疗药剂或是抗生素，所以一定要非常注意小心。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">People who were attacked by Guard Dogs are getting infected faster. It must be stopped. Please go extract the virus from Guard Dogs.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Banyak orang yang terkena wabah virus yang diserbarkan oleh Anjing penjaga, kita harus menghentikan ini secepatnya. Tolong kumpulkan contoh virus dari anjing-anjing penjaga itu.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">遭Guard Dog咬伤的人类快速感染，必须尽快阻止疫情的扩大。请帮忙搜集Guard Dog的病毒。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Thank you! Let me make it up to you!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Terimakasih. Ini hadiah kecil sebagai tanda terimakasih.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">谢谢您！让我把奖励品交给您！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Virus sample of Guard Dog isn't the only thing needed to progress the research further and it is on temporary hold. If I just had a normal blood sample, everything must be whole lot easier.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Katanya penelitian dihentikan sementara karena contoh virus dari anjing penjaga tidak cukup. Andai saja ada contoh darah anjing penjaga yang masih normal…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">因为Guard Dog异常的病毒让研究没有任何进展暂时中断。如果有Guard Dog正常的血液...研究应该可以进行得更顺利。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I thought all the Guard Dogs had been mutated. I never thought to get normal blood! This is enough to help the research.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Aku pikir semua anjing penjaga sudah berubah menjadi monster, tapi ternyata masih ada contoh darah normalnya seperti ini! Kayaknya ini sudah cukup untuk bahan percobaan.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">如果是全部的Guard Dog都被感染了，那还会有正常的血液吗？只需要这一点点的量对研究就会有很大的帮助。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I know its rude of me to call you but you know, I cannot go anywhere. I have a very personal favor to ask…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Maaf yah memanggil kamu kesini karena aku tidak bisa kemana-mana. Aku ada satu permintaan…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我现在哪儿也不能去所以才会口气这么差叫你过来这里。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">有件事需要拜托你</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_7_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_8_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I have seen a person who looks very similar to who I dated before I attended nursing school. If you see a tall and slim young man with glasses then please tell him about me.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Disini ada orang yang sangat mirip dengan temanku pada saat pelatihan dulu. Tolong beritahu aku kalau kamu bertemu dengan laki-laki kurus tinggi yang memakai kacamata.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">接受维修教育前在这里看到一位很眼熟的人。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">如果有遇到高高瘦瘦的戴着眼镜的年轻男子，请帮我传达</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_8_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_9_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I have been getting trained to become a nurse for past a few years. I don't know about this place. Oh! Yes, I was at the hospital for a while. It's true.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Aku pelajar yang mendapatkan pendidikan perawat selama bertahu-tahun. Aku tidak tahu tentang tempat ini. Ah! Soalnya aku juga ada di rumah sakit untuk beberapa lama.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我是几年前在这里学习维修的学生。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这里的情况我不是很了解。因为有段时间我住院了。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_nursepat.ntk_9_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_obinain.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Agh…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Agh…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">额….嗯….</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_obinain.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Returned Obinine</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Obinine yang kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">重生的Obinine</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_obinain.ntk_1_0_10">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Sacrifice for Others</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pengorbanan demi orang lain</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">牺牲小我，完成大我。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_obinain.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about the current status</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang situasi saat ini</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问现况</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_obinain.ntk_1_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Message of Obinine</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pesan Obinine</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">来自Obinine的信息</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_obinain.ntk_1_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Pendant Piece of Partisan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Potongan kalung pasukan elit</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">游击队的饰品碎片</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_obinain.ntk_1_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Deliver Pendant Piece of Partisan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menyampaikan potongan kalung pasukan elit</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">传递游击队的饰品碎片</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_obinain.ntk_1_0_6">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Find someone who can help</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Carilah orang yang bisa membantu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">寻求伸出援手的人</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_obinain.ntk_1_0_7">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Notify Obinine</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Beritahukan kepada Obinine</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">通知 Obinine</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_obinain.ntk_1_0_8">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Death of Betrayal</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kematian pengkhianat</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">叛徒的死期</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_obinain.ntk_1_0_9">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Deliver Pendant Piece of Partisan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menyampaikan potongan kalung pasukan elit</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">传递游击队的饰品碎片</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_obinain.ntk_10_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Oh.. The pedant piece of Partisan representing honor.. It is really small..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Potongan kalung yang menandakan kehormatan pasukan elit….ukurannya sangat kecil.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">噢！象征游击队荣耀的饰品碎片也太小了吧。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_obinain.ntk_10_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_obinain.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Eww.. Head is heavy.. Who are you? Helping me wake up again? I am the member of Daramaian Partisan. Anyways, I appreciate your help!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ah…pusing…Kamu siapa, kenapa kamu menolongku? Aku anggota pasukan elit Daramaian, makasih sudah membantu.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">啊！头好痛！您是谁？又把我叫醒了？我是 Daramaian游击队的成员。总之，谢谢您的帮忙唷。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_obinain.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_obinain.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I am the member who assist the captain of our partisan. My captain and I was experimented by an old man. I don't remember anything after that. Ugh.. I cannot remember how that doctor looked like…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Aku adalah asisten yang membantu ketua pasukan. Bos dan seorang kakek dulu melakukan eksperimen padaku. Aku tidak ingat setelah itu. Ah</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我是负责协助队长的游击队成员。某个老人对我和队长进行了实验，但之后的事情，我都想不起来了。 额…..我甚至想不起那位博士的长相。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_obinain.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_obinain.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Before I was blacked out, I remember traveling with other members including captain Veno. During the harsh journey, we met with a very nice doctor. He had made a suggestion to us and that's all I remember..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sebelum hilang ingatan aku sering ikut Bos Veno, tiba-tiba kami bertemu dengan dokter yang sangat ramah. Terus dia menawarkan sesuatu kepada kami..aku tidak ingat lagi setelah itu.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">在我昏厥之前，我记得我跟Veno队长和队员们一起行动。在这艰难的旅途中，我们遇到了一位很亲切的博士。但我现在只记得，他对我们做了一项建议，我却想不起来内容。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_obinain.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_obinain.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">If you find captain Veno somewhere around here, don't forget to tell me about it. Even if you fail to find him please find me his traces left behind.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tolong temukan Bos Veno yang ada di sekitar sini. Kalaupun tidak ketemu tolong carikan jejak dia.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">如果您有看到Veno在这附近，别忘记一定要通知我一声。, 如果真的找不到他的人，请您至少试着找找看他的踪迹。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_obinain.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_obinain.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I see.. That's what happened.. Must had no choice..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You have a quite talented crew. My great captain Veno.. Wow!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Must.. have lost his power because of the mind controlling of that evil doc. Also, it is very sad that he would not be able to recognize me and our brothers.. It is really sad!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ah…begitu rupanya..harus gimana lagi….</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Teman-teman kalian juga hebat sekali, padahal Bos Veno bukan orang biasa.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mungkin..dia juga sudah sedikit lemah karena dikontrol dokter itu. Aku semakin sedih kalau ingat bahwa dia tidak mengenali kami...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我了解了….所以才会那样子啊~没得选择了。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">您有个很优秀的团队，我伟大的队长Veno….哇呜！他一定被邪恶的博士折磨到体力变得很差，还有我们的失散弟兄….真的很难过。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_obinain.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_obinain.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I am looking for a person who can find all of our scattered partisan members and deliver this news. Please help me!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Aku sedang mencari orang yang bisa menyampaikan berita ini kepada anggota pasukan elit yang sekarang terpencar. Tolong yah…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我正在寻找可以帮忙找出其他失散的游击队成员，并解说情况的那个人。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_obinain.ntk_7_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_obinain.ntk_8_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Betrayal of Lucian?! Umm.. I kind of expected it.. Then would you please do me a favor?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pengkhianatan dari Lucian? Ah…sudah kuduga…Kalau begitu tolong bantu aku yah.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">叛徒Lucian?! 嗯…..果然不出我所料。您愿意帮我一个忙吗？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_obinain.ntk_8_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_obinain.ntk_9_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Lucian used to be a great warrior of our partisan. Enemies fell as the candle in the light in front of his sword. But he must have known that he was getting weaker as the time went by. Therefore, he was thinking about the unthinkable, taking over the absolute point for its power. He needs to wake up now. Please go teach him some sense and retrieve our pendant.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lucian adalah salah satu prajurit yang hebat. Banyak musuh yang sudah berlutut di depan pedangnya. Tapi! Dia pasti sadar bahwa kekuatannya semakin melemah. Karena itu dia ingin mendapatkan kekuatan dari Titik Point Absolut . Kini dia harus sadar diri. Tol</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">Lucian 曾是游击队最优秀的战士。很多敌人都败在他的倒下。不过，岁月不饶人，他变得有些脆弱。他最近在策划一件恐怖行动。他希望可以拥有绝对起点的力量。请找到他，给他点教训，让他清醒吧，另外，请取回饰品。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_obinain.ntk_9_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_presearcher.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Who is the teacher up in Control Tower? Umm..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Siapa yang ada di tower pengontrol? Hmm</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">谁是在Control Tower的那位老师呢？嗯…</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_presearcher.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Set Starting Point</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Merubah save point</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">设定开始位置</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_presearcher.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Trade Items</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jual-beli item</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">交易物品</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_presearcher.ntk_1_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Listento mumbling</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mendengarkan bisikan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">听听看那喃喃自语之音</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_presearcher.ntk_1_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Request of Nurse Trainee (Dispatched) II</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Permintaan Nurse Trainee (Agen) II</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">Nurse Trainee (Dispatched)的请求 II</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_presearcher.ntk_1_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Unknown Secret</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Rahasia tak terungkap</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">不可告人的秘密</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_presearcher.ntk_1_0_6">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Suspicious Relationship</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Hubungan yang mencurigakan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">可疑的关系</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_presearcher.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I used to be a gold digger before I came to this place. As I have worked many years, I figured out how to make the money. Many people would look whats in front of them to make money. And it will lead you to someplace where you can no longer avoid. Riches say one needs to be prepared to make money. Must learn how to look further before..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sebelum datang ke tempat ini aku adalah orang yang sangat suka uang. Setelah bekerja bertahu-tahun aku jadi tahu bagaimana caranya. Banyak orang yang hanya melihat apa yang ada di depan mereka untuk mencari uang. Kalau seperti itu pasti ada situasi yang t</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">来这里以前我是爱钱一族。赚钱赚了十几年终于找到了方法。很多人为了赚钱只注重眼前的利益。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这样可能会带来不可避免的情况。想要赚大钱也要有那个本事。与其觊觎其它利益还不如守本分。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_presearcher.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">继续听取</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_presearcher.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">No way! I do not know that person. I used to be the researcher who went back and forth from Control Tower to Evironment Control Tower. When such incident happened, I escaped from basement of complex just before they made me an experiement object.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mana mungkin. Aku tidak tahu siapa dia. Aku peneliti yang bekerja di sekitar menara pengontrol lingkungan. Pada saat kejadian itu terjadi aku hampir dijadikan bahan percobaan tapi aku berhasil melarikan diri.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">有这种事。你居然不知道我是谁。我是中央控制塔Control Tower和环境控制塔Evironment Control Tower来回奔波的研究员。在事件爆发前我被抓到研究院B1F进行实验，不过最后逃出来了。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_presearcher.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_presearcher.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">There was a woman who ran with me. She told me that she was a student. Please help me find her who saved my life.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ada seorang wanita yang juga berhasil melarikan diri denganku. Katanya dia adalah pelajar. Tolong carikan dia yang merupakan penyelamat hidupku.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">还有一位女生跟我ㄧ起逃走，她说她是学生。她是我的恩人请你帮忙寻找她的下落</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_presearcher.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_presearcher.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Awe.. A brother of mine… I might have had one or.. I might not had one.. Ahg! Ahg! Ahg! I don't know..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">………………………………………………….</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ah…..saudara….sepertinya pernah ada…sepertinya tidak…..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ah~Ah~Ah! Aku tidak…ta…hu…………………..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我好像有个哥哥..又好像没有...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">阿!阿阿! 不知道..啦</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_presearcher.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_priest.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ruin.. upon those who run counter to nature!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Hancurkan! Para perusak alam…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">毁灭.... 那些与大自然背道而驰的人！！！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_priest.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask who she is.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya siapa anda</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问她是谁？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_priest.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Deliver Garansanoa's Message.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menyampaikan pesan dari Garansanoa</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">传达Garansanoa的信息</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_priest.ntk_1_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask if she is feeling alright.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya apakah sedang sakit</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">问她会不会痛？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_priest.ntk_1_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Hand over the cure.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Memberikan obat</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">交付治疗的药</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_priest.ntk_1_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask what is going on.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya apa yang terjadi</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问现在什么事情正在发生</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_priest.ntk_1_0_6">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Tell her the result</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Melaporkan hasil</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">告诉她结果</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_priest.ntk_1_0_7">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask what happened in the past.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya kegiatan sebelumnya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问过去发生的事情</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_priest.ntk_1_0_8">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about basement</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang basement</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问关于地下室的事情</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_priest.ntk_1_0_9">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">암흑의 목걸이의 부활을 의뢰한다.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">암흑의 목걸이의 부활을 의뢰한다.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">암흑의 목걸이의 부활을 의뢰한다.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_priest.ntk_10_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Heard there is a underground facility under the Environment Control Tower in the Central Park. Find the entrance around the tower to go in and find his friends. Be careful, because it is filled with dangerous creatures which were experimented like us.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Di bawah menara Central Park ada ruangan bawah tanah. Coba kamu telusuri sekitar menara, nanti akan ada pintu masuk. Di dalam ruangan itu ada banyak korban yang jadi kelinci percobaan seperti aku, jadi berhati-hatilah</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">在Central Park的 Environment Control Tower下面有地下设备。找到Control Tower周围的入口，进去就可以寻找朋友了。听说和我们一起被实验的生命体遍布在里面。要小心！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_priest.ntk_10_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_priest.ntk_11_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">음... 이계마나와 미완성된 암흑의 목걸이... 모두 다 있군. 자 그럼 어디 힘을 부활시켜 볼까? 혹시 미완성된 암흑의 목걸이를 차고 있다면 어서 벗게나. 착용을 하고 있으면 힘을 부활시킬 수가 없으니...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">음... 이계마나와 미완성된 암흑의 목걸이... 모두 다 있군. 자 그럼 어디 힘을 부활시켜 볼까? 혹시 미완성된 암흑의 목걸이를 차고 있다면 어서 벗게나. 착용을 하고 있으면 힘을 부활시킬 수가 없으니...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">음... 이계마나와 미완성된 암흑의 목걸이... 모두 다 있군. 자 그럼 어디 힘을 부활시켜 볼까? 혹시 미완성된 암흑의 목걸이를 차고 있다면 어서 벗게나. 착용을 하고 있으면 힘을 부활시킬 수가 없으니...</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_priest.ntk_11_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">암흑의 목걸이의 힘을 부활시킨다.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">암흑의 목걸이의 힘을 부활시킨다.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">암흑의 목걸이의 힘을 부활시킨다.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_priest.ntk_11_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">처음으로</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">처음으로</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">처음으로</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_priest.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Obeying Daian..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Dulu pengikut Daiyan…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">服从Daian....</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_priest.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_priest.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Garansanoa.. The elder.. Respectable of.. Daian..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Garansanoa…pengikutnya…. Daeyun</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">Garansanoa.. 那位长者.... 尊敬长者的Daian....</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_priest.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_priest.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Cures are.. Paranovan's Orb.. Piece of Vicious Mind.. Memories are..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Obat…ingat...Paranovan's Orb.. Piece of Vicious Mind</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">治疗方法是.. Paranovan的Orb……一块Vicious Mind..... 回忆是..</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_priest.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_priest.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Thanks…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Terima kasih</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">谢谢您。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_priest.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_priest.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Long time ago, Dr. TK has abducted some of us, the Daramaian Priests. After we were brought here, they have conducted experiments on us. The last thing I remember.. The horrifying screams of High Elders who have turned into weird creatures. I must revenge those researchers who have conducted experiment on us.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Dulu ada orang yang bernama Choi telah menculik pengikut Daramai. Mereka dibawa kesini untuk dijadikan kelinci percobaan. Seingatku.. Dulu sering sekali terdengar jeritan ketakutan mereka yang telah dikloning.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">很久以前，TK博士绑架了我们Daramaian祭司。之后，我们被带到了这里，他们对我们进行了实验。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">最后的记忆是，高大长老发出了惨叫声之后，还变成了怪异的生物。我一定要报仇！对那些进行实验的研究人员。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_priest.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_priest.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I can smell their pain from you. Thanks!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Terima kasih…ternyata kamu?? Master…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">从您身上能闻出他们的痛苦。谢谢了！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_priest.ntk_7_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_priest.ntk_8_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Daramai is a society of many tribes united together. Garansanoa is an elder of our Daian tribe. The people who he is looking for must be on a very important mission..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Daramai adalah kelompok sosial yang terdiri dari berbagai suku. Garansanoa adalah orang yang dituakan di suku Daeyun. Orang yang sedang dicarinya pasti orang-orang yang punya tugas penting…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">Daramai是各部族聚集的社会。Garansanoa是我们炎魔族的长老。他要找的人一定是背负重要任务的人。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_priest.ntk_8_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask if she knows their whereabouts</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya apakakah tahu jalan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问她是否知道他们的踪迹</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_priest.ntk_9_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I was abducted and brought here while fighting a war against Lagia and I don't really know anything.. I am sorry.. If I find out anything then I will make sure to notify Garansanoa.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Aku tertangkap saat sedang berperang dengan Lagia….jadi aku tidak tahu apa-apa. Maaf…kalau aku sudag mendapat kabar baru segera aku sampaikan kepada Garansanoa.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">在和Lagia的战斗中被抓来这个地方，我什么都不知道…对不起…有知道任何消息一定会马上告诉Garansanoa。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_priest.ntk_9_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_sailer.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Customer is my King.. Hahaha</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tamu adalah Raja... Hahaha</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">顾客就是王...哈哈哈</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_sailer.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Operate Item Compounder</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menghidupkan Mesin Converter</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">启动物品组合机</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_sailer.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Trade Items</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jual Beli Item</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">物品交易</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_sailer.ntk_1_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about Item Compound</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang Pembentukan Benda</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问关于物品组合机</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_sailer.ntk_1_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about Item Compound</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang Pembentukan Benda</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问关于物品组合机</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_sailer.ntk_1_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask him to make you basic item</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ingin Membuat Item Dasar</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">告诉他你希望制作基础物品</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_sailer.ntk_1_0_6">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask who he is?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya Siapakah Dia</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">问问看他是谁？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_sailer.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Huhu.. Can't tell you more. Just think of it as ingredients are needed to make something. Something useful might come out if items are put in the Item Compounder together. Well, even though definition of "Useful" can be different to each person.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Huhu.. Tidak bisa memberitahu lebih lagi. Hanya butuh beberapa bahan untuk membuat sesuatu. Jika sudah tersedia, tinggal masukkan ke Mesin Converter saja dan Item akan terbentuk dengan sendirinya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">呵呵..我无法告诉你太详细的东西。要制作特定的物品就需要相对应的材料。 只要将材料放入物品组合机就可以获得非常实用的物品。当然，这实用的定义是因人而异的。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_sailer.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_sailer.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Basic item.. I will teach you how to make Fermented Recovery Potion. Buy 1 bread from the Merchant and 1 Liquid Fermentation Potion from me and bring them to me.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Item Dasar. Aku akan mengajarkan cara membuat Fermented Recovery Potion. Beli 1 Bread dari Merchant and 1 Liquid Fermentation Potion dari saya dan bawa kemari</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">关于基础物品…让我来告诉您制作Fermented Recovery Potion的方法。从Merchant买一个面包，并从我这里买一罐Liquid Fermentation Potion就可以透过我来调制了。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_sailer.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回首页。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_sailer.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">First show me the required items and then ask me to use the Compounder. Remember to bring the exact quantity of each item.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tunjukkan bahannya padaku dan katakan jika ingin menggunakan Mesin Converter. Jumlah bahannya harus benar dan sesuai</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">给我看所需的材料内容，并告诉我您想用物品组合机就行了。切记，要正确地控制每项材料的数量哟。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_sailer.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_sailer.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Huhuhu.. Who are you?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Huhuhu.. Siapakah kamu?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">呵呵，您是谁？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_sailer.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_saintsailer.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Well, it has been a long time since I have last seen a human being.. Just tell me if you need anything.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lama sekali nggak pernah berjumpa</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bilang saja kalau ada yang diperlukan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">好久没见到人类了。有什么问题，请尽管来找我。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_saintsailer.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Trade Items</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jual beli item</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">交易物品</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_saintsailer.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Tell him, Garansanoa has sent you</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bilang bahwa kamu dikirim oleh Garansanoa</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">告诉他，是Garansanoa派您来的。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_saintsailer.ntk_1_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Tell him, you've taken care of the researchers</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Berkata sudah selesai menangani</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">告诉他，您有保护那些研究员。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_saintsailer.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Is it from the guy with a cloying manner wearing a black outfit? I remember, he gave me something to play at marbles but it didn't do any good. Hey, you should help me here. Please put down those Researchers. I really need a good night sleep!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kamu dikirim oleh orang yang memakai baju hitam itu? Dia memberikan sesuatu sih untuk bermain kelereng, tapi gak ada gunanya…kamu bantu saya dong. Bisa tolong tangani para 'Researcher'? Aku mau tidur di malam hari.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">是身穿黑色衣服令人厌烦的家伙派你过来的吧.，他跟我说要给灵珠的但我没办法帮助你，需要有学生来帮忙.帮我处理研究员因为我晚上想好好睡觉</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_saintsailer.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_saintsailer.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Excellent!!. I hope I can have a good night sleep now. Let me give you this Marble which that guy in the black outfit gave me as a token of my appreciation. I hope you can make a good use of it.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Oh! Hebat sekali rupanya. Kini bisa hidup kah. Saya berikan sphere yang diterima dari teman yang memakai baju hitam sebagai tanda terimakasih. Tapi saya tidak tahu apa ini berguna atau tidak</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">哦!!你真厉害.现在想好好睡一觉了.为了谢谢你那我就把身穿黑衣服的朋友那里拿到的灵珠给你吧.虽然我也不知道有没有用处</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_saintsailer.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Congrats for making this far!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Selamat datang sudah sampai ke sini.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">欢迎大家来到这里。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
