    <VALUE Lang="cn">St.Power Plant 净化</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_1_0_25">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Talk with Student Director</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bicara pada Student Director</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">和Student Director对话</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_1_0_26">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Volunteer for Second Group</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Group sukarelawan kedua</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">第二组义工</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_1_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Dangerous Company</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kawan seperjalanan yang berbahaya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">危险的同伴</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_1_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Investigate Power Facility 1-2</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Penyelidikan Peralatan Tenaga Listrik 1-2</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">调查Power Facility 1-2</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_1_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Exterminate Guard Dog with Fluorescent Color</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pembasmian Anjing penjaga</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">消灭Guard Dog with Fluorescent Color</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_1_0_6">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Report Fluorescent Colored Guard Dog Extermination</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Laporan pembasmian anjing penjaga</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">报告 Fluorescent Colored Guard Dog 的歼灭状况</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_1_0_7">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Message from Student Director (Dispatched)</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pesan Student Director (Agen)</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">Student Director (Dispatched)的信息传送</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_1_0_8">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Survivor Recon</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pengintaian korban yang selamat</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">搜寻生还者</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_1_0_9">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Report Survivor Recon</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Laporan pengintaian korban yang selamat</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">报告生还者搜寻结果</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_10_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Really?! It's just getting more suspicious. Power Plant Manager wasn't even here for a few recent years… looking for a CD.. Hmm.. If my guess is right then the high officials must have done something secretly.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Oh ya? Banyak sekali hal yang mencurigakan.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">是吗?! 有很多疑点。最近几年Power Plant Manager 不曾在这里停留...找到CD了..嗯..根据我的推测，一定是高层隐瞒其它相关人士秘密进行着某件事。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_10_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_11_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Very well. There was a very suprising incident. One day, mutants had attacked us teachers in surprise while we were educated secretly. That when he helped us. Now is the time for us to help him.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Penjaga Pembangkit Tenaga Listrik tidak berada disini selama bertahu-tahun. Suatu hari pada saat guru-guru kita sedang melakukan latihan, mereka diserang oleh makhluk-makluk yang tak dikenal. Dialah yang membantu kita saat itu. Sekarang adalah saatnya kit</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">看来你很清楚嘛! 过去很令人震惊的事件。有一天我们的老师被秘密接受教育的突变生命体袭击。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">那个时候这个人救了我们。现在该是我们协助他的时候了</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_11_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_12_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I am not sure who the nurse trainee (Dispatched) is but I heard that she had only studied the virus and the schizophrenia. Go ask her!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Aku tidak tahu siapa Nurse Trainee (Agen) sebenarnya, katanya dia adalah orang yang mempelajari virus dan penyakit jiwa. Cobalah tanyakan.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">虽然不知道Nurse trainee(Dispatched)是谁.不过他曾研究病毒和精神分裂症。去问问看吧</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_12_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_13_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">As expected, he managed to produce the Aspirin with herb of World Tree which can only be acquired by someone with mighty power. It is our turn to help him.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tuhkan aspirin dibuat dari bahan obat-obatan yang hanya bisa didapatkan oleh orang kuat dari taman dunia. Kini saatnya kita membantu mereka.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">看来你已经得到只有强者才能获得的世界之树草药并成功制作阿斯匹林</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">现在换我们帮助他了</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_13_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_14_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Go see him once more. If he is ok then he must have came back to normal.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Coba cari dia sekali lagi. Mungkin dia bisa kembali menjadi orang normal.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">再去找找看。幸运的话说不定他可以恢复正常</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_14_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_15_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Glowing and sprkling monument is still left here all in one piece. If you have time would you please go check it out? You might will be able to find new informantion around there.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Monumen yang bersinar itu berada di tempat sama selama bertahun-tahun. Kalau ada waktu coba periksa daerah sekitar Monumen Peringatan Hujan Meteor dan cari petunjuk.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">听说最近这几年纪念碑不断散发出异常光线。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">如果可以的话请前往陨石纪念碑附近确认说不定可以获得新的资讯，再把结果告诉我</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_15_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_16_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">What? It’s not a meteorite? Cant' be?! If it is just a immitatin than how could it stay unchanged that long..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Hmm? Ini bukannya meteor? Nggak mungkin? Kalau ini hanya imitasi bagaimana bisa batu ini tidak berubah setelah sekian lama.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">什么?不是陨石?! 怎么可能?! 就算是伪造品怎么会这么久都不会改变真是令人好奇</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_16_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_17_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">There was a script covered with stain over it? A few days ago, Nurse Trainee (Dispatched) found that the saliva of Guard Dog (Elite) help oxidation while she was studying virus samples. Use that saliva and remove the stain over that script written on the Meteorite Monument.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ada tulisan yang tidak jelas? Beberapa hari yang lalu Nurse Trainee (Agen) menemukan bahwa ludah Anjing penjaga (Elit) memiliki zat yang sama dengan virus yang tersebar. Mungkin kita bisa membaca tulisan di monumen dengan menggunakan ludah itu.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">你是说上面有模糊不清的刻字？听说几天前Nurse Trainee (Dispatched)研究中的病毒样本Guard Dog (Elite) 口水有腐蚀的作用。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">如果利用口水应该可以看到陨石纪念碑上斑驳的文字。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_17_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_18_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I did not know that the Saliva of Guard Dog (Elite) was a very dangerous chemical. It would be hard to believe but if that Saliva is vaporised then it even destroys the Ozone layer. Please defeat all Guard Dogs (Elite) infected with virus.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Aku tidak tahu kalau ludah Anjing penjaga (Elit) adalah cairan yang membahayakan. Mungkin kamu tidak percara tapi bila ludah itu menguap lapisan ozonpun bisa meledak. Bunuh semua Anjing penjaga (elit) yang terkena virus.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">不知道 Guard Dog (Elite)的口水竟然是这么危险的物质。很难以置信如果口水蒸发连臭氧层也会被破坏。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">请你帮忙消灭全部有病毒的 Guard Dogs (Elite) 。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_18_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_19_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You did well! It feels great to watch you grow! Learning and training ourselves is the only way fulfill what we desire!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Makasih. Senang banget melihat kamu yang terus berkembang! Itulah satu-satunya jalan untuk memenuhi keinginan kita.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">真是辛苦你了。看到你有所成长真的很开心!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">为了我们的希望你能继续加油</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_19_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">If you cannot talk to dispatched Extra Activity Teacher then why don't you take over the control tower. Seems like there were unseen rivarly between the students from each school to find the clue of Another World. Therefore, the teachers dispatched here only allowed students who dominated this place to trade items, receive quests and talk to them. In order to train them hard.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau kamu tidak bisa berbicara dengan Guru ekstrakulikuler (Agen), cobalah kuasai daerah sekitar menara pengontrol. Semua siswa sedang berkompetisi untuk mengumpulkan petunjuk tentang Dunia lain. Karena itu Guru ekstrakulikuler (Agen) hanya berbicara dan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">如果无法和 Dispatched Extra Activity Teacher对话，那么请先占领Control tower。看来各学院的学生为了寻找异界的线索私底下正在展开一场战斗。Dispatched Extra Activity Teacher为了帮助学生变的更强，只有占领这里的学生可以进行对话、物品买卖、接收任务。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_20_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I'm glad you are coming. I just want to help you earn new power. Help me purify Saint Power Plant and you'll get new sphere to learn the power.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Senang sekali bertemu denganmu! Saya sedang mendata pelajar yang akan pergi ke Ground Zero. Masih banyak slot yang tersisa, kamu tertarik untuk ikut?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">你终于来了！现在正在招募愿意被派遣到Saint Power Plant 的人。还缺很多人手。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">净化Saint Power Plant 的话，您可以拿到新的灵珠，并学习新技能唷。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_20_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_21_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">We need to purify Saint Power Plant once again, please eliminate Tech Researcher around here.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kamu akan menjadi contoh bagi pelajar lainnya. Pergilah, aku akan menyusulmu.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我们必须再进行一次Saint Power Plant的净化。应该会有更多人加入。我马上就会跟上您，先出发吧！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_21_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_22_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It's the perfect time to see you! I've been getting applications from students who want to go to Ground Zero. So far, we need more students. Can you support for the students dispatched first?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Waktu yang tepat sekali! Saya sudah mendapatkan list pelajar yang akan ke Ground Zero. Kami masih memerlukan beberapa lagi. Bisakah kamu membantunya?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我们在完美的时间点上相遇了。！我收到了许多想要进入 Ground Zero的申请单。现在我们需要更多的学生加入。您愿意支援吗？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_22_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_23_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You will be the role model for the other students. Go now. I'll follow you soon.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kamu akan menjadi teladan untuk yang lain. Duluan saja, saya menyusul sebentar lagi.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">您将成为学生们效法的榜样。请现在就出发。我很快就会跟上您的。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_23_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">..that this is one of the places hit by meteoric shower and was used as the energy source for the research complex. Umm.. Something must have been found in the meteorite.. Anyways, thanks!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Fakta bahwa tempat ini adalah salah satu tempat dimana hujan meteor terjadi dan Professor Choi telah menggunakan ruang bawah tanah sebagai tempat pembangkit tenaga listrik. Hmm..kamu sudah menemukan sesuatu di meteor yang terjatuh itu…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这里是曾下过流星雨的其中一个地方，也是崔泰圭博士作为供给圣财团研究所能源的地方.嗯..在陨石掉落的地方似乎有找到线索。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">总之谢谢你。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You seem strong enough as the people said! This is the Saint Power Plant discovered a few days ago. Many teachers and the students are investigating this area but we need more help from strong students like you. Please help them.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Seperti yang sudah kuduga kamu adalah siswa yang kuat! Ini adalah Saint Power Plant yang ditemukan beberapa hari yang lalu. Banyak siswa dan guru yang ditugaskan untuk menyelidiki tempat ini tapi kami masih butuh bantuan dari orang yang kuat.. Mau kerja b</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">果真如同所闻你是很强的学生！这里是几天前被发现的Saint Power Plant。许多荣誉指导老师和学生正在这里进行调查，这里四处充满危险需要优秀学生的协助</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Someon has seen a giant animal gushing out smoke from its body near the Power Facility 1-2. It is not sure if it was a human or a mutant but you will be able to find a clue by investgating this area.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ada orang yang melihat makhluk besar yang mengeluarkan asap dari tubuhnya di sekitar Peralatan Tenaga Listrik 1-2. Tidak ada yang apakah dia manusia atau binatang, coba selidiki daerah sekitar itu dan carilah petunjuk berguna.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">有人在Power Facility 1-2前方看到一个身体冒烟的大怪物。不知道是人类还是突变的生命体。如果调查这四周应该可以获得一些线索。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The Guard Dogs which used to guarding this place are glowing in weird fluorescent color. It must be an undiscovered virus. Anyways, they are listed in the dagerous creature list so please defeat them.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Anjing penjaga yang dulu menjaga tempat ini mengeluarkan cairan berwarna yang aneh. Sepertinya itu virus yang sampai saat ini belum ditemukan obatnya. Pokoknya dia termasuk ke dalam salah satu hewan yang membahayakan. Tolong bunuh mereka.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这里的Guard Dog身上出现不明的色彩。可能是还没被发现过的病毒。不过在危险生命体清单上应该已经有纪录。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">请帮忙打倒Guard Dog。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Thank you! We now can investigate broader area.. When did Nurse Trainee (Dispatched) got here??...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Makasih. Berkat kamu kita bisa bekerja di lingkungan yang lebih luas. Kapan Nurse Trainee (Agen) tiba?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">谢谢。幸亏有你才能确保这一大片的活动区域....Nurse Trainee (Dispatched) 什么时候会来呢？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_7_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_8_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I am not sure whether the information of this place where the meteorite had fallen, unkown creatures and viruses can be useful to find clues but please tell 'Student Conselor' at Market Plaza about it.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tempat dimana hujan meteor terjadi, makhluk hidup yang berubah dan virus yang belum pernah ditemukan mungkin bisa menjadi petunjuk. Sampaikan hal-hal ini kepada School Life Guidance yang ada di Market Place.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这个地方曾经有流星雨也发现稀有的生命体、新种病毒、所有事件的线索，不知道这些对你有没有帮助。请把这些消息告诉位在Market Plaza的Student Conselor。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_8_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_9_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">There was a trace of a humna.. Umm.. It cannot be the dispatched teachers.. There might be a survivor, would please go take a look?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ada jejak manusia..Hm..Dia pasti bukan agen dari sekolah. Atau mungkin dia adalah korban yang selamat, tolong diperiksa.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">有人类的痕迹...嗯..应该不是派遣老师</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">可能是还有生还者可以帮忙去搜寻吗</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_scmasterpat.ntk_9_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_sps_nurse.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask me anything!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ada apa?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">有疑问，尽管问！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_sps_nurse.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Trade Items</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jual beli item</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">交易物品</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_sps_nurse.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Get healed</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Minta disembuhkan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">接受治疗</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_urga.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Growl..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Grrrrng…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">吼……</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_urga.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Wave some food.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mengocok makanan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">挥动食物</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_urga.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Deliver Garansanoa's request</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menyampaikan permintaan Garansanoa</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">转达Garansanoa的请求</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_urga.ntk_1_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Deliver Garansanoa's message</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menyampaikan pesan dari Garansanoa</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">转达Garansanoa的讯息</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_urga.ntk_1_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask if he needs any help</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya apakah ada yang bisa dibantu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问他是否需要帮忙</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_urga.ntk_1_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Tell him the result</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Melaporkan hasil</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">告知结果</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_urga.ntk_1_0_6">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Urga's Call</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Panggilan Urga</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">Urga的呼喊</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_urga.ntk_1_0_7">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Urga's Test</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Urga's Test</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">Urga的测试</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_urga.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Well, unless it is a delicious salmon but… Yeahy!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Masa? Ikan salmon yang enak itu ya?..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">嗯， 除非它是一条好吃的鲑鱼，不然我是不会…… 噢耶！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_urga.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Sorry</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Meminta maaf</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">抱歉…..</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_urga.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I am Urga. Please observe good manners next time.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Namaku Urga. Lain kali yang lebih sopan ya..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我叫做 Urga。下次请您注意态度，保有礼貌。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_urga.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_urga.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Oh, you must mean what we have talked about last time. I saw a man and two woman wandering around the tower. They were headed south..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Aaa yang kemarin itu? Aku lihat satu laki-lagi dan dua perempuan itu di sekitar menara. Mereka ke arah selatan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">喔你是说上次说过的那件事呀，我有看过一名男子和两名女子在塔的附近徘回，他们往南边走了说…</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_urga.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_urga.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Well my memories are really vague since it has been a very long time. I believe it was about time when my friends got violent.. Go towards Foundation Patrol Center from here, if there is a priest who has not lost the consciousness, she might know more .</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sudah lama sekali, jadi aku ngga ingat.. waktu itu teman-temanku sangat agresif sekali. Coba pergi ke arah College of Nursing, mungkin disana masih ada yang masih selamat dan belum hilang kesadarannya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">好久的事了记不太得了，是我朋友变粗暴的那时候… 你要不要往财团镜湖台那去看看？如果还没发疯的黑羽祭司还在的话，他可能会知道</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_urga.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_urga.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I've tried to persuade my friends but they wouldn't listen..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Teman-teman sadah dinasehati, tapi tak pernah menghiraukan..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">就算我想说服朋友，他们也不会听我的…</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_urga.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_urga.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Please rest in piece..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Selamat tinggal…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">请安息</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_urga.ntk_7_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_urga.ntk_8_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I'm glad you are coming. I just want to help you earn new power. Pass my exam and you'll get new sphere to learn the power.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya merasa senang kamu datang. Saya hanya ingin membantu kamu mendapatkan kekuatan baru. Selesaikan ujian dan kamu akan mendapatkan sphere untuk mempelajari kekuatan baru.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">谢谢你来找我呀。没什么特别的事，想要帮助你获得新能力才叫你来的....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">如果通过试炼可以获得新力量的灵珠</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_urga.ntk_8_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_urga.ntk_9_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Eliminate Priest of Destruction in Cplx Basement or St.Research Cplx.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalahkan Priest of Destruction di Cplx Basement atau St. Research Cplx.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">请消灭位在Cplx Basement 或是St.Research Cplx的 Priest of Destruction。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_0_urga.ntk_9_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_busdriver1.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">... Hmm...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">... Hmm...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">…..嗯…….</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_busdriver1.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Talk to the Bus Driver</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mendengarkan cerita</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">与Bus Driver进行对话</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_busdriver1.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Bus Driver's Request</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mendengarkan permintaan Bus Driver</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">Bus Driver的请求</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_busdriver1.ntk_1_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Give the Spare Parts</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menyerahkan Genuine Parts</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">交付零件</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_busdriver1.ntk_1_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Bus Driver's 2nd Request</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mendengarkan permintaan kedua Bus Driver</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">Bus Driver的请求2</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_busdriver1.ntk_1_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask if he needs help</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tanya apa dia butuh bantuan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问他是否需要帮忙</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_busdriver1.ntk_1_0_6">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Tell him what happened</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Beritahu apa yang terjadi</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">报告结果</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_busdriver1.ntk_10_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Excuse me. Would you be so kind to help me acquire some spare parts from the Technical Teacher located near the college Crossroads so that I can get this bus moving again?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Maaf sebelumnya, maukah kalian mengambilkan genuine part dari Technical Teacher di sekitar perempatan sekolah?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Supaya bus dapat digunakan dan pelajar pun menjadi lebih terbantu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">不好意思，您可以帮我从Technical Teacher那儿要一点零件过来吗？ 他就在学院交叉路口那里。唯有如此我才能修好公车，使它发动成功！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_busdriver1.ntk_11_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">"Have you ever been to SG Hole? If so then you must have met those inferior Green Mask (Uncle Potato). Because of their threats I am afraid to drive the bus.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">If you can please defeat them and scare them away."</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Apa kamu pernah ke SG Hole ? Jika iya, kamu pasti pernah bertemu dengan Green Mask. Karena kelakuannya, Saya jadi takut untuk mengendarai bus.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bisakah kamu mengalahkannya?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">您有去过SG Hole了吗？如果有去过的话，那您一定有见过那些坏心的 Green Mask (Uncle Potato)。因为他们威胁我，甚至想我勒索。因此我连公车都不敢开了。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">如果可以的话，请您帮我打退他们。好吗？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_busdriver1.ntk_11_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_busdriver1.ntk_12_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Thanks! Now I will be able to drive this bus around.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Terima kasih! Sekarang saya merasa jauh lebih tenang.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">谢谢您，现在我终于可以开公车载学生上下学了。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_busdriver1.ntk_12_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_busdriver1.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">....</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_busdriver1.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ha ha! Yes, you can commute on the school bus. It's better than travelling by foot!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">hoho…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tentu saja, naiklah Bus.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Andai saja busnya bisa digunakan pasti akan sangat mudah berpergian, sekarang harus berlari deh.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">哈哈！是的。您可以利用校车来通勤。搭车比步行的方式好太多了。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_busdriver1.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_busdriver1.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Oops! I'm sorry! I didn't know you were there!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I've been very busy trying to find out what the hell is wrong with this wreck!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Euhm, sebentar</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">噢！我很抱歉，我不知道您在这儿！ 我正忙着找出这些不对劲的原因。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_busdriver1.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask What He is Doing</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya apa yang harus dilakukan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问他在做什么？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_busdriver1.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Oh! This bus is unoperational. I can't even get this thing to work. I really need to fix this bus so that the students can travel safely. It's dangerous to just walk around with all the chaos in the outskirts.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It's too bad there aren't any spare parts available to fix this thing.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Euhm, kenapa nieh bis nggak mau jalan sieh?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Yah….. partnya juga nggak ada, gimana nieh?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">噢！这台公车无法使用。连我都无法用它来进行工作。我得把它修好，这样学生们才能安全使用。毕竟在这混乱地区独自行走，是非常危险的事情。但现在没有修理用的零件，情况真糟糕。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_busdriver1.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask the Driver more about Bus</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang bus</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问Driver关于更多的公车情报</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_busdriver1.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Based on my assessment of this wreckage, I can say that repairing this bus shouldn't be a major problem. The spare parts required to repair this vehicle, however, need to be acquired as soon as possible. I can't repair this bus unless I can get all the necessary spare parts.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bukan rusak yang berat…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tidak ada genuine partnya jadi tidak bisa dibetulin?!..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">根据公车残骸的报告评估，我可以说，修理这辆车不应该是个大问题。修复此车所需的零件，需要尽快收集到才行。在我能得到所有必要的配备之前，我是无法进行修理的。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_busdriver1.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_busdriver1.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Thank you for bringing the spare parts I need. I can finally start repairing this wreck.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The students can use the bus to conveniently move from one area to another once I'm done fixing it.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Naah, ini genuine part yang dicari</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Akhirnya sekarang bisa juga dibetulin</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sekarang para pelajar pun bisa naik bus dan berpergian dengan mudah</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">谢谢您带来我要的零件了！我终于可以开始修 破损的公车了！从现在起，学生们往来其他地区间时，会更加的方便与安全唷！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_busdriver1.ntk_7_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Bus Driver's 2nd Request</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mendengarkan permintaan kedua Bus Driver</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">Bus Driver的请求2</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_busdriver1.ntk_8_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Please visit the Construction Supervisor located near the crossroads of the Sacred Gate Campus. I heard he has a favor to ask from me, but I can't visit him myself because of this bus problem.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mau tidak pergi kepada Construction Supervisor yang ada di sekitar perempatan sekolah?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ada pekerjaan yang sulit sehingga dia memanggil, karena bus tidak jalan jadi aku susah pergi kesana…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">请您去拜访Construction Supervisor，他位在Sacred Gate Campus的交叉路那儿。我听说他想请我帮忙，但我无法去找他，因为我得处理公车的问题。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_busdriver1.ntk_9_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The problem with the bus started a few days ago, and it's been getting worse since then. The bus won't even move at all now. It seems that the other buses in the area are having similar problems.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sejak beberapa hari lalu kondisi bus tiba-tiba mulai aneh, bahkan sekarang tidak bergerak sama sekali…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bus-bus yang lainnya juga tidak kelihatan, mungkin terjadi masalah yang sama.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">几天前开始，公车就故障了。而且越来越严重，连发动都成问题了。好像此地区的其他公车也都有类似的问题。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_busdriver1.ntk_9_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_busteminal.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">This is the Bus Stopl.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Once have your Bus Ticket ready, you can use the Bus Service to move to another area.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Informasi rute bus kota</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Untuk menggunakan bus cukup menunjukan tiket</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">公车站</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_busteminal.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ride the bus.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Naik Bus</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">搭乘公车</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_busteminal.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ride the bus.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Naik Bus</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">搭乘公车</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_busteminal.ntk_1_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Trade Items</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Beli tiket</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">交易物品</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_busteminal.ntk_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">This is the Bus Stop.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Once have your Bus Ticket ready, you can use the Bus Service to move to another area.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Informasi rute bus kota</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Untuk menggunakan bus cukup menunjukan tiket</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这里是公车站。只要您拥有Bus Ticket ，就可以使用公车服务，畅游各地区唷。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_busteminal.ntk_1_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ride the bus.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Naik bus</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">搭乘公车</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_busteminal.ntk_1_1_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Trade Items</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Beli tiket</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">交易物品</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_busteminal.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You can't take bus, now.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bus sedang rusak, untuk sekarang bus tidak bisa digunakan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Maaf untuk ketidak nyamanan ini</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">您现在无法使用公车服务。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_busteminal.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_circleroom_1.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">This Terminal controls the entrance and exit to the Society Room.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Terminal Society Room</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mengatur akses keluar masuk Society Room</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这个终端机掌控着 Society Room的出入口机能。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
