    <VALUE Lang="cn">终端机正常运作中</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_circleroom_1.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_circleroom_1.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The Force Field mechanism of this Terminal is running properly.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You'll need Spiritual Spheres to optimize the Force Field function of this Terminal. You are required to gather 12 Spiritual Spheres to complete this Terminal's Force Field optimization.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pengoperasian Force Field di Terminal berfungsi secara normal</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Untuk mendapatkan hasil dari Force Field kumpulkanlah Spiritual Sphere dan dapatkan autentikasi, dibutuhkan 12 buah</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">终端机的结界机能正常运作中。您需要12颗灵珠才能通过认证，并得到结界的能量。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_circleroom_1.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_circleroom_1.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Force Field optimization completed!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Please move to the next Terminal to optimize the remaining Force Fields.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Autentikasi Force Field telah selesai</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jika sisa autentikasi Force Field telah selesai hasilnya bisa di dapatkan dan untuk autentikasi Force Field berikutnya harap gunakan terminal yang sesuai</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">本结界认证已结束。请前往下个终端机，并完成结界认证。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_circleroom_1.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_circleroom_1.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">There are evil spirits roaming inside the Society Room.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The mobs of monsters possessed by these spirits are causing strange effects to their surroundings.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Please try your best to eliminate them.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Para Roh Jelmaan sedang beraksi di dalam Society Room</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Roh Jelmaan ini dapat mempengaruhi situasi disekelilingnya. Tolong bersihkan Roh Jelmaan ini sebelum terjadi hal yang lebih buruk</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">许多恶灵在 Society Room里徘徊游荡。被这些恶灵所附着的怪物身上有着不良物质，导致周遭环境出现奇怪现象。请您尽全力处理掉怪物。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_circleroom_1.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_circleroom_1.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The target amount required for purification has been achieved and verified.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Thank you for your efforts.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Konfirmasi target pembersihan musuh telah selesai</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Terima kasih atas kerja keras kalian</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">已经确认了目标物与其数量净化的完成。 谢谢您，辛苦您了。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_circleroom_1.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_circleroom_1.ntk_9_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The priority targets of this area are the Elite Fencers. Please help eliminate 30 Elite Fencer targets.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Di lokasi ini targetnya adalah Elite Fencer</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jatuhkan 30 orang</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">此地的首要净化对象为Elite Fencer。请除掉30只Elite Fencer，维持良好校园风气。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_circleroom_1.ntk_9_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_cleaner1.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I'm not sure how the streets got to be this dangerous. I'm so lucky to have found a safe place to hide!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Sheesh! I really don't know what'll happen to me if I'm not careful.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Entah mengapa wilayah sekitar sini menjadi seperti ini</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Beruntung kamu masih bisa bernafas disini</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jika saja kamu ada saat itu, tidak tahu apa yang akan terjadi sekarang…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我不懂街道为何会变成这幅模样？</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我算幸运的了，至少可以躲到这里。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">稍微一不注意，可能连我也会遭殃的。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_cleaner1.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">What are you talking about?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya siapa anda</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">您在说什么？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_cleaner1.ntk_1_0_10">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about Freezing Halogen</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang Freezing Halogen</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问Freezing Halogen的事情</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_cleaner1.ntk_1_0_11">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Tell him what happened</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Memberitahukan apa yang terjadi</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">告诉他事情的真相</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_cleaner1.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Listen to Cleaner's Advice</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mendengarkan nasihat Cleaner</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">听取Cleaner的忠告</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_cleaner1.ntk_1_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Delivering Recycled Trash</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menyerahkan item-item Recycle</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">传达回收型垃圾</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_cleaner1.ntk_1_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Deliver Recycled Trash</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menyerahkan item-item Recycle</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">传达回收型垃圾</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_cleaner1.ntk_1_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Exchange a Green Pearl for a Red Pearl.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tukar Green Pearl dengan Red Pearl.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">用 Green Pearl 兑换 Red Pearl。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_cleaner1.ntk_1_0_6">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Exchange a Blue Pearl for a Green Pearl</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tukar Blue Pearl dengan Green Pearl</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">用 Blue Pearl 兑换 Green Pearl。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_cleaner1.ntk_1_0_7">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Exchange a Green bead for 5 red beads.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tukar Green bead dengan 5 red beads.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">用 Green bead 兑换5个 red beads。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_cleaner1.ntk_1_0_8">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Exchange a Blue Bead for 25 Red beads.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tukar Blue Bead dengan 25 Red beads.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">用 Blue Bead 兑换 25个 Red beads。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_cleaner1.ntk_1_0_9">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Exchange a Red bead.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tukar Red bead.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">兑换1个 Red bead。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_cleaner1.ntk_10_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Thank you!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Terima kasih</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">谢谢您！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_cleaner1.ntk_10_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_cleaner1.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">...</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_cleaner1.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You still have no idea after seeing it?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Things suddenly got weird while I was cleaning the streets.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Nggak lihat? Kan jadi begini sewaktu bersih-bersih di daerah sini~</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">看了这景象之后，您还无法明白市发生了什么事情了吗？当我在清扫街道时，事情就变得非常不对劲了。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_cleaner1.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_cleaner1.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ever since these events happened, we never had the chance to run away.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">No one is left to do the cleaning up till now.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Dahulu walaupun dibersihkan setiap hari, pengumpulan item-item Recycled pun juga dilakukan setiap hari</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sekarang jangankan bersih-bersih, saya sibuk melarikan diri kesana kemari</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">从那件事情发生之后，我们一直没有机会逃走。到现在没有一个人愿意留下来做打扫……。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_cleaner1.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_cleaner1.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Thank you very much! I'm so sorry for bothering you.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">We really have to treasure all kinds of resources. I'll ask for your help later in case you have any spare time to assist me.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I'll give you something nice if you collect any of my available items.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Terima kasih untuk kerja keras kalian para pelajar</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Gunakan material secukupnya, nanti jika waktu memungkinkan mohon bantuannya lagi</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Hanya dengan mengumpulkan dan datang saja aku akan menggantikannya dengan yang lain</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">真的很谢谢您。如果您有空，往后也请多多指教。只要您收集我所需要的东西过来，我就会兑换珍奇异宝给您。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_cleaner1.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_cleaner1.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Wow! This Blue Pearl is a very valuable item. Please choose any item here in exchange for this Blue Pearl.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Coba lihat…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Spiritual Speheres yang itu memiliki nilai yang cukup tinggi…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Nah, pilihlah item yang diinginkan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">哇!!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这颗青珠一定有他的价值，请选择要换取的东西吧</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_cleaner1.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Exchange Burr</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tukar Burr</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">换取 Burr</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_cleaner1.ntk_6_0_10">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Exchange Fine Silver</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tukar Fine Silver</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">换取 Fine Silver</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
