    <VALUE Lang="cn">换取 Fine Iron</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_cleaner1.ntk_8_0_9">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Exchange Silver</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tukar Silver</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">换取 Silver</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_cleaner1.ntk_9_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">After I gather up the trashes, they would just lay them open again while I do something else just for a second.. So, I have to do it all over again and my back cannot stand it anymore. Please help me!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kami kehilangan trash yang telah kami kumpulkan sebelumnya. Setiap hari mengumpulkan trashes membuat pinggang kami sakit. Tolong bantulah kami.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">去做其它事情之后整理好的垃圾就会被弄乱。所以每次都又要再把垃圾一个一个捡起来所以腰都挺不直了。拜托帮帮我。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_cleaner1.ntk_9_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_extraacti.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Confirm the goal of Extra Activity and carry it out by pressing 'Y' button then you will be able to earn Title which you can add to your name and the activity points. Carry out many Easy Activities and purchase a special item.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tekan tomtol 'Y' untuk melihat misi yang diberikan. Hadiah berupa badge dan activity point akan diberikan kepada siswa yang menyelesaikan misi ini. Kumpulkan point dan cobalah beli item khusus dengan point itu.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">利用快捷键'Y'接收任务确认特​​别活动的目标，即可获得称号和活动点数。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">可以先试试看进行低阶活动购买特殊的道具</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_extraacti.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Trade Items</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jual-beli item</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">交易物品</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_gichogwahak1.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The Terminal located in the Basic Science Classroom is not functioning properly.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Please attend to this problem immediately.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Terminal Basic Science Classroom</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saat ini di dalam sekolah terjadi kesalahan perhitungan, tolong diperhatikan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">Basic Science Classroom终端机，现在因为学院里面电脑错误无法正常运转。请留意。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
