  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_gichogwahak1.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Due to the errors found in the School's</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Information Center System,</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">the Information Room has all the available information contained within these 2 files.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">We will restore all necessary information</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">as soon as we resolve the situation.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">For the meantime, you can stay</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">and browse through these two documents.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Karena kerusakan yang terjadi pada sitem data base di dalam sekolah, hanya 2 buah data yang tersimpan di Information Room saat ini.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kami akan berusaha untuk meperbaiki kerusakan secepatnya.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Apakah kamu ingin membaca 2 data tadi?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">因为学院资料库系统故障，资料室现在只能储存2份档案。我们会尽快复原所有重要的资料。请稍微阅读一下这份文件，好吗？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_gichogwahak1.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about the Sword Section Student named Chi Ri Qing</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pencarian data tentang Chi Ri Qing dari kelas Sword</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问关于剑道部学生 Chi Ri Qing。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_gichogwahak1.ntk_2_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about the Archery Section Student named Cheng Xi Zhi</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pencarian data tentang Cheng Xi Zhi dari kelas Archery</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问关于弓箭部学生 Cheng Xi Zhi。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_gichogwahak1.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Chi Ri Qing is a Sacred Gate Campus 2nd Year Student. He is a former Trainee of the Sword Section Class. His background is very interesting: both of his parents died in a chaotic incident.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Since then, he left the school carrying out his own investigation about the incident.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">If you have seen or have any information about this student, please contact the Administration Office immediately.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sacred Gate School kelas 2</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pelajar training kelas Sword</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Keahliannya menggambar sketsa orang</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kedua orang tuanya meninggal karena kecelakaan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sekarang sedang melakukan penyelidikan di luar sekolah</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Apabila telah ditemukan harap segera melaporka</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">Chi Ri Qing是Sacred Gate Campus2年级的剑道部修练生。双亲都因为事故而死亡，现在离开学院，单独进行调查。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">万一您有发现新情报的话，请您跟Administration Office连络。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_gichogwahak1.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_gichogwahak1.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Cheng Xi Zhi is a 2nd Year student from the Sacred Gate Campus, and a former trainee of the Archery Section. Both of her parents died in the catastrophic phenomenon that caused the major problems in our world. She is now using her Evil Spirit to find her mutated older sister.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">This student has important information regarding the location of Leonair Campus. We must get in contact with her immediately.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sacred Gate School kelas 2</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pelajar training kelas Archery</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kedua orang tuanya meninggal karena kecelakaan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saat ini dia sedang beraktivitas mencari kakaknya yang telah menjadi Roh Jelmaan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ada kabar bahwa lokasi Leonine School telah diketahui, de</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">Cheng Xi Zhi是Sacred Gate Campus2年级的弓箭部修练生。双亲都因事故而亡，现在以复制灵追寻已变异的姐姐，单独进行中。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_gichogwahak1.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_gichogwahak1.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">There are no means of keeping this Terminal functioning properly.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saat ini terminal tidak berfungsi dengan baik</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">现在终端机的​​机能没有办法正常运作</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
