  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_guard1.ntk_10_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Make sure you stop and never pass through the crossroads in front.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">There are a lot of weird dogs loitering that area, and no one knows where they came from.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It would be safer to travel along the left or right corner streets.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Honestly, I'm not very familiar with the other roads because I've never actually passed by them before.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau ada perempatan jangan lurus terus</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mengapa ada begitu banyak anjing aneh…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Untuk jalan pulang sebaiknya ambil jalan ke kiri ataupun ke kanan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Selebihnya aku tak tahu, karena belum pernah mencobanya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">千万不要从前面交叉路街直行</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">那里有很多狗狗阿</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">绕左边或右边的路走大概会好点</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">但是我也没走过 所以不太确定唷</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
