  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_guard1.ntk_13_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">직접 본 적은 없으니까 녹색 구슬이라는 것 밖에는 알 수가 없군</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">더 자세한 건 '학생주임'님께 여쭈 보면 알 수 있지 않을까</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">직접 본 적은 없으니까 녹색 구슬이라는 것 밖에는 알 수가 없군</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">더 자세한 건 '학생주임'님께 여쭈 보면 알 수 있지 않을까</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">직접 본 적은 없으니까 녹색 구슬이라는 것 밖에는 알 수가 없군</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">더 자세한 건 '학생주임'님께 여쭈 보면 알 수 있지 않을까</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_guard1.ntk_13_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_guard1.ntk_14_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Having these fellahs around is like my own personal hell, I tell ya!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Karena mereka keadaan jadi gawat~</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">因为那群家伙, 所以代志大条啦</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_guard1.ntk_14_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about What Happened</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya apa yang terjadi</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问发生何事了？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_guard1.ntk_14_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about the Situation Outside</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang bagian luar</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问外头的现况</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_guard1.ntk_14_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask for Useful Information</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang informasi yang bermanfaat</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问实用的情报</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_guard1.ntk_14_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_guard1.ntk_15_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You mean the mail from the Headquarters of the Finance Department?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Hmm...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I actually had that document earlier, but I'm not sure where I placed it.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ah! It's here.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It looks like a simple document, but this was personally requested by the Student Director.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I think he has very little trust in the students.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">What's important is that the document is still here.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kiriman pos dari kantor pusat yayasan?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ya, kiriman seperti itu memang ada</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">aku meletakannya di sekitar sini…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ah! Ini dia!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bukan hal yang penting ya? Biasanya Student Director datang langsung untuk mengambilnya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Atau mungkin dia sangat memperc</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">从财团本部那里来的邮件吗？</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这个嘛，本来有那种邮件的不知道放在这的哪里了。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">阿 在这里！</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">看来似乎不太重要，但是Student Director有亲自过来拿。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">他大概只相信学生到某种程度而已，</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">呵呵 总之在这里呀。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_guard1.ntk_15_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_guard1.ntk_16_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Goodness! I almost forgot...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I should have told you at the very beginning. I was thinking of asking you to do something.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I wasn't aware of the full extent of the chaos caused by these weird mobs on the campus grounds and the surrounding area. That is why I'm staying here.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Not so long ago, the note written by the Health Advisor that the Blood Drinker requested was stolen.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I'm sorry for bothering you, but may I know if you've found the stolen note?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Benar-benar deh…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mulanya aku kira hanya mendengarkan permintaan yang ringan saja…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mana aku tahu kalau situasi di luar sekacau ini</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Terus pas sudah keluar dari sekolah, aku malah tidak bisa masuk lagi soalnya banyak orang-orang aneh yang membuat k</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">哎呀, 我忘记了….</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">起初没想这么多, 本来想要拜托你的...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我不知道外头如此混乱，再加上不知道出来外面、或是学院里面都会有奇怪的人从某处冒出来为非作歹，所以根本无法再进入...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">不久前向那群名叫Blood Drinker的恶棍找到了Health Advisor所写的便条纸并抢走。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">有点不好意思, 请问学生找不到那张便条纸吗？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_guard1.ntk_16_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_guard1.ntk_17_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Well, I'll be...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">This is the note!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Thanks for finding it.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Even though you found this note, there are still bigger problems that we've got to deal with.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Benar, kertas catatanya yang ini!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Terima kasih ya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tapi kembalinya kertas catatan ini juga menjadi masalah…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">没错 就是这便条纸</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">同学, 谢啦.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">但是就算找回这便条纸问题还是在呀</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_guard1.ntk_17_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_guard1.ntk_17_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Guard's 2nd Request</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mendengarkan permintaan Security kedua</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">Guard的请求2</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_guard1.ntk_18_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Please consider helping me out by delivering this medicine to the Health Advisor.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The Health Advisor has ordered the recovery of the first-aid medicine several times. We need that medicine back as soon as possible.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Please accept my request for your help again.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">There are these fellahs known as the Blood Drinkers that rob people who possess the medicine. It's pretty clear that these Blood Drinkers have the medicine. Please make sure they can't rob people of their medicine again.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau dipikir-pikir apakah aku akan mampu membawa Medicines itu kembali?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Medicines ini sangat dibutuhkan olah Nurse Trainee, dapatkanlah Medicines tersebut secepatnya…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Disana,,</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Dengarkan permintaanku sekali lagi ya tolong…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sesaat yang lalu Bla</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">仔细一想, 我有可能经过那家伙取得药品吗？</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">Health Advisor千叮咛万嘱咐说要尽快取得急救药品...那, 同学.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">再接受我一个请求。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">刚刚看见那群叫 Blood Drinkers的家伙从别人手上抢走类似的药品。如此招摇的拥有这些药品，难保不会再被抢走吧？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_guard1.ntk_18_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_guard1.ntk_19_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Oh! You found them all!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Thank you very much!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Please take all this medicine to the Health Advisor now.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The people causing trouble on campus are preventing me from bringing this medicine to the Health Advisor.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Wow, benar-benar sudah didapatkan semuanya!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Terima kasih banyak ya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sekarang bisakah kamu antar Medicines ini kepada Nurse Trainee?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tidak ada jalan lain kah, selain aku yang mengantarkannya langsung?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bahkan di dalam sekolah pun mereka berbuat k</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">喔, 真的都找齐哩！</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">真是谢谢你 ​​学生！</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">现在就把这药品拿去给Health Advisor吧！</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">虽然我得直接拿过去, 不过没有其他办法了吗?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">学院里头也有那些人在胡作非为。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_guard1.ntk_19_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_guard1.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">.....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">.....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">.....</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_guard1.ntk_20_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Hmm? Did the Health Advisor like it?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Oh! He did?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You see those fellahs, especially those Ardee Boys, getting more reckless? Trust me, you wanna stay away when they start waving around those daggers.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">So you might see all sorts of folk carrying around daggers dripping with fresh blood, but you don't need to be that afraid of them. Now those Ardee Boys, on the other hand, are dangerous! Do me a favor, and help me by taking those knives away from the Ardee Boys. It's probably impossible to get all their daggers, but I think getting 10 Daggers from them shouldn't be a problem.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Emm, apakah Nurse Trainee menyukainya?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tentu…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Namun, para bandit itu membuat masalah disini</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Terutama para Henchman sambil mengayunkan pedangnya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Entah bagaimana pedang tersebut sangat tidak enak dilihat</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">aku tidak takut tertusuk pedang itu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">
    </VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">嗯, 好吧, Health Advisor还满意吗?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">是阿…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">但是那群家伙在这里更会乱来。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">特别是那群叫啥Ardee Boys的家伙正挥舞着刀。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">总之是因为刀子而心情不好，也不一定是怕那刀子啦。即使大家都带着沾血的东西，也不可能跟那群家伙一样。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">学生 再拜托你最后一次！</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">帮我抢那些刀来！</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">虽然不可能抢走全部，不过我想夺得10把应该不是问题。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_guard1.ntk_20_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_guard1.ntk_21_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Sorry for troubling you like this, but I really appreciate your hard work, especially since it's making our campus much safer.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I'm really impressed by your performance. I'll be sure to commend you for all the good you've done for me if I ever meet your teachers again.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Terima kasih untuk kalian semua</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Walaupun sedikit, namun bisa mengurangi tingkat bahaya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ini adalah jasa kalian~</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Nanti kalau bertemu guru akan aku sampaikan tentang masalah ini</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">学生 每次麻烦你 真是感谢</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">虽然是小忙 不过可以减少危险呀</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">学生的功劳真大</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">以后遇见老师会记得夸赞学生的喔</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_guard1.ntk_21_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_guard1.ntk_22_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I heard that there's more of those capital items around.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You can learn more about the rumor through the campus's crossroads there~</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Nggak kayak dulu akhir-akhir ini banyak item-item praktis yang muncul</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jadi para pelajar sekarang punya banyak waktu luang</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tidak pernah terpikirkan untuk menemukan kembali fungsi-fungsi yang hilang</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ada rumor yang mengatakan benda itu ada di peremp</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">和以往不一样，听说在最近有许多更便利的东西已出现~</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">因为太便利，而让人多出很多闲暇的时间,</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">那过程中， 因为功能下降，所以就算遗失也不会想找回来</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">在学园的十字路口，那样地事情时常可见，甚至只要随意找寻就可以发现这些传闻</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_guard1.ntk_22_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_guard1.ntk_23_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I hear that item's very small and easy to lose.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Search for the people that came back from the dead on Leonair Campus and talk to them.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You might get some useful information from him</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Hal yang membuat nyaman itu sangat kecil sehingga mudah hilang…dan mudah terjatuh…Khususnya pada saat berlari karena dikerjar oleh sesuatu, benda itu jatuh tanpa kita sadari</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Aku juga mendengar kalau ada orang-orang yang memungut item yang terjatuh itu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">那便利的东西因为太小，所以容易丢掉…也容易失去... 特别是被敌人追赶而逃跑的时候，在不知不觉的情况下都可能会遗落或损坏时~</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">那样的东西，是从那些家伙们的聊天的话中听到的，</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">Leonair Campus的盗墓人，听说主要是那样的家伙们干的, 去找寻并追究那些家伙的话，说不定还可以发现些事实。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_guard1.ntk_23_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_guard1.ntk_24_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I hear that item's very small and easy to lose.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Search for the people that came back from the dead on Leonair Campus and talk to them.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You might get some useful information from him.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Hal yang membuat nyaman itu sangat kecil sehingga mudah hilang…dan mudah terjatuh…Khususnya pada saat berlari karena dikerjar oleh sesuatu, benda itu jatuh tanpa kita sadari</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Aku juga mendengar kalau ada orang-orang yang memungut item yang terjatuh itu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">那便利的东西因为太小，所以容易丢掉…也容易失去... 特别是被敌人追赶而逃跑的时候，在不知不觉的情况下都可能会遗落或损坏时~</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">那样的东西，是从那些家伙们的聊天的话中听到的，</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">Leonair Campus的盗墓人，听说主要是那样的家伙们干的, 去找寻并追究那些家伙的话，说不定还可以发现些事实。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_guard1.ntk_24_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_guard1.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Sigh... I don't even know where to begin.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">My situation is a bit complicated because I have to take care of the Health Advisor's request to search for first-aid medicine.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I lost the list of medicines! This is a serious problem…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mungkin iya…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Nurse meminta untuk mencarikan First Aid Kit, tidak dapatkah kalian melakukannya?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ditambah gawat lagi karena saya sudah kehilangan daftar obat yang dibutuhkan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这个嘛</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">因为保健教育生的请求, 所以才外出找急救药品, 结果却变得进退不得不是吗?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">再说记下来的药品列表也不见了, 真是麻烦大了</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_guard1.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_guard1.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">This is the first time in my life that I've encountered a problem that doesn't make any sense at all. I can't even go outside to assess the actual situation.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Where in the hell are these mobs coming from?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Not so long ago, those creatures almost killed me while I was rescuing a friend of mine. I barely died, and I tell ya…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It was horrible!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Aku juga baru keluar sampai depan saja…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Seumur hidup baru aku alami kejadian yang susah dimengerti seperti ini</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sebenarnya darimana orang-orang yang berpenampilan mirip itu muncul…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Beberapa waktu yang lalu aku hampir saja mati gara-gara mereka, u</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我也出不去外面阿这是我生平头一次遇见让我无法理解的事情</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这么多长相类似的东西到底是从哪里冒出来的</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">不久前差点死在那群家伙手里为了救某个朋友好不容易才死里逃生</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_guard1.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_guard1.ntk_4_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about Situation on the Streets</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang jalan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问街道现况</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_guard1.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">.........</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">.........</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">.........</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_guard1.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">하도 정신이 없어서 누군지</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">얼굴도 기억 나질 않는데</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">하여튼 그 친구가 자기 이름이</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">그렇다고 했던 것만 겨우 기억</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">나는군</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">하도 정신이 없어서 누군지</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">얼굴도 기억 나질 않는데</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">하여튼 그 친구가 자기 이름이</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">그렇다고 했던 것만 겨우 기억</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">나는군</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">하도 정신이 없어서 누군지</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">얼굴도 기억 나질 않는데</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">하여튼 그 친구가 자기 이름이</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">그렇다고 했던 것만 겨우 기억</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">나는군</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_guard1.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_guard1.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Hmm...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Let me see. Even though I had a tough time coming here, I don't think I have any other information to tell you.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Wait, hold on for a minute!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">There's this thing called the Abrasive Kit. You can use that item to produce better and stronger equipment for yourself.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Euhm, kalau aku sih disini, yah lagi seperti ini saja…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">O, iya, dengar-dengar ada yang namanya Abrasive Kit</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Katanya itu bisa digunakan untuk membuat peralatan menjadi lebih bagus</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这个嘛我好不容易来这里也不觉得有怎样</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">听说这里有个叫做炼制材的, 利用它, 可以制作更优的装备</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_guard1.ntk_7_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_guard1.ntk_7_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask How to Use Abrasive Kits</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang Abrasive Kit</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问如何制作研磨剂</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_guard1.ntk_8_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Open the Inventory Window and choose the Abrasive Kit. Drag it to the item you want to transform by clicking the top right position of the item, and the item will be upgraded.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You should know that there's a big probability of failure, though.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Please note that items vanish when transformation attempts are unsuccessful.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pertama-tama bukalah inventory dan pilihlah Abrasive Kit , setelah itu pilihlah item yang akan diupgrade lalu klik kanan, maka item itu akan terupgrade dengan sendirinya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">先将道具视窗打开，选择研磨剂后，按一下要改造之物品的右上方就可以进行改造了。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">但是只是说说啦。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">你要先明白，在改造失败的情况下，先前所改造的成果将会全部消失。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_guard1.ntk_8_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_guard1.ntk_9_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">난리도 아니야~</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">여기부터는 최소한 레벨이 35는 돼야 갈 수 있을걸세.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">그러니 그냥 얌전히 돌아가서 연습 좀 더 하고 나오게나.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">난리도 아니야~</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">여기부터는 최소한 레벨이 35는 돼야 갈 수 있을걸세.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">그러니 그냥 얌전히 돌아가서 연습 좀 더 하고 나오게나.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">난리도 아니야~</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">여기부터는 최소한 레벨이 35는 돼야 갈 수 있을걸세.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">그러니 그냥 얌전히 돌아가서 연습 좀 더 하고 나오게나.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
