  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_gwahak_1.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The Force Field Mechanism of the Terminal is running properly. You need Spiritual Spheres to optimize the Force Field.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You'll need 20 Spiritual Spheres to optimize this Terminal.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pengoperasian Force Field di Terminal berfungsi secara normal</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Untuk mendapatkan hasil dari Force Field kumpulkanlah Spiritual Spheres. Dibutuhkan 20 buah</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">终端机的结界功能运转正常。您需要收集20颗灵珠，才能得到结界效果习得的独特认证。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_gwahak_1.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_gwahak_1.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The Force Field Optimization is completed.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Please proceed to the next Terminal to complete the Force Field Authentication Process.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Autentikasi Force Field telah selesai</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jika sisa autentikasi Force Field telah selesai hasilnya bisa di dapatkan dan untuk autentikasi Force Field berikutnya harap gunakan terminal yang sesuai</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">本结界认证已结束。请前往下个终端机，并完成结界认证。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_gwahak_1.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_gwahak_1.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">There are evil spirits roaming around the Science Center. The mobs of monsters that they possess are causing strange effects to their surroundings. Please try your best to eliminate them.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Para Jelmaan sedang beraktivitas di dalam Science Center</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Roh Jelmaan ini dapat mempengaruhi situasi disekelilingnya. Tolong bersihkan Roh Jelmaan ini sebelum terjadi hal yang lebih buruk</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">许多恶灵在Science Center里徘徊游荡。被这些恶灵所附着的怪物身上有着不良物质，导致周遭环境出现奇怪现象。请您尽全力处理掉怪物。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_gwahak_1.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
