    <VALUE Lang="GS">There are evil spirits roaming around the School Sports Field. The mobs of monsters that they possess are causing strange effects to their surroundings. Please try your best to eliminate them.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Para Jelmaan sedang beraktivitas di dalam Science Center</VALUE>
