    <VALUE Lang="GS">Register for Examination to pass through the Main Entrance</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mulai ujian melewati Main Gate</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">申请Main Entrance的通行考验</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_maingate1.ntk_1_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Test the Terminal</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ujian di Terminal</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">终端机测试</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_maingate1.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The Skill Testing Program has been initiated!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The basic purpose of this program is to protect the students, and also serves as a temporary measure for determining when students develop their abilities beyond a certain level.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Good Luck, Students!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Skill Test Program di mulai</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Program ini dibuat untuk melindungi para pelajar dari gangguan dari luar sekolah. Untuk sementara hanya pelajar yang memiliki kemampuan di atas rata-rata saja yang akan dipilih</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">能力试验程式开始</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">此程式从学院外部存在的危险要素开始, 为了要保护学生,是最起码的的限制条件, 为了选出能力确认在一定水准以上的学生, 因而设立的临时方案</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_maingate1.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_maingate1.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The Terminal's force field is running properly.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Authentication is required to enter and exit through the school's Main Gate.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pengoperasian Force Field di Terminal berfungsi secara normal</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tidak bisa semiteman mengakses keluar masuk Entrance. Untuk mengakses keluar masuk harus melakukan autentikasi Skill</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">终端机的结界机能正常运转中</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">没有办法随意出入正门, 为了出入正门必须取得能力的认证</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_maingate1.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Register for Examination to pass through the Main Entrance</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ujian melewati Entrance</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">申请Main Entrance的通行考验</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_maingate1.ntk_3_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_maingate1.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The Terminal is running properly.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Terminal beroperasi secara normal</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">终端机正常运作中。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_maingate1.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_maingate1.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">시험의 내용은 20분 내에 씨름부원 10명을 쓰러트려 능력을 인정받는 것이며, 시험 진행중 사망하거나 포기할 경우 재시도할 수 있습니다</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">씨름부원의 정보는 다음과 같습니다</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">시험의 내용은 20분 내에 씨름부원 10명을 쓰러트려 능력을 인정받는 것이며, 시험 진행중 사망하거나 포기할 경우 재시도할 수 있습니다</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">씨름부원의 정보는 다음과 같습니다</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">시험의 내용은 20분 내에 씨름부원 10명을 쓰러트려 능력을 인정받는 것이며, 시험 진행중 사망하거나 포기할 경우 재시도할 수 있습니다</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">씨름부원의 정보는 다음과 같습니다</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_maingate1.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">다음으로</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">다음으로</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">다음으로</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_maingate1.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">체력 : 1200</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">공격력 : 65~105</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">방어력 : 35</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">약점 : 공격력이 강하지만 속도가 느리므로 공격 동작 사이에 밀어내기가 가능한 스킬을 써서 견제한다면 유리하게 이끌 수 있습니다</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">체력 : 1200</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">공격력 : 65~105</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">방어력 : 35</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">약점 : 공격력이 강하지만 속도가 느리므로 공격 동작 사이에 밀어내기가 가능한 스킬을 써서 견제한다면 유리하게 이끌 수 있습니다</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">체력 : 1200</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">공격력 : 65~105</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">방어력 : 35</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">약점 : 공격력이 강하지만 속도가 느리므로 공격 동작 사이에 밀어내기가 가능한 스킬을 써서 견제한다면 유리하게 이끌 수 있습니다</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_medic_1.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Let me check you for injuries.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Apakah ada yang terluka?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">让我看看您哪里受伤？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_medic_1.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about the Strange Person</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang Orang-orang tak dikenal</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问怪人的事情</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_medic_1.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about the Strange Person's Identity</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya siapa anda</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问怪人的身份</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_medic_1.ntk_1_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about the Healing Treatment Situation</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang pengobatan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问治疗状况</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_medic_1.ntk_1_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Nurse's Request</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mendegarkan permintaan Nurse</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">Nurse的请求</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_medic_1.ntk_1_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Give the Medicine</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menyerahkan Medicines</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">药品传达</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_medic_1.ntk_1_0_6">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about the bad adults</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang Bad Man</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问坏人的事情</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_medic_1.ntk_1_0_7">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Tell her what happened</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bercerita tentang hal yang terjadi</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">告诉她事情的始末</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_medic_1.ntk_1_0_8">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Change Save Point</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mengubah titik awal</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">变更开始位置</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_medic_1.ntk_1_0_9">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Trade Items</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jual beli item</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">交易物品</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_medic_1.ntk_10_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Thank you very much!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It's fortunate that there's been a dramatic decrease in the number of sick patients I have to treat. It looks like this medicine should last me quite a while.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Terima kasih sekali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Untungnya para korban juga menurun, dengan stok Medicines ini saya rasa akan cukup</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">真是多谢.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">幸好伤患的数量正在减少, 这些药品暂时应付的过去</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_medic_1.ntk_10_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_medic_1.ntk_11_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">자신보다 센 사람들한테는 먼저 덤비지 않는다거나, 주위에 뛰어다니는 사람들만 먼저 공격하거나, 무기를 들고 있는 사람한테만 덤빈다거나, 또 어떨때는 절대로 먼저 공격하지 않는 타입도 봤어요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">자신보다 센 사람들한테는 먼저 덤비지 않는다거나, 주위에 뛰어다니는 사람들만 먼저 공격하거나, 무기를 들고 있는 사람한테만 덤빈다거나, 또 어떨때는 절대로 먼저 공격하지 않는 타입도 봤어요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">자신보다 센 사람들한테는 먼저 덤비지 않는다거나, 주위에 뛰어다니는 사람들만 먼저 공격하거나, 무기를 들고 있는 사람한테만 덤빈다거나, 또 어떨때는 절대로 먼저 공격하지 않는 타입도 봤어요</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_medic_1.ntk_11_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_medic_1.ntk_12_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">아무래도 그 패턴만 미리 알고 있으면 더 쉽겠죠?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">아무래도 그 패턴만 미리 알고 있으면 더 쉽겠죠?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">아무래도 그 패턴만 미리 알고 있으면 더 쉽겠죠?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_medic_1.ntk_12_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_medic_1.ntk_13_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I never imagined that I'd be doing all of this on my own, but I don't have a choice since there aren't enough people to assist me in treating these patients.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya tidak pernah mengira akan diberi tugas seperti ini</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tapi sekarang tenaga kerjanya sedang kurang jadi setidaknya saya harus menolong</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">当初我也没有想到是做这一类型的事情, 而且现在缺乏人手, 所以我也只好硬着头皮做下去了.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_medic_1.ntk_13_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_medic_1.ntk_14_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The Medicine can be acquired from the Nurse located at the Sacred Gate Ring.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Are you willing to get that medicine for me?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Nurse di Sacred Gate Ring sedang memberikan Medicines</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Maukah kamu mengambilkannya?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">去位于 Sacred Gate Ring的Nurse那边可以拿到药品。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">愿意帮我去拿吗？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_medic_1.ntk_14_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_medic_1.ntk_15_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It's going to be difficult to get help from the hospitals in the neighboring cities because the tunnel is blocked.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jika sampai ke kota sebelah saja, kita bisa mendapatkan bantuan dari Rumah sakit disana. Tetapi ada rumor jika tunnel penghubung mengalami penyumbatan dan tidak bisa di lewati</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mungkin juga kita akan terjebak selamanya disini…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">"虽然可以去隔壁都市的医院取得帮助, 不过听说在那中间的隧道有东西挡住过不去,</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">难怪都被关在这里无法动弹."</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_medic_1.ntk_15_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_medic_1.ntk_16_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Not only is the tunnel full of toxic gas, but all kinds of strange creatures have started living in the tunnel.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ahhaa, dan ada satu berita.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Penyebab penyumbatan di dalam Tunnel itu adalah gas dan para binatang</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">阿, 还有一个消息,</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">隧道里面挡住的东西是不知名的气体跟禽兽</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_medic_1.ntk_16_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_medic_1.ntk_17_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Traveling through the tunnel is going to be really difficult, even if you bring a gas mask. There's a Student from the Combat Section named Zhen, however, that claims to know another way of traveling through the tunnel.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jika masuk ke dalam akan membuat napas menjadi sesak, dan penggunaan alat pernapasan pun juga akan sia-sia saja</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tetapi. Jin pelajar kelas Brawler mengatakan, ada cara untuk melewati Tunnel tersebut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">听说进去的话会无法呼吸，无法久待，连戴防毒面具都没用。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">但是格斗部一个叫[Zhen]的学生，说有某种方法可以经过那地方。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_medic_1.ntk_17_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_medic_1.ntk_18_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">They are just a shameful adults.. You will be able to find Drunkards on the way to Rotary. They could not stop their old habits before the phenomenon. They are stealing rubbing alcohol and I cannot cure the students. I hope someone can stop them.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Orang jahat? Jika pergi ke arah Ring, disana ada para Drunkard. Saya tidak bisa menghilangkan kebiasaan lamaku. Setiap malam saya mencuri alkohol sehingga tidak bisa membantu para pelajar. Jika ada yang mencegahku pasti akan lebih baik.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">真是一个没有出息的大人...朝Rotary的方向走去可见到许多Drunkard酒鬼。可能是发生异变之后，还留着以前的坏习惯。每天晚上把消毒用的酒精偷走让我没办法帮学生消毒。拜托帮帮我阻止这些人！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_medic_1.ntk_18_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_medic_1.ntk_19_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Don't blame yourself! If they had a little piece of human in them then might have tried to cure them but they already are no longer human beings.. Well, anyways, I would be able to sleep at night now. Thank you!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jangan menyalahkan diri sendiri. Jika ada orang lain pasti kamu sudah diobati. Karena tampaknya mereka bukan lah orang sungguhan.. Untungnya hal yang membuatku begadang sudah mulai berkurang. Makasih ya.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">不要太自责了。如果身体还是异常就必须要接受治疗...因为你也变成不正常的人了。不过现在晚上没办法睡觉的情况变少了。谢谢你</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_medic_1.ntk_19_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_medic_1.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">.....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">.....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">.....</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_medic_1.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">They started appearing not too long ago. There was only one at first, but then they started multiplying and spread all over the Campus area.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya juga tidak tahu pasti, namun….</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Melihat perilakunya tampaknya mereka terlihat biasa saja</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">不久前开始出现</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">本来只有一个。但瞬间居然增加了数十数百倍。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">再说对他们而言，连造成『事故』的能力都没有，比起他们， 我......</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_medic_1.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_medic_1.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Yeah, I don't look very well, but I can't help it because of the harsh conditions in this area. I don't have any choice: I have to take care of these medicines and sell them here.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya dikirim oleh Rumah Sakit yang didekat untuk magang</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Aneh ya magang di tempat seperti ini?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">看我的外型就会知道了.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">现在我能做的只有这件事情, 就是在这里管理药品</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_medic_1.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_medic_1.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">여기까지 올 수 있었으니 기본적인 것들은 알고 있을테죠</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">그러니 두 가지만 더 알려드리도록 할까요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">여기까지 올 수 있었으니 기본적인 것들은 알고 있을테죠</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">그러니 두 가지만 더 알려드리도록 할까요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">여기까지 올 수 있었으니 기본적인 것들은 알고 있을테죠</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">그러니 두 가지만 더 알려드리도록 할까요</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_medic_1.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_medic_1.ntk_5_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">'석화'에 대해 묻는다</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">'석화'에 대해 묻는다</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">'석화'에 대해 묻는다</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_medic_1.ntk_5_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">'착란'에 대해 묻는다</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">'착란'에 대해 묻는다</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">'착란'에 대해 묻는다</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_medic_1.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I'm so sorry, but I haven't fully recovered my memory yet. There's a risk of making your injuries worse if I treat them right now. There's no way to tell for sure whether my medical skills will help or harm you.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Do you understand?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mohon maaf, karena saya masih magang…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jika saya memberikan pengobatan, takutnya nanti malah memperparah lukanya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lagipula peralatan dan Medicinesnya pun tidak banyak tersedia</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya akan berusaha agar bisa mengobatinya sebentar lagi</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">不好意思, 我的记忆还是没完全恢复.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">现在帮你治疗的话, 伤口说不定会恶化.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我的医术可能帮助你, 也可能害了你阿</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_medic_1.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_medic_1.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">몸을 돌처럼 단단하게 만들어서 거의 움직일 수 없게 된 상태죠</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">하지만 그만큼 방어력이 올라가 버립니다</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">몸을 돌처럼 단단하게 만들어서 거의 움직일 수 없게 된 상태죠</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">하지만 그만큼 방어력이 올라가 버립니다</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">몸을 돌처럼 단단하게 만들어서 거의 움직일 수 없게 된 상태죠</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">하지만 그만큼 방어력이 올라가 버립니다</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_medic_1.ntk_7_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_medic_1.ntk_8_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">어지러워지는 상태라고 설명할 수 있겠군요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">명중율과 공격력이 반감돼 버려서 공격이 어려워지는 경우인데, '스태미너' 가 적을 때에도 같은 상태가 됩니다</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">어지러워지는 상태라고 설명할 수 있겠군요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">명중율과 공격력이 반감돼 버려서 공격이 어려워지는 경우인데, '스태미너' 가 적을 때에도 같은 상태가 됩니다</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">어지러워지는 상태라고 설명할 수 있겠군요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">명중율과 공격력이 반감돼 버려서 공격이 어려워지는 경우인데, '스태미너' 가 적을 때에도 같은 상태가 됩니다</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_medic_1.ntk_8_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_medic_1.ntk_9_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">We've just run out of medical supplies. What am I going to do? There are people that still need me to give them medical treatment.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I really appreciate that you're here to help.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Akhirnya semua Medicines telah habis~</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Terima kasih karena mau membantu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">刚好药品都用完了怎么办? 刚正在做,</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">您来帮忙真是感谢。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_medic_1.ntk_9_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_s_ex1.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ren-Ren</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">T.T</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">Ren-Ren</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_s_ex1.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">What's the matter?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya apa yang terjadi</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">什么事情？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_s_ex1.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">How are you able to talk to me?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya bagaimana cara mengatakannya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">您用什么方式和我说话的呢？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_s_ex1.ntk_1_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">What can I do to help?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya sebaiknya bagaimana</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我该怎么帮忙？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_s_ex1.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">……………….</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_s_ex1.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">처음으로</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">처음으로</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">처음으로</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_s_ex1.ntk_2_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">물품 매매</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">물품 매매</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">물품 매매</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_s_ex1.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I met the people that came out from Leonine Campus. I clearly recall that someone snuck up and attacked me by surprise after I entered Leonine Campus. What? Why is my corpse still here...?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya diganggu oleh para berandal dari 'Leonine'…'Leonine School'</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya tidak bisa mengingat dengan jelas serangan tiba-tiba ketika memasuki 'Leonine School'</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya tak tahu mengapa mayat saya tetap berada disini</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bagaimana ini…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我有遇见从 Leonine Campus出来的人。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我清楚地记得，有人突然攻击我，然后我进入了狮族校园。什么？为什么我的尸体还在这里......？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_s_ex1.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_s_ex1.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It looks like… I-I've turned into a monster, just like them. I guess I was transported here right after I died.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya pikir saya telah berubah menjadi monster, sama seperti mereka</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Entah bagaimana, sesaat setelah mati saya tiba-tiba sudah disini…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我好像也跟他们一样变成怪物了,</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">在死掉的瞬间被传送到这里来了</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_s_ex1.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_s_ex1.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It's too late to do anything for me now. Just do your best to make sure that nobody else suffers what I had to go through... Hey, and don't hesitate to kill me if you see me again, and I'm transformed into something I don't want to be...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sekarang mungkin sudah terlambat mempersiapkan segala sesuatunya…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mau tidak mau kita harus berusaha untuk mencegah jatuhnya korban jiwa lagi…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jika nanti kamu melihat saya berubah menjadi monster lagi, jangan segan untuk membunuh saya ya…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jika kam</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">现在准备什么都太晚了,</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">只好尽量努力不要再有任何牺牲了...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">还有以后遇见已经变身的我, 不要犹豫, 就杀了我吧</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_s_ex1.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_s_ex1.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I vaguely remember feeling like… I was being cloned? I think there's a lot of clones of me. I don't know how many of my friends were attacked...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya merasakan kalau diri saya bermutasi menjadi banyak</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mungkin tidak lama lagi mungkin saya berubah dan akan menyerang teman-teman</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">而且依稀感觉到我被复制成很多个,</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">不知有多少朋友遭到袭击</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_s_ex1.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_s_ex2.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">...</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_s_ex2.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">What's the matter?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya apa yang terjadi</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">什么事情？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_s_ex2.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">How are you able to talk to me?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya bagaimana cara mengatakannya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">您用什么方式和我说话的呢？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_s_ex2.ntk_1_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">What can I do to help?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya sebaiknya bagaimana</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我该怎么帮忙？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_s_ex2.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">...</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_s_ex2.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_s_ex2.ntk_2_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Trade Items</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jual beli item</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">交易物品</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_s_ex2.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Right, I was killed… I was investigating the park, and… I don't know what it was. Well, whoever or whatever it was, it came from Leonair Campus. All I know is that it killed me. I can't remember anything else…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Aku mati….</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ketika sedang pergi survei ke taman….ada sesuatu yang muncul dari 'Leonine School'</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">aku tidak ingat, namun semuanya…telah mati….</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">没错！我死掉了..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我去公园调查到一半, 不知道从Leonair学院出现什么！！</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">忘记是什么东西了, 但我知道是他们杀了我！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_s_ex2.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_s_ex2.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I'm definitely dead, but I people can still hear me and I can hear them. I'm not very sure what's happening, but it feels like I'm slowly disappearing. I think this is where... I hate admitting this, but I might end up turning into a monster.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Walaupun aku sudah mati, namun aku tetap dapat berbicara, mendengarpun juga bisa</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bagaimananya tidak tahu pasti, namun sedikit-sedikit jiwaku terasa hilang</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mungkin juga karena aku sudah menjadi monster</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我明明就死了却还可以说话, 也听的见...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我不太清楚到底怎么回事, 不过我似乎慢慢在消失中...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">搞不好就这样成为怪物</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_s_ex2.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_s_ex2.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">We need to search for people that can replace us, but first we must stop the things that are coming out from Leonair Campus.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kita harus menemukan orang yang tepat untuk menggantikan kita</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tapi sebelum itu kita harus menghentikan mereka yang keluar dari Leonine Campus</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">要去找可以替代我们的人。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">但在这之前要先阻止从Leonair学院冒出来的东西。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_s_ex2.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_s_ex3.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Sob... Sob~</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Huhuhuhu…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">呜呜呜</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_s_ex3.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">What's the matter?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya apa yang terjadi</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问是什么事情</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_s_ex3.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">How are you able to talk to me?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya bagaimana cara mengatakannya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问怎么可以说话</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_s_ex3.ntk_1_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">What can I do to help?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya sebaiknya bagaimana</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问如何是好</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_s_ex3.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">...</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_s_ex3.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_s_ex3.ntk_2_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Trade Items</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jual beli item</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">物品买卖</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_s_ex3.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I-I don't wanna die…!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">There's still much I need to finish!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I just don't wanna die like this!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya belum mau mati…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Masih banyak hal yang belum dilakukan…!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Aku tidak mau mati seperti ini~!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我还不想死..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">还有好多事情没有做..!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">不想就这样死掉~!"</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_s_ex3.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_s_ex3.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Huh? Of course I'm not dead yet! I-I can still talk to you, and you can hear me, right? Right?!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">There's no way I'm dead. I'm still here!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I-I'm still alive! I have to be!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Oke, saya belum mati, masih bisa bicara!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya belum mati! Masih hidup!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Aku masih hidup~!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这.. 我还没死, 当然可以说话!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我还没死, 还活着!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我还活着</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_s_ex3.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_s_ex3.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I really don't know…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I-I c-can't remember anything now!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It doesn't matter, what I can remember…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I just want you to help me stay alive!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You can still hear me, right?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I definitely can't die! Not now, not like this!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Gak tahu..saya…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sekarang saya gak bisa mengingat apapun…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Namun jika berhasil mengingat alangkah bagusnya ya!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tolong biarkan saya hidup seperti ini!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tak bisa kah kamu mendengarkan suaraku?!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya tidak mau mati!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我..也不知道..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">现在我什么也不记得了..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">不过有没有记忆已经无所谓了</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">让我就这样活下去吧!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">听不到我的声音吗?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我说我不想死</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_s_ex3.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">설마 그 열쇠는...!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">틀림없군 ‘깨달음의 열쇠’야!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">어디서 구한 건지는 모르겠지만 대단한데!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">그 열쇠를 지니고 있다면 이 반지의 주인이 될 수 있다는 얘기지.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">자, 열쇠를 나에게 주고 반지를 받도록 해.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">설마 그 열쇠는...!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">틀림없군 ‘깨달음의 열쇠’야!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">어디서 구한 건지는 모르겠지만 대단한데!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">그 열쇠를 지니고 있다면 이 반지의 주인이 될 수 있다는 얘기지.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">자, 열쇠를 나에게 주고 반지를 받도록 해.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">설마 그 열쇠는...!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">틀림없군 ‘깨달음의 열쇠’야!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">어디서 구한 건지는 모르겠지만 대단한데!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">그 열쇠를 지니고 있다면 이 반지의 주인이 될 수 있다는 얘기지.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">자, 열쇠를 나에게 주고 반지를 받도록 해.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Trade Items</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jual beli item</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">交易物品</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Change Save Point</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mengubah titik awal</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">变更开始位置</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_1_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">반지를 받는다</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">반지를 받는다</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">반지를 받는다</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Looks like you already had it verified at the Administration Office. How was it?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Mmm...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Is that the cassette? It doesn't look very good from here. Hmm, let me take a look.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Baru balik dari konfirmasi di Admin. Office ya?!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Gimana?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Apa? tape?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kondisinya sungguh buruk… coba aku lihat dulu..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">您您似乎已经去Administration Office确认过了，对吗？</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">那边怎么样呢？</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">嗯.. 那就是带子cassette吗？</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">状况似乎不太好。给我看看…</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_1_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Give the Cassette</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Keluarkan Cassette</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">交付卡带</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_1_1_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about the Cassette's Condition</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tanyakan kondisi Cassette</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问卡带的状态</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_1_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Let me have the cassette. I don't think it'll be of any use to you if you hold onto it.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lihat, sekarang tape itu telah menjadi item tak berguna?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Simpan disini dulu sampai kamu berhasil mencari cara untuk memperbaikinya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sekarang mau dibawa juga paling tidak akan berguna…palingan aka n menambah bau saja!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">请把卡带交给我，反正您拿着也没啥用处。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_1_2_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Give the Cassette</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Titipkan Cassette</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">交付卡带</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_1_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">This isn't a place that you can just freely enter.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bukan tempat yang bisa dimasuki semiteman, kembalilah!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这里不是您可以自由进出的地方唷。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
