  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_1_3_7">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I want to enter Leonair Campus.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ingin memasuki Leonine School</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我想进入 Leonair Campus</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_1_3_8">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I want to enter Leonair Campus.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ingin memasuki Leonine School</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我想进入 Leonair Campus</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_1_3_9">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Examination Result Confirmed.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Konfirmasi hasil ujian</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">确认考试结果</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_10_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Correct! This is the leaf I saw before. All the others have mutated, but this one is still the same.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Oh yeah, benar yang ini</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Dahulu daun ini tampak jelas sekali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tapi ini… aneh</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Yang lain telah banyak yang berubah, tapi mengapa ini tidak?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">对, 这没错.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">就是以前资料上看的那个叶子.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">可是这好奇怪, 其他都变了, 怎么这个还是老样子..?"</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_10_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_11_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You are not allowed to enter this area.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Hanya dengan melihatnya sekilas saja kita bisa tahu kita tidak bisa memasuk, ee malah berapi- beraninya?!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">您无法进入此地区。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_11_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_12_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Good!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Now go inside Leonair Campus to understand the real situation.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Oke, kebetulan sekali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Seperti yang aku bilang, aku sekarang tidak bisa kemana-kemana</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pergilah ke Leonine School dan dapatkan kabar tentang situasi disana</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">很好，刚好就这样。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">就像我说的，我现在在这里动弹不得。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">请您进去Leonair Campus里头了解一下大概的状况。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_12_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_13_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">What are these?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Bandages?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Considering how decayed this thing is, I'd say that these came from the corpses.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Apa ini?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bandage?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sudah kotor gini… pasti langsung di ambil dari mayatya?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这是什么? 绷带Bandage?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">而且这腐蚀的状态, 应该是从尸体身上撕下来的吧?"</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_13_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_14_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Even if we only have a little information, the experimental body of the plant will produce an accurate forecast.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">We need to figure out how the dead people over there were reanimated.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Entah bagaimana informasinya sangat kurang</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">prediksi hanya benar sampai tentang Plant Lab. saja, selebihnya…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mengapa orang-orang mati ini masih berkeliaran?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">不管怎么说, 情报都太少了..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">植物实验体跟预测的一样, 不过除此之外的.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">到底什么死掉的家伙会走来走去</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_14_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_15_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Although I'm not an expert on this, I was still able to find many things that were definitely out of place. Figuring out what's going on isn't going to be easy at all.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Walaupun aku bukan seorang expert, namun siapapun yang melihatnya akan beranggapan ini keadaan yang sangat aneh</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kenapa ini kotor sekali, sampai-sampai Headernya pun tak terbaca</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">虽然我不是这一方面的专家, 不过这上面沾有这么多的异物, 只要一看就知道应该很难读取的到吧.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_15_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_16_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The Sacred Financial Group Research Center seems to have the capability to easily recover these things.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It's it a good thing that they have someone who's a specialist on this at the Trading Hole. You need to bring it to him and request for it to be restored.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sepertinya ini bisa diperbaiki dengan mudah di Pusat penelitian Yayasan, tapi sekarang itu tidak mungkin…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kabarnya ada seorang expert di dekat Trading Hole, bawa dan mintalah untuk diperbaiki olehnya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">虽然Sacred Financial Group Research Center可以轻易复原它，但现在却不​​行。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">听说Trading Hole有一位这方面的专家。带去拜托他应该就可以复原了。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_16_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about Sacred Financial Group Research Center</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang research yayasan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问有关 Sacred Financial Group Research Center的事情</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_16_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_17_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ordinary people never seem to understand the things I usually talk about. I guess it's because I learned so much technical knowledge at the Research Center.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Aku seperti orang yang terbuang</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jangan terlalu dipikirkan itu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ini hanya tempat penelitian kecil saja kok</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我好像说了太多废话.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">不要想太多.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">只是因为仅剩单纯的技术研究所了</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_17_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_18_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You need to take the special purpose elevators located on the 3rd floor to reach the underground floors.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You will also need a special ID Card to access the elevators.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mungkin nanti malah merepotkan kamu~</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Untuk ke Basemant 2 hanya bisa dengan elevator</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">dan untuk pergi ke lantai 3 dibutuhkan Special ID Card</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">如果真是如此, 那就麻烦了..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">如果要去地下二楼就要去三楼的专用电梯.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">而且要去三楼的话要有特别的ID卡</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_18_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about Special ID Card</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang Special ID Card</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问特殊ID Card。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_18_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_19_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It was restored successfully!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Even though it took you a long time, I really appreciate your efforts.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Have you seen its contents?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It's better that you don't tell anyone else what you saw and learned for now.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Oh, sudah berhasil memperbaikinya ya?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Walau sedikit lama, tapi makasih untuk usahanya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">By the way…. Sudah lihat kontennya?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sebaiknya kamu tutup mulut tentang semua hal yang kamu lihat ya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">复原成功了.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">虽然花了不少时间, 不过真是辛苦你了.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">说的也是, 看的到内容吧?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">不管看到什么, 暂时还是别说出去比较好</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_19_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Accept Order</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menerima petunjuk</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">接受指示</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_19_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Accept Order</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menerima petunjuk</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">接受指示</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_19_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Accept Order</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menerima petunjuk</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">接受指示</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_19_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Accept Order</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menerima petunjuk</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">接受指示</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_19_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
