    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">....</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_20_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It seems that someone tampered with this tape.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It's like that somebody else viewed the contents of this tape, but as long as it's still viewable, it should be fine.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kondisi tape…. Sedikit aneh</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Apakah kamu menunjukannya kepada orang lain…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">tidak apa-apa kok..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">带子的状态有点怪...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">不会是给谁看过了吧?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">那有什么关系吗?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_20_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_21_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The School Administration Office normally holds the card for safekeeping, and only uses it on special occasions.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You need to get that card and have it duplicated.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Biasanya di tiap-tiap School Admin. Office terdapat Emergency Card yang disimpan disana…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mungkin sekarang hanya ada di Sacred Gate School</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Situasi sedang gawat, sebaiknya cepat pergi untuk mendapatkan salinan Cardnya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">各学院的 Administration Office会保管特殊时刻用的卡片。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">请取得卡片，并复制卡片。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_21_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_22_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Good! This looks like Leonair Campus.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The map and the authentication book both confirm the strange phenomenon in that place.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">That means that you've felt the unbalanced energy corrupting the school.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Iya, ini adalah Leonine School</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Melihat kamu membawa Map dan sertifikat, sepertinya kamu sudah mengerti, mundurlah sebentar</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tidak kah kamu lihat adanya unsur ketidak-seimbangan dari elemen-elemen itu?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">好, 这就是Leonair Campus。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">不但带了地图，就连认证书都一起带过来了。看来您是略有所闻喔。但还是先后退吧。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">你是说看不见从那里面渗出来不均衡的元素吗？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_22_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_23_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Hmmm...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Very Good!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">While I look for someone to replace me, you can go ahead and test your abilities in this area.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bagus…lah..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bagaimanapun aku membutuhkan orang untuk menggantikan aku, ikutilah ujian untuk mengetahui kemampuanmu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">嗯, 很好..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">反正正好需要有人代替我进去, 借机测验一下你的能力吧</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_23_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_24_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You have to prove that you can handle the challenges that lie ahead by defeating 20 Sacred Gate Defenders in 40 minutes.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You can come back to me after you accomplish this feat.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tangkaplah 20 orang Saint Private Guard dalam 20 menit!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Setelah itu baru aku bisa setuju</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">给你40分钟，抓20名Sacred Gate Defender来，我就佩服您。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_24_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_25_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Let me warn you that the electrical attack from these mobs can be lethal. Please be careful.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Oh, hanya untuk saran saja, serang berandalan itu dengan listrik</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我给你一句忠告, 那群家伙的电气攻击厉害的不得了</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_25_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_26_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Whether you like it or not, you have to listen to what I have to ask.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">There's something growing inside Leonair campus. You have to venture inside for me and learn what it is.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Suka atau tidak, kamu harus dengarkan permintaanku</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saat ini di dalam Leonine School terdapat sesuatu aneh</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sudah ada beberapa orang yang masuk untuk mencari tahu penyebabnya, namun pada akhirnya hanya sebuah kekuatan aneh yang muncul</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">不管你讨厌或喜欢，都要听我的请求。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">现在 Leonair campus里面某些东西正在成长。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">已经有几个知道发生什么事情，虽然进去过，却只将那奇怪的气息扩大。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_26_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_27_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Can you tell me what's going on inside? I need more information so that I can make a new Force Field to replace the old one.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You'll need to conduct a thorough observation of the grass and the plants growing on the campus.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jadi, beritahukan apa yang terjadi di dalam sana</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tidak ada cara lain selain menggantikan aku untuk melakukan Force Field</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Di dalam sana terdapat sebuah kolam yang sangat besar… Beberapa tumbuhan terdapat di dalamnya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">那么, 请告诉我里面究竟怎么了?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我说了, 因为我要代替作出结界, 没办法了.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">进去里面看的话, 是草吗? 就是有满满的植物体</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_27_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_28_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Please collect 5 Smallpox leaves for me.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Dari semuanya, dapatkanlah 5 lembar Smallpox Leaves, dan berikan padaku</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">去取得一个叫做Smallpox leave的叶子五片来。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_28_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_29_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">There are ladders inside the campus.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Climb the ladders and pass by a drill ground to take samples of the plant, and then come back.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jika strukturnya masih sama seperti yang dulu, ketika masuk akan menemukan tangga panjang berulang-ulang</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jika menaiki anak tangga itu, kamu akan sampai pada jalan menuju Sports Field. Pergilah sampai sana</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ambil lah beberapa Sample dari sekitar sana</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">如果跟以前的结构一样的话, 一进去会有反覆的阶梯.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">爬完阶梯后, 经过操场会有一条路, 去拿样本回来</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_29_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The Special Agents of the Sacred Financial Group were organized to determine whether the all the recent abnormal phenomena originates from this place.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Aku adalah 'Field Agent' yang meneliti Yayasan saint</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Aku datang untuk menyelidiki penyebab fenomena yang terjadi sekarang ini. Mungkin penyebabnya dari sekitar sini.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">圣财团的调查派遣人员? 确定现在正扩散的异常现象是否从这附近而来</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about Sacred Financial Group</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang Sacred Financial Group</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问关于Sacred Financial Group的事情</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_30_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">So you saw reanimated corpses wandering around campus.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It seems like the situation is worse than we anticipated. It's even more critical that we solve this problem as soon as we can.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Di dalam sana para Corpse sedang berkeliaran?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Walaupun bukan hal yang di luar dugaan, namun hal ini tak begitu bagus</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bagaimanapun dengan sample ini masih belum bisa…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">那里面有尸体走来走去吗?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">虽然不超过预期想像的, 不过状况不是太好.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">总之用这程度的样本看来, 似乎不是可以掌握的状况</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_30_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_31_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Excuse me.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Can you please help me investigate Leonair Campus, and see if the Student director is still alive?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I believe that you'll be able to do this.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Maaf sebelumnya, lakukanlah survei sampai School Admin. Office di Leonine School</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jika Students Director masih hidup, mungkin kamu bisa mendapatkan sedikit petunjuk</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">不好意思请帮我调查一下Leonair Campus。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">还有，请帮我看看是否 Student director 到现在还活着？</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我相信您办得到的。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_31_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_32_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Great!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I'm going to assume that you're capable of accomplishing this task.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Alright, I'm putting my trust in you.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Please be careful!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Beruntunglah….</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertemu orang sepertimu membuatku bisa meminta bantuan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">aku mempercayaimu… berhati-hatilah!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这样就太好了.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">遇见跟你一样的人就可以拜托吧</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">因为信任你, 所以小心点喔</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_32_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_33_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">게다가 이런 구식 기록매체를 아직까지 쓰고 있다니...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">아무래도 전문가에게 보여야 겠는걸, 일단은 내가 보관하고 있도록 하지</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">게다가 이런 구식 기록매체를 아직까지 쓰고 있다니...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">아무래도 전문가에게 보여야 겠는걸, 일단은 내가 보관하고 있도록 하지</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">게다가 이런 구식 기록매체를 아직까지 쓰고 있다니...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">아무래도 전문가에게 보여야 겠는걸, 일단은 내가 보관하고 있도록 하지</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_33_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_34_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">This damage wasn't caused by humidity; these wounds were caused by prolonged exposure to heat.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tampaknya kerusakan ini bukan disebabkan oleh kelembaban</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Dilihat dari depannya, sepertinya luka karena terlalu lama terkena panas..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">并非单纯潮湿所造成的损伤.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这是要在一定的热度下经过很长的时间才会出现的伤口</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_34_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_35_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">If these symptoms persist, your nerves might also be affected!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It's hard for me to say whether that'll happen.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tidak hanya gangguan saluran pernapasan, sistem saraf pun memiliki gejala yang sama, jika benar gejalanya….</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mungkin… saja</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">如果说症状不只呼吸, 就连神经都受到影响的话..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">难说是不是..."</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_35_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_36_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Some people have recently come, asking about that disease.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Verified information suggests that it might be influenced by the experimentation of the plant's body.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Baru-baru ini banyak orang yang datang kesini untuk menanyakan tentang penyakit itu, sampai sebelum mereka kesini data-data telah aku periksa namun…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Entah bagaimana, mungkin ini pengaruh dari Smallpox?!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">最近开始有人询问那个病, 虽然来这之前有确认过资料, 总之好像是植物体实验的影响</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_36_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_37_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I believe that the influence from these plants could not have proliferated unless it was spread through the discharge pipe located at the 2nd floor of Leonair Campus.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tetapi kalau penyebabnya sederhana, tidak mungkin memberikan pengaruh sejauh itu...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mungkinkah ada hubungannya dengan Drainase di Basement 2 Leonine Campus</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">但就单纯的速度来说, 影响不会扩散这么远.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">会不会跟Leonair学院地下二楼的排水管有关系</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_37_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_38_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">We still need to reorganize with the present students' abilities to fully understand the situation.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Selama aku berada disini mengawasi situasi ini. Aku jadi berpikir sepertinya kedepan para pelajar akan kesulitan untuk menyelesaikan situasi ini</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">在这里一边整理情况, 怎么想都觉得目前学生的能力将难以承担往后的事情</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_38_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_39_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Please go to the Trading Hole and locate the Master of Taoist Rites. What he has to teach you will really help you become stronger.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pergilah ke Trading Hole untuk bertemu para Master Agent, dan mintalah diajari</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Walaupun sedikit, setidaknya bisa membantu menjadi lebih kuat</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">去 Trading Hole找Master of Taoist Rites。如果可以请求授课就太好了。即使只变强一点点都会有帮助的。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_39_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It seems to me that you don't care about the school.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It's impossible not to know about the four schools that were established by the Sacred Financial Group in this area.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tampaknya kamu tidak pernah peduli dengan sekolah</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalian psti tahu kan 4 sekolah besar yang ada di sekitar sini</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Yayasan Saint inilah yang membiayai sekolah-sekolah itu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">似乎对学院漠不关心.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">没道理不知道这周边成立了四间很奇怪的学院.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">那个后援团体就是我们圣财团</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_40_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">... ……</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_41_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You're so annoying, and I'm so tired of standing here! Ugh! Anyway, meet the Construction Supervisor, ask him about his problem, and then come back here. The supervisor has been requesting help from the company for quite some time.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Aku sudah lama tidak bisa pergi kemana-mana jadi tidak tahu apa-apa, malah kamu ternyata banyak tanya!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Nah! Pergi dan tanyalah sama dia apa yang jadi masalahnya, lalu tawarkan bantuan padanya. Setelah itu kembali kesini</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ada Construction Supervisor,</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">太久没有动了，只是站着也会晕，居然会有家伙找这种麻烦。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">好！首先去问问这个人，并帮助他之后再来找我。据说是Construction Supervisor，他正对财团发邮件要求帮助。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_41_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Accept</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menerima</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">接受</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_41_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Reject</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menolak</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">决绝</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_42_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Isn't it obvious? We're aiding people with requests for help. Even if we don't receive any requests, we search and assist people in need. Whether it's a personal problem or national threat, we try to help out.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jika ada orang yang membutuhkan bantuan, maka bantulah. Jika tidak ada, maka cari dan batulah.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Semua pekerjaan yang telah kamu lakukan, dari yang terkecil sampai yang paling besar intinya sama… hanya beda skala saja..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">不要问为什么，需要帮助的人就给予帮助，不需要帮助的人，亲自访问需要什么样的帮助。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">就像现在你所做的事情那样，从小开始到国家单位为止… 仅仅是规模不同而已，内容都相似。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_42_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask for More Details</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya lebih detail</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问细节</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_43_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">So you don't know after all?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Oh well... There's nothing more for me to say about it…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">If you've got any more questions, then you'd better ask the teachers.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tidak tahu?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Yahh… aku juga tidak bisa memberitahu lebih…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Cobalah cari guru di sekitar sini dan tanyakan kepada mereka</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">不清楚。是啊… 我只能说到这里…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">最好寻找周围的老师了解一下。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_44_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I was expecting that.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It won't be hard to do it.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Well then, see you later.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Nah begitu dong</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kan tidak terlalu sulit</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Hati-hati ya..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">没错。不是很难的事情，快去快回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_45_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I'm sorry about that. If you won't help this time, then I won't mention it anymore. Still, wouldn't you want to go there and help him out?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Aku tidak akan membatu kamu…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Anggap saja tugas kamu itu pekerjaan mulia…hati-hati ya!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">虽然不大好，但好像不是能拒绝的立场啊。如果不帮我，我也不再多说什么了。就当作做件好事，快去快回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_46_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You've defeated them! Thank you very much!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kamu mengalahkan mereka! Terima kasih!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">学生谢谢你帮忙把它们赶走</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">辛苦你了</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_46_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_47_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It is just too hard for me to investigate the phenomenon alone. I could get all the hands I need but this is sucha dangerous place and…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Terlalu sulit untuk saya dalam melakukan penyelidikan sendiri. Tempatnya sangat berbahaya.. Jika kamu ingin membantu saya.. Berlatihlah dulu.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我现在正在调查异变的发生，不过人手不足。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">想要请你帮忙，不过那个地方实在是非常危险。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_47_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I would help you.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我会帮助您的</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_48_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Thank you but you are not just ready yet for Leonine school… If you really like to help me then please get some more training.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Terima kasih.. Namun saya rasa kamu belum cukup kuat. Berlatihlah lagi.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">很高兴你有心要协助调查，不过以你现在的实力要去Leonine学院....实在是很危险</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">请再继续完成更艰难训练累积实力后，再来找我吧。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_48_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_49_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Hmmm, wow you've got the Bine Hands of mutatant man eating Poison Ivy! You must have gotten some training!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Hm.. Kamu mendapatkan Bine Hand! Kamu harus mendapatkan beberapa pelatihan lagi!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">哇！竟然这么快就取得Bine Hands mutatant man eating Poison Ivy！看来这段时间训练的成效还不错！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_49_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Hmmmph!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Heem…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">哼哼！！！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Who are you?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya siapa anda</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">您是谁？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_5_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_50_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I just am glad to know that there are beings that haven't lost their minds at this dead land of Leonine school. It would be possible to find out what happened on the day of Phenomenon with their help… This is a very dangerous job but would you please go find out?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya merasa senang masih ada yang tidak kehilangan akal pikiran mereka ketika berada di Leonine Campus. Mungkin kita bisa menemukan sesuatu dari mereka… Bisakah kamu membantu saya?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">最近听说异变事件发生后到现在Leonine 学院还有人存活...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">去找它们打听应该可以知道异变当天到底发生了什么事情</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这次的任务非常危险确定要帮忙打听实际的情况吗?"</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_50_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_51_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Umm.. So this "hard to Read' notebook contains the record of what happened here at Leonine on the day of Phenomenon. Great job! Thank you so much for this precious data.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Umm.. Jadi ini catatan "Hard to Read' yang berisi tentang apa yang terjadi selama ini. Benar - benar Terima Kasih.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这本 Leonine手册虽然已经严重损毁不过它可是纪录很多当时发生异变的情况</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">真的很谢谢你~帮忙找到这本珍贵的手册</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_51_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">My current position will be compromised if I try to infiltrate the campus.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Take my advice, and never step inside that school. It'd be wise of you to stay here where it's safe.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jika aku mundur sedikit saja, maka posisimu akan terdistorsi!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jika sudah mengerti, kembalilah!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">只要我稍微退后, 我现在的位置应该就会被取代了.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">了解的话就打起精神.后退呀</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Request to Enter Leonair Campus</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ingin memasuki Leonine School</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">要求进入 Leonair Campus</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_6_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Are you going in from that side?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I can't really leave. I'm pretty much forced to stand here.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It's… I can't explain it. I don't know whether it's stupid or…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mau pergi kesana? Kamu?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">aku tuh tidak bisa bergerak kemana-kemana, dan kamu masih menyuruh aku pergi?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kamu masih tidak tahu ya??</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">你要从那边进去?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我现在站在这里动也不能动, 你还说这种话.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">莫名其妙!不知是笨还是厉害</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_7_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_8_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Not bad!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You're still okay?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I just want to ask you something...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Oh! Nothing, never mind!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tidak buruk kok?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lumayan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Apakah kamu benar-benar…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ah tidak jadi, lupakan saja</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">不差吧? 算还可以的...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我只是想问一下你.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">没事啦! 算了</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_8_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Special Agent's Request</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Permintaan Field Agent</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">Special Agent的请托</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_8_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_9_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I can't leave my station, so it'd really help me out if you'd do something for me.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saat ini aku tidak bisa bergerak kemana-kemana. Maukah kamu mendengarkan permintaanku, tak apa-apa kan?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我在这里动弹不得, 可以帮我一个忙吗? 没关系吧?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_saint1.ntk_9_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_sanchek_1.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">This Terminal controls the access to the Walking Zone area.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Terminal Walking Zone</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mengatur akses keluar masuk Walking Zone</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">此终端机掌控着 Walking Zone area 的出入机能。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_sanchek_1.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Activate Authentication</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Konfirmasi pengaktifan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">确认激活</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_sanchek_1.ntk_1_0_10">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Force Field Optimization</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Autentikasi Force Field</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">结界认证</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_sanchek_1.ntk_1_0_11">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Force Field Optimization</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Autentikasi Force Field</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">结界认证</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_sanchek_1.ntk_1_0_12">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Test the Terminal</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Terminal Test</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">终端机测试</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_sanchek_1.ntk_1_0_13">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Force Field Optimization</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Authenticate the Protective Barrier</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">结界认证</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_sanchek_1.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Test the Terminal</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ujian di Terminal</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">终端机测试</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_sanchek_1.ntk_1_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Test the Terminal</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ujian di Terminal</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">终端机测试</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_sanchek_1.ntk_1_0_4">
