    <VALUE Lang="cn">立即接收</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1.ntk_10_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">어머~ 아직도 등록이 제대로 안되셨나 봐요?여기, '외출신청서' 를 '교무실' 의 '학생주임' 께 제출하시면 등록이 마무리 될 수 있을거예요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">어머~ 아직도 등록이 제대로 안되셨나 봐요?여기, '외출신청서' 를 '교무실' 의 '학생주임' 께 제출하시면 등록이 마무리 될 수 있을거예요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">어머~ 아직도 등록이 제대로 안되셨나 봐요?여기, '외출신청서' 를 '교무실' 의 '학생주임' 께 제출하시면 등록이 마무리 될 수 있을거예요</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1.ntk_10_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1.ntk_11_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Why did you register so late?It's similar to the paper before this. All you need to understand is how to arrange everything, and make sure that the style looks good. It's so easy, it's like you don't even need to know how to write.Long and messy documentation isn't really necessary in this world since everything can be solved with just a mouse click.So do I just write on the paper?No other orders?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Euhm, pendaftarannya sudah terlambat?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Dulu kertas seperti ini hanya ada sebagai formalitas, saya tidak pernah menyangka bahwa kertas ini akan digunakan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sangat tidak sesuai kan menulis formulir seperti ini di dunia yang semuanya bisa diselesaikan ha</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这么晚注册啊?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">以前像这种用纸, 就只知道把样式陈列好放着, 真的不知道该怎么写.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">像最近这个什么东西只要一颗按键就全ok的世界, 写这种裹脚布长的文件岂不是很不搭调吗?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">但是这用纸像这样写好就可以了吗?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">不需要什么顺序吗</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1.ntk_11_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1.ntk_12_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It's not enough to simply fill out the registration application form and bring it over, right?It can be finished pretty easily because of the Student Director. Otherwise, you'll need to redo it before you come here again.Anyway, this is all possible because now happens to be a critical time.Just present the Egress Application Form to the Student Director at the School Administration Office, and you'll be almost finished with registration.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau Student Registration Form dibawa begitu saja tidak boleh, kan?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau orang lain pasti akan menyuruh kamu untuk membuatnya lagi, untung saja karena beliau Student Director baik, jadi langsung mengurusnya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Atau mungkin saja karena ini adalah dar</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">"只有把注册申请书填​​好带过去是不行的吧?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">再怎么说也是学生主任, 所以才这样容易处理, 若是别人的话, 一刚开始就叫你重弄好再来了.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">反正现在是非常时期的体制, 这也是有可能的...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">反正, 在这里将外出申请书向教务处的学生主任提出, 注册就做的差不多了."</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1.ntk_12_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1.ntk_13_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">What, you're still working on your registration?Sorry, but I just came directly ...We handle these cases one by one, but I'll need to make an exception in this situation.Perhaps coming directly would be better after all ... I suppose so...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ooo, sedang mendaftar yah?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mohon maaf yah, menyuruh kamu datang langsung seperti ini…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau biasanya sieh... ada orang yang bertugas untuk membagikannya sekaligus, tapi sekarang tidak bisa seperti itu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tapi kalau diambil secara langsung seperti i</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">什么, 还在注册吗?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">抱歉, 直接就过来了...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">平常的话就必须对号一个一个来, 但现在这种情况是没办法的.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">所以... 也许直接来反而好一点... 应该吧</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1.ntk_13_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1.ntk_14_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">There's no way to go outside when things start getting weird and dangerous.The students are able to venture out because they've got a little bit of power, but the dangers outside are a nightmare for normal people like me.The monsters outside are dead. I only heard about it, but I guess it's true.Doesn't it seem kind of weird? I didn't believe it at first, but you'd agree after listening to them.Isn't it true that human beings have no concern for one another? Some of them don't even respond when you speak toThere'</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kita tidak bisa keluar seenaknya sejak kecelakaan mulai terjadi</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Beberapa waktu yang lalu, Main Building diserang orang-orang bersenjata</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Akupun bergegas keluar dan memang persis seperti rumor yang ku dengar</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mereka semuanya telah mati</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Aneh</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">发生异象的时候, 没有办法随意地出去外面.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这里的学生是因为有一点力量才有办法出去看看, 像我这样的普通人, 出去对我来说是连作都不敢作的梦.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">虽说只是传闻, 说是那外面的怪人们都死了.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">会觉得有点奇怪吧? 我也是不相信, 不过你听了他们说的话就会觉得也有这样的可能.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">不就是那样吗? 长的一样的人们, 互不理对方... 即使在耳旁讲话也好像没听到...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">虽说我也没有直接看到作确认, 不过就是很奇怪.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">那么, 一定要把外出申请书向学生主任提出</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
