  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1.ntk_25_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The paper for medical report usage? It's a sample of a medical report document.Only the Health Room uses these documents, so in any case, what's written here is probably true.The Health Room staff is very busy now… They've got their hands full helping people.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Medical? Aaa... maksusnya medical record untuk pengobatan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lagipula yang dipakai di health room hanya ini saja, pasti benar</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Memang health room juga sibuk yah? Tumben menyuruh orang lain yang datang kesini….</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Padahal ada di depan…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">病历表用纸啊, 是说医疗用文件之样式啦.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">反正保健室就只用这个, 不会错的.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">保健室也很忙吗? 都被叫去跑腿了</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1.ntk_25_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1.ntk_26_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Are you a new student?Hmmm. It's tiring, isn't it?Especially now.Now, I heard that this college was established to handle these kinds of situations.That's probably the reason why this institution isn't as advanced as some other colleges. In other words, you'll need to work harder.Hmmm. This probably won't be much help, but you can go ahead and have this bread.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Selamat datang pelajar baru, kamu akan mendapatkan tantangan berat, ambil bread ini dan berlatihlah dengan sungguh-sungguh.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">你是新生吗?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">恩... 会很累吧?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">偏偏在这种时候...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">不过, 听说本来就是顾虑到会发生这种事才设立的学院阿?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">但是因为比起其他学院的学生落后了很多, 所以因该要加倍努力.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">恩... 虽然帮不上什么大忙, 不过这些面包你就拿去用吧."</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1.ntk_26_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1.ntk_27_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Well, I was just thinking…The teachers at this college are pretty cruel.I mean, they don't really inform the new students of anything.Of course, you might not really be a new student.Even so, the teachers' behavior is inexcusable.Hmmm. It might be weird for me to do this like this, but…I'm going to help you, see.Please level up until you reach Level 5.Once you do that, I'll give you a reward.Good luck!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tidak tahu apakah ini hanya pikiranku saja</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Guru di sekolah ini tampaknya kers hati</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Walaupun ada pelajar baru, namun tidak diajarkan sesuatu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mungkin mereka tidak tahu jika ada pelajar baru, namun….</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tetap saja itu hal yang aneh</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Emm.. Penggant</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1.ntk_27_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1.ntk_28_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">See?I knew you'd make it!Ah, and here's your reward.Okay, so it's not all that great, but it'll come in handy.Come to me anytime if you need any help, I'll see what I can do. Good luck!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lihatlah-</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Aku sudah tahu kamu pasti bisa-</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Nih, hadiahnya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Walaupun bukan sesuatu sesuatu yang mewah, tapi aku pikir akan berguna buatmu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kedepannya jika kamu membutuhkan bantuan, aku akan berusaha memberikan yang terbaik. Untuk itu, berlatuhlah</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">你看.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我就知道你一定可以的.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">那么这是给你的奖励.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">虽然不是很了不起的东西,不过多少还是会有些帮助的.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">此后如有需要我帮忙的我也会帮助你的, 所以请你加油喔</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1.ntk_28_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1.ntk_29_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">There's nothing I can particularly do to help you at the moment.Please work hard, and level up more.I'll be sure to reward you once you raise your level high enough, alright?Good luck, now!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Aku rasa aku masih bisa membantumu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mau berusaha untuk mencapai level berikutnya kan?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Aku akan memberimu hadiah lagi</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ngerti kan? Semangat ya…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">目前好像没有我可以帮忙的地方.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">请加油练到下一级好吗?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">跟之前一样我会给你一些奖励的.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">加油喔..."</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1.ntk_29_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Hmm... First, there are normal items.Then, there are rare items. Rare items are usually superior to normal items in terms of effect and performance.Ah, but Blessed Items are the hardest to find. They're very special, and incredibly well made.If you obtain these kinds of items, you'll probably want to hold onto them!Hmmm, there are some really precious items that I've never seen.If you look at the information record of our department, you should be able to ask about it, and maybe even obtain it.Oh, right. ThHmm..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ehmmm…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pertama, ada item biasa</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ada juga item yang memiliki fungsi lebih baik, biasa disebut sebagai rare item.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Diantara rare item itu ada uniqe item, yang dibuat secara khusus, mungkin akan sulit untuk ditemukan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau kamu menemukannya, mauka</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">嗯... 先是平凡的一般道具.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">也有经过改良, 机能稍强的上位道具, 叫做罕见道具.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这其中也有叫做受祝福的道具的, 是较特别且做得很好的, 应该是比较难找.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">如果您获得这种东西的话,可以好好保管它们吗?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">还有... 我也有一些没见过的虽也不太清楚, 但真的是相当稀贵的道具.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">看我们本社的资料记载, 应该是可以询问获得的.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">啊, 还有一种不可以随意使用的任务道具, 这种东西即使您拿来给我可能也没有办法帮您处理, 就稍微较困难了~</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">请一定只在任务修行的时候使用</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1.ntk_30_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">2004년 아테네 올림픽의 결과금 - 9개, 은 - 12개, 동 - 9개총 30개 + 1개티켓 [30개] : 선물셋트 교환 티켓 [31개] : 선물셋트 교환그대로 저희에게 판매하시면 상금을 보상받으실 수 있으니 선물이 마음에 안드신다면 그냥 팔아주세요총 메달 수 30개를 맞추신 분들께는 티켓을 선물셋트로 교환해드리겠습니다. 그리고 안타깝게 메달을 돌려받지 못한 체조 메달을 포함해 31개를 선택하신 분들께도 선물셋트를 교환해 드리도록 하겠습니다.열심히 노력해준 태극전사들에게 아낌없는 격려와 축하의 박수 부탁드립니다.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">2004년 아테네 올림픽의 결과금 - 9개, 은 - 12개, 동 - 9개총 30개 + 1개티켓 [30개] : 선물셋트 교환 티켓 [31개] : 선물셋트 교환그대로 저희에게 판매하시면 상금을 보상받으실 수 있으니 선물이 마음에 안드신다면 그냥 팔아주세요총 메달 수 30개를 맞추신 분들께는 티켓을 선물셋트로 교환해드리겠습니다. 그리고 안타깝게 메달을 돌려받지 못한 체조 메달을 포함해 31개를 선택하신 분들께도 선물셋트를 교환해 드리도록 하겠습니다.열심히 노</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">2004년 아테네 올림픽의 결과금 - 9개, 은 - 12개, 동 - 9개총 30개 + 1개티켓 [30개] : 선물셋트 교환 티켓 [31개] : 선물셋트 교환그대로 저희에게 판매하시면 상금을 보상받으실 수 있으니 선물이 마음에 안드신다면 그냥 팔아주세요총 메달 수 30개를 맞추신 분들께는 티켓을 선물셋트로 교환해드리겠습니다. 그리고 안타깝게 메달을 돌려받지 못한 체조 메달을 포함해 31개를 선택하신 분들께도 선물셋트를 교환해 드리도록 하겠습니다.열심히 노</VALUE>
