  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Yes, we're the best shop for managing items ... Items must first be validated and approved to ensure quality, fair pricing, and product categorization before they can be distributed.The education learned by members of society can finally be used now.Although it's been mentioned before, some of our department's resources are currently unavailable. We apologize for being unable to offer items that we should have on hand.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ya, itu adalah kontrol langsung dari Head Quarter</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">是, 本社可以说是管理最佳物流的直营店...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">是卫生, 品质, 价格, 制品种类等所有部份都要获得官方检证, 派遣给全国各地学校之优秀的物流社.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">从那里接受社员教育, 现在终于派上用场了.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">虽说如此, 现在从本社可以获得的资源都断绝了, 没有绝对有的物品... 抱歉</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
