  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_10_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">OMG!!!!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You haven't registered ?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Just hand in the Egresses Application Form to the Student Director and the registration process will be finished.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Aduh?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Masih belum terdaftar yah?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pendaftaran akan selesai kalau kamu menyerahkan 'Pass Application' ini ke 'Student Director' yang ada di 'School Admin. Office'</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">噢！您还没注册？请将Egresses Application Form交给 Student Director，可完成注册手续就。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_10_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_11_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You haven't finished registering?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Last time I thought that this kind of paper process were just a formality</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">At this age where everything is done at a click of a button, don't you think this type of documenting process is a bit strange?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">But I am not sure whether I am allowed to just hand you the used paper like that</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Don't we need to go through some kind of procedures first?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Euhm, pendaftarannya sudah terlambat?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Dulu kertas seperti ini hanya ada sebagai formalitas, saya tidak pernah menyangka bahwa kertas ini akan digunakan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sangat tidak sesuai kan menulis formulir seperti ini di dunia yang semuanya bisa diselesaikan ha</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">您还没完成注册吗？上次我以为那张申请书只是道手续形式，没想到还真需要亲自动手呢！这个时代的人做事情都是靠一根手指头和一个按钮解决的，这里为何这么麻烦，太奇怪了！ 我不确定可不可以直接给您这单子，也许我们该先进行别的手续……</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_11_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_12_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">We can't just bring the application form in right?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Only the Student Director will help you handle it, if it's another person, you will definitely be required to redo the whole thing.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Anyway this kind of unusual system isn't impossible</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">No matter what just hand in the "Egresses Application Form" to the Student Director and the whole registration process will be over.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau Student Registration Form dibawa begitu saja tidak boleh, kan?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau orang lain pasti akan menyuruh kamu untuk membuatnya lagi, untung saja karena beliau Student Director baik, jadi langsung mengurusnya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Atau mungkin saja karena ini adalah dar</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">果然我们不能只拿张申请单来，对吧！在这个时候，只有Student Director会马上帮您处理，其他人是不可能热心帮忙的。总之，非常时期有非凡的处理方式。现在，您只要将Egresses Application Form交给Student Director，整个任务将会顺利结束。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_12_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_13_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Are you in the process of registration?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I apologize for having you come all the way yourself.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Normally the person on duty will allocate everything but the current situation doesn't allow it.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">however bringing it there personally will definitely make it more delicious.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ooo, sedang mendaftar yah?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mohon maaf yah, menyuruh kamu datang langsung seperti ini…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau biasanya sieh... ada orang yang bertugas untuk membagikannya sekaligus, tapi sekarang tidak bisa seperti itu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tapi kalau diambil secara langsung seperti i</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">噢！您正在注册吗？抱歉，让您亲自跑了一趟。以前负责人都会自己上前来分配所有事物给所有人，但现在的情况却不允许我们这么做。不过，如同您亲自处理所投入的诚意，成果也是会一样非常美好的。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_13_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_14_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ever since the mutation happened , we cannot simply go outdoors.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The students here have special abilities that enable them to go outdoors, which is impossible for a person like me.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I heard that the strange people outside are actually all dead.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Strange isn't it? I didn't believe it at first but after listening carefully it definitely seems real.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">People with identical looks gathering together .... even if you talk to them it's as if they cannot hear you.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Even though I did not see it for myself I still think it's rather strange.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Come, the application form must be handed in to the Student Director.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kita tidak bisa keluar seenaknya sejak kecelakaan mulai terjadi</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Para pelajar di sini masih bisa pergi keluar karena mempunyai kekuatan untuk itu, tapi orang biasa seperti saya bagaimana bisa</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ini baru rumor saja, katanya orang-orang yang berkeliaran</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">当发生异变之后，我们就无法任意外出了。学生们因为有超能力，所以外出没问题，但像我们这种凡夫俗子是不可能的。传闻外面的怪人们早就已经死了。我一开始也不相信这个奇怪的谣言，但渐渐地也感受到祂们的不对劲。那些怪人们仔细一看，长得一模一样，还整天聚在一起，却从不交谈，上前搭话也听不见任何声音。额…...其实这些不是我亲眼所见的，都是听来的。但是，真的感觉毛毛的。好了，这张《外出申请单》一定要交到Student Director手中唷。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_14_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_15_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Please take your test at the 1-1 classroom . Good luck!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lakukanlah ujian di Terminal Classroom 1-1</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kerjakan dengan baik.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">请至1-1 classroom来接受挑战。请全力以赴。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_15_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
