  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_25_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">What? Do you mean the healing scroll?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The Health Care room only uses this type</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The Health Care room is very busy isn't it? Why would they call you over...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Medical? Aaa... maksusnya medical record untuk pengobatan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lagipula yang dipakai di Health Room cuman ini, jadi pasti benar</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Healt room juga sibuk, yah? Tumben menyuruh orang lain untuk datang ke sini</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">你说医药纸卷吗？Health Care room是需要此款文件的。但Health Care room很忙吗？竟然派您前往这儿来办事……</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_25_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_26_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You are a new student?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">hmm .. it must be tough</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Of all the time ..it has to be now...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">From what I know, the college is built to prevent this kind of thing</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Your level is lagging behind the other students by alot, you need to work harder.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Please do accept this piece of bread to help you in your endeavours.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pelajar baru ya?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Emm…. Pasti berat ya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tapi kenapa di saat seperti ini…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Memang, dari pertama terdengar sepertinya sekolah ini dipersiapkan untuk hal-hal tersebut?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Namun, kamu banyak tertinggal dari pelajar yang lainnya. Aku akan berusaha sebaik</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">您是新生吗？嗯……....偏偏出现在这个时候，您会很辛苦的。听说，学院的存在就是为了预防这种事情发生。您的升等速度比其他学生还要慢，需多多加油唷。给您一块面包，希望能助长您的士气。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_26_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_27_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">In my own opinion , I think that the teachers of this college have no feelings.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">They even refuse to teach the new batch of students.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You are not really considered a new student so there is a possibility</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">but this is just outrageous</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Although I can't say I am taking over the teacher</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">But I want to help you</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Please strive to reach level 5</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I will give you rewards.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Good luck!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tidak tahu apakah ini hanya pikiranku saja</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Guru di sekolah ini tampaknya kers hati</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Walaupun ada pelajar baru, namun tidak diajarkan sesuatu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mungkin mereka tidak tahu jika ada pelajar baru, namun….</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tetap saja itu hal yang aneh</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Emm.. Penggant</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">在我眼中，这学校的老师有点冷血。举例来说，最近来了一批新生，但他们却拒绝教学！ 您不算很新的新生，所以可能对您来说并不奇怪。但这真的不合理。我虽然没有要接管他的工作，但我会尽力帮您。首先，请努力练到第5级，然后我会给您奖励的。加油唷！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_27_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_28_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I knew you could do it.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Here are the rewards.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Even though they are not really anything , but they will definitely be able to help you</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">If you need any further assistance I will try my best to help you. Good luck!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lihatlah-</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Aku sudah tahu kamu pasti bisa-</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Nih, hadiahnya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Walaupun bukan sesuatu sesuatu yang mewah, tapi aku pikir akan berguna buatmu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kedepannya jika kamu membutuhkan bantuan, aku akan berusaha memberikan yang terbaik. Untuk itu, berlatuhlah</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我就知道您会成功！来，这是奖品。虽不是什么昂贵礼物，但它其实挺有用的。如果还需要其他协助，请尽管提出唷。继续加油！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_28_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_29_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I should still be able to help you.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Can you try your best to reach the next level?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I will give you rewards as usual.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Good luck!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Aku rasa aku masih bisa membantumu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mau berusaha untuk mencapai level berikutnya kan?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Aku akan memberimu hadiah lagi</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ngerti kan? Semangat ya…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">看来您还是需要我的协助….请继续练到下个级数，好吗？我一样会再给您奖励的！多多加油唷！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_29_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Hmm...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Firstly there are ordinary items</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Then there are those with modifiable items which are rare items.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">One of them is called a unique item, which is specially made of good quality items, but it is hard to find.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">If you do find it please take good care of it.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">And... even though I have never seen it with my own eyes, I know of one more very rare item.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Please look at Main Centre's item details to find out more.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">And then there's one more quest item which shouldn't be simply used, this item is one of which even I wouldn't want to handle . Please pay attention to it.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You can only use it upon finishing the quest.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Hmm...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Firstly there are ordinary items</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Then there are those with modifiable items which are rare items.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">One of them is called a unique item, which is specially made of good quality items, but it is hard to find.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">If you do find it please take good car</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">득도의 경지에 이른 ‘마루치’ 와 ‘아라치’ 의 기운이 서로 만날 때 이르는 경지를 가리키는 말이라고 들었는데요</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">'석화'에 대해 묻는다</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_30_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The 2004 Athens Olympic games results. Golds , 12 Silvers and 9 Bronzes. Altogether 30 plus 1. Tickets [30 pieces] : Gift exchange package Tickets [31 pieces] : Gift exchange package If you sell them to us you can get back reinbursements, If you do not like the gift you may sell it. Those who guess the correct number of 30 will be given the gift exchange package , which includes the haven't returned Gymnastic Gold. We will give the gift exchange package to a total of 31 people.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Hasil Olimpiade Athena 2004</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Emas - 9 buah, perak - 12 buah, perunggu - 9 buah</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Total 30 buah + 1 buah</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tiket [30 buah] : Ditukarkan dengan Gift Set</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tiker [31 buah] : Ditukarkan dengan Gift Set</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jika kamu menjualnya kepada kami, maka ka</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">2004年雅典奥林匹克的结果 - 9个金牌 12个银牌 9个铜牌，共30个。在这儿您需要30个牌加1张《票卷》来进行兑奖活动。答对数量30的人，可以拿《票卷》来兑换《礼包》。还没归还体操金牌的人也可以拿到礼包唷。详细方法为：[30]个牌和[1]张票必须先同时兑换成1份《礼包票卷[31张]》，然后再拿着《礼包票卷[31张]》进行《礼包》的兑换。若将《礼包》卖给我们，可得到奖品，所以，假如您不喜欢《礼包》的物品，卖给我们是最好的选择。总之，将会有31位同学是可以兑换《礼包》的。请给选手们热烈的欢呼与掌声。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_30_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Exchange for Combined Gifts</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menukarkan dengan Gift Set</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">兑换礼包</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_30_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Exchange for Combined Gifts</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menukarkan dengan Gift Set</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">兑换礼包</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_30_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Exchange for Combined Gifts</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menukarkan dengan Gift Set</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">兑换礼包</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_31_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Is it a cake dropped by the strange rabbit?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">This is not edible because it isn't really food.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">But it looks very strange so I asked them to keep it.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">If you collect 10 of the cakes , we will exchange a box with an unknown item for them.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I cannot just give it to you like that.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It may be a cheap recovery potion or a rare weapon. Bottomline is it's a magical box.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It looks like it's an item created especially for experiments.I am not sure.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Do you want to exchange this?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Rice cake yang dijatuhkan oleh kelinci-kelinci aneh kan?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tidak bisa dimakan karena tidak seperti bentuknya ini bukanlah makanan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tapi Rice cake seperti ini terlihat sangat langka jadi ada perintah untuk mengumpulkannya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau kamu bisa mengumpulkan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这月饼是被一只奇怪的兔子丢下的，对吧？这不能吃，但模样挺珍奇怪异的，就先保管好它吧。如果您收集到10颗，可以跟我们交换1个秘密礼盒。我们不是那种不懂付出的人唷！秘密礼盒的物品有可能是便宜的恢复剂，也有可能是昂贵的武器。总之它就是个神秘魔法盒。而且我个人觉得它就像是个实验用的特别物品。所以………….您要兑换吗？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_31_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Swap New Year Cake for Box</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tukar New Year Cake dengan Box</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">拿月饼兑换箱子</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_31_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Resign</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menyerah</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">辞职</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_32_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It's strange you suddenly ask some question regarding skills.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">In order to use skills you need to have some skill points.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Or upon completing a task , however this is only available at the beginning , it is a special case.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bingung ya karena kamu tiba-tiba bertanya tentang skill….</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Untuk menggunakan skill, pertama-tama pelajarilah Scroll terlebih daulu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Melalui Quest kamu dapat mempelajari secara otomatis, namun hanya berlaku di tingkat awal saja… karena situasinya khusu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">您突然问到技能的事情，让我有点惊讶….想要使用技能，必须先累积技能点数。初期的时候，可以透过任务学习技能，不过那只有初期而已。基本上，技能文书才是王道！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_32_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask How to Familiarize with the Skill</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang cara mempelajari skill</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问精通技能的方法</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_32_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask how to use the Skill</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang cara mempelajari skill</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问技能的使用方法</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_32_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_33_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Upon entering the Main Centre , you will see diferrent department trainers , press the "M" key to help you determine your position.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You may purchase skill scrolls there.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Spheres obtained throught quests may be used to exchange for skill scrolls.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau kamu masuk ke Main Building ada Instructor sesuai jurusan masing-masing, kamu bisa mengetahui lokasi mereka dengan mudah dengan cara menekan tombol 'M' di keyboard</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Disana kamu juga bisa membeli scroll</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Spiritual Spheres yang telah didapatkan de</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">当您进入Main Centre内部后，会看到各个部门的指导老师。请按下键盘[M]键，来决定您该往哪位老师的位置移动。在此地，您不仅可以购买技能文书，透过任务所得到的珠珠也可以在这儿兑换为《技能文书》唷。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_33_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_34_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Click the right button of the mouse after selecting a skill scroll in order to learn the skill.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Pressing the "K" key will let you see the skills you may be able to learn in the future, skills which are already available will be brightly litted , it will be easy for you to differentiate skills which are available for you to use from those that aren't .</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Choose the skills that are already available from the skills window and move it to the 1-10 numbers on the left of your screen.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Select the skills from the numbers assigned to them and click on the right button of the mouse to use them according to the situation.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">However you must make sure you read carefully each skills function as every skill are different.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Untuk mempelajari skill, klik kanan mouse pada scroll</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau kamu menekan 'K' kamu bisa melihat skill-skill yang bisa dipelejari kedepannya. Skill yang bisa digunakan berwarna terang sehingga kamu mudah membandingkannya.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Klik skill yang sudah dipelaj</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">请在技能文书上，按下滑鼠右键来进行技能学习。键盘[K]键可带您一起查看未学过的新技能。技能图示在画面上呈现明亮或暗沉，这将方便您做区别- 已学过的技能图案，将闪透着亮光，表示“现可使用”之意。请选择可使用的技能，并拖拽到游戏视窗左侧的1~10号快捷格，再选定设好的技能快捷码，点击滑鼠右键，就可以实际运用各种技能了。不过，在这之前，您必须先确认好各个技能的用途与效果，因为它们的特色皆大大不同。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_34_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_35_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Go to the office.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The Student Director directed me to inform the new students to go to the office, but it actually slipped my mind.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The office is at the room beside this. It's easy to find.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">If you are still unsure, you may press the "M" key to have a view of the game map.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ah, coba pergi ke School Admin. Office</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Student director berpesan untuk menyuruh para Pelajar baru pergi ke School Admin. Office, tapi tadi saya lupa</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">School Admin. Office ada di ruangan sebelah jadi mudah dicari</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jika tidak tahu, klik tombol 'M' u</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">请您去办公室一下。Student Director曾命令我去通知所有的新生到办公室集合，但我忘记说了。办公室就在旁边，很好找的。如果您怕走丢，可以按键盘的[M]键，透过完整的游戏地图来查询唷。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_35_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_36_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Welcome to the new student's registration.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">We have specially prepared gifts for the new batch of students.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Upon leaving the Main Centre you will receive bread prepared by us . Please do accept them.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">If you do not know the entrance's location, press the "M" key to bring up the game map which will help you determine its position.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Other hotkeys may be identified by pressing on the "H" key.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Selamat datang pelajar baru!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kami telah menyiapkan hadiah spesial untuk para pelajar baru</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Didepan Main Building sudah disiapkan banyak bread, pergilah untuk mengambilnya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jika tidak tahu lokasinya, klik tombol 'M' untuk melihat Map keseluruhan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">欢迎新生前来注册。我们特别准备了好礼要给各位。当您踏出了Main Centre，将会收到我们做的面包。一定要拿到唷。若您不知道出入口的位置，请按下键盘的[M]键，透过地图来做查询。另外一个热键为[H]键，可透过它来查询唷。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_36_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Yes, it is a franchise managed by the Main Centre.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Hygiene, quality, price, variety are all examined, and circulated throughout the whole country's colleges by a good company.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Staff training taught this, but it's certainly surprising that it's only being applied now.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">But now the Main Centre has already cut off all resources and supply, therefore there's not a single here that's looking good...so sorry about this..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Yes, it is a franchise managed by the Main Centre.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Hygiene, quality, price, variety are all examined, and circulated throughout the whole country's colleges by a good company.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Staff training taught this, but it's certainly surprising that it's only bein</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">是的，它是由Main Centre管理的特许经营权。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">卫生、素质、价格、品种都在试验阶段，并同时透过好品质公司在全国数个学校里流通。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">员工针对此进行培训，但令人惊讶的是它现在才真正开始作业。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">不过，现在的Main Centre已经切断所有资源和供应，所以没有任何人在此捣乱。不错吧！知识，挺可惜的。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">If it is items.. it means objects.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">If you defeat an enemy, you may rob him of his items, but the stronger the enemy, the more powerful weapons may be robbed, please do keep that in mind .</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">If you manage to obtain a good object and do not intend to use it, or if you need the money, do consider selling it to me.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">However you may also choose to trade it with your friend.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">If it is items.. it means objects.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">If you defeat an enemy, you may rob him of his items, but the stronger the enemy, the more powerful weapons may be robbed, please do keep that in mind .</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">If you manage to obtain a good object and do not intend to use it</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">如果这是件道具，那它就代表是个物体。如果您击败了敌人，将可以夺走他的物品。敌人越强大，物品越有价值。请铭记这点。如果您正计划要拿到，但不打算使用一件好物品；或是您正需要金币，那么可以考虑将这些夺来的物品卖给我；或者您也可以选择和朋友们做交易。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">득도의 경지에 이른 ‘마루치’ 와 ‘아라치’ 의 기운이 서로 만날 때 이르는 경지를 가리키는 말이라고 들었는데요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">득도의 경지에 이른 ‘마루치’ 와 ‘아라치’ 의 기운이 서로 만날 때 이르는 경지를 가리키는 말이라고 들었는데요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">득도의 경지에 이른 ‘마루치’ 와 ‘아라치’ 의 기운이 서로 만날 때 이르는 경지를 가리키는 말이라고 들었는데요</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
