    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I heard that upon achieving a certain level, enlightenment will bestow upon you and you may be free from masculinity boundaries.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Even though its just a rumour</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">but there's a book called Maori's Magical Manual which in its broken condition is circulating around outside.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Katanya…kekuatan atau power maskulin~</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ini hanya rumor</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Katanya.. buku bernama Rare book of maruchi berterbangan dalam keadaan terpotong-potong kecil</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">听说若达到特定等级，将能得到启发，突破男子汉的极限，将过往的自卑一扫而空。有个谣言，说是有本叫做 《Maori的魔法手册〉的书，以被撕破的模样，在外头世界不停地被转借浏览。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_7_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_8_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I heard that upon achieving a certain level, enlightenment will bestow upon you and the boundaries of femininity may be broken.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Even though it's just a rumour</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">but there is a book called Alloy's Magical Manual which in its broken condition is floating around somewhere outside.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It isn't an ordinary ancient book isn't it?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Katanya…kekuatan atau power feminin~</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ini hanya rumor</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Katanya buku bernama Rare book of maruchi berterbangan dalam keadaan terpotong kecil-kecil</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Walau bagaimanapun juga sepertinya itu buku lama kan?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">听说若达到特定等级，将能得到启发，突破女性的极限。有个谣言，说是有本叫做 《Alloy的魔法手册〉的书，以被撕破的模样，在外头世界不停地被转借浏览。我想这应该不只是本普通的旧书，对吧？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_8_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_shop1_c.ntk_9_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">May I know what are you looking for?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sedang mencari apa?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">请问一下，您在寻找什么呢？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
