  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_archer1.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The Main Gate of the campus building is straight ahead. The Welfare Society and the Lockers are over there. You should go there so you'll know where they are when you need them.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Oh, and you've got to visit the Student Director at the School Administration Office to register as a student. The office is next to the Welfare Society.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You can get your wounds treated at the First-Aid Room. You'd better know how to get there. Sooner or later, you're probably going to get injured!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jangan bertingkah kayak anak baru….</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Di depan sana ada 'Grocery Merchant' dan Locker Custodian', temuilah mereka</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Terus jangan sampai lupa untuk melapor kepada Student Director tentang pendaftaran pelajar</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Nurse Trainee' bisa mengobati kamu saat ter</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">新生的举止...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">一直走出去的话就有玄关吧?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">那两边有""Welfare Society""和""Locker""。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">学院生的注册,一定要去跟""Welfare Society""旁边的""Administration Office""的""Student Director""说</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">到""医护室""的话可以治疗伤口, 所以先去打个招呼。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_archer1.ntk_7_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_archer1.ntk_8_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">What do you want to know?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mau aku kasih cerita?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">想知道什么呢？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
