    <VALUE Lang="cn">领取未经验证的纸币</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex1.ntk_1_0_6">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Technical Teacher's Test</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Meminta ujian</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">Technical Teacher的测试</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex1.ntk_1_0_7">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Confirm Test Results</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Konfirmasi hasil ujian</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">确认测试结果</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex1.ntk_1_0_8">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Give the Order Document</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menyerahkan Orders Book</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">传达 Order Document</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex1.ntk_1_0_9">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about Experimental Mutation</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang Experiment Mutant</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问实验变体</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex1.ntk_10_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">That money is really strange, and it's good we discovered it before the problem got any worse. Just carry on with delivering the Order Document.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">That'll help out a lot!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Benar? Itu Currency yang bermasalah waktu itu kan?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Untung lah, sudah terdeteksi sebelum terjadi masalah yang lebih besar lagi</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Terus tolong kirimkan Orders Book ini</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">那纸币真的有点怪异。可以在发生问题之前，发现这些危险因子，真是好家在。请传达这份Order Document。谢谢您的帮忙。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex1.ntk_10_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex1.ntk_11_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Oh, so you already reached level to qualify for this exam?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You learn faster than I thought!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Let me remind you of this test's purpose again before I give you the exam questions. Your regular targets in this test won't be human begins. That's the reason why you need to regular take these kinds of exams. You'll be able to learn the stuff you really need to know.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You need to diligently continue your studies since you'll eventually fight enemies higher than this level.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Do you understand me?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sudah bisa untuk mengikuti ujian?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kamu terlihat lebih cepat belajarnya!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bagus..kalau begitu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">已经到了可以测验的程度了吗？比我预期的还要快呢！很好。那么~请让我再跟您说一次本测验的目的。这跟平常您们上格斗课的目标是不一样的，因为对手并不是人类。希望您可以了解这种能力考试的举办意义。您的敌人攻击水平不低，请您一定要持续认真学习。了解了吗？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex1.ntk_11_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex1.ntk_12_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Good, you pass the exam by achieving your level. It's a little less than what I expected, but...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You'll need to practice more so that you'll be ready for any kind of attack from these fellahs.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bagus, segini juga cukup..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Namun aku pikir ini masih kurang~ kedepannya berlatihlah lagi ya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">很好！您已通过测验，顺利升级了。虽然比我预期的还要不足，我想您需要更多的练习，将才能随时随地地，从容地应付那些Fellahs的攻击。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex1.ntk_12_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex1.ntk_13_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Although it's impossible to understand the entire situation now, I think there's something weird about the stuff that the Financial Group is involved in. I would tell you more, but I really can't give you more information because of my position.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sekarang kamu bilang tidak tahu? Tidak gunanya kalau kamu tidak tahu…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">tapi kamu kan sudah lihat sekilas kan?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">虽然现在您已经可以了解到所有的状况了，但我认为财团要做的事情还是有点奇怪。我想告诉您更多的事情，但碍于我的立场，我只能说到这里了。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex1.ntk_13_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex1.ntk_14_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">그래서 당분간만 내가 대신 봐주고 있긴 한데, '서클복'을 특성에 맞게 좀 더 강화한 제품인 모양이야...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">그래서 당분간만 내가 대신 봐주고 있긴 한데, '서클복'을 특성에 맞게 좀 더 강화한 제품인 모양이야...</VALUE>
