  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex1.ntk_28_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I guess that now you're aware that anyone could be an enemy.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kamu mungkin tahu apa yang kamu pelajari di kelas, namun sampai kapan monster dua tangan dua kaki tersebut akan menjadi musuh kalian..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我想您已经意识到了，任何人皆有可能会成为您的敌人。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex1.ntk_28_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex1.ntk_29_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">........</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">........</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">..........</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex1.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Hmm...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You can imagine how it would have been if you had listened in class. It all happened 18 years ago, earlier than anyone expected.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Euhm, kalau pernah mendengarnya pada saat jam pelajaran kamu pasti sudah punya perkiraan~</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Walaupun lebih cepat dari yang diperkirakan, namun seperti sudah di ramalkan sebelumnya?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sejak 18 tahun yang lalu…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">嗯…...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">如果您上课都有仔细听的话，应该可以想象现况是如何的。已经18年了… 事件发生的历史，可是出乎预料的久。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex1.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex1.ntk_30_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">그 개 뿐만이 아냐</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">지금 모든 걸 다 알 순 없겠지만, 재단에서 하는 일 중에 걸리는 게 좀 있거든</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">그 개 뿐만이 아냐</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">지금 모든 걸 다 알 순 없겠지만, 재단에서 하는 일 중에 걸리는 게 좀 있거든</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">그 개 뿐만이 아냐</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">지금 모든 걸 다 알 순 없겠지만, 재단에서 하는 일 중에 걸리는 게 좀 있거든</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex1.ntk_30_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex1.ntk_31_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">하지만 아직은 아니야...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">미안하지만 나도 정리해서 알려줄 수 입장은 못 되니까...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">하지만 아직은 아니야...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">미안하지만 나도 정리해서 알려줄 수 입장은 못 되니까...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">하지만 아직은 아니야...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">미안하지만 나도 정리해서 알려줄 수 입장은 못 되니까...</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex1.ntk_31_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex1.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">We predicted long ago that this would happen, but it was much worse than we thought it would be.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Please collect any important information related to this matter.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bencana ini sendiri sudah diperkirakan sebelumnya, namun sekarang tidak ada seorang pun yang tahu apa yang akan terjadi selanjutnya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Selain itu, belum diketahui apakah ini benar-benar sama seperti yang diprediksi sebelumnya..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Oleh karena itu harus du</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我们很早就预料到会发生这种事情了。不过，事情可能会出乎我们意料，甚至发展成更糟糕的局面。请您收集所有相关的重要情报。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex1.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex1.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Right now, I'm managing distribution of these unique costumes since the person that was originally assigned to this job disappeared. Personally, I don't like the idea of doing this.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sebelumnya, ada orang yang mengurus hal ini, namun menghilang entah kemana</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">现在是我在管理Unique costumes，因为原本的负责人旷职，然后就消失了。说句良心话，我并不喜欢做这件事情。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex1.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex1.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Hmm...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">What do you want to know?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Emm, apa yang kamu ingin ketahui?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">嗯…….</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">您想知道些什么呢？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex1.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about Situation</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya situasi</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问现况</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex1.ntk_6_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask What Needs to be Done</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya apa yang harus dilakukan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问需要做些什么？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex1.ntk_6_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about Unique Costumes</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang upgraded Suit</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问关于Unique Costumes。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex1.ntk_6_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex1.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ah, are you looking for spare parts to fix the bus?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Several people came to collect those same spare parts. They keep coming back because the buses keep getting involved in accidents. I'm just glad we're able to help out by having spare parts available. Although we've prepared all the necessary equipment for these kinds of situations, we starting to run out of spare parts.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Oh, kamu mencari genuine part untuk memperbaiki Bus?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Beberapa hari yang lalu pun ada beberapa orang yang datang mencari genuine part untuk memperbaiki kendaraan mereka yang kecelakaan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">噢！您在寻找可以修复公车的零件，对吗？最近有几个人收走了那些零件，但因为出了车祸，又跑来找我了。 我很高兴可以提供重要的零件给大家。 虽然我们都有在准备，可是，渐渐地，零件的数量真的越来越少了。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex1.ntk_7_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex1.ntk_8_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">All the spare parts have been distributed. The ones we have left aren't what you need.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You can get the spare parts you need from the supervisors at the Construction Site located at the 4th Hole. First, you'll need to work hard to prove yourself to them.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Genuine part lagi? Benar-benar…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Coba lihat… ini item lama, standarnya pun berbeda</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">tapi sayang sekali aku tidak punya item yang seperti ini..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">所有的零件都被分散了。我们现在仅有的零件，不是您们需要的东西。您可以从位在4th Hole的Construction Site的 Supervisors那儿，得到您需要的零件。首先，您得靠自己的力量，去解决他们唷。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex1.ntk_8_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex1.ntk_9_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">So you're here to buy some more spare parts.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Hmmm...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Where'd you get this weird money? Look, I've still got plenty of those things here, and I have no idea where they came from.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kamu datang untuk mencari genuine part lagi? Oh, ternyata tidak</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Em</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">所以您是来这儿买零件的。嗯….... 您是从哪儿买到这些纸币的呢？瞧瞧！我也领到非常多张，但我真的不懂它们是从何来的。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex1.ntk_9_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
