    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex2.ntk_12_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The cleaner just left after dumping this on me not too long ago.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sebenarnya barusan Pak Cleaner memberikan sesuatu lalu pergi</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">不久前清洁工人把这丢给我后就走了</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex2.ntk_12_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex2.ntk_13_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Looks like these Currency Notes contain something important. For now, it'd be wise to pick up items that people drop on the streets.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sepertinya currency/ uang kertas yang dimaksud sangat penting…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Aku juga akhir-akhir ini melihatnya banyak yang jatuh di jalan, untuk sementara akan aku kumpulkan terlebih dahulu...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">那纸币似乎确实有什么重要的东西</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">现在在路上常会看见有掉落的东西, 先捡起来收着吧</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex2.ntk_13_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about Leonair Campus's Location</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mendengarkan informasi tentang Leonine School</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问Leonair Campus的位置</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex2.ntk_14_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I'm pretty sure that it was located near the Trading Hole Passage, but one day it just suddenly vanished.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Dulu jelas-jelas ada di sekitar Sacred Gate tunnel yang ada di Sacred Gate's park</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tapi suatu hari tiba-tiba menghilang</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">以前明明就在那边Trading Hole Passage的附近</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">但是某天突然消失不见</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex2.ntk_14_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex2.ntk_15_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It's perfect!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The pieces of the map still exist. Even the teachers weren't aware of this!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Potongan Map itu benar-benar tersisa rupanya!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Untung saja…siapa sangka kalau masih ada di sana…Para guru juga tidak tahu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">地图的纸片真的还在呀</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">搞不好老师也不知道至今还在真是太好了</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex2.ntk_15_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex2.ntk_16_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Hmm...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I need someone to do something for me.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I'll continue to do my part to help clear up this situation in order to ensure the safety of the students as well as the citizens.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Unfortunately, the mobs plaguing this area have multiplied dramatically.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The number of mobs causing trouble around here has increased astronomically.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Euhm, sebenarnya memeng ada kerjaan untuk kamu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menjaga keamanan para pelajar dan warga sekitar, kita memang berusaha untuk membereskan semuanya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Akhir-akhir ini orang-orang yang membuat kerusuhan di sekitar sini bertambah banyak</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">嗯, 我正想要找人帮我做点事情</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">为了确保学生跟市民最基本的安全我是有在持续整理拉</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">不过最近这周围为非作歹的家伙变多了</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex2.ntk_16_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex2.ntk_17_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Well done!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The Sacred Financial Group will always appreciate your help in transporting reinforcements and supplies.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bagus, kamu sudah berusaha dengan baik</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Akan ada banyak hal yang harus kamu lakukan sebelum kiriman bantuan dari yayasan tiba</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">很好, 做的很好</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">往后财团中有补给或支援的时候, 需要你协助的事情会很多喔</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex2.ntk_17_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex2.ntk_18_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The situation has worsened, prompting the Sacred Financial Group to dispatch people to monitor the events.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Walaupun pekerjaan sudah berjalan seperti ini, namun tidak ada kabar apapun dari kantor pusan yayasan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya sudah mendengar bahwa ada agen yang diutus tapi jangan bilang kalau semua itu yayasan…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">事​​情进行到这样财团本部却什么话都没说</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">虽然消息有说要派重要人员来, 会不会都是财团内部…</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex2.ntk_18_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex2.ntk_19_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">We can't just relax and allow these guys to just multiply and continue menacing these areas.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Makasih atas kerja kerasnya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tapi kita tidak bisa membiarkan keadaan seperti ini tanpa tahu jelas dari mana asal musuh-musuh itu…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">辛苦了</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">但是以那群家伙不知从何出现且数量越来越多的状态来看, 是不可以坐视不管的</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex2.ntk_19_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex2.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Hmm...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Welcome to the Sacred Gate Ring!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">How can I help you?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Hmm...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Selamat Datang di Sacred Gate Ring!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ada yang bisa dibantu?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">嗯......</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">欢迎来到Sacred Gate Ring！</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">需要什么帮忙呢？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex2.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex2.ntk_2_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Trade Items</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jual beli item</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">交易物品</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex2.ntk_20_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The Student Director told this is one of the things is the world that just can't be changed.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Apakah Student's Director pernah berkata seperti ini?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Di dunia ini kadang ada sesuatu yang tidak boleh untuk diketahui… '</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">Student Director没有说过这种话吗</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这世界上没有可以坐视不管的事情</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex2.ntk_20_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex2.ntk_21_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">........</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">........</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">........</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex2.ntk_22_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">In any case, everyone will have their abilities tested on a regular basis.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bagaimanapun, jangan melihat para pelajar atapun guru melakukan ujian reguler untuk mengukur skill mereka adalah hal yang menyebalkan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">反正学生或是老师都会定期考试来测定能力, 希望你不要觉得烦</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex2.ntk_22_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex2.ntk_23_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Our enemies are growing in power.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">They're becoming better skilled, and their numbers are gradually increasing. They'll become quite formidable if left unchecked.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">We can't relax and just assume that we're better than them.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Para musuhpun sepertinya juga mengalami peningkatan skill mereka. Sedikit lebih kuat bukan sesuatu hal yang patut dibanggakan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">敌人的能力也在变, 稍微有变强, 要顺便消除自负的态度</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex2.ntk_23_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex2.ntk_24_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">.........</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">.........</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">.........</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex2.ntk_25_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">This counterfeit was skillfully crafted. I'm sure that it'd easily pass for genuine money.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Yeah, bentuknya menyerupai uang, namun jika dilihat secara seksama itu adalah palsu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Namun masalah lain timbul karena ada juga yang beranggapan itu bukanlah palsu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">是啊看起来跟钱没两样, 不过仔细看是伪钞</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">但问题是询问之后却有并非伪钞的反应出现</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex2.ntk_25_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex2.ntk_26_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Moreover, this current looks like it has ancient writing that probably has some hidden meaning. Please take this money for note verification.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Disekitarnya terpancar tulisan-tulisan aneh seperti tulisan ganil…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kayaknya currency ini sendiri mempunyai arti yang lain, tolong bawakan kesini ya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">而且纸币周围反射奇怪的文字, 似乎是古代的神秘暗号。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">总之，这些纸币本身似乎带有什么意义, 拜托你拿去确定一下。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex2.ntk_26_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex2.ntk_27_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You need to take these to the Technical Teacher.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Aaa, kalau yang ini harus aku simpan, lebih baik kamu minta selembar lagi ke Technical teacher saja sana</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">啊！这必须由老师保管，拿去给Technical Teacher 吧！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex2.ntk_27_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex2.ntk_28_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">.......</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">.......</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">.......</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex2.ntk_29_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Moreover, the place is now filled with weird mobs that appeared shortly after the abnormal phenomenon began.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ditambah lagi di tempat itu ada gedung-gedung yang sepertinya sudah dibangun sejak dulu dan ditinggali oleh banyak orang</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Waktunya sangat bertepatan dengan saat kecelakaan terjadi</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">而且那个位置, 从以前就有的东西, 比如说像建筑物, 现在却被入侵的人们占据</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">虽说与异变发生的时间点相同</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex2.ntk_29_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex2.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You should know the answers to your questions.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">This isn't your first time here.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Your point of reference should be the Sacred Gate Park: to its right is the Phoenix Campus, to the left is Mystic Peak Campus, and to the south is Sacred Gate Campus.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Good, do you remember now?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Apa… kenapa bertanya seperti pendatang baru?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lihat 'Taman Sacred Gate', disebelah kanan 'Ph-School', kalau ke sebelah kiri 'MP_School' dan kalau ke belakang 'SG_School'</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Yah, sekarang sudah ingat kan?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">什么？你问的问题就像第一次来这里的人似的。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">朝着Sacred Gate Park，往右边走是Phoenix学院；往左边走的话是Mystic Peak学院；往后面走是Sacred Gate学院。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">好吧, 现在想起来没？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex2.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex2.ntk_30_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The big problem right now is to confirm the location of Leonair Campus.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">We have received contrasting information regarding its location. Some say it's south of Sacred Gate Park, while others say it's to the north.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It's really confusing, and the only way to pinpoint its exact location is to go there ourselves.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Masalahnya bukan itu, tapi masalah sebenarnya Leonine School itu ada dimana</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ada orang yang bilang kalau sekolah itu ada di bagian selatan Sacred Gate's park, ada juga yang bilang ada di bagian utaranya. Kalau tidak dikonfirmasi kita tidak bisa tahu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">
    </VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">问题不出在那, 而是Leonair Campus现在到底在哪里？</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">有人说在Sacred Gate Park的南边, 也有人说在北边, 不直接去确定的话根本无法得知。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex2.ntk_30_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex2.ntk_31_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Cheng Xi Zhi, a student at the Archery Section was able to verify the location of Leonair Campus, and even drew up a map.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Unfortunately, the map was stolen and torn to pieces. We still don't know who did it.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tapi kebetulan ada pelajar dari Leonine School kelas archery yang bernama Heeji sung yang tahu lokasi Leonine School dan telah membuat map, setelah aku cari tahu ternyata……</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tetapi map itu telah direbut oleh rombongan yang tidak dikenal dan dipotong-pot</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">但是听说刚好有个叫做Cheng Xi Zhi的弓箭部学生, 确定了Leonair Campus的位置, 还做了张地图。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">那地图却被怪人抢夺, 被撕成一片一片的..</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex2.ntk_31_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex2.ntk_32_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The identities of the thieves aren't important.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Right now, we need to find the pieces of that map.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Aku tidak tahu siapa rombongan itu, tapi yang lebih penting adalah kalau potongan-potongan map itu harus bisa ditemukan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">虽然不知道那怪人是谁重要的是如何找到那被撕成一片片的地图</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex2.ntk_32_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex2.ntk_33_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I heard that there were some clowns in the area when the map was torn up.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Hmm...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Do you think this clue will be enough to lead us to the pieces of the map?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Katanya para Clown ada di sekitar tempat dimana map disob다, mungkin saja kita bisa mencari potongannya disana?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">地图被撕破的时候附近有小丑这样会找不到吗</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex2.ntk_33_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex2.ntk_34_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">........</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">........</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">........</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex2.ntk_35_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">We have fewer than 7 pieces of the map, and they're all in pretty bad condition.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Coba kita lihat... potongan yang jumlahnya hanya tujuh. ini kok sangat memusingkan yah?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">来看看 剩不到七张 怎么这么乱阿</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex2.ntk_35_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex2.ntk_36_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Even if it seems impossible, I have to try and put these pieces together.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The writing is sloppy, the drawings look terrible, the paper is crumpled, and the edges of the pieces just don't fit together right.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kayaknya ini bukan sesuatu yang aku bisa gabungkan deh</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tulisannya tidak rapi, ditambah gambarnya tidak teratur, kerusakannya juga parah jadi saya tidak yakin ini bisa digabungkan atau tidak</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">哎呀不管老师再怎么拼凑都不行的吧</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">字太草, 图案也不规则, 损伤很严重, 连接线不确实</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex2.ntk_36_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex2.ntk_37_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The Student Director is experienced in working with archeological evidence. Maybe he might be able to put those torn pieces of paper back together.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Student director dari Sacred Gate School katanya pernah coba menggali peningaalan sejarah, mungkin dia juga bisa menggabungkan ini</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">Student Director有做过遗迹挖掘的工作, 搞不好可以拼凑的起来</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex2.ntk_37_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex2.ntk_38_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">.....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">.....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">.....</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex2.ntk_39_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">We can't let a lack of manpower deter us from stopping this evil from spreading. The consequences will be catastrophic if we fail.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It'd be advisable to address the problem now before it gets out of control.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Karena jumlahnya kurang, kalau dibiarkan seperti ini kita tidak tahu apa yang akan terjadi nanti</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pada saat kita ada waktu luang, ada bagusnya untuk menghilangkan semua yang menjadikan bencana</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">不管怎样因为人力不足就这样放任她们变多的话后果将不堪射想</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">即使只有一点点余力如能将会造成祸端的东西消失就太好了</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex2.ntk_39_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex2.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">This use to be a great place to relax because it was always full of singing birds and playing children.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">There were clowns selling balloons and making people laugh. Things have changed now, and that blissful atmosphere has been replaced by a murderous mist.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sebelumnya banyak burung-burung serta anak-anak bermain disini, saat ini sudah berubah menjadi lautan darah</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Karena Clown yang dulu sering bermain bersama pada saat aku berjualan balon menjadi gila</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">以前来玩的时候有很多鸟跟小孩，现在却变的杀气腾腾。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">那时小丑Clown还边卖气球边跟我们玩，真是开心啊。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex2.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex2.ntk_40_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">.......</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">.......</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">......</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex2.ntk_41_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Don't worry, the teacher is just talking to herself. Sorry to have bothered you.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jangan dipedulikan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Aku hanya berbicara untuk dirinya sendiri</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bagaimanapun, kerja yang bagus!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">啊, 不要操心了</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">是老师自己在那边讲的</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">总之, 辛苦啦</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex2.ntk_41_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex2.ntk_42_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">......</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">......</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">......</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex2.ntk_43_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Does the Financial Group have any intentions to help at all?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Apakah kamu berkeinginan untuk membantu yayasan?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">到底财团有没有意思要帮忙</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex2.ntk_43_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex2.ntk_44_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I'm really sorry, but you need to continue your education so that you won't make the same mistakes when you face similar problems.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Maaf sekali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Harusnya aku masih harus ngajarin kalian agar bisa lebih siap menghadapi musuh…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">真是抱歉</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">你们还需要再教育往后有事情的话才可以应付</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex2.ntk_44_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex2.ntk_45_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">.......</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">.......</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">.......</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex2.ntk_46_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I suppose you must feel disappointed since the teachers don't know much.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Untuk saat ini memang banyak yang belum diketahui namun….</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kenyataannya, yang diketahui para guru juga tidak banyak</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">虽然当下会觉得闷闷的</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">事实上我们的老师知道的并不多</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex2.ntk_46_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex2.ntk_47_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I know that there are many different and contrasting views on this problem that aren't necessarily true.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">How can I put this…?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It's like when someone says that one plus one doesn't equal two.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Wouldn't that statement be incomprehensible?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lagi pula, ini bukan seseuatu yang semuanya benar..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kamu juga tidak mengertikan alasan mengapa 1 ditambah 1 jawabannya bukan 2?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">能够告诉我们的正反面还不一定是对的</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">怎么说哩…说一加一不等于二, 不就让人无法理解吗?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex2.ntk_47_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex2.ntk_48_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Your mission is to slay the monster called Ice Master.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I won't give you a time limit like in past missions, so give it your best shot.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">O, mau melakukan ujian sendiri, hebat juga!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau gitu udah nggak perlu perkenalan lagi dong?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Susah juga untuk mencari tugas yang sesuai</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Iya, kayaknya segitu udah cukup deh</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau pelajar sekelas pasti tahu kan tentang ice tyrant?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kenapa t</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">哇，都主动要考试，真不简单!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">那么不需要说废话了吧?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">看看…要找适当的题材不容易耶。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">好，那种程度应该可以…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">依你的程度应该知道 '寒冰将领' 吧?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">吓什么…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这次的考试课题就是打倒那家伙。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">不会像之前的考试一样有限制时间。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">不管几次挑战看看吧!</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex2.ntk_48_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex2.ntk_49_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You beat the Ice Master? I guess you can handle the cold.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Anyway, you pass the mission.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Waw?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Beneran sudah mengalahkan makhluk es itu?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Wah, benar-benar kuat dan nggak bisa diremehkan nieh</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Karena dia sangat dingin, dia jenis orang yang tidak bisa aku hadapi dulu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pokoknya, kamu lulus ujian ini</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mungkin tidak akan ada ujian lagi</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">真的打败那个寒冰将领?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">真的变的这么强。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">他给人的感觉冷冰冰的实在是不想去惹他…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">反正考试是合格了!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">以后可能不需要透过老师考试了。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">也找不到适合的题材。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">话说回来。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex2.ntk_49_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex2.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">득도의 경지에 이른 ‘마루치’ 와 ‘아라치’ 의 기운이 서로 만날 때 이르는 경지를 가리키는 말인데</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">본래는 소승불교에서 모든 번뇌를 뚫고 이치를 깨달아 열반의 경지에 이른 성자를 말이고 ‘나한’ 이라고도 하지</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">득도의 경지에 이른 ‘마루치’ 와 ‘아라치’ 의 기운이 서로 만날 때 이르는 경지를 가리키는 말인데</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">본래는 소승불교에서 모든 번뇌를 뚫고 이치를 깨달아 열반의 경지에 이른 성자를 말이고 ‘나한’ 이라고도 하지</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">득도의 경지에 이른 ‘마루치’ 와 ‘아라치’ 의 기운이 서로 만날 때 이르는 경지를 가리키는 말인데</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">본래는 소승불교에서 모든 번뇌를 뚫고 이치를 깨달아 열반의 경지에 이른 성자를 말이고 ‘나한’ 이라고도 하지</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex2.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">'깨달음의 열쇠' 에 대해 묻는다</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">'깨달음의 열쇠' 에 대해 묻는다</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">'깨달음의 열쇠' 에 대해 묻는다</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex2.ntk_5_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">'나한의 구슬' 에 대해 묻는다</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">'나한의 구슬' 에 대해 묻는다</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">'나한의 구슬' 에 대해 묻는다</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex2.ntk_5_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex2.ntk_50_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Are you going to Root Hole?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It's strange that time has stopped. I though the 공간축 might have changed...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I knew that the Saint building is located in Root Hole.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Hopefully, you'll be able to have a look inside Root Hole.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mau pergi ke arah Root Hole lagi?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tidak disangka banget waktu tiba-tiba telah berhenti</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya pikir dimensi yang akan berubah</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lagian membayangkan saja memang susah, kalau dimensi berubah</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tahu kan, kalau kantor pusat yayasan ada di Root Hole?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">要会到本洞那里吗。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">时间停止真是意外。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">以为空间轴会变</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex2.ntk_50_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex2.ntk_51_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">......</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex2.ntk_52_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The Sacred Financial Group's community service?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Of course, we all know about that because all the campuses are part of the Sacred Financial Group.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I just realized that we don't have any information about the company. Well, I suppose you think me irresponsible for not caring about the company's background, but... I'm sorry, I don't know any of the details.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kegiatan sosial yayasan?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tentu saja aku tahu kalau skolah-sekolah ini berasal dari yayasan yang sama.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ternyata di dalam kelas tidak ada pelajaran mengenai informasi yayasan tersebut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Yaah… walaupun aku rasa aku tidak bertanggung jawab untuk mengat</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">财团的社会活动？我们学院都属于同一个财团，这当然知道。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这么说上课时间里没有提过财团的事情。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">嗯… 我说这些话可能会觉得我没有责任心,但是对这些财团的背景还是有距离感… 太详细的内容, 我也不是非常的清楚</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex2.ntk_53_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The Dispatched Agent who is investigating the phenomenon at Leonine school is having a hard time because of the Saint Private Guards(= Sacred Gate Defender).</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Please defeat them to help Dispatched Agent with his investigation.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Dispatched Agent yang sedang menyelidiki Leonine School mengalami kesulitan karena Saint Private Guard. Tolong kalahkan beberapa Saint Private Guard untuk membantunya.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">听说 Leonine学院负责调查异变事件的Dispatched Agent已经被 Saint Private Guards(= Sacred Gate Defender)弄得不勘其扰。请你帮忙把它们赶走让Dispatched Agent可以专心调查。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex2.ntk_53_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex2.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">그 열쇠를 지니고 있다면 재단에 보관중인 걸 받을 수도 있게 된다는 얘기는 들었지</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">하지만 지금은 조각조각으로 나뉘어져 있을테니까 일단 7조각을 모으게 되면 나한테 가져오도록 해</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">그 열쇠를 지니고 있다면 재단에 보관중인 걸 받을 수도 있게 된다는 얘기는 들었지</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">하지만 지금은 조각조각으로 나뉘어져 있을테니까 일단 7조각을 모으게 되면 나한테 가져오도록 해</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">그 열쇠를 지니고 있다면 재단에 보관중인 걸 받을 수도 있게 된다는 얘기는 들었지</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">하지만 지금은 조각조각으로 나뉘어져 있을테니까 일단 7조각을 모으게 되면 나한테 가져오도록 해</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex2.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_ex2.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">아, 그 녹색 구슬 말이지?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">그냥 하나씩만으로는 별다를 게 없는데 30개를 다 합쳐서 목걸이를 만들면 꽤 쓸만해 진다지</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">아, 그 녹색 구슬 말이지?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">그냥 하나씩만으로는 별다를 게 없는데 30개를 다 합쳐서 목걸이를 만들면 꽤 쓸만해 진다지</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">아, 그 녹색 구슬 말이지?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">그냥 하나씩만으로는 별다를 게 없는데 30개를 다 합쳐서 목걸이를 만들면 꽤 쓸만해 진다지</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
