    <VALUE Lang="id">'박치기' 를 얻는다</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">'박치기' 를 얻는다</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_fighter1.ntk_10_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">처음으로</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">처음으로</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">처음으로</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_fighter1.ntk_11_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Why haven't you finished the student registration?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Are the college services not operating properly?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Submit your registration form to the Welfare Society, and then take it to the School Administration Office. The Student Director will then process your Exit Approval Form.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bagaimana sih, kok kamu belum mendaftar juga?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Situasinya nggak bener karena sistem di dalam sekolah sedang tidak normal</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Nah, kalau kamu pergi menemui Grocery Merchant dia akan memberikan kamu application form, serahkan itu kepada Student Director se</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">怎么还没完成学院注册呢？是因为学校的服务不够完善吗？去Welfare Society那边缴交注册单，并前往Administration Office，那边的Student Director先生会批准您的外出申请单的。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_fighter1.ntk_11_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_fighter1.ntk_12_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I've found out that quests are very difficult at first. But now... It's really hard for me to finish them.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sampai beberapa waktu lalu saja proses tugas tidak pernah seperti ini, saya pikir juga ini sudah sangat keterlaluan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">一开始，这些任务对我来说真的是比登天还难，而现在，要完成它们，仍是需要挤尽我吃奶的力气，非常的难。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_fighter1.ntk_12_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_fighter1.ntk_13_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Hmm? Your registration is almost done.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The next procedure is to request for Exit Approval.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Now, there's something you need to do before you submit your registration form.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pendaftaran pelajar baru sudah selesai.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Selanjutnya mintalah 'Exit Approval'</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">嗯，您的学院注册差不多完成了。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">接下来是申请外出。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">现在，在给申请书之前，有件事要先确认好。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_fighter1.ntk_13_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_fighter1.ntk_14_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Just give the registration form to the Student Director at the School Administration Office, and then you may go outside.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Hand it to him if you're finished.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau kamu serahkan formulir ini kepada Student Director kamu bisa bergerak kemana saja dengan sesuka hati, bawa dan gunakan dengan baik</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tulislah dengan baik, dan berikanlah</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">您只要将申请书交给位在School Administration Offic的Student Director 先生就可以外出了。写好就交给他吧！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_fighter1.ntk_14_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_fighter1.ntk_15_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Spiritual Spheres are earned by achieving certain character levels. You can use Spiritual Spheres to learn available skills of your choice.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jika kamu mempunyai Spiritual Spheres, berarti kekuatan kamu sudah cukup diakui. Pilihlah Skill yang kamu inginkan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">达到特定等级，就能拿到Spiritual Spheres。您可自由使用Spiritual Spheres来选择可学的技能唷。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_fighter1.ntk_15_0_10">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
