  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_fighter1.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I think I've already said this before.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Never mind, I'll repeat again. I'll make sure you remember this!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kayaknya dulu saya pernah memberitahu kamu….</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Yah, tak ada hubungannya sih, aku akan beritahu kamu sekali lagi jadi ingatlah</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">之前好像已经讲过了…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">啥,没关系吧,反正再讲一次,这次把他记牢</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_fighter1.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_fighter1.ntk_40_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">.......</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">.......</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">.......</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_fighter1.ntk_41_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You are awarded 3 Stat Points each time your character levels up. Your character's build and growth is determined by how these Stat Points are allocated to your character's attributes.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">3 point akan dialokasikan setiap kali level naik.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Arah pertumbuhan karakter akan dibedakan berdasarkan point yang didistribusikan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">角色成功晋级，已发送了3个能力点数。依据该点数的各个属性分配，角色会以相同方式被朔造定型。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_fighter1.ntk_41_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_fighter1.ntk_42_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Primarily investing in the Dexterity stat, followed by Strength, will result in a character with fast fist attacks.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau berkonsentrasi pada kecepatan karakter digolongkan kepada jenis 'Pukulan Cepat' dimana pukulan yang digunakan lemah namun sangat cepat</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">如果您将能力集中在敏捷，并稍微着重一些在体力，则能成为“速拳型”高手。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_fighter1.ntk_42_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_fighter1.ntk_43_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Conversely, primarily investing in the Strength Stat, followed by Dexterity, will enable your character to perform powerful leg attacks.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sebaliknya kalau berkonsentrasi pada kekuatan kalian digolongkan kepada jenis 'Pukulan Kuat' dimana pukulan yang digunakan sangat kuat namun lambat</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">若将点数均匀分配在力量和敏捷，并稍微着重一些在体力，那么您的角色将成为“强腿攻击型”高手</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_fighter1.ntk_43_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_fighter1.ntk_44_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Lastly, distributing the points evenly to Strength, Dexterity, and Intelligence will result in a Skill Type character.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Yang terakhir disebut dengan golongan 'Pukulan Energi' dimana point dikonsentrasikan pada pikiran dan pukulan dikeluarkan melului energi yang ada di seluruh tubuh</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">最后，如果您把点数加在力量和敏捷方面，又稍着重一些精神的话，就能使您的角色变身为Skill型高手唷。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_fighter1.ntk_44_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_fighter1.ntk_45_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">......</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">......</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">......</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_fighter1.ntk_46_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Most skills will require you to consume Skill Points in order to learn them.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Setiap kali skill dikuasai untuk pertama kali dan level naik, skill point akan digunakan.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">所有的技能都需要花费您的技能点数来进行学习。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_fighter1.ntk_46_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_fighter1.ntk_47_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You should have more than enough Skill Points at the beginning since the starting skills won't require many Skill Points.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Skill pada fase awal tidak membutuhkan banyak point jadi mungkin akan banyak point yang tersisa</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">一开始，您的技能点数绝对是足够的，因为初期的要求不会太严格。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_fighter1.ntk_47_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_fighter1.ntk_48_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You'll find, however, that you might not have enough points to learn some of the later skills. Think and plan carefully, and choose the essential skills that you want to learn.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pikirkan dengan baik dan kuasai skill yang benar-benar kamu butuhkan. Kamu akan kesulitan apabila nanti kamu tidak bisa belajar skill yang diingankan karena kekurangan point</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">但之后，可能会发生技能点数不够用，导致该学的技能无法学的窘境。必须先谨慎思考，利用有限的技能点数，搭配好您真正期望的技能之树。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_fighter1.ntk_48_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_fighter1.ntk_49_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">.......</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">.......</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">.......</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_fighter1.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">In group combat, the Brawler Section students specialize in close range attack and breaking enemies out of their attack formations. Brawler Students also find it is easier to concentrate because they don't use two-handed weapons or shields.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Peran dari pelajar brawler dalam pertarungan kelompok adalah melakukan serangan langsung di barisan paling depan sambil membuat gerakan musuh terpencar.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pasti lebih mudah untuk berkonsentrasi karena tidak ada tameng ataupun senjata yang harus dipegang</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我想你应该知道在集体的战斗中, 格斗部所担任的角色, 就是在前方进行近身攻击的同时, 打乱敌人的步调. 而且因为没有盾牌或双手武器等碍眼的东西, 所以应该更能够集中精神.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_fighter1.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_fighter1.ntk_50_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The Main Gate of the campus building is straight ahead. The Welfare Society and the Lockers are over there. You should go there so you'll know where they are when you need them.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Oh, and you've got to visit the Student Director at the School Administration Office to register as a student. The office is next to the Welfare Society.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You can get your wounds treated at the First-Aid Room. You'd better know how to get there. Sooner or later, you're probably going to get injured!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lihat gak ada 'Grocery Merchant' dan 'Locker Custodian' disana?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Untuk masalah pendaftaran jangan lupa bilang ke Student Director.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">学院的Main Gate就在正前方。Welfare Society 和 Lockers 都在那儿附近。建议您先前往确认位置，以后有急事要办时，就不怕找不到他们了。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">噢！关于学生的注册，您必须去拜访一下那位在Welfare Society旁边Administration Office里的Student Director先生。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">此外，您也可以到First-Aid Room去接受伤口的治疗。不过，保健室的位置是一定要先打听清楚的，因为您会很容易在战斗中受伤的。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_fighter1.ntk_50_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_fighter1.ntk_51_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">.........</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">.........</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">.........</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_fighter1.ntk_52_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">This is just my observation, but all the teachers and students from the school came out fine.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Please remember that the evil can't control everyone!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Walaupun semua orang, sampai para guru pergi keluar untuk menyelidiki kejadian itu.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">tapi kalian tetap tidak boleh lengah dan berdiam saja!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这是我个人的看法，但全校的师生几乎都跑出来了。请您们记住，邪不胜正！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_fighter1.ntk_52_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_fighter1.ntk_53_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">There aren't too many normal human beings around anymore. Most have already been transformed into evil monsters. Although it's a really bad situation, it's not like things can't be changed for the better.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Please remember this.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sekarang di luar sana sudah tidak ada orang-orang yang normal lagi, hanya ada monster yang menghancurkan apapun yang mereka lihat. Jangan lupa orang yang harus menyelesaikan masalah ini adalah kalian</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">现在外面几乎没有正常人，大部分都是突变后的邪恶怪物。虽然现况很糟糕，但却无能为力。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_fighter1.ntk_53_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_fighter1.ntk_54_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The teachers are doing all that they can to return things back the way they should be.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya juga ingin agar semua ini kembali seperti semula secepatnya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">学校老师们都在尽力恢复原貌，希望学生们也一起努力。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_fighter1.ntk_54_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_fighter1.ntk_55_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">.......</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">.......</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">.......</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_fighter1.ntk_56_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Like I said before, these violent monsters are wrecking our campus. Please get out there, and keep them from causing even more destruction.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Seperti yang sudah aku bilang mereka yang berada diluar adalah orang-orang yang menghancurkan apapun yang terlihat dan sedang mencari sesuatu yang bisa dihancurkan lagi</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">如同我先前说过的，现在有许多暴力怪物在破坏校园，请向前阻止，给他们一点颜色瞧瞧，并维持校园治安吧。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_fighter1.ntk_56_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_fighter1.ntk_57_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Know that carelessness may result in you ending up in a really bad situation.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau disini sih nggak ada masalah, tapi kalau diluar kamu bisa kehilangan nyawa bila lengah sedikit</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">要记住，只要稍不留神，就会让你跌进万恶深渊。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_fighter1.ntk_57_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_fighter1.ntk_58_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Remember that you'll be entering a world full of dangers once you submit the Exit Approval Form. Please be careful out there!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Exit Approval yang kamu tuliskan berisikan tentang segala resiko akan bahaya, ingatlah itu baik-baik!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">要知道一不小心，就会导致您陷入非常糟糕的局面。别忘记，只要你提交外出申请单，就是进入危险可怕世界的时候了。在外闯荡时，请小心安全。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_fighter1.ntk_58_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_fighter1.ntk_59_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Oh... So you saw the List of Saints.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It's true that there's nothing wrong with the list.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ah, but you're probably curious about what's behind it. Am I right?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Why are there so many students with family problems?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It's quite simple, actually.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Not too many loving parents would send their children to an experimental school.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Even if extraordinary benefits were offered, most parents would think that traditions set by normal schools are more important.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kamu sudah liat Saint List rupanya…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sebenarnya tidak ada masalah dengan daftarnya.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tapi tetap penasaran… iya kan?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kenapa banyak sekali keluarga yang memiliki masalah…?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jika dipikir-pikir ini hal yang sepele tapi...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sebenarnyakan hanya sedik</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">噢，您看过了这份圣徒列表！没错，就是这些内容。哦，我猜您很好奇它的背景故事，对吧？为何会有这么多的学生被难解的家庭问题所困扰呢？答案很简单。就是，并没有太多的父母会愿意把子女送到具有实验性质的学校念书。就算福利再好，他们还是比较信任普通学校所走的传统路线。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_fighter1.ntk_59_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tetap mendengarkan.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">继续</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_fighter1.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Skill Points are set at 0 at the start. Each time your character's level increases, you will be awarded with 1 Skill Point. You can use these Skill Points to learn new skills or upgrade existing skills.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pertama dimulai dari '0' dan setiap naik level akan mendapatkan '1' buah 'Skill Point'</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">技能点数从0个开始计算，每当角色等级晋级时，就会增加 1个技能点数。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_fighter1.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_fighter1.ntk_60_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Many people raise this question...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">What is forgiveness, and does it work?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Oh, but it's not like I have the right to teach you anything.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Why should I force what little I know upon you?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You know that there are arenas in the Trading Hole.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You can find teachers that can teach you more over there.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Banyak orang yang mempertanyakannya…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Apakah itu perbuatan yang dapat diampuni atau perbuatan yang layak dapat pujian.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tetapi..aku sebagai pengajar semua itu tidak benar..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Aku juga sebenarnya dipaksa untuk mengerjakan sesuatu yang aku tak ketahui</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">很多人提出不少疑问，例如，什么是可以原谅的？被原谅是件好事吗？不过我觉得我没有资格教您们这些东西。我不能仅仅仗着比您懂多一点，就对您颐指气使。您知道在Trading Hole有不少竞技场，对吧？在那边，您可以找到适合您的老师唷。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_fighter1.ntk_60_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Begin</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">最初</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_fighter1.ntk_61_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">What?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Now, I've told you that you needed to be ready for this situation.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Well, it's too late now.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Maybe you can find the items you need in the Resource Room.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Dasar, kenapa juga nggak daftar dulu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Karena nggak ada persiapan apa-apa makanya kena kejadian seperti itu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau pergi ke Information room terminal di depan Main building kamu pasti bisa menemukan sesuatu yang pas</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">什么？嗯，我已经告诉过您了，必须随时随地最好准备。现在似乎有点迟了。不过也许您能在Resource Room找到您需要的物品唷。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_fighter1.ntk_61_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Begin</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">最初</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_fighter1.ntk_62_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Spiritual Spheres are earned by achieving certain character levels. You can use Spiritual Spheres to learn available skills of your choice.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jika kamu mempunyai Spiritual Spheres, berarti kekuatan kamu sudah cukup diakui. Pilihlah Skill yang kamu inginkan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">达到特定等级，就能拿到Spiritual Spheres。您可自由使用Spiritual Spheres来选择可学的技能唷。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_fighter1.ntk_62_0_10">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Exchange Item for Authentic Combo</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pilih Authentic Combo</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">兑换 Authentic Combo</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_fighter1.ntk_62_0_11"><VALUE Lang="tw">兌換 氣功砲（137級／格鬥部）</VALUE><VALUE Lang="GS">Skill book: Ultimate  (Lv137, Class=65, Item=174/54)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="id">Skill book: Ultimate  (Lv137, Class=65, Item=174/54)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="cn">Skill book: Ultimate  (Lv137, Class=65, Item=174/54)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="th">Skill book: Ultimate  (Lv137, Class=65, Item=174/54)</VALUE></SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_fighter1.ntk_62_0_12">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Cancel</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">取消</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_fighter1.ntk_62_0_9"><VALUE Lang="tw">兌換 墜地打擊（147級／格鬥部）</VALUE><VALUE Lang="GS">Skill book: Down Strike (Lv147, Class=65, Item=174/14)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="id">Skill book: Down Strike (Lv147, Class=65, Item=174/14)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="cn">Skill book: Down Strike (Lv147, Class=65, Item=174/14)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="th">Skill book: Down Strike (Lv147, Class=65, Item=174/14)</VALUE></SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_fighter1.ntk_63_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Spiritual Spheres are earned by achieving certain character levels. You can use Spiritual Spheres to learn available skills of your choice.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jika kamu mempunyai Spiritual Spheres, berarti kekuatan kamu sudah cukup diakui. Pilihlah Skill yang kamu inginkan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">达到特定等级，就能拿到Spiritual Spheres。您可自由使用Spiritual Spheres来选择可学的技能唷。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_fighter1.ntk_63_0_10"><VALUE Lang="tw">兌換 暗影衝刺（157級／格鬥部）</VALUE><VALUE Lang="GS">Skill book: Shadow Dash (Lv157, Class=65, Item=174/36)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="id">Skill book: Shadow Dash (Lv157, Class=65, Item=174/36)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="cn">Skill book: Shadow Dash (Lv157, Class=65, Item=174/36)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="th">Skill book: Shadow Dash (Lv157, Class=65, Item=174/36)</VALUE></SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_fighter1.ntk_63_0_11">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Exchange for Scroll of Earth Rupture</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pilih Earth Rupture</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">兑换 Earth Rupture</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_fighter1.ntk_63_0_12">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Cancel</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">取消</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_fighter1.ntk_63_0_9"><VALUE Lang="tw">兌換 砲擊重拳（197級／格鬥部）</VALUE><VALUE Lang="GS">Skill book: Cannon Bash (Lv197, Class=65, Item=174/16)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="id">Skill book: Cannon Bash (Lv197, Class=65, Item=174/16)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="cn">Skill book: Cannon Bash (Lv197, Class=65, Item=174/16)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="th">Skill book: Cannon Bash (Lv197, Class=65, Item=174/16)</VALUE></SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_fighter1.ntk_64_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Spiritual Spheres are earned by achieving certain character levels. You can use Spiritual Spheres to learn available skills of your choice.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jika kamu mempunyai Spiritual Spheres, berarti kekuatan kamu sudah cukup diakui. Pilihlah Skill yang kamu inginkan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">达到特定等级，就能拿到Spiritual Spheres。您可自由使用Spiritual Spheres来选择可学的技能唷。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
