  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_knight1.ntk_37_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">.......</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">.......</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">.......</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_knight1.ntk_38_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Great strength allows you to fulfill two important objectives in battle.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You can use your strength to attack your enemies or to protect your friends.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jika punya kekuatan, kamu bisa mengerjakan 2 hal,</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Melukai orang lain atau melindunginya.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">强大的力量可以让您实现在战斗中的两个重要目标。您可以用您的力量来攻击敌人；或者是保护您的朋友。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_knight1.ntk_38_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_knight1.ntk_39_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You know which use of your strength is best without telling me, right?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Remember that hurting others can only be considered moral if you do it to protect someone.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mana yang benar</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tidak perlu saya kasih tahu, kamu sudah mengerti kan?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ingatlah, melukai orang hnya dapat dimaafkan kalau bertujuan untuk melindungi orang lain.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">您知道的，力的用法是最重要的，这不用我再提醒了，对吧？请记住，只有在保护人的时候，才可以去伤害别人。这么左侧能得到原谅。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_knight1.ntk_39_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_knight1.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Although you can learn and understand swordsmanship by swinging a sword on your own, please listen to me carefully, even if I'm repeating basics that you already know.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jangan cuma istirahat! Gunakan pedang kamu, dengan begitu kamu bisa belajar dengan sendirinya.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pertama akan saya beritahu kamu pengetahuan dasarnya, dengarkan dengan baik</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">虽然您能够透过挥舞刀剑来习得剑法，但我还是得把基本的东西再讲一次，请注意听。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_knight1.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_knight1.ntk_40_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">.......</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_knight1.ntk_41_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You are awarded 3 Stat Points each time your character levels up. Your character's build and growth is determined by how these Stat Points are allocated to your character's attributes.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Setiap level naik 3 point akan dialokasikan dan arah pertumbuhan akan disesuaikan dengan pembagian point</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">角色成功晋级，已发送了3个能力点数。依据该点数的各个属性分配，角色会以相同方式被朔造定型。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_knight1.ntk_41_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_knight1.ntk_42_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">If you evenly distribute points to Strength, Stamina, and Dexterity, then your character will grow into a Swordsman with very fast attacks.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau berkonsentrasi pada kecepatan kalian digolongkan kepada jenis sword dimana kamu bisa menyerang musuh dengan cepat menggunakan sword</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">假如您分配点数到Strength、Stamina、Dexterity的话， 您的角色会成为‘快攻速’剑道高手。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_knight1.ntk_42_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_knight1.ntk_43_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">If you concentrate on the Strength stat, then your character will become a Swordsman that inflicts great damage to enemies.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau berkonsentrasi pada kekuatan kalian akan digolongkan pada jenis blade dimana kamu tidak menggunakan sword tetapi power sword yang kekuatan penghancurnya tinggi saat menyerang</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">假如您集中点数在 Strength，您的角色会成为‘高破坏力’的剑道者。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_knight1.ntk_43_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_knight1.ntk_44_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Lastly, distributing the points evenly to Strength, Dexterity, and Intelligence will result in a Skill Type character.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Terakhir kalau berkonsentrasi pada pikiran kalian akan digolongkan ke dalam jenis sword/ blade dimana kamu menyerang dengan menggunakan tenaga dalam</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">最后，若均匀地把点数分配在 Strength、Dexterity、和 Intelligence，您的角色将会成为‘技能型’的角色。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_knight1.ntk_44_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_knight1.ntk_45_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">......</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">......</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">.......</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_knight1.ntk_46_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Take note that practitioners in the Sword Section consume a relatively large amount of SP.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Yang harus diperhatikan bagi kalian yang memilih jurusan Sword adalah bahwa kalian membutuhkan stamina yang lebih banyak bila dibandingkan dengan jurusan yang lain pada masa perkembangan kalian</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">必须注意的是，剑道部相对地会消耗许多SP。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_knight1.ntk_46_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_knight1.ntk_47_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Your Accuracy and attack rate will diminish once your SP is completely depleted. Try to avoid this dangerous scenario.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau stamina terus berkurang, ketepatan dan kekuatan serangan menjadi berkurang. Tergantung pada situasi yang ada hal ini bisa membahayakan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">如果SP完全消耗殆尽，您的命中率和攻击力也会跟着消失。要小心避免次悲剧发生。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_knight1.ntk_47_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_knight1.ntk_48_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Therefore, cast your skills wisely, and don't needlessly overexert yourself.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Karena itu…. selalu ingat di dalam hati kamu agar tidak menyerang musuh dengan brutal atau tanpa dipikirkan sebelumnya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">因此，出招时千万不要勉强，要慎重行动。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_knight1.ntk_48_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_knight1.ntk_49_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">..........</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">..........</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">..........</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_knight1.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Stand at the front of your party. Protecting them is your primary job. This is how a Swordsman displays his power.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Berada di barisan paling depan dan melindungi teman-teman adalah tugas kalian.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau punya kekuatan tentu saja harus digunakan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">您们的任务是站在同伴们的面前，先发的同时并保护他们。剑道部的‘力’就是要这样子表现出来的。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_knight1.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_knight1.ntk_50_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You should have more than enough Skill Points at the beginning since the starting skills won't require many Skill Points.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Skill pada fase awal tidak membutuhkan banyak point jadi mungkin akan banyak point yang tersisa</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">一开始，您的技能点数绝对是足够的，因为初期的要求不会太严格</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_knight1.ntk_50_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_knight1.ntk_51_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You'll find, however, that you might not have enough points to learn some of the later skills. Think and plan carefully, and choose the essential skills that you want to learn.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pikirkan dengan baik dan kuasai skill yang benar-benar kamu butuhkan. Kamu akan kesulitan apabila nanti kamu tidak bisa belajar skill yang diingankan karena kekurangan point</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">但之后，可能会发生技能点数不够用，导致该学的技能无法学的窘境。必须先谨慎思考，利用有限的技能点数，搭配好您真正期望的技能之树。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_knight1.ntk_51_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_knight1.ntk_52_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">.....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">.....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">.......</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_knight1.ntk_53_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Oh, and you've got to visit the Student Director at the School Administration Office to register as a student. The office is next to the Welfare Society.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You can get your wounds treated at the First-Aid Room. You'd better know how to get there. Sooner or later, you're probably going to get injured!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Terus jangan sampai lupa untuk melapor kepada Student Director tentang pendaftaran pelajar</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Nurse Trainee' bisa mengobati kamu saat terluka, karena itu sapalah dia terlebih dahulu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">噢！关于学生的注册，您必须去拜访一下那位在Welfare Society旁边Administration Office里的Student Director先生。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">此外，您也可以到First-Aid Room去接受伤口的治疗。不过，保健室的位置是一定要先打听清楚的，因为您会很容易在战斗中受伤的。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_knight1.ntk_53_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_knight1.ntk_54_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">......</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">......</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">.......</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_knight1.ntk_55_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">This is just my observation, but all the teachers and students from the school came out fine.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Please remember that the evil can't control everyone!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">There aren't too many normal human beings around anymore. Most have already been transformed into evil monsters. Although it's a really bad situation, it's not like things can't be changed for the better. Please remember this.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Walaupun semua orang, sampai para guru pergi keluar untuk menyelidiki kejadian itu.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Harus selalu diingat bahwa orang yang bisa menyelesaikan situasi saat ini adalah kalian</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这是我个人的看法，但全校的师生几乎都跑出来了。请您们记住，没有恶灵是可以控制你们的！！！</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这边的人几乎都不算是人了。他们都变成邪恶的妖怪了。虽然这情况很糟糕，但尚未到无药可救的地步。请别忘记这点。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_knight1.ntk_55_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_knight1.ntk_56_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The teachers are doing all that they can to return things back the way they should be.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya juga ingin situasi ini bisa diselesaikan secepatnya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">学校老师们都在尽力恢复原貌，希望学生们也一起努力。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_knight1.ntk_56_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_knight1.ntk_57_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">........</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">........</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">.......</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_knight1.ntk_58_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Like I said before, these violent monsters are wrecking our campus.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Please get out there, and keep them from causing even more destruction.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Seperti yang sudah aku bilang mereka yang berada diluar adalah orang-orang yang menghancurkan apapun yang terlihat dan sedang mencari sesuatu yang bisa dihancurkan lagi</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我之前也有说过，现在有许多暴力怪物在破坏校园，请向前阻止，给他们一点颜色瞧瞧，并维持校园治安吧。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_knight1.ntk_58_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_knight1.ntk_59_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Know that carelessness may result in you ending up in a really bad situation.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Di dalam sekolah kamu bisa kehilangan nyawa bila lengah sedikit</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">要知道一不小心，就会导致您陷入非常糟糕的局面。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_knight1.ntk_59_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_knight1.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Initially, your character's Skill Points are set to 0. You earn 1 additional Skill Point every time your character levels up. You can use these points to learn new skills.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ini benar-benar hebat!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sejak kapan kamu menjadi kuat begitu?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sepertinya kamu sudah mampu pergi ke Sacred Gate's Park.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">技能点数从0个开始计算，每当角色等级晋级时，就会增加 1个技能点数。您可利用这些技能点数，来学习新的技能，亦或是提升旧技能的等级。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_knight1.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_knight1.ntk_60_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Remember that you'll be entering a world full of dangers once you submit the Exit Approval Form. Please be careful out there!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Exit Approval yang kamu tuliskan berisikan tentang segala resiko akan bahaya, ingatlah itu baik-baik!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">要知道一不小心，就会导致您陷入非常糟糕的局面。别忘记，只要你提交外出申请单，就是进入危险可怕世界的时候了。在外闯荡时，请小心安全。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_knight1.ntk_60_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_knight1.ntk_61_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Oh... So you saw the List of Saints.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It's true that there's nothing wrong with the list.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ah, but you're probably curious about what's behind it. Am I right?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Why are there so many students with family problems?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It's quite simple, actually.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Not too many loving parents would send their children to an experimental school.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Even if extraordinary benefits were offered, most parents would think that traditions set by normal schools are more important.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kamu sudah liat Saint List rupanya…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sebenarnya tidak ada masalah dengan daftarnya.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tapi tetap penasaran… iya kan?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kenapa banyak sekali keluarga yang memiliki masalah…?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jika dipikir-pikir ini hal yang sepele tapi...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sebenarnyakan hanya sedik</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">噢，您看过了这份圣徒列表！没错，就是这些内容。哦，我猜您很好奇它的背景故事，对吧？为何会有这么多的学生被难解的家庭问题所困扰呢？答案很简单。就是，并没有太多的父母会愿意把子女送到具有实验性质的学校念书。就算福利再好，他们还是比较信任普通学校所走的传统路线。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_knight1.ntk_61_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tetap mendengarkan.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">继续</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_knight1.ntk_62_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Many people raise this question...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">What is forgiveness, and does it work?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Oh, but it's not like I have the right to teach you anything.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Why should I force what little I know upon you?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You know that there are arenas in the Trading Hole.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You can find teachers that can teach you more over there.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Banyak orang yang mempertanyakannya…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Apakah itu perbuatan yang dapat diampuni atau perbuatan yang layak dapat pujian.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tetapi..aku sebagai pengajar semua itu tidak benar..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Aku juga sebenarnya dipaksa untuk mengerjakan sesuatu yang aku tak ketahui</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">很多人提出不少疑问，例如，什么是可以原谅的？被原谅是件好事吗？不过我觉得我没有资格教您们这些东西。我不能仅仅仗着比您懂多一点，就对您颐指气使。您知道在Trading Hole有不少竞技场，对吧？在那边，您可以找到适合您的老师唷。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_knight1.ntk_62_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Begin</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">最初</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_knight1.ntk_63_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Spiritual Spheres are earned by achieving certain character levels. You can use Spiritual Spheres to learn available skills of your choice.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jika kamu mempunyai Spiritual Spheres, berarti kekuatan kamu sudah cukup diakui. Pilihlah Skill yang kamu inginkan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">达到特定等级，就能拿到Spiritual Spheres。您可自由使用Spiritual Spheres来选择可学的技能唷。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
