    <VALUE Lang="id">Konfirmasi Nurse Trainee</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">确认位置</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_medic1.ntk_1_0_6">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Confirm Position</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Konfirmasi Nurse Trainee</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">确认位置</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_medic1.ntk_1_0_7">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Confirm Position</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Konfirmasi Nurse Trainee</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">确认位置</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_medic1.ntk_1_0_8">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Confirm Position</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Permintaan Nurse Trainee</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">确认位置</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_medic1.ntk_1_0_9">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Nurse's Request</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menyerahkan Cartel sheet</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">Nurse的请求</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_medic1.ntk_10_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Poisoning causes the victim's Strength and Stamina to continuously diminish, and it inflicts more damage than burns. Please be aware of this!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Stamina terus menurun karena keracunan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Harus berhati-hati karena penurunannya lebih banyak bila dibandingkan saat saat pembakaran.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">中毒后体力会持续下降，比烧灼时减少的量更大，请特别注意！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_medic1.ntk_10_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_medic1.ntk_11_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Suffocation causes the victims movements to become confused and spasmodic, indicating a lack of control. This condition doesn't last for too long, but it's still considered to be very dangerous. Please be careful not to get suffocated!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ini adalah kondisi dimana gerakan tidak dapat dilakukan seketika, biasanya tidak berlangsung lama.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tapi tetap saja ini kondisi yang berbahaya.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">瞬间行动会不良，不过一般来说持续时间不长。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">话虽如此, 这也算危险的状况。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_medic1.ntk_11_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_medic1.ntk_12_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Although the medicines I have aren't really enough to heal your condition, I'll still try my best to treat you. Please let me take a look at your injuries.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Meskipun medicinenya tidak cukup, aku masih bisa membantu sedikit. Coba perlihatkan lukamu.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">虽然药品不够, 不过还是可以帮上小忙, 把受伤的地方给我看</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_medic1.ntk_12_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about Wound Treatment</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang pengobatan luka</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问伤口治疗</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_medic1.ntk_12_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about Chaotic Situation</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang kondisi</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问现况</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_medic1.ntk_12_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about Different Illnesses</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang kondisi abnormal</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问异常疾病</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_medic1.ntk_12_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_medic1.ntk_13_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Oh! Are you going to register?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I bet this is your first time to register. You seem a little nervous!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Do you understand the terms of registration?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I can assure you that you can come to me for treatment until you reach Level 15. Please visit me in case you need to be treated.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Don't you think it'd be more convenient if you change your Save Point over here?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jadi, kamu ingin mendaftar?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sebelum kamu mencapai level 15, saya akan mengobati lukamu. Jika kamu terluka, datanglah kesini.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">嗯.. 你在登记吗?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">不是第一次了吧,哪会有人这么僵硬的??</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">了解吗</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">可以确实治疗到等级15为止, 所以受伤的话赶快到这里来.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">如果将位置变更为从这里开始不是更方便吗</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_medic1.ntk_13_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_medic1.ntk_14_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Writing these medical reports is really exhausting work, and I just ran out of paper. Do you think you can help me with this problem?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">There are paper supplies at the Welfare Society. Would you go there and get some paper for me?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sesibuk apapun harusnya bekerja sambil menulis dokumen</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tanpa sepengetahuan saya ternyata paper terus berkurang</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau pergi ke shop di sana ada sih, kamu bisa tolong ambilkan nggak?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">不管再怎样累人还是有很多文件要写跟做很多的事, 但不知何时纸全用光了</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">那里的Welfare Society有, 请问你愿意帮我带过来吗</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_medic1.ntk_14_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_medic1.ntk_15_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ah! Thank you very much!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">This job requires me to write medical records all day.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">If you get injured in the future, please feel free to come to me for help.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I'll attend to your medical needs and make sure you get quality treatment.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Aaa~ Makasih banyak-</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tadi dokumen yang ditulis terburu-buru harus dipindahkan dong</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau suatu saat nanti kamu terluka, datang ke sini yah ~</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Aku pasti obati dengan pelayanan yang terbaik~</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">啊 真是多谢!!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">刚刚急急忙忙写下的东西得再写一次了呢</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">以后受伤的话再过来吧</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">会给予你更好的治疗</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_medic1.ntk_15_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_medic1.ntk_16_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Oh! You already got it?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Thank you very much! You've been a great help! We have a medicine shortage if you didn't bring new supplies. We'd have big trouble on campus without any first-aid supplies.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I hope the situation outside gets better. I'm afraid it'll affect the campus if things continue like this.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Eh, kamu yang ambil yah?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Dulu kan saya minta bantuan pada Security Guard</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pokoknya makasih deh, kebetulan lagi perlu banget</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lagian juga kita memang sedang kekurangan medicine, kalau tidak ada P3K tidak tahu deh gimana.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Situasi di luar harus ce</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">喔~ 学生你带来啰</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这不是守卫大叔你要求的嘛?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">不管怎样, 谢啦!! 正好需要.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">药品本来是不够的, 若没有这类急救药品的话实在没法度了.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">外面的状况得快点好转才是, 真是令人担心啊!</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_medic1.ntk_16_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_medic1.ntk_17_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The quality and quantity of medicine supplies aren't very good, so we have to find a way to produce our own.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Excuse me. Would you be willing to help me collect some Cigarette Butts?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Have you ever heard of Little Hooligan and the Hooligan? They're notorious for chain-smoking.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I requested someone to collect cigarette butts from Little Hooligan for me. He brought me butts that weren't high enough in quality, and they couldn't be used to make medicinal materials. Would you help me acquire cigarette butts from the Hooligan instead?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Oh, and don't worry. I'll give you some money if you can get me 20 cigarette Butts from the Hooligan.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Situasi permintaan dan penawaran Medicines sedang tidak bagus, sampai-sampai kita harus membuat sendiri obat-obat yang darurat</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Maaf, bisa bantu kumpulkan Cigarette Filter nggak?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya dengar orang-orang seperti Hooligan dan Little Hooligan pada merok</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">药品供给的状况不好, 已经紧急到要直接制作使用的地步了</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">不好意思, 可以帮我收集香烟的烟蒂吗?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">有两个叫做Little Hooligan和Hooligan的人常叼着烟！</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">上次拜托过，但Little Hooligan抽的烟品质不太好, 无法用作药品的材料。请帮我取得Hooligan的烟吧！</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">如果你帮我收集到20个, 我就换钱给你。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_medic1.ntk_17_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_medic1.ntk_18_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Wow! You already collected the Cigarette Butts!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Thank you so much!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">We should be able to produce our own medicinal materials, starting today. If you find yourself with free time later, please come here and help me again, okay?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Wahh, sudah terkumpul semua</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Makasih banyak</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sepertinya kita harus mandiri kedepannya, karena itu kalau ada waktu tolong bantu lagi yah</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">哇~ 你都收集到啦?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">真是感谢</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">因为往后有阵子可能都得这样自给自足, 所以有空的话再帮个忙吧.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_medic1.ntk_18_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_medic1.ntk_19_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">We're experiencing a shortage in medicines and medical supplies use for treatment.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">If this continues, we'll need to come up with new ways to get or make the medical equipment and supplies that we need on our own.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I just got a great idea! The Street Junkies outside carry plaster and wear bandages, right?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Yes, now I remember that those guys carry bandages on them, but the Street Junkies don't really need them. I think that other students will benefit more from having those bandages.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Having said that, will you help me get bandages from the Street Junkies?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">We don't have many bandages on hand, so we'll need to replenish our supply.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bukan hanya obat-obatan, peralatan kesehatan yang lain juga kurang</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau sudah seperti ini, kumpulkan saja semua bahan yang bisa dicari</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tadi saya lihat, ada beberapa pelajar yang salah satu tangannya digips</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Di saku para Pelajar itu kayaknya ada</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">不只药品, 医疗用品全都不足</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这样看来可以用的东西全都要找来准备好</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我刚看了一下是不是有群打着石膏的学生</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">那群学生的口袋里似乎有满满的绷带</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">虽说打着石膏看起来是很痛啦, 不过这样浪费绷带的话对其他学生不好吧?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">说得好, 把剩下的绷带拿来...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">补给的状况不是很好, 所以我才说要分着使用呀!"</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_medic1.ntk_19_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_medic1.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">.....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">.....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">.....</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_medic1.ntk_20_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">This is great! Thanks!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Most students may look tough, but they're actually good and obedient like you, deep down inside. You really have to communicate pleasantly to people to get their respect.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Anyway, thanks a lot! I might come and ask for your assistance again in the future. *Smiles*</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Wah, untung saja~</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Para pelajar itu keliahatannya bermuka menakutkan, tetapi ternyata baik hati...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Iya benar, kalau diajak ngobrol dengan baik-baik siapa saja pasti mau</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bagaimana pun juga, makasih ya. Nantinya saya mohon bantuannya lagi~</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">啊 太好了</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">那群学生的脸虽然看起有点吓人, 不过挺听话的嘛…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">是啊..有耐心慢慢说服的话, 不管是谁都会亲切相待的</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">不管怎么说, 谢啦, 以后还要麻烦你呢</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_medic1.ntk_20_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_medic1.ntk_21_0">
