  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_sc.ntk_29_0_7"><VALUE Lang="tw">兌換 強力射擊（47級／超能部）</VALUE><VALUE Lang="GS">Skill book: Power Shooting (Lv47, Class=3072, Item=389/122)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="id">Skill book: Power Shooting (Lv47, Class=3072, Item=389/122)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="cn">Skill book: Power Shooting (Lv47, Class=3072, Item=389/122)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="th">Skill book: Power Shooting (Lv47, Class=3072, Item=389/122)</VALUE></SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_sc.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It overpowers a human brain when the power of solidified stone and the scientific thinking are combined together. If we are too dependable on the weapons then we would better be called a Hunter's Group.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau kekuatan dari solid stone digunakan pada pikiran ilmiah, kekuatan yang melebihi batas manusia bisa didapatkan. Kalau terobsesi hanya pada senjata yang bagus maka akan lebih baik bila menyebutnya jurusan tembakan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">当Solidified stone的力量和科学的思维结合在一起，就会击败人脑。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">如果我们仅仅执着在武器上面,不如就改名叫做"猎人团队"啦。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_sc.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
