    <VALUE Lang="cn">..</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_sc.ntk_48_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">..</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_sc.ntk_49_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">..</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_sc.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Physical powers are rather weak than any other classes so, it is required to keep certain distance from the target. Taking temporary control over a target or attack by dealing lasting damages are the role of true Scientist. You can play many different type of roles so you must always keep calm and understand the circumstances.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Karena kemampuan fisik kamu lebih rendah dibandingkan dengan pelajar kelas lain, kamu harus menjaga jarak dengan musuh yang menghampiri. Harus berperan untuk mengontrol gerakan musuh atau melakukan serangan berulang-ulang untuk menciderai mereka. Kalian h</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">因为体力比其他职业弱一些，所以要与周围的敌人保持一点距离。瞬间控制对方的行动、或者给予持续性的伤害，是,超能部所要扮演的其中一项角色。要常常冷静沉着地观察周围唷。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_sc.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_sc.ntk_50_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">"Why aren't you registered yet..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Because you are not ready, such things are happening to you..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You should be able to find something proper at the DB room terminal in front of Main Center."</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kenapa juga tidak daftar dulu…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Karena tidak ada persiapan apa-apa makanya kena kejadian seperti itu…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau pergi ke Information room terminal di depan Main building kamu pasti bisa menemukan sesuatu yang pas</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">怎么还没完成学院注册呢？就是因为您都不做好准备，所以才会发生这种事情。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">先去Main Center前面的资料终端机DB room terminal找找看吧。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_sc.ntk_50_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_sc.ntk_51_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">……………</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_sc.ntk_52_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Our group has just been reborn and I am too busy to take care of everyone. However, I don't expect anyone to behave disorderly?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya tidak bisa mengurus semua hal, karena kelas ini baru dibangun. Tapi kalian harus tetap bersemangat.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">新部门刚成立不久，每天都忙得晕头转向。因为突发的异变事件，害得整个学院都不得安宁。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_sc.ntk_52_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">继续</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_sc.ntk_53_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">All creatures were just normal human beings once, inside and out of the school. However, if you feel pity and go easy on them will just put yourself in dangerous situations. Everything is depending on you all.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Di dalam atau luar sekolah pada awalnya semua adalah citizen. Tapi jangan sampai kamu terluka karena mengasihani mereka dengan gegabah. Bagaimana caranya menyelesaikan masalah ini adalah tergantung pada hati kalian</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">在学院四周徘徊的那些人，原本跟您一样都是好人。但异变发生之后，举止越来越怪异，甚至到处破坏东西。请您不要对他们心软，也要努力找出异变的真正原因。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_sc.ntk_53_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">继续</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_sc.ntk_54_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I wouldn't be here, if the accident in the basement didn't occur. But I have already decided to be with you all so, I will give my 100% to help you.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau saja tidak ada kejadian di basement itu, aku tidak perlu muncul di sekolah. Tapi karena aku sudah berjanji untuk bersama kalian aku akan membantu sebisanya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">要是这里没有发生异变，我也不会来到这里了。我会尽量协助您，有问题尽管问我唷。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_sc.ntk_54_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_sc.ntk_55_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_sc.ntk_56_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">There are soulless people wandering around outside of the school. Inside the school it is a bit safer but once you go out the main gate, you need to be careful. You don't know what will come after you.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Di luar sekolah banyak orang yang berkeliaran. Tempat paling aman adalah di dalam sekolah.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">因为异变的恶影响，校外的情况比校内更为严重。据情报显示，这种现象将持续非常久。在情况好转之前，请您务必小心行事。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_sc.ntk_56_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">继续</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_sc.ntk_57_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Once you get the approval from Student Director, it means that you are ready to face the great dangers like that so be prepared.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau kamu menyerahkan formulir pass, kamu harus menjalani semua itu. Kuatkanlah hati kamu dan semangat</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">一旦您申请了外出证，那就代表您将付起全数的责任了！加油！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_sc.ntk_57_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_sc.ntk_58_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">…………</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_sc.ntk_59_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">"The facts about Saint List is just a tip of an iceberg.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You will understand when you get closer to the truth.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Your own matters are important but I hope you could get closer to the truth and think more."</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saint list tidak lebih dari satu bagian saja.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau kamu sudah mendekati pada kenyataan kamu bisa tahu lebih banyak lagi.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Hal yang berkaitan dengan kalian juga penting, tapi aku harap kamu bisa mendekati kenyataan dan berpikir yang lebih banyak</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">Saint List的部分是小事。当您越接近事实，就会发现更多的真相。虽然现在手边的事情很重要，但希望您可以主动去发掘真相，激发更多的想法。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_sc.ntk_59_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">继续</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_sc.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Starting from '0', you will be able to receive '1' Skill Point each when you level up.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pertama dimulai dari '0' dan setiap naik level akan mendapatkan '1' buah 'Skill Point'</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">技能点数从0个开始计算，每当角色等级晋级时，就会增加 1个技能点数。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_sc.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_sc.ntk_60_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">"You will probably get more curious..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Go see Scientist Student Rep. at Trading Hole, she will be able to give you more details."</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kamu pasti punya banyak pertanyaan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau kamu pergi ke Trading Hole disana ada Science Club Manager</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Temui dia karena dia bisa memberikan informasi yang lebih banyak</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我知道您一定感到很困惑。请前往Trading Hole去拜访超能部学生Rep。她会告诉您更多细节的。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_sc.ntk_60_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_sc.ntk_61_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Great, you've got a spiritual sphere, exchange it for a skill scroll of your choice.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sudah punya spiritual sphere rupanya. Silahkan tukarkan dengan Scroll of skill yang kamu inginkan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">太好了！您已拥有Spiritual Spheres。可以兑换想要的技能文书唷。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
