  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_spirit1.ntk_34_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Spiritual Spheres are earned by achieving certain character levels. You can use Spiritual Spheres to learn available skills of your choice.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jika kamu mempunyai Spiritual Spheres, berarti kekuatan kamu sudah cukup diakui. Pilihlah Skill yang kamu inginkan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">达到特定等级，就能拿到Spiritual Spheres。您可自由使用Spiritual Spheres来选择可学的技能唷。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_spirit1.ntk_34_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Exchange Item</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tukar</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">交换物品</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_spirit1.ntk_34_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Cancel</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Batal</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">取消</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_spirit1.ntk_35_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Spiritual Spheres are earned by achieving certain character levels. You can use Spiritual Spheres to learn available skills of your choice.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jika kamu mempunyai Spiritual Spheres, berarti kekuatan kamu sudah cukup diakui. Pilihlah Skill yang kamu inginkan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">达到特定等级，就能拿到Spiritual Spheres。您可自由使用Spiritual Spheres来选择可学的技能唷。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_spirit1.ntk_35_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Exchange Item</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tukar</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">交换物品</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_spirit1.ntk_35_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Cancel</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Batal</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">取消</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_spirit1.ntk_36_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Spiritual Spheres are earned by achieving certain character levels. You can use Spiritual Spheres to learn available skills of your choice.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jika kamu mempunyai Spiritual Spheres, berarti kekuatan kamu sudah cukup diakui. Pilihlah Skill yang kamu inginkan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">达到特定等级，就能拿到Spiritual Spheres。您可自由使用Spiritual Spheres来选择可学的技能唷。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_spirit1.ntk_36_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Exchange Item</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tukar</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">交换物品</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_spirit1.ntk_36_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Cancel</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Batal</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">取消</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_spirit1.ntk_37_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">.......</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">.......</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">.......</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_spirit1.ntk_38_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Destiny has chosen students to join the Shaman Section.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tapi ada perkumpulan yang dinamakan Shaman Club untuk para pelajar yang terpilih seperti kalian</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">命运让您们与气功部同在一起。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_spirit1.ntk_38_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_spirit1.ntk_39_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The power of your skills lies in your understanding of the Universe's Spirit.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Remember that your goals are not geared toward destruction.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Yang dimaksud dengan Shaman adalah mengerti dan membaurkan komponen nyata dan abstrak yang menyusun dunia ini.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tapi jangan sampai lupa bahwa tujuan dari melakukan hal tersebut adalah untuk membangun bukan menghancurkan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">技能的力量大小取决于对宇宙精神的理解度。请记住，您的目标不该只是进行破坏而已。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_spirit1.ntk_39_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_spirit1.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Focusing Stat points to Intelligence will develop a character that will be good at Support.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Fokus Stat point kamu di INT akan membuat karakter kamu bagus sebagai pendukung untuk karakter lain.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">请将能力点数集中在 Intelligence，那么您的角色将能成为‘辅助’的高手唷。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_spirit1.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about Enemy</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang musuh</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问敌人</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_spirit1.ntk_4_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_spirit1.ntk_40_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">......</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">......</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">......</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_spirit1.ntk_41_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Those enemies are just clones of mobs whose minds are unstable.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">They are the opposite of people whose souls are free.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">angan khawatir karena semua musuh-musuh yang terlihat hanyalah boneka hasil kloning yang berbeda dengan wujud asli mereka.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">噢！别担心。我不是要您去杀人。其实，那些敌人都是妖怪的复制品，它们的精神都很不稳定，请小心。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_spirit1.ntk_41_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_spirit1.ntk_42_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">There are times when you must grant death to free those trapped spirits.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kamu tidak perlu merasa bersalah karena kamu telah membebaskan jiwa-jiwa yang terkurung di dalam tubuh yang telah mati.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">有很多时候，您必须承认死亡一事，对于那些受伤的灵魂们，反倒是一种解脱的好方式。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_spirit1.ntk_42_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_spirit1.ntk_43_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">하지만... 언젠가는 살인이라는 걸 하기 싫어도 해야 할 때가 올 거야. 그때는...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">하지만... 언젠가는 살인이라는 걸 하기 싫어도 해야 할 때가 올 거야. 그때는...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">하지만... 언젠가는 살인이라는 걸 하기 싫어도 해야 할 때가 올 거야. 그때는...</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_spirit1.ntk_43_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_spirit1.ntk_44_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">.....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">.....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">.....</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_spirit1.ntk_45_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You must always stay behind your partners, and back them up. Support them so that they can use the full extent of their powers.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Selalu ada dibarisan paling belakang untuk membatu teman-teman kalian supaya bisa mengoptimalkan kekuatan mereka, dan melanjutkan peran dari para member party</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">您本身是不太适合战斗。您可以尽量位在同伴们的后方，给他们提供支援。有您的后勤支援，他们才能够将攻击力发挥得淋漓尽致。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_spirit1.ntk_45_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_spirit1.ntk_46_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">.......</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">.......</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">.......</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_spirit1.ntk_47_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You should have more than enough Skill Points at the beginning since the starting skills won't require many Skill Points.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You'll find, however, that you might not have enough points to learn some of the later skills. Think and plan carefully, and choose the essential skills that you want to learn.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Skill pada fase awal tidak membutuhkan banyak point jadi mungkin akan banyak point yang tersisa</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">一开始，您的技能点数绝对是足够的，因为初期的要求不会太严格。但之后，可能会发生技能点数不够用，导致该学的技能无法学的窘境。必须先谨慎思考，利用有限的技能点数，搭配好您真正期望的技能之树。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_spirit1.ntk_47_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_spirit1.ntk_48_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">하지만 나중엔 모자라서 배울 수도 있는 스킬을 못배우고 썩히게 될 경우가 생길 수도 있으니까 잘 생각해 보고 꼭 필요한 스킬만 익히도록.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">하지만 나중엔 모자라서 배울 수도 있는 스킬을 못배우고 썩히게 될 경우가 생길 수도 있으니까 잘 생각해 보고 꼭 필요한 스킬만 익히도록.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">하지만 나중엔 모자라서 배울 수도 있는 스킬을 못배우고 썩히게 될 경우가 생길 수도 있으니까 잘 생각해 보고 꼭 필요한 스킬만 익히도록.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_spirit1.ntk_48_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_spirit1.ntk_49_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">.....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">.....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">.....</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_spirit1.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ah! Don't worry, you're not suited for killing.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ah! Jangan khawatir, kamu tidak cocok untuk membunuh.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">噢！别担心。我不是要您去杀人。其实，那些敌人都是妖怪的复制品，它们的精神都很不稳定，请小心。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_spirit1.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_spirit1.ntk_50_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You need to go to the School Administration Office for student registration. It is located near the Welfare Society.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Look for the Student Director so he can assist you in your registration.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You can get your wounds treated at the First-Aid Room. You'd better know how to get there. Sooner or later, you're probably going to get injured!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Terus jangan sampai lupa untuk melapor kepada Student Director tentang pendaftaran pelajar</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Nurse Trainee' bisa mengobati kamu saat terluka, karena itu sapalah dia terlebih dahulu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">噢！关于学生的注册，您必须去拜访一下那位在Welfare Society旁边Administration Office里的Student Director先生。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">此外，您也可以到First-Aid Room去接受伤口的治疗。不过，保健室的位置是一定要先打听清楚的，因为您会很容易在战斗中受伤的。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_spirit1.ntk_50_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_spirit1.ntk_51_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">......</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">......</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">......</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_spirit1.ntk_52_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">We are conducting an investigation of the case.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Please remember that the evil can't control everyone!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Walaupun semua orang, sampai para guru pergi keluar untuk menyelidiki kejadian itu.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">tapi kalian tetap tidak boleh lengah dan berdiam saja!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">请您前往进行调查的相关协助。要记住，您们不是那么简单就会被恶魔给打倒的。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_spirit1.ntk_52_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_spirit1.ntk_53_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">There aren't too many normal human beings around anymore. Most have already been transformed into evil monsters. Although it's a really bad situation, it's not like things can't be changed for the better.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Please remember this.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Di sekitar sekolah sudah jarang orang normal, yang tersisa hanya monster yang menghancurkan apapun yang mereka lihat. Jangan sampai lupa bahwa orang yang bisa menyelesaikan masasalah ini adalah hanya kalian</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这边的人几乎都不算是人了。他们都变成邪恶的妖怪了。虽然这情况很糟糕，但并不是无药可救。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_spirit1.ntk_53_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_spirit1.ntk_54_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The teachers are doing all that they can to return things back the way they should be.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya juga ingin agar semua ini kembali seperti semula secepatnya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">学校的老师们正尽全力将所有的人事物恢复成原来的样子。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_spirit1.ntk_54_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_spirit1.ntk_55_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">.....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">.....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">.....</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_spirit1.ntk_56_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Like I said before, these violent monsters are wrecking our campus.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Please get out there, and keep them from causing even more destruction.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Seperti yang sudah aku bilang, mereka yang berada di sekitar sekolah adalah orang-orang yang menghancurkan apapun yang terlihat dan sedang mencari sesuatu yang bisa dihancurkan lagi</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">现在有许多暴力怪物在破坏校园，请向前阻止，给他们一点颜色瞧瞧，并维持校园治安吧。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_spirit1.ntk_56_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_spirit1.ntk_57_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Know that carelessness may result in you ending up in a really bad situation.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Remember that you'll be entering a world full of dangers once you submit the Exit Approval Form. Please be careful out there!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau kamu lengah sedikit saja di daerah sekitar sekolah kamu bisa kehiangan nyawa</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">要知道一不小心，就会导致您陷入非常糟糕的局面。别忘记，只要你提交外出申请单，就是进入危险可怕世界的时候了。在外闯荡时，请小心安全。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_spirit1.ntk_57_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_spirit1.ntk_58_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">외출 신청서를 써 내면 그걸로 너는 그 위험 속으로 들어가게 된다는 걸 명심하고 마음 단단히 먹도록 해!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">외출 신청서를 써 내면 그걸로 너는 그 위험 속으로 들어가게 된다는 걸 명심하고 마음 단단히 먹도록 해!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">외출 신청서를 써 내면 그걸로 너는 그 위험 속으로 들어가게 된다는 걸 명심하고 마음 단단히 먹도록 해!</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_spirit1.ntk_58_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_spirit1.ntk_59_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">.....4-1</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">.....4-1</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">.....4-1</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_spirit1.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Your character build is not suited for battle.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Karakter kamu dibuat bukan untuk sebagai pembunuh.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">您本身是不太适合战斗。您可以尽量位在同伴们的后方，给他们提供支援。有您的后勤支援，他们才能够将攻击力发挥得淋漓尽致。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_spirit1.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_spirit1.ntk_60_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It is essential for you to learn how to meditate in peace. This is how you can strengthen your power and eventually tap into your full potential.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Given the current situation, however, there isn't time to think about that now.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau dulu, aku memilih untuk bermeditasi dan bersatu dengan elemen yang ada di sekitar</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tapi dalam situasi sekarang yang seperti ini, cara yang santai seperti itu tidak kepikiran oleh aku </VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这是很基本的。您应该要知道如何冥想，这是可以加强您的Power，甚至是可以激发您潜力的好方法唷。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">以现在的情况来看，我们根本没有时间去思考任何事情。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_spirit1.ntk_60_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_spirit1.ntk_61_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You will need skills that can inflict direct damage to your enemies when you must face them.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You are awarded 3 Stat Points each time your character levels up. Your character's build and growth is determined by how these Stat Points are allocated to your character's attributes.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Walaupun susah, kamu harus bisa merasakan semua elemen yang bergerak disekitar kamu pada saat bertarung dengan musuh. Kemudian pada saat itu arah pertumbuhan akan diputuskan sesuai dengan distribusi dari 3 skill point yang diberikan setiap kali level naik</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">您需要学习技能，才能在遇到敌人时，对他们进行致命的攻击。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">每当角色成功晋级，就会发送了3个能力点数。依据该点数的各个属性分配，角色会以相同方式被朔造定型。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_spirit1.ntk_61_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_spirit1.ntk_62_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Primarily investing Stat Points in Strength, followed by Dexterity, will develop a Spear Type character that will have strong close-ranged abilities.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jika kamu memilih mendistribusikan statusmu di POW diikuti dengan DEX, maka karakter kamu akan sangat kuat dalam pertarungan jarak dekat menggunakan tombak</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">首先，将点数均匀分配在力量，并适度搭配敏捷，您的角色将能成为‘强悍近战长矛型’高手唷。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_spirit1.ntk_62_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_spirit1.ntk_63_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You can also allocate Stat Points equally to Strength, Dexterity, and Intelligence to build an Attack Type character.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Focusing your Stat Points in Intelligence will develop a Supportive Type character.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kamu juga bisa mengalokasikan statusmu rata di semua bagian (POW, INT dan DEX) untuk membuat karakter tipe menyerang</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">您可以将能力点数均匀分配在敏捷，力量，与精神，那么您的角色将成为Attack型高手。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">若将能力点数集中在精神，那么您的角色将能成为‘辅助’的高手唷。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_spirit1.ntk_63_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_spirit1.ntk_64_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Oh... So you saw the List of Saints.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It's true that there's nothing wrong with the list.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ah, but you're probably curious about what's behind it. Am I right?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Why are there so many students with family problems?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It's quite simple, actually.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Not too many loving parents would send their children to an experimental school.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Even if extraordinary benefits were offered, most parents would think that traditions set by normal schools are more important.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ah, jadi kamu sudah melihat Saint list.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Benar - benar tidak ada yang aneh hingga saat ini.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ah, kamu sepertinya ada pikiran lain bukan?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mengapa banyak pelajar yang bermasalah?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jawabannya sangat mudah, banyak orang tua yang mengirim anak - anakn</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">噢，您看过了这份圣徒列表！没错，就是这些内容。哦，我猜您很好奇它的背景故事，对吧？为何会有这么多的学生被难解的家庭问题所困扰呢？答案很简单。就是，并没有太多的父母会愿意把子女送到具有实验性质的学校念书。就算福利再好，他们还是比较信任普通学校所走的传统路线。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_spirit1.ntk_64_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">继续</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_spirit1.ntk_65_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Many people raise this question...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">What is forgiveness, and does it work?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Oh, but it's not like I have the right to teach you anything.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Why should I force what little I know upon you?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You know that there are arenas in the Trading Hole.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You can find teachers that can teach you more over there.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kamu bisa mencoba ke Trading Hole. Di sana akan ada guru yang bisa mengajar ataupun menjawab pertanyaan kamu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">许多人都问我，何谓宽恕？宽恕是否能化解怨恨？我想我不够资格给意见，也没权力对您行使任何要求。您知道的。Trading Hole有不少竞技场。在那边您可以找到更好的老师。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_spirit1.ntk_65_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Begin</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">最初</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_spirit1.ntk_66_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">很多人提出不少疑问，例如，什么是可以原谅的？被原谅是件好事吗？不过我觉得我没有资格教您们这些东西。我不能仅仅仗着比您懂多一点，就对您颐指气使。您知道在Trading Hole有不少竞技场，对吧？在那边，您可以找到适合您的老师唷。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_spirit1.ntk_67_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">What?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Now, I've told you that you needed to be ready for this situation.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Well, it's too late now.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Maybe you can find the items you need in the Resource Room.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Apa?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sudah kubilang kamu harus bersiap - siap untuk menghadapai hal semacam ini.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ini sudah sangat telat sekarang.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mungkin kamu bisa menemukan sesuatu di Resource Room.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">什么？嗯，我已经告诉过您了，必须随时随地最好准备。现在似乎有点迟了。不过也许您能在Resource Room找到您需要的物品唷。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_spirit1.ntk_67_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Begin</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Begin</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">最初</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_spirit1.ntk_68_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Spiritual Spheres are earned by achieving certain character levels. You can use Spiritual Spheres to learn available skills of your choice.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jika kamu mempunyai Spiritual Spheres, berarti kekuatan kamu sudah cukup diakui. Pilihlah Skill yang kamu inginkan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">达到特定等级，就能拿到Spiritual Spheres。您可自由使用Spiritual Spheres来选择可学的技能唷。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
