  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_spirit1.ntk_74_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Spiritual Spheres are earned by achieving certain character levels. You can use Spiritual Spheres to learn available skills of your choice.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jika kamu mempunyai Spiritual Spheres, berarti kekuatan kamu sudah cukup diakui. Pilihlah Skill yang kamu inginkan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">达到特定等级，就能拿到Spiritual Spheres。您可自由使用Spiritual Spheres来选择可学的技能唷。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_spirit1.ntk_74_0_4"><VALUE Lang="tw">兌換 靈魂波動（237級／氣功部）</VALUE><VALUE Lang="GS">Skill book: Soul Wave (Lv237, Class=520, Item=176/21)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="id">Skill book: Soul Wave (Lv237, Class=520, Item=176/21)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="cn">Skill book: Soul Wave (Lv237, Class=520, Item=176/21)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="th">Skill book: Soul Wave (Lv237, Class=520, Item=176/21)</VALUE></SENTENSE>
