  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_spirit1.ntk_75_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Spiritual Spheres are earned by achieving certain character levels. You can use Spiritual Spheres to learn available skills of your choice.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">达成特定等级可获得灵珠。透过灵珠您可选择并学习可学的技能。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Spiritual Sphere didapat setelah mencapai beberapa level tertentu. Kamu dapat menukar Spiritual Spheres dengan skill pilihanmu.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
