  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_1_12">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It looks like you still haven't registered as a College Student yet! Even though the situation outside is complete chaos, I'll never allow a new student to skip the registration process. You need to register first so we can confirm whether you are qualified to be a student of this college. Please finish the Registration process as soon as possible.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Senang bertemu denganmu, saya Student Director, apakah kamu pelajar yang dipanggil?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">学生呢…好像没有正式注册为学院生的样子…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">就算电脑系统没有办法达到预期的效果, 但却没办法骗过我的记忆力!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这些麻烦而拖拖拉拉的兔崽子们连成为我们学生的资格都没有!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">还不赶快去把事情办好来</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
