  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_100_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Hm? Haha! Is it even possible to even reach this place at your level?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I guess it won't be difficult for you to match 7 pieces, right?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I'm just worried that since you're new, you might not be able to assemble the 7 pieces on time.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Emm!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Euhm, segitu saja sudah lari-lari tergesa?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ngumpulin 7 potongan kayak gini apanya yang susah???</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">!哼, 呵呵, 以这程度到有到这里吗?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">只是要去把7片对起来哪有什么难的...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">但是门外汉们看起来7片就像是100片一样, 短时间内没有办法拼好也是可能的</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
