  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_101_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Look at the part of this note that's torn.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">This might be a clue. If you find anything else like this, then please bring it to me.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It's been a long time since I've been this excited.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Please bring these kinds of items here if ever you find anything similar, alright?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tapi memang sih buat orang awam kadang 7 potongan nggak ada bedanya dengan 100 potongan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau kamu lihat bagian ini ada bentuk yang terputus pada arah yang sama</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">好好看着这部分, 看到同方向被撕开的花纹了吧?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这可以是个暗示, 还有个问题就像陷阱一样... 嗯? 要我直接拿过去?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">好久没拿到令人高兴的东西了, 但却有点可惜.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">以后如果再找到相似的东西再拿过来</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
