  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_105_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The students might not have the Brooms ready by now. There's one thing I need to explain first.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tapi kamu kayaknya masih belum menyiapkan Special Broom…Harus aku jelaskan dulu ya…Hemm</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">但是学生到现在好像还没有准备扫帚…那我先该要说明的有一项…嗯</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_105_0_1">
