  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_115_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Anyway, this matter is worth investigating.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I'll give you a copy of the ID Card. You should go and make good use of it.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Namun aku rasa efeknya tidak begitu besar…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">bagaimanapun juga survei tetaplah dibutuhkan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">不管怎么说还是值得调查看看.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">那么, 这边有ID 卡的复制本, 拿去试试看吧</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_115_0_1">
