  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_118_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I have a feeling that the 2nd floor basement is very dangerous. This ID Card can give you access to the 3rd Floor basement. Remember to use the dedicated elevators to access specific areas of the basement.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Please be careful: it won't be easy to go through the basements.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Good Luck!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bagaimanapun Basement 2 itu berbahaya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Aku punya firasat yang sangat buruk…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">地下2F怎么说都很危险.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我感觉相当的不好.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这卡虽然可以用到3楼, 但要去地下室的话, 要搭专用的电梯才能到.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">应该不是很容易去的</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
