  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_121_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">In order to start a Gang, you need at least five (5) members that do not belong to any other Gang. The Gang Leader applicant should be at Character Level 30, and pay a processing fee of 1,000,000 Gold Coins.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Gang Upgrade Charges:</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">[Level D]: 2,000,000 Gold Coins</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">[Level C]: 3,500,000 Gold Coins</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">[Level B]: 5,000,000 Gold Coins</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">[Level A]: 7,000,000 Gold Coins</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sebagai Master party kamu harus sudah melewati level 30 untuk bisa membangun sebuah club dan mempunya minimal 5 orang member party, ditambah kamu harus mempunyai biaya sebesar 1,000,000.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">为了要创设组织, 至少需要由【5名无组织成员】来组成, 且申请创组织的人等级需要在【30级以上】, 以及支付【1,000,000】的创设费。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">【组织升级费用】</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">【D级】：2,000,000 Gold Coins</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">【C级】：3,500,000 Gold Coins</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">【B级】：5,000,000 Gold Coins</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">【A级】：7,000,000 Gold Coins</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">【S级】：10,000,000 Gold Coins</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_121_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_122_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Experience will be lost if you disband or terminate the Gang.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jangan coba-coba membangun club tanpa tahu apa-apa</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau club yang pernah dibangun lalu dibubarkan maka kamu akan kehilangan EXP, kamu bisa rugi kalau menganggap sepele hal ini.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">啊, 如果要将已创设的组织解散的话, 就会失掉经验值, 想得太简单的话会有所损失的</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_122_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_123_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">If you quit a Gang or kicked out of one, then you temporarily won't be allowed to join another Gang. Please remember this.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Terus ingat juga kalau kamu dikeluarkan dari club atau keluar atas kemauan sendiri, kamu tidak akan bisa mendaftar ke club lain untuk sementara waktu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">脱离已加入的组织或是被除名的话, 暂时会无法加入其它组织, 要记住这点</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_123_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_124_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">지역마다의 유동 금액을 관리하기 위해서는 전산실을 관리해 줘야만 하지.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">프로그램을 지니고 인증을 받은 관리자에게만 그 권한이 주어지는데...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">지금 같은 상황에서는 상당히 심한 경쟁이 있을 것 같군.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">어때 프로그램을 받아 가겠나?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">지역마다의 유동 금액을 관리하기 위해서는 전산실을 관리해 줘야만 하지.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">프로그램을 지니고 인증을 받은 관리자에게만 그 권한이 주어지는데...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">지금 같은 상황에서는 상당히 심한 경쟁이 있을 것 같군.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">어때 프로그램을 받아 가겠나?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">지역마다의 유동 금액을 관리하기 위해서는 전산실을 관리해 줘야만 하지.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">프로그램을 지니고 인증을 받은 관리자에게만 그 권한이 주어지는데...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">지금 같은 상황에서는 상당히 심한 경쟁이 있을 것 같군.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">어때 프로그램을 받아 가겠나?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_124_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">인증용 CD를 받는다</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">인증용 CD를 받는다</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">인증용 CD를 받는다</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_124_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_125_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">No wonder I don't see you nowadays. You went to that place!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Akhir-akhir ini tidak kelihatan.... ternyata sudah berkeliaran sampai sana toh?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Haha…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau dipikir-pikir kamu hebat juga yah</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bisa pergi kesana pake kekuatan kamu sendiri?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Walaupun bukan apa-apa, kamu pelajar yang cukup berguna juga</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">一阵子没看到你原来跑去那种地方啊。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">真是…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这么说来你也挺厉害的。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">你一个人去了那个地方是吗?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">虽然不算什么，但是还是值得称赞。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_125_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_126_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I already know the situation there.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Please send this document to the Trading Hole Police Station.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ya udah, aku sudah mengerti situasi disana</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Aku pikir kota itu hilang secara keseluruhan habis tidak ada berita sedikitpun,</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">kalau segitu sieh masih untung</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sampaikan dokumen ini kepada polisi yang ada di Trading Hole</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Dia bisa membantu untuk men</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">那边的情形我大致知道了。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">因为一直没有消息，我还以为整个城市消失不见了，这样的结果还算好的。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">把这文件交给Trading Hole的警察局Police Station。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">会对掌握状况有所帮助。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">还有我苦口婆心的给你忠告</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_126_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_127_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Middle Hole and Root Hole have serious problems. You need to cool off and go further.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jangan pikir situasi kedepannya juga akan sama hanya karena kamu bisa selamat sampai disini</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau di Midtown saja sudah seperti itu bagaimana dengan Root Hole</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ruang atau waktu, diantara dua hal ini pasti ada salah satunya yang menjadi aneh</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Perg</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">Middle Hole和Root Hole的情况很严重。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">空间…时间…其中一个​​一定出现了异常。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">你要冷静的前进。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">冷静的……..</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_127_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_129_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Lee Shi Zhang, the Director of the Financial Group, is one of the most sought after Feng Shui masters.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">He became able to foresee the future after that meteor shower 18 years ago...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Director Lee yang membangun yayasan ini cukup terkenal di dunia pendidikan sebagai ilmuwan fheng sui dan geografi.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">18 tahun yang lalu sewaktu beliau melakukan penyelidikan tentang peristiwa hujan meteor, beliau menemukan sesuatu.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Terus katanya dia</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">创立财团的李董事长是一位很有名的风水地理学家。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">18年前调查流星雨事件的时候发现了某个东西。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">从此之后就可以预测未来发生的事情…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">可能那就是现在的异变。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_129_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_13_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Now isn't a good time for students to be ignorant about the registration process. We didn't need such repetitive routines in the past, but now...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya akan menyimpan form ini. Terima kasih</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">学生的时机不好.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">以前的话, 是不需要像这些反覆的作业的</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_13_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_130_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Teachers only know academics and administration. They don't know anything else.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Still, I never expected the Financial Group Area to be the worst.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sebagai guru yang hanya bertugas untuk mengatur sekolah, saya tidak tahu bagaimana saya bisa sampai kepada keputusan untuk membangun sekolah tapi perkiraan saya mengatakan bahwa kemungkinan terburuk bisa dicegah dengan cara seperti ini….</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bukannya begit</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">老师只是担任管理学院的任务而已，是无法得知要如何创立学院的结论。但是大家都以为做好准备就可以防止最坏的事态。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">难道不是如此吗…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">结果没想到最严重的竟然是财团的本部周围…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">果然我不该相信那些小鬼头</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_130_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_131_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Our universe exists side by side with parallel universes in other dimensions. There are theories that our world is merging with those other universes, and we'll eventually coexist with the inhabitants of those other worlds. We won't be able to physically see this once the worlds merge, even if a being from another world is right beside us. Now, if these theories are true, then wouldn't it be possible to travel to other dimensions? Hmm, but these theories still haven't been proven, though.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Dunia yan kita berdiri sekarang ini…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Di sekitarnya ada dunia-dunia yang terhubung pada ruang dan waktu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Karena kita tidak pernah melihat strukturnya secara langsung kita tidak bisa jelaskan bagaimana tapi…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">kalau lengah ada kemungkinan kalau kita</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我们现在生活的世界…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">周围有着无数的空间与时间颠倒的世界。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">但是人类的眼睛无法看到构造，所以也不知如何形容。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">但是有传说说在那里，一不小心可能会掉入连接的其他世界。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_131_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_132_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It's already been proven.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">If a single cell from another dimension manages to enter our universe and merge with an organism that is native to this world, then a completely new life form will be created. Those dangerous creatures that you see right now are a product of that process. Do you understand now?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tapi memangnya itu sudah dikonfirmasi yah?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Makhluk dari dunia lain datang ke dunia nyata tidak dengan wujud aslinya.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Apakah itu rohnya ataupun salah satu bagian tubuh mereka, bila hal tersebut datang ke dunia nyata,</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">maka nantinya mereka akan men</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">没想到已经证实了。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">不要以为这世界的生命体就这样回到现世界…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">只要有一个细胞流入现世界，然后与本来存在的融合在一起，就会成为另外一种的生命体。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">外面那些整天找东西破坏的家伙…也是经过那种方式形成的。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">明白了吗?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_132_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_133_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Root Hole?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The Financial Group's Building?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Yes, I met an old man there.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I heard they're twins. Do you know what he's talking about?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Root Hole?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bangunan Financial Group?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Yah, saya bertemu dengan Old Man di sana.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Dengar - dengar mereka saudara kembar. Kamu tahu apa yang mereka katakan?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">本洞?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">有财团本部那个大楼吗?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">啊，是那位老爷爷啊。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">之前我也有见过几次。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">好像是双胞胎吧…?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">一些财团高阶的人也不敢随便。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">不过不知道是什么样的人。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">所以呢，那位老爷爷说什么啊?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_133_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_134_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">En...en..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Haha....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The old man seems to like you very much.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">En...en..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Haha....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sepertinya Old Man sangat menyukaimu.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">嗯…嗯…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">哈哈。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">小子，不过那个老爷爷很欣赏你嘛。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">他可是不太会称赞别人的喔。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我大概懂了。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_134_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_135_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Go to the Trading Hole and talk to AngBeeLan. You might be able to learn more.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pergi ke Trading Hole dan bicara dengan AngBeeLan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">去 Trading Hole可以找到有一位叫AngBeeLan的阿姨。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">在那边可以学到些东西唷。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_135_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_136_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">This cannot be...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jangan - jangan…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这无法做为….</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_136_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Talk about Sacred Financial Group</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya mengenai Sacred Financial Group</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">谈谈Sacred Financial Group的事情</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_136_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Talk about Sacred Financial Group</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya mengenai Sacred Financial Group</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">谈谈Sacred Financial Group的事情</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_137_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">This looks like the student attendance list.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Maybe it's more like the student record list.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Anyway, there's nothing wrong with the list.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Why are you so curious about it?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ini seperti daftar para pelajar,</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tidak ada yang aneh dengan itu. Mengapa kamu sangat penasaran?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">可以说的学生们的考勤表…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">应该是更靠近学生记录部方面。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">就算任何一方没有什么特别异常，好奇​​什么？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_137_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about Background of Students</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang Pertukaran Pelajar</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问学生的背景</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_138_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">How did you enter this school?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I did the same thing you did. Don't waste your time on that list.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bagaimana kamu bisa masuk kampus ini?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Aku melakukan hal yang sama denganmu.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">学生是如何入学的?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">没什么差别，所以不要把精力浪费在不必要的地方</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_138_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Begin</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mulai</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">最初</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_14_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">There are still many students that haven't registered. Most of them don't even report to the school.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">We wouldn't have these problems if the school schedules for this academic year were more organized.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Masih ada pelajar yang belum terdaftar rupanya!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">ayaknya kamu sudah masuk sekolah sejak lama.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sayang sekali, kalau jadwal pelajar normal kamu pasti sudah bisa naik kelas</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">还有到现在为止还没作注册的学生啊!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">学生们来学校报到已经有一段时间了说...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">真可惜, 学校日志能照预定进行的话, 学年也可以往下走的啊</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_14_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_15_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I understand that it's tough to operate normally in all this chaos, but we can't completely ignore proper procedure.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Walaupun situasi tidak memungkinkan kita untuk mengerjakan tugas dengan normal, tidak boleh dong kalau sampai mengabaikan prosedur yang ada.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">虽然这情形下进行正常业务很难, 但像这样完全不管程序也是不行的</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_15_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_16_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">We should do our best to survive through all of this.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">We need to remain calm and collected until this immense problem is resolved.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kamu harus bertahan hidup sampai kamu bisa mengamankan situasi ini dan bisa melakukan hal yang lebih besar</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">一定要活着, 将现在发生的异象平息下来, 要一直撑到完成大事之后!</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_16_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The Student Director's Test</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ujian dari Student Director</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">结界认证</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_16_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Force Field Authentication</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Autentikasi Force Field</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">结界认证</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_16_0_6">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Force Field Authentication</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Autentikasi Force Field</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">结界认证</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_16_0_7">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Force Field Authentication</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Autentikasi Force Field</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">结界认证</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_16_0_8">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Force Field Authentication</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Autentikasi Force Field</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">结界认证</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_16_0_9">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_17_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You'll better understand that the world's balance has started to break down after you attend your classes.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The students react as if they don't even care after they learn this.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saat ini dunia yang kita tempati sedang kacau. Apakah kamu mengetahui alasannya ? Sepertinya kamu tidak mengetahuinya.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">听课的时候你们就会了解, 我们现在生活的世界, 他的平衡已经开始分裂...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">虽这样说, 但看学生的表情, 是那种好像完全不知道的表情</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_17_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_18_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Your Registration and Exit Approval is already completed. Why do you look ill at ease?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau dilihat dari dokumen yang ada, kamu sudah terdaftar dan sudah menyerahkan formulir pass….</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sebenarnya kenapa yah kok aku jadi tidak tenang?Kenpa yah?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">文件上明明就注册申请好了, 外出申请书也都好了...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">但是为什么还是那么不安呢? 嗯</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_18_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_19_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The Force Fields around the campus need to be activated in order to see their effect.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Untuk mendapatkan efek dari force field yang maksimal, sepertinya harus menggunakan peralatan khusus yang….</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">但是结界还是需要用一些特别的阵形或什么的, 才能真正看出它的效果, 要用像那种奇计</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_19_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Main Entrance</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Persiapan melintasi Main Gate</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">正门</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_19_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">....</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_20_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Please acquire the Broom from the Locker Custodian, and dispose of the Rubbish inside the Dormitory before you return it to him. Please don't mess around, okay?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Special broom harus dikembalikan kepada Locker custodian dan sebelumnya kamu harus sudah selesai membersihkan dormitory dan menyerahkan trash. Atau kalau tidak kamu harus menyerah untuk membersihkan dormitory.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jangan sampai bingung ya!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">扫帚Broom要还给Locker Custodian, 在那之前要先把宿舍清理完, 把垃圾处理掉, 不然就要放弃清扫Dormitory。千万别搞混啊！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_20_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_21_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The students are doing good in terms of their training. Please be prepared to go outside for your training.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kamu selama ini rajin latihan sendiri rupanya!?,</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sekarang lebih baik kamu siap-siap untuk beraktivitas di dalam Sekolah</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Namun~</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">学生们这一段时间来都认真的练习着吧...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">现在慢慢地要准备到外面去了.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">但是呢</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_21_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_22_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Really! These are two Cigarette Butts!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It's not that I don't trust the students. I just worry about them.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Oo, iya!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Benar itu 2 buah cigarette butt.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bukannya aku tidak percaya kamu, tapi aku khawatir.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">喔! 是吗!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">真的是两个烟蒂耶!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我说这啊... 不是我不信任学生, 是担心他们</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_22_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_23_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">So these are the notes from the Legend?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I've been expecting these for a long time.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ini currency yang sering terdengar di rumor itu rupanya!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mana…coba.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sesuai dengan perkiraan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">原来这就是传闻中的纸币!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">哪里... 果然...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">果然如预想中的一样."</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_23_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_24_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">My associates will contact you again in case they need some more notes in the future.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">We'll inform you of where we'll meet.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Let me remind you that we're not normal money isn't involved in this situation.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Emm!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kedepannya aku akan mengabari kapan Currency ini dibuang, saat itu kumpulkanlah Currency tersebut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Aku bilang sekali lagi, ini bukan potongan uang biasa</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">啊... 学生们. 以后若需要纸币时会再通知你们, 从那时要集合再看取得的地方.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我再说一次, 这绝对不是普通的钱</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_24_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Issue Order Books</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pendistribusian Orders books</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">颁发指令簿</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_24_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_25_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">At last! The Order Books and information from the Financial Group Headquarters have arrived.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The Guard outside the Main entrance is holding them now. Please help me get the documents from the Guard. Return here once you get them.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kebetulan ada kabar yang mengatakan bahwa Order book yang diterbitkan oleh yayasan pusat sudah sampai.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sekarang disimpan oleh Security guard yang ada di luar Main Gate kamu bawakan kesini yah</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">最后从财团本部那里送来的命令书以及消息到了.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">现在由正门外面的守卫保管着, 学生们去把它拿来</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_25_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_26_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Our campus also needs backup disks. If you want to recover the emergency facilities, there's no other way but to make a move and acquire these disks.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Aduh, Sekolah kita juga membutuhkan Kembaliup disk</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ya sudah lah, tolong sampaikan kalau hal yang mendesak sudah diperbaiki kembalikan Kembaliup disk secepatnya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这个呢... 我们学院也需要备用磁片.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">没办法吧? 要恢复紧急的设施的话, 就要马上绕一圈."</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_26_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_27_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">So these are the notes from the Legend?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I've been expecting these for a long time.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ini currency yang sering terdengar di rumor itu rupanya!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mana…coba.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sesuai dengan perkiraan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">原来这就是传闻中的纸币啰</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">哪里... 果然...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">果然跟预想中的一样</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_27_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_28_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Alright, thanks! With these, I can now use the facilities around here that I need. Hold on for a bit, this won't take long!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Just bring the documents over.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Oh, oke. Makasih ya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Dengan ini kita bisa buat item yang dibutuhkan,</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">tunggu sebentar, tidak lama kok</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">.....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Emm… Ura Darmai… ternyata kamu Lagia</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">… oke, segini saja sudah!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">.....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Nah, sekarang kamu bisa membawa Letter of Opinion ini</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">喔, 好, 辛苦了.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">用这个就可以使用必要的设备了.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">...等一下, 不会等很久的。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">那么, 把这意见书拿过去就可以了。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_28_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_29_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Do you want some instructions? Let me see? It's been awhile. I don't know if it's still good.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mau menyesuaikan map?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Coba lihat…euhm kalau ini sieh pekerjaan aku dulu tidak tahu sekarang bisa atau tidak nieh</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">要配合指导吗?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">让我瞧瞧... 那是年轻时的事, 不知道现在这样, 实力的发挥有没有退步</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_29_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">This place was built to gather outstanding students and educate them so that would grow to become strong individuals. If new students still haven't reached a commendable level by now, then that implies a lack of self discipline on their part.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tapi ini adalah tempat di mana orang-orang yang berbakat terpilih dan mendapatkan pendidikkan khusus.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Aku melihat para pelajar baru yang sekarang level rendah..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tidak ada tanda-tanda kemajuan dari orang-orang itu~</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">集中各地选出的人才, 随着特别教育过程的不同, 可说是作育英才的地方~</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">依我看来, 这次入学的新生并没有达到一定的水准.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">反正就是一群闻不到一点发展气味的兔崽子们</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_30_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Please clean the Dormitory and gather all the garbage. We just happened to prepare the broom. Go and collect the garbage when you have the time.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kebetulan aku mau menyuruh kamu membersihkan dormitory dan mengumpulkan sampah…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tampaknya kamu sudah siap bersih-bersih dengan membawa Broom itu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bagus, masih ada waktu, pergi dan kumpulkanlah</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">要不然是要他们清扫宿舍后把垃圾集中...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">嗯, 刚好准备了扫帚的样子.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">很好, 有时间的时候, 去把垃圾收集一下</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_30_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_31_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Wow! You collected a lot! This should be enough for now. Thank you very much.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Please come back again to help if you have the time to spare.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Banyak juga yang terkumpul</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Aku pikir jumlah ini sangat cukup</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Semakin banyak yang dikumpulkan semakin baik, jika kamu punya waktu luang, bawa dan konfirmasikan itu kepada guru, aku akan sangat berterima kasih padamu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">集中了好多喔...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">先这样就够了。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">啊, 垃圾有很多不错阿, 学生们一有时间就过来, 只要向老师申请, 能帮忙把垃圾带走的话会很感谢的</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_31_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_32_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Brooms will help students sift through garbage to find possible clues that may help in the investigation.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pokoknya kamu butuh Special Broom untuk membersihkan dormitory dan memilih trash yang bisa digunakan untuk bahan penyelidikan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">总之, 为了让学生在清扫宿舍的垃圾时, 能够选别出有助于调查的垃圾, 所以才需要经过特别处理的扫帚…</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_32_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Prepare Broom</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Persiapan Special broom</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">准备扫帚</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_32_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_33_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The Broom can be acquired from the Locker Room. Take it, and then I'll explain what to do next.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Locker Custodian pasti punya special broom, kamu bawa dulu special broom darinya nanti kita bicara lagi</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">特别的扫帚保管在保管箱那,学生们先去把扫帚拿来,再来讲接下来的事</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_33_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_34_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">This money doesn't look counterfeit at all. These notes were forged pretty intricately. It's obviously that these were made for some purpose.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Karena sekarang kita sudah tahu bahwa currency itu bukan currency palsu semiteman</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">jadi kalau kamu lihat langsung dipungut dan dikumpulkan.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pasti ada alasan dibalik penyebaran currency palsu yang dibuat sangat mirip itu.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pasti ada suatu tujuan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">那纸币不是像单纯的伪造纸币, 你们要分清楚看清楚将它们收集起来...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">像这些制作精美的纸币, 没有理由胡乱制造它们.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">分明有什么目的</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_34_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_35_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Hm? The numbers on this money are flawless.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Let's see what we can do with these low quality notes.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Em, untuk jumlahnya segini cukuplah…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau kita coba, kita pasti bisa tahu apa yang bisa dilakukan oleh jimat-jimat ini</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">嗯, 数字的话像这种程度就可以了...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这些本质不好的不适合的东西到底可以做什么, 我们先试试看就知道了</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_35_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_36_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Please don't forget to report any important discoveries you might find on the 3rd Floor to me.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jika ada sesuatu yang terjadi di lantai 3, jangan lupa untuk memberi tahukannya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">如果在3楼发现到什么也不要忘记报告</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_36_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">ID Card Confirmation</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Konfirmasi ID Card</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">ID Card的确认</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_36_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_37_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">What's in this cassette?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Could this contain the records of Leonair Campus?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Did you check the contents?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Have you made a request to the Specialist from the Financial Group?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tape ini?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jangan bilang kalau ini tape yang berisi catatan tentang Leonine School.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kamu belum lihat isinya, kan?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Filed Agent dari yayasan minta bantuan kamu?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sini berikan tape itu pada aku</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这个带子是...?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">难不成装载着Leonair学院的记录...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">学生们, 你们没看内容吧?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">已经拜托了财团的专员了?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">好吧... 把那带子也拿到这边来.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这样的话...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">那么, 把这带子拿过去给他</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_37_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_38_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Students, may I have your attention?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Everything has been predetermined from the very beginning.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Everything depends on the existence that controls them.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">This process is inescapable.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">There shouldn't be any more doubts about life, right?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">There are the things that can be understood, and things that should never be known. You must learn to distinguish between the two.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Dengarkan baik-baik ya…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Misalkan dunia ini sudah ditentukan awal dan akhirnya,</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">semua yang ada bisa dikendalikan oleh sesuatu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">dan juga masa lalu dan masa depan semua berjalan semestinya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Maka tidak ada keraguan untuk tetap hidup?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kita harus m</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">学生, 这世上啊...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">万一像刚开始一样已经一切都注定了.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">所有万物都依附着某种存在而被操纵着.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">而随着过去或未来的时间, 没有办法逃离这样的过程的话...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">那就没有任何对于活着的疑惑了​​吧?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">有些事是可以知道, 有些事是不能知道的, 你们一定要分清楚.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_38_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_39_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You have to verify this first. It shouldn't be a problem. This means you can't predict what will happen next.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sampai-sampai seperti ini?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau dulu mungkin tidak akan menjadi masalah apapun tapi sekarang...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sangat sulit untuk memprediksi apa yang akan terjadi kedepannya...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">要连这个也作确认之后...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">以前的话可能没有什么问题, 但是现在的话就有点...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">该怎么说呢, 就是说会发生什么事情也无法预料的意思</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_39_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You wouldn't need to ask this question is you had been listening during class.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The surrounding chaos outside prevents students from maintaining a stable state of mind.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau kamu mendengarkan pelajaran dengan baik kamu tidak perlu lagi tanya kepada aku…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau sekarang semua komponen yang ada di sekitar kita sangat kacau dan makhluk biasa tidak bisa menjaga pikiran dan badan mereka</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">如果你有好好听课的话, 甚至连问我的必要都没有...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">但是因为现在周边的构成要素都变的混乱, 平凡的生命体并没有办法维持原来的样子或精神状态.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_40_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Yeah! This matter will demand much in terms of your time.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sudahlah, itukan bukan hal yang harus dipikirkan dari sekarang</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">对啊, 这又不是什么需要很多时间的事</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_40_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_41_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I am sure that there will be people that will be forced to play a role in starting chaos.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">If that is your destiny, whether you like it or not, you'll have to do it.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ada saja anak yang membangkang di urusan yang tidak penting.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Walaupun tidak suka ini pekerjaan yang harus dilakukan suatu hari nanti</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">一定会有几名那种对一些没用的小事乱反抗的兔崽子...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这是不论你讨厌还是耍固执都需要做的事</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_41_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_42_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">In these troubled times, a Gang should display solidarity and do its best to serve its purpose.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Untuk melekatkan hubungan antara pelajar, yayasan memberikan ijin untuk mendirikan club. Karena itu dirikanlah club dan selalu berusaha keras untuk beraktivitas di club tersebut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">在学院里面组织要能发挥功用, 而且在现在的情况下, 要提升团结力, 不论是创设组织或是加入, 都要尽最大的力积极地去做!</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_42_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Establish Gang Organization</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Membentuk Club</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">创建帮派组织</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_42_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Increase the Gang's Status</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Meningkatkan ranking Club</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">提升帮派组织的地位</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_42_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_43_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">...</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_44_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">This situation was predicted a long time ago.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Sadly, it happened earlier than expected.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">We must act swiftly to find all the details so that we can solve this as soon as possible.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Seperti yang pernah diprediksikan dahulu, namun ini lebih cepat dari perkiraan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jadi sebaiknya cari tahu apa penyebabnya secepatnya…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这是从很久以前就预知的事情了, 但是比预想的时间来的快多了.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">因为这个原因, 所以要赶快找出事情的原委,尽快将它解决</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_44_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_45_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">......</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">......</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">......</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_46_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">There was a big fight among the students not very long ago. Since then, these strange events started to happen. Maybe we can figure something out by learning what happened in that fight. There have also been malicious rumors of some students joining Green's side.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Who could have spread these rumors?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Could it be that group from Sacred Gate Park?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Katanya kejadian itu timbul sejak para pelajar kita berkelahi di daerah itu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mungkin saja kamu bisa menemukan sebuah jejak di daerah sana</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">不久之前我们的学生在大本营大闹了一架之后, 从此就开始发生一些异象了...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">说不定, 也许可以从这里理出一些头绪.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">有谣言说在这群学院生中有一部分转向名叫""Green青""的势力范围里去.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">到底是谁在到处放这种话?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">该不会是Sacred Gate Park那群不像样的家伙吧?"</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_46_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_47_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">.........</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">.........</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">.........</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_48_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Perhaps solving the mystery in Leonair Campus will improve the situation. It's especially troublesome that the teachers and students there have become our enemies, though. We need to be ready in case this situation gets worse.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Katanya kalau masalah yang menimpa Leonine School bisa diselesaikan dan situasi ini bisa membaik</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">也许只要解决最近Leonair学院的问题, 搞不好就能使事态镇静下来也说不定...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">但那地方的学生和教师们变成了敌人, 当然​​是不容易解决.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">不知该怎么说, 也不知会不会变成最糟的情况, 事先有点觉悟比较好</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_48_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_49_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">그곳의 학생과 교사들이 적으로 변해버렸다면 말처럼 쉽지 않겠지</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">그곳의 학생과 교사들이 적으로 변해버렸다면 말처럼 쉽지 않겠지</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">그곳의 학생과 교사들이 적으로 변해버렸다면 말처럼 쉽지 않겠지</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_49_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Green? It sounds decent enough. Since the college was established, the area nearby became gangster territory run by criminal organizations.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mereka adalah orang yang tidak sesuci namanya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mereka gerombolan preman di daerah ini sejak sebelum sekolah dibangun, mungkin sekarang udah jadi kelompok gangster deh</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">青... 青...并不像是名字一般那么干干净净的人.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">从我们学院设立前开始, 这附近就是一些流氓们走出来的地盘, 现在就成为黑社会的团体了</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_50_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">어쩌면 최악의 사태가 될지도 모르니 각오를 해 두는게 좋을거야.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">어쩌면 최악의 사태가 될지도 모르니 각오를 해 두는게 좋을거야.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">어쩌면 최악의 사태가 될지도 모르니 각오를 해 두는게 좋을거야.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_50_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_51_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">......</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">......</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">......</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_52_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Something like this has never happened before.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The procedures are getting more complicated</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">since the Computer Room isn't functioning</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">properly.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">If this isn't fixed soon, the students will be in</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">danger. Whoops! I s-said too much!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Karena kejadian yang tak terduga bukan hanya kita kekurangan pekerja tapi kondisi di sistem database juga aneh</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">即使不是这样, 爆发了以前没有过的事, 程序也比较复杂, 我是说一直到电算室都变得很怪...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">像这样的程序都不做的话, 学生也有可能变得危险... 哎呀, 我好像说太多了</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_52_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_53_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I'll help you process the application forms.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Take the original copy, and then go to the Society Room to submit your Exit Approval to the teacher.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Bring it here after you've got it filled out.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Para pelajar bisa saja berbahaya kalau kita tidak melakukan sesuatu…Eh, maaf aku terlalu banyak ngomong</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sini, aku bantu mengurus application form, kalau dokumen aslinya kamu bawa saja. Kalau kamu pergi menemui club inctructor dia akan memberikan pass a</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">那么, 我会帮你们处理注册申请书, 把原本带走, 去到社团室的话, 给老师们外出申请书...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">把那写一写带过去</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_53_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_54_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I'm not questioning the capabilities of the students. It just means they aren't human anymore.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I have no idea what's wrong. Too many students are coming to the First-Aid Room, and I can't figure out a perfect solution to this problem. Please try to understand.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Gunakanlah itu dan bawalah kemari</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bukannya aku meragukan kemampuan kalian, tapi orang-orang yang berkeliaran di depan sana sudah bukan manusia lagi.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">虽说不是对学生的实力有所怀疑, 但是那些外面的家伙们已经不是人类了.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">最近不知怎么搞的, 莽撞的跑向医护室的笨蛋们越来越多, 没有办法只好想一些替代的方法. 这你们知道就好!</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_54_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_55_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">최근엔 멋모르고 뛰쳐나갔다가 양호실로 직행하는 얼간이들이 많아져서 어쩔 수 없이 제한을 좀 하고 있는거니까 그리 알도록!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">최근엔 멋모르고 뛰쳐나갔다가 양호실로 직행하는 얼간이들이 많아져서 어쩔 수 없이 제한을 좀 하고 있는거니까 그리 알도록!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">최근엔 멋모르고 뛰쳐나갔다가 양호실로 직행하는 얼간이들이 많아져서 어쩔 수 없이 제한을 좀 하고 있는거니까 그리 알도록!</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_55_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_56_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">......</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">......</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">......</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_57_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Something like this has never happened before.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The people on campus are getting restless.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">If you don't want to get injured,</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">then I suggest that you concentrate</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">on your studies and training.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lagipula sekarang bukan hanya sekolah kita, tapi jadwal kegiatan di tempat lain juga memang sedang dihentikan karena kecelakaan yang secara tiba-tiba. Jangan berpikir ini adalah kerugian untuk kamu dan teruslah berlatih sendiri</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">反正现在发生了以前没有过的事, 不只是我们学院生, 全都处在日期静止的状态, 不要想损害, 就专心的自习吧</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_57_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_58_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">If this problem is not solved quickly, the college will be powerless to do anything. Whoops! I s-said too much!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Anyway, following the Registration Procedures is a bit difficult.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau kejadian ini tidak diselesaikan bukan hanya sekolah kita saja tapi seluruh dunia bisa….astaga kebanyakan ngomong nieh</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这件事不赶快收拾的话, 不只是学院的问题, 可能整个世界都会消失... 哎呀! 我说太多了.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">反正这个注册申请书... 瞧瞧.并没有照正常程序来进行嘛.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这样就有点困难</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_58_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_59_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">하여튼 이 등록신청서는... 보자...정상적인 절차를 거쳐 오지 않았군</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">좀 곤란하겠는데</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">하여튼 이 등록신청서는... 보자...정상적인 절차를 거쳐 오지 않았군</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">좀 곤란하겠는데</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">하여튼 이 등록신청서는... 보자...정상적인 절차를 거쳐 오지 않았군</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">좀 곤란하겠는데</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_59_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The four colleges were set up Force Fields. The strange phenomenon on Leonair Campus spread to the Sacred Gate, Mystic Peak, and Phoenix campuses.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">4 kampus yaitu Sacred Gate School, Mystic Peak School, Phoenix School dan Leonine School terdapat force field sistem setelah dibangun.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Diantara keempatnya terjadi sesuatu yang aneh pada Leonine sekolah, dan kamu mungkin tahu kalau kecelakaan terjadi l</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">Sacred Gate、Mystic Peak、Phoenix、还有Leonair 这4个学院, 因结界形成而设立。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">其中, Leonair Campus变得越来越奇怪，异象发生的速度比以前快了许多。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_60_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">.......</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">.......</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">.......</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_61_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I'll help you fill out the application form. Go to the Welfare Society and get another copy. The Welfare Society prepares the application forms.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sudahlah, Aku bantu tulis lagi aplikasi yang ini, kamu pergi temui Grocerry Merchant saja terus terimalah Pass Application</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">不过也没有办法, 这申请书我来帮你写吧, 去Welfare Society那边再拿一份写好来...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">那申请书商店那边也应该有准备好的吧</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_61_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_62_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Please follow the procedures for processing the application form.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">These are the rules, not just meaningless writing on paper. Do you understand?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mungkin Application itu juga sudah disiapkan di Shop</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tapi kalau kedepannya kamu harus melewati proses yang benar yah</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">即使如此,下次一定要确实地照着申请书的程序来作.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这是规则, 就要去遵守, 订规则时不是纸几张写写就好, 听懂了吗?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_62_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_63_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">규칙이란 건 지키라고 있는 거지 책 만드는 데에 페이지 채워주려고 만든 게 아니란 말이다 알아들었나?!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">규칙이란 건 지키라고 있는 거지 책 만드는 데에 페이지 채워주려고 만든 게 아니란 말이다 알아들었나?!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">규칙이란 건 지키라고 있는 거지 책 만드는 데에 페이지 채워주려고 만든 게 아니란 말이다 알아들었나?!</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_63_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_64_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">........</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">........</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">........</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_65_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Eh? The Exit Approval ends here.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I've already said this many times. It's up to you whether you want to hear it again.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Euhm formulir pass selesai.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mungkin kamu sudah sering mendengar hal ini, aku bilang sekali lagi terserah kalau kamu mau bilang aku tukang ngomel atau apa</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">嗯, 外出申请到这里为止.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">到现在为止已经讲很多遍了, 我要再讲一句.你们要当作是啰唆不听的话随你们便</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_65_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_66_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I've already told you about the different locations on the map. I'm not repeating myself.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I've already told you about how to fight monsters. I'm not repeating myself.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Aku nggak akan menyebut lagi tentang dunia lain yang sering kita bahas saat jam pelajaran</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">对于学生们在课堂上学到关于其他世界的事我不再提.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">对于怎么对付那在外面游走似人非人的怪物我也不再提</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_66_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_67_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I won't repeat myself to the other students either.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Now, what would it be?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Aku juga tidak akan bilang apa yang harus kamu lakukan kepada orang-orang yang mirip dengan manusia yang melakukan kekacauan di luar sana.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sama saja dengan hal seperti kamu harus melakukan ini demi pelajar yang lain</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">还有对于为了其他学生该怎么做的事我也不再讲.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">那么是什么呢?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_67_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_68_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">All I ask is for you students to be careful and not to die.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">That's all I can tell you.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Terus apa?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jangan sampai kamu mati!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ini adalah satu-satunya yang bisa aku katakan pada kamu sebagai seorang guru</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">是叫你们不要死.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我以一个老师的身分可以跟学生讲的就是这个而已</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_68_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_69_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">......</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">......</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">......</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">What?! You still don't know the location of the Health Room? You can go straight across the Administration Office, and you'll probably see a room with the "Health Room" sign.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ada bom yang meledak dan penyebabnya tidak diketahui di Health Room</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">啧啧, 到现在还不知道Health Room在哪里啊...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">从Administration Office出去直走的话，会看到有间写着[Health Room]的地方，找一下！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_7_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_70_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Our world is changing. Some students have started to develop special and uncanny aptitudes and capabilities.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Most of them don't even understand how to use their ability effectively. It's hard to stay safe right now.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Siapa gurumu ? Dunia ini membutuhkan orang orang yang bisa menjaga kesadaran dirinya sendiri.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这, 到底是谁告诉过了呢...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">反正现在这世界维持着本来的精神和形态, 就像这些学生一样带有特别的要素.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">但是学生们到现在还是没办法彻底的活用那些要素, 真的没有无法得知到何时才能安全</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_70_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
