  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_75_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Just by looking at them, I can tell some of the people in front of Headquarters are fools.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Nonetheless, I'm not worried by them because the exams that must be taken by all students will weed them out.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Just by looking at them, I can tell some of the people in front of Headquarters are fools.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Nonetheless, I'm not worried by them because the exams that must be taken by all students will weed them out.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我虽一看就知道, 但是因为在本馆前面就是有一些糊里糊涂的家伙.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">不管怎么说还是要给学生考考试, 我的心里才会感觉比较舒服</VALUE>
