    <VALUE Lang="cn">.......</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_82_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I've already told this to you many times. The situation outside is beyond my comprehension. I never would have imagined anything like this.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Some students who reached the Main Gate and attempted to pass through it were rushed to the First-Aid Room. Why weren't they able to go through?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kan sudah aku bilang berkali-kali dari sejak pendaftaran, dengan bayangan Trading Hole seperti biasa kamu tidak bisa pergi keluar sana</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">刚开始注册时就已经讲过很多次了, 现在外面并非一般市内的面貌, 是你们无法想像的状况.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">有些才到门口就受伤回到医护室了, 要怎样做才可以站出正门?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_82_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_83_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">There is a test you must take before you can pass through the Main Gates.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Once the test procedure at the Terminal located near the Main Gate begins, you are required to finish the test within a specific amount of time.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Banyak banget anak-anak yang ceroboh dan dibawa ke Nurse Trainee setelah babak belur di Main Gate. Kalau misalkan kita beri ijin kepada semua orang untuk keluar Main Gate kira-kira apa yang terjadi?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">所以准备了简单的能力试验程式.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">正门的终端机将它启动的话, 就开始提出问题, 要在限制的时间内通过</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_83_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_84_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">그래서 간단한 능력 시험 프로그램을 준비했지</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">정문의 단말기를 작동시키면 문제를 제시할테니, 제한시간 내에 통과할 수 있도록 해</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">그래서 간단한 능력 시험 프로그램을 준비했지</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">정문의 단말기를 작동시키면 문제를 제시할테니, 제한시간 내에 통과할 수 있도록 해</VALUE>
