  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_86_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">We can't just ignore this, not matter how bad it seems. Do you feel uneasy about this? Imagine how the other students would feel if they also found out.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You've got to be tough!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Walaupun udah kami peringatkan berkali-kali tetap saja ada orang yang bertindak tanpa pikir panjang dan akhirnya harus diobati. Jadi kita pikir mungkin saja ujian seperti ini tidaklah cukup</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pokoknya hati-hati dan jangan sampai lengah!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">不管再怎么菜, 也不能这样鬼混, 这就像是去保持已凋谢的花的美丽是没用的. 像这种程度的考试, 就这么不安...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">学生们怎么会知道...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">反正给我好好振作!</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_86_0_1">
