    <VALUE Lang="GS">.......</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">.......</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">.......</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_91_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Hm? So the people at Mystic Peak share my opinion?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">This is an experimental product of Counterfeited Anxiety Money.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It looks the same as normal notes, but it's kind of weird.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Just take a look at the copper coins.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Hm? Jadi orang - orang di Mystic Peak mempublikasikan pendapat saya?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Terlihat seperti note biasa tapi sedikit aneh.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Coba lihat copper coin ini.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">是伪造安神特货币的实验品...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">真的很像是那个, 有点奇怪, 一定要看一下铜板吗?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_91_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_92_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">.........</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">.........</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">.........</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_93_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ah, no! It's not necessary to read it all right now. Just submit those documents to the Lecturer. Please go and find the mail sent by the Sacred Financial Group.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Coba kamu pergi dan cari saja surat yang nama pengirimnya adalah kantor pusat yayasan saint</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">啊, 不是...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">现在已经没有必要看内容了, 就把东西分别交给教授们就好.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">去把圣财团本部发出的邮件找出来</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_93_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_94_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">가서 세인트 재단 본부가 발송자로 돼 있는 우편물을 찾아 가면 돼</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">가서 세인트 재단 본부가 발송자로 돼 있는 우편물을 찾아 가면 돼</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">가서 세인트 재단 본부가 발송자로 돼 있는 우편물을 찾아 가면 돼</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_94_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_95_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">......</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">......</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">......</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_96_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Students, may I have your attention?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Since the computers in our college are unable to operate properly, it'll be difficult to get authentication just by showing documents.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The documents should match the data in the system.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tapi gini lho</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sekarang sedikit susah untuk memberikan verifikasi pada Letter of Opinion karena sistem komputer di sekolah sedang tidak berfungsi dengan normal</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我说学生们啊...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">现在我们学院的电脑室没有办法自动运行, 只有给意见书就要求认证实在有点困难?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">至少要经过资料的比对之后, 才能够看出程度</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_96_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_97_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Let's just skip the documentation of the emergency procedures, and I'll inform you of any developments. In the meantime, I want you to go to Mystic Peak's Student Director and procure the Computer room Backup disk.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It's urgent that we get it so that we can recover our information from the primary facilities.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Setidaknya kita harus membandingkan data yang ada.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tapi kalau keadaan darurat seperti ini kita harus siaga penuh</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">真要这样看程度的话, 连紧急处理方案也要写吗?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我会再联络你们, 去找Mystic Peak学院的Student Director, 拿恢复电脑室的备用磁片来...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">因为很急, 就回复一些必要的设施就好, 然后把资料找一找</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_97_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_t_master1.ntk_98_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">연락은 해 놓을테니까 현암학원의 학생주임님께 가서 전산실 복구용 백업디스크를 좀 받아오도록 해</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">급한대로 필요한 시설만 복구해서 자료를 찾아보도록 하지</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">연락은 해 놓을테니까 현암학원의 학생주임님께 가서 전산실 복구용 백업디스크를 좀 받아오도록 해</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">급한대로 필요한 시설만 복구해서 자료를 찾아보도록 하지</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">연락은 해 놓을테니까 현암학원의 학생주임님께 가서 전산실 복구용 백업디스크를 좀 받아오도록 해</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">급한대로 필요한 시설만 복구해서 자료를 찾아보도록 하지</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
