  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_trick.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I know your situation very well, but I cannot take any more risks. I'm sorry, but take this as a consolation.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya sangat memahami situasimu, tapi saya tidak tidak mengambil risiko lebih besar lagi. Maaf, silahkan ambil ini sebagai penghiburan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我知道你的情况很好, 但是我不能冒任何的风险了, 把这当成是一种安慰吧</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_trick.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Take the bus and go to Mystic Peak Lake Shop. Then, eliminate the Stray Dogs.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Naik bis dan pergilah ke Mystic Peak Lake Shop. Kemudian, singkirkan Stray Dog</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">坐车去Mystic peak Lake Shop, 消灭Stray Dogs.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_trick.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Go to the MarketPlace. The Assassin Student has the detailed information.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pergi ke MarketPlace. Assassin Student memiliki informasi yang mendalam</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">去MarketPlace,  Assassin Student有详细情报</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_trick.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You have to be careful! He is not an easy target.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kamu harus berhati-hati! Dia bukanlah target yang mudah</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">你必须小心! 他不是一个那么简单的敌人.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
