  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_10_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">어머~</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">아직도 등록이 제대로 안되셨나 봐요?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">여기, '외출신청서' 를 '교무실' 의 '학생주임' 께 제출하시면 등록이 마무리 될 수 있을거예요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">어머~</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">아직도 등록이 제대로 안되셨나 봐요?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">여기, '외출신청서' 를 '교무실' 의 '학생주임' 께 제출하시면 등록이 마무리 될 수 있을거예요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">어머~</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">아직도 등록이 제대로 안되셨나 봐요?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">여기, '외출신청서' 를 '교무실' 의 '학생주임' 께 제출하시면 등록이 마무리 될 수 있을거예요</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_10_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_11_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">등록이 늦으셨네요?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">예전에는 이런 용지는 그냥 형식상으로만 진열해 놓고 있을줄만 알았는데, 정말로 쓰게 줄은 몰랐어요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">등록이 늦으셨네요?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">예전에는 이런 용지는 그냥 형식상으로만 진열해 놓고 있을줄만 알았는데, 정말로 쓰게 줄은 몰랐어요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">등록이 늦으셨네요?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">예전에는 이런 용지는 그냥 형식상으로만 진열해 놓고 있을줄만 알았는데, 정말로 쓰게 줄은 몰랐어요</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_11_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_12_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It is not enough to just fill up the registration application form and bring it over right?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau Student Registration Form dibawa begitu saja tidak boleh, kan?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">只有把注册申请书填好带去是不够的。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_12_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_13_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">What, still on registration? Normally we go one by one, but this situation is different. So ... Perhaps coming directly would be better.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ooo, sedang mendaftar yah?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mohon maaf yah, menyuruh kamu datang langsung seperti ini…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau biasanya sieh... ada orang yang bertugas untuk membagikannya sekaligus, tapi sekarang tidak bisa seperti itu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tapi kalau diambil secara langsung seperti i</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">什么？您还在注册吗？通常我们都是一个一个按序进行的。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">但现在情况有点特殊，所以………也许直接来会比较好唷。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_13_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_14_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">이변이 일어나기 시작한 이후로는 함부로 바깥에 나가질 못해요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">이변이 일어나기 시작한 이후로는 함부로 바깥에 나가질 못해요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">이변이 일어나기 시작한 이후로는 함부로 바깥에 나가질 못해요</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_14_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_15_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Is this the papers for the medical reports? These are sample of documents for medical reports. In any case, the Health Room is the only department that uses these. So, it cannot be wrong. What! The Health Room is very busy too? This is why everybody was asked to help the others.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Medical? Aaa... maksusnya medical record untuk pengobatan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lagipula yang dipakai di Health Room cuman ini, jadi pasti benar</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Healt room juga sibuk, yah? Tumben menyuruh orang lain untuk datang ke sini</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这些是病历表用纸啊？这些是样式，没错的！通常Health Room 是使用这些东西的唯一部门。所以，它不可能是错的。什么！Health Room 非常忙吗？这就是为什么每个人都被要求去跑腿做事了。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_15_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_16_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">.....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">.....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">.....</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_17_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">There are also items called Blessed Items. They are more special and quite hard to find. If you obtain these kind of items, could you please keep them properly?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Diantara rare item itu ada uniqe item, yang dibuat secara khusus, mungkin akan sulit untuk ditemukan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau kamu menemukannya, maukah kamu menyimpannya?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">其中也有叫做受祝福的道具的，是较特别且做得很好的，应该是比较难找。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">如果您获得这种东西的话，可以好好保管它们吗？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_17_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_18_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">And... I have some items which I have never seen before, but they are really precious items. Look at the information records of our department, and you should be able to enquire and obtain it.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Dan…Saya juga kurang tahu karena belum pernah melihatnya secara langsung, katanya ada item yang benar-benar langka.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bila kamu melihat data item yang ada di Head Quarter kami, mungkin kamu bisa mengenalinya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">还有…我也有一些没见过的。虽也不太清楚，但真的是相当稀贵的道具。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">看我们本社的资料记载，应该是可以询问获得的。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_18_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_19_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ah, there is one type of item which cannot be used on your own will. I can't help you with these type of Items.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ah, ada quest item yang tidak bisa digunakan seenaknya, saya tidak bisa membeli item-item seperti itu meskipun kamu membawanya ke sini</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">啊，还有一种不可以随意使用的任务道具。这种东西即使您拿来给我，可能也没有办法帮您处理。的确稍微较困难了。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_19_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">......</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">......</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">......</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">처음으로</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">처음으로</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">처음으로</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_2_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">물품 매매</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">물품 매매</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">물품 매매</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_20_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Please use it only when you are on quest training.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tolong item ini digunakan hanya untuk melakukan quest saja</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">请您只在任务修行的时候使用它。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_20_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_21_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">.......</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">.......</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">.......</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_22_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Prior to the dispatch of all items to the various society, the items must be validated and approved first to ensure its quality, pricing and product classification.The education that the Society Members learned can now be utilized.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kami adalah distributor ulung yang telah memeriksa secara resmi segala kebersihan, kualitas, harga, jenis produk, dll sebelum di sebar ke seluruh sekolah di penjuru negeri ini.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kami mempelajari saat mendapatkan pendidikan dan akhirnya sekarang bisa mem</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">是卫生、品质、价格、制品种类等，所有部份都要获得官方检证，派遣给全国各地学校之优秀的物流社。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">从那里接受社员教育，现在终于派上用场了。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_22_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_23_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The resources available from our department has all been cut-off. I'm sorry for not having these items be readily available to students.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tapi sekarang, kami tidak mendapatkan bantuan lagi dari Head quarter. item itu tidak ada… Maaf</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">虽说如此，现在从本社可以获得的资源都断绝了，没有绝对有的物品…抱歉。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_23_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_24_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">......</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">......</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">......</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_25_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">If you have unwanted good items, you can come to me. I will exchange them for money.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jika kamu mendapatkan item yang bagus namun tidak tahu akan digunakan atau tidak, ataupun juga kamu lebih membutuhkan uang daripada tem itu, bawalah kepada aku.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">如果有取得好的物品，但不想用、或需要钱的话，尽管来找我。我会帮您处理。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_25_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_26_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You can also trade with your friends if you like.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tapi kamu tidak harus datang kepada aku saja karena ada cara lain seperti 'pertukaran 1 per 1' dengan teman</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">如果您愿意，也可以和您的朋友进行交易唷。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_26_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_27_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">요즘같이 버튼 하나로 모든게 다 되는 세상에서 이런 구닥다리 같은 서류나 쓰고 있는게 참 안어울리지 않아요?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">요즘같이 버튼 하나로 모든게 다 되는 세상에서 이런 구닥다리 같은 서류나 쓰고 있는게 참 안어울리지 않아요?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">요즘같이 버튼 하나로 모든게 다 되는 세상에서 이런 구닥다리 같은 서류나 쓰고 있는게 참 안어울리지 않아요?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_27_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_28_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">근데 이 용지를 그냥 이렇게 드리면 되는지 모르겠네요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">무슨 절차를 밟아야 하는건 아닌지...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">근데 이 용지를 그냥 이렇게 드리면 되는지 모르겠네요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">무슨 절차를 밟아야 하는건 아닌지...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">근데 이 용지를 그냥 이렇게 드리면 되는지 모르겠네요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">무슨 절차를 밟아야 하는건 아닌지...</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_28_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_29_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">......</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">......</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">......</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Hmm... First are the normal items. There are items which had been upgraded, with better performance. They are called rare items.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ehmmm…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pertama, ada tem biasa</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ada juga item yang memiliki fungsi lebih baik, biasa disebut sebagai rare item.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">嗯…首先是平凡的一般道具。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">也有经过改良，机能稍强的上位道具，叫做罕见道具。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_30_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The Student Director has made things to be done easily. You don뭪 have to repeat things all over again when you come back.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau orang lain pasti akan menyuruh kamu untuk membuatnya lagi, untung saja karena beliau Student Director baik, jadi langsung mengurusnya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">再怎么说也是托 Student Director的福，才这样容易处理的。若是别人的话, 一刚开始就叫你重弄好再来了。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_30_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_31_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">During these critical times, it is now possible.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Atau mungkin saja karena ini adalah darurat...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">反正现在是非常时期的体制，这也是有可能的。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_31_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_32_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Anyway, just present the Exit Approval Form to the Student Director at the School Administration Office. The registration is almost done.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pokoknya pendaftaran akan selesai kalau kamu menyerahkan pass formulir ini kepada Student Director</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">总之，只要出示Exit Approval Form给位在Administration Office的 Student Director就可以了。注册几乎都完成了。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_32_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_33_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">.....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">.....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">.....</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_shop1.ntk_34_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">여기 학생들이야 그만한 힘이 있으니까 나가볼 수 있겠지만, 저 같은 일반인은 나가는 건 꿈도 못 꾸죠</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">여기 학생들이야 그만한 힘이 있으니까 나가볼 수 있겠지만, 저 같은 일반인은 나가는 건 꿈도 못 꾸죠</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">여기 학생들이야 그만한 힘이 있으니까 나가볼 수 있겠지만, 저 같은 일반인은 나가는 건 꿈도 못 꾸죠</VALUE>
