    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_archer1.ntk_9_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">There's no turning back now.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Please be aware of this.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Perhatian! Tidak ada jalan untuk kembali lagi</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这儿没有回头路。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">但千万不能大意。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_archer1.ntk_9_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_ex1.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Oh!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It's great to see a normal human after all this time!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Senang bisa bertemu dengan sesama manusia</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">噢！可以见到正常人真是开心！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_ex1.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Trade Items</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jual beli item</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">交易物品</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_ex1.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Listen to Conversation</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mendengarkan cerita</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">听取对话</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_ex1.ntk_1_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Request for Bus Spare Parts</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Meminta genuine part Bus</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">申请公车零件</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_ex1.ntk_1_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Request for Generator Spare Parts</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Meminta Generator Part</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">申请发电机零件</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_ex1.ntk_1_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Collect Unverified Currency Notes</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Penarikan kembali Unconfimred Currency</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">收集未验证纸币</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_ex1.ntk_1_0_6">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Technical Teacher's Test</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pelaksanaan ujian</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">Technical Teacher的测验</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_ex1.ntk_1_0_7">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Confirm Test Results</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Konfirmasi hasil ujian</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">确认测验结果</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_ex1.ntk_1_0_8">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Give the Order Document</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menyerahkan Orders Book</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">传达命令书</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_ex1.ntk_10_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">That money is really strange, and it's good we discovered it before the problem got any worse. Just carry on with delivering the Order Document.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Benar? Itu Currency yang bermasalah waktu itu kan?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Untung lah, sudah terdeteksi sebelum terjadi masalah yang lebih besar lagi</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Terus tolong kirimkan Orders Book ini</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">是吗？那纸币明明就有问题！</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">在大问题发生之前确认出有危险实在太好了。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">请尽量持续传达这份Order Document。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_ex1.ntk_10_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_ex1.ntk_11_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Oh, so you already reached level to qualify for this exam?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You learn faster than I thought!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sudah bisa untuk mengikuti ujian?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kamu terlihat lebih cepat belajarnya!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">已经到可以测验的程度了吗?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">比想像中学习的速度快呀</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_ex1.ntk_11_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_ex1.ntk_12_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Good, you pass the exam by achieving your level. It's a little less than what I expected, but...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You'll need to practice more so that you'll be ready for any kind of attack from these fellahs.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bagus, segini juga cukup..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Namun aku pikir ini masih kurang~ kedepannya berlatihlah lagi ya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kamu mungkin tahu apa yang kamu pelajari di kelas, namun sampai kapan monster dua tangan dua kaki tersebut akan menjadi musuh kalian..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">很好 这程度就合格了</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">但是这算比想像中的差所以以后要多练习</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">虽然上课时都听懂了但你无法猜对何时那些有两只手两只脚的家伙会不会以你敌人的身分出现"</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_ex1.ntk_12_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_ex1.ntk_13_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">.......</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">.......</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">.......</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_ex1.ntk_14_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">In any case, I can’t help you with your search. You might want to visit the Supervisor located at the Construction Site 4th Hole.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mungkin saja Marionette yang ada di sekitar Lake Water Park punya items seperti itu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">总之老师所带的东西里头没有这种零件。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">位在Construction Site 4th Hole的Supervisor搞不好有带着。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_ex1.ntk_14_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_ex1.ntk_15_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You can get the spare parts you need from the supervisors at the Construction Site located at the 4th Hole.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You'll have to prove yourself to them first. They might give you a bit of a rough time!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Orang-orang itu sudah tidak normal, mungin kamu harus sedikit bertindak</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">你可以从你的头头那边取得所需零件。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">他位在 4th Hole的建筑工地。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">你必须要先证明自己，</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">他们一开始可能会有点严格粗暴。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_ex1.ntk_15_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_ex1.ntk_16_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">.....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">.....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">.......</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_ex1.ntk_17_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">혹시나 해서 현금지급기에서 확인도 해 봤더니 정품으로 인식하더라구</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">혹시나 해서 현금지급기에서 확인도 해 봤더니 정품으로 인식하더라구</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">혹시나 해서 현금지급기에서 확인도 해 봤더니 정품으로 인식하더라구</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_ex1.ntk_17_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">다음으로</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">다음으로</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">다음으로</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_ex1.ntk_18_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">아까 물어보니까 청소부들이 이런 지폐를 다발로 모으고 있다는 소리까지 들리는 거 보니까 이대로 놔두면 문제가 커질 것 같아</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">아까 물어보니까 청소부들이 이런 지폐를 다발로 모으고 있다는 소리까지 들리는 거 보니까 이대로 놔두면 문제가 커질 것 같아</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">아까 물어보니까 청소부들이 이런 지폐를 다발로 모으고 있다는 소리까지 들리는 거 보니까 이대로 놔두면 문제가 커질 것 같아</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
