  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_ex1.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">처음으로</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">처음으로</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">처음으로</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_ex1.ntk_2_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">물품 매매</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">물품 매매</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">물품 매매</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_ex1.ntk_20_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">....</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_ex1.ntk_21_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Great! So....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Let me remind you of this test's purpose again before I give you the exam questions. Your regular targets in this test won't be human begins.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bagus..kalau begitu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sebelum aku memberikan soal, akuakan memberi tahukan sekali lagi tujuan dari ujian ini</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sasaran dari pelajaran yang kamu terima dari kelas adala bukan warga biasa…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">很好,那么</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">出题之前我会再跟你们说一次之前讲的本次测验的目的,你们平时上格斗课的目标绝对不是一般人</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_ex1.ntk_21_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_ex1.ntk_22_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">That's the reason why you need to regular take these kinds of exams.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You'll be able to learn the stuff you really need to know.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Although things are moving faster than I'd like, I can't expect you to do more than your absolute best.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Karena itu, dengan adanya ujian reguler ini pelajar jadi tahu kekuranyanya dan mana yang harus diperbaiki</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sepertinya lebih cepat dari apa yang di perkirakan, namun sampai saat ini belum…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">所以要定期举行这种能力考试,可以学到更多需要学习的部分</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">虽说情况比预定的进行的快,但不会只到现在</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_ex1.ntk_22_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_ex1.ntk_23_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You need to diligently continue your studies since you'll eventually fight enemies higher than this level.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Do you understand me?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Musuh yang akan kalian hadapi nantinya tidaklah seperti ini, oleh karena itu berlatihlah terus kedepannya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mengerti?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">因为你们真正要战斗的敌人,他们的水准并非这程度,所以以后要持续学习</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">了解了吗</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_ex1.ntk_23_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_ex1.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Hmm...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You can imagine how it would have been if you had listened in class.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It all happened 18 years ago, earlier than anyone expected.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Euhm, kalau pernah mendengarnya pada saat jam pelajaran kamu pasti sudah punya perkiraan~</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Walaupun lebih cepat dari yang diperkirakan, namun seperti sudah di ramalkan sebelumnya?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sejak 18 tahun yang lalu…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">嗯如果有听课的话可以猜出大概的样子</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">比起预计的是快了不过早就预料到啦从18年前"</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_ex1.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_ex1.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">We predicted long ago that this would happen, but it was much worse than we thought it would be.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Please collect any important information related to this matter.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bencana ini sendiri sudah diperkirakan sebelumnya, namun sekarang tidak ada seorang pun yang tahu apa yang akan terjadi selanjutnya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Selain itu, belum diketahui apakah ini benar-benar sama seperti yang diprediksi sebelumnya..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Oleh karena itu harus du</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">虽然早已预想到事件的大概,现在却全然不知会怎样</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">再加上至今仍不知当初预知的事情是否正确</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">那必须先做确定</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">多收集可能的情报</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_ex1.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_ex1.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Right now, I'm managing distribution of these unique costumes since the person that was originally assigned to this job disappeared. Personally, I don't like the idea of doing this.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I just think it's kind of a pity to just give away items like this.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sebelumnya, ada orang yang mengurus hal ini, namun menghilang entah kemana</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Karena itu untuk sementara waktu aku yang ditugaskan berjaga di sini. Ini adalah seragam club yang sudah diupgrade dan disesuaikan dengan karakteristiknya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Maunya sih saya beb</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">本来是有人决定管理这个不过不知道跑去哪里了</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">所以暂时由我来看管是针对社服的特性再做强化的产品模样</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">心意一样但想就这样分配掉掉点可惜耶</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_ex1.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_ex1.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Hmmm...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">What do you want to know?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Emm, apa yang kamu ingin ketahui?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">嗯…. 您想问什么呢？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_ex1.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about the Situation</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya situasi</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问现况</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_ex1.ntk_6_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about What Should be Done</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya apa yang harus dilakukan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问该做什么才好？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_ex1.ntk_6_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about Unique Costumes</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang upgraded Suit</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问奇特服装</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_ex1.ntk_6_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_ex1.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ah, are you looking for spare parts to fix the bus?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Several people came to collect those same spare parts. They keep coming back because the buses keep getting involved in accidents.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I'm just glad we're able to help out by having spare parts available. Although we've prepared all the necessary equipment for these kinds of situations, we starting to run out of spare parts.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Oh, kamu mencari genuine part untuk memperbaiki Bus?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Beberapa hari yang lalu pun ada beberapa orang yang datang mencari genuine part untuk memperbaiki kendaraan mereka yang kecelakaan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tolong ya ambilkan sekarang..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">karena walaupun aku sudah melaku</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">阿 你在找修理公车用的零件吧</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">最近虽然有几个人收走一样的零件却因为出车祸又来找我</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">如果这次可以确实带走就好了</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">虽然为了应付这类事情准备很多东西但现在零件几乎没剩了</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_ex1.ntk_7_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_ex1.ntk_8_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">All the spare parts have been distributed. The ones we have left aren't what you need.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Genuine part lagi? Benar-benar…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Coba lihat… ini item lama, standarnya pun berbeda</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">tapi sayang sekali aku tidak punya item yang seperti ini..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">又是零件 全部都被包走了</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">看一下这是以前的规格也有点不一样吧</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_ex1.ntk_8_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_ex1.ntk_9_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">So you're here to buy some more spare parts.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Hmm... Where'd you get this weird money? Look, I've still got plenty of those things here, and I have no idea where they came from.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">These notes were verified earlier by the withdrawal machines as genuine.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I've already asked the cleaner to collect all these notes. This could be a big problem if we let this continue.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Please take them again for verification.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kamu datang untuk mencari genuine part lagi? Oh, ternyata tidak</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Euhm…maksudnya mata uang yang sedikit aneh itu, kan?...Ini dia</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">aku tidak tahu mananya yang salah, tapi yang jelas ada bagian yang aneh…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">又是来买零件吗? 真是的</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">嗯, 这是哪里奇怪的纸币呀? 这里有耶</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我虽无法正确指出是哪里, 不过这纸币就是怪怪的</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">好像有去现金提款机确认过, 不过告知是真的呀</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">刚刚问过, 从清洁工人说这种纸币包成一束来看, 这样下去问题会扩大</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">带去再确认一次</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_ex1.ntk_9_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_ex2.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">아, 그거 혹시 열쇠 조각 ...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">잠깐 줘 볼래?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">어쩌면 그 ‘깨달음의 열쇠’ 일지도 모르겠는데!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">정말 ‘깨달음의 열쇠’ 라면 ‘세인트 재단’ 에게서 뭔가를 받기 위한 증표가 될 거야</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">아, 그거 혹시 열쇠 조각 ...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">잠깐 줘 볼래?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">어쩌면 그 ‘깨달음의 열쇠’ 일지도 모르겠는데!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">정말 ‘깨달음의 열쇠’ 라면 ‘세인트 재단’ 에게서 뭔가를 받기 위한 증표가 될 거야</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">아, 그거 혹시 열쇠 조각 ...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">잠깐 줘 볼래?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">어쩌면 그 ‘깨달음의 열쇠’ 일지도 모르겠는데!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">정말 ‘깨달음의 열쇠’ 라면 ‘세인트 재단’ 에게서 뭔가를 받기 위한 증표가 될 거야</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
