  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_fighter1.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I think I've already said this before.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Never mind, I'll repeat again. I'll make sure you remember this!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kayaknya dulu saya pernah memberitahu kamu….</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Yah, tak ada hubungannya sih, aku akan beritahu kamu sekali lagi jadi ingatlah</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">3 point akan dialokasikan setiap kali level naik.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Arah pertumbuhan karakter akan dibedakan berdasarkan point yang didistri</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我想我之前已经说过了。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">没关系，我会再次重复一次。请仔细听唷！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_fighter1.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_fighter1.ntk_40_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">.....4-1</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">.....4-1</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">.....4-1</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_fighter1.ntk_41_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You are awarded 3 Stat Points each time your character levels up. Your character's build and growth is determined by how these Stat Points are allocated to your character's attributes.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Setiap kali skill dikuasai untuk pertama kali dan level naik, skill point akan digunakan.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Skill pada fase awal tidak membutuhkan banyak point jadi mungkin akan banyak point yang tersisa</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">角色成功晋级，已发送了3个能力点数。依据该点数的各个属性分配，角色会以相同方式被朔造定型。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_fighter1.ntk_41_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_fighter1.ntk_42_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Primarily investing in the Dexterity stat, followed by Strength, will result in a character with fast fist attacks.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pikirkan dengan baik dan kuasai skill yang benar-benar kamu butuhkan. Kamu akan kesulitan apabila nanti kamu tidak bisa belajar skill yang diingankan karena kekurangan point</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">将点数重点分配在敏捷，并适度搭配一些强度，您的角色将能成为‘快速攻击型’高手唷。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_fighter1.ntk_42_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_fighter1.ntk_43_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Conversely, primarily investing in the Strength Stat, followed by Dexterity, will enable your character to perform powerful leg attacks.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">若将点数重点分配在力量，而其次才是敏捷的话，将使你的角色成为“超强力大腿”型高手唷。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_fighter1.ntk_43_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Walaupun semua orang, sampai para guru pergi keluar untuk menyelidiki kejadian itu.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">tapi kalian tetap tidak boleh lengah dan berdiam saja!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_fighter1.ntk_44_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Lastly, distributing the points evenly to Strength, Dexterity, and Intelligence will result in a Skill Type character.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">最后，依据您在力量、敏捷、精神部分的各个分配，角色将成为“专业技能型”高手唷。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_fighter1.ntk_44_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_fighter1.ntk_45_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">......6</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">......6</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">......6</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_fighter1.ntk_46_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Most skills will require you to consume Skill Points in order to learn them.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Hampir semua skill memerlukan Skill Point untuk mempelajarinya.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">技能学习时，几乎都会要求您支付一些技能点数。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_fighter1.ntk_46_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_fighter1.ntk_47_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You should have more than enough Skill Points at the beginning since the starting skills won't require many Skill Points.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kamu seharusnya mempunyai banyak skill point yang tersisa karena level awal belum banyak skill untuk dipelajari.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">一开始，您的技能点数绝对是足够的，因为初期的要求不会太严格。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_fighter1.ntk_47_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_fighter1.ntk_48_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You'll find, however, that you might not have enough points to learn some of the later skills. Think and plan carefully, and choose the essential skills that you want to learn.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kamu akan menemukannya. Akan tetapi, mungkin kamu akan kekurangan skill point karena banyaknya skill yang harus dipelajari.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">但之后，可能会发生技能点数不够用，导致该学的技能无法学的窘境。必须先谨慎思考，利用有限的技能点数，搭配好您真正期望的技能之树。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_fighter1.ntk_48_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_fighter1.ntk_49_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">..7</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">..7</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">..7</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_fighter1.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">In group combat, the Brawler Section students specialize in close range attack and breaking enemies out of their attack formations. Brawler Students also find it is easier to concentrate because they don't use two-handed weapons or shields.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Peran dari pelajar brawler dalam pertarungan kelompok adalah melakukan serangan langsung di barisan paling depan sambil membuat gerakan musuh terpencar.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pasti lebih mudah untuk berkonsentrasi karena tidak ada tameng ataupun senjata yang harus dipegang</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">在前头负责近距离战斗,使敌人的动作散乱,是在集团战斗中格斗部所负责的位置.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">像盾牌啦两手没有碍手碍脚的武器,就很容易专心</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_fighter1.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_fighter1.ntk_50_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The Main Gate of the campus building is straight ahead. The Welfare Society and the Lockers are over there. You should go there so you'll know where they are when you need them.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pintu Gerbang Kampus ada di depan, tinggal jalan terus saja.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">学院的Main Gate就在正前方。Welfare Society 和 Lockers 都在那儿附近。建议您先前往确认位置，以后有急事要办时，就不怕找不到他们了。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_fighter1.ntk_50_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_fighter1.ntk_51_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You can get your wounds treated at the First-Aid Room. You'd better know how to get there. Sooner or later, you're probably going to get injured!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kamu dapat menyembuhkan luka kamu di Ruang First-Aid. Kamu sebaiknya tahu bagaimana cara ke sana karena kamu akan membutuhkannya tidak lama lagi</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">您也可以到First-Aid Room去接受伤口的治疗。不过，保健室的位置是一定要先打听清楚的，因为您会很容易在战斗中受伤的。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_fighter1.ntk_51_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_fighter1.ntk_52_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">....12</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">....12</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">....12</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_fighter1.ntk_53_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">This is just my observation, but all the teachers and students from the school came out fine.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Please remember that the evil can't control everyone!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menurut penelitian saya, semua dalam keadaan baik - baik saja.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Harap diingat bahwa iblis tidak bisa mengontol semua orang!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这只是我个人的看法。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">不过，几乎所有的老师和学生们都从校园里跑出来了。请记住，邪永远是不胜正的！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_fighter1.ntk_53_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_fighter1.ntk_54_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">There aren't too many normal human beings around anymore. Most have already been transformed into evil monsters. Although it's a really bad situation, it's not like things can't be changed for the better.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Please remember this.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Banyak manusia sudah kehilangan akal sehatnya karena para monster tersebut. Hanya sedikit dari mereka yang tersisa.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Harap diingat!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">请记住，没有恶灵是可以控制你们的！！！</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这边的人几乎都不算是人了。他们都变成邪恶的妖怪了。虽然这情况很糟糕，但尚未到无药可救的地步。请别忘记这点。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_fighter1.ntk_54_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_fighter1.ntk_55_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The teachers are doing all that they can to return things back the way they should be.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Para guru akan kembali seperti semula lagi. Mari berharap demikian.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">老师们正尽全力地想要把所有东西都恢复到原状。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_fighter1.ntk_55_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_fighter1.ntk_56_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">.....13</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">.....13</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">.....13</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_fighter1.ntk_57_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Like I said before, these violent monsters are wrecking our campus.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Please get out there, and keep them from causing even more destruction.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Seperti yang sudah saya katakan, para monster sudah merusak lingkungan kampus.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Harap dibantu sebelum mereka menghancurkan lebih banyak lagi.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我之前也有说过，现在有许多暴力怪物在破坏校园，请向前阻止，给他们一点颜色瞧瞧，并维持校园治安吧。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_fighter1.ntk_57_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_fighter1.ntk_58_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Know that carelessness may result in you ending up in a really bad situation.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Harap waspada karena sedikit kesalahan saja bisa berakibat buruk.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">要知道一不小心，就会导致您陷入非常糟糕的局面。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_fighter1.ntk_58_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_fighter1.ntk_59_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Remember that you'll be entering a world full of dangers once you submit the Exit Approval Form. Please be careful out there!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Harap diingat bahwa kamu akan langsung menghadapi para monster begitu menyerahkan Exit Approval Form.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">别忘记，只要你提交外出申请单，就是进入危险可怕世界的时候了。在外闯荡时，请小心安全。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_fighter1.ntk_59_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_fighter1.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Skill Points are set at 0 at the start. Each time your character's level increases, you will be awarded with 1 Skill Point. You can use these Skill Points to learn new skills or upgrade existing skills.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pertama dimulai dari '0' dan setiap naik level akan mendapatkan '1' buah 'Skill Point'</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">技能点数从0个开始计算，每当角色等级晋级时，就会增加 1个技能点数。您可利用这些技能点数，来学习新的技能，亦或是提升旧技能的等级。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_fighter1.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_fighter1.ntk_60_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Oh... So you saw the List of Saints.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It's true that there's nothing wrong with the list.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ah, but you're probably curious about what's behind it. Am I right?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Why are there so many students with family problems?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It's quite simple, actually.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Not too many loving parents would send their children to an experimental school.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Even if extraordinary benefits were offered, most parents would think that traditions set by normal schools are more important.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ah, jadi kamu sudah melihat Listnya Saints.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tidak ada yang salah, tapi kamu penasaran bukan?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mengapa banyak pelajar yang menjadi aneh?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sebenarnya jawabannya sangatlah mudah.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Banyak orang tua yang mengirimkan anaknya ke kampus karena mereka mal</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">噢，您看过了这份圣徒列表！没错，就是这些内容。哦，我猜您很好奇它的背景故事，对吧？为何会有这么多的学生被难解的家庭问题所困扰呢？答案很简单。就是，并没有太多的父母会愿意把子女送到具有实验性质的学校念书。就算福利再好，他们还是比较信任普通学校所走的传统路线。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_fighter1.ntk_60_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">继续</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_fighter1.ntk_61_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Many people raise this question...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">What is forgiveness, and does it work?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Oh, but it's not like I have the right to teach you anything.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Why should I force what little I know upon you?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You know that there are arenas in the Trading Hole.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You can find teachers that can teach you more over there.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Banyak yang bertanya tentang ini...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Apakan maaf itu? Bagaimana itu bekerja?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya tidak perlu memberitahumu bukan?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kamu dapat menanyakan jawabannya ke Guru di Trading Hole..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">很多人提出不少疑问，例如，什么是可以原谅的？被原谅是件好事吗？不过我觉得我没有资格教您们这些东西。我不能仅仅仗着比您懂多一点，就对您颐指气使。您知道在Trading Hole有不少竞技场，对吧？在那边，您可以找到适合您的老师唷。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_fighter1.ntk_61_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Begin</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">最初</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_fighter1.ntk_62_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">What?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Now, I've told you that you needed to be ready for this situation.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Well, it's too late now.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Maybe you can find the items you need in the Resource Room.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Apa?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mungkin kamu bisa menemukan sesuatu di Resource Room.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">什么？嗯，我已经告诉过您了，必须随时随地最好准备。现在似乎有点迟了。不过也许您能在Resource Room找到您需要的物品唷。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_fighter1.ntk_62_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Begin</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Begin</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">最初</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_fighter1.ntk_63_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Spiritual Spheres are earned by achieving certain character levels. You can use Spiritual Spheres to learn available skills of your choice.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jika kamu mempunyai Spiritual Spheres, berarti kekuatan kamu sudah cukup diakui. Pilihlah Skill yang kamu inginkan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">达到特定等级，就能拿到Spiritual Spheres。您可自由使用Spiritual Spheres来选择可学的技能唷。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_fighter1.ntk_63_0_5"><VALUE Lang="tw">兌換 墜地打擊（147級／格鬥部）</VALUE><VALUE Lang="GS">Skill book: Down Strike (Lv147, Class=65, Item=174/14)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="id">Skill book: Down Strike (Lv147, Class=65, Item=174/14)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="cn">Skill book: Down Strike (Lv147, Class=65, Item=174/14)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="th">Skill book: Down Strike (Lv147, Class=65, Item=174/14)</VALUE></SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_fighter1.ntk_63_0_6">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Exchange for Authentic Combo</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tukar dengan Authentic Combo</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">兑换 Authentic Combo</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_fighter1.ntk_63_0_7"><VALUE Lang="tw">兌換 氣功砲（137級／格鬥部）</VALUE><VALUE Lang="GS">Skill book: Ultimate  (Lv137, Class=65, Item=174/54)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="id">Skill book: Ultimate  (Lv137, Class=65, Item=174/54)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="cn">Skill book: Ultimate  (Lv137, Class=65, Item=174/54)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="th">Skill book: Ultimate  (Lv137, Class=65, Item=174/54)</VALUE></SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_fighter1.ntk_63_0_8">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_fighter1.ntk_64_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Spiritual Spheres are earned by achieving certain character levels. You can use Spiritual Spheres to learn available skills of your choice.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jika kamu mempunyai Spiritual Spheres, berarti kekuatan kamu sudah cukup diakui. Pilihlah Skill yang kamu inginkan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">达到特定等级，就能拿到Spiritual Spheres。您可自由使用Spiritual Spheres来选择可学的技能唷。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_fighter1.ntk_64_0_5"><VALUE Lang="tw">兌換 砲擊重拳（197級／格鬥部）</VALUE><VALUE Lang="GS">Skill book: Cannon Bash (Lv197, Class=65, Item=174/16)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="id">Skill book: Cannon Bash (Lv197, Class=65, Item=174/16)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="cn">Skill book: Cannon Bash (Lv197, Class=65, Item=174/16)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="th">Skill book: Cannon Bash (Lv197, Class=65, Item=174/16)</VALUE></SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_fighter1.ntk_64_0_6"><VALUE Lang="tw">兌換 暗影衝刺（157級／格鬥部）</VALUE><VALUE Lang="GS">Skill book: Shadow Dash (Lv157, Class=65, Item=174/36)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="id">Skill book: Shadow Dash (Lv157, Class=65, Item=174/36)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="cn">Skill book: Shadow Dash (Lv157, Class=65, Item=174/36)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="th">Skill book: Shadow Dash (Lv157, Class=65, Item=174/36)</VALUE></SENTENSE>
