    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_medic1.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I don't think this is a disease. I think this is more like a serious chemical reaction where the victim's body get burned, paralyzed by electricity, or frozen. There's another condition in which the victim's body is petrified.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ini bukan penyakit lebih kepada reaksi kimia</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Badannya terbakar, atau lumpuh, atau membeku….</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ada juga kasus mengeras seperti batu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我不认为那是疾病。我想这应该是一种严重的化学反应，受害者的尸体都被烧伤、被电力瘫痪，或被冻结。另外，也有发生像石头般的硬化现象。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_medic1.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_medic1.ntk_5_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about Burn Effects</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang 'Flame'</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问 Burn 效果</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_medic1.ntk_5_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about Paralysis Effects</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang 'Paralysis'</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问 Paralysis 效果</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_medic1.ntk_5_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about Freezing Effects</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang 'Frozz'</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问 Freezing 效果</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_medic1.ntk_5_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Asking about Poisoning Effects</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang 'Poisoned'</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问 Poisoning 效果</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_medic1.ntk_5_0_6">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about Suffocation Effects</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang 'Faint'</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问 Suffocation 效果</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_medic1.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I have no idea what the situation outside is like, but judging from what I've heard from the teachers, it doesn't look good at all.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Gimana yah, saya juga kurang tahu soalnya nggak pernah keluar</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya dengar dari para guru yang baru saja keluar kayaknya…terjadi masalah besar…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我不清楚外面的状况。但听其他老师们说好像情况真的很糟糕。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_medic1.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_medic1.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Burns will cause the body to weaken, resulting in lower Strength and Stamina. Please be careful since burns can end up being fatal.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ini adalah keadaan dimana stamina menurun karena seluruh tubuh terbakar</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">全身着火时，会导致体力弱化，进而降低力量和耐力。请小心，因为烫伤是最致命的伤害。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_medic1.ntk_7_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_medic1.ntk_8_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Paralysis caused by electricity or some other form of shock will cause the body's Movement Speed to slow down.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Keadaan dimana energi terkuras dan gerakan menjadi sangat lambat</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">电力造成的麻痹或是其他形式的休克，都会使人体的移动速度变慢。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_medic1.ntk_8_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_medic1.ntk_9_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Freezing the body causes it to stiffen, resulting in decreased Movement Speed and Defense. The effects could be fatal if the victim suffers in this condition for a prolonged period of time.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Karena tubuh membeku gerakan menjadi lambat dan pertahanan pun menurun</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau terus dibiarkan, ini bisa membahayakan jadi harus diobati secepatnya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">身体的冰冻效果会使其过度紧绷，造成移动速度和防御力变得迟缓。如果在此状态下维持过久，可能成为最致命的一击。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_medic1.ntk_9_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_nin.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Oh, you are not an Assassin, the friend of darkness seeking the light! I cannot help you!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ah, Kamu bukan Assassin.. Sang pangeran kegelapan. Maaf saya tidak dapat membantumu !!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">噢！您不是寻夜光的忍术部，不好意思，没办法帮您。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_nin.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Trade</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Trade</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">进行交易</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_nin.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">인술부기념주화로 행운에 도전하고 싶어요!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">인술부기념주화로 행운에 도전하고 싶어요!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">인술부기념주화로 행운에 도전하고 싶어요!</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
