    <VALUE Lang="cn">…….</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_nin.ntk_41_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">'3' points are given at each level up. Depending on how you distribute them will decide your expertise.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">'3 Point akan kamu dapatkan ketika naik level. Cara kamu mendistribusikannya akan mempengaruhi kemampuanmu.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">每晋级能得到3点数。 随着您点数的投资分配，角色的个性将被定型。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_nin.ntk_41_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_nin.ntk_42_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">If you distribute into DEX then you will be the fast blade master using Dual Spear.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jika kamu menaikkan Dex, Kamu akan menjadi Fast Blade Master menggunakan Dual Spear.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">如果您集中在敏捷， 将能成为超快速的双剑高手。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_nin.ntk_42_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">继续</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_nin.ntk_43_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">If you distribute into POW then you will be the powerful and unstoppable Scythe master dealing great damages.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jika kamu menaikkan Pow, Kamu akan sangat kuat dalam menggunakan Scythe.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">如果您集中在力量，将能成为强大的大镰刀高手，还能带给敌人超高的伤害量。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_nin.ntk_43_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">继续</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_nin.ntk_44_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">If you distribute into INT then you will be the master of giant Shuriken using magic and toxic bombs.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jika kamu menaikkan Int, Kamu akan ahli dalam pertempuran menggunakan Shuriken.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">如果您集中在精神，将能成为法术、Shuriken和Toxic bomb的高手。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_nin.ntk_44_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">继续</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_nin.ntk_45_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">…….</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_nin.ntk_46_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">…….</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_nin.ntk_47_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">…….</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_nin.ntk_48_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">…….</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_nin.ntk_49_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">…….</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_nin.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The uniqueness and the advantage of Assassin is that we take out an opponent quick in no matter what kind of condition we are in. Therefore, it is essential that we reduce the unnecessary movement using skills. Remember, Assassin has be quick and precise in any given condition!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Hal unik dan keuntungan dari Assassin adalah serangan yang cepat tanpa memperdulikan hal lainnya. Ingat! Assassin memiliki kecepatan dalam segala kondisi!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">忍术部的特征是可以在任何情况迅速压制敌人。所以，让攻击动作更敏捷是很重要的。不管在什么情况下，忍术部的攻击是果断的敏捷！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_nin.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_nin.ntk_50_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Why are you not registered..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You have not been getting ready as I have told you that is why…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You will find something suitable at the DB room Terminal, go get it!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kenapa kamu tidak terdaftar... Kamu belum siap seperti yang telah saya katakan.. Kamu akan menemukan sesuatu yang menarik di DB room Terimal. Pergilah !</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">怎么还没完成学院注册呢？就是因为您都不做好准备，所以才会发生这种事情。先去本馆前面的资料终端机找找看吧。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_nin.ntk_50_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">继续</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_nin.ntk_51_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">…….</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_nin.ntk_52_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">We have just been created and it is hard to take care of everything. The chaos in and outside of school and the pile of works… Gee… I have no time to rest…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kami mengalami kesulitan untuk mendapatkan segalanya. Huru Hara diluar sekolah telah meraja lela. Huff.. Saya tidak punya waktu untuk beristirahat.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">新部门刚成立不久，每天都忙得晕头转向。因为突发的异变事件，害得整个学院都不得安宁。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_nin.ntk_52_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">继续</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_nin.ntk_53_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The creatures that wander around in and outside of school used to be the innocent teachers and citizens. Well, there also have been people who weren't innocent but anyways…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The point is that they have been mutated and turned into freaks so do not pity them! Surviving is our top priority until we can go back to our homes.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Makhluk makhluk dipergunakan untuk membuat kekacauan diluar sekolah. Banyak korban korban yang berasal dari orang orang yang tidak bersalah. Point nya adalah mereka berubah menjadi agresif!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">在学院四周徘徊的那些人，原本跟您一样都是好人。但异变发生之后，举止越来越怪异，甚至到处破坏东西。请您不要对他们心软，也要努力找出异变的真正原因。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_nin.ntk_53_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">继续</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_nin.ntk_54_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">If it hadn't been the sudden phenomenon, I would not have become the instructor. However, since I have decided to do this, I am here to support you so don't hesitate to come to talk to me.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jika tidak ada kejadian ini, Saya mungkin tidak akan menjadi Instructor. Namun jangan membenci saya. Saya siap membantumu kapanpun !</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">要是这里没有发生异变，我也不会来到这里了。我会尽量协助您，有问题尽管问我唷。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_nin.ntk_54_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_nin.ntk_55_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">…….</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_nin.ntk_56_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The phenomenon has much more effect outside of the school. All the people outside right now reports that they should never let their guard down for a second. Once you are out there, don't lose your tension. Remember, surviving is our top priority.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Fenomena ini telah memiliki dampak yang besar. Semua orang melaporkan hal yang sama. Ingat !! Keselamatan adalah prioritas kami !</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">因为异变的恶影响，校外的情况比校内更为严重。据情报显示，这种现象将持续非常久。在情况好转之前，请您务必小心行事。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_nin.ntk_56_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">继续</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_nin.ntk_57_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Once you submit the Exit Approval Form, you are swearing to take full responsibility of all the risk so be strong!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sekali kamu memasukkan Exit Approval Form, Kamu berjanji akan bertanggung jawab terhadap semua kekuatanmu !</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">一旦您申请了外出证，那就代表您将付起全数的责任了！加油！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_nin.ntk_57_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_nin.ntk_58_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">…….</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_nin.ntk_59_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">This is just a portion about the Saint List. You will be surprised when you get closer to the truth. The current moment is important but I hope you could think deeper as you get closer to the truth.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ini hanya sebagian dari Saint List. Kamu akan terkejut jika tahu kebenarannya. Saya harap kamu dapat berpikir lebih.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">Saint List的部分是小事。当您越接近事实，就会发现更多的真相。虽然现在手边的事情很重要，但希望您可以主动去发掘真相，激发更多的想法。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_nin.ntk_59_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">继续</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_nin.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Starting from '0', you will receive '1' skill point at each level up.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Dimulai dari 0, Kamu akan menerima 1 Skill Point setiap naik level.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">新创角色从等级“0”开始。之后每升1级，可以获得技能点数1点。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_nin.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_nin.ntk_60_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I know you must be confused!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Go to Trading Hole and meet Sia. She will give you extra information on Saint List.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya tahu kamu pasti bingung!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pergilah ke Trading Hole dan temui Sia. Dia akan memberikan informasi lebih tentang Saint List.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我知道您一定感到很困惑。前往Trading Hole去拜访Sia。她会告诉您更多圣徒列表的事情。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_nin.ntk_60_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
