    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问归还扫帚的事情</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It looks like you still haven't registered as a College Student yet! Even though the situation outside is complete chaos, I'll never allow a new student to skip the registration process.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You need to register first so we can confirm whether you are qualified to be a student of this college.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Please finish the Registration process as soon as possible.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kamu tidak tedaftar secara resmi, walau database tidak berjalan normal, ingatanku tidak bisa dibohongi.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">学生呢......好像没有正式注册为学院生的样子...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">就算电脑系统没有办法达到预期的效果，但却没办法骗过我的记忆力！</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这些麻烦而拖拖拉拉的兔崽子们连成为我们学生的资格都没有！</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">还不赶快去把事情办好来！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
