  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_10_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">음?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">어디서 그런 걸 들었지?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">'세인트 재단' 에 보관중인 뭔가를 얻기 위한 증표이긴 한데, 열쇠는 그렇다 쳐도 대체 '파견요원' 이 지금 어디에 있는지 알 수가 없으니...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">음?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">어디서 그런 걸 들었지?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">'세인트 재단' 에 보관중인 뭔가를 얻기 위한 증표이긴 한데, 열쇠는 그렇다 쳐도 대체 '파견요원' 이 지금 어디에 있는지 알 수가 없으니...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">음?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">어디서 그런 걸 들었지?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">'세인트 재단' 에 보관중인 뭔가를 얻기 위한 증표이긴 한데, 열쇠는 그렇다 쳐도 대체 '파견요원' 이 지금 어디에 있는지 알 수가 없으니...</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_10_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_100_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">We won't beat this phenomenon by just leveling up and curing illnesses. We need to look at this with a broader perspective to find the root of the problem.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bukan melakukan hal simple seperti menghadapi rintangan atau menghentikan penyakit</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pasti ada seustu yang lebih besar…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">并非单纯的克服关卡或是抵挡疾病的水准</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">分明就是更大…</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_100_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_101_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The cost of experimenting and researching to achieve that end is quite high.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I'll try to gather everyone to discuss this matter when I have the time.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kedepannya, jika mempunyai waktu luang, tolong kumpulkan lagi</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">kalau mau melakukan eksperimen pasti banyak yang dibutuhkan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">啊,以后有时间再集合大家吧</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">如果真要实验的话,一定会花费很大的。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_101_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_102_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">....32q</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">....32q</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">....32q</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_103_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The students might not have the Brooms ready by now. There's one thing I need to explain first. Hmm...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tapi kamu kayaknya masih belum menyiapkan Special Broom…Harus aku jelaskan dulu ya…Hemm</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">但是学生到现在好像还没有准备扫帚…那我先该要说明的有一项…嗯.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_103_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_104_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The strange phenomenon that happened a long time ago endangered the people's physical and mental well-being.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Karena kecelakaan yang terjadi beberapa waktu lalu, kebanyakan makhluk hidup hilang kesadaran ataupun terjadi perubahan aneh pada tubuh mereka</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">因为不久之前发生的异象,有危及生命的危险,大部分是精神的或是外型上的异常变形。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_104_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_105_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Most of the students and teachers that attempted to stop it were left inside the campus dormitory. This caused the accumulation of a lot of garbage.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Setelah itu kebanyakan para pelajar dan guru yang pergi keluar dari sekolah untuk mengamankan situasi ini. Tapi tidak tahu kenapa trash di dormitory masih terus bertambah banyak</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">在那之后,学院里的学生或老师都为了平息异象,大部分离开学院,但就继续待在宿舍,</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">堆积很多垃圾啊</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_105_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_106_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It seems that the garbage is related to the negative effects of that strange phenomenon.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau dilihat dari keseluruhan cerita trash disana bisa saja timbul akibat dari kecelakaan yang terjadi</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">"以前后的情况看来,那些垃圾成为异象之下副产物的可能性也是相当高的</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">"</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_106_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_107_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Please investigate the garbage. You might be able to find a way to stop this strange situation from spreading.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ada kemungkinan bila kita melakukan penyelidikan dengan trash itu kita bisa mendapatkan jalan keluar untuk menenangkan situasi sekarang. Mungkin saja</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">反正调查一下那些垃圾,也许可以找到平息异象的方法</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">也不一定…反正就是说不定的意思嘛</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_107_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_108_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">....34</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">....34</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">....34</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_109_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You already have a Broom? Please go and collect the garbage and bring it here.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tampaknya kamu sudah siap bersih-bersih dengan membawa Broom itu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bagus, masih ada waktu, pergi dan kumpulkanlah</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">恩, 看来你已经准备好扫帚了,正好有空的话就去收集一些垃圾拿过来吧</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_109_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_11_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">구슬 자체로는 그리 대단한 물건이 아니지만 30개를 합치면 꽤 쓸만한 목걸이를 만들 수 있지</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">구슬 자체로는 그리 대단한 물건이 아니지만 30개를 합치면 꽤 쓸만한 목걸이를 만들 수 있지</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">구슬 자체로는 그리 대단한 물건이 아니지만 30개를 합치면 꽤 쓸만한 목걸이를 만들 수 있지</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_11_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_110_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Please clean the Dormitory and gather as much garbage as you can.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau nggak bisa pergi ke dormitory mengumpulkan trash di dormitory(exrta building) juga sama saja kok</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bisa lihat Main building kan? Kalau pergi ke sebeleah kanan dan paling ujung ada pintu menuju dormitory(extra building). Cari yang teliti</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">也不必一定要走到宿舍,你到宿舍分馆去打扫一下就好.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">走出本馆往左走到底就可以看到宿舍分馆的入口</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_110_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_111_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">......36</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">......36</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">......36</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_112_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Have you already made the request to the Specialist from the Sacred Financial Group?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Okay, please bring the cassette over here.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sini berikan tape itu pada aku….</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Seperti ini</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ini bawakan tape ini</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">已经拜托了财团的专员了?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">好吧…把那带子也拿到这边来</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这样的话…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">那么,把这带子拿过去给他。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_112_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_113_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">.....40q</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">.....40q</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">.....40q</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_114_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">In order to start a Gang, you need at least five (5) members that do not belong to any other Gang. The Gang Leader applicant should be at Character Level 30, and pay a processing fee of 1,000,000 Gold Coins.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Gang Upgrade Charges:</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">[Level D]: 2,000,000 Gold Coins</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">[Level C]: 3,500,000 Gold Coins</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">[Level B]: 5,000,000 Gold Coins</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">[Level A]: 7,000,000 Gold Coins</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sebagai Master party kamu harus sudah melewati level 30 untuk bisa membangun sebuah club dan mempunya minimal 5 orang Member party, ditambah kamu harus mempunyai biaya sebesar 1,000,000. Jangan coba-coba membangun club tanpa tahu apa-apa</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">为了要创设组织, 至少需要由【5名无组织成员】来组成, 且申请创组织的人等级需要在【30级以上】, 以及支付【1,000,000】的创设费。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">【组织升级费用】</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">[Level D]: 2,000,000 Gold Coins</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">[Level C]: 3,500,000 Gold Coins</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">[Level B]: 5,000,000 Gold Coins</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">[Level A]: 7,000,000 Gold Coins</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_114_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_115_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Experience will be lost if you disband or terminate the Gang.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">If you quit a Gang or kicked out of one, then you temporarily won't be allowed to join another Gang. Please remember this.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau club yang pernah dibangun lalu dibubarkan maka kamu akan kehilangan EXP, kamu bisa rugi kalau menganggap sepele hal ini.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Terus ingat juga kalau kamu dikeluarkan dari club atau keluar atas kemauan sendiri, kamu tidak akan bisa mendaftar ke club l</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">并不是一件很简单的事.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">啊, 如果要将已创设的组织解散的话, 就会失掉经验值, 想得太简单的话会有所损失的~</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">脱离已加入的组织或是被除名的话, 暂时会无法加入其它组织, 要记住这点…</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_115_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_116_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Hmpf. I never expected the situation over there to be that bad.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Please go there and check it out.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Akhir-akhir ini tidak kelihatan.... ternyata sudah berkeliaran sampai sana toh?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Haha…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau dipikir-pikir kamu hebat juga yah</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bisa pergi kesana pake kekuatan kamu sendiri?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Walaupun bukan apa-apa, kamu pelajar yang cukup berguna juga</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ya uda</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">哼, 一度做了安全保证，但去到那里以后却是不同的状况.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">哈哈...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">还有你看有奇特的刮胡刀.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">听说那个地方用力量的话就可以去?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">另外不是只有一件, 真是有成效的学生.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">是?, 那边的事情大概知道了吧。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_116_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_117_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">No information? Did you comb through the entire city?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Wei got this document from the Trading Hole Police.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You can try to advice him.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Aku pikir kota itu hilang secara keseluruhan habis tidak ada berita sedikitpun,</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">kalau segitu sieh masih untung</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sampaikan dokumen ini kepada polisi yang ada di Trading Hole</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Dia bisa membantu untuk mengerti situasi yang ada</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sekalian aku pering</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">完全没有消息？您有观察过整个城市了吗？</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这份文件是从Trading Hole 的警察拿到的。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">您可以试着劝他一下…</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_117_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_118_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">There's nothing I need you to do now. Maybe you can check out the area between Middle Hole and Root Hole.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jangan pikir situasi kedepannya juga akan sama hanya karena kamu bisa selamat sampai disini</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau di Midtown saja sudah seperti itu bagaimana dengan Root Hole</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ruang atau waktu, diantara dua hal ini pasti ada salah satunya yang menjadi aneh</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Perg</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">没有什么，我需要你现在去做！。也许你可以检查一下 Middle Hole 和Root Hole之间的区域。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_118_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_119_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">This cannot be...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pasti penasaran banyak banget</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">不会吧！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_119_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Talk about Sacred Financial Group</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang Yayasan Saint</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">听取关于Sacred Financial Group的讯息</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_119_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Get Information about Generation</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang dunia lain</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">听取关于一世代相关讯息</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_12_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It's strange that the students sent to investigate Leonair Campus haven't arrived yet.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The specialist from the Financial Group also doesn't have any idea what happened.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tidak bisa diremehkan nih, para pelajar yang dikirim untuk menyelidiki Leonine School tidak ada yang kembali.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Field agent yang katanya dikirim dari yayasan juga tidak ada kabar beritanya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">被派去Leonair Campus调查的学生们还没回来, 果然这事非比寻常。从Financial Group那边派去的专员也没有消息。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_12_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about the College</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang School</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问学院的事情</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_12_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about the Health Room</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang Health Room</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问Health Room的事情</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_12_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about Chaotic Situation</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang peristiwa kecelakaan itu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问现在的状况</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_12_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about the Green</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang Green</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问Green组织的事情</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_12_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about the Leonair College ID Card</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang Leonine School ID</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问Leonair College ID Card的事情</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_12_0_6">
