  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_42_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">This situation was predicted a long time ago. Sadly, it happened earlier than expected.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">We must act swiftly to find all the details so that we can solve this as soon as possible.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Seperti yang pernah diprediksikan dahulu, namun ini lebih cepat dari perkiraan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jadi sebaiknya cari tahu apa penyebabnya secepatnya…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这是从很久以前就预知的事情了,但是比预想的时间来的快多了.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">因为这个原因,所以要赶快找出事情的原委,尽快将它解决…</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_42_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_43_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">.......5</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">.......5</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">.......5</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_44_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">There was a big fight among the students not very long ago.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Since then, these strange events started to happen. Maybe we can figure something out by learning what happened in that fight.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">There have also been malicious rumors of some students joining Green's side.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Who could have spread these rumors?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Could it be that group from Sacred Gate Park?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Katanya kejadian itu timbul sejak para pelajar kita berkelahi di daerah itu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mungkin saja kamu bisa menemukan sebuah jejak di daerah sana</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">不久之前我们的学生在大本营大闹了一架之后，从此就开始发生一些异象了…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">说不定，也许可以从这里理出一些头绪。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">有谣言说在这群学院生中有一部分转向名叫”Green”的势​​力范围里去</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">到底是谁在到处放这种话？</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">该不会是Sacred Gate Park 那群不像样的家伙吧？！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_44_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_45_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">.....6</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">.....6</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">.....6</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_46_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The weird phenomenon that started in Leonair Campus has spread to other areas.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Katanya kalau masalah yang menimpa Leonine School bisa diselesaikan dan situasi ini bisa membaik</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">"这其中，Leonair Campus变得奇怪，异象发生的速度比以前快了许多。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_46_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">"</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_47_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Perhaps solving the mystery in Leonair Campus will improve the situation. It's especially troublesome that the teachers and students there have become our enemies, though. We need to be ready in case this situation gets worse.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tapi para pelajar dan guru disana berpaling menjadi musuh, jadi pasti tidak gampang.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bisa saja situasi yang terburuk terjadi, jadi kalian harus bersiap dari sekarang</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">"也许只要解决最近Leonair学院的问题，搞不好就能使事态镇静下来也说不定…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">但那地方的学生和教师们变成了敌人,当然是不容易解决</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">不知该怎么说,也不知会不会变成最糟的情况,事先有点觉悟比较好.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">"</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_47_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
