  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_50_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">If this isn't fixed soon, the students will be in danger. Whoops! I s-said too much!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Para pelajar bisa saja berbahaya kalau kita tidak melakukan sesuatu…Eh, maaf aku terlalu banyak ngomong</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">像这样的程序都不做的话,学生也有可能变得危险…哎呀,我好像说太多了</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_50_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_51_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I'll help you process the application forms. Take the original copy, and then go to the Society Room to submit your Exit Approval to the teacher.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Bring it here after you've got it filled out.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sini, saya bantu mengurus Registration Form kalau dokumen aslinya kamu bawa saja. Kalau kamu pergi menemui club inctructor dia akan memberikan Pass Application</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Gunakanlah itu dan bawalah kemari</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">"那么,我会帮你们处理注册申请书,把原本带走,去到社团室的话,给老师们外出申请书</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">把那写一写带过去</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">"</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_51_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_52_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I'm not questioning the capabilities of the students. It just means they aren't human anymore.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I have no idea what's wrong. Too many students are coming to the First-Aid Room, and I can't figure out a perfect solution to this problem. Please try to understand.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bukannya saya meragukan kemampuan kalian, tapi orang-orang yang berkeliaran di depan sana sudah bukan manusia lagi</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Akhir-akhir ini ada beberapa orang bodoh yang nggak tahu apa-apa dan coba bertingkah namun akhirnya malah harus menemui nurse trainee. K</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">"虽说不是对学生的实力有所怀疑,但是那些外面的家伙们已经不是人类了</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">!最近不知怎么搞的,莽撞的跑向医护室的笨蛋们越来越多,没有办法只好想一些替代的方法.这你们知道就好!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">"</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
