  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_59_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Please follow the procedures for processing the application form.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">These are the rules. We didn't just frivolously decide on them, understand what I mean?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Yang namanya peraturan dibuat untuk ditaati, bukan cuman dibuat untuk memenuhi buku belaka. Ngerti nggak?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">所谓的规则是必须要遵守的,而并不是只是说说而已,你听清楚了吗?!</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
