  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The four colleges were set up Force Fields. The strange phenomenon on Leonair Campus spread to the Sacred Gate, Mystic Peak, and Phoenix campuses.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">4 kampus yaitu Sacred Gate School, Mystic Peak School, Phoenix School dan Leonine School terdapat force field sistem setelah dibangun.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Diantara keempatnya terjadi sesuatu yang aneh pada Leonine sekolah, dan kamu mungkin tahu kalau kecelakaan terjadi l</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">Sacred Gate、Mystic Peak、Phoenix、还有Leonair 这4个学院, 因结界形成而设立。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_60_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">......16</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">......16</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">......16</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_61_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Eh? The Exit Approval ends here.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I've already said this many times. It's up to you whether you want to hear it again.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Euhm formulir pass selesai.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mungkin kamu sudah sering mendengar hal ini, aku bilang sekali lagi terserah kalau kamu mau bilang aku tukang ngomel atau apa</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">嗯,外出申请到这里为止</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">到现在为止已经讲很多遍了,我要再讲一句.你们要当作是啰唆不听的话随你们便。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_61_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_62_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I've already told you about the different locations on the map. I'm not repeating myself.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I've already told you about how to fight monsters. I'm not repeating myself.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Aku nggak akan menyebut lagi tentang dunia lain yang sering kita bahas saat jam pelajaran</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya juga nggak akan bilang apa yang harus kamu lakukan kepada orang-orang yang mirip dengan manusia yang melakukan kekacauan di luar sana</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sama saja dengan ha</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">对于学生们在课堂上学到关于其他世界的事我不再提</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">对于怎么对付那在外面游走似人非人的怪物我也不再提</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">还有对于为了其他学生该怎么做的事我也不再讲。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_62_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_63_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I won't repeat myself to the other students either.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Now, what would it be?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">All I ask is for you students to be careful and not to die. That's all I can tell you.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Terus apa?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jangan sampai kamu mati!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ini adalah satu-satunya yang bisa aku katakan pada kamu sebagai seorang guru</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">那么是什么呢?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">是叫你们不要死</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我以一个老师的身分可以跟学生讲的就是这个而已。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_63_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_64_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">.....17</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">.....17</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">.....17</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_65_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Our world is changing. Some students have started to develop special and uncanny aptitudes and capabilities.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Siapa gurumu ? Dunia ini membutuhkan orang orang yang bisa menjaga kesadaran dirinya sendiri.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这,到底是谁告诉过了呢…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">反正现在这世界维持着本来的精神和形态,就像这些学生一样带有特别的要素。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_65_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_66_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Most of them don't even understand how to use their ability effectively. It's hard to stay safe right now.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tapi tidak ada seorangpun yang yang yakin sampai kapan kita bisa aman karena kalian juga kan masih belum bisa menggunakan elemen itu dengan baik.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Seperti yang sudah kamu dengar saat melakukan pendaftaran….aaa, maaf mungkin kalian tidak pernah dengar d</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">"但是学生们到现在还是没办法彻底的活用那些要素,真的没有无法得知到何时才能安全</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">就像学生们入学时也讲过的…啊抱歉,这些你们不用听</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">"</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_66_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_67_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Our college has special Force Fields everywhere. It's unfortunate that these Force Fields are affected by the unusual phenomena at a certain level.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">There are also the strong mobs outside campus that cause destruction and chaos.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I believe that you'll be able to defeat them if you activate and learn the effects of the Force Fields.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sekolah kita mempunyai sistem force field di beberapa tempat sehingga bisa menghalangi kemungkinan kecelakaan yang terjadi.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Diluar sekolah memang banyak musuh yang lebih kuat dan kejam yang melakukan kerusuhan, tetapi kalau kemampuan kamu sudah diakui</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我们的学院处处都有特别的结界,但是却还是在某种程度上会受到异象的影响</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">虽然学院外面有更强,更异常的家伙在闹,但能从这些结界开始,学习能力的认证,获得力量的话,可以说是更强的。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_67_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_68_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">.......18</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">.......18</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">.......18</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_69_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Just by looking at them, I can tell some of the people in front of Headquarters are fools.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Nonetheless, I'm not worried by them because the exams that must be taken by all students will weed them out.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau kamu keluar sekolah nanti kamu pasti bisa tahu, banyak pelajar yang baru saja sampai ke Main Building kalah dan langsung dibawa lagi ke sini</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kayaknya saya akan lebih nyaman kalau menguji kalian dulu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我虽一看就知道,但是因为在本馆前面就是有一些糊里糊涂的家伙</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">不管怎么说还是要给学生考考试,我的心理才会感觉比较舒服…。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_69_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">What! You still don't know the location of the Health room?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You can go straight across the Administration Office and you'll probably see a room labeled as the "Health Room".</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ada bom yang meledak dan penyebabnya tidak diketahui di healt room</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">啧啧, 到现在还不知道Health Room在哪里啊...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">从Administration Office出去直走的话，会看到有间写着[Health Room]的地方，找一下！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_7_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_70_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">There are mobs of Little Hooligans running around. Please get two (2) Cigarette Butts from them.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">If you do this, I will reward you with both experience and Skill Points.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Coba bawakan dua buah cigarette butt yang diisap oleh para little hooligan di depan sana</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau lulus ujian ini nanti aku kasih skill point dan EXP</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">外面有个叫做 Little Hooligans的家伙晃来晃去去拿两个他嘴里叼的香烟烟蒂来。如果通过考试的话,我就给你们加经验值和技能点数。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_70_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_71_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">......19q</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">......19q</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">......19q</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_72_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You've completed the Force Field Activation?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">That was fast!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You must be fairly strong!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Emm, baru sekarang autentikasi Force Field selesai?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lumayan cepat..lah..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Coba…wow sudah cukup kuat sekarang</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">嗯…结界认证已经结束了吗?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">真的算是很快就结束了呢</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">那里…喔! 变强哩！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_72_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_73_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The School Principal used a strange material to create the Force Field. It's almost unbelievable, but it really has amazing effects!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ketika Director Lee bilang bahwa kita harus membuat sistem force field dari orang-orang aneh itu aku sedikit ragu. Tapi ternyata ada gunanya juga</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">社长用那些奇怪的东西造结界的时候,还半信半疑,原来真的有此惊人效果啊！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_73_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_74_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">....21</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">....21</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">....21</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_75_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I've already told this to you many times. The situation outside is beyond my comprehension. I never would have imagined anything like this.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Namun~</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kan sudah aku bilang berkali-kali dari sejak pendaftaran, dengan bayangan Trading Hole seperti biasa kamu tidak bisa pergi keluar sana</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">但是呢~</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">刚开始注册时就已经讲过很多次了,现在外面并非一般市内的面貌是你们无法想像的状况</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">"</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">"</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_75_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_76_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Some students who reached the Main Gate and attempted to pass through it were rushed to the First-Aid Room. Why weren't they able to go through?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">There is a test you must take before you can pass through the Main Gates.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Banyak banget anak-anak yang ceroboh dan dibawa ke nurse trainee setelah babak belur di Main Gate, kalau misalkan kita beri ijin kepada semua orang untuk keluar Main Gate kira-kira apa yang terjadi?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">有些才到门口就受伤回到医护室了,要怎样做才可以站出正门？所以准备了简单的能力试验程式。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_76_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_77_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Once the test procedure at the Terminal located near the Main Gate begins, you are required to finish the test within a specific amount of time.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Karena itu kita sudah siapkan ujian kemampuan secara sederhana</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau kamu hidupkan Entrance Terminal dia akan memberikan tugas buat kamu, laksanakan tugas itu dalam waktu yang ditentukan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">正门的终端机将它启动的话，就开始提出题，要在限制的时间内通过。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_77_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_78_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">......22</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">......22</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">......22</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_79_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">We can't just ignore this, not matter how bad it seems. Do you feel uneasy about this? Imagine how the other students would feel if they also found out. You've got to be tough!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Walaupun udah kami peringatkan berkali-kali tetap saja ada orang yang bertindak tanpa pikir panjang dan akhirnya harus diobati. Jadi kita pikir mungkin saja ujian seperti ini tidaklah cukup</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pokoknya hati-hati dan jangan sampai lengah!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">"不管再怎么菜,也不能这样鬼混,这就像是去保持已凋谢的花的美丽是没用的.像这种程度的考试,就这么不安</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">学生们怎么会知道</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">反正给我好好振作!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">"</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_79_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_8_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">어디서 그런 위험한 약을...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">아니 어쩌면 좋은 일일지도 모르겠군</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">'망각의약'... 지금까지 네가 배웠던 모든 것들을 순식간에 잊어버릴 수 있는 약인데...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">그동안 조정했던 모든 능력 (스탯)과 기술 (스킬)을 처음 상태로 되돌리게 된다는 걸 명심하고</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">특히 스킬은 문서도 남아있지 않게 되니까 새로 구입하거나 찾아야 한다는 점을 잘 생각해서 선택하도록.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">어디서 그런 위험한 약을...</VALUE>
