  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_82_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The paper notes aren't normal money. Be careful not to misplace it!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Aku peringatkan lagi Currency ini bukan lembaran uang biasa, jadi hati-hati jangan sampai hilang di tengah jalan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">"也许可以给点主意,但是这纸币不是普通钱币之类的,不要中途遗失了!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">"</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_82_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_83_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">...24q</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">...24q</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">...24q</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_2_t_t_master1.ntk_84_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Hm? So the people at Mystic Peak share my opinion?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">This is an experimental product of Counterfeited Anxiety Money.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Euhm, begitu yah ternyata pikiran dari Phoenix school juga sama rupanya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">item palsu.. Lagia..?!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tapi sepertinya masih ada yang aneh… aku ingin melihatnya sekali lagi.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">""嗯,原来Mystic Peak的想法也一样</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">是伪造安神特货币的实验品</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">"</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
