  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_cheyuk_1.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The Terminal is functioning properly.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Terminal beroperasi secara normal</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">终端机正常运作中。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_cheyuk_1.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_cheyuk_1.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The Force Field Function of this Terminal is operating properly. You'll need 4 Spiritual Spheres to optimize the Force Field function of this Terminal.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pengoperasian Force Field di Terminal berfungsi secara normal</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jika ingin mendapatkan hasil autentikasi, kamu harus mengumpulkan spiritual sphere dan mendapatkan konfirmasi, untuk konfirmasi autentikasi kali ini dibutuhkan 4 buah spiritual sphere</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">终端机的结界功能运转正常。您需要收集4颗灵珠，才能通过认证，并得到结界的能量。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_cheyuk_1.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_cheyuk_1.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Force Field Verification is completed!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Please move to the next Force Field Terminal to complete the Authentication process.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Autentikasi Force Field telah selesai</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jika sisa autentikasi Force Field telah selesai hasilnya bisa di dapatkan dan untuk autentikasi Force Field berikutnya harap gunakan terminal yang sesuai</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">本结界认证已结束！请前往下个终端机，并完成结界认证。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_cheyuk_1.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_cheyuk_1.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">학습1관 내부에는 일부의 복사령들이 활동중입니다</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">이들이 지닌 구성자들이 주변의 요소들에게 불확실한 영향을 끼치고 있으니, 구성자들을 가능한한 제거해 주십시오</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">현재 우선시되는 체인가이의 정보는 아래와 같습니다</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">체력 : 230</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">공격력 : 25~36</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">방어력 : 4</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">약점 : 걷기만 하므로 공격과 이동을 적절히 사용하면 효과를 볼 수 있습니다</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">학습1관 내부에는 일부의 복사령들이 활동중입니다</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">이들이 지닌 구성자들이 주변의 요소들에게 불확실한 영향을 끼치고 있으니, 구성자들을 가능한한 제거해 주십시오</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">현재 우선시되는 체인가이의 정보는 아래와 같습니다</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">체력 : 230</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">공격력 : 25~36</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">방어력 : 4</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">약점 : 걷기만 하므로 공격과 이동을 적절히 사용하면 효과를 볼 수 있습니다</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">학습1관 내부에는 일부의 복사령들이 활동중입니다</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">이들이 지닌 구성자들이 주변의 요소들에게 불확실한 영향을 끼치고 있으니, 구성자들을 가능한한 제거해 주십시오</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">현재 우선시되는 체인가이의 정보는 아래와 같습니다</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">체력 : 230</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">공격력 : 25~36</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">방어력 : 4</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">약점 : 걷기만 하므로 공격과 이동을 적절히 사용하면 효과를 볼 수 있습니다</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_cleaner1.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I'm not sure how the streets got to be this dangerous. I'm so lucky to have found a safe place to hide!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Sheesh! I really don't know what'll happen to me if I'm not careful.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Entah mengapa wilayah sekitar sini menjadi seperti ini</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Beruntung kamu masih bisa bernafas disini</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jika saja kamu ada saat itu, tidak tahu apa yang akan terjadi sekarang…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我不晓得为何外面街道变得如此危险。现在这个地方真的很安全，我很庆幸可以躲在这里。嘘，我很担心，我一不小心就惹祸上身。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_cleaner1.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">What are you talking about?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya siapa anda</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">您在说什么？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_cleaner1.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Listen to Cleaner's Advice</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mendengarkan nasihat Cleaner</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">聆听Cleaner的忠告</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_cleaner1.ntk_1_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Delivering Recycled Trash</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menyerahkan item-item Recycle</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">传达 Recycled Trash</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_cleaner1.ntk_1_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Deliver Recycled Trash</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menyerahkan item-item Recycle</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">传达 Recycled Trash</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_cleaner1.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">... …</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_cleaner1.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You still have no idea regarding the situation after seeing it? Things suddenly got weird while I was cleaning the streets. Please be careful around this area. It's very dangerous!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bisa kamu lihat kan? Tiba-tiba jadi seperti ini kan pada saat bersih-bersih di daerah sini</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">看了这景象之后，您还无法明白市发生了什么事情了吗？当我在清扫街道时，事情就变得非常不对劲了。在此区活动时，一定要小心自身的安危。这边真的很危险。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_cleaner1.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_cleaner1.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ever since these events happened, we never had the chance to run away. No one is left to do the cleaning up till now.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Dahulu walaupun dibersihkan setiap hari, pengumpulan item-item Recycled pun juga dilakukan setiap hari</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sekarang jangankan bersih-bersih, saya sibuk melarikan diri kesana kemari</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">从那件事情发生之后，我们一直没有机会逃走。到现在没有一个人愿意留下来做打扫……。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_cleaner1.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_cleaner1.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Thank you very much! I'm so sorry for bothering you. We really have to treasure all kinds of resources. I'll ask for your help later in case you have any spare time to assist me. I will exchange any precious items you collect for any of my available items.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Terima kasih untuk kerja keras kalian para pelajar</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Gunakan material secukupnya, nanti jika waktu memungkinkan mohon bantuannya lagi</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Hanya dengan mengumpulkan dan datang saja aku akan menggantikannya dengan yang lain</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">真的很谢谢您。如果您有空，往后也请多多指教。只要您收集我所需要的东西过来，我就会兑换珍奇异宝给您。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_cleaner1.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_cleaner1.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">....</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_cleaner1.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">If this mess and resource shortage continues, then we'll suffer tremendous problems later on.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kebetulan kita sedang kekurangan material, jika sedikit saja tidak bisa dikumpulkan kedepannya akan lebih sulit</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">如果物资短缺，环境脏乱的情况一直持续下去的话，往后我们一定会遭遇到更大的灾难的。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_cleaner1.ntk_7_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_cleaner1.ntk_8_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">There are other matters that you don't need to worry about for now. Just concentrate on helping me collect some Empty Bottles.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kumpulkanlah Empty Bottles saja dan abaikan yang lainnya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Setidaknya kalian harus bisa menjaga Medicines tersebut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">您什么都不要想，也不需要操心任何事情。现在只需要帮我把 Empty Bottle收集好就可以了。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_cleaner1.ntk_8_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_gichogwahak1.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The Terminal located in the Basic Science Classroom is not functioning properly. Please take note of this.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Terminal Basic Science Classroom</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saat ini di dalam sekolah terjadi kesalahan perhitungan, tolong diperhatikan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">现在位于Basic Science Classroom的终端机无法正常运转。请注意一下。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_gichogwahak1.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Activate Authentication</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Konfirmasi pengaktifan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">启动认证</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_gichogwahak1.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Retrieve Information</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mencari data</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">检索资料</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_gichogwahak1.ntk_1_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Retrieve Information</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mencari data</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">检索资料</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_gichogwahak1.ntk_1_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Retrieve Information</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mencari data</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">检索资料</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_gichogwahak1.ntk_1_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Retrieve Information</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mencari data</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">检索资料</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_gichogwahak1.ntk_1_0_6">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Retrieve Information</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mencari data</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">检索资料</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_gichogwahak1.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Due to the errors found in the School's</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Information Center System,</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">the Information Room has all the essential</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">information contained within these 2 files.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">We will restore all necessary information</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">as soon as we resolve the situation.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Do you want to stay and read through these</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">documents?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Karena kerusakan yang terjadi pada sitem data base di dalam sekolah, hanya 2 buah data yang tersimpan di Information Room saat ini.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kami akan berusaha untuk meperbaiki kerusakan secepatnya.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Apakah kamu ingin membaca 2 data tadi?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">因为学院资料库系统故障，资料室现在只能储存2份档案。我们会尽快复原所有重要的资料。请稍微阅读一下这份文件，好吗？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_gichogwahak1.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about the Sword Section Student named Chi Ri Qing</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pencarian data tentang Chi Ri Qing dari kelas Sword</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问关于剑道部学生 Chi Ri Qing。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_gichogwahak1.ntk_2_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about the Archery Section Student named Cheng Xi Zhi</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pencarian data tentang Cheng Xi Zhi dari kelas Archery</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问关于弓箭部学生 Cheng Xi Zhi。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_gichogwahak1.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Chi Ri Qing is a Sacred Gate Campus 2nd Year Student. He is a former Trainee of the Sword Section Class. His background is very interesting: both of his parents died in a chaotic incident.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Since then, he left the school carrying out his own investigation about the incident.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">If you have seen or have any information about this student, please contact the Administration Office immediately.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sacred Gate School kelas 2</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pelajar training kelas Sword</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Keahliannya menggambar sketsa orang</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kedua orang tuanya meninggal karena kecelakaan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sekarang sedang melakukan penyelidikan di luar sekolah</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Apabila telah ditemukan harap segera melaporka</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">Chi Ri Qing是Sacred Gate Campus2年级的剑道部修练生。双亲都因为事故而死亡，现在离开学院，单独进行调查。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">万一您有发现新情报的话，请您跟Administration Office连络。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_gichogwahak1.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_gichogwahak1.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Cheng Xi Zhi is a 2nd Year student from the Sacred Gate Campus, and a former trainee of the Archery Section. Both of her parents died in the catastrophic phenomenon that caused the major problems in our world. She is now using her Evil Spirit to find her mutated older sister.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">This student has important information regarding the location of Leonair Campus. We must get in contact with her immediately.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sacred Gate School kelas 2</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pelajar training kelas Archery</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kedua orang tuanya meninggal karena kecelakaan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saat ini dia sedang beraktivitas mencari kakaknya yang telah menjadi Roh Jelmaan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ada kabar bahwa lokasi Leonine School telah diketahui, de</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">Cheng Xi Zhi是Sacred Gate Campus2年级的弓箭部修练生。双亲都因事故而亡，现在以复制灵追寻已变异的姐姐，单独进行中。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_gichogwahak1.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_gichogwahak1.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">There are no means to keep this Terminal to function properly.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saat ini terminal tidak berfungsi dengan baik</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">现在没有方法可以使终端机的机能正常运转。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_gisuk_1.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">This Terminal controls the entrance and exit to the Dormitory.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Terminal Dormitory</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mengatur akses keluar masuk Dormitory</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这个终端机掌控着 Dormitory 的出入口机能。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_gisuk_1.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Confirm Activation</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Konfirmasi pengaktifan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">确认激活</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
