    <VALUE Lang="cn">取得文件</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_10_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Make sure you stop and never pass through the crossroads in front.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">There are a lot of weird dogs loitering that area, and no one knows where they came from.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It would be safer to travel along the left or right corner streets. Honestly, I'm not very familiar with the other roads because I've never actually passed by them before.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau bisa jangan pergi lewat trotoar, lebih baik kamu kembali lewat jalan sebelah kanan atau kiri</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Setidaknya masih ada sedikit tata krama yang tersisa pada orang-orang gila itu, mereka nggak turun ke jalanan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">千万不要从前面的交叉路过去唷！</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">狗儿怎么这么点… 绕左绕右的路可能会比较好一点。不过我没走过，不是很确定。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_10_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_11_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">득도의 경지에 이른 ‘마루치’ 와 ‘아라치’ 의 기운이 서로 만나서 이루는 경지를 말하는거 라더군</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">아마도 '나한의 구슬' 과 '깨달음의 열쇠'도 관계가 있을거야</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">득도의 경지에 이른 ‘마루치’ 와 ‘아라치’ 의 기운이 서로 만나서 이루는 경지를 말하는거 라더군</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">아마도 '나한의 구슬' 과 '깨달음의 열쇠'도 관계가 있을거야</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">득도의 경지에 이른 ‘마루치’ 와 ‘아라치’ 의 기운이 서로 만나서 이루는 경지를 말하는거 라더군 아마도 '나한의 구슬' 과 '깨달음의 열쇠'도 관계가 있을거야</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_11_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">'깨달음의 열쇠' 에 대해 묻는다</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">'깨달음의 열쇠' 에 대해 묻는다</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">'깨달음의 열쇠' 에 대해 묻는다</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_11_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">'나한의 구슬' 에 대해 묻는다</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">'나한의 구슬' 에 대해 묻는다</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">'나한의 구슬' 에 대해 묻는다</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_11_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_12_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">예전에 재단에서 온 사람들이 그런 말을 하는 걸 들은 적이 있는데 열쇠가 지금은 조각 조각으로 나뉘어져 있다더군</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">일단은 그 조각들을 합쳐야 할 텐데 말야...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">예전에 재단에서 온 사람들이 그런 말을 하는 걸 들은 적이 있는데 열쇠가 지금은 조각 조각으로 나뉘어져 있다더군</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">일단은 그 조각들을 합쳐야 할 텐데 말야...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">예전에 재단에서 온 사람들이 그런 말을 하는 걸 들은 적이 있는데 열쇠가 지금은 조각 조각으로 나뉘어져 있다더군</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">일단은 그 조각들을 합쳐야 할 텐데 말야...</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_12_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_13_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">직접 본 적은 없으니까 녹색 구슬이라는 것 밖에는 알 수가 없군</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">더 자세한 건 '학생주임'님께 여쭈 보면 알 수 있지 않을까</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">직접 본 적은 없으니까 녹색 구슬이라는 것 밖에는 알 수가 없군</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">더 자세한 건 '학생주임'님께 여쭈 보면 알 수 있지 않을까</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">직접 본 적은 없으니까 녹색 구슬이라는 것 밖에는 알 수가 없군</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">더 자세한 건 '학생주임'님께 여쭈 보면 알 수 있지 않을까</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_13_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_14_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">These mobs bring nothing but destruction to the environment.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Karena mereka keadaan jadi gawat~</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这些混混只会惹是生非，破坏环境。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_14_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask what is Happening</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya apa yang terjadi</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问发生何事了？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_14_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about Situation on the Streets</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang bagian luar</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问外头状况</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_14_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask for Useful Information</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang informasi yang bermanfaat</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">申请有用的情报</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_14_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_15_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You mean the mail from the Finance Department Headquarters?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Hmmm...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I actually had that document earlier, but I'm not sure where I placed it.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kiriman pos dari kantor pusat yayasan?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ya, kiriman seperti itu memang ada</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">aku meletakannya di sekitar sini…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">你指的是从 Finance Department Headquarter来的信件吗？嗯………我明明有这封信的，但我忘了把它放到哪里去了。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_15_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_16_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Goodness! I almost forgot...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I should have told you at the very beginning. I was thinking of asking you to do something.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Benar-benar deh…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mulanya aku kira hanya mendengarkan permintaan yang ringan saja…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">太好了！我差点儿忘了。我应该要早一点拜托您的…我想请您帮我做点东西。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_16_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_17_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Well… I'll be…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">This is the note! Thanks for finding it. Even though you found this note, there are still bigger problems that we've got to deal with.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Sigh...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Benar, kertas catatanya yang ini!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Terima kasih ya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tapi kembalinya kertas catatan ini juga menjadi masalah…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">噢~~我试试~对了！就是这张！谢谢您帮我找到！可是，就算您找到了，但现实存在的问题仍尚未解决……唉。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_17_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_17_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Guard's 2nd Request</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mendengarkan permintaan Security kedua</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">Guard的请求2</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_18_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Please consider helping me out by delivering this medicine to the Health Advisor.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau dipikir-pikir apakah aku akan mampu membawa Medicines itu kembali?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Medicines ini sangat dibutuhkan olah Nurse Trainee, dapatkanlah Medicines tersebut secepatnya…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">请考虑帮我一个忙，把这药品交给 Health Advisor.。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_18_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_19_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Oh! You found them all! Thank you very much Student! Please take these medicines to the Health Advisor now.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Wow, benar-benar sudah didapatkan semuanya!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">哇！您都找齐了！谢谢您！！！现在，请您把这些药品都交给Health Advisor。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_19_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">.....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">.....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">.........</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_20_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Hm? Did the Health Advisor like it?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Oh! He did?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Emm, apakah Nurse Trainee menyukainya?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tentu…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">嗯？ Health Advisor还满意这结果吗？</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">噢！真的？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_20_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_21_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Sorry for troubling you like this, but I really appreciate your hard work, especially since it's making our campus much safer.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I'm really impressed by your performance.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I'll be sure to commend you for all the good you've done for me if I ever meet your teachers again.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Terima kasih untuk kalian semua</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Walaupun sedikit, namun bisa mengurangi tingkat bahaya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ini adalah jasa kalian~</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Nanti kalau bertemu guru akan aku sampaikan tentang masalah ini</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">很抱歉每次都要麻烦您。我真的很感谢您的帮忙。托您的福，危险渐渐减少中。如果我遇到您的导师，我一定会对您大力赞扬的！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_21_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_22_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">......</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">......</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">....</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_23_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Oh! It's over here!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It might not seem very important, but the Student Direction personally requested this.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ah! Ini dia!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bukan hal yang penting ya? Biasanya Student Director datang langsung untuk mengambilnya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Atau mungkin dia sangat mempercayai kamu?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">噢！在这里！看起来很像重要耶！但 Student Direction已经亲自申请了。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_23_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_24_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Maybe he sets a limit on how much he trusts the students. What's important is that the document is still here.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Hoho, pokoknya ini dia</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">他大概不是很信任相信学生的样子。总之，文件仍原封不动的放在这儿，真是太好了。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_24_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_25_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">....</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_26_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I wasn't aware of the full extent of the chaos caused by these weird mobs on the campus grounds and the surrounding area. That is why I'm staying here.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mana aku tahu kalau situasi di luar sekacau ini</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Terus pas sudah keluar dari sekolah, aku malah tidak bisa masuk lagi soalnya banyak orang-orang aneh yang membuat kerusuhan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我不知道外面的世界原来是这么的混乱！这些奇怪的人，总是会突然从学院的某处冒出来为非作歹，这也是为什么我会留在这里的原因。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_26_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_27_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Not so long ago, the note written by the Health Advisor that the Blood Drinker requested was stolen. I'm sorry for bothering you, but may I know if you've found the stolen note?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Beberapa saat yang lalu Black Belt telah merampas kertas catatan yang berisi perintah dari Nurse Trainee</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Maaf tapi bisa tolong bantu rebut kertas catatan itu kembali nggak?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">不久之前，Health Advisor写的纸条被Blood Drinker给偷走了。很抱歉打扰您，但我想问您，您是否有找到那张便条纸呢？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_27_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_28_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">....</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_29_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The Health Advisor has ordered the recovery of the first-aid medicine several times. We need that medicine back as soon as possible.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Disana,,</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Dengarkan permintaanku sekali lagi ya tolong…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">Health Advisor总是叮咛要我们尽快取得药品。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_29_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Sigh... I don't even know where to begin.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">My situation is a bit complicated because I have to take care of the Health Advisor's request to search for first-aid medicine.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I lost the list of medicines!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">This is a serious problem</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mungkin iya…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Nurse meminta untuk mencarikan First Aid Kit, tidak dapatkah kalian melakukannya?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ditambah gawat lagi karena saya sudah kehilangan daftar obat yang dibutuhkan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">唉~我不知道是从何开始的。其实我的情况有点复杂，因为我为了要履行 Health Advisor的请求，跑去寻找急救药品，但我竟然弄丢了药品清单。这真的是很严重的事情…。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_30_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Please accept my request for your help again.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">There are these fellahs known as the Blood Drinkers that rob people who possess the medicine. It's pretty clear that these Blood Drinkers have the medicine. Please make sure they can't rob people of their medicine again.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sesaat yang lalu Black Belt juga merampas Medicines yang serupa dari orang-orang</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mungkin saat ini Medicines tersebut ada di mereka, maukah kalian merampasnya kembali?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">请您再接受我一个请求。刚刚看见一群叫做Blood Drinker的家伙从别人的手上抢走药品。请您去教训他们，让他们不敢再偷枪别人的药品。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_30_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_31_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">....</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_32_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Thank you very much!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Please take this medicine to the Health Advisor now.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Terima kasih banyak ya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sekarang bisakah kamu antar Medicines ini kepada Nurse Trainee?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">谢谢您！现在请您把药品交给 Health Advisor吧。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_32_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_33_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The people causing trouble on campus are preventing me from bringing this medicine to the Health Advisor.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tidak ada jalan lain kah, selain aku yang mengantarkannya langsung?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tapi mau bagaimana lagi, orang-orang itu membuat kerusuhan sampai di dalam sekolah</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这些人一直在制造骚乱，甚至阻扰我们把药送给Health Advisor.。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_33_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_34_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">.....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">.....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">.....</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_35_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Those mobs bring nothing but chaos to the streets!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Especially that group of mobsters known as the Gangsters!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Namun, para bandit itu membuat masalah disini</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Terutama para Henchman sambil mengayunkan pedangnya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">那群混混把这里搞得天翻地覆的。特别是叫做 Gangster的那群。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_35_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_36_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">So you might see all sorts of folk carrying around daggers dripping with fresh blood, but you don't need to be that afraid of them.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Entah bagaimana pedang tersebut sangat tidak enak dilihat</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">aku tidak takut tertusuk pedang itu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bagaimanapun juga mereka itu tidak benar, membawa pedang yang berlumuran darah</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">总之您应该已经看到了，那些人手中拿着的刀上不停地流着鲜血。不过，您不用怕他们。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_36_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_37_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Please help me out by taking the Knives away from those Gangsters.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It's probably impossible to get all their daggers, but I think getting 10 Daggers from them shouldn't be a problem.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pelajar, kali ini ini lakukanlah permintaan terakhirku</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ambilah pedang-pedang tersebut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tidak perlu semuanya, cukup ambil 10 buah saja dari mereka</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">请帮我从 Gangster那儿夺回刀子。虽然要您拿回全部的匕首是不太可能的，但我想10把应该是没问题的。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_37_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_38_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I hear that some strange kind of money has appeared.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">At least that's what I heard. You can learn more about the rumor at the campus's crossroads over there.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jadi para pelajar sekarang punya banyak waktu luang</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tidak pernah terpikirkan untuk menemukan kembali fungsi-fungsi yang hilang</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ada rumor yang bilang kalau item seperti itu sering ditemukan di daerah large trading hall 1, kalau kamu kesana past</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我听说有些奇怪的金币在流动。但这只是听说而已。您可以从学院的十字路口那儿得知更多的资讯。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_38_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_39_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I hear that item is very small and easy to lose.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Search for the people that came back from the dead on Leonair Campus and talk to them.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You might learn some useful information.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Item praktis itu mudah hilang dan terjatuh karena ukurannya sangat kecil</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Apalagi kalau sedang berlari karena dikejar sesuatu, benda ini sangat mudah terjatuh~</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Aku juga mendengar kalau ada orang-orang yang memungut item yang terjatuh itu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Katanya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我听说那物品太小容易弄丢。特别是被敌人追赶而逃跑的时候。请通知从Leonair Campus逃出来的人。同时，您也可以从他们身上学到不少东西。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_39_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">This is the first time in my life that I've encountered a problem that doesn't make any sense at all. I can't even go outside to assess the actual situation.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Where in the hell are these mobs coming from?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Not so long ago, those creatures almost killed me while I was rescuing a friend of mine. I barely died, and I tell ya…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It was horrible!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Aku juga baru keluar sampai depan saja…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Seumur hidup baru aku alami kejadian yang susah dimengerti seperti ini</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sebenarnya darimana orang-orang yang berpenampilan mirip itu muncul…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Beberapa waktu yang lalu aku hampir saja mati gara-gara mereka, u</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这是我生平第一次遇见让我无法理解的事情。这么多长的类似的东西，到底是从何而来的？不久前，我在拯救我朋友时，差点死在那群混混的手里。我真是死里逃生啊！唉…</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_4_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about Situation on the Streets</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang jalan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问街道的状况</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_40_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I hear that item is very small and easy to lose.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Search for the people that came back from the dead on Leonair Campus and talk to them.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You might learn some useful information.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Karena item yang membuat nyaman itu sangat kecil, jadi mudah hilang…. dan jatuh</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Apalagi kalau sedang berlari karena dikejar sesuatu, benda ini sangat mudah terjatuh~</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Aku juga mendengar kalau ada orang-orang yang memungut item yang terjatuh itu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我听说那物品太小容易弄丢。特别是被敌人追赶而逃跑的时候。请通知从Leonair Campus逃出来的人。同时，您也可以从他们身上学到不少东西。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_40_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">.........</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">.........</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">.........</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">하도 정신이 없어서 누군지</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">얼굴도 기억 나질 않는데</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">하여튼 그 친구가 자기 이름이</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">그렇다고 했던 것만 겨우 기억</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">나는군</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">하도 정신이 없어서 누군지</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">얼굴도 기억 나질 않는데</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">하여튼 그 친구가 자기 이름이</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">그렇다고 했던 것만 겨우 기억</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">나는군</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">하도 정신이 없어서 누군지</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">얼굴도 기억 나질 않는데</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">하여튼 그 친구가 자기 이름이</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">그렇다고 했던 것만 겨우 기억</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">나는군</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Hmmmm... Let me see.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Let me see. Even though I had a tough time coming here, I don't think I have any other information to tell you. Wait! Hold on a minute.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">There's something called an Abrasive Potion that you can use to make better equipment.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Euhm, kalau aku sih disini, yah lagi seperti ini saja…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">O, iya, dengar-dengar ada yang namanya Abrasive Potion</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Katanya itu bisa digunakan untuk membuat peralatan menjadi lebih bagus</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这个… 我虽然一路走来很辛苦，但我其实没有什么好情报可以给您。不过，听说有个叫做研磨剂的东西，利用它，可以制作更酷炫的装备唷。试试吧！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_7_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_7_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask How to Use Abrasive Potions</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tanya bagaimana cara menggunakan Abrasive Potions</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问要如何研磨剂品</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_8_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Open the Inventory Window and choose the Abrasive Potion. Drag it to the item you want to transform by clicking the top right position of the item, and the item will be upgraded.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pertama-tama bukalah inventory dan pilihlah Abrasive Potion, setelah itu pilihlah item yang akan diupgrade lalu klik kanan, maka item itu akan terupgrade dengan sendirinya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">首先，打开背包，选择研磨剂 Abrasive Potion，并拖曳到您想要改造的物品上。同时，请在该物品上方，按下右键即可升级该物品的等级了。 （不过，改造失败时，先前的改造效果将全数消失。）</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_8_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_guard1.ntk_9_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">난리도 아니야~</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">여기부터는 최소한 레벨이 35는 돼야 갈 수 있을걸세.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">그러니 그냥 얌전히 돌아가서 연습 좀 더 하고 나오게나.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">난리도 아니야~</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">여기부터는 최소한 레벨이 35는 돼야 갈 수 있을걸세.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">그러니 그냥 얌전히 돌아가서 연습 좀 더 하고 나오게나.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">난리도 아니야~</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">여기부터는 최소한 레벨이 35는 돼야 갈 수 있을걸세.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">그러니 그냥 얌전히 돌아가서 연습 좀 더 하고 나오게나.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
