  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_locker.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">A Broom? Well, it's pretty inconvenient for me to carry this broom around while I'm trying to finish everything I need to do.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sapu? Ini akan sangat mengganggu untuk dibawa ke mana mana ketika saya melakukan hal lain.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">扫把？反正我在处理事情时，拿着扫把也是挺不方便的。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_locker.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Open the Locker</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Buka Locker</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">开启置物箱</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_locker.ntk_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_locker.ntk_1_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The weather is getting cold and gloomy. I'm starting to feel aches and pains in my body.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Cuaca berangsur dingin. Saya mulai merasakan pegal dan sakit di seluruh badan saya.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">天气又冷又阴的，我的身体开始感到疼痛了。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_locker.ntk_1_2_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Open the Locker</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Buka Locker</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">开启置物箱</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_locker.ntk_1_2_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about Locker Usage</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tanya tentang Penggunaan Locker</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问关于置物箱的使用方法。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_locker.ntk_1_2_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about the Campus</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tanya tentang Kampus</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问关于学院。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_locker.ntk_1_2_4">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return Broom</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tukar Broom</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">归还扫把。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_locker.ntk_1_2_5">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Borrow Broom</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pinjam Broom</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">借扫把。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_locker.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">.......</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">.......</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">……</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_locker.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Of course! Just use these lockers whenever you want. Try to stick to using just one locker space for yourself, alright? Store items that you want to keep and use later inside your locker. You'll need to spend some more money if you want to expand your locker space.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tentu saja! Kamu bisa menggunakannya kapan pun kamu mau. Simpan item - item yang tidak diperlukan saat ini agar bisa dipergunakan ketika memerlukannya. Kamu memerlukan uang untuk membuka locker lain jika ingin.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">当然！置物箱，您尽管用就是了。但请尽量保持一人份的使用量，好吗？最好是保管真正想收藏的，但又不太紧急的物品。当您嫌置物箱空间不够，想要加大空间时，是需要付些钱币的唷。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_locker.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Open the Locker</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Buka Locker</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">开启置物箱</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_locker.ntk_3_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_locker.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Sigh. How do I answer that question? As you probably know, there are 3 Campuses in the area, but there are rumors of a fourth campus. I've heard the teachers and the School Administration talking about the Force-- Force Fiel... Ah yes! The Force Field! I'm not one hundred percent sure, but I think there's something very important about that Force Field. Of all the campuses here, Leonair Campus is the probably the weirdest. I remember that I was just listening to some teachers talking when the sky suddenly change</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I really want to know more about what actually happened. If you guys find important information about that event, please don't forget to let me know, alright?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jangan bertanya hal seperti itu pada saya~</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Yang aku ketahui hanyalah kabar desas-desus yang tak berdasar, namun apabila kamu tetap ingin mengetahuinya..baiklah</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Nah… jadi sangatlah jelas selain sekolah ini terdapat 3 buah sekolah lainnya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Yang terp</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">哀，我该怎么回答好呢？您大概已经听说了，似乎学院的总数不是3个，而是4个！老师们和行政部门的人有提到像是结…..结界的东西….. 啊！就是结界！没错！虽然不能100%的保证，但我相信所谓4个学院的传闻，绝对跟这结界有着很大的关联。现在全部的学院里，最诡异离奇的就属Leonair学院了 。我记得当时我正在听老师们交谈，结果天空急剧变色。但情况太混乱，之后我什么也不记得了。如果各位同学们，关于这部分，有什么新发现，一定要马上跟我说，好吗？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_locker.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Open the Locker</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Buka Locker</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">开启置物箱</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_locker.ntk_4_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_locker.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Broom? Oh! That Broom! I really have no idea what's so special about these brooms. Well, if you really think you'll need one, feel free to take it. Please bring it back as soon as you're done using it.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Special Broom?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ahh</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">扫把？噢！刚提到的扫把！我实在是不懂它有什么特别的。这样吧。如果您真认为您会需要，别介意，尽管拿去使用。 只要记住，用完后，要马上归还唷。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_locker.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_main_1.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">This Terminal controls the entrance and exit to the Main Center.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Terminal Main Building</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mengontrol ijin keluar masuk ke Main Building</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这个终端机掌控着 Main Center 的入口机能。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
