  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_10_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">어머~</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">아직도 등록이 제대로 안되셨나 봐요?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">여기, '외출신청서' 를 '교무실' 의 '학생주임' 께 제출하시면 등록이 마무리 될 수 있을거예요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">어머~</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">아직도 등록이 제대로 안되셨나 봐요?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">여기, '외출신청서' 를 '교무실' 의 '학생주임' 께 제출하시면 등록이 마무리 될 수 있을거예요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">어머~</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">아직도 등록이 제대로 안되셨나 봐요?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">여기, '외출신청서' 를 '교무실' 의 '학생주임' 께 제출하시면 등록이 마무리 될 수 있을거예요</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_10_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_11_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">등록이 늦으셨네요?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">등록이 늦으셨네요?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">등록이 늦으셨네요?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_11_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_12_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It is not enough to just fill up the registration application form and bring it over, right?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau Student Registration Form dibawa begitu saja tidak boleh, kan?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau orang lain pasti akan menyuruh kamu untuk membuatnya lagi, untung saja karena beliau Student Director baik, jadi langsung mengurusnya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">只有把注册申请书填好带去是不够的。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_12_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_13_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">What! You are still on registration? Normally we go one by one, but this situation is an exception. So... perhaps coming directly would be better... It should be...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ooo, sedang mendaftar yah?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mohon maaf yah, menyuruh kamu datang langsung seperti ini…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau biasanya sieh... ada orang yang bertugas untuk membagikannya sekaligus, tapi sekarang tidak bisa seperti itu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tapi kalau diambil secara langsung seperti i</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">什么？您还在注册吗？通常我们都是一个一个按序进行的。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">但现在情况有点特殊，所以………也许直接来会比较好唷。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_13_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_14_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Don't have any way to go outside at the abnormal time. The students can go outside because they have a little power but for a normal person like me, going out is just like a nightmare.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kita tidak bisa keluar seenaknya sejak kecelakaan mulai terjadi</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">发生异象的时候, 没有办法随意地出去外面.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这里的学生是因为有一点力量才有办法出去看看, 像我这样的普通人, 出去对我来说是连作都不敢作的梦。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_14_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_15_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Paper for medical report usage? It뭩 the sample document for medical report. In any case, the Health Room only uses this, cannot be wrong. The Health Room is very busy too? Everybody is called to help people...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Medical? Aaa... maksusnya medical record untuk pengobatan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lagipula yang dipakai di Health Room cuman ini, jadi pasti benar</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Healt room juga sibuk, yah? Tumben menyuruh orang lain untuk datang ke sini</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这些是病历表用纸啊？这些是样式，没错的！通常Health Room 是使用这些东西的唯一部门。所以，它不可能是错的。什么！Health Room 非常忙吗？这就是为什么每个人都被要求去跑腿做事了。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_15_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_16_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">.....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">.....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">.....</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_17_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">There are also items called Blessed Items, which are more special and very well done and are therefore quite hard to find. If you obtain this kind of items, could you please keep them properly?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Diantara rare item itu ada uniqe item, yang dibuat secara khusus, mungkin akan sulit untuk ditemukan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau kamu menemukannya, maukah kamu menyimpannya?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这其中也有叫做受祝福的道具的,是较特别且做得很好的,应该是比较难找.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">如果您获得这种东西的话,可以好好保管它们吗?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">"</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_17_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_18_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">And... I have some items which I have never seen before, but are really precious items. Look at the information record of our department and you should be able to inquire and obtain.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Dan…Saya juga kurang tahu karena belum pernah melihatnya secara langsung, katanya ada item yang benar-benar langka.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bila kamu melihat data item yang ada di Head Quarter kami, mungkin kamu bisa mengenalinya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">还有…我也有一些没见过的,虽也不太清楚,但真的是相当稀贵的道具.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">看我们本社的资料记载,应该是可以询问获得的</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_18_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_19_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ah, there is one type of item which cannot be used on your own will. I can't help you with these items, it will be a little bit difficult. Please use it only during a quest training.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ah, ada quest item yang tidak bisa digunakan seenaknya, saya tidak bisa membeli item-item seperti itu meskipun kamu membawanya ke sini</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">啊,还有一种不可以随意使用的任务道具,这种东西即使您拿来给我可能也没有办法帮您处理,就稍微较困难了~</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">请一定只在任务修行的时候使用."</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_19_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">......</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">......</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">......</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_2_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">물품 매매</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">물품 매매</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">물품 매매</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_20_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Please use it only when you are on quest training.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tolong item ini digunakan hanya untuk melakukan quest saja</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">请一定只在任务修行的时候使用</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_20_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_21_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">.....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">.....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">.....</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_22_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Prior to the dispatch of all items to the various societies, the items must be validated and approved to ensure quality, proper pricing and product type. The knowledge that the society members learned from there can now be finally used.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kami adalah distributor ulung yang telah memeriksa secara resmi segala kebersihan, kualitas, harga, jenis produk, dll sebelum di sebar ke seluruh sekolah di penjuru negeri ini.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kami mempelajari saat mendapatkan pendidikan dan akhirnya sekarang bisa mem</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">是卫生.品质,价格,制品种类等所有部份都要获得官方检证,派遣给全国各地学校之优秀的物流社.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">从那里接受社员教育,现在终于派上用场了.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_22_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_23_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Although it said so, now that the available resources from our department were all cut off, I don't have the item that should have been available ... Sorry.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tapi sekarang, kami tidak mendapatkan bantuan lagi dari Head quarter. item itu tidak ada… Maaf</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">虽说如此,现在从本社可以获得的资源都断绝了,没有绝对有的物品…抱歉</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_23_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_24_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">.....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">.....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">.....</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_25_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">If you have any unwanted items, come to me and I will exchange it with money.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jika kamu mendapatkan item yang bagus namun tidak tahu akan digunakan atau tidak, ataupun juga kamu lebih membutuhkan uang daripada tem itu, bawalah kepada aku.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">如果有取得好的物品,但不想用,或需要钱的话,来找我可以帮您处理.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_25_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_26_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">But if you could trade items with your friends, it is not necessary to look for me.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tapi kamu tidak harus datang kepada aku saja karena ada cara lain seperti 'pertukaran 1 per 1' dengan teman</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">但是也有跟您的朋友们交换的方法,所以也不一定要来找我</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_26_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_27_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">.......</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">.......</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">.....</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_28_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">예전에는 이런 용지는 그냥 형식상으로만 진열해 놓고 있을줄만 알았는데, 정말로 쓰게 줄은 몰랐어요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">예전에는 이런 용지는 그냥 형식상으로만 진열해 놓고 있을줄만 알았는데, 정말로 쓰게 줄은 몰랐어요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">예전에는 이런 용지는 그냥 형식상으로만 진열해 놓고 있을줄만 알았는데, 정말로 쓰게 줄은 몰랐어요</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_28_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_29_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">요즘같이 버튼 하나로 모든게 다 되는 세상에서 이런 구닥다리 같은 서류나 쓰고 있는게 참 안어울리지 않아요?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">요즘같이 버튼 하나로 모든게 다 되는 세상에서 이런 구닥다리 같은 서류나 쓰고 있는게 참 안어울리지 않아요?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">요즘같이 버튼 하나로 모든게 다 되는 세상에서 이런 구닥다리 같은 서류나 쓰고 있는게 참 안어울리지 않아요?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_29_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Hmm... First is normal item. There are upgraded items with better performance, called rare items.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ehmmm…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pertama, ada item biasa</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ada juga item yang memiliki fungsi lebih baik, biasa disebut sebagai rare item.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">嗯…首先是平凡的一般道具。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">也有经过改良,机能稍强的上等道具，叫做稀有道具。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_30_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">근데 이 용지를 그냥 이렇게 드리면 되는지 모르겠네요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">무슨 절차를 밟아야 하는건 아닌지...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">근데 이 용지를 그냥 이렇게 드리면 되는지 모르겠네요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">무슨 절차를 밟아야 하는건 아닌지...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">근데 이 용지를 그냥 이렇게 드리면 되는지 모르겠네요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">무슨 절차를 밟아야 하는건 아닌지...</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_30_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_31_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">.....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">.....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">.....</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_32_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It can be done easily because of the Student Director. Otherwise, you may have to repeat it again before you return. Anyway, since now is a critical time, it is possible. Anyway, just present the Egress Application Form to the Student Director at the School Administration Office, the registration is almost done.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Atau mungkin saja karena ini adalah darurat...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pokoknya pendaftaran akan selesai kalau kamu menyerahkan pass formulir ini kepada Student Director</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">再怎么说也是"Student Director", 所以才这样容易处理, 若是别人的话, 一刚开始就叫你重弄好再来了.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">反正现在是非常时期的体制, 这也是有可能的...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">反正, 在这里将外出申请书向Administration Office的"Student Director"提出, 注册就做的差不多了</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_32_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_33_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">.....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">.....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">.....</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_34_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Although it's only hearsay, the monsters out there are already dead.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Para pelajar di sini masih bisa pergi keluar karena mempunyai kekuatan untuk itu, tapi orang biasa seperti saya bagaimana bisa</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">虽然这只是传闻，但外头的怪物们似乎都已经死掉了。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_34_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_35_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">소문이지만 저 바깥에 있는 괴한들은 다들 이미 죽은 상태래요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">좀 이상하죠? 저도 믿지 못하고 있는데, 얘기들을 잘 들어보면 정말 그런 것 같기도 해요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">소문이지만 저 바깥에 있는 괴한들은 다들 이미 죽은 상태래요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">좀 이상하죠? 저도 믿지 못하고 있는데, 얘기들을 잘 들어보면 정말 그런 것 같기도 해요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">소문이지만 저 바깥에 있는 괴한들은 다들 이미 죽은 상태래요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">좀 이상하죠? 저도 믿지 못하고 있는데, 얘기들을 잘 들어보면 정말 그런 것 같기도 해요</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_35_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_36_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Feel weird? I didn't believe it too, but you will after listening to them. Isn't it just like that? Human beings have no concern for one another... There are no responses even when you speak to them.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Gitu kan, orang-orang yang bermuka mirip itu berkerumun…..Walaupun diajak bicara sepertinya mereka tidak mendengar</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Aku juga sih tidak melihatnya secara langsung tapi memang aneh sekali kan?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">会觉得有点奇怪吧? 我也是不相信, 不过你听了他们说的话就会觉得也有这样的可能.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">不就是那样吗? 长的一样的人们, 互不理对方... 即使在耳旁讲话也好像没听到</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_36_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_37_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I didn't see it with my own eyes, but it just sounds very strange. So, you must hand the Exit Approval Form to the Student Director.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ini, jangan lupa menyerahkan Pass Application ke Student Director</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">总之，只要出示Exit Approval Form给位在Administration Office的 Student Director就可以了。注册几乎都完成了。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_37_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Yes, we are the best shop to manage the items flow...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ya, itu adalah kontrol langsung dari Head Quarter… tentang masalah pendistribusian</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">是的。本社可以说是管理最佳的物流直营店…。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Hmm... Are you asking about items? You can get some items after defeating an enemy. Stronger enemies drop better items.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Yang kamu maksud itu item.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jika kamu mendapatkan item yang bagus namun tidak tahu akan digunakan atau tidak, ataupun juga kamu lebih membutuhkan uang daripada tem itu, bawalah kepada aku.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">道具的话… 您说的是物品吧。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">打倒敌人的话,，就可获得一些道具。敌人越强，其会掉落的道具也就越好。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">득도의 경지에 이른 ‘마루치’ 와 ‘아라치’ 의 기운이 서로 만날 때 이르는 경지를 가리키는 말이라고 들었는데요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">득도의 경지에 이른 ‘마루치’ 와 ‘아라치’ 의 기운이 서로 만날 때 이르는 경지를 가리키는 말이라고 들었는데요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">득도의 경지에 이른 ‘마루치’ 와 ‘아라치’ 의 기운이 서로 만날 때 이르는 경지를 가리키는 말이라고 들었는데요</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">'마루치' 에 대해 묻는다</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">'마루치' 에 대해 묻는다</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">'마루치' 에 대해 묻는다</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_shop1.ntk_6_0_2">
