  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_37_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Mastering the use of a bow is very difficult. There are many different archery styles, but you must start by learning the fundamental techniques.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalian pelajar kelas archery jangan hanya mengandalkan kekuatan fisik saja POW, tapi kalian juga harus meningkatkan DEX juga supaya membantumu mencapai tujuan,</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tapi hati-hati, POWnya jangan sampai diabaikan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">要专精弓箭是不简单的事情。因为弓箭部的种类多得不计其数。首先，您需要学会基本功。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_37_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_38_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The ability to attack a target from long range is the primary advantage of the Archery Section.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Setiap menaiki level, pendistribusian point mempengaruhi pertumbuhan.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pelajar yang berkonsentrasi pada DEX, akan digolongkan menjadi golongan 'panah cepat', yaitu pemanah yang bisa memanah dengan cepat</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">弓箭部的主打强项就是远距离攻击。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_38_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_39_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">힘과 민첩과 체력에 나누게 되면 보다 강한 공격을 할 수 있지만 발사속도가 떨어지는 강공형으로,</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">힘과 민첩과 체력에 나누게 되면 보다 강한 공격을 할 수 있지만 발사속도가 떨어지는 강공형으로,</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">힘과 민첩과 체력에 나누게 되면 보다 강한 공격을 할 수 있지만 발사속도가 떨어지는 강공형으로,</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_39_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">ゐ???</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">ゐ???</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">ゐ???</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Concentration is the most important thing when using a bow.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Hal yang paling penting saat menggunakan panah adalah konsentrasi</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">使用弓箭时，最重要的部分就是集中力。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_40_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">민첩과 기력과 지력에 나누게 되면 기를 이용한 공격과 기술을 지닐 수 있는 기공형으로 성장할 수 있으니 참고하도록 해라.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">민첩과 기력과 지력에 나누게 되면 기를 이용한 공격과 기술을 지닐 수 있는 기공형으로 성장할 수 있으니 참고하도록 해라.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">민첩과 기력과 지력에 나누게 되면 기를 이용한 공격과 기술을 지닐 수 있는 기공형으로 성장할 수 있으니 참고하도록 해라.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_40_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">처음으로</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">처음으로</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">처음으로</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_41_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">......4-1</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">......4-1</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">......4-1</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_42_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Don't invest too many Stat Points in physical strengths since characters also benefit from concentration and other attributes.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Now, it's not always possible, but it's ideal if an archer can always maintain a safe distance from his enemies.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Untuk memusatkan konsentrasi ke tingkat yang paling tinggi kamu tidak perlu memikirkan hal yang tidak berguna seperti memperbesar otot</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">别投资太多的能力点数在体力方面，因为角色也是需要提高集中力和其他属性能力的。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">要和敌人维持一定的安全距离是件艰难的挑战。不过为了保护自身不受到目标物的攻击，要多多小心唷。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_42_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_43_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Try to keep your distance from your target, especially when you suddenly find yourself in a close encounter.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mungkin ini terdengar seperti bualan saja, tapi harus diingat bahwa pemanah yang memanah dengan alasan seperti itu harus selalu menjaga target dan jarak</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">若不小心踏入了近距战斗程，仍得努力保持和敌方的一丁点儿安全距离。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_43_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_44_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You'll probably fare better if you form a group with other players since you have relatively weak defenses.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Apabila harus mendekati musuh dengan terpaksa, tetap usahakan untuk membuat jarak dengan musuh</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Karena pertahanannya lemah, lebih baik kamu bersatu dengan anggota lain yang bisa memberikan kamu perlindungan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">因为您的防御力较弱，建议和其他伙伴一起组队会比较好。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_44_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_45_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">........5</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">........5</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">........5</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_46_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Nonetheless, try not to ignore your Strength stat.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tapi kamu harus tahu kalau Archery mengharuskan untuk mempelajari jurus tentang ilmu panah dari dasar sambil melihat bagaimana cara menggunakan panah</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">尽管如此，记住别忽略了您的力量使用。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_46_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_47_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You are awarded 3 Stat Points each time your character levels up. Your character's build and growth is determined by how these Stat Points are allocated to your character's attributes.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">If you concentrate on Dexterity, you will develop great Attack Speed and become a Fast Attack Type.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Distributing Stat Points evenly to Strength and Dexterity, and investing some into Vitality, will develop your character into a Power Attack Type.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Lastly, distributing the points evenly to Strength and Dexterity and some to Intelligence will build a Skill Type character.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jurus dasar dari Archery adalah untuk melukai sebanyak-banyaknya kepada target dan meminimalkan bahaya dengan cari tidak mendekati target</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">角色成功晋级，已发送了3个能力点数。依据该点数的各个属性分配，角色会以相同方式被朔造定型。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">如果您将能力集中在敏捷，则能强化攻速，成为速攻型高手。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">若将点数均匀分配在力量和敏捷，并稍微着重一些在体力，那么您的角色将成为PowerAttack型高手。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">另外，如果您把点数加在力量和敏捷方面，又稍着重一些精神的话，就能使您的角色变身为Skill型高手唷。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_47_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_48_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">......5-2</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">......5-2</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">......5-2</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_49_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">'K'키로 스킬창을 열고 가장 오른편의 '기공' 항목에서 '거절'을 선택한 뒤 열리는 왼편 윗편의 슬롯에 위치시키게 되면 그 순간부터 오른쪽 클릭으로 '거절' 기술을 쓸 수 있을거야.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">주변의 적들을 튕겨내는 기술이니 유용하게 쓰도록 해.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">'K'키로 스킬창을 열고 가장 오른편의 '기공' 항목에서 '거절'을 선택한 뒤 열리는 왼편 윗편의 슬롯에 위치시키게 되면 그 순간부터 오른쪽 클릭으로 '거절' 기술을 쓸 수 있을거야.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">주변의 적들을 튕겨내는 기술이니 유용하게 쓰도록 해.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">'K'키로 스킬창을 열고 가장 오른편의 '기공' 항목에서 '거절'을 선택한 뒤 열리는 왼편 윗편의 슬롯에 위치시키게 되면 그 순간부터 오른쪽 클릭으로 '거절' 기술을 쓸 수 있을거야.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">주변의 적들을 튕겨내는 기술이니 유용하게 쓰도록 해.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_49_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">?쩊홁</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">?쩊홁</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">?쩊홁</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You need to use your skills more frequently if you want to master the art of instantly killing your enemies.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Students from the Archery Section need not to depend solely on strength. Consider upgrading your character's agility to increase the accuracy of hitting you targets.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Iya, mengkonfirmasi ulang hal-hal yang mendasar adalah suatu tindakan yang bagus.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Archery itu adalah Memanah dengan menggunakan gaya barat</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">要不断地使用技能，才有办法攻破敌人的致命要害。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">弓箭部的朋友们，请别只想凭借蛮力。务必考虑提升角色的敏捷度，来增加攻击目标的准确度。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_50_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">......7</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">......7</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">......7</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_51_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">그 양 옆에 ‘매점’ 하고 ‘락커룸’이 있으니까 가 봐</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">그리고 학원생 등록에 대해서는 ‘매점’ 바로 옆에 ‘교무실’의 ‘학생주임’께 꼭 말씀드리고</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">그 양 옆에 ‘매점’ 하고 ‘락커룸’이 있으니까 가 봐</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">그리고 학원생 등록에 대해서는 ‘매점’ 바로 옆에 ‘교무실’의 ‘학생주임’께 꼭 말씀드리고</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">그 양 옆에 ‘매점’ 하고 ‘락커룸’이 있으니까 가 봐</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">그리고 학원생 등록에 대해서는 ‘매점’ 바로 옆에 ‘교무실’의 ‘학생주임’께 꼭 말씀드리고</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_51_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">짾??</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">짾??</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">짾??</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_52_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">‘양호실’에 가면 상처치료도 해 주니까 미리 가서 인사나 드리도록 해</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">‘양호실’에 가면 상처치료도 해 주니까 미리 가서 인사나 드리도록 해</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">‘양호실’에 가면 상처치료도 해 주니까 미리 가서 인사나 드리도록 해</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_52_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">?쩊홁</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">?쩊홁</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">?쩊홁</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_53_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">.......9</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">.......9</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">.......9</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_54_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">There aren't too many normal human beings around anymore. Most have already been transformed into evil monsters. Although it's a really bad situation, it's not like things can't be changed for the better.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Please remember this.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Di sekitar sekolah sudah jarang orang normal, yang tersisa hanya monster yang menghancurkan apapun yang mereka lihat. Jangan sampai lupa bahwa orang yang bisa menyelesaikan masasalah ini adalah hanya kalian</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">妖怪了。虽然这情况很糟糕，但并不是无药可救的地步。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_54_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_55_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The teachers are doing all that they can to return things back the way they should be.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Aku juga ingin agar semua ini kembali seperti semula secepatnya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">学校的老师们正尽全力将所有的人事物恢复成原来的样子。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_55_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_56_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">.....10</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">.....10</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">.....10</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_57_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Like I said before, these violent monsters are wrecking our campus.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Please get out there, and keep them from causing even more destruction.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sekarang di daerah sekitar sekolah sudah tidak ada orang-orang yang normal lagi, hanya ada monster yang menghancurkan apapun yang mereka lihat</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">如同我先前说过的，现在有许多暴力怪物在破坏校园，请向前阻止，给他们一点颜色瞧瞧，并维持校园治安吧。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_57_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_58_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Know that carelessness may result in you ending up in a really bad situation.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau kamu lengah sedikit saja di daerah sekitar sekolah kamu bisa kehiangan nyawa</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">要记住，只要稍不留神，就会让你跌进万恶深渊。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_58_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_59_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Remember that you'll be entering a world full of dangers once you submit the Exit Approval Form. Please be careful out there!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Exit Approval yang kamu tuliskan berisikan tentang segala resiko akan bahaya, ingatlah itu baik-baik!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">要知道一不小心，就会导致您陷入非常糟糕的局面。别忘记，只要你提交外出申请单，就是进入危险可怕世界的时候了。在外闯荡时，请小心安全。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_59_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Skill Points are set at 0 at the start. Each time your character's level increases, you will be awarded with 1 Skill Point. You can use these Skill Points to learn new skills or upgrade existing skills.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Most skills will require you to consume Skill Points in order to learn them.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You should have more than enough Skill Points at the beginning since the starting skills won't require many Skill Points.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You'll find, however, that you might not have enough points to learn some of the later skills. Think and plan carefully, and choose the essential skills that you want to learn.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pertama dimulai dari '0' dan setiap naik level akan mendapatkan '1' buah 'Skill Point'</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Skill point akan digunakan setiap kali mempelajari skill pertama kali dan menaikan level</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Skill pada fase awal tidak membutuhkan banyak point jadi mungkin akan ban</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">技能点数从0个开始计算，每当角色等级晋级时，就会增加 1个技能点数。您可利用这些技能点数，来学习新的技能，亦或是提升旧技能的等级。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">所有的技能都需要花费您的技能点数来进行学习。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">一开始，您的技能点数绝对是足够的，因为初期的要求不会太严格。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">但之后，可能会发生技能点数不够用，导致该学的技能无法学的窘境。必须先谨慎思考，利用有限的技能点数，搭配好您真正期望的技能之树。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_60_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Oh... So you saw the List of Saints.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It's true that there's nothing wrong with the list.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ah, but you're probably curious about what's behind it. Am I right?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Why are there so many students with family problems?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It's quite simple, actually.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Not too many loving parents would send their children to an experimental school.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Even if extraordinary benefits were offered, most parents would think that traditions set by normal schools are more important.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kamu sudah liat Saint List rupanya…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sebenarnya tidak ada masalah dengan daftarnya.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tapi tetap penasaran… iya kan?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kenapa banyak sekali keluarga yang memiliki masalah…?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jika dipikir-pikir ini hal yang sepele tapi...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sebenarnyakan hanya sedik</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">噢，您看过了这份圣徒列表！没错，就是这些内容。哦，我猜您很好奇它的背景故事，对吧？为何会有这么多的学生被难解的家庭问题所困扰呢？答案很简单。就是，并没有太多的父母会愿意把子女送到具有实验性质的学校念书。就算福利再好，他们还是比较信任普通学校所走的传统路线。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_60_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tetap mendengarkan.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">继续</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_61_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Many people raise this question...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">What is forgiveness, and does it work?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Oh, but it's not like I have the right to teach you anything.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Why should I force what little I know upon you?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You know that there are arenas in the Trading Hole.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You can find teachers that can teach you more over there.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Banyak orang yang mempertanyakannya…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Apakah itu perbuatan yang dapat diampuni atau perbuatan yang layak dapat pujian.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tetapi..aku sebagai pengajar semua itu tidak benar..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Aku juga sebenarnya dipaksa untuk mengerjakan sesuatu yang aku tak ketahui</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">很多人提出不少疑问，例如，什么是可以原谅的？被原谅是件好事吗？不过我觉得我没有资格教您们这些东西。我不能仅仅仗着比您懂多一点，就对您颐指气使。您知道在Trading Hole有不少竞技场，对吧？在那边，您可以找到适合您的老师唷。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_archer1.ntk_61_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Begin</VALUE>
