  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex1.ntk_19_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Do you think that this trash still needs to be gathered?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It'd definitely be better for us Street Cleaners if all the garbage and trash was sorted and collected.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Please help us out, okay?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Para Cleaner mengatakan mereka mengumpulkan Currency tersebut, jika tidak ditindak lanjuti akan menjadi masalah besar</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">您认为这个垃圾还需要收集？</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">如果所有的垃圾和垃圾都能进行分类收集的话， Street Cleaners会很开心的。请帮助我们，好吗？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex1.ntk_19_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
