    <VALUE Lang="cn">传达药品</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_1_5_13">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Apply for Test</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mendaftar ujian</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">申请测验</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_1_5_14">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Check the Test Results</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Konfirmasi hasil ujian</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">确认测试结果</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_1_5_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Listen to Conversation</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mendengarkan cerita</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">听取对话</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_1_5_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Investigate Shouting</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Konfirmasi panggilan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">请求调查</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_1_5_4">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Apply for the Examination</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ujian dari Physiscs Teacher</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">申请考试</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_1_5_5">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Verify the Exam Results</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Konfirmasi hasil ujian</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">确认考试结果</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_1_5_6">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Accept Order (Currency Notes Verification)</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menerima petunjuk</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">接受指示 (纸币验证)</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_1_5_7">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Give the Order Document</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menyerahkan Orders Book</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">传达指令文件</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_1_5_8">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about Leonair Campus's Location</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya dimana lokasi Leonine School</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问 Leonair 学院的位置</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_1_5_9">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Confirmation of Pieces of Map</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Konfirmasi Pieces of Map</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">确认地图纸片</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_10_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It's good that you want to take the examination.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">In any case, students and teachers will have their abilities examined on a regular basis.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I hope you don't mind this too much.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bagus, ternyata kamu orang yang sangat aktif</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bagaimanapun, jangan melihat para pelajar atapun guru melakukan ujian reguler untuk mengukur skill mereka adalah hal yang menyebalkan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">自发性地接受考试是不错啦!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">反正学生或是老师都会定期考试来测定能力,希望你不要觉得烦</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_10_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_11_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Great, you did really well!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Now that you've grown stronger and reached your current level, you'll easily be able to handle the dangers that lie ahead.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Don't rest on your laurels, though: you'll need to regularly take ability examinations to keep in good shape.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Euhm, bagus</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ujian kali ini harus bisa lulus, sehingga kedepannya tidak ada yang perlu dikhawatirkan lagi..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pokoknya ujian kemampuan yang ditentukan selesai di sini</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">嗯!很好!算是良好的</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这种程度是稳可以过的,用这试着去想以后,这样想的话就理所当然的东西也…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">总之定期能力测验就这样了</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_11_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Accept Order (Currency Notes Verification)</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menerima petunjuk</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">接受指令 (验证纸币)</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_11_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_12_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The Cleaner gave me these things before he left.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Yes, actually it doesn't look any different from regular money, but you can tell it's counterfeit if you look very carefully.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">This counterfeit was skillfully crafted. I'm sure that it'd easily pass for genuine money.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sebenarnya barusan Pak Cleaner memberikan sesuatu lalu pergi</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Yeah, bentuknya menyerupai uang, namun jika dilihat secara seksama itu adalah palsu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Namun masalah lain timbul karena ada juga yang beranggapan itu bukanlah palsu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">事实上不久前清道夫大叔给我这就走了!!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">是阿,看起来跟钱没两样,不过仔细看是伪钞</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">但问题是询问之后,却有并非伪钞的反应出现</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_12_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_13_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Looks like these Currency Notes contain something important. For now, it'd be wise to pick up items that people drop on the streets.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sepertinya currency/ uang kertas yang dimaksud sangat penting…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Aku juga akhir-akhir ini melihatnya banyak yang jatuh di jalan, untuk sementara akan aku kumpulkan terlebih dahulu...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">那纸币似乎确实有什么重要的东西</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">现在在路上常会看见有掉落的东西,先捡起来收着吧!</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_13_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about Leonair Campus's Location</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mendengarkan informasi tentang Leonine School</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问Leonair Campus的位置</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_14_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I am pretty sure that it was located near the Trading Hole Passage, but one day it suddenly disappeared!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jelas sekali kalau dulu ada di atas Sacred Gate's Park yang ada di sekitar Sacred Gate's Tunnel</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tapi suatu hari tiba-tiba menghilang</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">以前明明就在Trading Hole隧道Passage的附近</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">但是某天突然消失不见</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_14_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_15_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It's perfect! The pieces of the map still exist. Even the teachers weren't aware of this!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Potongan Map itu benar-benar tersisa rupanya!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Untung saja…siapa sangka kalau masih ada di sana…Para guru juga tidak tahu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">地图的纸片真的还在呀</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">搞不好老师也不知道至今还在,真是太好了</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_15_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_16_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Hmm...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I need someone to do something for me.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I'll continue to do my part to help clear up this situation in order to ensure the safety of the students as well as the citizens.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Unfortunately, the mobs plaguing this area have multiplied dramatically.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Euhm, sebenarnya memeng ada kerjaan untuk kamu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menjaga keamanan para pelajar dan warga sekitar, kita memang berusaha untuk membereskan semuanya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Akhir-akhir ini orang-orang yang membuat kerusuhan di sekitar sini bertambah banyak</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">嗯!要不然之前是有要你做的事情啦</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">为了确保学生跟市民最基本的安全是持续整理中没错</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">但最近这周围为非作歹的家伙变多了</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_16_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_17_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Well done!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The Sacred Financial Group will always appreciate your help in transporting reinforcements and supplies.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bagus, kamu sudah berusaha dengan baik</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Akan ada banyak hal yang harus kamu lakukan sebelum kiriman bantuan dari yayasan tiba</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">很好 做的很好</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">往后财团中有补给或支援的时候要你做的事情会很多喔</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_17_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_18_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You came at the right time.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It would be unwise to say that we can hold up for another week.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Although this situation is temporary, we will still need to know how to solve these kinds of problems in the future.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kamu telah menyelesaikannya dengan tepat waktu rupanya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau ada cadangan sebanyak ini, untuk sementara waktu sepertinya kita bisa bertahan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mungkin jauh kedepannya baru akan menjadi masalah</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saat itu kalian harus berpikir dengan otak kalian…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">
    </VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_18_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_19_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">....3</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">....3</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">....3</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">…......</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">처음으로</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">처음으로</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">처음으로</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_2_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">물품 매매</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">물품 매매</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">물품 매매</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_20_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Good! Do you remember now?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau meliwati tunnel yang ada di sana ada Sacred gate town terus ada jalan menuju Mystic peak town dan Sacred gate school</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Iya bener, sekarang ingat?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">很好，现在您有想起来什么来了吗？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_20_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_21_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">...4</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">...4</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">...4</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_22_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I don't have the time to explain these things to you. I'll just sum it up in one sentence.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">There aren't many normal people around this here. Please be careful in approaching strangers.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya beritahu kamu satu hal saja, karena untuk saat ini sangat tidak mungkin bila saya menceritakan semuanya dengan detail</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Di daerah sekitar sini hampir tidak ada lagi orang yang normal, jangan menilai hanya dengan penampilan mereka saja tetapi harus l</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">现在没办法拉哩拉杂说一堆,我只告诉你一句话</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">现在周围几乎没有正常的人,千万不要只因为外表就去接近</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_22_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_23_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">....10</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">....10</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">....10</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_24_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Our enemies are growing in power.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">They're becoming better skilled, and their numbers are gradually increasing. They'll become quite formidable if left unchecked.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">We can't relax and just assume that we're better than them.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sekalian untuk menghilangkan kepercayaan diri yang berlebihan, karena kamampuan dari para musuh juga terus berubah</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">敌人的能力也在变,稍微有变强,要顺便消除自负的态度</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_24_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_25_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">......12</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">......12</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">......12</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_26_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Moreover, this currency looks like it has ancient writing that probably has some hidden meaning.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Please take this money for note verification.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Disekitarnya terpancar tulisan-tulisan aneh seperti tulisan ganil…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kayaknya currency ini sendiri mempunyai arti yang lain, tolong bawakan kesini ya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">而且纸币周围反射奇怪的文字，似乎是古代的神秘暗号。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">总之，这些纸币本身似乎带有什么意义，拜托你拿去确定一下。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_26_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_27_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You need to take these to the Technical Teacher.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Aaa, kalau yang ini harus aku simpan, lebih baik kamu minta selembar lagi ke Technical teacher saja sana</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">阿！这必须由老师保管。拿去给Technical Teacher一张比较好吧。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_27_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_28_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">....14</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">....14</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">....14</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_29_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Moreover, the place is now filled with weird mobs that appeared shortly after the abnormal phenomenon began.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ditambah lagi di tempat itu ada gedung-gedung yang sepertinya sudah dibangun sejak dulu dan ditinggali oleh banyak orang</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Waktunya sangat bertepatan dengan saat kecelakaan terjadi</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">而且那个位置阿,从以前就有的东西,像建筑物现在却被侵入的人们占据</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">虽说异象出现的时机精确的一致</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_29_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You should know the answers to your own questions. It's not your first time here.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Your point of reference should be the Sacred Gate Park: to its right is the Phoenix Campus, to the left is Mystic Peak Campus, and to the south is Sacred Gate Campus.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Apa… kenapa bertanya seperti pendatang baru?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kamu juga jangan-jangan jadi aneh?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">什么 一定就像第一次来这里的人问的</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">朝着Sacred Gate Park，往右边走是Phoenix Campus，往左边走的话是Mystic Peak Campus，往后面走是Sacred Gate Campus阿。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_30_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The big problem right now is to confirm the exact location of Leonair Campus.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">We have received contrasting information regarding its location. Some say it's south of Sacred Gate Park, while others say it's to the north.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It's really confusing, and the only way to pinpoint its exact location is to go there ourselves.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Masalahnya bukan itu, tapi masalah sebenarnya Leonine School itu ada dimana</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ada orang yang bilang kalau sekolah itu ada di bagian selatan Sacred Gate's park, ada juga yang bilang ada di bagian utaranya. Kalau tidak dikonfirmasi kita tidak bisa tahu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">
    </VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">问题不出在那，而是Leonair Campus现在到底在哪里。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">有人说在Sacred Gate Park的南边；也有人说在北边。太混乱了！我想若不直接去确定的话，根本无法得知。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_30_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_31_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It's a good thing that Cheng Xi Zhi, a student in the Archery Section, was able to verify the location of Leonair Campus and was able to draw a map.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Unfortunately, the map was stolen and torn to pieces. We still don't know who did it.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tapi kebetulan ada pelajar dari Leonine School kelas archery yang bernama Heeji sung yang tahu lokasi Leonine School dan telah membuat map, setelah aku cari tahu ternyata……</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tetapi map itu telah direbut oleh rombongan yang tidak dikenal dan dipotong-pot</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">但是听说刚好有个叫做Cheng Xi Zhi的射箭部学生,确定了Leonair Campus的位置，还做了张地图。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">不幸地，那地图却被怪人抢夺，被撕成一片一片的。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_31_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_32_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The identities of the thieves aren't important.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Right now, we need to find the pieces of that map.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Aku tidak tahu siapa rombongan itu, tapi yang lebih penting adalah kalau potongan-potongan map itu harus bisa ditemukan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">虽然不知道那怪人是谁,重要的是如何找到那被撕成一片片的地图</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_32_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_33_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I heard that there were some clowns in the area when the map was torn up.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Hmm...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Do you think this clue will be enough to lead us to the pieces of the map?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Katanya para Clown ada di sekitar tempat dimana map disob다, mungkin saja kita bisa mencari potongannya disana?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">地图被撕破的时候，附近有小丑Clown聚集，您觉得这样的线索是不是足够我们去破解呢?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_33_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_34_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">.....15</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">.....15</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">.....15</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_35_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">We have fewer than 7 pieces of the map, and they're all in pretty bad condition.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Coba kita lihat... potongan yang jumlahnya hanya tujuh. ini kok sangat memusingkan yah?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">来看看 剩不到七张,怎么这么乱阿!</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_35_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_36_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Even if it seems impossible, I have to try and put these pieces together.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The writing is sloppy, the drawings look terrible, the paper is crumpled, and the edges of the pieces just don't fit together right...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kayaknya ini bukan sesuatu yang aku bisa gabungkan deh</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tulisannya tidak rapi, ditambah gambarnya tidak teratur, kerusakannya juga parah jadi saya tidak yakin ini bisa digabungkan atau tidak</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">哎呀!不管老师再怎么拼凑都不行的吧,</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">字太草,图案也不规则,损伤很严重,连接线不确实</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_36_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_37_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The Student Director is experienced in working with archeological evidence. Maybe he might be able to put those torn pieces of paper back together.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Student Director dari Scred Gate School katanya pernah coba menggali peningaalan sejarah, mungkin dia juga bisa menggabungkan ini</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">Student Director有做过遗迹挖掘，搞不好可以拼凑的起来。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_37_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_38_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">....16</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">....16</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">....16</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_39_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">We can't let a lack of manpower deter us from stopping this evil from spreading. The consequences will be catastrophic if we fail.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It'd be advisable to address the problem now before it gets out of control.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Karena jumlahnya kurang, kalau dibiarkan seperti ini kita tidak tahu apa yang akan terjadi nanti</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pada saat kita ada waktu luang, ada bagusnya untuk menghilangkan semua yang menjadikan bencana</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">不管怎样,因为数字不足就这样放着,往后不知该怎办</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">即使只有一点点余力,如能将会造成祸端的东西消失就太好了</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_39_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">C'mon! Don't make your teacher feel bad by acting like you don't care.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Huh? Where'd the teacher go?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau kamu bertanya dengan tampang yang sepertinya tidak tahu apa-apa begitu, para guru bisa-bisa jadi sedih nih~</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau sekarang, para guru juga pasti sudah pergi jauh</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">用这样一脸无知的表情问的话,教你们的老师会很忧郁的</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">哎呀!现在那个老师不知走到多远去了</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_40_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">....18</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">....18</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">....18</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_41_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Please help me retrieve the medicines listed on this document.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sampaikan Letter of Opinion sekalian mengkonfirmasi kalau item sudah diterima dengan baik</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Aku kumpulkan item yang mungkin saja dibutuhkan sebagai persediaan, jangan sampai lupa untuk menyampaikannya yah</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">恩!! 麻烦你帮我传达需要接到物品的意见书,如果可以补给的话,就请他将此清单上面的药品拿给我,谢谢你搂</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_41_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_42_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Your mission is to slay the monster called Ice Master.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I won't give you a time limit like in past missions, so give it your best shot.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">O, mau melakukan ujian sendiri, hebat juga!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau gitu udah nggak perlu perkenalan lagi dong?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Susah juga untuk mencari tugas yang sesuai</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Iya, kayaknya segitu udah cukup deh</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau pelajar sekelas pasti tahu kan tentang ice tyrant?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kenapa t</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">喔?你的任务是杀死叫做冰法师‘Ice Master’的怪物。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我不会给你限制时间，所以您可以放心地慢慢完成任务。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_42_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_43_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You beat the Ice Master? I guess you can handle the cold.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Anyway, you pass the mission.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Waw?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Beneran sudah mengalahkan makhluk es itu?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Wah, benar-benar kuat dan nggak bisa diremehkan nieh</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Karena dia sangat dingin, dia jenis orang yang tidak bisa aku hadapi dulu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pokoknya, kamu lulus ujian ini</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mungkin tidak akan ada ujian lagi</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">你打了‘Ice Master’？</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">哇！我想你不用再害怕寒冷了。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">恭喜您过关了！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_43_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_44_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Are you going to Root Hole?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It's strange that time has stopped. I thought the 공간축 might have changed...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I knew that the Saint building is located in Root Hole.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Hopefully, you'll be able to have a look inside Root Hole.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mau pergi ke arah Root Hole lagi?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tidak disangka banget waktu tiba-tiba telah berhenti</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya pikir dimensi yang akan berubah</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lagian membayangkan saja memang susah, kalau dimensi berubah</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tahu kan, kalau kantor pusat yayasan ada di Root Hole?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">您要去Root Hole吗？</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">那儿能停止时间， 很神奇。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我想空间轴应该是被改变了。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我知道财团总社Saint building位在Root Hole。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">希望您也能逛逛。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_44_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">득도의 경지에 이른 ‘마루치’ 와 ‘아라치’ 의 기운이 서로 만날 때 이르는 경지를 가리키는 말인데</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">본래는 소승불교에서 모든 번뇌를 뚫고 이치를 깨달아 열반의 경지에 이른 성자를 말이고 ‘나한’ 이라고도 하지</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">득도의 경지에 이른 ‘마루치’ 와 ‘아라치’ 의 기운이 서로 만날 때 이르는 경지를 가리키는 말인데</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">본래는 소승불교에서 모든 번뇌를 뚫고 이치를 깨달아 열반의 경지에 이른 성자를 말이고 ‘나한’ 이라고도 하지</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">득도의 경지에 이른 ‘마루치’ 와 ‘아라치’ 의 기운이 서로 만날 때 이르는 경지를 가리키는 말인데</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">본래는 소승불교에서 모든 번뇌를 뚫고 이치를 깨달아 열반의 경지에 이른 성자를 말이고 ‘나한’ 이라고도 하지</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">'깨달음의 열쇠' 에 대해 묻는다</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">'깨달음의 열쇠' 에 대해 묻는다</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">'깨달음의 열쇠' 에 대해 묻는다</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_5_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">'나한의 구슬' 에 대해 묻는다</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">'나한의 구슬' 에 대해 묻는다</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">'나한의 구슬' 에 대해 묻는다</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_5_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">처음으로</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">처음으로</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">처음으로</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">그 열쇠를 지니고 있다면 재단에 보관중인 걸 받을 수도 있게 된다는 얘기는 들었지</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">하지만 지금은 조각조각으로 나뉘어져 있을테니까 일단 7조각을 모으게 되면 나한테 가져오도록 해</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">그 열쇠를 지니고 있다면 재단에 보관중인 걸 받을 수도 있게 된다는 얘기는 들었지</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">하지만 지금은 조각조각으로 나뉘어져 있을테니까 일단 7조각을 모으게 되면 나한테 가져오도록 해</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">그 열쇠를 지니고 있다면 재단에 보관중인 걸 받을 수도 있게 된다는 얘기는 들었지</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">하지만 지금은 조각조각으로 나뉘어져 있을테니까 일단 7조각을 모으게 되면 나한테 가져오도록 해</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">처음으로</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">처음으로</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">처음으로</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">아, 그 녹색 구슬 말이지?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">그냥 하나씩만으로는 별다를 게 없는데 30개를 다 합쳐서 목걸이를 만들면 꽤 쓸만해 진다지</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">아, 그 녹색 구슬 말이지?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">그냥 하나씩만으로는 별다를 게 없는데 30개를 다 합쳐서 목걸이를 만들면 꽤 쓸만해 진다지</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">아, 그 녹색 구슬 말이지?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">그냥 하나씩만으로는 별다를 게 없는데 30개를 다 합쳐서 목걸이를 만들면 꽤 쓸만해 진다지</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_7_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">처음으로</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">처음으로</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">처음으로</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_8_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Okay, let's see...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">How shall I say this?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mau dengar cerita apa?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">OK！让我想想.....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我该怎么跟您解释呢？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_8_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask for Directions</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya jalan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问指示</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_8_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about Situation</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang situasi</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问现况</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_ex2.ntk_9_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ah, I've heard the Construction Supervisor mention this before. I really appreciate that you accepted my request.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It'd be wise to accept all the help you can get. Keep up the good work.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">O iya, aku dengar dari Supervisor Construction</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Beliau sangat berteri makasih karena kamu memenuhi permintaan dia</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mereka juga sudah sedikit tahu bahwa situasi sekarang sangat aneh, kita harus membantu sebisanya. Bagus!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">啊！听Construction Supervisor说过了。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">你接受我的请托，真是非常感谢。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">希望您能得到所有的支援。加油！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
