    <VALUE Lang="GS">망각의 약을 사용하겠다고 한다</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">망각의 약을 사용하겠다고 한다</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">망각의 약을 사용하겠다고 한다</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_medic1.ntk_25_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_medic1.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Unfortunately, I can't help the patients with severe injuries since there isn't much medicine left. I can still treat people that have suffered minor injuries, but I can't help students beyond Level 15 because my skills are still pretty limited.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau luka ringan masih bisa aku obati, tapi kalau luka parah tidak bisa karena persediaan medicine sangat sedikit.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tapi tetap saja kalau kamu sudah melebihi level 15, aku tidak bisa membantu karena sudah diluar kemampuan aku.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这里剩下的药品不多了, 重伤的我已经没办法医治, 但轻伤我还是可以协助治疗.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">不过, 如果学生的等级超过15级以上的话, 我可能就会因能力不足, 而帮不上忙了</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_medic1.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_medic1.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">미안, 내 실력으로 학생을 치료했다가는 오히려 해를 입힐지도 몰라.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">미안, 내 실력으로 학생을 치료했다가는 오히려 해를 입힐지도 몰라.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">미안, 내 실력으로 학생을 치료했다가는 오히려 해를 입힐지도 몰라.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_medic1.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_medic1.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I don't think this is a disease. I think this is more like a serious chemical reaction where the victim's body get burned, paralyzed by electricity, or frozen. There's another condition in which the victim's body is petrified.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ini bukan penyakit lebih kepada reaksi kimia</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Badannya terbakar, atau lumpuh, atau membeku….</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ada juga kasus mengeras seperti batu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">与其说是病, 不如说是化学反应让身体着火, 放电麻痹或是冻僵.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">像石头般僵硬的状况也有</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_medic1.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_medic1.ntk_5_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about Burn Effects</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang 'Flame'</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问Burn 效果</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_medic1.ntk_5_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about Paralysis Effects</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang 'Paralysis'</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问Paralysis 效果</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_medic1.ntk_5_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about Freezing Effects</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang 'Froze'</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问Freezing 效果</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_medic1.ntk_5_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Asking about Poisoning Effects</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang 'Poison'</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问Poisoning 效果</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_medic1.ntk_5_0_6">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about Suffocation Effects</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang 'Faint'</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问Suffocation 效果</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_medic1.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I have no idea what the situation outside is like, but judging from what I've heard from the teachers, it doesn't look good at all.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Gimana yah, saya juga kurang tahu soalnya nggak pernah keluar</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya dengar dari para guru yang baru saja keluar kayaknya…terjadi masalah besar…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这个嘛... 因为我又不能出去, 所以不清楚详细状况, 听从外面回来的老师说, 好像大事不妙了…</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_medic1.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_medic1.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Burns will cause the body to weaken, resulting in lower Strength and Stamina. Please be careful since burns can end up being fatal.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ini adalah keadaan dimana stamina menurun karena seluruh tubuh terbakar</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">全身着火之时, 体力状态会减弱</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_medic1.ntk_7_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_medic1.ntk_8_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Paralysis caused by electricity or some other form of shock will cause the body's Movement Speed to slow down.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Keadaan dimana energi terkuras dan gerakan menjadi sangat lambat</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">犹如触电后所有动作都将变慢</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_medic1.ntk_8_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_medic1.ntk_9_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Freezing the body causes it to stiffen, resulting in decreased Movement Speed and Defense. The effects could be fatal if the victim suffers in this condition for a prolonged period of time.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Karena tubuh membeku gerakan menjadi lambat dan pertahanan pun menurun</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau terus dibiarkan, ini bisa membahayakan jadi harus diobati secepatnya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">身体冻僵, 所有动作都会稍稍迟缓, 且防御力减低.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">持续太久会有危险, 可以的话最好尽快治疗</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_medic1.ntk_9_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_nin.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Oh, you are not an Assassin, the friend of darkness seeking the light! I cannot help you!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ah, Kamu bukan Assassin.. Sang pangeran kegelapan. Maaf saya tidak dapat membantumu !!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">噢！您不是寻夜光的忍术部，不好意思，没办法帮您。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_nin.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Trade</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Trade</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">进行交易</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_nin.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">인술부기념주화로 행운에 도전하고 싶어요!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">인술부기념주화로 행운에 도전하고 싶어요!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">인술부기념주화로 행운에 도전하고 싶어요!</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_nin.ntk_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Do your best until we can go back to our home!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lakukan yang terbaik sampai kita bisa kembali ke rumah kita!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">在我们回到原本的星球之前，您一定要尽最全力完成各项任务。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
