  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_spirit1.ntk_10_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I've found out that quests are very difficult at first. But now... It's really hard for me to finish them.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sampai beberapa waktu lalu saja proses tugas tidak pernah seperti ini, saya pikir juga ini sudah sangat keterlaluan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Walaupun semua orang, sampai para guru pergi keluar untuk menyelidiki kejadian itu.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">一开始，这些任务对我来说真的是比登天还难，而现在，要完成它们，仍是需要挤尽我吃奶的力气，非常的难。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_spirit1.ntk_10_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_spirit1.ntk_11_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Hmm? Your registration is almost done.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The next procedure is to request for Exit Approval.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pendaftaran pelajar baru sudah selesai.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Selanjutnya mintalah 'Exit Approval'</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">嗯，您的学院注册差不多完成了。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">接下来是申请外出。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_spirit1.ntk_11_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_spirit1.ntk_12_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Spiritual Spheres are earned by achieving certain character levels. You can use Spiritual Spheres to learn available skills of your choice.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jika kamu mempunyai Spiritual Spheres, berarti kekuatan kamu sudah cukup diakui. Pilihlah Skill yang kamu inginkan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">达到特定等级，就能拿到Spiritual Spheres。您可自由使用Spiritual Spheres来选择可学的技能唷。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
