  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_spirit1.ntk_37_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">.......3</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">.......3</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">.......3</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_spirit1.ntk_38_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Destiny has chosen students to join the Shaman Section.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tapi ada perkumpulan yang dinamakan Shaman Club untuk para pelajar yang terpilih seperti kalian</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">命运让您们与气功部同在一起。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_spirit1.ntk_38_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_spirit1.ntk_39_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The power of your skills lies in your understanding of the Universe's Spirit.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Remember that your goals are not geared toward destruction.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Yang dimaksud dengan Shaman adalah mengerti dan membaurkan komponen nyata dan abstrak yang menyusun dunia ini.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tapi jangan sampai lupa bahwa tujuan dari melakukan hal tersebut adalah untuk membangun bukan menghancurkan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">技能的力量大小取决于对宇宙精神的理解度。请记住，您的目标不该只是进行破坏而已。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_spirit1.ntk_39_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_spirit1.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Focusing your Stat points to Strength and Dexterity makes your character an Attack Type.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">On the other hand, focusing your Stat points to Intelligence makes your character built for Support.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sebagai gantinya lebih baik kamu berpikir untuk berkembang ke tipe serangan dan melindungi dimana skill point didistribusikan ke INT dan bisa menggunakan jimat serangan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">若将能力点数集中分配在力量和敏捷方面，您的角色将能成为Attack型高手。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">若将能力点数集中在精神，那么您的角色将能成为‘辅助’的高手唷。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_spirit1.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about the Enemy</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang musuh</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问敌人的事情</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_spirit1.ntk_4_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_spirit1.ntk_40_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">.....3-2</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">.....3-2</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">.....3-2</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_spirit1.ntk_41_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">After buying the Book of "HP Recovery", press "K" to open the Skill Panel. Click the "HP Recovery" Option in the "Support" menu, and then drag and drop it to a Shortcut Slot. Afterwards, right-click to use it.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Make good use of that skill.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Setelah membeli dan menguasai 'Scroll of Life Recovery', bukalah layar skil dengan menggunakan tombol 'K'. Setelah memilih 'Breath of Iife' pada daftar 'Perlengakapan', kemampuan recovery bisa digunakan dengan cara meletakkan mouse pada slot ujung kiri at</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">您在购买“HP Recovery"的技能文书之后，请先按下滑鼠K键，并打开技能视窗。接着点击"Support"选单里的"HP Recovery" 的选项，并拖曳至热键栏。之后，只要点选滑鼠右键就可以使用技能了！ 好好地使用吧。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_spirit1.ntk_41_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_spirit1.ntk_42_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">.......4-1</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">.......4-1</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">.......4-1</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_spirit1.ntk_43_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It is essential for you to learn how to meditate in peace. This is how you can strengthen your power and eventually tap into your full potential.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Given the current situation, however, there isn't time to think about that now.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau dulu, aku memilih untuk bermeditasi dan bersatu dengan elemen yang ada di sekitar</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tapi dalam situasi sekarang yang seperti ini, cara yang santai seperti itu tidak kepikiran oleh aku</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这是很基本的。您应该要知道如何冥想，这是可以加强您的Power，甚至是可以激发您潜力的好方法。但以现在的情况来看，我们根本没有时间去思考任何事情。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_spirit1.ntk_43_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_spirit1.ntk_43_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">What do you say?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Apa?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">您怎么说呢？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_spirit1.ntk_43_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_spirit1.ntk_44_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You will need skills that can inflict direct damage to your enemies when you must face them.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Walaupun susah, kamu harus bisa merasakan semua elemen yang bergerak disekitar kamu pada saat bertarung dengan musuh</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">您需要学习技能，才能在遇到敌人时，对他们进行致命的攻击。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_spirit1.ntk_44_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_spirit1.ntk_45_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You are awarded 3 Stat Points each time your character levels up. Your character's build and growth is determined by how these Stat Points are allocated to your character's attributes.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kemudian pada saat itu arah pertumbuhan akan diputuskan sesuai dengan distribusi dari 3 skill point yang diberikan setiap kali level naik</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">角色成功晋级，已发送了3个能力点数。依据该点数的各个属性分配，角色会以相同方式被朔造定型。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_spirit1.ntk_45_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_spirit1.ntk_46_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Primarily investing Stat Points in Strength, followed by Dexterity, will develop a Spear Type character that will have strong close-ranged abilities.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau pembagian point dikonsentrasikan pada POW kamu akan digolongkan kepada Spear kuat dimana kemampuan bertarung sangat tinggi. Kalau bisa jauhilah perkembangan ini</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">首先，将点数均匀分配在力量，并适度搭配敏捷，您的角色将能成为‘强悍近战长矛型’高手唷。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_spirit1.ntk_46_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_spirit1.ntk_47_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">......5</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">......5</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">......5</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_spirit1.ntk_48_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Those enemies are just clones of mobs whose minds are unstable.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">They are the opposite of people whose souls are free.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">There are times when you must grant death to free those trapped spirits.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kamu tidak perlu merasa bersalah karena kamu telah membebaskan jiwa-jiwa yang terkurung di dalam tubuh yang telah mati.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tapi….Suatu hari nanti kamu akan dihadapkan kepada situasi dimana kamu harus membunuh seseorang mau tidak mau…Saat itu…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">那些敌人都是已经精神不正常的复制妖怪。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">不同于活人，它们的灵魂已经没有任何意义了。有很多时候，您必须承认死亡一事，对于那些受伤的灵魂们，反倒是一种解脱的好方式。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_spirit1.ntk_48_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_spirit1.ntk_49_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">.....7</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">.....7</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">.....7</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_spirit1.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ah, don't worry, I'm not asking you to kill people.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Those enemies are just clones of mobs whose minds are unstable.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Aaa, jangan khawatir bukan berarti kamu harus membunuhnya..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">angan khawatir karena semua musuh-musuh yang terlihat hanyalah boneka hasil kloning yang berbeda dengan wujud asli mereka.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">噢！别担心。我不是要您去杀人。其实，那些敌人都是妖怪的复制品，它们的精神都很不稳定，请小心。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_spirit1.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_spirit1.ntk_50_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You are required to consume Skills Points when you first learn skills, and as you master them.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Skill' yang di dapatkan pertama kali dan Skill yang didapat setiap menaiki level, akan membutuhkan 'Skill Point'</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">技能学习时，一开始都会要求您支付一些技能点数。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_spirit1.ntk_50_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_spirit1.ntk_51_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You should have more than enough Skill Points at the beginning since the starting skills won't require many Skill Points.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Skill pada fase awal tidak membutuhkan banyak point jadi mungkin akan banyak point yang tersisa</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">一开始，您的技能点数绝对是足够的，因为初期的要求不会太严格。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_spirit1.ntk_51_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_spirit1.ntk_52_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You'll find, however, that you might not have enough points to learn some of the later skills. Think and plan carefully, and choose the essential skills that you want to learn.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pikirkan dengan baik dan kuasai skill yang benar-benar kamu butuhkan. Kamu akan kesulitan apabila nanti kamu tidak bisa belajar skill yang diingankan karena kekurangan skill point</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">但之后，可能会发生技能点数不够用，导致该学的技能无法学的窘境。必须先谨慎思考，利用有限的技能点数，搭配好您真正期望的技能之树。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_spirit1.ntk_52_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_spirit1.ntk_53_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">......8</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">......8</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">......8</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_spirit1.ntk_54_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Oh, and you've got to visit the Student Director at the School Administration Office to register as a student. The office is next to the Welfare Society.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You can get your wounds treated at the First-Aid Room. You'd better know how to get there. Sooner or later, you're probably going to get injured!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Di depan sana ada 'Grocery Merchant' dan Locker Custodian', temuilah mereka</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Terus jangan sampai lupa untuk melapor kepada Student Director tentang pendaftaran pelajar</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">噢！关于学生的注册，您必须去拜访一下那位在Welfare Society旁边Administration Office里的Student Director先生。此外，您也可以到First-Aid Room去接受伤口的治疗。不过，保健室的位置是一定要先打听清楚的，因为您会很容易在战斗中受伤的。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_spirit1.ntk_54_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_spirit1.ntk_55_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">‘양호실’에 가면 상처치료도 해 주니까 미리 가서 인사나 드리도록 해</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">‘양호실’에 가면 상처치료도 해 주니까 미리 가서 인사나 드리도록 해</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">‘양호실’에 가면 상처치료도 해 주니까 미리 가서 인사나 드리도록 해</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_spirit1.ntk_55_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_spirit1.ntk_56_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">...10</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">...10</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">...10</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_spirit1.ntk_57_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Please remember that the evil can't control everyone!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">There aren't too many normal human beings around anymore. Most have already been transformed into evil monsters. Although it's a really bad situation, it's not like things can't be changed for the better.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">tapi kalian tetap tidak boleh lengah dan berdiam saja!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Di sekitar sekolah sudah jarang orang normal, yang tersisa hanya monster yang menghancurkan apapun yang mereka lihat. Jangan sampai lupa bahwa orang yang bisa menyelesaikan masasalah ini adalah han</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">请记住，没有恶灵是可以控制你们的！！！</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这边的人几乎都不算是人了。他们都变成邪恶的妖怪了。虽然这情况很糟糕，但尚未到无药可救的地步。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_spirit1.ntk_57_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_spirit1.ntk_58_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The teachers are doing all that they can to return things back the way they should be. Please remember that.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya juga ingin agar semua ini kembali seperti semula secepatnya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">老师们正尽全力地想要把所有东西都恢复到原状。请别忘记这点。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_spirit1.ntk_58_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_spirit1.ntk_59_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">....11</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">....11</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">....11</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_spirit1.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Your specialty isn't direct fighting.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You must always stay behind your partners, and back them up. Support them so that they can use the full extent of their powers.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalian tidak sesuai dengan pertarungan yang benar dan orang yang tidak boleh sesuai dengan itu.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Selalu ada dibarisan paling belakang untuk membatu teman-teman kalian supaya bisa mengoptimalkan kekuatan mereka, dan melanjutkan peran dari para member pa</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">您本身是不太适合战斗。您可以尽量位在同伴们的后方，给他们提供支援。有您的后勤支援，他们才能够将攻击力发挥得淋漓尽致。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_spirit1.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_spirit1.ntk_6_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Emm! You're obviously able to sense that you've grown stronger. This is a natural result of your training. At your level, it should not be a problem to go outside the campus for training. Go and give it a try.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You'll have to go out and learn more stuff.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Euhm, aku bisa merasakan kalau tenaga dalam kamu sudah bertambah kuat, kamu telah berlatih dengan keras rupanya.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau segitu sepertinya kamu sudah bisa mencoba keluar dari sekolah, coba saja keluar lewat main gate.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau kamu mungkin bisa meraih h</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">嗯！！可以明显感受到您变强了。这表示您过去一直都很努力在练习唷。我想，以您现在的实力来看，直接到学院外面闯荡也是没有问题的！要试试看吗？能力越强，挑战越多，能得到的东西也就越丰盛唷。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_spirit1.ntk_6_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_spirit1.ntk_60_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Now, there's something you need to do before you submit your registration form.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Like I said before, these violent monsters are wrecking our campus. Please get out there, and keep them from causing even more destruction.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Seperti yang sudah aku bilang, mereka yang berada di sekitar sekolah adalah orang-orang yang menghancurkan apapun yang terlihat dan sedang mencari sesuatu yang bisa dihancurkan lagi</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">在提交注册单之前，需要请您先注意一件事情。现在有许多暴力怪物在破坏校园，请向前阻止，给他们一点颜色瞧瞧，并维持校园治安吧。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_spirit1.ntk_60_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_spirit1.ntk_60_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_spirit1.ntk_61_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Know that carelessness may result in you ending up in a really bad situation.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau kamu lengah sedikit saja di daerah sekitar sekolah kamu bisa kehiangan nyawa</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">要知道一不小心，就会导致您陷入非常糟糕的局面。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_spirit1.ntk_61_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_spirit1.ntk_62_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Remember that you'll be entering a world full of dangers once you submit the Exit Approval Form. Please be careful out there!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Exit Approval yang kamu tuliskan berisikan tentang segala resiko akan bahaya, ingatlah itu baik-baik!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">别忘记，只要你提交外出申请单，就是进入危险可怕世界的时候了。在外闯荡时，请小心安全。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_spirit1.ntk_62_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_spirit1.ntk_63_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Oh... So you saw the List of Saints.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It's true that there's nothing wrong with the list.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ah, but you're probably curious about what's behind it. Am I right?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Why are there so many students with family problems?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It's quite simple, actually.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Not too many loving parents would send their children to an experimental school.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Even if extraordinary benefits were offered, most parents would think that traditions set by normal schools are more important.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kamu sudah liat Saint List rupanya…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sebenarnya tidak ada masalah dengan daftarnya.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tapi tetap penasaran… iya kan?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kenapa banyak sekali keluarga yang memiliki masalah…?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jika dipikir-pikir ini hal yang sepele tapi...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sebenarnyakan hanya sedik</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">噢，您看过了这份圣徒列表！没错，就是这些内容。哦，我猜您很好奇它的背景故事，对吧？为何会有这么多的学生被难解的家庭问题所困扰呢？答案很简单。就是，并没有太多的父母会愿意把子女送到具有实验性质的学校念书。就算福利再好，他们还是比较信任普通学校所走的传统路线。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_spirit1.ntk_63_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tetap mendengarkan.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">继续</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_spirit1.ntk_64_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Many people raise this question...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">What is forgiveness, and does it work?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Oh, but it's not like I have the right to teach you anything.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Why should I force what little I know upon you?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You know that there are arenas in the Trading Hole.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You can find teachers that can teach you more over there.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Banyak orang yang mempertanyakannya…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Apakah itu perbuatan yang dapat diampuni atau perbuatan yang layak dapat pujian.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tetapi..aku sebagai pengajar semua itu tidak benar..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Aku juga sebenarnya dipaksa untuk mengerjakan sesuatu yang aku tak ketahui</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">很多人提出不少疑问，例如，什么是可以原谅的？被原谅是件好事吗？不过我觉得我没有资格教您们这些东西。我不能仅仅仗着比您懂多一点，就对您颐指气使。您知道在Trading Hole有不少竞技场，对吧？在那边，您可以找到适合您的老师唷。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_spirit1.ntk_64_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Begin</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">最初</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_spirit1.ntk_65_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">What?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Now, I've told you that you needed to be ready for this situation.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Well, it's too late now.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Maybe you can find the items you need in the Resource Room.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau kamu sudah mendaftar dan bersiap-siap sebelumnya, hal seperti ini pasti bisa kamu selesaikan sendiri……</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau kamu pergi ke Warehouse yang ada di Classroom Center 1, kamu pasti bisa menemukan sesuatu yang berguna disana</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">什么？嗯，我已经告诉过您了，必须随时随地最好准备。现在似乎有点迟了。不过也许您能在Resource Room找到您需要的物品唷。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_spirit1.ntk_65_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Begin</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">最初</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_spirit1.ntk_66_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Spiritual Spheres are earned by achieving certain character levels. You can use Spiritual Spheres to learn available skills of your choice.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jika kamu mempunyai Spiritual Spheres, berarti kekuatan kamu sudah cukup diakui. Pilihlah Skill yang kamu inginkan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">达到特定等级，就能拿到Spiritual Spheres。您可自由使用Spiritual Spheres来选择可学的技能唷。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
