    <VALUE Lang="cn">.......39q</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_t_master1.ntk_108_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">In order to start a Gang, you need at least five (5) members that do not belong to any other Gang. The Gang Leader applicant should be at Character Level 30, and pay a processing fee of 1,000,000 Gold Coins.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Gang Upgrade Charges:</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">[Level D]: 2,000,000 Gold Coins</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">[Level C]: 3,500,000 Gold Coins</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">[Level B]: 5,000,000 Gold Coins</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">[Level A]: 7,000,000 Gold Coins</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sebagai Master party kamu harus sudah melewati level 30 untuk bisa membangun sebuah club dan mempunya minimal 5 orang Member party, ditambah kamu harus mempunyai biaya sebesar 1,000,000. Jangan coba-coba membangun club tanpa tahu apa-apa</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">为了要创设组织, 至少需要由【5名无组织成员】来组成, 且申请创组织的人等级需要在【30级以上】, 以及支付【1,000,000】的创设费。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">【组织升级费用】</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">[Level D]: 2,000,000 Gold Coins</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">[Level C]: 3,500,000 Gold Coins</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">[Level B]: 5,000,000 Gold Coins</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">[Level A]: 7,000,000 Gold Coins</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_t_master1.ntk_108_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_t_master1.ntk_109_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Experience will be lost if you disband or terminate the Gang.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">If you quit a Gang or kicked out of one, then you temporarily won't be allowed to join another Gang. Please remember this.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau club yang pernah dibangun lalu dibubarkan maka kamu akan kehilangan EXP, kamu bisa rugi kalau menganggap sepele hal ini.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Terus ingat juga kalau kamu dikeluarkan dari club atau keluar atas kemauan sendiri, kamu tidak akan bisa mendaftar ke club l</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">并不是一件很简单的事.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">啊, 如果要将已创设的组织解散的话, 就会失掉经验值, 想得太简单的话会有所损失的~</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">脱离已加入的组织或是被除名的话, 暂时会无法加入其它组织, 要记住这点</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_t_master1.ntk_109_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_t_master1.ntk_11_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">구슬 자체로는 그리 대단한 물건이 아니지만 30개를 합치면 꽤 쓸만한 목걸이를 만들 수 있지</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">구슬 자체로는 그리 대단한 물건이 아니지만 30개를 합치면 꽤 쓸만한 목걸이를 만들 수 있지</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">구슬 자체로는 그리 대단한 물건이 아니지만 30개를 합치면 꽤 쓸만한 목걸이를 만들 수 있지</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_t_master1.ntk_11_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_t_master1.ntk_110_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Hmpf. I never expected the situation over there to be that bad.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Please go there and check it out.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Akhir-akhir ini tidak kelihatan.... ternyata sudah berkeliaran sampai sana toh?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Haha…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau dipikir-pikir kamu hebat juga yah</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bisa pergi kesana pake kekuatan kamu sendiri?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Walaupun bukan apa-apa, kamu pelajar yang cukup berguna juga</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ya uda</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">哼, 一度做了安全保证，但去到那里以后却是不同的状况.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">哈哈...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">还有你看有奇特的刮胡刀.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">听说那个地方用力量的话就可以去?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">另外不是只有一件, 真是有成效的学生.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">是?, 那边的事情大概知道了吧</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_t_master1.ntk_110_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_t_master1.ntk_111_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Wei got this document from the Trading Hole Police. You can try to advice him.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">There's nothing I need you to do now. Maybe you can check out the area between Middle Hole and Root Hole.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sampaikan dokumen ini kepada polisi yang ada di Trading Hole</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Dia bisa membantu untuk mengerti situasi yang ada</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sekalian aku peringatkan kamu sesuatu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">喂, 这文件上洞的警察署前找到的.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">可以协助状况掌握.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">还有用老婆的心劝告一下吧…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">一直到?在无事可做，只有在旁边想一些相同的事情.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">中洞那程度的损害跟本洞比起来是非常分明地状况.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">空间…时间... 二个中间其中一个，现在确实地有异常的状况.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">去了理它的差别吧.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">差很多喔</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_t_master1.ntk_111_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_t_master1.ntk_112_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">This cannot be...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pasti penasaran banyak banget</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这不该是...</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_t_master1.ntk_112_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Talk about Sacred Financial Group</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang Yayasan Saint</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">谈谈Sacred Financial Group的事情</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_t_master1.ntk_112_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Get Information about Generation</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang dunia lain</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">听取关于时代的事情</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_t_master1.ntk_113_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Lee Shi Zhang, the Director of the Financial Group, is one of the most sought after Feng Shui masters.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">He became able to foresee the future after that meteor shower 18 years ago...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Director Lee yang membangun yayasan ini cukup terkenal di dunia pendidikan sebagai ilmuwan fheng sui dan geograpi</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">18 tahun yang lalu sewaktu beliau melakukan penyelidikan tentang peristiwa hujan meteor, beliau menemukan sesuatu.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Terus katanya dia b</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">财团的创立者Lee Shi Zhang先生在学界相当有名的风水地理学者，18年前的流星雨事件，在调查中他不知发现了什么秘密的东西，因为那样地做，他就可以预知若干未来的事情...那样的话恐怕他连现在发生的异变都可预知到。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_t_master1.ntk_113_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_t_master1.ntk_114_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Security at the Sacred Financial Group will be tight. The new recruits in their security force won't be too dangerous, but be careful. Their sheer numbers can very well overwhelm you.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sebagai guru yang hanya bertugas untuk mengatur sekolah, saya tidak tahu bagaimana saya bisa sampai kepada keputusan untuk membangun sekolah tapi perkiraan saya mengatakan bahwa kemungkinan terburuk bisa dicegah dengan cara seperti ini</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">只是接受学园管理任务的老师，要创造怎样的学园不知道也还不能做结论， 这样准备的话最坏的事态程度是可以阻止及预想，对吧。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">但是那样的财团的总社周边都有最深重警备状态...但是我相信这些乳臭未干的小子们应该不会失手</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_t_master1.ntk_114_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_t_master1.ntk_115_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Our universe exists side by side with parallel universes in other dimensions. There are theories that our world is merging with those other universes, and we'll eventually coexist with the inhabitants of those other worlds. We won't be able to physically see this once the worlds merge, even if a being from another world is right beside us. Now, if these theories are true, then wouldn't it be possible to travel to other dimensions? Hmm, but these theories still haven't been proven, though.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Dunia yan kita berdiri sekarang ini…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Di sekitarnya ada dunia-dunia yang terhubung pada ruang dan waktu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Karena kita tidak pernah melihat strukturnya secara langsung kita tidak bisa jelaskan bagaimana, tapi kalau lengah ada kemungkinan kalau kita bis</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我们现在居住生存的世界...在周边有数万个空间和​​时间，而让我们这些世界的人们紧系在一起。那构造从人类的眼睛看来，本体并没有，就算一点点也不知如何表现，那样假设与它连接的话可以进入不同的世界，但是听说那样的东西还未确认。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_t_master1.ntk_115_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_t_master1.ntk_116_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I can't even imagine what kinds of things might live in other worlds and dimensions.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">And then there's that idea that, somehow, life native to our world can be combined with life from other worlds, resulting in the creation of a completely new life form. It all sounds so complicated.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Makhluk dari dunia lain datang ke dunia nyata tidak dengan wujud aslinya.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bila jiwa ataupun sel yang datang ke dunia ini bergabung dengan bentuk asalnya maka akan terbentuk satu makhluk yang lain</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Salah satunya adalah makhluk-makhluk yang suka merusa</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这世系的生命体们原原本本用现世系的想法去想的话是不可为的...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">现世系精神细胞一个一个进入并和既存的东西融合的话，用那种方式的话一定又会有不同生命体产生</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">在外面不知在找什么而来往穿梭的家伙们... 那个复杂难懂的事态，它的利害了解吗?"</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_t_master1.ntk_116_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_t_master1.ntk_117_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Root Hole?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Have you heard of a building that belongs to the Sacred Financial Group?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I've been there for the last few years...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Root Hole?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Maksudnya gedung dimana kantor pusat yayasan berada?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">O, Old man yang itu?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Dulu juga aku pernah melihat beliau beberapa kali.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau tidak salah dia kembar kan?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Para petinggi dari yayasan saja tidak bisa bertindak semiteman pada</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">本洞?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">听说有财团总社所属的大楼?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">啊, 听你这样说激励我的灵感</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">在过去我也有看过几次</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">恐怕是好几年前...?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">财团高上的贵族们也只是会到处批评而不做什么事的人罢了</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">到底是怎样的人也不得而知</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">是吗, 那个人真的是这样吗?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_t_master1.ntk_117_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_t_master1.ntk_118_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Eh... Ehhhn...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Heh heh... Those guys only know how to praise students.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">…Eheumm…eheumm</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Haha</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tapi kayaknya Old Man itu suka sama kamu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">soalnya dia jarang banget memuji orang lain.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ya aku sudah mengerti</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">嗯…嗯</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">哈哈</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">家伙, 但是那些老头子们可以进入学生的心中吗</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我看他们只能对学生门说些称赞的话吧</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">大概了解了</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_t_master1.ntk_118_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_t_master1.ntk_119_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Go to the Trading Hole and talk to AngBeeLan. You might be able to learn more.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau pergi ke Trading Hole, kamu bisa menemui seseorang yang bernama Miranda.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Old man akan membantu kamu bila Miranda sudah mengakui kamu.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kamu bisa tahu kenapa kalau sudah bertemu dan mendengarnya langsung dari dia,</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">ayo pergi ke sana</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">去拜访Trading Hole的AngBeeLan吧！他会教您更多。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_t_master1.ntk_119_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_t_master1.ntk_12_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It's strange that the students sent to investigate Leonair Campus haven't arrived yet.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The specialist from the Financial Group also doesn't have any idea what happened.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tidak bisa diremehkan nih, para pelajar yang dikirim untuk menyelidiki Leonine School tidak ada yang kembali.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Field agent yang katanya dikirim dari yayasan juga tidak ada kabar beritanya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">被派去Leonair Campus调查的学生们还没回来, 果然这事非比寻常。从Financial Group那边派去的专员也没有消息。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_t_master1.ntk_12_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about the College</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang School</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问有关学院的事情</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_t_master1.ntk_12_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about the Health Room</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang Health Room</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问有关Health Room</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_t_master1.ntk_12_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about Chaotic Situation</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang peristiwa kecelakaan itu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问现况</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_t_master1.ntk_12_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about the Green</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang Green</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问有关Green组织的事情</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_t_master1.ntk_12_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about the Leonair College ID Card</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang Leonine School ID</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问 Leonair College的 ID Card</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_t_master1.ntk_12_0_6">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_t_master1.ntk_120_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">This looks like the student attendance list.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Maybe it's more like the student record list.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Anyway, there's nothing wrong with the list.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Why are you so curious about it?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Apa yah? bisa dibilang sebagai daftar hadir para pelajar,</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">atau lebih dekat ke catatan para pelajar.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">alau dibilang dua-duanya juga tidak ada masalah,</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Penasaran tentang apa?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">可以说的学生们的考勤表…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">应该是更靠近学生记录部方面。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">就算任何一方没有什么特别异常，好奇​​什么？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_t_master1.ntk_120_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about Background of Students</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang Kembaliground dari pendaftaran para pelajar</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问学生的背景</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_t_master1.ntk_121_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">How did you enter this school?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I did the same thing you did. Don't waste your time on that list.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bagaimana bisa kamu mendaftar ke sekolah?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jangan khawatir karena karena hal yang tidak penting</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">您是如何进入学校的呢？我做了跟您一样的事情。请不要把时间浪费在那张表格上面。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_t_master1.ntk_122_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Please send this document to a policeman.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sampaikan dokumen ini ke Polisi</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">请将文件资料交给警察</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_t_master1.ntk_13_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Now isn't a good time for students to be ignorant about the registration process. We didn't need such repetitive routines in the past, but now...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya akan menyimpan form ini. Terima kasih</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">学生的时机不好.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">以前的话, 是不需要像这些反覆的作业的…</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_t_master1.ntk_13_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_t_master1.ntk_14_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">아직까지 등록을 못한 학생이 있었군!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">학생은 들어온 지 꽤 오래된 것 같은데...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">아깝게 됐어, 학사일정이 제대로 됐으면 학년도 올릴 수 있었을 텐데 말이야</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">아직까지 등록을 못한 학생이 있었군!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">학생은 들어온 지 꽤 오래된 것 같은데...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">아깝게 됐어, 학사일정이 제대로 됐으면 학년도 올릴 수 있었을 텐데 말이야</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">아직까지 등록을 못한 학생이 있었군!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">학생은 들어온 지 꽤 오래된 것 같은데...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">아깝게 됐어, 학사일정이 제대로 됐으면 학년도 올릴 수 있었을 텐데 말이야</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_t_master1.ntk_14_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_t_master1.ntk_15_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">아무리 정상업무 진행이 어려운 상황이라고는 해도 이렇게 절차를 무시하면 좀 곤란하지-</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">어쩔 수 없는 노릇이군, 이 신청서는 대신 써 줄테니까 매점에 가서 외출신청서나 받아서 써 와</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">아무리 정상업무 진행이 어려운 상황이라고는 해도 이렇게 절차를 무시하면 좀 곤란하지-</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">어쩔 수 없는 노릇이군, 이 신청서는 대신 써 줄테니까 매점에 가서 외출신청서나 받아서 써 와</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">아무리 정상업무 진행이 어려운 상황이라고는 해도 이렇게 절차를 무시하면 좀 곤란하지-</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">어쩔 수 없는 노릇이군, 이 신청서는 대신 써 줄테니까 매점에 가서 외출신청서나 받아서 써 와</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_t_master1.ntk_15_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_t_master1.ntk_16_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">We should do our best to survive through all of this. We need to remain calm and collected until this immense problem is resolved.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kamu harus bertahan hidup sampai kamu bisa mengamankan situasi ini dan bisa melakukan hal yang lebih besar</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">一定要活着, 将现在发生的异象平息下来, 要一直撑到完成大事之后!</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_t_master1.ntk_16_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The Principal's Examination</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ujian dari Student Director</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">Principal的考验</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
