    <VALUE Lang="cn">.....15</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_t_master1.ntk_58_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">아마 그 신청서도 매점에 준비해 두고 있을게다</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">하지만 다음부터는 제대로 정상적인 절차를 받아 오도록 해</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">아마 그 신청서도 매점에 준비해 두고 있을게다</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">하지만 다음부터는 제대로 정상적인 절차를 받아 오도록 해</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">아마 그 신청서도 매점에 준비해 두고 있을게다</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">하지만 다음부터는 제대로 정상적인 절차를 받아 오도록 해</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_t_master1.ntk_58_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_t_master1.ntk_59_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">규칙이란 건 지키라고 있는 거지 책 만드는 데에 페이지 채워주려고 만든 게 아니란 말이다 알아들었나?!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">규칙이란 건 지키라고 있는 거지 책 만드는 데에 페이지 채워주려고 만든 게 아니란 말이다 알아들었나?!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">규칙이란 건 지키라고 있는 거지 책 만드는 데에 페이지 채워주려고 만든 게 아니란 말이다 알아들었나?!</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_t_master1.ntk_59_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_t_master1.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The four colleges were set up Force Fields. The strange phenomenon on Leonair Campus spread to the Sacred Gate, Mystic Peak, and Phoenix campuses.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">4 kampus yaitu Sacred Gate School, Mystic Peak School, Phoenix School dan Leonine School terdapat force field sistem setelah dibangun.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Diantara keempatnya terjadi sesuatu yang aneh pada Leonine sekolah, dan kamu mungkin tahu kalau kecelakaan terjadi l</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">Sacred Gate、Mystic Peak、Phoenix、还有Leonair 这4个学院, 因结界形成而设立。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">其中, Leonair Campus变得越来越奇怪，异象发生的速度比以前快了许多。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_t_master1.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_t_master1.ntk_60_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">.......16q</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">.......16q</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">.......16q</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_t_master1.ntk_61_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Eh? The Exit Approval ends here.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I've already said this many times. It's up to you whether you want to hear it again.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Euhm formulir pass selesai.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mungkin kamu sudah sering mendengar hal ini, aku bilang sekali lagi terserah kalau kamu mau bilang aku tukang ngomel atau apa</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">嗯, 外出申请到这里为止.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">到现在为止已经讲很多遍了, 我要再讲一句.你们要当作是啰唆不听的话随你们便.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">"</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_t_master1.ntk_61_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_t_master1.ntk_62_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I've already told you about the different locations on the map. I'm not repeating myself.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I've already told you about how to fight monsters. I'm not repeating myself.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I won't repeat myself to the other students either.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Aku nggak akan menyebut lagi tentang dunia lain yang sering kita bahas saat jam pelajaran</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya juga nggak akan bilang apa yang harus kamu lakukan kepada orang-orang yang mirip dengan manusia yang melakukan kekacauan di luar sana</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sama saja dengan ha</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">对于学生们在课堂上学到关于其他世界的事我不再提.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">对于怎么对付那在外面游走似人非人的怪物我也不再提.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">还有对于为了其他学生该怎么做的事我也不再讲</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_t_master1.ntk_62_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_t_master1.ntk_63_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Now, what would it be?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">All I ask is for you students to be careful and not to die.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">That's all I can tell you.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Terus apa?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jangan sampai kamu mati!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ini adalah satu-satunya yang bisa aku katakan pada kamu sebagai seorang guru</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">"那么是什么呢?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">是叫你们不要死.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我以一个老师的身分可以跟学生讲的就是这个而已</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_t_master1.ntk_63_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_t_master1.ntk_64_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">......17</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">......17</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">......17</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_t_master1.ntk_65_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Our world is changing. Some students have started to develop special and uncanny aptitudes and capabilities.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Siapa gurumu? Dunia ini membutuhkan orang orang yang bisa menjaga kesadaran dirinya sendiri.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这, 到底是谁告诉过了呢...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">反正现在这世界维持着本来的精神和形态, 就像这些学生一样带有特别的要素</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_t_master1.ntk_65_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_t_master1.ntk_66_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Most of them don't even understand how to use their ability effectively. It's hard to stay safe right now.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Banyak dari mereka yang tidak tahu cara menggunakannya. Ini sangat berbahaya di luar sana.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">"但是学生们到现在还是没办法彻底的活用那些要素, 真的没有无法得知到何时才能安全.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">就像学生们入学时也讲过的... 啊, 抱歉, 这些你们不用听.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">"</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_t_master1.ntk_66_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_t_master1.ntk_67_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Our college has special Force Fields everywhere. It's unfortunate that these Force Fields are affected by the unusual phenomena at a certain level.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">There are also the strong mobs outside campus that cause destruction and chaos. I believe that you'll be able to defeat them if you activate and learn the effects of the Force Fields.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sebenarnya kampus kita terdapat spesial Force Fields di manapun. Tetapi karena suatu hal banyak yang tidak berfungsi.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">"我们的学院处处都有特别的结界, 但是却还是在某种程度上会受到异象的影响.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">虽然学院外面有更强,更异常的家伙在闹, 但能从这些结界开始, 学习能力的认证, 获得力量的话, 可以说是更强的.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">"</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_t_master1.ntk_67_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_t_master1.ntk_68_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">....18</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">....18</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">....18</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_t_master1.ntk_69_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Just by looking at them, I can tell some of the people in front of Headquarters are fools.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Nonetheless, I'm not worried by them because the exams that must be taken by all students will weed them out.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Banyak orang - orang di depan Headquarters sangatlah bodoh. </VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我虽一看就知道, 但是因为在本馆前面就是有一些糊里糊涂的家伙.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">不管怎么说还是要给学生考考试, 我的心理才会感觉比较舒服</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_t_master1.ntk_69_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_t_master1.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">What?! You still don't know the location of the Health Room?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You can go straight across the Administration Office to find a room with the "Health Room" sign on it.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ada bom yang meledak dan penyebabnya tidak diketahui di Health Room</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">啧啧, 到现在还不知道Health Room在哪里啊...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">从Administration Office出去直走的话，会看到有间写着[Health Room]的地方，找一下！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_t_master1.ntk_7_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_t_master1.ntk_70_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">There are mobs of Little Hooligans running around. Please get two (2) Cigarette Butts from them.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">If you do this, I will reward you with both experience and Skill Points.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tolong kumpulkan 2 Cigarette Butts dari Little Holligans.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jika kamu melakukannya, saya akan memberi hadiah berupa exp dan skill point.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">外面有个叫做 Little Hooligan的家伙晃来晃去, ​​去拿两个他嘴里叼的香烟烟蒂来。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">如果通过考试的话, 我就给你们加经验值和技能点数。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_t_master1.ntk_70_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_t_master1.ntk_71_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">......19q</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">......19q</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">......19q</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_t_master1.ntk_72_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You've completed the Force Field Activation?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">That was fast!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You must be fairly strong!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kamu sudah menyalakan Force Field?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Itu sangat cepat!!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kamu pasti benar - benar kuat!!!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">嗯... 结界认证已经结束了吗?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">真的算是很快就结束了呢.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">那里... 喔! 变强哩</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_t_master1.ntk_72_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_t_master1.ntk_73_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The School Principal used a strange material to create the Force Field. It's almost unbelievable, but it really has amazing effects!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">School Principal menggunakan material aneh untuk membuat Force Field. Terlihat mustahil tapi benar - benar terjadi!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">社长用那些奇怪的东西造结界的时候, 还半信半疑, 原来真的有此惊人效果啊!</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_t_master1.ntk_73_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_t_master1.ntk_74_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">....21</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">....21</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">....21</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_t_master1.ntk_75_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I've already told this to you many times. The situation outside is beyond my comprehension. I never would have imagined anything like this.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sudah kukatakan berkali - kali, situasi ini di luar kendali saya. Saya tidak menyangka ini akan terjadi.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">但是呢~</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">刚开始注册时就已经讲过很多次了, 现在外面并非一般市内的面貌, 是你们无法想像的状况</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_t_master1.ntk_75_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_t_master1.ntk_76_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Some students who reached the Main Gate and attempted to pass through it were rushed to the First-Aid Room. Why weren't they able to go through?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Banyak pelajar yang begitu mencoba melewati Pintu Gerbang langsung menuju ke arah First-Aid Room. Bagaimana mungkin mereka tidak bisa melewatinya?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">有些才到门口就受伤回到保健室了, 要怎样做才可以站出正门?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_t_master1.ntk_76_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_t_master1.ntk_77_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">There is a test you must take before you can pass through the Main Gates.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Once the test procedure at the Terminal located near the Main Gate begins, you are required to finish the test within a specific amount of time.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ada tes yang harus kamu ambil sebelum melewati Main Gates.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Begitu Terminal di dekat Main Gate diaktifkan, kamu harus menyelesaikan misinya dalam waktu yang sudah ditentukan.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">所以准备了简单的能力试验程式.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">正门的终端机将它启动的话, 就开始提出问题, 要在限制的时间内通过</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_t_master1.ntk_77_0_1">
