  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_t_master1.ntk_81_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">In order to acquire knowledge on the Suggestion Book, students need to bring the paper notes to the Student Director located at Mystic Peak.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tuh kan……</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sesuai dengan perkiraan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kamu bawa Currency ini kepada Student Director dari SG Campus lalu dapatkan Letter of Opinion darinya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">果然如预想中的一样.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">学生们要拿着纸币去给Mystic Peak学院的Student Director，以学习Suggestion Book。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_t_master1.ntk_81_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_t_master1.ntk_82_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The paper notes aren't normal money. Be careful not to misplace it!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Aku peringatkan lagi Currency ini bukan lembaran uang biasa, jadi hati-hati jangan sampai hilang di tengah jalan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">也许可以给点主意, 但是这纸币不是普通钱币之类的, 不要中途遗失了!</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_t_master1.ntk_82_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_t_master1.ntk_83_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">...24q</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">...24q</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">...24q</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_t_master1.ntk_84_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Hm? So the people at Mystic Peak share my opinion?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">This is an experimental product of Counterfeited Anxiety Money.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Euhm, pikiran Sacred Gate juga sama rupanya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">item palsu.. Lagia..?!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tapi sepertinya masih ada yang aneh… aku ingin melihatnya sekali lagi.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">嗯, 原来Mystic Peak的想法也一样。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">是伪造Anxiety Money的实验品。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_t_master1.ntk_84_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_t_master1.ntk_85_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It looks the same as normal notes, but it's kind of weird. Just take a look at the copper coins.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Emm!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kedepannya aku akan mengabari kapan Currency ini dibuang, saat itu kumpulkanlah Currency tersebut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">真的很像是那个, 有点奇怪, 一定要看一下铜板吗?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_t_master1.ntk_85_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
