  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_t_master1.ntk_90_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The documents should match the data in the system.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Let's just skip the documentation of the emergency procedures, and I'll inform you of any developments.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Setidaknya kita harus membandingkan data yang ada.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tapi kalau keadaan darurat seperti ini kita harus siaga penuh</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">至少要经过资料的比对之后, 才能够看出程度.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">真要这样看程度的话, 连非常对策书也要写吗?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
