  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_t_master1.ntk_91_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">In the meantime, I want you to go to Mystic Peak's Student Director and procure the Computer room Backup disk.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It's urgent that we get it so that we can recover our information from the primary facilities.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya akan hubungi sebelumnya, kamu silahkan temui Student Director dari Mystic Peak Kampus dan minta Kembaliup disk untuk memulihkan Information Room.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kita perbaiki dulu hal-hal yang darurat, terus coba cari data yang dibutuhkan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我会再联络你们, 找Mystic Peak的Student Director，拿恢复电脑室的备用磁片来。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">因为很急,就回复一些必要的设施就好，然后把资料找一找。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
