  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_citizen1.ntk_31_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">...</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_citizen1.ntk_31_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Collect Old Book</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mengumpulkan Old Book</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">收集旧书</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_citizen1.ntk_31_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_citizen1.ntk_32_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">...</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_citizen1.ntk_32_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_citizen1.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ah! Do you really want to help me?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Thank you very much.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The MinFuLeiSi Special Publishing House published a book that was snatched from me. The title of the book is "Online Games Programming Guide." A villain known as the Cripple Guy took it.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Please help me by retrieving that book from that vile mobster!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ah, bisa tolong seperti itu?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Benar-benar terimakasih-</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Buku yang direbut berjudul 'Online Game Programming Guide' yang dikeluarkan oleh Penerbit Minplus</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tadi direbut oleh orang-orang yang bernama Air Dunker…tolong bantu yah</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">阿！真的要帮我吗？</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">真是感谢！</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我被抢的书是MinFuLeiSi Special Publishing House出版社出的，书名是 "Online Games Programming Guide"。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">刚刚被名叫Cripple Guy 的朋友抢走了。请您帮我找回来好吗？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_citizen1.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_citizen1.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I can't believe that this rare book was snatched by that person. This is inexcusable!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Would you help me find it again, please?!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ditambah lagi buku yang saya temukan dengan susah payah malah direbut oleh orang-orang aneh itu…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Maaf bisakah kamu membantu saya untuk menemukan buku sekali lagi?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">再说如此难买的书居然被怪人给抢走</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">不好意思 可以再帮我找一次书吗</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_citizen1.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Accept Request</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menerima</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">接受委托</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_citizen1.ntk_5_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Accept Request</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menerima</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">接受委托</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_citizen1.ntk_5_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Accept Request</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menerima</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">接受委托</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_citizen1.ntk_5_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Accept Request</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menerima</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">接受委托</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_citizen1.ntk_5_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Accept Request</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menerima</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">接受委托</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_citizen1.ntk_5_0_6">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Accept Request</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Terima Pesan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">接受请求</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_citizen1.ntk_5_0_7">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Accept Request</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Terima Permintaan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">接受请求</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_citizen1.ntk_5_0_8">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_citizen1.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Thanks! It's great to know that you'll help me out. Another book entitled "Games Programmer C++" was stolen from me.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It was snatched by a villain known as the Skating Master.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Please help me!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ah, bisa tolong seperti itu?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Benar-benar terimakasih-</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Buku yang direbut berjudul 'C++ For Game Developer' yang dikeluarkan oleh Penerbit Minplus</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tadi direbut oleh orang-orang yang bernama Skating Master…tolong bantu yah</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">阿,真的要帮我吗?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">真是多谢！</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我被抢的书书名是"Games Programmer C++"，</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">刚刚被名叫Skating Master的朋友抢走。请您帮我找回来好吗？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_citizen1.ntk_6_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_citizen1.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">That book I bought is very precious!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It is one of my favorite books because it covers the basics of Programming. I spent a lot of money on it. Sadly, somebody took it away from me.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Could you help me get that book back?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ah…buku-buku yang ingin saya temukan benar-benar sangat berharga…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Atau mungkin aku yang paling kelihatan remeh</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya tidak tahu kenapa setiap kali saya mendapatkan buku yang sulit ditemukan itu mereka merebutnya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bisa tolong bantu saya?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">阿 我买的书真的超级贵重的</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">还是搞不好我是最自信满满的</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">到底?什么我好不容易买到的要抢走呢</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">可以帮我一下忙吗</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_citizen1.ntk_7_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Accept Request</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menerima</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">接受委托</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_citizen1.ntk_7_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Accept Request</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menerima</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">接受委托</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_citizen1.ntk_7_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Accept Request</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menerima</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">接受委托</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_citizen1.ntk_7_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Accept Request</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menerima</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">接受委托</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_citizen1.ntk_7_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Accept Request</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menerima</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">接受委托</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_citizen1.ntk_7_0_6">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Accept Request</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Terima Pesan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">接受请求</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_citizen1.ntk_7_0_7">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Accept Request</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Terima Permintaan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">接受请求</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_citizen1.ntk_7_0_8">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_citizen1.ntk_8_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ah, do you really want to help me?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Thank you very much.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The book that got snatched from me was published by the MinFuLeiSi Special Publishing House, and it's entitled "Special Influence Games Programming."</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It was snatched by a fiend named Hodel. Please help me!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ah, bisa begitu?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Benar-benar terimakasih banyak</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Buku yang direbut berjudul 'Game Architecture' yang dikeluarkan oleh Penerbit Minplus</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tadi direbut oleh orang-orang yang bernama Hodel…tolong bantu yah</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">阿！真的要帮我吗？</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">真是感谢！</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我被抢的书是 MinFuLeiSi Special 出版社出的，书名是 "Special Influence Games Programming"。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">刚刚被名叫Hodel的朋友抢走了。请您帮我找回来好吗？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_citizen1.ntk_8_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_citizen1.ntk_9_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Now I'm a little afraid of buying books.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It's alright for me to just stand like this, but… Why do my books keep getting targeted?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">This time I didn't buy this book, and it's more important to me since I received it from a friend.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Can you help me one more time?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kini saya benar-benar merasa takut untuk membeli buku</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau saya diam seperti ini tidak apa-apa, tapi orang-orang aneh itu menyerang kalau buku datang</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Padahal kali ini saya bukan membeli buku tapi mendapatkannya dari kenalan saya, tapi malah direbu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">现在来买书真有点怕怕的</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">就这样站着是没关系只有书动的话会被怪朋友袭击</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这次书不是用买的是从认识的人那里拿来的</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">可以 再帮我一次吗</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_citizen1.ntk_9_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Accept Request</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menerima</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">接受委托</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_citizen1.ntk_9_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Accept Request</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menerima</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">接受委托</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_citizen1.ntk_9_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Accept Request</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menerima</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">接受委托</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_citizen1.ntk_9_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Accept Request</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menerima</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">接受委托</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_citizen1.ntk_9_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Accept Request</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menerima</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">接受委托</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_citizen1.ntk_9_0_6">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Accept Request</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Terima Pesan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">接受请求</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_citizen1.ntk_9_0_7">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Accept Request</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Terima Permintaan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">接受请求</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_citizen1.ntk_9_0_8">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I'm not sure how the streets became like this.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I consider myself lucky for being able to find a safe hiding place over here.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Sheesh! I really don't know what'll happen to me if I'm not careful.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Entah mengapa wilayah sekitar sini menjadi seperti ini</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Beruntung kamu masih bisa bernafas disini</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jika saja kamu ada saat itu, tidak tahu apa yang akan terjadi sekarang…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">街道为何会变成这幅模样？</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我算幸运的了，至少可以躲到这里。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">稍微一不注意，可能连我也会遭殃的。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Who are you talking about?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya siapa anda</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">您指的是谁？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_1_0_10">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Give the Key</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Meminta data</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">交付 Key</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_1_0_11">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Take the Golf Stick</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya apakah ada sesuatu yang terjadi</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">领取 Golf Stick</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_1_0_12">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Give the Trash</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menyerahkan trash</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">交付 Trash</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_1_0_13">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask if Everything is Alright</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya apakah ada sesuatu yang terjadi</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问一切都还好吗？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_1_0_14">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Give the Golf Stick</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Memberikan Golf Sticks</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">交付 Golf Stick</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_1_0_15">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about Problem</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya apakah ada sesuatu yang terjadi</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问关于问题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_1_0_16">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Find out the Results</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Memberitahukan hasil</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">找出结果</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_1_0_17">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about Garbage</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang trash</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问垃圾</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_1_0_18">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Deliver the Oil</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menyampaikan oil</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">传递Oil</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_1_0_19">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about Garbage</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang trash</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问关于垃圾</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_1_0_20">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about Garbage</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bekerja secara suka rela untuk mengumpulkan trash yang bisa didaur ulang</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问关于垃圾</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_1_0_21">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about Garbage</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya apakah ada sesuatu yang terjadi</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问关于垃圾</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_1_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Mention Collecting Recycled Resources</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menyerahkan item-item Recycle</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">谈到资源回收</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_1_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about Lost Children</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang anak-anak yang hilang</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问失踪的孩子</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_1_0_6">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask for Directions</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang jalan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">寻求指引</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_1_0_7">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Volunteer to Collect Rubbish</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bekerja secara suka rela untuk mengumpulkan trash yang bisa didaur ulang</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">自愿收集垃圾</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_1_0_8">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Give the Recyclable Rubbish</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menyerahkan trash yang bisa didaur ulang</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">交付资源回收垃圾</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_1_0_9">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask if Everything is Alright</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya apakah ada sesuatu yang terjadi</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问一切都还好吗？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_10_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Do you think that this trash still needs to be gathered? It'd definitely be better for us Street Cleaners if all the garbage and trash was sorted and collected. Please help us out, okay?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bisa tolong kumpulkan lagi?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau kami senanglah</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau begitu saya mohon bantuannya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">你认为这个垃圾还需要收集吗？对我们来说，如果所有的垃圾和垃圾都进行分类收集，当然是最好不过了。请帮助我们，好吗？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_10_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_11_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It's great to know that you're here to help. There are these monsters that make our job difficult in cleaning the streets. Those long-furred dogs pulling milk-bottle carts really give me the creeps. Watch out, or they'll bite you!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I'm not kidding...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It's possible, you know?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Meskipun ini bukan sesuatu yang pantas untuk dibanggakan, anjing-anjing berbulu tebal yang menarik gerobak susu itupun takut pada saya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kadang aku berpikir…mungkin suatu saat akupun akan digigit oleh anjing itu….</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我们很高兴地你在这里帮忙。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">有这些怪物，不停地阻扰我们清扫街道。。那些长毛狗拖着奶瓶车的模样真是令人看了毛骨悚然。小心，他们会咬伤你！</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我是认真的。这不是不可能的事情，了解吗？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_11_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Accept Request</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menerima</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">接受请求</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_11_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_12_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Do you really want me to give this to you?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Here! Take it. It's really huge, so be very careful with it.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bisa tolong melakukannya seperti itu?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau begitu saya mohon bantuannya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Hati-hati karena ukuran badan anjingnya sangat besar</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">您真的希望我把它给您吗？</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这边，请收下。牠的身躯很大，请小心安全。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_12_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_13_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Whoa! It looks like you've taken care of those monster dogs!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">How the heck did you do it?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Thank you very much for your help.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Finally! I can now start cleaning the street without worrying about those hounds biting me.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Hebat sekali kamu bisa mengurus anjing yang seperti monster itu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sebenarnya apa yang sudah kamu lakukan?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pokoknya terimakasih</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Baru kinilah saya bisa bersih-bersih</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">哇！看起来你已经解决了怪物狗的问题。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">您是怎么做到的呢？</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">非常感谢您的帮助。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">终于！我现在可以开始打扫街道，不必再担心那些猎狗咬我了。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_13_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_14_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Maybe you won't believe me, but I really think that we absolutely must dispose of all this trash. I mean, sure it's a form of pollution, but there's more to it than that.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">There's something else about the trash, but I can't quite put my finger on it. Please help be acquire what I need by collecting some trash.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mungkin terdengar aneh kalau saya bilang bahwa sampah-sampah ini penting, tapi</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ada kan hal seperti itu contohnya benda yang telah terkena polusi atau apalah…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya tidak bisa bilang apa isinya, tapi bisa bantu saya untuk menemukannya?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">也许你不会相信，但我真的认为处理这些所有的垃圾是很重要的事情。我的意思是，它的确是一种污染物，但还有更多安脏东西存在。我无法一个人胜任，请大家帮忙我一起收集垃圾。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_14_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Accept Request</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menerima</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">接受请求</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_14_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_15_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Somebody said that they saw it taken away by a group of strange people called the Wrestlers.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Although I'm not sure whether or not they're still holding the trash, I need your help to find out.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ada orang yang melihat para Wrestler sedang membawanya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya tidak tahu apakah dia masih membawa sampah-sampah itu tapi tolong yah</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">有人说，他们看到它带走了一群奇怪的人叫Wrestler。 虽然我不知道他们是否还拿着垃圾，但还是需要您的帮助来了找一下。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_15_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_16_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Wow! Thank God! You found it!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Hmm...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It would be better if I take this to the Research Institute for them to analyze. I suspect that we won't learn any good news from this, though...have a feeling it is not going to be good news?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Huh, what did you say?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Sorry! Don't mind me. I was just talking to myself.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Untung saja kamu sudah menemukannya rupanya.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Coba..isinya kayaknya masih begitu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ah…saya pikir terjadi sesuatu yang tidak baik contohnya dipanggil ke pusat penelitian</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Apa? Ah, jangan pedulikan. Aku ngomong sendiri</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">哇！天啊！！您找到了！</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">嗯... 如果我拿这个去研究所对他们进行分析，应该归很不错。我怀疑，我们不会从中得到益处，但…就是有种不是好事的感觉。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">噢~对不起！我只是在自言自语。不要理我。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_16_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_17_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I only wanted to sweep the Golf Course. Suddenly, I found myself being chased by these ridiculous girls carrying gold clubs.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I can't even finish my sweeping because these nutcases chased me all the way here. Don't you think the world will get so dirty if nobody sweeps it?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tada saya pergi untuk membersihkan lapangan golf, eh tiba-tiba ada wanita-wanita aneh yang mengayun-ayunkan tongkat pada saya.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jangankan bersih-bersih saya jadi terusir sampai di sini</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya mohon tolong lakukan sesuatu dengan Golf club itu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya p</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我只是想清扫Golf Course。突然间，我发现自己被携带黄金俱乐部的这些女孩追打了起来。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我甚至无法完成打扫，因为这些疯子在这里追了我一整天。如果没人打扫的话，你不会认为世界会变得很脏吗？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_17_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Accept Request</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menerima</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">接受请求</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_17_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_18_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Oh! Please...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I get goose bumps seeing those golf clubs aimed at me! It was terrible!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">There were also those mobs carrying bombs! Watch out for them!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Those monsters were huge! Please be careful!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya minta tolong yah</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kini hanya melihat Golf club saja saya merinding</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau ga salah Golf Bomber?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Hati-hati karena wanita-wanita itu yang paling berbahaya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">哦！拜托...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">看到这些球杆瞄准了我，还真是起了鸡皮疙瘩！ 此外，那些携带炸弹的小怪！当心他们！</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">那些怪物体型超大的！请小心！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_18_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_19_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">A gold club!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I've seen one of these before, but I'm not familiar with this one in particular.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Golf Club!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ah…dulu juga itu bukan item yang ingin saya dekati, kini saya ingin semakin menjauhinya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">黄金俱乐部！我已经看过这些人了，但我不是很熟悉这一地带。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_19_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">...</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_20_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The living area of the locals is very limited. These nasty hoodlums cause trouble and make this place a living hell for the people that have to live here.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">These jerks have even caused some students to get stranded!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tanpa kericuhan yang dibuat oleh merekapun jumlah warga terus saja menurun, karena mareka kita tambah kesusahan kan?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Katanya mereka sangat takut kepada para pelajar jadi tolong saya yah</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">当地人的生活区域是非常有限的。可恶的流氓制造混乱，使的住在这里的人都深感不安。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这些人甚至害的某些学生滞留，无法顺利离开！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_20_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Accept Request</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menerima</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">接受请求</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_20_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_21_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Although there are only a few of those hoodlums around, try your best to nab 20 of them!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I know you're powerful enough to take them out! Please try your best to eliminate them now!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Karena jumlanya tidak begitu banyak</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau kita tangkap 20 orang saja dan memberi mereka pelajaran mungkin mereka akan sedikit diam</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Hanya badannya saja yang besar tidak begitu kuat</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya minta tolong yah</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">虽然流氓数量不算太多，但还是请您尽量捉住20名！ 我相信您的实力足够强大，把他们赶走！尽全力消灭他们。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_21_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_22_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">We're really grateful that you're here to help.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Students like you should be concerned of the situation after experiencing this chaos.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">We all agree that this strange phenomenon must be resolved as soon as possible.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Terimakasih sudah bekerja keras</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Itu sudah cukup untuk membuat orang-orang itu jinak</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Keadaan ganjil yang membuat orang-orang menjadi aneh ini harus cepat-cepat hilang….</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我们真的很感谢您在这儿的帮忙。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">像你这样的学生，在经历混乱后，是应该要被关心的。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我们都认为这种奇怪的现象，是必须要尽快解决的议题。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_22_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_23_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">.....4</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">.....4</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">.....4</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_24_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The lack of resources today reflects the chaotic future we will experience if students don't contribute to the resolution of this situation.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">There are other matters you have to consider. For the meantime, will you help me collect some Empty Bottles?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">No matter what happens, we will always need medical supplies.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kebetulan kita sedang kekurangan material, jika sedikit saja tidak bisa dikumpulkan kedepannya akan lebih sulit</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kumpulkanlah Empty Bottles saja dan abaikan yang lainnya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Setidaknya kalian harus bisa menjaga Medicines tersebut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">连物资都不够，到处都乱七八糟，再募集不到的话，往后就会更惨了。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">其他的先别管，请先帮我收集好空瓶，不管怎样，我们一定要保管好药品！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_24_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_25_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">.....6</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">.....6</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">.....6</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_26_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Did something unfortunate happen to him?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Perhaps he went through an operation which made him a cyborg. What do you think?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Itukan satu hal yang sudah pasti?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Dia tidak mendapatkan operasi di suatu tempat dan menjadi robot atau apa kan?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">该不会是哪里出了大事了吧？</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">也许他在哪里偷偷做了改造手术，结果变成了半机械人了吧？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_26_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_27_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">.....7</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">.....7</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">.....7</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_28_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">There are fewer and fewer normal students…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">This is a very depressing situation!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I'm not sure whether it involves a group of delinquent students or a group of lazy airheads with mental problems.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I just know that there's a group of lowlifes loitering around and tossing trash on the streets on purpose. It's really nasty!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jumlah orang-orang juga semakin sedikit</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Karena tidak menjadi kotor seperti itu….</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Aku tidak tahu apakah mereka orang-orang yang</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">...11</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_28_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
