  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_29_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">What's worse is that they choose to throw around trash that can't be recycled!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pokoknya saya pusing karena orang-orang yang membuang sampah semiteman dan membuat jalanan kotor</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ditambah lagi mereka hanya membuang item-item yang bisa didaur ulang saja</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">重点是他们不停地在街道上丢弃“不可回收的垃圾”。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_29_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You still have no idea about the chaos after seeing the outskirts? Things started getting crazy as I was cleaning the streets. The bloodthirsty monsters scared the hell out of me!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bisa kamu lihat kan? Tiba-tiba jadi seperti ini kan pada saat bersih-bersih di daerah sini</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">您还不明白吗？当我在清扫街道时，就发生了这些事情了。喷血的怪物真是把我吓破了胆呢。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
