  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_31_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Do you think there's no need to see what's in the trash!?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Please be quick, and just take it over there.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ah, dan kamu tidak ada perlunya untuk melihat isi sampah itu kan?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Harus langsung diserahkan yah</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">垃圾的内容没必要看了，对吧？</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">请尽快拿过去。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_31_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
