  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_33_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ah, yup!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">If this is the case, go over to the Financial Group Research Institute! Oh wait... No! It's at another place. I'm sorry... Try the Recycling Research Center, it should be over there.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ah, ada</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau ini mungkin di pusat penelitian Yayasan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ah, nggak, bukannya yang lain tapi katanya ini bisa digunakan di pusat penelitian daur ulang dengan baik…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">噢~是的。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">如果是这样的话，请到Financial Group Research Institute！</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">哦，等一下......不！这是在另一个地方。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">抱歉，请到Recycling Research Center，它应该会在那里。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_33_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
