  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_39_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">...14</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">...14</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">...14</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">예전에는 그래도 매일 청소를 했으니까 재활용품 수집도 그럭저럭 됐는데</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">요즘 같아서는 청소가 문제가 아니라 도망다니기도 바쁘네 원...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Dahulu walaupun dibersihkan setiap hari, pengumpulan item-item Recycled pun juga dilakukan setiap hari</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sekarang jangankan bersih-bersih, saya sibuk melarikan diri kesana kemari</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">예전에는 그래도 매일 청소를 했으니까 재활용품 수집도 그럭저럭 됐는데</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">요즘 같아서는 청소가 문제가 아니라 도망다니기도 바쁘네 원...</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_40_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Hmm...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">How do I say this? Somebody threw away something which he shouldn't have.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Euhm…it….</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Apa yah…Seseorang sudah mencuri sampah-sampah yang tidak boleh dibuang semiteman</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">嗯……我该怎么说呢？某人把不该扔的东西乱丢在路上了。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_40_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_41_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">...15</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">...15</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">...15</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_42_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Can you go check the contents of the trash for me? Once you find what I want, please bring it back to me.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Dan…saya hanya tanya sih…kamu tidak mengeceknya di dalam tumpukkan sampah juga kan?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tidak usah melihatnya langsung bawa ke sini kalau kamu sudah berhasil menemukannya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">可以请您去检查垃圾中的内容吗？如果已经找到了我要的东西，就请马上把它带回来给我。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_42_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_43_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">....19</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">....19</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">....19</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_44_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Let me handle this.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I'm really sorry to bother you.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">This was supposed to be the stuff I was going to give you after I finished cleaning.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya tangani ini semua</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Terimakasih atas kerja kerasnya.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya pungut ini semua sewaktu bersih-bersih tadi</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">让我来处理这个问题。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我真的很抱歉一直打扰你。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这应该是我打扫完之后再拿给您的东西。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_44_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_45_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Looks like it's not going to a big deal. This trash looks properly sorted and collected. I'm not sure if this is enough of a reward to pay you for helping me, but...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Can you please accept this as a token of my appreciation?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kelihatannya masih bagus makanya aku kumpulkan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mungkin ini tidak cukup disebut sebagai balasan tapi maukah kamu menerimanya?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">看起来没什么大碍。看起来垃圾已经妥善地分类好了。您帮了我很大的忙，我不知道这份谢礼够不够表达我的谢意，但…可以请您收下我的这份心意吗？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_45_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_46_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">This was something I overheard while I was doing my sweeping rounds...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">There was this bunch of never-seen-before nasty guys who identify themselves as part of the "Green" Organization. They started causing mayhem by harassing the locals.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya mendengarnya pada saat bersih-bersih</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Katanya anggota komplotan biru yang selama ini tidak terlihat mulai mengganggu orang-orang di sekitar sini sejak beberapa waktu yang lalu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这是我在清扫中无意听到的话。听说不久前，有陌生的"Green" 组织]不良分子在骚扰民众。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_46_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_47_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">A few days ago I witnessed a glimpse of the treacherous activities of that evil organization.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I heard they had all the students clumped up into one place and suffocated them to death! This is horrible! Why isn't anybody doing something about them?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya juga tadi lihat sebentar, benar-benar mengerikan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Katanya setelah kalah oleh kalian mereka jadi tidak angkuh lagi…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kenapa mereka mulai bergerak lagi sekarang…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">没多久我也瞥见了那杀气腾腾的模样，听说学生们是被推挤结果窒息而死的。实在是太可怕了！为什么没人早一步伸出援手呢？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_47_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_48_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">....22</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">....22</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">....22</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_49_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">There are very few policemen around here, and we need to mobilize more men to scout the entire area. You know what I just heard? The violent "Green" Organization is hiding in their headquarters near the dock warehouse. It is located opposite of the Trading Hole No. 1 Passage. Do you have any information on them?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Setidaknya harus ada tenaga kerja di kepolisian yang bisa di gerakkan tapi kalau begini…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya mendengarnya tadi</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Katanya pangkalan nomor satu dari gerombolan Red Axe itu ada di Warehouse Warf passage yang ada di seberang Tunnel no.1?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这里的警察数量不多，我们需要动员更多的人来侦察整个区域。听说暴力的“绿色”组织正躲在附近码头仓库里面。它位在Trading Hole No. 1 Passage。你有他们任何的情报吗？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_49_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">수고했어 학생</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">물자는 아껴 써야 하니까 앞으로도 시간이 되면 또 부탁해요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">그냥 모아오면 다른 걸로 바꿔줄테니까</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Terima kasih untuk kerja keras kalian para pelajar</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Gunakan material secukupnya, nanti jika waktu memungkinkan mohon bantuannya lagi</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Hanya dengan mengumpulkan dan datang saja aku akan menggantikannya dengan yang lain</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">수고했어 학생</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">물자는 아껴 써야 하니까 앞으로도 시간이 되면 또 부탁해요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">그냥 모아오면 다른 걸로 바꿔줄테니까</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_50_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">What should we do if the students get scattered?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">...Ah, yup! I picked this up too while doing my cleaning. I'm sorry to have troubled you... Do you want to have this, though?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kadang saya khawatir mungkin mereka menunggu kesempatan saat para pelajar terpencar</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">….Ah, ini juga aku pungut pada saat bersih-bersih</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Terimakasih atas kerja kerasnya…bisa menerima ini?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">如果学生们走失了，我们该怎么办？</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">......啊，是啊！这也是扫地扫到一般捡到的。对不起，又要麻烦你了......您要拿去吗？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_50_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_51_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Although I don't remember when it started. Lots of boxes are spotted nowadays.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I'll know what it contains when I shake it, based on my experience at this sort of thing.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I am sure it will contain something like an "Add-on Kit."</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Hm, it won't open very easily. You could try using some oil… And I don't really know what's inside the box. It's also pretty hard to find oil. I doubt I could open this box at all now…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Maybe... Do you want to try?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya tidak tahu sejak kapan tapi kotak-kotak seperti ini mulai berkeliaran</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya bukan sekali dua kali melakukan pekerjaan ini jadi kalau saya getarkan sedikit saja saya tahu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sudah pasti item-brang enhancer</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Masalahnya kotak ini tidak bisa dibuka</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">虽然我不记得什么时候开始的，大量的箱子到处流窜。我之前也有遇过这种事情，随便一晃，就知道一定是研磨剂之类的。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">问题是，这个箱子很难打开，如果有润滑油是最好。 我真的不知道箱内有什么，不过，最近油类真的太难求了。我想我应该打不开这箱子。也许，您可以试试看哟。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_51_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Accept</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menerima</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">接受</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_51_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Reject</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menolak</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">拒绝</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_52_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Oil from tuna is suitable, and you can easily find it near this area.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">There are many workers in tuna fishing boats on the wharf.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Just so you know, you cannot just use any tuna oil, and the quality of the tuna is not always the same.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Can you gather 10 bottles of high quality tuna oil?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Diantara item yang bisa ditemukan di daerah sekitar sini Minyak tunalah yang paling cocok</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau kamu ke Wharf Passage kamu bisa menemukan banyak Fisherman…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Masalahnya ikan tuna yang dibawa mereka tidak dalam keadaan yang baik sehingga kita tidak bi</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">鲔鱼油是最合适的，在这地区，你可以很容易地找到它唷。 在Wharf里有许多工人在鲔鱼渔船工作。但您要知道，你不能使用随便一种的鲔鱼油，有些鲔鱼油的质量并不是很好。所以，可以请您收集高品质的鲔鱼油10瓶过来吗？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_52_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Begin</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">最初</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_53_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Oh~ Okay, okay!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The box is here... Try to open it.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Good Luck…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Uwah~ Makasih! Makasih!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Nah…saya akan memberikan box coba dibuka</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Semoga keberuntungan mengikutimu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">哎呀！辛苦了！箱子在这里，试着打开看看吧。祝您好运。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_53_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Begin</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">最初</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Let me think...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Are you referring to those strange crying children?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I hope they weren't captured or eaten by those evil monsters.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Euhm….maksudnya anak-anak yang berisik itu?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Setelah beberapa lama tidak terlihat…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tidak mungkin penculikan atau…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">让我想想，您是说那个吵闹的小孩吗？有一阵子没看到他了。难不成他被诱拐了？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Can you please pick out the trash and pass them to me? You should be able to collect the recyclable items by sweeping the streets.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bisa tolong rebut sampah-sampah itu?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Padahal bisa bersih-bersih dan juga mengumpulkan item yang bisa didaur ulang….</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">可以请您把那垃圾交给我吗？您应该是可以一边清扫，一遍收集可回收的垃圾的。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_7_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Accept Request</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menerima</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">接受请求</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_7_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_8_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Those roller skating mobsters and those crazy girls holding screwdrivers are the main offenders when it comes to littering.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Our streets would be much cleaner if we got rid of those fools.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Orang-orang yang menaiki Inline skater dan wanita-wanita yang membawa obeng itu adalah para pelaku yang membuang sampah</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jalan-jalan bisa menjadi bersih kalau kita buat orang-orang itu diam</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">滑着直排轮到处跑的女疯子和拿着螺丝起子跑跳的女孩子，是乱丢垃圾的主犯。只要扫除那群肇事者，街道就会变干净了。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_8_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_9_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Just as I thought...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Collecting this trash is no problem for you. Go ahead and give it to me now.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tuh kan……</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya pikir ini tidak akan menjadi masalah</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Nah, berikan sampahnya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">果然拿不出我所料。收集垃圾应该对您不难，请把它交给我。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_cleaner1.ntk_9_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
