  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_icecream_1.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_icecream_1.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">음... 그러네요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">항상 핫도그를 사라왔던 애들이 언제부터인지 보이지 않더니...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">잘은 모르겠어요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">몇 명이 모여서 근처 산에 놀라간다면서 좋아했던 걸 본 게 마지막이었던 것 같은...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">음... 그러네요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">항상 핫도그를 사라왔던 애들이 언제부터인지 보이지 않더니...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">잘은 모르겠어요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">몇 명이 모여서 근처 산에 놀라간다면서 좋아했던 걸 본 게 마지막이었던 것 같은...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">음... 그러네요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">항상 핫도그를 사라왔던 애들이 언제부터인지 보이지 않더니...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">잘은 모르겠어요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">몇 명이 모여서 근처 산에 놀라간다면서 좋아했던 걸 본 게 마지막이었던 것 같은...</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_icecream_1.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_icecream_1.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I'll give you some of our Ice Cream if you help us collect recyclable trash.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Would that be fine with you?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya akan berikan Ice cream kalau kamu bisa mengumpulkan sampah-sampah yang bisa didaur ulang</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mau mencobanya?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">只要您给我“可回收的垃圾”，我就给您好吃的 Ice Cream。愿意试试吗？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_icecream_1.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Accept Request to Collect Recyclable Trash</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menerima</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">接受请求，收集Recyclable Trash。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_icecream_1.ntk_6_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_icecream_1.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">This is what you should do.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Please collect the bottles from the folks who are carrying light poles accompanied by vile hounds.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">They just little those bottles when they can be recycled pretty easily. Would you help me bring back those bottles?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bisa melakukannya begitu?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau begitu…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kumpulkanlah botol-botol kaca</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Anjing-anjing besar dan orang-orang yang membawa Lighting rod yang ada di sekitar sini berkeliaran dan membuat orang-orang tidak bisa menggunakan botol kaca yang bisa didaur ul</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这就是您该做的。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">请从Folk那边收集空瓶过来。Folk带着灯杆，身旁还跟着Vile Hound。请您帮忙带回这些瓶子，谢谢。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_icecream_1.ntk_7_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_icecream_1.ntk_8_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Oh! Are you done collecting the bottles?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">A little tougher than you thought, right?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Here, please have this Ice Cream!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">If you'd like to try one more time, please don't hesitate to let me know.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sudah mengumpulkan semuanya rupanya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Susahkan?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Nah, terima ice cream ini</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau mau mengumpulkan Botol kaca lagi silahkan datang lagi ke sini</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">都拿来了啊？辛苦了！如果还想要在收集一次的话，请别犹豫，尽管过来跟我说就行了。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_icecream_1.ntk_8_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_icecream_1.ntk_9_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">So... You want to do it again?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You're really helpful! Thank you!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mau melakukannya lagi?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau kamu yah makasih-</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau begitu, selamat bekerja-</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">你们想再度挑战吗？这是我们的荣幸。谢谢您。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_c1_icecream_1.ntk_9_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
