  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_capsule.ntk_23_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Wow! You've got all the answers correctly! congratulations!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Wow! Selamat! Kamu menjawab semuanya dengan benar!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">哇！您完美地打对了所有的答案了！恭喜您！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_capsule.ntk_24_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">How could you answer it wrong? Don't just select any answer… Eliminate 10 Chief Hooligan as a punishment.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bagaimana kamu bisa salah menjawabnya? Jangan asal pilih jawaban saja… Bunuh 10 Chief Hooligan sebagai hukuman.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">您怎么能答错？！ 不要随便作选择啊……！请歼灭10 只Chief Hooligan。这是您的惩罚。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_capsule.ntk_24_0_1">
