  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_capsule.ntk_28_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">No such thing is free in this world. You need to complete a simple penalty before you can retake the quiz. Hurry up and eliminate them Chief Hooligans!!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tidak ada yang namanya gratis di dunia ini. Kamu harus menyelesaikan hukuman kamu sebelum mengulang kuisnya. Cepat bunuh Chief Hooligans!!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">天底下没有免费的午餐。您需要完成一个简单的惩罚，才能重新挑战测试。快快行动吧！请消灭Chief Hooligan！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_capsule.ntk_29_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Just give me minute while I check the answers</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Berikan saya sedikit waktu untuk memeriksa jawabannya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">请给我一分钟，让我确认一下答案。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_capsule.ntk_29_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Check the answer of each question.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Memeriksa jawaban dari tiap pertanyaan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">确认各个提问的答案</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_capsule.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Director of Saint foundation has prepared Hair Color Card and Hair Style Card for every student. Get it for free, now!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Direktur Saint Foundation sudah menyediakan Hair Color Card dan Hair Style Card untuk setiap pelajar. Harap diambil sekarang!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">圣财团理事长已准备了 Hair Color Card和Hair Style Card 要给各位学生。快去拿免费的礼物吧！就是现在！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_capsule.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I want my Hair Color Card and Hair Style Card.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya ingin mengambil Hair Color Card dan Hair Style Card.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我要我的Hair Color Card 和 Hair Style Card。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
