    <VALUE Lang="GS">Execute Authentication</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menjalankan program authentication</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">认证执行</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_danmal1.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">....</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_danmal1.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Access authentication succeeded.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Access to Control Room Office granted.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Verifikasi izin keluar masuk telah sukses</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya akan memberikan izin untuk memasuki kantor administrasi ke depannya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">认证执行成功。获准控管办公室的进出。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_danmal1.ntk_3_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_danmal1.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Password Incorrect.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Access Denied.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kode verifikasinya tidak sesuai</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tidak mendapatkan izin keluar masuk</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">密码错误。无法出入此地。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_danmal1.ntk_4_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_guard1.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ugh...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">How am I to live now...?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Aduh-</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kini saja kerja apa yah untuk hidup…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">额吼….</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我现在是要怎么活下去？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_guard1.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Trade Items</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jual beli item</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">交易物品</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_guard1.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Listen to Conversation</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mendengarkan cerita</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">听取对话</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_guard1.ntk_1_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Show Curving Key</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Memperlihatkan kunci yang bengkok</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">给看弯曲的钥匙</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_guard1.ntk_1_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Show Curving Key</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Memperlihatkan kunci yang bengkok</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">给看弯曲的钥匙</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_guard1.ntk_1_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask what happened on the day of phenomenon</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ingin tahu lebih jelas tentang hari pada saat terjadi kecelakaan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">想要知道当初异变发生的当天的更多详细的情况</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_guard1.ntk_10_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Practically, the students were considered as outsiders and I had to call the cops. Suddenly, there was blasts heard from the 3rd floor and all the glasses were shattered then people started to change into monsters one by one.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tiba-tiba terdengar suara ledakkan dari lantai 3 terus kaca-kaca semua pecah, tiba-tiba orang-orang yang ada di sekitar berubah jadi monster. Saya tidak kepikiran untuk memanggil polisi karena terlalu kaget</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">之后正在考虑要报警的时候，就突然听到3楼有爆炸的声音，且在爆炸的同时，所有的玻璃窗全都破碎，然后周围所有的人，就一个个开始变成了怪物……..</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_guard1.ntk_10_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">继续</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_guard1.ntk_11_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">What an old man could do in that situation.. No place to hide and I was just shivering with the fright. Then, a few have forced out the big iron door and little bit later two men came out helping a wounded man. He was soaked in blood.. It was a horrible experience.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Orang tua kayak saya mau gimana lagi….nggak ada tempat untuk bersembunyi juga, takut sekali waktu itu. Terus tiba-tiba ada orang yang menghancurkan pintu besi dan beberapa orang lompat keluar. Beberapa waktu kemudian ada 2 orang laki-laki yang keluar, sal</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我这个老人还能怎样…..我也只能站在那边发抖。就在那个时候，有一群人踢开铁门冲了出来。再隔了一阵子，就看到两个男生扶着另一个受伤的人走出来。那个人伤的很重，全身上下的衣物都被血染红了…..实在是太恐怖了。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_guard1.ntk_11_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">继续</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_guard1.ntk_12_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I have made eye contact with some of them but I couldn't dare talk to them.. After the first group had gone away, another group of suspicious people came out and two were sent to pursuit the first group and rest of them have went separate ways. Some went to the wharf and some went to storages.. As I recall now, all of them were wearing weird clothes.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya bertatapan dengan beberapa orang dari mereka tapi nggak berani mengajak ngobrol. Beberapa menit setelah semua orang pergi, tiba-tiba orang-orang yang mencurigakan berdatangan dan mengirimkan dua orang ke arah orang-orang tadi pergi terus langsung bub</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">虽然有与其中几个人对到眼睛，但我实在不敢开口询问。在这群人全部离开后，隔了一阵子，又有一群非常可疑的人跑过来，然后其中两人朝着先前那些人离开的方向跑去，而其他人就全部跑散了。有些人朝着码头跑过去，有些人朝着仓库的方向跑过去….现在回想起来，他们的穿着实在是有点奇怪。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_guard1.ntk_12_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask if he hasn't seen them since</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya apakah setelah itu pernah melihat mereka lagi</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">问他是否之后再也没见过他们了呢？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_guard1.ntk_13_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I haven't seen them since.. I mean the people who did not lose themselves. I saw the pursuers a few times since the incident but they would just disappear soon or looked crazy so I haven't had a chance to talk to anyone.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya nggak pernah melihat mereka lagi setelah itu. Pastinya mereka orang-orang yang sedang mencari kesadaran. Kadang saya lihat orang-orang yang mengejar mereka, tapi langsung hilang lagi. Orang-orang yang tersisa biasanya sudah tidak normal lagi</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">之后我就没有见到他们了.. 正确来说再也没有看过保持清醒的人了.虽然偶尔也会看到一些人来来回回的跑,但看起来这些人的精神状态都是很不稳定的,所以我也不赶贸然跟他们搭话。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_guard1.ntk_13_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_guard1.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">….....</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_guard1.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">This building is still under surveillance, and we have no other choice than to work ourselves to the bone. What else can I do?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Setidaknya saya sudah menjaga gedung ini sampai sekarang, tapi kali ini mereka menyerang tanpa pikir panjang bagaimana saya bisa menjaga gedung ini?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">现在这建筑物仍继续管制中无可奈何只好帮忙不这样怎办哩</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_guard1.ntk_3_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_guard1.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Yes...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Now there's still something left to do.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Let's combine the keys, make them complete.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Heum…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Setidaknya masih ada hal yang bisa kamu lakukan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Hanya perlu menggabungkan potongan kunci ini menjadi sebuah kunci yang sempurna kan?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">嗯....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">现在仍有要做的事情,</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">可以合成钥匙做成一把完整的吧</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_guard1.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_guard1.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">......3</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">......3</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">......3</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_guard1.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Although the people from "Green" seem mean and fierce, they're actually quite kind and polite.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It's unfortunate that this group is losing their sanity, maybe even their humanity, too.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Padalah dulu meskipun mereka bertampang garang, mereka sangat sopan dan baik</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kini mereka saja sudah menjadi gila</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">青的人虽然长得凶恶,不过有礼貌又亲切,</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">但是那群人现在完全失了神</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_guard1.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_guard1.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">.....4</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">.....4</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">.....4</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_guard1.ntk_8_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Alright, come on. Let's try this…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It's… It's not too hard.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Though, I was much better at this when I was younger.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Alright, here we go!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Done!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Nah…nah…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tidak begitu sulit kan…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Walau begini juga dulu saya cukup terkenal…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Nah!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sudah beres…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">来！</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">不是很难。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我年轻的时候就很厉害了。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">来!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">做好了!</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_guard1.ntk_8_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_guard1.ntk_9_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The weather that day was wonderful. I was on my way to work, saying hello to all the laborers and sailors. Except, a group of students were barging into a building, it was such a great day. They were just.. did not have any respect for this old storage manager.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Hari itu udaranya sangat bagus, nggak ada yang spesial juga. Kecuali pada saat banyak pelajar berlari masuk ke gedung….Mungkin orang tua kayak gini tidak terlihat di mata mereka</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">那天的天气非常的好。不论是水手或者在码头边从事各行各业的人，都在准备着要去上班。除了许多学生跑进建筑物内的事情以外。这些家伙…​​根本就是目中无人。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_guard1.ntk_9_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">继续</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_helper.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">May I ask what you're looking for?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Boleh saya bertanya, apa yang anda cari?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">能告诉我你在找什么吗?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_helper.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Trade Item</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Trade Item</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">交易物品</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Nice to meet you. Can you please fulfill my simple request?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Senang bertemu denganmu. Bisakah kamu membantu saya?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">幸会。可以拜托你帮忙一个简单的任务吗?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Receive Suspicious Folk's Request.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menerima Suspicious Folk's Request</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">接受可疑人士的请托</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The smell of the sea is the only thing that makes me feel at peace here. Those nasty gangsters have seized control of the facilities.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Wangi laut di sinilah yang membuat saya merasa nyaman berada di sini Akan tetapi, para bandit itu datang untuk menguasai fasilitas di sini</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">嘿~.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">真的都找回来了呀,</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">真开心啊</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_1_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Give the Scripture</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menyerahkan Scripture</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">转交经典</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_1_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Whoa! What a sturdy looking student you are!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Hmm, what is wrong with your clothes though?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">A student must wear something proper.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It's your lucky day!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I have just prepared something, why don't you go get it?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Consider it as a present from an old man!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ehe!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kamu kelihatan kuat sekali!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pakaian apa yang kamu pakai itu?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Yang namanya orang itu harus memakai pakaian yang cocok</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kebetulan ada yang sudah saya siapkan pergi dan carilah</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">嘿!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">还真是可靠的朋友啊!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">但是, 衣服怎么穿这样</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">人家说佛要金装, 人要衣装</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">刚好我这有准备好的衣服, 我去拿来给你</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">老人家认为是偶尔给个礼物, 我却非常感激啊</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_1_2_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Listen to his story</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mendengarkan cerita</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">听取故事</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
