    <VALUE Lang="cn">听取故事</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_1_7">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The smell of the sea is the only thing that makes me feel at peace here. Those nasty gangsters have seized control of the facilities.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Wangi laut di sinilah yang membuat saya merasa nyaman berada di sini Akan tetapi, para bandit itu datang untuk menguasai fasilitas di sini</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">海的味道，是这里唯一让我感到平静的东西。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">那些可恶歹徒掌控了设备的控制。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_1_7_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Greet the Old Man</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menyapa</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">向Old Man打招呼</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_1_7_10">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about Document</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang dokumen</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问文件书</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_1_7_11">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Exchange 13 Spiritual Spheres</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menukar 13th Spiritual Sphere</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">兑换 13 灵珠</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_1_7_12">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about Security Code for Head Office</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang kode keluar masuk Main Building</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问要进入Head Office的安全密码</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_1_7_13">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask to Implant Code</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Meminta pencangkokan kode</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问植入密码</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_1_7_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about What Happened</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya apa yang terjadi</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问发生了何事</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_1_7_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Give the Empty Bottles</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menyerahkan empty bottle</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">传达空瓶</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_1_7_4">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about What Happened</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya apa yang terjadi</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问发生了何事</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_1_7_5">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Give the Spare Parts</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menyerahkan part</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">传达零件</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_1_7_6">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about Situation</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya situasi</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问现况</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_1_7_7">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Give the Cassette</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menyerahkan tape</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">传达卡带</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_1_7_8">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about the Cassette</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang tape</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问卡带</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_1_7_9">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Give the Recovered Cassette</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menyerahkan tape yang sudah diperbaiki</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">传达已修复好的卡带</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_1_8">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_10_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It looks like it's been placed in a humid environment for a long time. Please go to the Trading Hole and ask the Image Expert to recover it. He's a good friend of mine.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kayaknya terlalu lama disimpan di tempat yang lembab</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kadar garam juga mengambil bagian</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Carilah 'Audio Visual Expert' di Trading Hole dan minta dia untuk memperbaikinya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Dia orang yang aku kenal makanya dia akan lakukan tanpa banyak omong</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">看起来好像长期受潮的样子。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">还有不少盐分。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">去找Trading Hole 的影像专家 Image Expert，拜托他修复带子。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">是我认识的朋友，二话不说就会帮忙了</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_10_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_11_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Wow! Thanks! Is there any news from my friend who fixed this?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Okay! Forget about the cassette for a moment.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">This might be good to know: a few days ago there was a kid who was kidnapped and disappeared,</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Who could have done that?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Euhm…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Makasih atas kerja kerasnya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Orang yang membantu memperbaiki ini tidak bilang sesuatu?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">…Kalau begitu sudahlah</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Untuk sementara lupakan saja tentang tape ini</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya mengatakan itu hanya karena khawatir</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Anak-anak mungkin diculik atau men</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">嗯…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">辛苦了，学生。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">帮忙修复的朋友没说叫什么吗?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">行了，没关系…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">一时之间，先把带子的事忘掉。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">别婆婆妈妈的了。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">日前孩子们不知是被绑架了，还是消失了…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">探听之下，原来是那些人…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">还是全都忘掉才好。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_11_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_12_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">.......</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">.......</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">.......</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_13_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The last thing I heard was something about the No. 4 Wharf. I think you can just ignore it. Maybe.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You might not have any help, but it won't be hard to search for it.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">The last thing I heard was something about the No. 4 Wharf. I think you can just ignore it. Maybe.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">You might not have any help, but it won't be hard to search for it.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">以前虽听说要到No. 4 Wharf，但并未明确要给何人，所以就暂时搁着。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">虽没有帮手，但不难找。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_13_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_14_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">There's much more you'll need to do in the future.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Somehow, I believe you'll be able to accomplish your goals.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">There's much more you'll need to do in the future.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Somehow, I believe you'll be able to accomplish your goals.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">以后麻烦的事还多著呢。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">相信你会好好干的</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_14_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_16_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">My duty here was to safeguard the docks and prevent illegal activity here. I'm sad to say that the illegal traders are just ignoring me, and this area is really under the control of evil gangsters.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau dilihat dari kamu yang datang ke tempat seperti ini untuk bertanya saya jadi tahu kamu penasaran tentang dokumen apa…tapi sekarang dokumen itu tidak ada pada saya…beberapa waktu yang lalu orang-orang yang membawa ikan di punggungnya sudah merebutnya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">来到这种地方，看他问什么，即使不说，也大概知道是为了那份文件…我现在可没有那份文件…不久前扛着好像鱼的男子来过，全都带走了，什么…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">从文件到书籍，凡是用纸做的东西全都带走了。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">还真…做得很好。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">你如果把那些找回来的话，我不会忘记，一定会向您致谢的。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_16_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Listen to the Old Man's Request</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menerima</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">听取Old Man的请求</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_16_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menolak</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_17_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Thank you…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Although this is just an old book, it's pretty important to me.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Take care…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Terimakasih…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Meskipun di mata orang lain kebanyakannya adalah buku-buku tua tapi untuk saya semua ini sangatlah berharga…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Hati-hati dan semoga beruntung….</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">谢谢…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">虽然剩下的书大多是旧书， 但对我而言则是重要的…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">保重，祝你好运</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_17_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_18_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I'm grateful for what you've done.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya benar - benar berterima kasih atas semuanya.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">喂…收下。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">不是特殊的珠子吗?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">不是啦…已经很普遍了。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">当作纪念也好，不然的话，以后必要时，我也可以用文件来交换。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">你方便就好</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_18_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_19_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Hm? The item I gave you came back to me?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Hm? Tukar itemnya dengan saya?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">哼…我给您的珠子又还给我了吗？有些意外…</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_19_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Get Scroll of Warrior Dance</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tukar dengan skill scroll Warrior Dance</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">获得Warrior Dance 技能文书</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_19_0_10"><VALUE Lang="tw">兌換 火柱（127級／氣功部）</VALUE><VALUE Lang="GS">Skill book: Fire Pillar (Lv127, Class=520, Item=176/32)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="id">Skill book: Fire Pillar (Lv127, Class=520, Item=176/32)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="cn">Skill book: Fire Pillar (Lv127, Class=520, Item=176/32)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="th">Skill book: Fire Pillar (Lv127, Class=520, Item=176/32)</VALUE></SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_d_oldman1.ntk_19_0_11"><VALUE Lang="tw">兌換 麻痺（147級／氣功部）</VALUE><VALUE Lang="GS">Skill book: Paralyzed (Lv147, Class=520, Item=176/53)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="id">Skill book: Paralyzed (Lv147, Class=520, Item=176/53)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="cn">Skill book: Paralyzed (Lv147, Class=520, Item=176/53)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="th">Skill book: Paralyzed (Lv147, Class=520, Item=176/53)</VALUE></SENTENSE>
