    <VALUE Lang="cn">拿Hero Invitation 兑换 Hero's Power Bow Pack</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_6thkor.ntk_2_0_6">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Exchange Hero Invitation for Hero's Vital Bow Pack</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menukarkan Invitation letter dengan 'Hero's vital bow'</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">拿Hero Invitation 兑换 Hero's Vital Bow Pack</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_6thkor.ntk_2_0_7">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Exchange Hero Invitation for Hero's Cestus Pack</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menukarkan Invitation letter dengan 'Hero's gaunts'</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">拿Hero Invitation 兑换 Hero's Cestus Pack</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_6thkor.ntk_2_0_8">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Exchange Hero Invitation for Hero's Heavy Cestus Pack</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menukarkan Invitation letter dengan 'Hero's heavy fist'</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">拿Hero Invitation兑换 Hero's Heavy Cestus Pack</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_6thkor.ntk_2_0_9">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Exchange Hero Invitation for Hero's Vital Cestus Pack</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menukarkan Invitation letter dengan 'Hero's vital gaunts'</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">拿Hero Invitation 兑换 Hero's Vital Cestus Pack</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_6thkor.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Good Luck !!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Semoga Beruntung!!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">祝您好运！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_azi.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Please continuously show your Love and Support for Ran Online in 2012!!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Terus berikan dukungan dan cinta untuk RAN Online di tahun 2012!!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">在2012年里，请您一往如初地支持、爱戴、继续关心我们的Ran Online！谢谢！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_azi.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Trade Items</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jual beli item</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">交易物品</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_bus.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">This is the Bus Terminal.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Once have your Bus Ticket ready, you can use the Bus Service to move to another area.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Informasi rute bus kota</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Untuk menggunakan bus cukup menunjukan tiket</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这里是公车站。只要您拥有Bus Ticket ，就可以使用公车服务，畅游各地区唷。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_bus.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ride the Bus</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Naik Bus</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">搭乘公车</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_bus.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">OpenShop</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jual beli item</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">开启商店</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_bus.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Document Scan is now complete.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Do you want to send?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Dokumen sudah selesai discan.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Apakah mau dikirim?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">已完成文件的扫描。要发送吗？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_bus.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Send Out Skill Document</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mengirimkan Dokumen Skill</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">寄出Skill Document</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_bus.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Processing...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Document has been sent.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Proses...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Dokumen sudah terkirim~~</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">处理中……..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">文件已传送完成。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_bus.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Begin</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mulai</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">最初</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_bus.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Dry ice is very important for storing ice cream, but the dry ice kept in the warehouse has been stolen. It's now your job to find the stolen dry ice.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Es Kering sangat penting untuk mencegah es krim mencair. Akan tetapi, setiap hari ada saja yang menghilang karena dicuri. Bisakah kamu membantu saya mencarinya?.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">Dry ice是储存冰淇淋最重要的东西。但被保管在Warehouse的Dry ice竟然被偷走了。请把它找出来。谢谢。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_bus.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">There are some places where the emergency action guide hasn't been delivered yet. Get the guide books near the book stores and distribute them.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Masih ada beberapa tempat yang belum tersampaikan pembagian Emergency Action Guide nya. Ambil Guide Books nya dekat toko buku dan tolong disalurkan..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">还是有些地方尚未接收到紧急措施的相关指令。请至Book Store附近领取导览手册， 并发给他们吧。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_bus.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You should obtain the security monitor videotape to report about the dead policeman in the prison.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The prisoners already transferred that videotape somewhere, so try to retrieve the security monitor videotape from the prisoners.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kamu seharusnya mendapatkan videotape yang berisi tentang laporan kematian polisi di penjara.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Video tersebut sudah dikirim ke suatu tempat, jadi tolong coba cari di sekitar prisoner.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">您应该要取得安全监控录像，并报告在监狱里死亡的警察事件。Prisoner已经将该录影带送到某处了。 请从他身上取回录影带。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_bus.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Many students were injured from the spell attacks, and especially large number of students were injured in Root Hole. Retrieve the spell skill document from the Elemental Sorcerer to make defensive mechanism work against the spell attacks.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Banyak pelajar yang terluka karena serangan sihir dan rata - rata terluka di Root Hole. Ambil spell skill dokumen dari Elemental Sorcerer untuk membuat alat mekanism berjalan normal lagi untuk menghadang sihir tersebut.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">许多学生受了法术之伤，特别是 Root Hole的学生伤得最严重。请您从Elemental Sorcerer那儿取回法术技能的文件，并制作防御装置。这是为了要阻挡来自法术的伤害持续扩大。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_bus.ntk_8_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Completed.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Completed.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">完成</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_christmas_200612.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Um . What should I do now?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">For god sake!! Rogue Ruloph stole all my Christmas present that I was going to give away on this Christmas</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Christmas present for those children out there…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Could you help me to take it back?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Eheh, sebaiknya bagaimana?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Gawat sekali, sewaktu saya membetulkan Kereta luncur Rudolph-rudolph nakal itu malah membuat ulah</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mereka sudah mengambil semua hadiah natal yang mau dibagikan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ini semua adalah hadiah yang akan dibagikan kepada para pe</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">嗯~我现在应该怎么办？</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">看在上帝份上！Rogue Ruloph偷走了我所有的圣诞礼物，这些是我原本要带去给孩子们当圣诞礼物的呢！</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">你能帮我把它夺回莱吗？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_christmas_200612.ntk_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Did you really take it back?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Thank you so much my dear.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Fortunately I got some items here that Rogue Rudolph did not steal.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">If you are okay, I would like to give you this for present. How’s that?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Benar-benar menemukannya?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Benar-benar terimakasih- Untung saja ada beberapa item yang tidak bisa dibawa oleh para Rudolph nakal</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sebagai balasan aku mau memberikan itu pada kamu, bagaimana?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">您真的把它送回去了吗？</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">太谢谢你了~亲爱的英雄。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">幸运的是我有一些物品没有被Rogue Rudolph给偷走。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">如果您不介意的话，我想把它送您作为奖励，可以吗？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_christmas_200612.ntk_1_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Exchange to X_Mas RandomBox[7D]</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ditukarkan dengan X_Mas Random Box</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">兑换X_Mas RandomBox[7D]</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_christmas_200612.ntk_1_1_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Exchange to Christmas Box [M] [3D]</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ditukarkan dengan 'Santa Suits [M]'</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">兑换Christmas Box [M] [3D]</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_christmas_200612.ntk_1_1_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Exchange to Christmas Themed Gift Box [F] [15D]</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ditularkan dengan 'Santa Suits [F]'</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">兑换Christmas Themed Gift Box [F] [15D]</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_christmas_200612.ntk_1_1_4">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Exchange to XMas Special Hat[M][15D]</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ditukarkan dengan X_Mas topi spesial (M)</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">兑换XMas Special Hat[M][15D]</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_christmas_200612.ntk_1_1_5">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Exchange to XMas Special Hat[F][15D]</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ditukarkan dengan X_Mas topi spesial (M)</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">兑换XMas Special Hat[F][15D]</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_christmas_200612.ntk_1_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Did you really take it back?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Thank you so much my dear.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Fortunately I got some items here that Rogue Rudolph did not steal.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">If you are okay, I would like to give you this for present. How’s that?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Benar-benar menemukannya?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Benar-benar terimakasih- Untung saja ada beberapa item yang tidak bisa dibawa oleh para Rudolph nakal</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sebagai balasan aku mau memberikan itu pada kamu, bagaimana?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">您真的把它送回去了吗？</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">太谢谢你了~亲爱的英雄。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">幸运的是我有一些物品没有被Rogue Rudolph给偷走。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">如果您不介意的话，我想把它送您作为奖励，可以吗？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_christmas_200612.ntk_1_2_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Exchange to X_Mas RandomBox[7D]</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ditukarkan dengan X_Mas Random Box</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">兑换X_Mas RandomBox[7D]</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_christmas_200612.ntk_1_2_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Exchange to Christmas Box [M] [3D]</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ditukarkan dengan 'Santa Suits [M]'</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">兑换Christmas Box [M] [3D]</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_christmas_200612.ntk_1_2_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Exchange to Christmas Themed Gift Box [F] [15D]</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ditularkan dengan 'Santa Suits [F]'</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">兑换Christmas Themed Gift Box [F] [15D]</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_christmas_200612.ntk_1_2_4">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Exchange to XMas Special Hat[M][15D]</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ditukarkan dengan X_Mas topi spesial (M)</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">兑换XMas Special Hat[M][15D]</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_christmas_200612.ntk_1_2_5">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Exchange to XMas Special Hat[F][15D]</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ditukarkan dengan X_Mas topi spesial (M)</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">兑换 XMas Special Hat[F][15D]</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_christmas_200612.ntk_1_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Did you really take it back?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Thank you so much my dear.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Fortunately I got some items here that Rogue Rudolph did not steal.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">If you are okay, I would like to give you this for present. How’s that?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Benar-benar menemukannya?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Benar-benar terimakasih- Untung saja ada beberapa item yang tidak bisa dibawa oleh para Rudolph nakal</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sebagai balasan aku mau memberikan itu pada kamu, bagaimana?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">您真的把它送回去了吗？</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">太谢谢你了~亲爱的英雄。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">幸运的是我有一些物品没有被Rogue Rudolph给偷走。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">如果您不介意的话，我想把它送您作为奖励，可以吗？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_christmas_200612.ntk_1_3_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Exchange to X_Mas RandomBox[7D]</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ditukarkan dengan X_Mas Random Box</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">兑换X_Mas RandomBox[7D]</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_christmas_200612.ntk_1_3_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Exchange to Christmas Box [M] [3D]</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ditukarkan dengan 'Santa Suits [M]'</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">兑换Christmas Box [M] [3D]</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_christmas_200612.ntk_1_3_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Exchange to Christmas Themed Gift Box [F] [15D]</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ditularkan dengan 'Santa Suits [F]'</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">兑换Christmas Themed Gift Box [F] [15D]</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_christmas_200612.ntk_1_3_4">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Exchange to XMas Special Hat[M][15D]</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ditukarkan dengan X_Mas topi spesial (M)</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">兑换XMas Special Hat[M][15D]</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_christmas_200612.ntk_1_3_5">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Exchange to XMas Special Hat[F][15D]</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ditukarkan dengan X_Mas topi spesial (M)</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">兑换XMas Special Hat[F][15D]</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_fire bird.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Have you ever heard about the Feather of Firebird?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Apakah kamu pernah mendengar tentang Feather of Firebird?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">您有听说过 Feather of Firebird吗？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_fire bird.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about the feather of Firebird.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang Feather of Firebird.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问关于Feather of Firebird。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_fire bird.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Say, you want to exchange the Feather of Firebird to 'Firebird Hat'!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jadi kamu ingin menukar Feather of Firebird dengan 'Firebird Hat'!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">说！您想要拿 Feather of Firebird 去兑换 'Firebird Hat'！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_fire bird.ntk_1_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Say, you want to upgrade your 'Firebird Hat'</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Apakah kamu ingin mengupgrade 'Firebird Hat'?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">快说！说您想要帮'Firebird Hat'做升级！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_fire bird.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Feather of Firebird? Firebird seldom reveals itself in this world! Do you know? When, it does appear, it means that something serious is going down somewhere in this world. It is not just considered holy for nothing. Even its feather also contains the mystical power. If you can eliminate monsters and collect some feathers for me then I will make you a hat with power of Firebird.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Feather of Firebird? Firebird selalu menyembunyikan dirinya! Apakah kamu tahu? Ketika dia muncul, berarti sesuatu akan terjadi di dunia ini. Bahkan bulu nya saja mengandung kekuatan ajaib. Jikalau bisa, kumpulkan bulu nya dan bawakan ke saya. Akan kubuatk</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">Feather of Firebird？Firebird很少在这世界上露脸见人！所以，知道吗？当它出现，就代表严重的事情即将降临在这个世界上的某个地方了。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">它不只是一种神圣的象征，甚至它的羽毛也包含了神秘的力量。如果您能消灭怪物，并收集了一些羽毛给我的话，我就让您的帽子与火鸟的力量做结合唷。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_fire bird.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_fire bird.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Did you get the feathers? Let me make you a hat filled with the power of Firebird.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Apakah kamu sudah mendapatkan bulunya?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">您拿到羽毛了吗？让我帮您的帽子与火鸟的力量做结合吧。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_fire bird.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Exchange 1 Feather of Firebird to Firebird Hat (I).</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tukar 1 Feather of Firebird dengan Firebird Hat (I).</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">请将1 Feather of Firebird 拿去兑换Firebird Hat (I)。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_fire bird.ntk_3_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_fire bird.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Did you get the feathers? More feathers for better hat! So collect them as many as you can!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Apakah kamu sudah mendapatkan bulunya? Makin banyak bulu yang kamu kumpulkan, makin kuat topi yang akan dihasilkan! Kumpulkan sebanyak yang kamu bisa!!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">您拿到羽毛了吗？越多的羽毛可以打造越酷炫的帽子哟。快多多收集吧！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_fire bird.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Receive Firebird Hat (II) [Feather of Firebird(10)+Firebird Hat(I)]</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menerima Firebird Hat (II) [Feather of Firebird(10)+Firebird Hat(I)]</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">领取Firebird Hat (II) [Feather of Firebird(10)+Firebird Hat(I)]</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_fire bird.ntk_4_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Receive Firebird Hat (III) [Feather of Firebird(30)+Firebird Hat(II)]</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menerima Firebird Hat (III) [Feather of Firebird(30)+Firebird Hat(II)]</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">领取 Firebird Hat (III) [Feather of Firebird(30)+Firebird Hat(II)]</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_fire bird.ntk_4_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Receive Firebird Hat (IV) [Feather of Firebird(100)+Firebird Hat(III)</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menerima Firebird Hat (IV) [Feather of Firebird(100)+Firebird Hat(III)</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">领取 Firebird Hat (IV) [Feather of Firebird(100)+Firebird Hat(III)</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_fire bird.ntk_4_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Receive Firebird Hat (V) [Feather of Firebird(300)+FirebirdHat(IV)]</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menerima Firebird Hat (V) [Feather of Firebird(300)+FirebirdHat(IV)]</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">领取Firebird Hat (V) [Feather of Firebird(300)+FirebirdHat(IV)]</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_fire bird.ntk_4_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Receive Firebird Hat (VI) [Feather of Firebird(300)+Firebird Hat(V)]</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menerima Firebird Hat (VI) [Feather of Firebird(300)+Firebird Hat(V)]</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">领取 Firebird Hat (VI) [Feather of Firebird(300)+Firebird Hat(V)]</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_fire bird.ntk_4_0_6">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Receive Firebird Hat (VII) [Feather of Firebird(300)+FirebirdHat(VI)]</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menerima Firebird Hat (VII) [Feather of Firebird(300)+FirebirdHat(VI)]</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">领取Firebird Hat (VII) [Feather of Firebird(300)+FirebirdHat(VI)]</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_fire bird.ntk_4_0_7">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Receive Firebird Hat (VIII) [Feather of Firebird(300)+FirebirdHat(VII)</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menerima Firebird Hat (VIII) [Feather of Firebird(300)+FirebirdHat(VII)</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">领取Firebird Hat (VIII) [Feather of Firebird(300)+FirebirdHat(VII)</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_fire bird.ntk_4_0_8">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_gentlegirl.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Do you have plates from the event ?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Eliminate mobs from your level to collect event plates then bring it to me. I have some nice items to exchange. You want hunt weak mobs and come to me to brag, right? Don't expect any compensation if you do such an action.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Apakah kamu mempunyai "plate" dari event?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bunuh monster di luar sana untuk mendapatkannya. Jika kamu membawanya, aku akan memberikan hadiah sebagai gantinya.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">您有从活动中得到Plates吗？</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">以你的等级程度去消灭怪物，并收集Plates拿来给我。我有一些不错的物品可以跟您交换唷。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">您想打些弱小的怪物，然后来我吹牛，对吧？</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">如过您真的这么做的话，就不要指望会得到任何奖励。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_gentlegirl.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about Oblivion Potion.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang Oblivion Potion.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问忘却药水的事情</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_gentlegirl.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Exchange to E Class Random Box (1~50Lv)</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tukar dengan E Class Random Box (1~50Lv)</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">兑换E Class Random Box (1~50Lv)</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_gentlegirl.ntk_1_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Exchange to D Class Random Box (51~100Lv)</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tukar dengan D Class Random Box (51~100Lv)</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">兑换D Class Random Box (51~100Lv)</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_gentlegirl.ntk_1_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Exchange to C Class Random Box (101~150Lv)</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tukar dengan C Class Random Box (101~150Lv)</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">兑换C Class Random Box (101~150Lv)</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_gentlegirl.ntk_1_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Exchange to B Class Random Box (151~200Lv)</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tukar dengan B Class Random Box (151~200Lv)</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">兑换B Class Random Box (151~200Lv)</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_gentlegirl.ntk_1_0_6">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Exchange to E Class Random Box (201Lv~)</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tukar dengan E Class Random Box (201Lv~)</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">兑换E Class Random Box (201Lv~)</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_gentlegirl.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It's already summer so let's forget all the bad memories in the past. Of course I'm not giving away Oblivion Potion for free because I'm afraid it will get rotten.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ahirnya musim panas telah tiba, lupakan semua kenangan masa lalu yang buruk. Tentu saja saya tidak akan memberikan Oblivion Potion gratis.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">夏天已到，让我们忘记所有的不愉快的回忆吧！当然，我不会免费送出Oblivion Potion，因为我害怕它会腐烂坏掉。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_gentlegirl.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Receives Oblivion Potion.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menerima Oblivion Potion.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">取得忘却药水</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_gsworldcup.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">.......</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">.......</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">.......</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_gsworldcup.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">OpenShop</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jual beli item</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">打开商店</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_gsworldcup.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ride the bus</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Naik Bus</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">搭乘公车</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_halloween_2008.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Halloween is over already! Why are you summoning me now? What, make jewels?... Geez, that is why people don't play on this server much.. Hey, yeah you over there? Don't you agree?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Halloween sudah selesai! Mengapa kamu memanggil saya sekarang? Apa! Hanya untuk membuat jewel?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">万圣节已经结束了！为什么你现在还召唤我呢？</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这是什么？制作珠宝？…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">噢噢~~ 这就是为什么人们不来这个伺服器进行游戏的原因吗？…. 哎，是啊，你在那里吗？你不同意吗？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_halloween_2008.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">What can you do with the jewels?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Apa yang bisa kamu lakukan dengan jewel tersebut?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这些珠宝能拿来做什么呢？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_halloween_2008.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">… Please just exchange the jewel.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">… Berikan saja jewel itu.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">请兑换珠宝给我。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_halloween_2008.ntk_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_halloween_2008.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Oh.. You don't know.. Ha Ha.. Of course, because you wouldn't have seen it before. It's alright! Don't be ashamed of your ignorance.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Mounting a jewel on a ring will add extra abilities to the ring. Ruby for HP and Attack Power, Sapphire for MP and SP, Jade for SP and Moving Speed. I am the mastermind who can make such jewels.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ah, kamu tidak tahu.. Ha Ha.. Tentu saja, karena kamu tak pernah melihat sebelumnya.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya bisa menambahnya menjadi kuat. Ruby untuk HP dan Kekuatan Serangan, Sapphire untuk MP dan SP, Jade untuk SP dan Moving Speed.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">呵呵..你不知道..哈哈..当然，因为你以前没有见过。这是正常的！千万不要感到不好意思。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">上装宝石能使戒指增加额外的能力。Ruby属于HP和攻击力；Sapphire属于MP和SP；Jade属于SP和移动速度。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我是谁呢？就是能够做出这样珠宝的天才。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_halloween_2008.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">… Please just exchange the jewel.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">… Berikan saja jewel itu.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">请兑换珠宝给我。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_halloween_2008.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Okay, get me 15 of each Chipped Ruby, Sapphire and Jade for each normal jewels and 35 of them each for each of deluxe jewels.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Okay, bawakan 15 dari tiap Ruby, Sapphire dan Jade untuk tiap jewel normal and 35 untuk setiap jewel deluxe.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">好。普通的部分，请给我15个Chipped Ruby, 15个Sapphire 和15个Jade ，昂贵的部分，请给我各35个。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_halloween_2008.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Here is chipped ruby.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Berikan chipped ruby.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这是碎裂的Ruby。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_halloween_2008.ntk_3_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Here is chipped Sapphire.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Berikan chipped Sapphire.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这是碎裂的Sapphire。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_halloween_2008.ntk_3_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Here is chipped Jade.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Berikan chipped Jade.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这是碎裂的Jade。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_halloween_2008.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">15 Chipped Rubies can be exchanged for a Ruby and 35 Chipped Rubies for a Deluxe Ruby, what do you wish to get?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">15 Chipped Rubies dapat diganti untuk Ruby and 35 Chipped Rubies untuk Deluxe Ruby.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">15个Chipped Rubies 可兑换1个Ruby ，35个 Chipped Rubies 可兑换1个 Deluxe Ruby。怎么样呢？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_halloween_2008.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Exchange 15 Chipped Rubies for a Ruby</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tukar 15 Chipped Rubies dengan Ruby</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">拿15 Chipped Rubies 去兑换1个 Ruby。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_halloween_2008.ntk_4_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Exchange 35 Chipped Rubies for a Deluxe Ruby</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tukar 35 Chipped Rubies untuk Deluxe Ruby</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">拿 35 Chipped Rubies去兑换1个 Deluxe Ruby。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_halloween_2008.ntk_4_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Exchange it for a different jewel.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pilih jewel lain.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">去兑换1个奇特Jewel。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_halloween_2008.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">15 Chipped Sapphires can be exchanged for a Sapphire and 35 Chipped Sapphires for a Deluxe Sapphire, what do you wish to get?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">15 Chipped Sapphires can be Tukard untuk Sapphire dan 35 Chipped Sapphires untuk Deluxe Sapphire.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">15个Chipped Sapphires 可兑换1个Sapphire ，35个Chipped Sapphires可兑换1个Deluxe Sapphire。怎么样呢？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_halloween_2008.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Exchange 15 Chipped Sapphires for a Sapphire</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tukar 15 Chipped Sapphires untuk Sapphire</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">拿15 Chipped Sapphires去兑换1个Sapphire。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_halloween_2008.ntk_5_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Exchange 35 Chipped Sapphires for a Deluxe Sapphire</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tukar 35 Chipped Sapphires untuk Deluxe Sapphire</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">拿35 Chipped Sapphires 去兑换1个 Deluxe Sapphire。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_halloween_2008.ntk_5_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Exchange it for a different jewel.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pilih jewel lain.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">去兑换1个奇特Jewel。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_halloween_2008.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">15 Chipped Jades can be exchanged for a Jade and 35 Chipped Jades for a Deluxe Jade, what do you wish to get?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">15 Chipped Jades can be Tukard untuk Jade dan 35 Chipped Jades untuk Deluxe Jade.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">15个Chipped Jades可兑换1个Jade ，35个Chipped Jades可兑换1个Deluxe Jade。怎么样呢？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_halloween_2008.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Exchange 15 Chipped Jades for a Jade</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tukar 15 Chipped Jades untuk Jade</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">拿 15 个Chipped Jades交换 Jade</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_halloween_2008.ntk_6_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Exchange 35 Chipped Jades for a Deluxe Jade</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tukar 35 Chipped Jades untuk Deluxe Jade</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">拿 35 个Chipped Jades交换 Deluxe Jade</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_halloween_2008.ntk_6_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Exchange to a different Jewel</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pilih jewel lain</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">兑换奇特的Jewel</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_july.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">This is an Item Assembler distributed and installed by the great robot scientist 'Tony Stark'.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mesin Penggabung Item yang dirakit oleh Tony Stalk pembuat mesin yang paling hebat.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">最棒的科学机器人- 'Tony Stark'是可靠的 'Item Assembler‘ 。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_july.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I would like to assemble my items.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ingin menggabungkan item.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我想要统整我的所有物品。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_july.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Trade Items</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jual beli item</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">交易物品</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_juneevent.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It's been a while! Hey, have you heard about the power of Starlight and Moonlight? People at Another World have managed to create a crystal condensed with new type of power using the pureness of the Moon and the stars. However, they've got them stolen to an unknown group, even before they have ever had a chance to use it. Would you please go and retrieve these crystals? If you can get them back then there will be great rewards waiting... Hmm, Hmm.. Anyways, remember that 6 Moonlight Crystals for a Moonlight Casket and 6 Moonlight Crystal and 1 Starlight Crystal can be exchanged for a Starlight Casket.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lama tak bertemu! Apakah kamu sudah mendengar tentang kekuatan dari Starlight dan Moonlight? Orang - orang dari dunia lain mencoba membuat sesuatu dari kekuatan bulan dan bintang. Akan tetapi, sebelum digunakan sudah dicuri oleh orang - orang yang tidak b</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">已经有一段时间了！嘿，你听说过星光和月光的力量吗？有人在另一个世界已成功地创造出月亮和星星的纯净力量的结晶。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">请你去确认这些结晶Crystals？请记住，</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">6个Moonlight Crystals可换取1个Moonlight Casket；</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">6个Moonlight Crystal 和 1个Starlight Crystal可换取1个Starlight Casket。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_juneevent.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">(EVENT) I've got the Moonlight Crystals.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">(EVENT) Saya mendapatkan Moonlight Crystals.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">（活动），我已经得到了Moonlight Crystal。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_juneevent.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You remember that 6 Moonlight Crystals can be exchanged for 1 Moonlight Casket and 6 Moonlight Crystals and 1 Starlight Crystal can be exchanged for 1 Starlight Casket, right? Now, what would you like to choose?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kamu ingat bahwa 6 Moonlight Crystals dapat ditukar dengan 1 Moonlight Casket dan 6 Moonlight Crystals dan 1 Starlight Crystal dapat ditukar dengan 1 Starlight Casket bukan? Mana yang kamu pilih?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">你还记得 6个 Moonlight Crystals可以兑换1个 Moonlight Casket；6个 Moonlight Crystals 和 1 个Starlight Crystal 可兑换 1个 Starlight Casket对不对？现在，作个选择吧！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_juneevent.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Exchange 6 Moonlight Crystals to a Moonlight Casket.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tukar 6 Moonlight Crystals dengan a Moonlight Casket.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">拿 6 Moonlight Crystals 去交换 1个Moonlight Casket。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_juneevent.ntk_2_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Exchange 6 Moonlight Crystals and 1 Starlight Crystal to a Starlight Casket.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tukar 6 Moonlight Crystals dan 1 Starlight Crystal dengan Starlight Casket.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">拿 6 Moonlight Crystals 和 1 Starlight Crystal 去交换 1个Starlight Casket。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_juneevent.ntk_2_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_optimus_seller.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You wouldn't know, how scary my boss 'Veno' is!!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You know what? Actually, I am a peace lover!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">This Bike is what 'Veno' used to ride.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I am selling it just to make enough gold to get away to somewhere in the outer space!!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Hey this is almost Free!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Will you hurry up and just buy this bike?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kamu tidak bakal tahu seberapa menakutkannya 'Veno' bos saya!!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kamu tahu apa? Saya adalah pecinta damai!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ini adalah motor yang dipakai 'Veno'.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya menjualnya agar saya bisa mendapatkan uang untuk kabur dari sini!!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ini sangat murah!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tolong beli y</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">您不会知道我的老板Veno有多么地可怕！</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">知道吗？我其实是个和平主义情人！</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这车子Veno曾经骑过。我会卖它是仅为了得到足够的金币，好脱身逃到外面的世界去。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">嘿，这几乎是免费的唷！ 您会想快点把这辆车给买下来吗？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_optimus_seller.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Trade Items</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jual beli item</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">交易物品</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_spring.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">There was an anonymous intel saying that a Gang called 'Chung' is planning to produce illegal weapons. They are eager collecting massive amount of gemstones to produce illegal weapons.. If you could just take the gemstones headed to 'Chung' while delivered then Saint Foundation will compensate you with a corresponding reward. Only, if you get me an Item which I need get from Saint Foundation. Hey, nothing is free in this world</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ada laporan bahwa Kelompok preman 'Red Axe' berusaha untuk memproduksi senjata secara ilegal. Mereka sedang mengumpulkan Gemstone dengan jumlah besar untuk memproduksi senjata ilegal ini. Kalau kamu bisa merebut Gemstone-gemstone itu sebelum sampai ke tan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">有匿名人士透露，一个名为Chung的帮派组织正计划生产非法武器。他们渴望收集大量的宝石来生产非法武器。如果你能取得以Chung为首的宝石，并交付完成，那么Saint Foundation将会给您奖励。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">只是，希望您也给我一个从 Saint Foundation取得的物品吧。嘿嘿，在这个世界上没有什么是免费的。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_spring.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Please exchange this for Newbie Pack.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tolong berikan Beginner Gift Box</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">请兑换 Newbie Pack。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_spring.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Please exchange this for Tough Hanger Pack.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tolong berikan Intermediate Gift Box</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">请兑换 Tough Hanger Pack。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_spring.ntk_1_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Please exchange this for Master Pack.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tolong berikan Superior Gift Box</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">请兑换 Master Pack。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_spring.ntk_1_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">How can I get the Gemstone?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bagaimana cara mendapatkan Gemstone?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我该如何取得Gemstone 宝石呢？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_spring.ntk_1_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">How can I get the Pendant?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bagaimana caranya mendapatkan rosary?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我该如何取得Pendant坠子呢？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_spring.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">All the hostile beings which exist in this world has some connectivity with 'Chung'. Rather weak ones which lower level students can face carry rubies, ones which average level students can face carries Aquas and the ones which are fairly stronger carries Tsavolight to supply them to 'Chung'.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You will be able to acquire gemstones which they carry by defeating them. Of course, its only possible when they do carry such stones.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kebanyakan musuh yang ada di dunia ini berhubungan langsung dengan komplotan 'Red axe'. Mereka yang bisa ditangani oleh para pelajar yang berlevel rendah biasanya membawa 'Rubi gemstone', yang berlevel menengah membawa 'Aqua gemstone' dan yang berlevel ti</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">所有这个世界里的是是非非皆与“Chung”有所关联。低等怪物负责将宝石Ruby；中等怪物负责将宝石Aquas，高等怪物负责将宝石Tsavolight传递给Chung组织。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">您若是击败了它们，就可以拿到它们持有的宝石。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_spring.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">How can I get the Pendant?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bagaimana caranya mendapatkan rosary?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我该如何取得Pendant坠子呢？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_spring.ntk_2_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_spring.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Pandents are used to produce exclusive ornaments. Therefore, Saint Foundation also has classified it as a 1st grade item and spends lots of time reserving it.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Currently, pendants are known to be possessed by only a few people. The Guard in front of Mystick Peak School, Archery Agent at Trading Hole and Jail Warden(Prison) at Prison Entrance who bought Ruby, Aqua and Tsavolight pandents panicly in the past, might be able to make quite a fortune now. Go talk to them, you might find a way to acquire them!.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Well, I don't even need to mention but who would have thought those useless items in the past could be come a Gold Mine now?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Rosay bisa digunakan untuk membuat aksesori berkualitas tinggi. Karena itu Yayasan Saint juga menganggapnya sebagai Item kelas 1 dan mengumpulkan semua tenaga untuk bisa mengumpulkannya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Hanya ada beberapa orang yang memiliki rosary saat ini. Mungkin Gu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">Pandent为高级装饰制品的材料。 因此， Saint Foundation将其归类为第一级物品，并投资花费大量的时间去保存管理。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">目前，已知Pandent仅由少数人所拥有。过去位在Mystick Peak School的Guard、Trading Hole的Archery Agent、Prison Entrance的Jail Warden(Prison)曾经大量抢购Ruby、Aqua、和 Tsavolight pandent。现在他们可成了大富豪了呢！</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">快去告诉他们，您已经找到取</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_spring.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">How can I get the Gemstone?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bagaimana cara mendapatkan Gemstone?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我该如何取得Gemstone 宝石呢？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_spring.ntk_3_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_summon.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="id">Monumen ini dibuat untuk menghormati para pahlamwan di RAN GS.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Event ini hanya terdapat di RAN GS.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kami berharap para user kami bisa menikmati game ini karena RAN GS adalah game yang langsung diupdate melalui pusat.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这块石头是Ran GS的已逝英雄纪念碑。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">英雄冉的GS。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">Ran的全球性服务希望您能成为本活动的最佳主角。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我们希望您能在这难得的机会里尽情享受各种优惠。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">也正因为主办者为Ran GS的研发商，因此您能享受到的优惠服务将会很不一样唷。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">This stone is created to pay a tributes to the honourable</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">hero of Ran GS.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Be the hero of this event and make this an event prepared</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">only for you in Ran Global Service.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">We hope you could enjoy such an honorable benefit which is only</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">possible because Ran GS is a service provided by the developer</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">directly.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_summon.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Who will be the first Hero to reach the level cap of Ran GS?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Siapakah user pertama yang akan menjadi pahlawan di RAN GS?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">谁将会是第一个成为GS最高荣誉者的英雄呢？拭目以待。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
