    <VALUE Lang="id">Event ini hanya terdapat di RAN GS.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kami berharap para user kami bisa menikmati game ini karena RAN GS adalah game yang langsung diupdate melalui pusat.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这块石头是Ran GS的已逝英雄纪念碑。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">英雄冉的GS。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">Ran的全球性服务希望您能成为本活动的最佳主角。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我们希望您能在这难得的机会里尽情享受各种优惠。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">也正因为主办者为Ran GS的研发商，您能享受到的优惠服务将会很不一样唷。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_summon2.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Who will be the first Hero to reach the level cap of Ran GS?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Siapakah user pertama yang akan menjadi pahlawan di RAN GS?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">谁会是第一个达成Ran GS最高上限的超级英雄呢？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e_summon2.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">########################################</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">#</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS"># [ Glorious Name of Ran World Heroes !! ]</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">#</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS"># Platinum Medalist - `ZenkiE_-l-</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS"># The Level 260 conquered on</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS"># February, 16th 2014 01:41 AM</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">#</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS"># Diamond Medalist - QuanVuU</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS"># The Level 260 conquered on</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS"># March, 9th 2014 20:42 PM</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">#</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS"># Ruby Medalist - -l-Wendy`Marvell</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS"># The Level 260 conquered on</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS"># April, 14th 2014 01:38 AM</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">#</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS"># Sapphire Medalist - -l-_`Babez`_-l-</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS"># The Level 260 conquered on</VALUE>
