    <VALUE Lang="id">Menyampaikan jejak orang yang dicari</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">传达您寻找对象的踪迹</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e1_arms.ntk_1_0_11">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Give Trails of Person You're Looking For</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menyampaikan jejak orang yang dicari</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">传达您寻找对象的踪迹</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e1_arms.ntk_1_0_12">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Give Trails of Person You're Looking For</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menyampaikan jejak orang yang dicari</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">交付您寻找的人的线索</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e1_arms.ntk_1_0_13">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Show Blueprint</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menunjukkan Blueprint</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">给看蓝图</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e1_arms.ntk_1_0_14">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Deliver the Action Guide</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menyerahkan buku panduan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">交付行动指南册</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e1_arms.ntk_1_0_15">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Give the Withdrawal Weapons</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menyerahkan senjata yang dikumpulkan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">交付回收的武器</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e1_arms.ntk_1_0_16">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Start "Collect a Bead"</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mendengarkan permintaan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">开始 "收集面包"</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e1_arms.ntk_1_0_17">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Give Collected Beads</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menyerahkan sphere</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">交付收集到的面包</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e1_arms.ntk_1_0_18">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Start Deliver the News</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya ada apa</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">开始报告内容</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e1_arms.ntk_1_0_19">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Start Deliver the News</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menyelidiki kerugian yang dialami</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">开始报告内容</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e1_arms.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask What's the Matter</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya ada apa</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问有什么关联？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e1_arms.ntk_1_0_20">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about the status of Middle Hole</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tanyakan tentang Middle Hole</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问Middle Hole的状况</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e1_arms.ntk_1_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Give the Weapons</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menyerahkan senjata</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">交付武器</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e1_arms.ntk_1_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Give the Weapons</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menyerahkan senjata</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">交付武器</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e1_arms.ntk_1_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Give the Weapons</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menyerahkan senjata</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">交付武器</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e1_arms.ntk_1_0_6">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Give the Weapons</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menyerahkan senjata</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">交付武器</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e1_arms.ntk_1_0_7">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Give the Weapons</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menyerahkan senjata</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">交付武器</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e1_arms.ntk_1_0_8">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Give Trails of Person You're Looking For</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menyampaikan jejak orang yang dicari</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">传达您寻找对象的踪迹</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e1_arms.ntk_1_0_9">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Give Trails of Person You're Looking For</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menyampaikan jejak orang yang dicari</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">传达您寻找对象的踪迹</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e1_arms.ntk_10_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Then I have something to ask of you.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I have no idea whether there are people who are injured or are in need of help like my friend.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Can you help check the situation nearby?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Iya, aku harus meminta satu bantuan.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mungkin ada orang-orang yang terluka seperti teman saya yang membutuhkan bantuan.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bisa tolong bantu saya untuk memeriksa tempat kejadian di sekitar sini?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">那么，有一件事要拜托一下。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">不知道有没有像我朋友一样受伤或求助的人!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">不确认一下附近的事​​故现场吗</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e1_arms.ntk_10_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e1_arms.ntk_11_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Hmm, furthermore, even the Trading Hole Police Station is reporting the current bad situation…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I am not even sure whether this is true or not.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Euhm, dan tolong sampaikan situasi di sini kepada Polisi di Trading Hole</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mungkin dia tidak tahu kalau hal seperti ini sedang terjadi</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">嗯，并且， 即使在Trading Hole Police Station也请转达一些这里的状况， 或许，有没有这回事都不清楚。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e1_arms.ntk_11_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e1_arms.ntk_12_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Oh what's this?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">What..?! Oh my goodness... How did you get this?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">This is the weapon blueprint that uses a human body. Permanent rechargeable bullet shell and self-recoverable armor... Who the hell even considered this?!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Apa ini?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ini….! Ya Tuhan darimana kamu temukan item-item seperti ini?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ini adalah blue print perakitan senjata yang menggunakan badan manusia</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tameng atau baju baja yang bisa memulihkan diri sendiri berulang-ulang….Sebenarnya orang-orang gila di ma</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这个是什么?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这个…!不会吧。这些是如何求到的?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">利用人的身体制作的武器设计图。这个!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">反复使用的子弹或自动恢复的盔甲…到底是哪个疯子想到这些!?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e1_arms.ntk_12_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask for More Details</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya lebih jelas lagi</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问细节</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e1_arms.ntk_13_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The weird laboratory in underground prison... And the blueprint of Leonine campus!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I heard some rumors about that laboratory. Is the company really doing this?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Terdapat tempat penelitian aneh di bawah penjara Leonine Kampus!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya mendengar banyak rumor aneh tentang laboratorium tersebut. Apakah mereka benar - benar melakukan hal aneh ini?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">监狱的异常实验场…加上 Leonine学院和这设计图！</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">对财团的研究设施虽然有所耳闻可是…财团真的在做这样的事情吗？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e1_arms.ntk_14_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Thank you very much... I will check it out.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Anyway... I cannot believe there is a book that can help us in this weird situation. Is there a good fortune teller that you know?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Terima kasih banyak... Saya akan mencoba mencari tahu.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya benar - benar tidak menyangka ada petunjuk yang bisa membantu kita dalam menghadapi masalah ini. Apakah kamu ada kenal peramal yang jago?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">谢谢。我会好好看的。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">不管怎样… 提前准备这些文件真是让人无法相信…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">不会是真的预言者之类的人吧?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e1_arms.ntk_14_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Begin</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">最初</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e1_arms.ntk_15_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Oh, that's a lot…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">How did you bring all of this?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You can leave that to us. We already heard about your story, and we'll bring this stuff to the police office.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Oh, banyak sekali…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bagaimana kamu bisa mendapatkan semua ini?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jangan khawatir, kamu bisa meninggalkan kami. Kami sudah mendengar ceritanya dan akan mengadukannya ke polisi segera.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">哎呀。这个量还不少呢。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这么多怎么拿过来的？是吗？事情听说了，你先放在这里吧。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我会好好整理后送到警察局的。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e1_arms.ntk_15_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Begin</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">最初</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e1_arms.ntk_16_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I need some beads to create and fix weapons. Think you can help me?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya membutuhkan beberapa beads untuk membuat dan memperbaiki senjata. Apakah kamu bisa membantu?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">你到离这里不远的地方,就能收集到灵珠,尽可能的话,快去快回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e1_arms.ntk_16_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e1_arms.ntk_17_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Wow, that's a bead, right?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Thank you.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next time, if you have free time, could you collect more beads for me?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Haha~</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Wow, itu adalah bead yang saya cari - cari.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Terima Kasih.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lain kali, jika kamu memiliki waktu kosong lagi, bantu saya mencarinya lagi y~</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Haha~</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">你全部收集回来了. 以后需要修理武器时就会需要它,等你有空时,希望再找一些回来,当做备份之用</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e1_arms.ntk_17_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e1_arms.ntk_18_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Good luck!!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Semoga Beruntung!!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">祝您好运！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e1_arms.ntk_19_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Are you blind? This is a total mess!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Apa kamu buta? Ini sungguh kacau!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">您瞎了吗？这简直是一团乱啊！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e1_arms.ntk_19_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e1_arms.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ah, it's that stone!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">But hasn't it been identified yet?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It's called... USS... Something...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I heard that it's like some sort of secret code, but it's only hearsay.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Is this for me?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Hmmph. It doesn't look like it'll be much use...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Well, thank you, anyway.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Oh! Batu itu rupanya!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tapi namanya belum diputuskan yah?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Apa yah….kayaknya…USS..atau apa gitu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tapi saya sudah mendengar itu dipanggil oleh nomor seperti kode rahasia.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ini untuk saya?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Heum…kalau hanya ini sih tidak ada gunanya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pokoknya te</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">喔，是那个石头啊!!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">然而，还没命名吗?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">叫什么…USS…怎么叫</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">听说是像暗号一样的号码，但只是听说。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这是给我的吗??</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">哼…什么，以这种样子，虽没别的用途</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">但请接受我所表达的谢意。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e1_arms.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e1_arms.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Why did the people come here in a scattered manner?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The shop's weapons are all stolen by these people!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">From what I know, those people aren't real.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Orang-orang yang tidak dikenal tiba-tiba datang dan mengambilnya dengan paksa</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Dia membawa semua senjata yang ada di toko</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Setelah aku mencari tahu ternyata mereka semua adalah palsu!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Aku keluar untuk mengejarnya tapi sudah terlambat…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">为何人们蜂拥而至， 是强制征调</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">把商店的武器全都拿走了，</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">就我所知，那些人都是冒牌的。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e1_arms.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e1_arms.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Then the snows came, there were earthquakes… It was total chaos in the city!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">My shop was pretty much ruined at that time...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Even though what I said was out of anger, I still have to get back my lost weapons.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Please, even if it's only some of them, can't they be recovered?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Hal yang membuatnya tambah buruk adalah gempa bumi yang timbul</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kota menjadi kacau balau seperti ini</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Toko saya juga hancur pada saat itu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kini saya ingin menemukan senjata itu meskipun dengan cara paksa</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya mohon tolong temukan meskipun hanya s</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">再加上雪上加霜，连地震都发生了，都市的表面，简直是满目疮痍。我的商店在那时也倒塌了。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">现在，即使说是气话，也想找回失去的武器。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">拜托一下，即使是其中的一部份，可以帮我找找吗?"</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e1_arms.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Reply</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menerima permintaan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">答复</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e1_arms.ntk_4_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Reply</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menerima permintaan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">答复</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e1_arms.ntk_4_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Reply</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menerima permintaan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">答复</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e1_arms.ntk_4_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Reply</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menerima permintaan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">答复</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e1_arms.ntk_4_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Reply</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menerima permintaan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">答复</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e1_arms.ntk_4_0_6">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menolak permintaan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e1_arms.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Honestly speaking, I don't expect them to be found, but we still have to try our best.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sebenarnya saya tidak terlalu berharap bisa mencarinya kembali, tolong carikan sebisa kamu saja~</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">老实说，虽不期待能再找回来，但尽可能的给找找看。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e1_arms.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e1_arms.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Wow, you really helped me find them!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Even though it's just some of them, I am still very grateful…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">As long as we have this, it will be easier to rebuild our shop…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">If we do this... And do that…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">He, benar-benar menemukannya!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Meskipun tidak semuanya tapi benar-benar terimakasih.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau saja ada ini saya bisa membuka toko kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ini akan banyak membantu.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Itu sih itu…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这样，真的帮忙找啊!!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">虽不是全部，但真的很感谢了，</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">只要有这个的话，在修复商店方面，将会非常有帮助。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">那个，那样</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e1_arms.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e1_arms.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">There are some friends that I'm waiting for, but I am afraid that they might have been victims of an earthquake.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Pardon me, but can you help me find them?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Though I have no idea when they will come back, I'll still wait for them.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">If my friend returns, we can hear more details about the stones.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">About last time at some Financial Group building…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ada teman yang terus menunggu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya khawatir dia terjebak oleh gempa</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Maaf tapi bisa tolong saya mencarinya di daerah sekitar sini?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mungkin akan datang terlambat karena itu aku akan menunggu di sini...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau dia datang kamu bisa mendengarkan cer</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">有继续等待的朋友，担心是不是陷进地震里。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">不好意思，不帮我在附近找找看吗?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">虽然什么时候上来都不知道，但我要在这里等待...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">那朋友来的话，可以听到更详细有关石头的事情。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">以前在什么财团研究所!!"</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e1_arms.ntk_7_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e1_arms.ntk_8_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Oh, you're here!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Hmmm, what have you found?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ahhhh ~</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I think I've been overly optimistic.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">At the city's current state, it's a mistake to hope for my friend to just mind his own business...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Oh, sudah datang rupanya!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Iya, sudah menemukan sesua</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">噢，来啦!!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">是的，找到了一点什么的</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">原来是….</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我好像只往太好的方面想了</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">在都市的表面变得如此的状况下， 希望那位朋友别多管闲事是错误的。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e1_arms.ntk_8_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e1_arms.ntk_9_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">That is your friend's item, isn't it?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Even though it's said to be stolen everywhere, but it's still strange...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya yakin ini semua adalah milik teman saya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Karena itu adalah benda-benda yang aku hadiahkan..jadi sudah pasti</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Aneh sekali kalau terpencar di sana sini</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这些分明是朋友的东西，对吧??</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">说是倒处被偷， 虽有点奇怪</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e1_arms.ntk_9_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e1_medic.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It's very dangerous here!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Anda tidak apa-apa?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Daerah sekitar sini sangat berbahaya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这里真的非常危险。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e1_medic.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Change Save Point</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mengubah titik awal</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">变更开始地点</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e1_medic.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Trade Items</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jual beli item</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">交替物品</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e1_medic.ntk_1_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about Related Problem</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya ada apa</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问相关事件</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e1_medic.ntk_1_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Give Him the Key</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menyerahkan kunci</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">给他钥匙</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e1_medic.ntk_1_0_6">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Deliver the Action Guide</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menyerahkan buku panduan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">传递行动指南</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e1_medic.ntk_1_0_7">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about the status of Middle Hole</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tanyakan tentang Middle Hole</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问Middle Hole的情况</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e1_medic.ntk_1_0_8">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask if he is in a trouble</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tanya apa dia butuh bantuan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问他是否遇到麻烦</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e1_medic.ntk_1_0_9">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Hand over the things found</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Berikan sesuatu yang ditemukan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">交出收集到的物品</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e1_medic.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ah… Yes, the situation here is getting worse.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">They assigned me to come here, and I brought a lot a medicine, but the wild dogs here nearly tore me apart.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ah..iya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Aduh jadi gawat</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya tidak tahu bagaimana kamu mengetahuinya tapi,</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sepertinya dia tahu bahwa daerah sekitar sini akan menjadi seperti ini</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya ditugaskan ke tempat ini tepat setelah bencana terjadi</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Karena itu saya membawa obat-obat</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">啊..是..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">有点为难</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">不知道会变成这样，但好像知道这周围会变成这样？？</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">发生异变后就马上接到被派到这里的命令，所以带了很多的药品过来…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">但竟然就在这附近被疯狗抢走了包包。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e1_medic.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e1_medic.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I'd be dead if students like you weren't there to save me.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Hm, I'm sorry, but those mad dogs stole my key. Do you think you can get it back?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya bisa selamat karena untung saja ada pelajar lewat yang menyelamatkan saya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pada saat itu saya kehilangan kunci tas</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kayaknya digigit dan dibawa oleh anjing-anjing itu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Gawat kan. Kalau tas itu tidak ada saya juga tidak perlu datang ke sini…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">幸好经过的学生救我才会没事​​…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">但是丢掉的包包的钥匙，</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">可是是被那些狗给叨走的..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">真是不妙，没有那个包包就不需要待在这里了</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">那…可否帮忙找寻钥匙？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e1_medic.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Agree</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menerima permintaan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">同意</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e1_medic.ntk_3_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Decline</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menolak permintaan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">拒绝</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e1_medic.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Oh, really?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Thank you very much. I'm sure you'll find it if you hunt down those dogs that are almost as big as wolves.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Be careful~</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Yang benar?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Benar-benar terimakasih-</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Anjing itu terlihat seperti anjing serigala</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Dari bibir mereka keluar udara dingin</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kamu akan mudah mencarinya karena mereka adalah anjing-anjing yang ada di sekitar sini</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Harus berhati-hati</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">真的吗?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">真是非常的感谢你。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">那只狗看起来很像一只狼。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">嘴巴里吐出像冷气的东西。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">是这周围的狗,所以找起来应该还蛮方便的。请小心啊。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">虽然有听到这些学院的学生个个都不是普通人，但怎么胜得过那吐出冷气的狼。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e1_medic.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e1_medic.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You get hurt?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Benar-benar…para pelajar dari sana semuanya tidak biasa</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya sudah dengar sih…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bagaimana kamu mengalahkan anjing besar itu?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kamu tidak terluka kan?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">您有受伤吗？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e1_medic.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Heal</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mengobati luka</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">疗伤</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e1_medic.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Even this place...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Thank you.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I already have the guideline, so it'd be really helpful in an emergency case.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sampai ke tempat sejauh ini….</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Terimakasih</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Akan sangat membantu kalau sekarang ada sesuatu yang bisa dijadikan standar</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">大老远的…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">谢谢-</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">现在只要有什么成为标准的东西，会有很大的帮助</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e1_medic.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Begin</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">最初</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e1_medic.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">As you can see, things are getting worse. I am so worried! Something big will happen, if this keeps up.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Seperti yang kamu lihat.. Segala sesuatunya menjadi buruh. Saya sangat khawatir sesuatu yang besar akan terjadi jika ini dibiarkan.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">去到哪里你自然就会了解。只是愈接近目的地情况更为险峻。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">一直往前走不知道会发生什么事,你自己要小心</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e1_medic.ntk_7_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e1_medic.ntk_8_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">We have received so many paticients after the phenomenon but there is not enough medicines to cure them all. They could be cureed instantly with proper medincine but.. It is really hard to see them suffer.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kamu menerima banyak pasien setelah hari itu namun tidak memiliki cukup obat untuk menyembuhkan mereka. Sangat menyedihkan..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">发生异变事件后受伤的病患不断增加看来治疗病患的药品快要不够用了。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">看到那些病患无法接受治疗的痛苦表情...内心感到很难过…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">听说机械贼头身上有那些药品要不要帮忙取得这些救命药</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e1_medic.ntk_8_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e1_medic.ntk_9_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Thank you! Because of you we can save so many lives.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Terima kasih! Karena kamu kita bisa menyelamatkan banyak nyawa.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">真的很谢谢您。托您的福，我们才能够拯救这么多条的人命。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e1_medic.ntk_9_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e2_oldman.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">In this space where time stops, not even wind exists.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Di ruang ini ternyata tidak ada selera seni rupanya…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这个地方时间是停止的！连一点儿风都没有。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e2_oldman.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Listen to Story</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mendengarkan cerita</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">听取故事</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e2_oldman.ntk_1_0_10">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The ring will be upgraded one step further.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mengupgrade ring</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">戒指将升等一级。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e2_oldman.ntk_1_0_11">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about Sacred Financial Group Background</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang latar belakang yayasan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问圣财团的背景</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e2_oldman.ntk_1_0_12">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask how to Enter Main Office</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya bagaimana caranya masuk ke kantor pusat</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">如何进入Main Office？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e2_oldman.ntk_1_0_13">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Listen to Advice</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mendengarkan nasihat</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">听取建议</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e2_oldman.ntk_1_0_14">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Show the Eight Signs of Divine</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menunjukkan the Eight Trigrams</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">展示Eight Signs of Divine</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e2_oldman.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Show Authentication Certificate</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menunjukkan Verification Form</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">出示认证书</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e2_oldman.ntk_1_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about Business</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya ada urusan apa</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问关于事业</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e2_oldman.ntk_1_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Listen to Advice</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mendengarkan nasehat</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">听取建议</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e2_oldman.ntk_1_0_6">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Listen to Advice</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mendengarkan nasehat</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">听取建议</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e2_oldman.ntk_1_0_7">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Listen to Advice</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mendengarkan nasehat</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">听取建议</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e2_oldman.ntk_1_0_8">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Deliver Material</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menyerahkan bahan-bahan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">转交材料</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e2_oldman.ntk_1_0_9">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The ring will be upgraded one step further.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mengupgrade ring</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">戒指将升等一级。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e2_oldman.ntk_10_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Hmmm?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Why are you waiting for this old man?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Hmmm…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">When you strangely respect the other person, there definitely must be a motive, right?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Though he would like to escape this dangerous place, it's impossible with a body that's so weak.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Hei…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Apa yang kamu harapkan dari orang tua ini?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau itu…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pada saat menghormati lawan daripada yang diharuskan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sudah punya tujuan untuk mendapatkan sesuatu pasti</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bukan yah?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau begitu apa yang hendak kamu berikan?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kayaknya kamu be</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">学生...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">期待这位老年人什么?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">他呀!!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">异常地尊重对方时，一定是有什么目的，不是吗?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">那么想给什么?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">虽想摆脱这危险的地方, 但以那么虚弱的身体，不要做梦了。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e2_oldman.ntk_10_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e2_oldman.ntk_11_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Let's say, will you naturally understand it?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">On this broken road, a soft piece of paper is floating.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">If that is the case, then time in this place hasn't completely stopped…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The knowledge the students have acquired…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">They haven't been improving?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I feel that not trying to understand is a good thing.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Hmmmph, it seems that it's understandable</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">This stoppage of time is a natural defense mechanism</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The Financial Group Main construction company will play out their role, and then…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Memang kalau dijelaskan bisa dimengerti?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Di jalanan yang retak di mana-mana</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kertas-kertas dan mobil-mobil yang tiba-tiba berhenti bergerak setelah beterbangan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tapi tidak berarti waktu di tempat ini terhenti sepenuhnya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">说什么来看看，自然可理解吗?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">在完全龟裂的街道上，飘了飘停在那固定的纸和车子...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">那样的话，这地方的时间也并非完全停止...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">目前为止，学生所学过的常识</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">是完全都停止的状况吗?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我认为不想要理解，也是好事 ...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">哼， 那样看来，确实是一个是可理解的</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这停止的时间是自然的自我防御本能</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn"> 扮演中继角色的, 就是财团本公司建筑物</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e2_oldman.ntk_11_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e2_oldman.ntk_12_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Haha, that is because I'm here.....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">That woman trusts students there, and gives presents.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Hahahah</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kok datang dengan membawa item-item ini</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Diatas perkiraan saya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau mereka tahu sesuatu tentang saya artinya….</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Si tomboy itu memberikan hadiah sebagai tambahan juga rupanya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kayaknya dia benar-benar percaya kamu-</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">哈哈哈</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">听了这个而来</VALUE>
