    <VALUE Lang="id">Untung saja fasilitas-fasilitas yang ada di sekitar sini juga bisa dibangun kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kayaknya mereka cukup antusias dengan berbagai macam kegiatan sosial</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">据说援助了生活费…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">不仅仅是帮助学生，甚至连学生的家族都有援助.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">因此这附近的很多设施都重新建筑了。积极的参与很多社会福利的事业.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e2_oldman.ntk_26_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask What He Noticed</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya apakah dia pernah melihatnya secara langsung</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问他注意到的事情</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e2_oldman.ntk_27_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I think most people in this town don’t know about it very well.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ah, right! You ever see a person wear a black suit in front of Leonine Campus?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">He would know about it very well since he is an employee of that company.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Masa kita harus membiarkan para warga yang telah hidup dengan tulus melihat langsung hal-hal seperti itu.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Iya…mungkin…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Di depan Leonine School kamu lihat anak muda dengan jaket hitam yang terus berjaga kan?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Dia kan termasuk orang yang bersangkuta</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">安分守己的普通市民很难亲眼目睹那些事情。是啊，是不是在虎令学院前面穿上黑色大衣的年轻人？</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">如果是他，因为是负责人，应该更清楚, 不是吗?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e2_oldman.ntk_27_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Begin</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">最初</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e2_oldman.ntk_28_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">This building is very different from the others in terms of security.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I remember that there are two major security systems. The one is the security code under skin, which human eyes cannot see. The other is voice recognition. You can't enter the building without passing both of those security systems.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kayaknya gedung ini cukup tertutup bila dibandingkan dengan gedung yang lain.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Dulu saya lihat bahwa ada dua tahap sistem keamanan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Yang pertama adalah kode, orang-orang yang menanamkan kode pada kulit mereka bisa melewati tahap yang pertama</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Yang</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">其他地方都比较开放，只有这个建筑物感到有点封闭。以前看过据说有两个阶段的保安步骤…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">第一关，用眼睛看不到的晶片，移植到皮肤的人们,就能通过第一关。第二关是声音辨识，如果没有做注册的</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e2_oldman.ntk_28_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask for More Details</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya lebih jelas lagi</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问更加详细的内容</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e2_oldman.ntk_29_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Haha, I don't know the details since I'm not an employee.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Maybe there's another security system.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ah. I just remembered something for you. You can find an old man like me at the Wharf passage.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Go there and ask him about it</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Eheh, aku juga bukan orang yang bersangkutan bagaimana bisa tahu dengan jelas?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mungkin saja sistem keamanan yang ketiga sudah ditambahkan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ah, iya kalau kamu ke Wharf Passage kamu bisa menemukan orang tua seperti saya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pergi ke arah sana dan bert</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">呵呵，我也不是负责人，能正确知道吗?说不定有第三个保安步骤。啊，对了，你到码头就可以见到跟我一样的老人。你去问问他。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e2_oldman.ntk_29_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Begin</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">最初</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e2_oldman.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Students? Yeah, I saw some…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It's interesting!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">During the break, they came to attend to some business of theirs.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">If that's the case, time should have been combined!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Right?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I think I've miscalculated…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Hei? Euhm…kayaknya ada beberapa orang…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menarik sekali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mau melakukan apa di tempat yang waktunya terhenti seperti ini?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau begitu kita harus menghubungkan waktu…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bukan yah?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kayaknya aku terlalu menilai tinggi kamu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">学生? 是呀…看到了几个人...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">有趣啊</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">在这停止的时间里，来要进行什么</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">那样的话，应该要把时间连结起来...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">不是吗??</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我好像太高估了!</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e2_oldman.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e2_oldman.ntk_30_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The security system isn't so secure…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You can easily get inside this building.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I'm so worried about it.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">But I am more concerned about the fact that you have to enter this building.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I got the message from the student who already entered here. He said that he will wait for incoming students on the 1st floor.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Just go to the building main door. The security process will be done automatically. You may use the Information Terminal to read the research documents.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bagaimana bisa ada sistem keamanan yang selemah ini, dan bagaimana bisa cara untuk melewati sistem keamanan itu telah dipersiapkan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Walaupun sekarang begitu aku khawatir karena mau tidak mau harus mencoba masuk…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya pernah menerima pesan…dari pelaj</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">为什么会有这么不堪的保安设备，是否准备好通过那些保安设备…有点担心啊.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">现在就算那样也只能是进去看，这更让人担心…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">虽然有收到资讯…但是先进去的学生打算等从1楼进来的学生。首先去正门前面，会自动完成保安步骤。好好利用能判读研究资料的终端机.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e2_oldman.ntk_30_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Begin</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">最初</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e2_oldman.ntk_31_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I've had a bad feeling of foreboding for quite some time.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">This eight signs of divine… I don't think they belong to this world. Surely it's the key that opens the way to another world. So you want to use this? The divine needs blood. Maybe special blood.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You can probably get it at the top of this building.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Anyway be careful.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sejak dulu firasat seperti ini memang sudah spesial</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bagua ini…walau bagaimanapun juga kayanya tidak terbuat hanya dari dunia kita saja</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pastilah kunci untuk keluar dari dunia ini</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Iya, kamu mau menggunakan ini?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau begitu mungkin kamu harus be</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">自古以来这样的感觉是特别的…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这Eight signs of divine… 不像是我们世界的.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">分明是能够离开这个世界的钥匙。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">那么，是不是想使用这个?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">如果是的话又得见血…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这家伙… 正在寻找血。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">嘴也非常刁…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">在那顶峰处,可能有适合这家伙口味的一群家伙。 …</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">不管怎样小心啊。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e2_oldman.ntk_31_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Begin</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">最初</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e2_oldman.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The students do not even know where their colleges are.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Want about the Financial Group's background?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Simply said, the founding of the Sacred Financial Group was originally meant to disrupt the World's balance.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Yeap, that's their original motive.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalian tidak tahu sama sekali tentang sekolah kalian sendiri rupanya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ditambah lagi tahu tidak kalau Kembaligroundnya adalah Yayasan saint?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya katakan satu hal saja</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tujuan awal dari didirikannya Yayasan Saint atau apa gitu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Agar tidak membuat</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">学生们完全不知道自己的学院在哪里。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">更何况，怎么知道那财团的背景，</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">简言之，圣财团当初创立的目的是不要破坏世界的均衡，</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn"> 是呀, 就是当初的目的。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e2_oldman.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about the Sacred Gate Financial Group</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang Yayasan Saint</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问关于Sacred Gate Financial Group的事情</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e2_oldman.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The students are stubborn.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I don't like their behavior. They act with no regrets at all.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Not a single day goes by without something happening.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kayaknya kamu anak yang gigih</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau aku bilang hal seperti ini sih memang sedikit</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya tidak begitu suka dengan kepribadian yang seperti itu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Yang masih muda tidak mau melalu jalan yang berputar sedikit pun…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tak pernah ada hari tanpa benturan </VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">学生的性格好像很顽固。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">话虽如此，但我不喜欢那样的性格，因为年轻人一点也没有回头的意思，没有一天不发生冲突的。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e2_oldman.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about Sacred Gate Financial Group HQ Building</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang gedung</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问关于Sacred Gate Financial Group HQ Building的事情</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e2_oldman.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Should I ignore the old man's advice?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">They do not seem different from the other students.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You mean you want to check out this building?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">As of this moment, there isn't a solution, as to what seems to be the problem.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I do not know what might happen.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Nor do I know how to solve it, nor how to teach.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kamu abaikan kata-kata saya karena saya sudah tua?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tidak jauh berbeda dengan pelajar yang lain rupanya!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mau tahu tentang gedung yah?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Masih belum ada yang bisa masuk ke sini karena itu tidak ada yang tahu apa yang terjadi di sana</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Aku tidak bisa</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我该忽视Old man的忠告吗？</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">和其他学生没什么不同啊</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">你是说想了解这大楼吗?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">至目前为止，还没有任何腹案， 其中倒底有什么问题??</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">不知道有什么事会发生!!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">不知道是不是即使了解，也无法说明。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e2_oldman.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e2_oldman.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Standing here doing nothing, that's a bit strange.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">How did he come here?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">How is he not damaged?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Students…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You got to introduce yourself before you ask questions from your elders. You can't expect manners without using basic manners. It's about respect.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Merasa aneh rupanya karena aku berdiri di tempat seperti ini tanpa terjadi apa-apa?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bagaimana anda datang ke sini….</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bagaimana bisa tidak terluka….</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Hei.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Waktu bertanya pada orang tua harusnya kamu memperkenalkan diri dulu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tata krama dasar s</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">在这里什么也不做地站着，好像蛮奇怪的</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">如何来这里的...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">如何不遭受损害...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">学生向大人请教什么时，必须先做自我介绍，连这种基本礼节都没有，有什么话好说?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e2_oldman.ntk_7_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Rebut the Old Man</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menyangkal Old Man</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">和老人顶嘴</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e2_oldman.ntk_8_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You guys are really hot-blooded students…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Easily pumped up.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">This will only worry people…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next time when you have an opponent to fight, no matter how big he is, never lose your head.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Your mind will definitely get you the win when everything else fails.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You students must learn how to control your emotions.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Wah benar-benar pelajar yang penuh semangat</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Hanya karena hal seperti itu kamu sudah marah</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Aduh kekhawatiran saja yang terus bertambah</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Meskipun yang harus kamu lawan nantinya adalah diri kamu sendiri…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau begini terus bisa-bisa kalah 100 kal</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">还真是血气旺盛的学生啊</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我指的只是那样容易冲动</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这个只会更令人担心</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">未来要打架的对象, 即使是他自己也...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">明显是百战百胜</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">学生要懂得先控制自己的情绪</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e2_oldman.ntk_8_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e2_oldman.ntk_9_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Even though there were a few people who passed by this old man…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">There was only one student who cared for my body…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Though I know not of his true intentions...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The important thing was his expression.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Hmm, I have no need to worry.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The air here is definitely better than anywhere else.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Due to the break.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ada beberapa orang yang sudah melewati orang tua ini tapi</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kayaknya kamu yang pertama kali mengkhawatirkan keadaan tubuh aku</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya tidak tahu apakah itu hanya basa basi atau memang tulus</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Setidaknya penting untuk menandai hal-hal seperti itu sendiri</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">虽有几个人经过这位老年人</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">担心我身体的，学生倒是一个呀</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">虽不知道是做做样子，还是真心的</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">即使如此，重要的是有所表示</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">嗯，我没必要担心</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这附近空气比所见的还好</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">由于时间停止，故连关节炎什么的也没有</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e2_oldman.ntk_9_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about the Situation</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang situasi saat ini dengan sopan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问现况</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e2_oldman.ntk_9_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about the Situation</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang situasi saat ini dengan sopan</VALUE>
