    <VALUE Lang="id">Masukkanlah password</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">限制地区出入的电梯。请输入密码。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_elevator.ntk_1_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Enter the password.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Masukan ID dan Password.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">请输入密码。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_elevator.ntk_1_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">This is the security elevator for the restricted area.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Pass permission is already confirmed.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ini adalah Elevator untuk akses area terbatas</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sudah mendapatkan verifikasi untuk masuk.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">限制地区出入的电梯。已验证完成。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_elevator.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The password is verified.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Pass permission for restricted area is confirmed.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ini adalah Elevator untuk akses area terbatas</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">密码验证完成。允许出入此地。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_giilchung1.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Hey! Hello!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Hello!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">嘿！哈咯！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_giilchung1.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Listen to the Story</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mendengarkan cerita</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">听取故事</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_giilchung1.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about Underground Laboratory</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang Basement Laboratory.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问关于地下Laboratory的事情</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_giilchung1.ntk_1_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Show Materials</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menunjukan data.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">展示材料</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_giilchung1.ntk_1_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Show the Parts</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menunjukan Genuine Parts.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">展示零件</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_giilchung1.ntk_10_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">By the way. The guy I talked to, before you, a while ago was just like that.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Look around you before you think about the reason behind this underground. What you are trying to do now…?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">We're not gods or legendary heroes. We're just human.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Teman yang tadi saya bilang kayaknya seperti itu.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mau aku kasih satu peringatan?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lebih baik kamu berpikir dulu apa yang hendak kamu lakukan daripada membayangkan tentang kenapa lantai bawah tanah menjadi seperti ini tanpa bukti yang jelas</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Yang na</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">刚刚说的朋友就是那种感觉。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">给你一个忠告?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">地下为何变成这样等没有根据的想像之前先想想我现在要做什么.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">不是那么大的存在~ 所谓人类的动物是</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_giilchung1.ntk_10_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Begin</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">最初</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_giilchung1.ntk_11_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Oh, you found something?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Can I see?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Oh? Wow~ Is it like a time machine?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Oh, I can read this! This is Ganil language.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Eh, kamu menemukan sesuatu yah?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Coba berikan sini?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Hoo? Hei~ jangan-jangan ini sejenis Time machine?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Soalnya aku sedikit tahu bagaimana cara membaca huruf yang tertulis di sini, aku pernah melihatnya tapi….</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Inikah tulisan Ganil?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">啊,是不是找到什么了?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">能给我看吗?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">呵呵?喂~ 这个是不是时间机器啊?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这里记载的文字有些我也会读,虽然看过…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">是加尼尔文字吧？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_giilchung1.ntk_11_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Continue</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tetap mendengarkan.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">继续</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_giilchung1.ntk_12_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The machine... It can go through something.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Vector?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I don't know whether... You can definitely move to another space and time with this machine.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Peralatan untuk melewati..sesuatu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kok vector?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bahkan kita tidak tahu apakah standarnya itu adalah ruang atau waktu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sudah pasti</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau kamu gunakan ini kamu bisa pergi ke dimensi lain yang ada di suatu tempat</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">好象是… 为了跨越什么的设备…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">Vector?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">不知道基准是空间还是时间…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我可以肯定使用这个可以联系到往其大地方的范围"</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_giilchung1.ntk_12_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Continue</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tetap mendengarkan.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">继续</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_giilchung1.ntk_13_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It's not yet functional, though.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It doesn't work at all.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">There are probably some parts missing that you can uncover…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tapi ini masih belum sempurna…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Karena jangankan menyelesaikannya dioperasikan saja tidak bisa</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sisa part yang lainnya pasti ada di suatu tempat</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau bisa mengumpulkan sisanya mungkin kita bisa mengetahui sesuatu yang penting</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">可是这个现在还不是很完善…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">不完善的同时还不能运作。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">那里有剩余的零件。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">可能把剩余的全部搜集的话就可以找出重要的东西</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_giilchung1.ntk_13_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Begin</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">最初</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_giilchung1.ntk_14_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Wow, impressive...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">How were you able to find all that stuff in this dirty gutter?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">How about changing your job? You can be a treasure hunter for life!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Benar-benar mengagumkan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bagaimana kamu bisa menemukannya di tempat yang kacau seperti ini?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bagaimana kalau nanti kamu coba buka agen detektif?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">真的值得尊敬…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">怎么会在这样的施工仓里找到?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">以后开服务中心如何?"</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_giilchung1.ntk_14_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Continue</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tetap mendengarkan.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">继续</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_giilchung1.ntk_15_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I'm not sure if this works very well since my major is software... I think the important parts are complete, but we might need some minor parts later.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Aku tidak pantas dipanggil sebagai ahli software tapi….</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sepertinya part-part ini sudah cukup, tapi mungkin saja pada saat merakitnya nanti diperlukan item-item kecil lainnya.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Masalahnya….</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bukan hanya cara penggunaannya tapi juga tidak tahu bagaim</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我不能保证我是软体专家…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">但是这些零件就已经很充分了。进行组合的话可能需要细微的东西。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">问题是…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">不知道如何使用这些…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">应该有使用说明书或待人注意书… 还是开发中制作的资料吧。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">其他人可能比较难开口,但你对这方面比较擅长，所以顺便找找看如何?"</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_giilchung1.ntk_15_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Begin</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">最初</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_giilchung1.ntk_16_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You know that this isn't just a list of names?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Yes, I don't mind the ideals of SFG or the ideals of another world.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">But I don't like to make sacrifices on that ideal. The indulgence of sacrifice is... Just an excuse...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Jung Il, maybe if he was there, he'd support it.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tahu kan kalau ini bukan daftar hadir biasa?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Benar, aku tidak peduli dengan bagaimana jadinya ideologi Yayasan ataupun ideologi dunia lain</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tapi…saya tidak suka dengan tekanan untuk melakukan pengorbanan yang lain demi tujuan yang hanya bagus di luar</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">不是平凡的考勤本，这点知道吧?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">是的,我不管财团的意念如何，异界的意念如何，都与我无关。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">但是… 为了那些虚假的好的目标，不赞成强烈要求其他牺牲的行为。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">那些假面具…最终只是借口而已。洪承日, 如果是那家伙可能会高兴的事情</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_giilchung1.ntk_16_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Begin</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">最初</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_giilchung1.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You should have many questions….</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Banyak yang mau kamu tanya kan…?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">您应该有很多疑问的……</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_giilchung1.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about Him</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya siapa anda</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问关于他的事情</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_giilchung1.ntk_2_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about List of Saints</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang Saint List</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问关于圣徒列表</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_giilchung1.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I was a sophomore at Sacred Gate Campus and enrolled in the swordsmanship class. I didn’t want to study here. Maybe that's why…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Dulunya anak kelas dua di SG_School</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Dulu ada di Swordsman</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Meskipun bukan disengaja mungkin ada sesuatu yang salah….</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我曾在Sacred Gate Campus 的2年级，并加入了剑道部。虽然不是我的本意，但是还是满不错的。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_giilchung1.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Continue</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tetap mendengarkan.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">继续</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_giilchung1.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Don't look at me like this~</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I'm not a good mood to talk to you nicely, and I'm not the type to take care of other people.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I don't care whatever people say, but because of my personality, I've hurt my shy friend many times.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Anyway someday he was getting into some kind of superstition…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I couldn't do anything about it....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jangan mencoba mendengarkan sambil melotot begitu~</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bukan sesuatu yang bisa diceritakan dengan bahagia….</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Karena dia tidak mempunya hati yang lapang untuk memikirkan posisi temannya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Padahal aku sama sekali tidak peduli, tapi ada teman yang terluka</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">别这样看我〜</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我不是一个会说好听话的人，而且我不是会照顾别人的那种类型。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我不在乎任何人。但由于我的性格，我伤害了许多我的朋友。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">有一天，他被某种迷信给害了... 但我却无法做任何事情…...</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_giilchung1.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Continue</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tetap mendengarkan.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">继续</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_giilchung1.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">If I think I don't stop him, he can't be normal anymore.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I couldn't believe that he was so afraid of his incarnation images and memory...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">So... I should do this...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Soalnya aku merasa bahwa kalau aku tidak menghentikannya dia akan tetap seperti itu dan tidak tahu akan menjadi apa</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Untuk memikirkan nasib saya sekarang saja saya sudah merasa kesusahan, kenapa juga harus memikirkan kehidupan lalu yang tidak bisa saya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">如果我不阻止他，他就无法恢复正常了。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我简直不敢相信，他很害怕他的化身形象和记忆......</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">所以...我应该这么做...</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_giilchung1.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Begin</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">最初</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_giilchung1.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">So Seung Il... After he died, I couldn't just leave this place…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">There are some clues left here…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">And I also heard that there is a private laboratory for S.F.G. near here...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I am sure that the monsters near here are related to that laboratory somehow.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Aku tidak tega meninggalkan tempat ini setelah si Caesar itu mati</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tapi bukan berarti di sini tidak ada apa-apa</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Karena saya dengar ruang percobaan yang berada di bawah kontrol Yayasan saint ada di sekitar sini</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Monster-monster yang ada di sekitar</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">So Seung Il死后我实在是无法离开这个地方…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">但是这不代表这里什么都没有。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">听说这附近肯定有S.F.G的private laboratory…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这周围的怪物肯定是受到那里的影响或从那里流出来的。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_giilchung1.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Continue</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Terus mendengarkan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">继续</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_giilchung1.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I think. It is already meaningless if the lab even exists.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menurut saya…keberadaan ruang percobaan itu tidak memberikan bantuan apapun..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mau tidak mau harus mengumpulkan petunjuk di ruang percobaan sebanyak-banyaknya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Masalahnya saya tidak tahu apa yang harus dicari</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我个人认为… 实验室的存在已经不会有任何帮助的。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_giilchung1.ntk_7_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Begin</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">最初</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_giilchung1.ntk_8_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">There's too many monsters… Too many for all of them to live underground.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Is it clear now?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Experiments on human bodies were conducted in that laboratory.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">They were making weapons out of human beings.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jumlah monster yang sangat banyak…Tapi makhluk-makhluk seperti ini bukan hanya ada di lantai bawah tanah saja kan?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sekarang sudah menjadi pasti kan.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Di ruang percobaan itu kita sudah melakukan percobaan terhadap makhluk hidup</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Yaitu percobaan untu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">很多怪物… 但是这些家伙不只是在地下？</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这个程度该是确定了。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">在实验室里进行了生体实验…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">那也是为了制造武器而进行的实验。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_giilchung1.ntk_8_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Continue</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tetap mendengarkan.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">继续</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_giilchung1.ntk_9_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Why? SFG officially creates 4 campuses for the sake of education? What about jail? And the Laboratory…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Is it a defense system for this village?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Haha…!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I'm getting silly with my thinking nowadays.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kenapa yah? Setelah yayasan membangun 4 buah badan pendidikan yang resmi lalu Prison? Ditambah lagi ada ruangan percobaan…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Apakah karena tujuan pertahanan untuk melindungi tempat di mana kita tinggal ini?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Hehe</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tuh kan~ Kalau berpikir terus sepert</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">为什么?成立4个正式教育机关财团的监狱? 以及实验室…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">真的是为了守护我们生活的地方，目的在于防卫吗?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">嘿嘿…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">看吧~ 如果这样想的话容易进入不必要的空想里</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_giilchung1.ntk_9_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Continue</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tetap mendengarkan.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">继续</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_hongjiyoun1.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It's too far from there~</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kamu sudah datang terlalu jauh rupanya -</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这边离太远了…..</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_hongjiyoun1.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Change Start Point</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Change save point</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">变更起点位置</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_hongjiyoun1.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask for Heal</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Meminta pengobatan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">请求治疗</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_hongjiyoun1.ntk_1_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Open the Shop</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jual beli item</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">开启商店</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_hongjiyoun1.ntk_1_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Listen to the Story</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mendengarkan cerita</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">倾听故事</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_hongjiyoun1.ntk_1_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask for Help</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Meminta bantuan.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">请求协助</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_hongjiyoun1.ntk_1_0_6">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Give Hair Clip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menyerahkan jepit rambut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">传递发夹</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_hongjiyoun1.ntk_1_0_7">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Inform [Request help from Hong Ji Yoon]</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menyampaikan berita [Meminta bantuan dari 'Hong Ji Yoon']</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">通知 [Hong Ji Yoon的求助]</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_hongjiyoun1.ntk_10_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I was with Dae Yook in front of that door, and needed to go to the restroom. We couldn't reach it in a normal way.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Isaya bersama Dae Yook di depan pintu tersebut dan ke tempat istirahat.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我和Dae Yook站在门前，然后要前往Restroom，但却无法利用正常的方法进去。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_hongjiyoun1.ntk_10_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">To Begin</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mulai</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回到开始</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_hongjiyoun1.ntk_11_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Did you see the floating objects? As you can see, the space here is quite unstable and time stopped. So you might use this to use the restroom.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">There is a broken window somewhere. And through that window, you can reach the toilet.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Because of this weird time space, we can destroy or move objects.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kamu lihatkan benda-benda yang melayang di udara di sekitar gedung ini?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Seperti yang kamu tahu waktu di daerah ini terhenti dengan tidak stabil</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kamu bisa naik hingga ke ruang direktur dengan menggunakan itu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ada kaca yang pecah di suatu tempat</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">请问您有看见飘在空中的物体吗？如同所见，此地既不稳定，时间是静止的。您应该可以利用它来使用restroom的。 在那儿有些破裂的窗户，透过窗户，您可以到达Toilet。由于这边的诡异时间，我们是可以随意毁坏和搬移任何物体的。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_hongjiyoun1.ntk_11_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">To Begin</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回到开始</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_hongjiyoun1.ntk_12_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Did you already find it?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Oh. I forgot.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You cannot pass through that passage again.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Weird? You can enter the passage several times but once you reach the end of passage, you cannot enter it again. Maybe there are certain rules for this passage. Anyway, I think there is another similar passage over there.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sudah pergi ke sana?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ah, aku lupa</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kamu tidak bisa melewati jalan itu lagi</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Anehkan? Bisa masuk ke sana berkali-kali tapi kalau sudah bisa melewatinya kamu tidak akan bisa masuk lagi.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pasti ada peraturan yang lebih jelas.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pokoknya…di sisi lai</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">您已经找到了吗？噢！我忘记了！您已经不能再越过这通路了。诡异吧！您可以无限制地进入，但一旦您到达终点，就无法在进行入场了。也许这隧道有什么特别规定吧。总之，还会有一条类似的地方的！别担心。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_hongjiyoun1.ntk_12_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">To Begin</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mulai</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回到开始</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_hongjiyoun1.ntk_13_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Lee Da Xu...Ah... Da Xu is my friend. Is he suffering from amnesia?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lee Da Xu...Ah... Da Xu adalah teman saya. Apakah dia sudah sembuh dari amnesia?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">Lee Da Xu…噢！这个人... Da Xu 是我的朋友，没错！他现在正受失忆之苦吗？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_hongjiyoun1.ntk_14_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">He can't remember anything? I believe his memories will come back slowly.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Dia tidak ingat apapun? Saya yakin dia pasti sembuh.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">他想不起任何事情吗？我想总有一天，他的记忆一定会回来的。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_hongjiyoun1.ntk_15_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Lee Da Xu? Ah… He's still alive, is that true? Da Xu and me are very good friends… How'd he lose his memories? If he's need any help to recover from his condition, then please let me know.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lee Da Xu? Ah… Dia masih hidup? Kami adalah teman sejak kecil. Padahal dia anak yang sangat baik kok bisa kehilangan ingatan yah…Tolong bilang saja kalau ada yang bisa saya lakukan untuk membantu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">Lee Da Xu 这个人? 他还活着啊？真不敢相信！ Da Xu和我是非常好的朋友…不过他是怎么失忆的呢？如果他需要我的帮助来恢复记忆，请您一定要跟我说唷。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_hongjiyoun1.ntk_15_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_hongjiyoun1.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Too many questions?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Terlalu banyak pertanyaan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">问题太多了吗？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_hongjiyoun1.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about Her</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang dia</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问她是谁？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_hongjiyoun1.ntk_2_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about Head Office Building</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang Head Office Building</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问 Head Office Building</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_hongjiyoun1.ntk_2_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about Bathroom</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang Bathroom</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问 Bathroom</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_hongjiyoun1.ntk_2_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about Restroom</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang Restroom</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问 Restroom</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_hongjiyoun1.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I'm sorry I didn't introduce myself</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Maaf saya lupa memperkenalkan diri</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">很抱歉我还没做自我介绍。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_hongjiyoun1.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about Hong Mi Ran</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang Hong Mi Ran</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问有关 Hong Mi Ran</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_hongjiyoun1.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ah. You met my mom?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">After the incident, I was not able to see her. Now I'm already here…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">How's my mom?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ah, kamu pernah bertemu ibu saya?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tidak sempat menyampaikan salam juga setelah bencana terjadi tiba-tiba saya sampai di sini</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ibu..baik-baik saja kan?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">噢！您见过我妈？事件发生之后，我都找不到她了。我人现在在这里，请问我妈妈过的还好吗？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_hongjiyoun1.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask how she came here.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya bagaimana bisa datang ke sini</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问她是如何过来的？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_hongjiyoun1.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">There was an upperclassman I liked… He was so perfect, I remember someone had he must be more than human. He had so many fans... Ugh... But then he turned into a monster.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I still wanted to protect him somehow… But there was nothing I could do.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ada senior yang saya suka.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Karena beliau terlalu sempurna saya sampai mendengar kabar bahwa dia bukan manusia bumi</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ada banyak anak-anak yang lebih cantik daripada saya mengikuti tapi semuanya menghilang begitu bencana terjadi.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Soalnya senior saya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我有一个暗恋的学长，他完美到不像地球人。比我更漂亮的女生也都喜欢他。甚至还倒追他。可是，异变发生后，大家都消失不见，学长竟然变成怪物了。我很想守护他，可是我真的不知所措。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_hongjiyoun1.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about that Boy</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang senior itu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问那位男孩是谁？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_hongjiyoun1.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I killed Joo Seong, vice-representative of the fighter class.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">There was no other choice.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">If I didn’t kill him, he would kill more people.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I have no regrets.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya membunuh Joo Seong, wakil perwakilan dari kelas Fighter.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tidak ada pilihan lain saat itu.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jika saya tidak membunuhnya saat itu, dia akan terus - terusan membunuh orang sekitarnya.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya tidak menyesal sama sekali.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我杀了格斗部部长Joo Seong。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我没有别的选择，如果我不杀他的话，他会杀死更多的人。我不后悔我这么做。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_hongjiyoun1.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Continue</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">继续</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_hongjiyoun1.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I had a boyfriend that always protected me.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">His name was Lee Dae Yook.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">He went to another world after he saw that I was having a hard time with everything that was happening.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">He didn't even tell me.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya mempunyai pacar yang selalu melindungi saya.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Nama dia adalah Lee Dae Yook.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Dia pergi ke dunia lain dan saya merasa dia pasti sangat kesusahan di sana.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我曾有一个总是在我身边守护我的男朋友。他的名字是Lee Dae Yook。他看过异世界之后，没跟我商量，就跑去了异世界。真的是伤透了我的心。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_hongjiyoun1.ntk_7_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">To Begin</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mulai</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回到开始</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_hongjiyoun1.ntk_8_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I don’t know how many floors this building has. The emergency stairs are destroyed and the elevator is broken. This building probably has more than 10th floors?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya kurang tahu berapa lantai. Soalnya tangga-tangga darurat tertutup dan lift tidak beroperasi dengan normal</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sudah pasti bisa melewati lanta 10 kan.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我不清楚这栋大楼有多少层，但紧急逃生口的楼梯已被毁坏，电梯也故障了。这栋大楼会有10楼以上吗？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_hongjiyoun1.ntk_8_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask for More Info</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang informasi</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问更多的讯息</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_hongjiyoun1.ntk_9_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Only a few things…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Like research notes…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I don't remember too many details…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I just remember being excited about the idea of visiting another world.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tidak begitu banyak.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Paling cuma pekerjaan tentang meneliti...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mungkin kamu berpikir seperti itu karena sudah tahu semuanya, tapi tidak ada informasi yang sedetail itu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Euhm~ bagaimana kalau mencoba pergi ke dunia lain?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">小事一件…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">就像研究笔记…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我已经记不起细节内容了…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我只记得我很兴奋，因为要去拜访异世界。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_hongjiyoun1.ntk_9_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask How to Visit Another World.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya bagaimana caranya pergi ke dunia lain.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问Another World怎么去？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_joon1.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Huh?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Heh?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">啊？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_joon1.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Listen to the Story</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mendengarkan cerita</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">听取故事</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_joon1.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Give Enrollment Form</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menyerahkan formulir pendaftaran.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">交付注册申请单</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_joon1.ntk_1_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about Damage</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menyerahkann formulir pendaftaran.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问受害内容</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_joon1.ntk_1_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Deliver the New Suit</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menyerahkan Uniform.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">传达新服饰</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_joon1.ntk_1_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I want to help.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya apakah ada yang bisa dibantu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我想要帮忙</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_joon1.ntk_1_0_6">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I want to help.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya apakah ada yang bisa dibantu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我想要帮忙</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_joon1.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Thanks~ The guy who processed my document said that it disappeared. Then he vanished too, and now I can't do anything until I find those forms… Anyway, thank you!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">terimakasih~</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pegawai yang bertugas untuk mengantarkan dokumen itu tiba-tiba menghilang setelah memberi kabar bahwa dokumennya hilang</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Setidaknya bilang hilang dimana jadi bisa dicari</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Selama ini saya tidak bisa mendaftar….</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pokoknya terimakasih!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">谢谢〜处理我文件的人说，它消失了。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">然后，他也跟着消失了。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">现在我不能做任何事情，直到我发现这些表格…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">无论如何，谢谢您了！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_joon1.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Begin</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">最初</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_joon1.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It's okay… I just took a bit of a beating… But I'll be fine. I probably need to train a bit more to catch up with my classmates.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bukan kerugian….</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Hanya kena pukul sedikit saja…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Padahal mereka bukan apa-apa, kalau saja saya bisa menahan pukulan mereka pasti sudah bisa membalas</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mungkin ketinggalan pelajaran karena sudah telat mendaftar</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">不能说是逃避…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">只是稍微被打住而已…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我大概需要接受更多的训练来赶上我的同学。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">一切都会好起来的。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_joon1.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Begin</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">最初</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_joon1.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Oh! Thanks, It will be useful I think I could defense myself with this. Watch me, I will catch up their skills as soon as possible.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ah!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Terimakasih, akan saya gunakan dengan baik</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau ada ini pasti tidak akan dipukuli lagi oleh orang-orang itu kan!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tunggu saja karena saya akan mengikuti kamu.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">啊！</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">谢谢,我会好好用的~</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">只要有这个就不会再被那些家伙打！</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">等着瞧吧！我会追到的！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_joon1.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Begin</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">最初</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_joon1.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Oh well... Everything is fine, but there is no computer game club.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Are we monkeys?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Why should we play and jump around campus?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I don't know why this school was such a boring atmosphere.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Let me play alone in quiet.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Setelah saya lihat semuanya bagus tapi di sini tidak ada perkumpulan game</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Memangnya kita monyet?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kamu bilang aku harus bermain sambil terus berlari-lari?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya nggak ngerti kenapa mereka menciptakan suasana yang primitif seperti ini</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">看样子这里什么都好，可是就是没有游戏区。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我们是猴子吗？</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">继续跳着玩？</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">到底是以什么想法制造出这种原始性的气氛…….</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">做成一个人安静玩的多好啊~</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_joon1.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Begin</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">最初</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_joon1.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">My friend told me that he'd find my document for me.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">So I'm waiting for him now.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Hmmm, but he's still not here.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Can you help me find that document?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Dia tidak muncul lagi hingga sekarang setelah berjanji untuk mengantarkan dokumen</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Setidaknya kita harus tahu ada apa dan di mana baru kita bisa mencoba untuk mencarinya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bisa bantu sedikit?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我朋友说他已经为我找到文件了。所以我正在等他。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">嗯……但他一直没来耶。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">您可以帮我拿到那份文件吗？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_joon1.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Agree</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menerima permintaan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">同意</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_joon1.ntk_6_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Reject</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menolak permintaan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">拒绝</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_joon1.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">They don't like me... Maybe because of my scores?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I'll need to study more than they do.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Do you think you can teach me how to learn things better and more quickly?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya tidak pernah menyangka saya akan diperlakukan seperti ini hanya karena sedikit terlambat</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Karena kamu tertinggal dalam proses pembelajaran bagaimana kalau kamu mencari sesuatu yang bisa dijadikan tambahan?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">他们不喜欢我，应该是分数的关系。我得比他们更用功念书才行。您可以教我如何念书才会念的又快又好吗？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_joon1.ntk_7_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">agree</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menerima permintaan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">同意</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_joon1.ntk_7_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">reject</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menolak permintaan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">拒绝</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_joon1.ntk_8_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Thank you.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">They'll find me if they come back here.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">So I guess all I can do for now is just wait.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Terimakasih.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Apakah orang itu akan kembali atau tidak, saya tak tahu. Untuk itu saya akan tetap disini</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">谢谢您。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">如果他们有回来的话，他们会来找我的。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">现在我能做的就只有等待。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_joon1.ntk_8_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Begin</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">最初</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_joon1.ntk_9_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I'll study here by myself.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Thank you.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Terima kasih, boleh kan aku berlatih sendiri disini?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我会在这边一个人好好念书。谢谢您。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_joon1.ntk_9_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Begin</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">最初</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_sosungil1.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Weird, it was a human…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ada masalah ya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">太诡异了，竟然是个人？！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_sosungil1.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Listen to the Story</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mendengarkan cerita</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">倾听故事</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
