    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about List of Saints</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang Saint List</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问圣徒列表</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_sosungil1.ntk_13_0_12">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about List of Saints</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang Saint List</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问圣徒列表</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_sosungil1.ntk_13_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about List of Saints</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang Saint List</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问圣徒列表</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_sosungil1.ntk_13_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about List of Saints</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang Saint List</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问圣徒列表</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_sosungil1.ntk_13_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about List of Saints</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang Saint List</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问圣徒列表</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_sosungil1.ntk_13_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about List of Saints</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang Saint List</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问圣徒列表</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_sosungil1.ntk_13_0_6">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about List of Saints</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang Saint List</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问圣徒列表</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_sosungil1.ntk_13_0_7">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about List of Saints</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang Saint List</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问圣徒列表</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_sosungil1.ntk_13_0_8">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about List of Saints</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang Saint List</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问圣徒列表</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_sosungil1.ntk_13_0_9">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about List of Saints</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang Saint List</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问圣徒列表</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_sosungil1.ntk_14_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You've heard of the list of inmates.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">How can all these gifted people be here?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Fate? Advertising? No way!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Everything was planned by SFG.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The sudden death of parents, retirements, house fires, and so on.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sudah pernanh dengar kan? Itulah daftar nama-nama tahanan…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bagaimana caranya mengumpulkan semua pelajar yang mempunyai kekuatan bisa berkumpul di sini?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Takdir? Rayuan? Nggak mungkin!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Yayasan mengontrolnya dari belakang.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Karena berbagai hal…mis</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这就是您听过的《犯人名单》。这些天才型人物怎么都聚到这儿了呢？是命运？还是诱拐？都不是！我看八成是SFG搞的鬼！父母亲的偶然死亡，退休，家中失火等……都是计划中的部分啊！！！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_sosungil1.ntk_14_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Continue</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Terus mendengarkan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">继续听</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_sosungil1.ntk_15_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">There are no parents that send their children to a new school without any good reason.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">While the higher-ups talk about world peace, they are actually committing crimes against humanity.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Don't believe me?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You can directly ask about it. Ask any teacher. See how they respond.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tidak akan ada orang tua yang sedang hidup dengan baik mau mengirimkan anaknya ke tempat yang tidak dikenal</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Melakukan tindakkan teror seperti itu dengan alasan untuk menjaga dan melindungi dunia ini.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pasti kamu tidak percaya dengan apa yang aku kat</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">世上没有父母亲会随便把自己的孩子送到全新的学校就读。当最高级干部谈到世界和平时，竟承认自己正犯下攻击人类的罪行。您不相信我说的话吧？！您可以先直接问问任何一位老师，看他们怎么回答你。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_sosungil1.ntk_16_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">"You want to complete the Eight Signs of Divine?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It is not an easy task..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ok go ahead.. Hope you would bring back a good news."</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kamu ingin menyelesaikan Bagua?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ini bukan hal yang semudah itu…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Iya coba sekali sana…aku harap kamu kembali dengan membawa berita baik</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">您说您想要完成Eight Signs of Divine任务吗？这可不是件简单的任务唷~ 先试试看吧！希望可以听到您的好消息。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_sosungil1.ntk_17_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">……….</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_sosungil1.ntk_18_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I fell something, near the No.3 Plant. I would've gone myself if JS was not here but.. Please go find out what happened for me.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Aku merasakan sesuatu terjadi di ruang Power Generation No. 3. Jika bukan Jess, aku pasti sudah pergi kesana… Coba kamu pergilah kesana dan cari tahu apa yang terjadi.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我发现有东西在No.3 Plant的附近游走移动。但如果JS不在这，我就无法自己一个人去！请帮我调查是发生了什么事请，好吗？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_sosungil1.ntk_18_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_sosungil1.ntk_19_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">A secret passage? I have never seen it.. Oh ok. I will investigate it on my own. Thank you!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jalan rahasia? Sepertinya sebelumnya tidak pernah ada … oke deh. Aku akan mencari tahu sendiri. Makasih ya.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">神秘隧道？我没看过耶…. 好的！我会替您调查看看！谢谢您！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_sosungil1.ntk_19_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_sosungil1.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You may have many questions…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">But you don't know much about it.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mungkin ada banyak hal yang mau kamu tanyakan..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tidak ada banyak hal yang mau aku katakan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">您可能有很多疑问，但您无法了解的事情也很多。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_sosungil1.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about Him</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya siapa anda</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问他是谁？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_sosungil1.ntk_2_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about the Underground</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang basement</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问地下楼层的事情</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_sosungil1.ntk_2_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about Ji Il Cheung</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang Jess</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问 Ji Il Cheung的事情</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_sosungil1.ntk_20_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You need to tell one more person about secret passage. Do you know Suah by any chance? I've heard about her from other kids. Don't ask me why, just go tell Suah about the secret passage. She would understand if you tell her that Liz has found the way to Adoniechus. Please do this for me.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Aku harus menyampaikan sesuatu kepada seseorang. Kamu kenal dengan orang yang bernama Suah? Aku pernah dengar dari teman begitu. Jangan tanyakan alasannya apa..Tolong bilang saja kepada Suah bahwa Ace sudah menemukan jalan ke Adoniecuse</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">关于神秘隧道，您得再告知某位人士。知道Suah是谁吗？我曾听过几个孩子提到这名字。先别问我原因，只要传达这个秘密，以及告诉她 Liz 有找到前往Adoniechus绝对起点的方法，她就会马上明白的。请您帮我这个忙！谢谢!</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_sosungil1.ntk_20_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_sosungil1.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Sacred Gate Campus... Swordsmanship class, and Mesran of Ragia in another world.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Who were you?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Not the one for now, the one before incarnation.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">SG_School…dulunya jurusan Sword, sebelum itu Methlan dari Lagia di dunia lain.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kamu siapa?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bukan kamu yang sekarang tapi kamu yang dulu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">圣门学院……..剑道部的天下…. Ragia的Mesran则在另一个世界里。请问您是谁呢？我问的不是现在，而是以前的您。以前的您，是谁呢?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_sosungil1.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask Again</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya lagi</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">继续问</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_sosungil1.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It is good not to remember what you were.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">If I could remember you were the hypocrite, you wouldn't forgive yourself. We are the ones who ignore the people that never benefited from the Light. We consider them as invaders.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I still cannot believe I was one of them.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Beruntunglah sekarang karena tidak bisa mengingat apa-apa</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Dia akan merasa sangat tertekan kalau dia ingat bahwa dirinya adalah salah satu anggota dari orang-orang munafik yang kotor itu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sudah menyabaikan teriakkan teman sekampung halaman yang berter</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我很庆幸能够忘记自己是谁。如果我能，那么我将会想起我的虚伪人格，而无法原谅我自己。我们总是忽略那些无法得到光明的可怜人们的呐喊声，甚至把他们当作是入侵者看待..….我到现在仍无法相信我竟是那种人……….</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_sosungil1.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Continue</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Terus mendengarkan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">继续听</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_sosungil1.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The war between Light and Dark. It sounds cool, but…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The Daramai race was forced to live in the day. Someday, they were able to realize the power of Light after suffering so long in the dark, and asked to share it. Their oppressors refused…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Perang antara cahaya dan kegelapan, judulnya sih memang sedikit keren.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tapi ada suku 'Daramai' yang hidup terkurung sesuatu dan hidup tanpa menerima bantuan dari cahaya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tapi entah karena apa authenticationya hancur dan orang-orang itu mulai tahu ket</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">阳光和黑暗的战争！听起来很酷唷！但是...…..某个叫做Daramai的种族因为长期被监禁，一直过着没有阳光的日子。最近，他们逃脱了牢笼，看见了阳光的力量，希望可以共享光明。可是，他们的暴君竟然拒绝了他们的请求……..</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_sosungil1.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Continue</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Terus mendengarkan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">继续听</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_sosungil1.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The Ragia considered themselves the rightful owners of the Light, and considered the Daramai as lowly invaders.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Another world was almost destroyed by war.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">So who am I? I am not a part of the Light race.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I want to fight against Light.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lagia yang menyebut suku bangsanya sebagai pemilik cahaya mengambil kesimpulan bahwa orang-orang yang perlu dikasihani itu adalah penyerbu dari kegelapan.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Perang itu telah membawa dunia lain hingga ke ambang kehancuran</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kamu tanya siapa aku? Kini ak</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">Ragia族自认是阳光的管理者，视Daramai族为低等的侵犯者。在另个世界里，因战争的摧残，已濒临末日的状态了。所以，我为何方神圣？ 我就是专门与阳光作对的黑暗族。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_sosungil1.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Begin</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">最初</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_sosungil1.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">This place is like the face behind the mask. Here.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">They pretend to be saviors of justice, but they developed weapons in secret.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Moreover...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Disini seperti bagian belakang dari sebuah topeng</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Di luar dia berpura-pura sebagai pembela kebenaran, tetapi di belakang dia sedang meneliti senjata tanpa sepengetahuan orang lain.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ditambah lagi….</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这条路有着假面人的神秘色彩。在这里，他们装作是捍卫正义的救世主，却同时秘密地进行武器研发！还有……</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_sosungil1.ntk_7_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Continue</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Terus mendengarkan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">继续听</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_sosungil1.ntk_8_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I believe you already saw almost too much.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">They are just like the people who insist that they own the Light.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">SFG doesn't care about human life. They've experimented on living human bodies.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kamu sudah banyak melihat hingga sekarang kan?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Orang-orang di yayasan ini tidak berbeda dengan mereka yang berpikir seolah-olah seluruh cahaya di dunia ini adalah milik mereka</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pasti tidak ada pikiran untuk menghargai kehidupan, karena itulah mereka</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">相信您已经看到许多真相了。他们与总是坚持阳光是自己的人没有差别。SFG并不在乎人类的生命，他们已经做了许多活人体实验了。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_sosungil1.ntk_8_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Continue</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Terus mendengarkan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">继续听</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_sosungil1.ntk_9_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You might be able to find something here.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">But you might regret what you learn.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Are you still willing to find out?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mungkin kita bisa mencari sesuatu di sini</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Setelah menemukannya mungkin akan berpikir bahwa lebih baik tidak tahu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kamu bisa percaya diri kamu sendiri seperti itu?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">也许您会找到些什么，但找到之后，可能会后悔学过某些东西。即使如此，您还是想要寻找吗？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_sosungil1.ntk_9_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Begin</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">最初</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_sujung1.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Uh... Hello?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Aaa…. Hai~</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">啊….您好！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_sujung1.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Listen to the Story</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mendengarkan cerita</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">听取故事</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_sujung1.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Give Enrollment Form</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menyerahkan formulir pendaftaran.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">交付入学申请书</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_sujung1.ntk_1_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about Damage</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menyerahkann formulir pendaftaran.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问被害内容</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_sujung1.ntk_1_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Deliver the New Suit</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menyerahkan Uniform.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">传递New Suit</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_sujung1.ntk_1_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I want to help.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya apakah ada yang bisa dibantu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我想要帮忙！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_sujung1.ntk_1_0_6">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I want to help.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya apakah ada yang bisa dibantu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我想要帮忙！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_sujung1.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ah... Thanks~ If the officer just tells me where I should look… Maybe I can find my papers on my own.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau saja pegawai itu menjelaskan dengan benar saya pasti bisa mendatanginya secara langsung</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jadi selama ini aku tidak bisa mendaftar dan terus begini…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">啊,谢谢~</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">如果职员好好告诉我的话我可以亲自找的...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">因此之前都没法注册</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_sujung1.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Begin</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">最初</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_sujung1.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I can endure the beatings... Still, they really hurt, though...~ This school uniform doesn't really absorb any brunt either...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Anak-anak kecil datang menyerang terus memukul, sebenarnya kalau sakit sedikit aku masih bisa tahan tapi</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Benar-benar sakit kan~</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Memang seragam terlalu tipis jadi bermasalah…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">小小的家伙过来打，如果一点点痛还能忍住?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">太痛了~</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">本来校服就很薄</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_sujung1.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Begin</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">最初</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_sujung1.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Oh, what are these clothes? They look sturdier... Maybe I'll even get the chance to fight back if someone hits me! Anyway, thanks. This'll be handy~~</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ih baju apa ini?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau segini pasti bisa menahannya kan, anda saja bisa memukulnya sekali saja</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Terimakasih, akan aku gunakan dengan baik~</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">"啊，这个衣服是什么~?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这个程度的话应该能忍受一定程度吧, 各打一顿也好…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">谢谢,会好好用的</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_sujung1.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Begin</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">最初</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_sujung1.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I don't get it</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya tidak mengerti</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">不明白耶~</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_sujung1.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Begin</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">最初</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_sujung1.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">My friend told me that he'd find my document for me.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">So I'm waiting for him now.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Hmmm, but he's still not here.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Can you help me find that document?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Harus bagaimana lagi pegawai yang biasanya menerima pendaftaran hilang entah kemana dan tidak kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya begini karena tidak tahu harus bagaimana</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bisa bantu sedikit?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我朋友说他已经为我找到文件了。所以我正在等他。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">嗯……但他一直没来耶。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">您可以帮我拿到那份文件吗？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_sujung1.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Agree</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menerima permintaan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">同意</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_sujung1.ntk_6_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Reject</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menolak permintaan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">拒绝</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_sujung1.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">They don't like me... Maybe because of my scores?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I'll need to study more than they do.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Do you think you can teach me how to learn things better and more quickly?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Aku benar-benar tidak tahu bahwa aku akan diganggu hingga seperti ini</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Karena kamu tertinggal dalam proses pembelajaran bagaimana kalau kamu mencari sesuatu yang bisa dijadikan tambahan?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bisa bantu sedikit?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">他们不喜欢我，应该是分数的关系。我得比他们更用功念书才行。您可以教我如何念书才会念的又快又好吗？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_sujung1.ntk_7_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Agree</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menerima permintaan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">同意</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_sujung1.ntk_7_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Reject</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menolak permintaan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">拒绝</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_sujung1.ntk_8_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Thank you.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">They'll find me if they come back here.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">So I guess all I can do for now is just wait.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Apakah orang itu akan kembali atau tidak, saya tak tahu. Untuk itu saya akan tetap disini</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">谢谢您。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">如果他们有回来的话，他们会来找我的。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">现在我能做的就只有等待。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_sujung1.ntk_8_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Begin</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">最初</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_sujung1.ntk_9_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I'll study here by myself.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Thank you.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Makasih, boleh kan aku berlatih sendiri disini?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我会在这边一个人好好念书。谢谢您。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_sujung1.ntk_9_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Begin</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">最初</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_sungheeji1.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Hello, welcome.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bagus, kamu sudah datang kesini</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">您好，欢迎欢迎。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_sungheeji1.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Listen to the Story</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mendengarkan cerita</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">听取故事</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_sungheeji1.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Open the Shop</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jual beli item</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">开启商店</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_sungheeji1.ntk_1_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Check if this Student was Mentioned by the Old Man</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Konfirmasikan pelajar yang diberi tahu Old Man</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">确认是否为Old Man提到的那位学生</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_sungheeji1.ntk_1_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about the Underground Laboratory</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang Basement Laboratory</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问关于地下室Laboratory的事情</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_sungheeji1.ntk_1_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Tell her about Seung Hee Jeon</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menyampaikan berita tentang Seung Hee Jeon</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">告诉她有关Seung Hee Jeon的事情</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_sungheeji1.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">What do you want to know?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Cerita apa yang mau kamu dengarkan?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">您想问什么呢？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_sungheeji1.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about Her</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya siapa anda</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问她的事情</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_sungheeji1.ntk_2_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about the Head Office Building</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang Foundation Headquarter</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问 Head Office Building的事情</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_sungheeji1.ntk_2_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about Sacred Financial Group's Public Service</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang kegiatan sosial yayasan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问Sacred Financial Group的社服活动</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_sungheeji1.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I'm Seung Hee Ji, Sophomore Archer Class at Sacred Gate campus.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">A few months ago, I followed my sister, and she transformed into a monster. I lost her near here.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I made the map of Leonine campus and sign board here so that I could easily trace friends and family that have been transformed into monsters.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Aku adalah Seung Hee Ji anak Archery dari Sacred Gate School kelas dua</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Aku mengejar kakakku yang sudah berubah menjadi monster beberapa bulan yang lalu hingga ke tempat ini</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Peta Leonine school atau</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我是Sacred Gate学院2年级生的弓箭部Seung Hee Ji。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">几个月前，我跟踪我的姐姐，而且她突变一只怪兽。可惜，最后我竟然跟丢了……….</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我制作了Leonine campus地图和路标，这都是为了要跟踪那些变成怪物的我的朋友与家人。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_sungheeji1.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Begin</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">最初</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_sungheeji1.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It's like a big tombstone here.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">A lot of people died to make this building.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">We believed they sacrificed themselves for our sakes, but</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tempat ini seperti batu nisan yang luas….</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Berapa banyak orang yang kehilangan nyawa demi gedung ini</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya ingin percaya bahwa semua ini adalah demi semuanya, tapi bukan…kan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau dipikir-pikir lagi tidak ada cara agar semua orang bahagia</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这就像个巨大的碑石一样。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">很多人为了建造这座建筑而死亡。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我们相信，他们是为了我们而牺牲的，可是……………</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_sungheeji1.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Begin</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">最初</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_sungheeji1.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The Sacred Financial Group obviously did several good jobs for this community.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">There are almost too many records of the company's donations and public service.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Now, there are still people that doubt the Sacred Financial Group.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Are they too good to be true? Maybe not.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I think somebody has to sacrifice for the others.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">All of us can't be happy, anyway.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Yayasan saint memang sudah melakukan banyak kebaikan untuk masyarakat</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Itu adalah hal yang tak bisa dipungkiri…kan ada catatannya…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tapi tetap saja ada orang yang curiga seperti ini…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kenapa yah? Apa karena terlalu banyak melakukan hal yang baik?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">
    </VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">Sacred Financial Group的确为了社会做了许多好事。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">他们捐赠许多东西，也有提供公共服务，这些都有被记录下来。但至今还是有人会怀疑 Sacred Financial Group。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">是因为他们太诚实了吗？也许不是。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我认为，总要有人被牺牲。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">总之，我们大家都高兴不起来。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_sungheeji1.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Begin</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">最初</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_sungheeji1.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Maybe... It is me.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I am the one who talked about it first.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Okay, look at these documents carefully.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I already read them so many times.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Although I couldn't find any suspected evidence…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Maybe the other can find it.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mungkin…sepertinya saya.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Karena saya sudah bilang….</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Nah, coba periksa potongan dokumen secara langsung</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sepertinya aku sudah melihat terlalu banyak….</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tapi bukan berarti saya jadi tahu apa yang harus dilakukan…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau dilihat oleh orang lain.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">也许......是我。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我是第一个谈到它的人。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">好吧，请您仔细看一下这些文件。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我已经阅读很多次了。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">虽然我无法找到任何可疑的迹象...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">也许其他人能找的到。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_sungheeji1.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Begin</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">最初</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_sungheeji1.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Oh well…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I haven't gone to the underground laboratory yet.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You cannot use the stairs. Maybe you have to use elevator although I don't know how to activate it. Anyway, I think you can go down if you can open it... You probably need a password.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Euhm….</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya belum pernah pergi ke ruang percobaan yang ada di bawah tanah</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kayaknya tidak mungkin bisa menggunakan tangga,</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kamu bisa menggunakan lift yang ada di sana</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya tidak tahu apakah beroperasi dengan lancar atau tidak tapi,</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau b</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">那….好吧...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我没有去地下Laboratory呢!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">您无法使用楼梯。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">也许你会需要用到电梯，但我不知道如何启动它。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">无论如何，我觉得你可以去看一下，如果你能打开它的话......对了，您还会需要一个密码。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_sungheeji1.ntk_7_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Begin</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">最初</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_sungheeji1.ntk_8_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Really? Where? Where did you meet my sister?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Where... Accidentally? Okay, I know you didn't expect this, but it is good news.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Although I sensed my sister in my heart, I didn't expect for her to really be alive somewhere.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Thank you so much.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Maybe if you meet my sister again, could you tell her my message?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I was so proud of you as my sister, and I believe you will survive in any bad situation.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Yang benar? Di mana? Kamu ketemu kakak di mana?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Dimana..secara kebetulan? Iya…karena kamu pasti tidak akan menyangka bisa bertemu dengan adik dari orang seperti itu…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Meskipun dia bukan kakak kandung saya, berita ini membuat saya bahagia.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Say</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">真的吗？在哪里？您在哪里见到我妹妹的呢？</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">碰巧？偶然？好吧，我知道这超乎您的想像，但没想到会是一个好消息。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">虽然我的心能感受到我的姐姐，但我没想到她真的是活在某个地方。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">太谢谢你了。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">如果您再碰到我的姐姐，能不能把我的信息交给她呢？</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">“可以成为您的妹妹我很骄傲。我相信您无论在哪里都可以熬过来的！”</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_sungheeji1.ntk_8_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Begin</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">最初</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_sungheeyoun.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Huh?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Huh?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">嗯？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_sungheeyoun.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Listen to the Story</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mendengarkan cerita</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">听取故事</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_e3_sungheeyoun.ntk_1_0_10">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about List of Saints</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang Saint List</VALUE>
