  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_choiyoungsub.ntk_13_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">What is this? You're in Trading Hole doing research? Is this for your future mission? That's impossible, I need to double check whether you completed it or not.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Apa-apaan nieh?Kalau di Trading Hole saja sudah kehilangan arah kayak gini gimana bisa melaksanakan tugas ke depannya? Ini nggak bisa dibiarkan..untuk sementarsa saya harus memeriksa tugas-tugas kamu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这是什么？你在 Trading Hole摸索这么久，将来能顺利的进行任务吗? 这样不行。暂时我要亲自确认是否完成任务。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_choiyoungsub.ntk_13_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
