    <VALUE Lang="id">Skill dari Archery</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">弓箭部</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_choiyoungsub.ntk_147_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Shaman Section</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Skill dari Shaman</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">气功部</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_choiyoungsub.ntk_15_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It seems the Trading Hole can complete the mission, here it's already over. Me and the students are ultimately heading in the same direction, fighting for the same purpose. *Sigh…*</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tugas yang harus kamu selesaikan di Trading Hole berakhir sampai di sini…dulu saya juga punya mimpi seperti kamu…eh saya ngomong apaan sieh</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">似乎在Trading Hole能达成的任务, 在这里结束了,我也有过和学生一样的梦想, 唉..我在胡说什么…</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_choiyoungsub.ntk_15_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_choiyoungsub.ntk_152_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Hurry and Go meet Student Counselor.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Segera pergi bertemu dengan Student Counselor.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">请快点去见Student Counselor。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_choiyoungsub.ntk_153_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Hurry and Come back again.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Cepat dan kembali lagi.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">请快点儿回来。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_choiyoungsub.ntk_154_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Then, Help me.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lalu bantu saya.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">然后，请帮助我。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_choiyoungsub.ntk_155_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Help me to deliver the important work.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bantu saya untuk mengirimkan surat penting.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">帮我传达这重要的事情</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_choiyoungsub.ntk_156_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Just take a bus to reach the Prison map.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Gunakan bus untuk mencapai Prison Map.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">只要搭乘公车就可以到达Prison map了。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_choiyoungsub.ntk_16_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I'll just give you mission here, and of course Lee Zhen will continue to give you missions. I don't want to make a habit of giving you assignments since I think it's important for you to train yourself.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sampai sini adalah tugas yang saya berikan, tentu saja kamu akan terus mendapat tugas dari Jin Lee. Saya tidak memberikan tugas kepada kamu berarti mulai saat ini kamu harus meningkatkan kemampuan kamu sendiri. Kayaknya nanti saya akan banyak minta bantua</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">到这里为只是我给你的任务。当然Lee Zhen会继续的给任务。我不给课题是希望您从现在开始自己来培养能力。将来应该有很多事请求学生帮忙。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_choiyoungsub.ntk_16_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_choiyoungsub.ntk_17_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Amanuoruoyin? I still can't believe we were able to get this much information about him...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Amano(young)?Euhm...Hebat sekali kamu bisa menemukan data seperti ini? Saya sudah pernah dengar sieh tapi melihatnya langsung seperti ini…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_choiyoungsub.ntk_17_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_choiyoungsub.ntk_18_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Hmm... Seems like it'll need more accessories later.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Euhm sepertinya saya bakalan butuh banyak genuine parts</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">嗯..好像以后会需要很多零件。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_choiyoungsub.ntk_18_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_choiyoungsub.ntk_19_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">We don't have much in the way of a collection. What accessories do we still need?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Segini kayaknya sangat kurang…..nggak ngerti juga harus mengumpulkan genuine parts apa</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">收集这么少, 根本没有用… 到底要找什么样的零件呢？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_choiyoungsub.ntk_19_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_choiyoungsub.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Oh... This is a waste of time since you're not tough enough for this. Oh well, thanks for your help.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Euheum, saya tidak bisa membuang waktu walaupun hanya sesaat, saya butuh orang yang sangat kuat, sepertinya kamu belum mempunyai kekuatan seperti itu. Lihat saja daerah sekitar, entah sejak kapan tapi tiba-tiba orang-orang dengan kekuatan aneh bermunculan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">呵…我不能这样的浪费一分一秒。对我来说比任何人都需要强而有力的人。但你似乎还没有具备那样强壮的力​​量。环顾一下四周，不知从何时开始出现一些有奇异力量的人。但我还是谢谢你的好意。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_choiyoungsub.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_ep4_choiyoungsub.ntk_20_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Please select the skill you need.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mau skill dari jurusan apa pilih saja</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">请选择您需要的技能、</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
