    <VALUE Lang="GS">Help with her Request</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mendengarkan permintaan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">帮助她</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_event_ami_c.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">There's a citizen who needs you to save her from some suspicious men.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I can't help her, but I know you have the power to save her.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Orang-orang yang berada di antara makhluk-makhluk aneh meminta pertolongan… Aku sendiri tak dapat berbuat apa-apa.. Andai ada orang yang mau membantu pasti akan sangat bagus…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">市民需要您的协助。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我帮不上忙，但您绝对可以胜任的！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_event_ami_c.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I told you before that there's a good citizen who needs your help. I know, you can do this!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Maaf, namun… Sepertinya kamu bisa membantuku… kalau aku butuh bantuan kamu..tolong bantu aku ya…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我早就跟您说过，有位好市民需要您的帮忙！相信您可以的。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
