  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_event_ami_c.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Thank you.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">There are lots of shady characters involved in the kidnapping. Prepare yourself well otherwise you will be in great danger.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Please take care.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Makasih.. Hati-hati ya… banyaknya jumlah makhluk-makhluk aneh itu memungkinkan mereka menyerangmu, kamu bisa dalam bahaya.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">谢谢您。</VALUE>
