    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_medic1.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Th.. they.. are not.. gon.. gonna co.. come.. any.. more..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mari…su suda..sudahi saja kah sekarang?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">他…们不…会再…过来了……</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_medic1.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_medic1.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">No… I don..t remem…ber … any.. Thing…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya tidak ingat !!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我…..什么都想不起来了……</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_medic1.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_t_ex1.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I-I'm so hungry…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">No more students…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Suffering in hunger...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">How did it come to this?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Eu..eu…lapar…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tak ada para pelajar dan…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lapar dan…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kenapa begini…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我肚子好饿……… 没有学生在受饥饿之苦的…..我们为什么会这样呢？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_t_ex1.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Request Key</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Meminta kunci</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">钥匙的请求</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_t_ex1.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Give Something to Eat</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menyampaikan makanan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">传递吃的</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_t_ex1.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_t_ex1.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Yes, I'm talking about a key.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The key to which room or building? Classroom? Information Center?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Iya…kunci maksudnya…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kunci dimana? Kelas? Information room?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">是啊！我指的就是那个钥匙。这是哪里的钥匙呢？Classroom？Information Center？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_t_ex1.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_t_ex1.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Food to eat!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">This is too unbelievably wonderful…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Here, you can have this key!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You are a good student.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I'll give you a better grade on your next paper.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Heh heh heh!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Makanan!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Baiklah, baiklah</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Nah, bawa aja kuncinya!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kamu adalah pelajar yang baik</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Nanti akan saya berikan lebih banyak nilai lagi</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Hahahahaha…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">吃的东西！！！！太好了！来！把钥匙拿走吧！您是个好学生。下次的考试，我会给您高分的。呵呵呵………</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_t_ex1.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_t_ex1.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">.....3</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">.....3</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">.....3</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_t_ex1.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">This is a video tape?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">So what is it you want to give me?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You give, you take, you give, you take. It's alright as long as the balance isn't tipped too far.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ah…tape rekaman</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau begitu kamu harus memberikan sesuatu kepada saya kan?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau yang satu pergi yang lain harus datang sehingga tidak merusak keseimbangan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这是录影带？</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">那么，您要给我什么？</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">你给我收，我给你收，将才能维持好平衡啊。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_t_ex1.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_t_ex1.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">But…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Please bring me something to eat.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I see some people eating outside.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Please bring me some food!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Karena itu…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tolong bawakan makanan untuk saya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Soalnya kayaknya saya melihat orang-orang yang membawa makanan di luar sana</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tolong dapatkan untuk saya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">但是…..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">请您帮我带点吃的来好吗？</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我看见有人在外面吃东西。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">请帮我带点食物进来。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_t_ex1.ntk_7_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_t_t_master1.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Where are my students? They're all gone!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I feel their spirits roaming this eerie building!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">How can I help you?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Di mana para pelajar saya? Mereka semua menghilang!!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我的学生在哪里？他们都走了？！</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我感觉他们的灵魂漫游在这个怪异的建筑里！</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我该怎么帮你？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_t_t_master1.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about Situation</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya situasi</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问现况</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_t_t_master1.ntk_1_0_10">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about the day of Phenomenon</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang Day of Phenomenon</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问异变当天的情况</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_t_t_master1.ntk_1_0_11">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask if he needs help</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tanya apa dia butuh bantuan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问他是否需要帮助</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_t_t_master1.ntk_1_0_12">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Hand over the things found</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Berikan sesuatu yang ditemukan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">交出所找到的东西</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_t_t_master1.ntk_1_0_13">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask if he is in a trouble</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tanya apa dia butuh bantuan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问他是否遇到麻烦了？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_t_t_master1.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about Situation</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya situasi</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问现况</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_t_t_master1.ntk_1_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Request Information</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Meminta data</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问资料</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_t_t_master1.ntk_1_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return the Key</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembalikan kunci</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">归还钥匙</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_t_t_master1.ntk_1_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Retrieve the Cassette</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menunjukkan Cassette</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">领取卡带</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_t_t_master1.ntk_1_0_6">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Take out the Crystal</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">mengeluarkan Crystal</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">拿出珠子</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_t_t_master1.ntk_1_0_7">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about the Cassette</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang Cassette</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问卡带</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_t_t_master1.ntk_1_0_8">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about the Code to Enter Basement Level 2</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang Code to Enter Basement Level 2</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问要进入Basement Level 2的密码</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_t_t_master1.ntk_1_0_9">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about Sacred Financial Group's Public Service</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang Sacred Financial Group's Public Service</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问Sacred Financial Group的社服活动内容</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_t_t_master1.ntk_10_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Student should have learned from class that the start of the chaos started about 18 years ago.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It started when the eclipse and meteor shower happened in Northern Asia.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pada saat jam pelajaran kamu pasti pernah belajar tentang kejadian 18 tahun tang lalu?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Gerhana matahari dan hujan meteor yang hanya terjadi di Asia pada siang bolong…mungkin lebih pantas dikatakan kejadian</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">学生们在上课时应该有学到一些18年前的事吧?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">一天内只在亚洲北部发生令人质疑的日蚀和流星雨现象…不,应该说是事件</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_t_t_master1.ntk_10_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_t_t_master1.ntk_11_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Once you collect all the necessary records, compile them and give the records to him!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Please don't forget to be polite.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Semua…catatan…semuanya…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bawa terus perlihatkan...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">La…gia…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">所有的…纪录…都…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">带过去…秀给他看…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">安... 神特</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_t_t_master1.ntk_11_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_t_t_master1.ntk_12_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">A-ha! I remember the special number code.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I wrote it in the memo.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Just bring it over so we can decipher the message using the code.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Euk….</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Hahahahaha…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau nomornya aku tahu dengan pasti</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Iya…sudah pasti tahu…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tapi saya tidak ingat…kini…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Experiment….Corpse….No...28</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Dia…mengambil…memo…yang aku tulis…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">咳…喝…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">咳哈哈哈哈…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我确实知道号码</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">好…你分明就知道…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">但是记不太清楚了现在</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">实验体..2..8…号</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我…写的…便条纸…带过去了</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_t_t_master1.ntk_12_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_t_t_master1.ntk_13_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">.......10</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">.......10</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">.......10</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_t_t_master1.ntk_14_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Everything started during that time. The Sacred Financial Group set up all 4 Colleges which are protected with Force field Mechanisms. This is their way to protect the people; especially the Students!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Semuanya dimulai sejak saat itu, yayasan saint yang mendirikan 4 sekolah ini juga dibangun dengan alasan itu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kamu mungkin sudah tahu bahwa hujan meteor itu bukanlah kejadian alam biasa, tapi kamu pasti tidak tahu tentang yang sebenarnya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">所有事情都在那时开始,设立我们4个学院的神圣财团也因为那件事之契机而创立</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">虽然已经知道那流星雨并非单纯的天体现象,但实际却无法了解</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_t_t_master1.ntk_14_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_t_t_master1.ntk_15_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">That is the starting point of all those inexplicable happenings.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">There's nothing to hide now. All the people already know what brought the chaos. I hope everyone can help to bring a little order, especially on the streets.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Here's some more information...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The meteor shower is a sign of communication between the outer world and the world we are living in right now. It is one of the greatest mysteries that consuming my thoughts.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kejadian itu yang menjadi permulaan dari ini semua</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">….Aku akan jelaskan karena sekarang sudah tak ada perlunya lagi menutupinya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Hujan meteor itu…adalah petunjuk dari komponen-komponen yang terkirim dari dunia lain ke dunia kita</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这所有事情的起点…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">…现在也没有什么好隐瞒的就把它讲出来吧</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">那流星雨是我们现在生存的世界和其他世界之间传送要素的痕迹</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_t_t_master1.ntk_15_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_t_t_master1.ntk_16_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">This just proves that there is another world or dimension out there!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">If I may be so bold, I actually believe that we are controlled by machines that are controlled by people! I just hope that this isn't true!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau sudah mengerti mungkin kamu akan berpikir bahwa dunia yang di sana adalah dunia yang asli dan dunia ini adalah palsu, atau sebenarnya manusia sudah dikontrol oleh mesin, tapi aku bisa katakan dengan yakin bahwa bukan seperti itu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sudah tak bisa di</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">大概就是说,那边是真正的世界,这边是假的世界,事实上人类受到机器的支配,只是精髓被吸收掉了</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">也许有人这样认为,但确实来讲不是这样的</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">严格说来两个世界各自独立在两个空间…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">嗯!</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_t_t_master1.ntk_16_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_t_t_master1.ntk_17_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I have a lot of beliefs and theories to share with you, but I don't have much time!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The only sure thing I can tell you is that there's still a way to stop the spread of this chaos and save our world.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Please keep your hopes up, okay?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Vigilance is a virtue!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">….Pikiranku..lagi</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Masih banyak yang mau saya ajarkan..tapi kita tidak punya…banyak waktu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Masih..masih bisa dihentikan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kita harus menghentikan….tindakan perebutan cahaya!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">还有…精神…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">虽然还有很多想教给你们的…却….没有什么时间了</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">还是…还是有可能可以堵住的</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">挡住光明那件事 都堵起来!"</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_t_t_master1.ntk_17_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_t_t_master1.ntk_18_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Oh my, I… My mind… I'm having trouble… Thinking…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You are… Did you bring the red ball to me before?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Why…? Suddenly…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Sacred Financial Group? No... Yes... I remember it like an angel that was supposed to work for good and justice. At least... When this place was Leonine campus before the incident.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Hah…tiba kesadaran saya…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Beberapa waktu yang lalu..kamu pernah membawa Red Sphere kan?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kenapa…tiba-tiba…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Yayasan? Eh….yang namanya yayasan sudah pasti tempat baik yang dibangun untuk tujuan baik…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bisa dikatakan berada di pihak yang benar.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">S</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">哎呀… 突然精神有点…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">学生是…不久前带来过红色珠子是吧?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">为什么… 突然…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">财团? 可是…财团的确可以说是以好的形象做好事的正义一方。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">至少…这里还是虎令学院为止</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_t_t_master1.ntk_18_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">继续</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_t_t_master1.ntk_19_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Dangerous... It already changed direction…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Laboratory... They experimented on humans, but this… They abandoned this world…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bahaya….sudah terlanjur salah arah</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Percobaan….kalau tentang percobaan menggunakan orang hidup saya akui itu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tapi…sama halnya dengan mereka membuang dunia ini…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">危险啊…已经是方向歪曲的实验… 认定使用活体的实验…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">但是这个… 那些家伙打算放弃这个世界</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_t_t_master1.ntk_19_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Begin</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">最初</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_t_t_master1.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_t_t_master1.ntk_20_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The day.. Wasn.. Wasn't.. Different.. From… any other day.. I don'..t rememeber.. Anything.. on that day…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Hari itu lain dari biasanya.. Saya tidak ingat apapun di hari tersebut !!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">那..天...没有发生什么特别不一样的事情呀....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我回想一下...完全想不起来</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_t_t_master1.ntk_20_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_t_t_master1.ntk_21_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">There.. Is … a notebook… I have.. Written.. Everything.. There.. A boy and a .. Girl student has one each… if.. You find.. The notebooks… then you will.. Be able to know what… happened.. On.. That.. Day…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ada sebuah notebook yang saya tulis. Semuanya ada disana. Seorang lelaki dan pelajar wanita masing masing memiliki 1. Jika kamu menemukannya, Kamu akan mengetahui fakta yang sebenarnya.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">对了!! 有一本手...册...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我把全部的事情都纪录在..那本手册..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">虎令学院的男同学女同学分别把那本手册拿走了</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">去找他们...应该可以知道..一切经过</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_t_t_master1.ntk_21_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_t_t_master1.ntk_22_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Now.. I.. Will.. Know.. What.. Ha..happen..ed</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sekarang saya tahu apa yang terjadi</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">现在...有了这本手册,我想应该就可以知道整件事情的来龙去脉了</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_t_t_master1.ntk_22_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_t_t_master1.ntk_23_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ta.. Take thie.. I don.. don't need it.. Any.. More..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ambil ini.. Saya tidak membutuhkannya..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这本手册你拿去...现在不需要我出马了</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_t_t_master1.ntk_23_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_t_t_master1.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Students! Where are my precious students?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">What's going on here?!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Karadoma...Lagia...Evilplate Monk...Narapa…Obi…Phirocha…Kualpie…Raileternity...Raileternity…?!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">同学们！我珍贵的学生在哪儿？</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">现在是怎么回事？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_t_t_master1.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_t_t_master1.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Dear Student: Please be careful when you explore the corridors. Be safe! Evil spirits are all around.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pelajar… semuanya kembali ke tempat semula… jangan berlari di lorong…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">亲爱的学生：在走廊闲逛时要小心安全，注意邪灵正在到处游荡！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_t_t_master1.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_t_t_master1.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ah! I need all necessary data information stored and encrypted in the Cassette! There are also documents like diaries that would help me understand how the chaos began!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">This video Cassette is locked!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Where is the key? I believe it is in the 3rd Classroom of the Second Year Corridors.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Please be discreet while traversing the eerie hallways!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ah..data…kalau diolah akan menjadi informasi</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau begitu…dokumen, jurnal….tape!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tape…ada Recording tape..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tapi terkunci</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kuncinya….</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Angkatan ke….2..kelas…3</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jangan berlari…di koridor….</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">啊…资料…资料加了些情报了…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">那么…文件,日志…带子!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">带子…有录影带…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">但是锁住了</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">钥匙呢…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">2年…3…班</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">不要在走廊上奔跑</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_t_t_master1.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_t_t_master1.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">This is the key!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Why is it bent out of shape? We need to fix it first. Someone in the 7th Class of the Second Year Batch can have this key fixed.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Student! Please visit him and get this key fixed! Don't run around in the hallway!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Take Care!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kunci…kuncinya….</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Benar kunci ini tapi…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jadi bengkok….</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kunci ini…jangan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Harus saya betulkan…kepada Zopar…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sekarang mungkin..kelas dua…7…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jangan….berlari…di koridor…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">钥匙…钥匙…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这钥匙没错,但是…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">但是…弯曲了</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这把钥匙..不行</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">要修理才行…给工友…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">现在的话…2年…7…班</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">不要在走道上奔跑</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_t_t_master1.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_t_t_master1.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Oh! Here's the Cassette!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Please use it properly and take good care of it.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">This is a very important clue in our investigation that can help us unlock the mystery of all this chaos.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tape..ini…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Semuanya…tertulis..di sini</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sudah pasti..semuanya…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya mohon…kami….</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jangan berlari…di koridor….</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">带子…这里…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这里…都…拍了</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">分明…都…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">拜托..我们…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">不要在走廊上奔跑</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_t_t_master1.ntk_7_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_t_t_master1.ntk_8_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Crystal! Hmm...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">What happened here?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">This isn't right! How did the Administration Office become this way? Where are the teachers? Everyone disappeared!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">S..phere…ohok ohok!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ohok! Ohok!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Di, di sini…sebenarnya apa yang terjadi?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Eh, kenapa School Admin. Office kacau begini?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tadi kamu bilang para guru ada di mana?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">珠…珠子…叩…叩!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">抠搂! 抠搂!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这,这里…到底发生什么事?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">不对啊, Administration Office怎么会变这样?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">教师们都到哪里去了?</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_t_t_master1.ntk_8_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Explain the Situation</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bercerita situasi sekarang</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">解释状况</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_t_t_master1.ntk_8_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Request Information</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Meminta informasi</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">要求资料</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_t_t_master1.ntk_8_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_t_t_master1.ntk_9_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It's real!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The entire city was affected by the abnormal phenomenon. I hope this can be fixed somehow.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Begitu yah…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Karena bencana terjadi dan seluruh kota….</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Nggak, kalau maksudnya kejadian yang telah direncanakan itu, ini tidak akan selesai hanya dengan sebuah kota</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya berharap bukan kejadian itu tapi</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">真的这样…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这个发生异像的都市啊…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">不是啊,如果是之前的事情的话,不是只有一个都市毁灭而已</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">真希望不会发生那样的事</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_t_t_master1.ntk_9_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_work1.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Me</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">should</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">ruin the job</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">or correct it.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">A..ku…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pekerjaan….</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Dihancurkan ga yah…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Betulkan tidak yah?....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我该毁了这份差事呢？还是改善它呢？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_work1.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Request Key Repair</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Meminta memperbaiki kunci</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">要求修理钥匙</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_work1.ntk_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The ceiling collapsed, the deck also broken ...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The windows fell down ... What should be done first?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Atappun runtuh…meja-meja terbelah..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kaca jendela pecah….saya tidak tahu apa yang harus dilakukan lebih dulu….</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">天花板坍塌，桥面也断了......</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">窗户掉了下来......我应该先做些什么好呢？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_work1.ntk_1_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Request Key Repair</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Meminta memperbaiki kunci</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">要求修理钥匙</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_work1.ntk_1_1_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about Help that may be Needed</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya apakah ada yang bisa dibantu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问可能需要的帮助</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_work1.ntk_1_1_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Give the Towel</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menyerahkan Towel</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">交付 Towel</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_work1.ntk_1_1_4">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Give the Glove</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menyerahkan Gloves</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">交付 Glove</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_work1.ntk_10_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I'll bend it too much out of shape if I use too much force …</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Knowing the correct amount of pressure is very important.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tapi kalau terlalu kuat maka akan bengkok ke bagian sebaliknya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kontrol kekuatan dan letak adalah hal yang penting</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">如果我用太多的力量，它会变形得很严重。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">知道如何控制力量是非常重要的。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_work1.ntk_10_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_work1.ntk_11_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">.....4</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">.....4</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">.....4</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_work1.ntk_12_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Spider webs are the worst! And there are cracks in the wall, desk, and blackboard.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I don't even have my towel and gloves… How can I work like this?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kayaknya sarang laba-laba itu yang menjadi masalah atau dinding yang retak itu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Di meja di papan tulis</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">蜘蛛网是最糟糕的部分！还有出现裂缝的墙壁、书桌以及黑板。哎呀！我没有毛巾和手套！这要我怎么做事情？！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_work1.ntk_12_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_work1.ntk_13_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Emm…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Help me find it first.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Eh, aku tidak bisa bekerja karena handuk dan sarung tanganku hilang</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tentu…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">嗯~</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">请先帮我找来。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_work1.ntk_13_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_work1.ntk_14_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I think my towel is in the Locker on the 1st Floor. Will you help me by getting it?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I can find my gloves on my own.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tolong carikan dulu benda-benda itu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kayaknya saya meninggalkan handuk di loker di lantai satu, tolong carikan yah…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Aku akan mencoba mencari sarung tangan!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我想我的毛巾是放在1楼的 Locker。可以请您帮我拿来吗？手套的部分，我想我可以自己试试看的。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_work1.ntk_14_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_work1.ntk_15_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">....5</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">....5</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">....5</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_work1.ntk_16_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">This means that I've got to work hard.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I need my towel if I'm going to work comfortably.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">That's right.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Dan lagi tidak mungkin kan saya bekerja dengan tidak berkeringat…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Walau bagaimanapun juga harus dilap pake handuk baru bisa bekerja dengan tenang</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tentu saja!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这意思就是我必须要工作得非常努力。如果我想要顺利地进行工作，那就得先拿到毛巾。就是那样！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_work1.ntk_16_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_work1.ntk_17_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">But…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Can't find my gloves...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Think carefully. Yes, I placed them on the shelf in the shop house… Did I?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Help me find it!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tapi…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Soalnya aku masih belum bisa menemukan sarung tangannya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Setelah dipikir-pikir kayaknya saya meninggalkannya di rak toko</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tolong carikan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">但是，怎么到现在都还没找到手套…….</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">仔细想想，噢对了！我把它放在Shop House的架子上面了。对吧？请帮我找找，好吗？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_work1.ntk_17_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_work1.ntk_18_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">......6</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">......6</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">......6</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_work1.ntk_19_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Now you can go.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I can complete this by myself.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Bring this crystal to the Student Director.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I don't need it anymore.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kini kamu boleh pergi</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Aku bisa melakukan semuanya sendiri</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sphere ini…bawa dan perlihatkan kepada Student Director</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Karena aku tidak perlu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">您可以走了。我可以自己完成。请把这Crystal交给Student Director，现在我不需要它了。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_work1.ntk_19_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_work1.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_work1.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">So does it mean it has to be done first?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It doesn't need much time, and it's not too hard.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Just a slight press</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Yah…jadi harus melakukan itu dulu?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Itu tidak begitu sulit dan tidak memakan waktu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Cukup dengan menekannya sedikit saja</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">所以，这个是我们必须先完成的意思吗？</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">嗯，不需要花太多的时间，也不是很难。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">只需要轻轻按一下就可以。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_work1.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_work1.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I reorganized all the College's facilities on my own.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It's an easy job.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I just don't know where to start.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Aku bilang aku sudah menyiapkan peralatan yang dibutuhkan oleh sekolah ini sendirian</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau segini sih saya bisa membereskannya dengan cepat</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tapi saya tidak tahu harus mulai dari mana</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我一个人把学校的设备全部都整顿好了。其实很简单的，不过，我不知道该从那边下手。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_work1.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_work1.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ah, my towel.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Hmm, I can work really hard if I have a towel.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I need something to wipe off my sweat, you know?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You can't hold anything if your hands slip from getting all sweaty.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ah, handukku!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Iya…aku bisa bekerja semauku kalau ada handuk ini….</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bisa gawat kalau pada saat berkeringat tidak ada handuk untuk mengelap</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tidak bisa memegang apa-apa karena kalau dilap memakai tangan licin</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">噢！我的毛巾。嗯，如果我能拥有一条毛巾的话，我就会工作得更努力的。因为我现在没有可以擦汗的东西。如果手是滑滑湿湿的，就无法抓住东西。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_work1.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_work1.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Glove! My glove…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I can start working now!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Hmm, but where do I begin?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">What should I do first?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sarung tangan! Sarung tanganku!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Baru kinilah aku bisa mulai bekerja</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tapi..apa yang harus pertama kali saya lakukan?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Apa yang harus dilakukan lebih dulu…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">手套！我的手套！</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">现在我可以开始正常工作了！！</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">嗯，从何开始好呢？</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">现在我该先做什么呢？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_work1.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_work1.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">skip</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">skip</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_work1.ntk_7_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Begin</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">最初</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_work1.ntk_8_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">.....3</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">.....3</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">.....3</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_work1.ntk_9_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I need to understand how to put this together… The logo won't pop off with just a light press.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Don't force the crooked area. I feel like it will slightly bend in the reversed direction… Back into shape.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tapi tetap saja kalau ditekan terlalu lemah tidak akan ada bekasnya jadi harus ditekan sedikit lebih kuat.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jangan menekannya di bagian yang bengkok tapi lengkungkan pada bagian sebaliknya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我需要知道如何把这个放在一起…… 绝不能让这个标识一下子轻按就被弹出来。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">弯曲的地方不要用力。我觉得在反方向的地方，它会变得弯曲.....一定要恢复原形。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_h_work1.ntk_9_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_industry_helper1.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I'm here to give support in students injured. Just tell me if there is anything I can help you.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya di sini untuk menolong orang - orang yang sakit. Katakan saja jika ada yang bisa dibantu.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我专门提供药物给学生。有什么需要我帮忙的，请尽管说，不用客气。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_industry_helper1.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Item Trade</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jual beli item</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">物品交易</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_industry_helper1.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Set as Starting Point</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menyimpan tempat awal</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">设为起点位置</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_industry_helper2.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Well, it has been a long time since I have last seen a human being.. Just tell me if you need anything.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Wah, sudah lama sekali saya melihat ada pelajar yang ke sini.. Katakan saja jika ada yang bisa dibantu.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">好久没见到人类了。有什么问题，请尽管来找我。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_industry_helper2.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Item Trade</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jual beli item</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">物品交易</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_infinitystairs.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Prepare your self or you'll regret it</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Siap - siap atau kamu akan menyesal.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">先做好完全准备，否则您会后悔的。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_infinitystairs.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Item Sale</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jual beli item</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">物品贩售</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Hey, newbie! Where do you belong?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I will give you a weapon which your circle uses. Tell me where you belong!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Extreme class also can use it. However, weapon would only be provided to a student who reached level 10. After that I will exchange it to a better weapon when you reach level 30, 50 and 70 so, don't forget to come and collect your weapon.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kamu pelajar baru yah? Dari jurusan apa?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya akan berikan senjata yang digunakan oleh jurusan kamu. Katakanlah kamu dari jurusan apa.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kelas extreme juga bisa menggunakannya. Tapi ingat ini hanya diberikan kepada mereka yang telah mencapai level 10.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">嘿，新生！你属于哪部门的？</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我会给你你部门里使用的武器。告诉我，你是终极部的也可以使用它。但是，武器将只提供给学生谁达到10级以上的人。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">当你达到30级，50级和70级时，我会再给您换个更好的武器，别忘了来拿你的武器。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Greet politely as a new member of Swordsman.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menyapa sebagai pelajar baru di swordsmans club</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">剑道部新成员向大家招呼！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_1_0_10">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask for a weapon for newbie.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Berkata bahwa kamu menginginkan senjata untuk pelajar baru</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">申请新手武器</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_1_0_11">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Greet politely as a new member of Assassin.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Greet as a new Assassin member</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">新忍术部成员进行礼貌的招呼</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_1_0_12">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Greet politely as a new member of Magician.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Berikan salam dengan sopan sebagai anggota baru Magician</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">作为一个魔术部的新成员有礼貌的打招呼.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Greet politely as a new member of Bralwer.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menyapa sebagai pelajar baru di brawler club</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我会给你，你的圈子使用的武器。告诉我，你是属于！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_1_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Greet politely as a new member of Archer.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menyapa sebagai pelajar baru di archery club</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">弓箭部新成员向大家招呼！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_1_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Greet politely as a new member of Shaman.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menyapa sebagai pelajar baru di shaman club</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">至尊级的也可以使用它。然而，武器将只提供给学生谁达到10级后，我会当你达到30级，50和70，因此换到一个更好的武器，别忘了来拿你的武器。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_1_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Greet politely as a new member of Scientist.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menyapa sebagai pelajar baru di science club</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">新超能部成员进行礼貌的招呼</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_1_0_6">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Tell him you are a new member of Extreme Class Swordsman.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Memberitahukan bahwa kamu adalah pelajar bari di kelas extreme swordsman</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">告诉他，您是终极部的剑道高手。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_1_0_7">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Tell him you are a new member of Extreme Class Brawler.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Memberitahukan bahwa kamu adalah pelajar bari di kelas extreme brawler</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">告诉他，您是终极部的格斗高手。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_1_0_8">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Tell him you are a new member of Extreme Class Archer.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Memberitahukan bahwa kamu adalah pelajar bari di kelas extreme archery</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">告诉他，您是终极部的弓箭高手。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_1_0_9">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Tell him you are a new member of Extreme Class Shaman.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Memberitahukan bahwa kamu adalah pelajar bari di kelas extreme shaman</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">告诉他，您是终极部的气功高手。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">If you are at Lv. 30 or higher and a new student then I can give you a weapon that would suit you.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya bisa memberikan senjata yang sesuai dengan latihan kamu bila kamu pelajar baru dan sudah mencapai level 30</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">新生的等级需为30级或30级以上，才能得到合适的武器唷。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_1_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I wanna weapon for a Sowrdsman which would suit me.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menginginkan senjata yang sesuai dengan latihan swordsman</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我想要适合我的剑道部专用武器。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_1_1_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I wanna weapon for a Brawler which would suit me.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menginginkan senjata yang sesuai dengan latihan brawler</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我想要适合我的格斗部专用武器。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_1_1_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I wanna weapon for a Archer which would suit me.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menginginkan senjata yang sesuai dengan latihan archery</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我想要适合我的弓箭部专用武器。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_1_1_4">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I wanna weapon for a Shaman which would suit me.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menginginkan senjata yang sesuai dengan latihan shaman</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我想要适合我的气功部专用武器。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_1_1_5">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I wanna weapon for a Scientist which would suit me.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menginginkan senjata yang sesuai dengan latihan science</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我想要适合我的超能部专用武器。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_1_1_6">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I wanna weapon for a Assassin which would suit me.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya weapon Assassin yang tepat</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我想要适合我的忍术部专用武器。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_1_1_7">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I wanna weapon for a Magician which would suit me.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya menginginkan senjata untuk Magician yang sesuai untuk saya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我想要一个适合我的魔术师的武器.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_1_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Are you a new student?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kamu pelajar baru?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">您是新生吗？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_1_2_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Listen to his story</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mendengarkan cerita</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">听取他的故事</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_10_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">...</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_11_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Maximizing the three force in slumber and the power of sorcery that trancends the time and space are the final destination of Shaman training. Everything starts with a staff.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tujuan akhir dari pengasahan shaman adalah untuk meningkatkan kekuatan ilmu gaib yang melebihi tiga energi dan ruang waktu yang terpendam</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">能够唤醒世界的沉睡，并超越时空间的强大咒语时气功部最终的研磨目标。气功部的基本功就从‘棒子’开始练起吧！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_11_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Receive a common type 'Staff'</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mendapatkan Common wand</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">领取一般型 'Staff'</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_11_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_12_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I can see that you've gotten stronger and will need a new weapon soon. Once you reach Lv. 30, 50 and 70, come back to me to exchange your weapon. Also, you know that it is not possible to exchange while you are equipping it, right?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau dilihat dari kemampuan kamu kayaknya kamu butuh senjata yang baru. Setelah mencapai level 30, 50, 70 datang lagi ke sini dan aku akan berikan senjata yang diinginkan. Tahu kan kalau senjata yang sedang dipakai tidak bisa ditukarkan?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我可以看到你已经变得更强大了，很快就会需要新的武器。一旦你到达30，50和70级时，请回到我身边来交换你的武器。另外，退还或更换是不可以的。知道吗？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_12_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Exchange for a Lv. 30 'Staff'</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tukar dengan Lv. 30 'Staff'</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">兑换 Lv. 30 'Staff'</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_12_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Exchange for a Lv. 50 'Staff'</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tukar dengan Lv. 50 'Staff'</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">兑换 Lv. 50 'Staff'</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_12_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Exchange for a power type spear.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tukar dengan power type spear.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">兑换 power type spear.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_12_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Exchange for a spirit type staff.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tukar dengan spirit type staff.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">兑换 spirit type staff.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_12_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Exchange for a dex type lance.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tukar dengan a dex type lance.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">兑换敏捷类型的Lance.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_12_0_6">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_13_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">...</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_14_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The reaseon why Scientist group uses gun is to suppress the enemy at instant. What type of weapon do you need?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Penggunaan gun bagi science club baru berarti kalau dia bisa mengontrol musuh dengan cepat. Butuh senjata apa?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">超能部用枪是为了要迅速压制敌人。您要哪种武器呢？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_14_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Gun DEX type.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Gun dari DEX</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">枪支-敏捷型</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_14_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Gun Power type.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Railgun dari POW</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">枪支-力量型</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_14_0_3">
