    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_20_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The basic of Assassination is to defeat a target without knowing that he or she already defeated the target. Therefore, it all starts with how to be the expert of training level weapon</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tugas Assassin adalah mengalahkan musuhnya tanpa diketahui. Kemampuan menggunakan senjata menjadi rahasianya.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">忍术部是利用固定石力量和自古流传下来的法术，在任何情况下都可以制服敌人的超强人气职业。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_20_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Dex Type "Dual Spear"</VALUE>
