    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_juniorteacher.ntk_21_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I can see that you need new weapon now. When you have reached level 30, 50 or 70 come back to me for a weapon. Remember you cannot trade the weapon while you are equipping it.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">I can see that you need new weapon now. When you have reached level 30, 50 or 70 come Kembali to me for a weapon. Remember you cannot trade the weapon while you are equipping it.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我可以看到你已经变得更强大了，很快就会需要新的武器。一旦你到达30，50和70级时，请回到我身边来交换你的武器。另外，退还或更换是不可以的。知道吗？</VALUE>
