  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_new_cdm_event.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">CDM Honor Award is given to the top 5 clubs which get the highest contribution point.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Bring the medal to me! I’ll exchange it to various items.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Exchangeable items are planning to be changed according to season.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">CDM Honor Award diberikan kepada 5 klub dengan kontribusi point tertinggi.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bawakan ke saya dan akan saya tukar dengan item menarik.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Item akan berubah setiap waktu.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">CDM荣誉奖励只颁发给5个得到最高贡献点数的组织。把勋章交给我，我可以兑换成许多好道具。道具种类每期更换一次。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_new_cdm_event.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
