  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_new_cdm_helper.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Welcome to Club Death Match~!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I am dispatched CDM Execution Agent from Saint Foundation for CDM’s operation.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Check your items before enter battle map~!!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Selamat Datang di Club Death Match~!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya adalah CDM Execution Agent dari Saint Foundation untuk mengaktifkan CDM.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Periksa item kamu sebelum masuk ke dalam~!!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">欢迎来到组织生死斗CDM！</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我被圣财团派遣来管理CDM的事情。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">进去战区之前，请先查看物品是否有备齐唷！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_new_cdm_helper.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Sales</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Penjual</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">销售</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_new_cdm_helper.ntk_1_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Multi Gate</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Multi Gate</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">多功能大门</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_new_cdm_helper.ntk_1_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Safe Zone and Battle Zone</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Safe Zone dan Battle Zone</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">安全区和战斗区</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_new_cdm_helper.ntk_1_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Battle Rule</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Peraturan Battle</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">战斗规则</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_new_cdm_helper.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Multi gate is newly developed gate moving method by Foundation.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Step up on the gate~! You can see more than one moving places.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Can you feel your battle will be changed according to your choice?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Multi Gate adalah Gate baru yang dibuat oleh Foundation.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Berdiri di atasnya~! Kamu akan mempunyai beberapa pilihan gerbang.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Dapatkah kamu merasakan battle yang akan terjadi ke depannya?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">多功能大门是财团最新研发的移动门。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">试试看吧！您可以看到不止一处的移动点。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">能想象您所选择战场的新变化吗？^^</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_new_cdm_helper.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_new_cdm_helper.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The place where you are standing is Safe zone.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You can’t attack other characters in this area.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">See the gate behind you.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You can move to battle zone through the gate.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">GO! Go for it!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ini adalah Safe zone.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kamu tidak dapat menyerang pemain lagin di area ini.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lihat Gerbang di belakangmu.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kamu dapat ke zona battle melalui itu.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pergi dan Menangilah!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">您的所在位置是安全地带。所以在这里您无法攻击其他角色。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">看看您身后的大门，您可以通过这道门前往战斗区。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">去吧！挑战您的极限！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_new_cdm_helper.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_new_cdm_helper.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Listen, I’ll give you brief guide about battle rule.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You can get points by killing opponent club member. On the contrary, you lose points when your club member is killed.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The club which gets the highest point at the end of battle will be a winner team.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">How easy it is~!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ah~ if you keep stay in safe zone for a certain time, you will be compulsorily moved to battle zone. Don’t forget it~!!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Dengar, Saya akan memberitahu peraturan battle.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kamu akan mendapat point ketika membunuh anggota klub lain. Sebagai gantinya, kamu akan kehilangan point ketika klub member kamu dibunuh.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Klub dengan point tertinggi akan menjadi pemenang ketika selesai.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Gampang bukan~!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ah~ Kalau kamu terus - terusan berdiri di safe zone, kamu akan otomatis pindah ke battle zone. Jangan lupakan itu~!!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">仔细听好，我将为您进行简单的战场规则解说。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">杀死敌方组织的成员可以获得分数。相反地自身队伍成员若是被杀死，将会失去分数。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">战斗结束前，得到最高分的组织将成为胜利者。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">很简单吧？！</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">噢！若您一直待在安全地区，那么超过一段时间后，您将会被强制移动至战斗区，请别忘记这点唷。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_new_cdm_helper.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_new_cdm_helper1.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I feel good after change battle ground~ What are you here for?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya berasa baik setelah pertarungan di Battleground~ Apa yang kamu inginkan?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我蛮喜欢战场的变化~不过您来这里是？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_new_cdm_helper1.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about CDM Honor Award.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang CDM Honor Award.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问关于CDM Honor Award.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_new_cdm_helper1.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about Honor Award Trade list.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang daftar Honor Award Tukar.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问关于Honor Award的交易名单</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_new_cdm_helper1.ntk_1_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Tell her that you want to exchange Honor Award.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Katakan padanya kamu ingin menukar Honor Award.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">告诉她，您想交换Honor Award。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_new_cdm_helper1.ntk_10_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Choose a class for item exchange. (20 Honor Awards)</VALUE>
