    <VALUE Lang="cn">有什么不对劲的吗？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_nin_hd.ntk_1_1_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about Saint List</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tanyakan tentang Saint List</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问圣徒列表</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_nin_hd.ntk_1_1_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about Saint List</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tanyakan tentang Saint List</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问圣徒列表</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_nin_hd.ntk_1_1_4">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about Saint List</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tanyakan tentang Saint List</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问圣徒列表</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_nin_hd.ntk_1_1_5">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Tell what Dispatched agent said</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Beritahu apa yang dikatakan Agent Dispatched</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">传达 Dispatched agent的信息</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_nin_hd.ntk_1_1_6">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Report the training result</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Laporkan hasil latihan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回报修炼结果</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_nin_hd.ntk_1_1_7">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Report the training result</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Laporkan hasil latihan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回报修炼结果</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_nin_hd.ntk_1_1_8">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Hand over the Books</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Berikan Buku</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">交出资料册</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_nin_hd.ntk_1_1_9">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Train</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Latihan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">修炼</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_nin_hd.ntk_10_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Oh there is a good opponent!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The Skating Boys who always wander around in a group to threat the terrified people. You will be able to learn about the unnecessary movements you may have while defeating them. Go on!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Oh ada lawan yang bagus!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Skating Boy selalu hidup berkelompok untuk menganggu orang. Kamu akan belajar banyak dari mereka.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">最近商洞附近出现扰民的帮派分子Skating Boy。请帮忙消灭他们。去吧！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_nin_hd.ntk_10_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_nin_hd.ntk_11_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You sure have improved a lot compare to when you have just came to me but you still haven't fixed bad habits that create unnecessary movements.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I think you need more training so I recommend you to go defeat Bloody Mary who have gotten more violent.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kamu cukup baik. Namun masih banyak gerakan yang tidak perlu. Saya rasa kamu masih perlu sedikit latihan.. Saya menyarankan kamu mengalahkan Bloody Mary.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">您的实力比以前好太多了。不过攻击上的坏习惯以及不够熟练的动作都应该注意一下。只要继续修炼，我想是没问题的。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_nin_hd.ntk_11_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_nin_hd.ntk_12_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You must be really curious about what happened in Leonine Campus. I am sure you have no problem going into Leonine Campus for research now but the Dispatched Agent stationed there won't trust your ability….</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Oh, there is a way!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I heard there is a mutatant monster called Poison Ivy at Leonine Campus. Defeat a few of them and collect their hands made of bines then the agent will trust you.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kamu harus curiga dengan apa yang terjadi di Leonine Campus. Saya yakin kamu tidak memiliki masalah saat ini.. Namun agent kamu masih butuh suatu pembuktian.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Oh, ada sebuah jalan!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">看来您对Leonine Campus发生的事情很感兴趣。以您现在的实力，协助调查异变事件应该是没有问题的。不过负责调查案件的Dispatched Agent似乎不是很信任您。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">先这样吧！您先消灭Leonine Campus里的突变植物Poison Ivy ，并搜集牠们的藤蔓，让Dispatched Agent瞧瞧您的真金不怕火实力。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_nin_hd.ntk_12_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_nin_hd.ntk_13_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">My research book had been stolen. I have recorded the data of the unnatural happenings just before the phenomenon but the Freezing Clowns have took it. I was too naive and never imagined getting it stolen to them… I would like to go by myself but there is a very important task which Ryuin the Assassin Instructor has asked me to do so would you please get my book back?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Data penelitian saya telah dicuri oleh Freezing Clown. Saya sangat kesal ! Bisakah kamu membantu saya untuk mendapatkan data tersebut ?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">有一本记录异变事件前各种意象的手册。原本怕被偷走，每天小心翼翼地保管，但最后还是被一群捣蛋鬼给偷走了。不过因为忍术部老师交待我更重要的事情，所以我一时走不开。可以请您帮我找回来吗？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_nin_hd.ntk_13_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_nin_hd.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Us, assassins have known a bit more about the meteorite phenomenon that had happened 18 years ago. The director of Saint Foundation must have known about the relationship between our world and Another World. I heard that he once mentioned that the previously done acts of both sides of world will eventually effect the world of today.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kita, Para Assassin telah mengetahui sedikit tentang apa yang terjadi 18 tahun lalu. Saint Foundation telah mengetahui hubungan antara dunia kita dan dunia lain. Saya mendengar bahwa dia pernah mengatakan bahwa tindakan yang telah dilakukan di dunia lain</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">忍术部对于18年前的流星雨事件已略有所闻。理事长似乎开始在关注异世界与现实世界两边的变化了。这两边世界的战斗中所引起的异象，即将给我们带来前所未有的可怕灾难。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_nin_hd.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Continue the conversation.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjutkan percakapan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">继续听取对话</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_nin_hd.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The meteorite actually was something else…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The creatures from the Another World could not cross over to our world in its original form and it was divided into a transmittable form to cross over. Saint List was the list that contained the list of the people like us who came over in that form. That is why we are the only ones who could withstand the phenomenon.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Meteor itu sebenarnya memiliki energi yang lain...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Makhluk Mahkluk dari dunia lain sebenarnya tidak dapat menyebrang kesini dengan cara biasa. Orang orang seperti saya bisa bertahan terhadap meteor tersebut.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">整个事件就像流行雨引起的一样。因为不正常的东西是不可能穿越来到现实世界的。正因为如此，异世界的生命体才会变成寄生体。我们这些人的名字已经被记录在意见书里面了。所以我们一定可以平安度过这次的异变。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_nin_hd.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Continue the conversation</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjutkan percakapan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">继续听取对话</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_nin_hd.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I guess the Foundation wanted to gather students like us and prepare before the phenomenon hit the world…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It was the matter of survivor of our world and that is why they have done such things.. The adults are all the same..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya kira yayasan ingin mengumpulkan pelajar seperti kita dan mempersiapkan segala sesuatunya sebelum hal itu terjadi..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ini adalah masalah keselamatan dunia kita.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我猜这可能是要在发生异变时，为了方便我们聚在一起而作的准备。看来大家奋斗都是为了活下去。成人的世界也不就是这样子嘛~~!</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_nin_hd.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_nin_hd.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I see, so you would like to help the dispatched agent researching Leonine Campus but you are not strong enough.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ok! Don't worry! I will make sure to train you strong enough for Leonine Campus.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya tahu, Jadi kamu ingin membantu dalam penyelidikan Leonine Campus namun kamu belum cukup kuat.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ok! Jangan khawatir! Saya akan memberikan pelatihan kepadamu.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我很想要让您去支援Leonine Campus的调查工作，但您的实力还不够，所以先继续接受训练，会比较好。别担心！我保证让您好好接受训练，以后一定可以胜任调查工作的。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_nin_hd.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_nin_hd.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">How was your fight against the Skating Boys? Since you came back in one piece, I guess they were alright to fight against. If not then you must be already…. Never mind!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Okay, just don't get too confident over a few wins against the Skating Boys. They are the easiest targets you can face here.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bagaimana pelatihanmu dengan Skating Boy? Sejak kamu kebali, Saya menduga bahwa mereka menyerang kembali.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ok, Jangan terlalu percaya diri terhadap dirimu sendiri. Mereka mudah ditemukan disini.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这次的试炼感觉如何呢？看您平安归来，想必您的实力已经到了不错的水准。真为您感到骄傲。不过，别高兴得太早唷。这只是开胃菜，后面还有更刺激的呢！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_nin_hd.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_nin_hd.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Guess, it was not easy for you this time! It took longer than expected. But you are back safe so it must be worth it. Well, you should have learned to be more careful and be modest about your skills. Now you will be hard one to defeat for the mobs..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ini tidak mudah untukmu sekarang! Namun kamu kembali selamat. Kamu harus lebih banyak belajar !</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这次的任务对您来说似乎难度太高了。不过看您平安归来，我也放心了不少。记得下次不要太逞强，否则还会像这次一样，受重伤差点儿回不来呢。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_nin_hd.ntk_7_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_nin_hd.ntk_8_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Did you get my notebooks back from Freezing Clowns?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Thank you so much! I was so mad when these were stolen. I had such a hard time collecting these data. Thank you, I wouldn't need to do it all over again. If my books are helpful to resolve the sudden phenomenon then it would be all for you.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Apakah kamu berhasil mengambil itemku dari Freezing Clown? Terima kasih banyak ! Saya sangat marah saat item saya dicuri. Membutuhkan waktu lama untuk mengumpulkan data. Jika memang ini membantu, Saya turut senang!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">您从Freezing Clown找到我的笔记本了吗？真的很谢谢您。当初千辛万苦找到的资料被偷走时，还对您迁怒大小声….真抱歉。这次真是多亏了您的帮忙。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_nin_hd.ntk_8_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_nin_hd.ntk_9_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">As you may already know, it is essential for us the assassins to defeat an opponent quickly and precisely. In order to do that we must reduce the unnecessary movements.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The problem is that it really is hard to understand the unnecessary movements without actual field experiences. As all the people have different looks, each one has unique habit when performing a same skill and those habits create vulnerability. Therefore, field experiences are essential to find out what unnecessary movements they each have.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Seperti yang sudah kamu ketahui Assassin sangat cepat dalam mengalahkan lawannya. Kamu harus mengurangi gerakan gerakan yang tidak perlu.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kamu akan semakin terbiasa dengan latihan.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">迅速压制敌人的攻击是我们忍术部保命的动作。请记得要尽可能地让攻击动作更敏捷。不要光说不练，您一定要实际进行训练之后，才能真正发现自己的缺点。一粒米养百样人，您要想办法突破瓶颈，超越别人。快去接受能加强攻击的实际训练法吧。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_nin_hd.ntk_9_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">继续</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_nurse_sport.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Oh my goodness! Why are so many people injured?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Oh Tuhan! Mengapa banyak sekali yang terluka?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">噢！我的天啊！为何有那么多的人受伤呢？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_nurse_sport.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Trade Items</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jual beli item</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">交易物品</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_olympic.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">올림픽 주화를 모두 모아 오셨네요.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">모아오신 올림픽 주화를 모두 드리지는 못하고...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">기념하는 의미로 한개만 드릴께요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">하지만 이 주화는 18일이 지나면 사라지는 거라서 기념용이라고 하기에는 좀...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">한국이 획득할 거라고 예상되는 총 메달수가 적힌 티켓으로 바꾸셔서 보관하시는 게 좋을거예요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">올림픽 주화를 모두 모아 오셨네요.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">모아오신 올림픽 주화를 모두 드리지는 못하고...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">기념하는 의미로 한개만 드릴께요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">하지만 이 주화는 18일이 지나면 사라지는 거라서 기념용이라고 하기에는 좀...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">한국이 획득할 거라고 예상되는 총 메달수가 적힌 티켓으로 바꾸셔서 보관하시는 게 좋을거예요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">올림픽 주화를 모두 모아 오셨네요.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">모아오신 올림픽 주화를 모두 드리지는 못하고...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">기념하는 의미로 한개만 드릴께요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">하지만 이 주화는 18일이 지나면 사라지는 거라서 기념용이라고 하기에는 좀...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">한국이 획득할 거라고 예상되는 총 메달수가 적힌 티켓으로 바꾸셔서 보관하시는 게 좋을거예요</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_olympic.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">올림픽 주화를 전달한다.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">올림픽 주화를 전달한다.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">올림픽 주화를 전달한다.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_olympic.ntk_1_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">한국이 최종적으로 획득할 거라고 예상되는 메달의 수를 선택하세요</VALUE>
