    <VALUE Lang="cn">....</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_p_knight.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Give the stone in your hand to me.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It looks important, so let me have a look.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tangannya menggenggam batu yang aneh.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Memungutnya karena sepertinya itu item penting</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">请将石头交给我。它看似很重要，请让我瞧瞧。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_p_knight.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Give the Stone to the Police</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Membawa stone ke Polisi Station</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">将石头交给Police</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_p_knight.ntk_3_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Put the Stone Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mengembalikan stone ke tempat semula</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">将石头放回去</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_p_knight.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It feels like it just escaped from the passage.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">There is a mark on the skin.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It seems like it was caused by the cold air from some unknown place.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It looks like the 3rd passage and the Trading Hole passage have both been captured by beasts.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sama kayak melarikan diri dari dalam terowongan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bekas radang dingin yang tertinggal di kulit</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kayaknya dia menerima pengaruh udara dingin entah dari mana</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mungkin Tunnel No.3 juga sudah dikontrol oleh para monster sama seperti Trading Hole Tunnel</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">感觉好像从隧道逃出来的感觉。皮肤上留下了记号，不晓得是不是被某种强烈冷风吹倒的关系。看来3rd passage和 Trading Hole的隧道都一样被猛兽们给占领了。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_p_knight.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Confirm Tunnel</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Memeriksa tunnel</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">确认隧道</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_p_knight.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Please report who have died. Even the smallest detail needs to be reported.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Melaporkan bahwa ada seseorang yang mati dan juga menyerahkan stone yang dipungut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">请报告有哪些人被杀害了。务必仔细报告，不能省略任何一丁点细节。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_p_knight.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_p_knight.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It should be enough to prove to the beasts at the passage that we are stronger than them.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Just ignore their presence, and go through the passage.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Dengan membuktikan bahwa kamu lebih kuat dari monster-monster yang ada di dalam terowongan itu saja sudah cukup</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Diabaikan saja dan berkonsentrasi bagaimana caranya melewati terowongan.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">只要让隧道里的那些猛兽们知道，我们是比他们强的就行了。集中精神，无视它们的存在，直接通过隧道吧！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_p_knight.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_p_knight.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It feels like the pulse is weakening.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Knows how to fall, but not how to stand…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Masih ada denyut nadi yang benar-benar lemah</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mungkin dia akan bangun dengan sendirinya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">脉搏似乎越来越脆弱。躺下来容易，要起身却很吃力。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_p_knight.ntk_7_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_p_police.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It's too dangerous here.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Di sini sangat berbahaya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这里太危险了。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
