  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_p_police.ntk_1_0_28">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Report the Status</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang prison</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">报告结果</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_p_police.ntk_1_0_29">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Report the Status</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang prison</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">报告结果</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_p_police.ntk_1_0_30">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask if he is in a trouble</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tanya apa dia butuh bantuan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问他有何问题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_p_police.ntk_1_0_31">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Hand over the things found</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Berikan sesuatu yang ditemukan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">交出收集到的物品</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_p_police.ntk_1_0_7">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about What is Happening</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya ada apa</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问发生了何事？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_p_police.ntk_1_0_8">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Report Situation of Comrades</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Memberitahukan kondisi teman-teman</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">报告同伴的状况</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_p_police.ntk_1_0_9">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Report Main Culprit of Violence</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Memberitahukan pelaku kerusuhan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">报告有关暴动的主犯</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_p_police.ntk_10_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I also feel the same way. I'm just a policeman, but it's obvious that there's something extraordinary is happening inside. I can't tell what it is, but it's definitely not good.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya juga setuju dengan hal itu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya hanya bekerja sebagai penjaga saja tapi saya yakin bahwa di dalam sana ada sesuatu hal yang mencurigakan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sudah terjadi</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya tidak tahu apa itu dengan pasti, tapi itu bukanlah hal yang baik</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sudah pasti</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我也有同感！虽然只做过警察，但明眼人都知道，里面肯定在从事某种特别的工作。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我不确定是啥，但明显一定不是好事情。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_p_police.ntk_10_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_p_police.ntk_11_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Understood.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I might be the only one who understands that place's design.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Please first check out the places that I told you.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Baiklah</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mungkin saya adalah satu-satunya yang tahu tentang struktur tempat itu.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pertama selidiki dulu tempat yang saya beritahukan.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">了解！我不敢说我是最了解那个地方的人，但，先请您确认一下我说的那个地方的位置在哪儿唷。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_p_police.ntk_11_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_p_police.ntk_12_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The facilities nearby should be checked out.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">If the quake's source comes from beneath, obviously we have to enter the underground center to find out more...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">We should know after checking out a few places nearby.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Peralatan yang ada di sekitar sini sudah dikonfirmasikan rupanya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau ledakkan itu terjadi dari ruangan serba ada yang ada di bawah tanah kita harus mencoba kesana.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sepertinya ada sesuatu yang bisa kita ketahui…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kamu bisa tahu kan karena sudah p</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">附近的设施都要确认看看唷。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_p_police.ntk_12_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_p_police.ntk_13_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Now we should focus on investigating the underground facilities, and then we can start after preparing sufficient manpower and equipment. Let's go and confirm the facilities underground again.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next, we should investigate the Prison facility.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sekarang berkonsentrasi dulu untuk menyelidiki peralatan yang ada di atas tanah</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau peralatan dan tenaga kerjanya sudah cukup kita pergi ke bawah tanah untuk memeriksa fasilitas di sana</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Nah, selanjutnya kamu harus menyelidiki fasilitas tahanan di</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">现在打算优先集中调查地上的设施，并充分地准备人力和物资后，再来强化设施。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">现在，我们前往调查 Prison 的设施吧！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_p_police.ntk_13_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_p_police.ntk_14_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">There still aren't any reliable clues.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">After some investigation, it seems that only the convicts might be able to escape from the prison</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">There's no way to do it.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Even if we barely have any information, we still need to report this to the Trading Hole Police.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau begini terus mungkin kita tidak bisa menemukan petunjuk yang berguna</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Yang kita tahu hanya kemungkinan tentang para tahanan yang telah kabur ke suatu tempat</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mau bagaimana lagi.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kabar seperti inipun mau tidak mau harus disampaikan ke polisi d</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">尚未有可靠的线索。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">目前为止，我们只收到犯人可能越狱的路线情报，不过，似乎不是很准确。即使是这样，我们还是先报告给Trading Hole Police一下吧！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_p_police.ntk_14_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_p_police.ntk_15_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I heard that the students are quite cautious.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Thank you for your help…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Whatever happened definitely wasn't normal. How many were killed?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I will seek revenge for my friends, even if I have to die.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">That is my destiny.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">See you...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kamu juga kayaknya hati-hati…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya merasa berterimakasih juga karena kamu peduli dengan hal itu, tapi...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kamu banyak dirugikan oleh kejadian yang tidak nyata setiap harinyakan?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Iya sih, kalau itu saya juga pasti saya mau membalaskan dendam teman</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">听说学生们都很伤心。为了那件事情，您也伤透了脑筋，太感激您了。这些都是不合理的，我们死伤太过惨重。我一定要不顾一切为同伴们报酬，就算是牺牲我自己！这是我的命！</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我们日后有缘再见了。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_p_police.ntk_15_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_p_police.ntk_16_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">That glove is made from asbestos.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The shoes are also made of flame retardant material.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Usually, he isn't very reliable.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">This towel… Smells poisonous.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It smells like something is burning?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">So....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sarung tangan itu sudah dilaisi oleh asbes rupanya.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sepatunya juga sama, hanya bagian bawahnya yang sudah dilapisi asbes…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mereka yang tidak bisa memakain karena tidak nyaman rupanya.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Handuk…ini baunya parah sekali.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kayaknya ada bau hangus yang</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">那手套是用防火布做的呀？</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">鞋子也是用阻燃剂材质制成的….</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">嗯，通常他的话都不太可靠，这毛巾……味道好毒好臭，好像是烧焦的样子。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_p_police.ntk_16_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_p_police.ntk_17_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The mystery is solved.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The culprits are still inside.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It's the guard!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Teka-teki sudah terpecahkan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pelakunya sudah pasti ada di dalam sini</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Yaitu dia Prison Warden!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">谜底揭开了。犯人还在里面。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">没错！就是他- 警卫！！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_p_police.ntk_17_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_p_police.ntk_18_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">There's no way to capture it?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It won't be easy since it transformed into a monster.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">But now the spirits of the fallen police may rest.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It will be much easier now.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I represent the police in giving thanks to the students.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Thank you very much... Really, thank you all so much.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tidak mungkin bisa menangkapnya…kan?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mereka yang sudah berubah menjadj monster pasti tidak patuh dan mau tertangkap</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pokoknya wasiat dari polisi yang meninggal telah terkabulkan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Barulah kini bisa beristirahat dengan tenang.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sebagai sesama pol</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">没有办法逮捕吗？</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">变成怪物的那个生物，是不会乖乖束手就擒的。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">虽然牺牲了警察的遗书，但问题因而解决，也算是大功一笔。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我是以警察的身份，向同学们致谢的！非常感激您。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_p_police.ntk_18_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_p_police.ntk_19_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I just returned.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">A criminal passed by just now, and I caught him.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I have some pieces, this weird stuff…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Though, we have to see it completely to find out...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It's obvious that it has the same logo as the government.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I don't know whether this has bigger implications.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Can you help me find the other pieces?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kebetulan kamu datang.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Baru saja saya menangkap kriminal yang lewat.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mereka membawa potongan seperti ini rupanya.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kita bisa tahu kalau melihat keseluruhannya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya yakin ini adalah lambang pemerintahan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我刚回来了。先前有犯人经过，我逮捕了他之后，将这些奇怪的碎片一起带在身上。虽然需要完整的物体才好判断，不过，跟政府标识是大同小异的。您能帮忙把剩余的碎片找回来吗？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_p_police.ntk_19_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_p_police.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">There was a sudden explosion, and the people... Something weird happened to them!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It almost seems natural for the criminals to have become more violent.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Even the police and watchmen's power increased.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tiba-tiba tanah bergetar dan orang-orang menjadi aneh</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Para tahanan sudah menimbulkan kerusuhan dan kekacauan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Para polisi di sana telah bersekongkol dengan para kriminal</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Benar-benar porak poranda</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">突然间一声巨响，人们全部的变的像神经病一样了。犯人毫无秩序地掀起暴动，连警察和警卫的力量也跟着变大了。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_p_police.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_p_police.ntk_20_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Can you show me where?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">This.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Hmm...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It's fake.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">When you first see it and it's undamaged, you wouldn't be able to discern whether it's fake or not</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You did well to figure it out, but you were also able to tell it was fake because it was in such a broken condition.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Coba tolong perlihatkan.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ini…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Begitu yah…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ini adalah palsu.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kamu tidak akan mengira bahwa ini palsu kalau kamu melihat bentuk keseluruhannya untuk pertama kali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sudah dibuat dengan sangat baik tapi karena sobek seperti ini kita bisa melihat</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">请给我看一下好吗？</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这个啊！嗯… 原来是它~ 它是假的啊！！</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">第一次看到这种东西，只要是没损坏处的，基本上是很难分辨真伪的。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">不过，这个已经有不少的撕裂处，照例来说应该要能看出破绽才是。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_p_police.ntk_20_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_p_police.ntk_21_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Actually, the certificate surface requires some stacked negatives.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It'll be too troublesome to reject them.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Please report this to the Trading Hole Police.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Soalnya pada sertifikat ini seharusnya ada beberapa lembar film yang menempel.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tapi kalau sampai hal-hal seperti ini berkeliaran biasa gawat</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tolong beritahukan Certificate ini ke Polisi Station</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">本来这证明书在表面上是有几张底片重叠的。所以您若要退还的话，太麻烦了！</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">还是请您先向Trading Hole Police报告一声吧！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_p_police.ntk_21_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_p_police.ntk_22_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">A prison run by a Financial Group. Isn't it strange?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Even if it is recognized internationally, it's still a little weird.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">If it weren't for my duties being assigned to this place, then I never would have come.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It was the first time I've been in such a bad environment that all I thought about was escape.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I think I saw some strange creature before I got out.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ah, it's not the right time.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Please report the Prison's current state to the Trading Hole police.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sejak awal aneh sekali kan kalau sebuah Yayasan mengoperasikan penjara seperti ini</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Meskipun sudah mendapatkan pengakuan internasional tapi saya tetap tidak mengerti</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya disini hanya untuk memenuhi jam kerja saya tapi</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pasti tidak akan mau datang</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">一个财团会经营这种监狱，不是很奇怪吗？就算是有国籍的认证，还是很让人难以理解。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我会在这里一直服务的，但平常是绝对不会任意进到这里。因为这里是我生平第一次看到气氛如此差的地方。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">逃脱之前，我还抓到一个很奇怪的生物，噢… 现在时间还没到。请您帮忙把监狱的现况告诉给Trading Hole police好吗？谢谢。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_p_police.ntk_22_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_p_police.ntk_23_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Oh, you mean this box?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">This is the only thing that remains after escaping the prison.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I had no idea it was like that…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">But it has been very helpful.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I think it has to do with something that is locked on the 2nd floor.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It can be opened as long as you find the key and CD. Do you need any help?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ah, maksudnya kotak ini rupanya.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pada saat keluar dari prison saya berusaha untuk tidak menghilangkan ini.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya tidak tahu kenapa begitu tapi….</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pokoknya karena kotak ini setidaknya bisa menerima bantuan kan?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Masalahnya satu dari dua sistem kea</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">您指的是这个箱子吗？在逃脱时，只有这个没有遗失，虽不知道为何会那样，但托这个箱子的福，我得了不少的帮助唷。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">现在问题是被锁在2楼的东西，只要您拿到钥匙和CD的话，就可以打开它。愿意帮忙吗？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_p_police.ntk_23_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Promise</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menerima</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">答应</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_p_police.ntk_23_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Decline</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menolak</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">拒绝</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_p_police.ntk_24_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">As long as you have the key and CD, it will be alright.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Besides us, it's guarded by former guards of the Citizens Company.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You can find it from them.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Asal ada kunci dan CD saja</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Selain kami juga para Private Guard yang bersama kami</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Karena sedang menyimpannya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kamu akan bisa mendapatkanya dari mereka.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">只要有钥匙和CD就可以了。除了我们之外，曾经在一起的Citizens Company警卫室那儿，应该也是可以找找看唷。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_p_police.ntk_24_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_p_police.ntk_25_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Thank you very much.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I can help you shortly.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Benar-benar terimakasih…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kini saya bisa memberikan bantuan walaupun sedikit</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">非常感谢！相信过没多久，我很快就可以报答您了。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_p_police.ntk_25_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_p_police.ntk_26_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It's a mutated ore found near the prison.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It's rarely seen.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You can find the broken stone at the Ore Mine which is between the prison fences.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Batu itu….</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Iya saya pernah melihatnya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Yang ditemukan di sekitar prison ini</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Katanya..batu yang mutan?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pokoknya langka deh</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau kamu pergi ke pertambangan yang ada di daerah pagar prison</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kamu akan bisa melihat potongan-potongannya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这是在监狱附近发现到的变种怪石。这种石头不常见，到监狱栅栏旁边的Ore Mine矿山去的话，还可以看到碎石唷。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_p_police.ntk_26_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_p_police.ntk_27_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Thank you for your help in the investigation. There's still a small matter of collecting a few important items that will be needed. I hope you may be able to help me find them.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Terimakasih sekali sudah membantu penyelidikan seperti ini. Bukannya hal lain tapi ada beberapa item yang dibutuhkan untuk penyelidikan, bisa tolong cari item itu?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">感谢您如此的大力协助我们调查。关于调查，还有一件小事。我们需要几样必需品，您能帮忙找来吗？谢谢。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_p_police.ntk_27_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_p_police.ntk_28_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Thanks to you, the investigation is running smoothly.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Terimakasih.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Terimakasih itu sudah banyak membantu penyelidikan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">谢谢。托您的福，调查工作进行得很顺利。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_p_police.ntk_28_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_p_police.ntk_29_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Please get a weapon there.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I know about the place that hides weapons.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Semakin waktu berlalu bahaya yang ada semakin besar</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sepertinya kita harus meningkatkan ketertiban umum.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Meskipun saya tidak punya hak untuk memutuskan hal seperti itu, tapi saya kan tidak bisa membiarkan senjata-senajat itu begitu saja</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kayaknya m</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">请把武器拿来好吗？</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我知道有个地方藏有武器唷。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_p_police.ntk_29_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Agree</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menerima permintaan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">同意</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_p_police.ntk_29_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ignore</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menolak permintaan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">拒绝</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_p_police.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">There's no way to guard the prison. I wanted to run away to the Trading Hole.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It slowly dawned on me that I was the only one left.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">My whole body was trembling and I didn't want to even think about going inside.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya mencoba untuk kabur ke Trading Hole karena sudah tak bisa lagi menjaga Prison</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Setelah saya sadar hanya ada saya sendiri di sini</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ditambah lagi saya sudah tidak mau masuk ke sana karena seluruh badan saya terluka</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tidak ingat.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">实在无法继续保卫监狱了，很想要逃往 Trading Hole那儿。当天亮清醒后，我才发现我是一个人。整身肮脏邋遢的，真的不想再进去里头了。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_p_police.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_p_police.ntk_30_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Good luck!!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Berhati-hatilah</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">祝您好运。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_p_police.ntk_30_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ignore</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">拒绝</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_p_police.ntk_31_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I am worried that if the rioting prisoners might escape from the prison because of the chaos created by the Phenomenon. We must stop the riot before they escape but we have left all the armors and weapons inside… I know it is not easy but would you please go find them inside the prison?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya khawatir tentang keributan yang terjadi di Prison. Kita harus menghentikannya, namun kami semua meninggalkan senjata di dalam.. Saya tahu ini tidak mudah.. Maukah kamu mengambil senjata tersebut di dalam Prison ?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我很担心，如果囚犯暴动的话，很有可能会从监狱里逃走。我们必须要阻止这事情发生。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">但在慌乱中，我们没能把盔甲和武器带走。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我知道这不容易，但能不能请您去监狱里，把它们拿出来呢？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_p_police.ntk_31_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_p_police.ntk_32_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Good! It may not be possible to defeat all the prisoners but it will be possible to stop them from esacping from the prison.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bagus! Ini tidak akan mudah. Namun kita dapat menghentikan mereka dengan cara ini.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">真的很谢谢您。虽然没法整个平定暴动，但至少能够阻止他们从监狱里逃出来。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_p_police.ntk_32_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_p_police.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The student is from the Sacred Financial Group college.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Well, do you want to listen to my request?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kamu Pelajar dari Yayasan saint kan?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau begitu bisa tolong kabulkan permintaan saya?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">您是Sacred Financial Group的学院生吗？</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">那么，愿意听一下我的请求吗？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_p_police.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Reply</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menerima permintaan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">愿意</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_p_police.ntk_4_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Resists</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menolak permintaan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">拒绝</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_p_police.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Please help my friends...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I don't know if we're too late.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Please...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I remember that it's near the Main Gate.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tolong selamatkan teman-teman saya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya tidak tahu sudah berapa lama waktu berlalu tapi</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mungkin masih belum terlambat</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tolong yah</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Seingat saya di daerah sekitar Main Gate</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">请救救我的同僚，不晓得过了多少时间了，希望不会太迟。拜托拜托！！！</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我记得是在大门附近…….</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_p_police.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_p_police.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">We're too late.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Do you still want to try?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Please listen… I still need you to help me.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">My friends were killed by those scumbags. Please find the culprit so he can be punished!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">…Sudah terlambat rupanya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tapi saya masih punya sedikit harapan…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tolong lakukan satu saja permintaan saya.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Karena makhluk seperti apa teman-teman saya harus mati….</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tolong temukan pelakunya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">太迟了吗？即使如此，想不想再试试？学生，还有一件事情，请听我说好吗？我的同僚因为某个家伙的关系，遭到了凶狠的杀害，请您帮我找出主嫌，可以吗？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_p_police.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_p_police.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">쮁┳짩퇱툹쿽閑좥쨓랫줄쫇閑?좥지킡촑㏀윰갠ず㉵...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">쩑㏀ず?짵좥㉩τ㉵밴쫇ㄳ쩳?좥쿽퀿촑㏀춏ヴ캵ず좥㉲쩈좥춏쨛ㅯ좧</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Karena tidak ada yang melewati tempat ini mungkin masih ada di dalam sana.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Itu adalah hal yang harus aku kerjakan tapi…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Aku minta bantuan pada kamu karena tidak mungkin melakukan hal itu dengan kemampuan saya ini.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Dan..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Harus hati-hati.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">쮁┳짩퇱툹쿽閑좥쨓랫줄쫇閑?좥지킡촑㏀윰갠ず㉵...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">쩑㏀ず?짵좥㉩τ㉵밴쫇ㄳ쩳?좥쿽퀿촑㏀춏ヴ캵ず좥㉲쩈좥춏쨛ㅯ좧</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_p_police.ntk_7_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_p_police.ntk_8_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I can't understand it…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Even if it were just a mere psychological illness, this should never have happened...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Right?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Well, I guess I don't know for sure.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya tidak bisa mengerti</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Hal seperti ini tidak akan terjadi karena orang gila biasa.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Nggak begitu yah?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Nggak, mungkin itu memang hal yang sudah ditentukan…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我无法理解，因为是单纯的精神病患，应该不会发生这种事情的。不是吗？唉…… 希望真的没事啊！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_p_police.ntk_8_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_p_police.ntk_9_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Even the police are starting to rebel.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">No matter how you look at it, it's not normal.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I heard that the Trading Hole police are alright, aren't they?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Please you should report this to them.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I don't know what else is happening. I need to wait for my orders here.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sampai-sampai yang namanya polisi membuat kerusuhan seperti itu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Walau bagaimanapun juga ini tidak normal</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tadi kamu bilang kalau Polisi Station masih selamat kan?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pergi ke sana dan beritahu mereka apa yang terjadi di sini.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya akan menunggu d</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">连警察都造反了！天啊！</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">无论是谁，应该都知道这是不正常的现象吧！听说 Trading Hole 的警察局还安然无恙。请您去告诉他们。我呢，就继续留守在这儿。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_p_police.ntk_9_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
