  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_s_medic_1.ntk_10_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Looks like you delivered the medicine safely.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It wasn't easy, was it?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">We'll be able to save a lot of lives with that medicine.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">If the road that leads to our hospital hadn't been blocked, this wouldn't have been necessary.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sudah menyerahkan obat-obatan itu dengan selamat rupanya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Susahkan?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tapi ada banyak orang yang selamat berkat obat-obatan itu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Andai saja jalan yang menuju rumah sakit kami tidak terhalang pasti tidak akan begini….</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">看来你平安无事地把药品送过去了</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">很辛苦吧?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">但是多亏那些药品, 才可以拯救很多人的性命.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">如果前往我们医院的路没有被堵住的话,就不会有这种事了</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_s_medic_1.ntk_10_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_s_medic_1.ntk_11_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You came just in time. Here, this is the medicine I've prepared, so please be sure that you bring it to where it needs to go, okay?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Untung sekali karena tadi saya khawatir karena walau bagaimanapun juga kita pasti butuh obat-obatan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya sudah menyiapkan obat-obatan yang diperlukan tolong serahkan yah</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bahaya kayaknya…hati-hati yah</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">你来的正好…我正担心那里可能需要一些药品</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这些是已经准备好的药品,还麻烦你送过去</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">路上小心喔</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_s_medic_1.ntk_11_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_s_medic_1.ntk_12_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It seems to me that you knew that this was inevitable. That's why you're telling me this in advance.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kebetulan sekali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kami juga mempelajari pembuatan obat-obatan yang bisa digunakan pada situasi seperti ini baru beberapa waktu yang lalu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">刚好就是这样</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我们也是不久前才学到在这种情况下所能用的治疗剂制造方法</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_s_medic_1.ntk_12_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Request Antibiotic</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Meminta penawar Allergy</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">请求制造Antibiotic</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_s_medic_1.ntk_12_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_s_medic_1.ntk_13_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It seems to me that you knew that this was inevitable. That's why you're telling me this in advance.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Wah ternyata…. saya tidak mengira hal ini bisa terjadi seperti ini….rasanya kamu yang mengajari saya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这样看来... 感觉上你是知道会发生这样的事,才会预先告诉我的</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_s_medic_1.ntk_13_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_s_medic_1.ntk_14_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Sorry to keep you waiting.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">These raw materials can make quite a mess, but they're pretty effective.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Can you please wait for a while?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Terimakasih atas kerja kerasnya.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ini sedikit kotor…tapi bahan-bahan ini diperlukan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bisa tunggu sebentar?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">"辛苦了</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">虽然材料有点乱七八糟, 不过满有效果的.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">可以再等一下吗?"</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_s_medic_1.ntk_14_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Wait</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menunggu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">等待</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_s_medic_1.ntk_14_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_s_medic_1.ntk_15_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It's finished now. Here, take it! I think injecting this medicine should cause the patient to experience a full recovery. However, the victim's body has been sustaining this sickness for a long period of time, so I'd still advise him to and rest for the next few days.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ini, semuanya sudah selesai</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kamu bisa sembuh dengan total kalau menerima suntikkan ini</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tapi tolong sampaikan agar dia bisa istirahat dulu untuk beberapa lama karena dulu pernah memiliki penyakit</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这里, 都完成了</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">打了这一针, 很明显就会完全好了</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">但是因为病患已久所以为了安全起见请帮我跟他说短期内需要多加注意一下</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_s_medic_1.ntk_15_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_s_medic_1.ntk_16_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">....3</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">....3</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">....3</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_s_medic_1.ntk_17_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">게다가 그들에겐 제대로 '사고' 할 수 있는 능력 조차 없는 것 같더군요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">그에 비하면 난...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">게다가 그들에겐 제대로 '사고' 할 수 있는 능력 조차 없는 것 같더군요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">그에 비하면 난...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">게다가 그들에겐 제대로 '사고' 할 수 있는 능력 조차 없는 것 같더군요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">그에 비하면 난...</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_s_medic_1.ntk_17_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_s_medic_1.ntk_18_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">.....4</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">.....4</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">.....4</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_s_medic_1.ntk_19_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It's fortunate that I've retained my sanity. Um, but aside from my medical skills and knowledge, I can't... I can't recall much else. All I can do is take care of all this medicine here…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bisa menjaga kesadaran saja sudah untung, ingatan saya tentang semuanya sudah hilang kecuali tentang cara pengobatan.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya juga bertemu secara kebetulan beberapa hari yang lalu dan akhirnya tinggal di sini sambil membantu pengobatan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">虽然幸好还拥有理智但是除了医术之外我什么也不记得了</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">现在我能做的只有这件事情就是在这里管理药品</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_s_medic_1.ntk_19_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_s_medic_1.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">.....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">.....</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">.....</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_s_medic_1.ntk_20_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">.........9</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">.........9</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">.........9</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_s_medic_1.ntk_21_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Excuse me, but can you deliver the medicine over there for me?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Maaf, tapi apakah kamu mau membantu mengambilkan Medicines?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">不好意思,可以帮我把药品带过去吗</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_s_medic_1.ntk_21_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_s_medic_1.ntk_22_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">*Sigh* It’s unfortunate that I don't have any medicine ready. I need to get some ingredients from the Physics Teacher at Mystic Peak Small Square.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It's a hard task since that area is infested by weird dogs, but I'm confident that you can do this for me.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It's urgent that I make this medicine.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ah, kebetulan saya tidak punya obat-obatan itu, kita harus mendapatkannya dari 'Physics Teacher[MP]' yang ada di 'Mystic Peak Small Square'</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Di daerah sekitar sini ada anjing-anjing dan berbahaya tapi tetap tolong saya yah</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ini adalah obat-obatan yan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">啊, 我刚好还没准备好那些药品, 需要跟Mystic Peak Small Square的Physics Teacher拿取.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">周边虽然狗很多, 不过还是要麻烦你了.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">因为这些是很急的药品</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_s_medic_1.ntk_22_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_s_medic_1.ntk_23_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">....12</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">....12</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">....12</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_s_medic_1.ntk_24_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">This is the first time I've seen so many spores in one place.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">They're almost just like sand.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Hmm...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">These must be the spores that caused the allergy, right?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ini pertama kalinya saya melihat spora berkumpul sebanyak ini</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Seperti serbuk pasir?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Euhm…sakit karena alergi dari spora ini yah?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">第一次看见这么多孢子被捆在一起</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">一定很像沙粒</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">嗯.. 就是这孢子才造成过敏的吧?"</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_s_medic_1.ntk_24_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_s_medic_1.ntk_25_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">......13</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">......13</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">......13</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_s_medic_1.ntk_26_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Here are some of the materials that are needed to produce the antibiotic.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You can get all of these things nearby.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Can you help me collect these items?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Di sini</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ini adalah bahan-bahan yang dibutuhkan untuk membuat obat-obatan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bisa bantu saya untuk mengumpulkannya, karena itu bisa ditemukan di sekitar sini?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">这里是制造治疗剂时需要的材料,</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">是附近就可以求得的东西,可以帮我收集来吗</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_s_medic_1.ntk_26_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_s_medic_1.ntk_27_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I heard that this hospital also gets some support from the Sacred Financial Group.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I'm new here so I don't know much about the Sacred Financial Group, but I'm aware that their support enabled this hospital to improve as a facility and a work environment.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya pernah mendengar bahwa rumah sakit kami juga dibiayai oleh Yatasan Saint</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya kurang tahu karena baru mulai bekerja belum lama ini, tapi kalau saya dengarkan orang-orang merasa senang karena setelah Yayasan membantu, peralatan disini menjadi lebih</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">听说过我们的医院也是圣财团在支援。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我也是刚上任不久不是很清楚，据说自从财团支援后设施也变好，待遇也好多了。也有人说支援都市开发计画…是个好人不是吗</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_s_medic_1.ntk_28_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Don't you want to know why the Werewolf has become more vicious after the sudden phenomenon? I wonder what has effected the Werewolf like that. It will be possible by analyzing the blood sample of Werewolf… Would you please get me some blood sample?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tidakkah kamu mau tahu mengapa Werewolf menjadi lebih agresif ? Saya bingung apa yang membuatnya menjadi seperti itu... Saya butuh beberapa sample darah mereka. Bantulah saya untuk mengumpulkan beberapa sample..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">异变之后不知道为什么Werewolf变得非常凶暴。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我很想知道到底是什么原因让它们变成这样。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">如果有Werewolf的血液应该可以找到真正的原因...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">为了让调查顺利进行，请帮忙取得Werewolf的血液样本。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_s_medic_1.ntk_28_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_s_medic_1.ntk_29_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Thank you for helping me clear this!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Terima kasih telah membantu saya!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">谢谢您帮我清理这些。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_s_medic_1.ntk_29_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_s_medic_1.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">They started to appear not too long ago. At first there was only one, but then they rapidly multiplied.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I don't think they were capable of masterminding or carrying out that chaotic incident.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tiba-tiba muncul beberapa waktu yang lalu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Orang-orang yang pada awalnya hanya ada satu tiba-tiba menjadi berpuluh bahkan beratus-ratus</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">不久前突然出现</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">一开始只有1个，但瞬间增加了数十数百倍</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">不过我认为他们没有能力去制造混乱</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_s_medic_1.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_s_medic_1.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">의사 선생님께서 왕진중이시라 지금은 저 혼자 있지만...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">사실 저희 선생님도 저들과 같이 변형돼 버린 몸이세요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">의사 선생님께서 왕진중이시라 지금은 저 혼자 있지만...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">사실 저희 선생님도 저들과 같이 변형돼 버린 몸이세요</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">의사 선생님께서 왕진중이시라 지금은 저 혼자 있지만...</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">사실 저희 선생님도 저들과 같이 변형돼 버린 몸이세요</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_s_medic_1.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_s_medic_1.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Since you are able to make it all the way here, you should already have the basics covered.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">There's just two more things I want to teach you.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sudah datang kesini berarti kamu sudah mengetahui hal-hal dasarnya kan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Karena itu, saya akan memberitahukan 2 hal lagi</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">你会来到这里,应该知道基本的东西</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我只告诉你两件事情</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_s_medic_1.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_s_medic_1.ntk_5_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about Effects of Petrification</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang Flint Spark</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问 Petrification的效果</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_s_medic_1.ntk_5_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about Effects of Confusion</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya tentang Mental Storm</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问 Confusion的效果</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_s_medic_1.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I'm sorry that my memory still hasn't fully recovered yet.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I might end up helping or harming you with my medical skills. I hope you understand the risks.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mohon maaf, karena saya masih magang…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jika saya memberikan pengobatan, takutnya nanti malah memperparah lukanya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Guru saya sering berkata bahwa yang namanya ilmu pengobatan adalah pedang yang berbilah dua.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">不好意思,我的记忆还是不完整</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">现在帮你治疗的话,伤口说不定还会恶化</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_s_medic_1.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_s_medic_1.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Petrification makes the body like stone.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The victim is immobilized, but his Defense ironically increases.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ini bisa membuat tubuh menjadi sangat keras seperti batu dan hampir tidak bisa digerakan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tapi kekuatan bertahan juga bertambah sebesar itu</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">身体像石头一样几乎不能动的状态</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">但是防御力却上升</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_s_medic_1.ntk_7_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_s_medic_1.ntk_8_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">This condition is characterized by the victim getting very dizzy. The Attack and Accuracy Rate of the victim is reduced by half, making him weak against his enemies. The moment SP (Stamina Point) is consumed, the victim will be in grave danger.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Saya pikir kita bisa menyebutnya sebagai keadaan yang memusingkan</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sama halnya dengan kondisi pada saat stamina menurun, situasi dimana Hit Attack dan Rate menurun</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">可以解释为晕眩状态</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">命中率跟攻击力减半, 攻击状况变的困难, 精力会跟敌人当时的状态一样</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_s_medic_1.ntk_8_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_s_medic_1.ntk_9_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Not long ago I received the bleak news from the Physics Teacher from Phoenix Hole saying that there're insufficient supplies of First-Aid medicines.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">But my situation is similar to most other people; I can't leave the position at which I'm currently stationed.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tadi saya menerima kabar dari Physics Teacher[Phoenix] kalau obat-obatan darurat sedang kurang</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tapi saya juga tidak bisa pergi meninggalkan tempat ini seperti orang-orang lain</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">不久前接到位在Phoenix Hole的 Physics Teacher说急救药品不足的消息。但是我跟其他人一样，现在无法离开位子。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_s_medic_1.ntk_9_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_s_police_1.ntk_1_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">This tunnel has been listed as a dangerous area.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It's not safe to use the left road that goes through the tunnel, and using the exit to the right road that is also hazardous.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Terowongan ini memisahkan area yang berbahaya sehingga aksesnya dikontrol</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Dari sudut pandang saya, sebelah kiri adalah jalan untuk melalui Tunnel sementara sebelah kanan adalah tempat yang bisa didatangi setelah melewat Tunnel tapi tidak bisa dimasuki</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">本隧道列为危险地区 管制中</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">从我看的角度, 左边是要通过隧道的路, 右边呢, 虽然是可以经过隧道通过的路, 但是一条不能随便去的路</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_s_police_1.ntk_1_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask about Dangerous Tunnel</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya bahaya apa</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问关于危险的隧道</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_s_police_1.ntk_1_0_2">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask How to Pass Through</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Bertanya cara melewatinya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问该如何通过</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_s_police_1.ntk_1_0_3">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Pass Through the Tunnel</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Melewati Tunnel</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">穿越隧道</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_s_police_1.ntk_1_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Exchange for Police Emblem</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tukar dengan Polisi Emblem</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">兑换Police 徽章</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_s_police_1.ntk_1_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask if he has seen a party with a girl</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tanyakan apakah pernah melihat rombongan gadis</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问他是否有见到少女等一行人？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_s_police_1.ntk_1_0_6">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Ask Crusio's Lover's Whereabouts.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tanyakan Dimana Crusio's Lover</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">询问Crusio的爱人的下落</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_s_police_1.ntk_10_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Let me replace your 30 Police Emblem pieces with this newly repaired Police Emblem.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Perkenankan saya mengganti 30 Polisi Emblem kamu dengan Polisi Emblem baru ini.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">让我把这个新修好的Police Emblem来替换您的30个Police Emblem pieces。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_s_police_1.ntk_10_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Exchange for Police Emblem</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tukar dengan Polisi Emblem</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">交换警徽</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_s_police_1.ntk_11_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">You mean the party with a girl? Well, I remember giving warning to a party with two adults males and one girl who went towards trading Hole. Especially, the girl was really pretty.. Since you are a student of Saint, you will be able to find them in Trading Hole.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Maksudnya rombongan gadis itu? Walaupun sudah diperingati akan bahaya, namun ada 2 orang pria dan 1 orang gadis yang pergi ke Trading Hole. Gadis itu sungguh cantik. Dia adalah pelajar dari Yayasan Saint pergi dan cari ke Trading Hole</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">你的意思是派对女孩？嗯，我记得我有给过警告，有两名成人男性和一名少女前往Trading Hole。尤其是，这个女孩真的很漂亮...因为你是 Saint的学生，你一定能找得到他们的。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_s_police_1.ntk_11_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Backg</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_s_police_1.ntk_12_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">After thorough investigation, the woman did not get married after the incident and is now living alone. Who the strongest is does not matter to her.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Setelah penyelidikan diketahui bahwa perempuan itu tidak menikah setelah insiden tersebut dan sedang tinggal sendirian sekarang. Siapa yang terkuat tidak penting baginya.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">经过深入的调查, 那位妇女自从那个事件之后就没有结过婚, 一直是单身. 最强的是谁对她并不重要.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_s_police_1.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">The Crazy Dogs blocking the tunnel will attack anything that passes them.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">It'll be tough to deal with them since the gas pipe near the tunnel makes it too dangerous for anyone who intends to enter the tunnel. Sorry for this bad news!</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Katanya anjing-anjing gila menggigit binatang ataupun manusia yang melewati terowongan.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tadinya saya berniat untuk masuk tapi kondisi pipa gas yang ada di sekitar lorong tidak stabil sehingga tidak bisa masuk semiteman</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mohon maaf atas ketidak nyama</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">因为有Crazy Dogs挡在隧道，会撕咬经过的人或禽兽..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">虽然想要镇压，不过因为隧道附近有瓦斯管，处于不安全状态，是不能随便进去的。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">造成不便真抱歉。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_s_police_1.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_s_police_1.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">We've learned from investigations that people that have lost their sanity also wander the tunnels.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">There is also a Giant Shepherd that leads the tunnel's inhabitants.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Menurut penyelidikan di dalam Tunnel bukan hanya ada anjing-anjing tapi juga beberapa orang yang kehilangan akal</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Dan ternyata anjing serigala yang besar sedang mengontrol semuanya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">根据调查, 隧道里面不只有疯狗，还有几个发神经的人..</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">还有Giant Shepherd统治着他们。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_s_police_1.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_s_police_1.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Of course, we can't allow a normal resident to go through.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Only students from the Sacred Gate School are allowed to enter.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tentu saja warga biasa tidak boleh diizinkan masuk</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ada perintah untuk memberikan izin masuk kepada seluruh pelajar Yayasan Saint</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Mauklah ke lorong yang ada di sebelah kiri kalau di lihat dari sudut pandang saya</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">当然，我们不能让一般市民进去这里。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">如果是Sacred Gate School的学生，那就另当别论了。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_s_police_1.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_s_police_1.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">....3</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">....3</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">....3</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_s_police_1.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">If my analysis is correct, then the German Shepherd did something to control the other dogs.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Jika benar secara Zoological Analysis, Entah dengan suatu cara apa Wolf dog bisa mengatur tempat itu…</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">如果动物学分析够正确的话，一定是German Shepherd狼狗做了什么，才能够控制住其他家伙。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_s_police_1.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Next Page</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Lanjut</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_s_police_1.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">They recognized him as their master. I guess we need to do the same if we want to go through that tunnel.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Dengan cara membuat mereka sadar siapa tuan mereka</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kalau bisa seperti itu mungkin ke depannya akan mudah untuk lewat.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">牠们认出他是自己的主人。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我想如果我们想通过该隧道，我们也得需要做同样的事情。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_s_police_1.ntk_7_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_s_police_1.ntk_8_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">......4</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">......4</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">......4</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_s_police_1.ntk_9_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Take extra caution if you venture inside. Those monsters are bloodthirsty and will attack any living thing.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tapi harus hati-hati</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Orang-orang yang ada di dalam itu menyerang seolah-olah mereka sudah siap mati</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">要格外小心，如果你冒险进去。那些怪物都是嗜血的，会攻击任何活的东西。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_s_police_1.ntk_9_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
