  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_school_helper.ntk_10_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Character skill info can be checked by pressing 'K' button. Skills can be learned with skill scrolls sold by each guidance teacher and also learned skill can be assigned in quickslot by clicking it with left mouse button and drag to the slot or just by double clicking it.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Place mouse cursor on a monster then press assigned shortcut key(Numeric Keys) and then click monster with right mouse button to initiate the skill.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Character skill info can be checked by pressing 'K' button. Skills can be Pilihed with skill scrolls sold by each guidance teacher and also Pilihed skill can be assigned in quickslot by clicking it with left mouse button and drag to the slot or just by do</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">键盘 K 键可确认角色技能。技能可透过'技能文书'来学习。'技能文书'可向各部门的指导老师购买。学过的技能可设定在《技能快捷视窗》内。设定方法为：滑鼠左键点击技能拖拽至窗槽，或是直接右键点击技能两次即可。之后，请将滑鼠游标放在怪物身上，按下指定的快速键（数字键），并用滑鼠右键点击怪物来施展技能。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_school_helper.ntk_10_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回首页。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_school_helper.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">"First, confirm ""Main Centre"" written on the ground,</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">then go follow the arrow to enter Main Centre."</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">"Ikuti anak panah yang tersedia untuk sampai ke Main Centre."</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">首先，请确认写在地上的"Main Centre"字样，然后再顺着箭头进入"Main Centre"。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_school_helper.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回首页。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_school_helper.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Changing the view can be done by rolling the mouse wheel button for zooming and you can rotate the view point by pressing and holding the mouse wheel button.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Also, Up, Down, Left and Right button can be used to change the view point.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Untuk mengubah sudut pandang, gunakan scroll pada mouse untuk memperbesar atau memperkecil, atau tahan scroll pada mouse dan gerakkan untuk mengubahnya.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Juga, tanda panah di keyboard dapat digunakan untuk mengubah sudut pandang.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">可利用转动滑鼠滚轮来缩放游戏画面的视角。按住滑鼠滚轮再转动即可。另外，键盘的上，下，左，右按键也可拿来改变视角唷。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_school_helper.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回首页。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_school_helper.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Press 'M' button on your keyboard to turn on/off the Mini Map.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Click left mouse button and hold the bottom left corner of the Mini Map window and drag it to adjust Mini Map window size.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Click left mouse button on the place you wish to go to in the Mini Map, Character will start to move to the destination automatically.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tekan 'M' pada keyboard untuk menyalakan / mematikan fungsi map.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tekan dan tahan tombol kiri mouse di mini map untuk menyesuaikan ukurannya.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Tekan posisi yang diinginkan di map sehingga character akan pindah ke posisi tersebut secara otomatis.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">键盘 M 键可开启或关闭迷你地图。在迷你地图上面，点选想去的地方，角色就能按您的指示到达目的地。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_school_helper.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回首页。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_school_helper.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Quest window can be turned on/off by pressing 'T' button.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Double click the desired quest to see more detailed information.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Daftar Quest dapat dilihat dengan menekan tombol "T".</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Klik 2 kali di bagian quest tersebut untuk melihat lebih jelas.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">可利用键盘 T 键来开启或关闭任务视窗。在这您可确认更详细的资讯。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_school_helper.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回首页。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_school_helper.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Tips will be shown on top center of your screen.</VALUE>
