<SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="ep12_slayer_vendor.ntk_10_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Fierce battles keep occurring in Lost Island.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">They are having a hard time recently as Mutant Citizens suddenly appears too much. So can you help them to overcome this situation?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Sangat sulit untuk mencari cara menyerang di Lost Island karena serangan dari Mutant Citizen. Tolong bantu bunuh mereka sehingga populasinya berkurang dan kami dapat mencoba lagi.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">Lost Island上不停地发生激战，甚至还出现了许多突变的市民。您能帮帮他们度过这次的难关吗？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
<SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="ep12_slayer_vendor.ntk_10_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
<SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="ep12_slayer_vendor.ntk_2_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I have been investigating this area for a few days and I found out this place was hit by meteoric shower. Plus, I have an intel saying that there is a meteorite outputing powerful energy had fell here but could not be able to find it. I still need more clues.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Seteleh menyelidiki tempat ini selama beberapa hari, aku baru tahu kalau peristiwa hujan meteor itu dulu terjadi disini. Kabarnya batu yang berenergi tinggi juga jatuh di sekitar sini, tapi aku belum bisa menemukannya. Kita harus mengumpulkan petunjuk lai</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我这几天一直在调查这个区域，发现陨石雨曾降临于此地，且某颗拥有强大能量的陨石也跟着一起坠落在地面。但不管我怎么找就是找不到它。请给我点线索吧！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
<SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="ep12_slayer_vendor.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
<SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="ep12_slayer_vendor.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I found confidential documents about Research Complex and Power Plant. According to the documents, Dr. TK has constructed power plant to source the power for research complex. It may be a obvious info but please do convey it to 'Student Director (Dispatched)</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Dokumen rahasia tentang Saint power plant dan Saint research aku temukan disini. Menurut dokumen itu Professor Choi sudah membangun Pembangkit Tenaga Listrik di Saint reseach. Coba sampaikan informasi pendek ini kepada Student Director (Agen).</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我找到了关于Research Complex和Power Plant的机密文件。文件里头写着，Dr. TK创立power plant的目的是为了要供给能量给Research Complex。虽然这似乎不是什么很机密的消息，但还是得请您把这信息报告给Student Director (Dispatched)。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
<SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="ep12_slayer_vendor.ntk_3_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
<SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="ep12_slayer_vendor.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I found confidential documents about Research Complex and Power Plant. According to the documents, Dr. TK has constructed power plant to source the power for research complex. It may be a obvious info but please do convey it to 'Student Counselor</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Dokumen rahasia tentang Saint power plant dan Saint research aku temukan disini. Menurut dokumen itu Professor Choi sudah membangun Pembangkit Tenaga Listrik di Saint reseach. Coba sampaikan informasi pendek ini kepada School Life Guidance di School Plaza</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我找到了关于Research Complex和Power Plant的机密文件。文件里头写着，Dr. TK创立power plant的目的是为了要供给能量给Research Complex。虽然这似乎不是什么很机密的消息，但还是得请您把这信息报告给 Student Counselor。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
<SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="ep12_slayer_vendor.ntk_4_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
<SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="ep12_slayer_vendor.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Creatures mutated by virus are getting out of hands. It would cause a catastrophe if they manage to get out from Power Plant. Please take care of them before they get out. It would make the research of teachers and students here whole lot easier.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Makhluk hidup yang berubah karena virus semakin membahayakan. Hal yang tidak bisa kita bayangkan mungkin saja terjadi kalau mereka keluar dari Saint Power Plant. Tolong bunuh mereka sebelum mereka keluar dari sini. Dengan begitu investigasi yang kita laku</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">受病毒感染而突变的生命体越来越不受控制了。如果牠们从Power Plant逃脱的话，将会发生前所未有的大灾难。请好好看住他们，千万不要让它们逃走了。我们必须这么做，才能使师生们的研究生活变得更顺利。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
<SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="ep12_slayer_vendor.ntk_5_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
<SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="ep12_slayer_vendor.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Discovered very powerful human type creatures near Solar Power Facility. You must defeat them first in order to find a very important clue. I expect very strong resistance... I am worried because the student who went out to do this mission is not still back yet.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Ada spesies yang mirip manusia di sekitar Pembangkit Listrik Tenaga Surya. Kita harus membunuh mereka untuk menemukan petunjuk yang sangat penting. Pastilah tidak mudah untuk melawan mereka…aku jadi khawatir karena orang yang bisa membantu belum muncul.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我们发现在Solar Power Facility附近，居住着一群异形超人族。您必须先击败他们，才能寻找我们需要的重要线索。我想他们的防御力一定很强大，因为之前接过这个任务的学生们，到现在都还没回来……我真的很担心。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
<SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="ep12_slayer_vendor.ntk_6_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
<SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="ep12_slayer_vendor.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Long time ago, Dr. TK has forced an experiment on live bodies of the workers and people here soley for his ambition. Many people showed side effects but some had managed to escape and went back to their formal lives... Who is Nurse Trainee (Dispatched)??</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Professor Choi melakukan percobaan kepada orang-orang yang bekerja disini untuk memenuhi keinginan pribadinya. Banyak orang yang merasa dirugikan oleh kejadian ini, beberapa dari para korban juga berhasil melarikan diri. Mereka kembali ke tempat asal masi</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">很久很久以前，Dr. TK为了满足他的野心，曾强行把员工和平民抓来进行活人体实验。不少人出现了可怕的并发症，而有些人则是幸运地逃出来，现正过着正常生活呢。话说回来，谁是Nurse Trainee (Dispatched)呢？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
<SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="ep12_slayer_vendor.ntk_7_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Back</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">返回</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
<SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="ep12_slayer_vendor.ntk_8_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Creepy sound is coming from the top of the Forbidden Tower.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Due to the sound, many students can’t sleep well and suffer from nightmare.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Can you find what happens there?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Murid - murid tersiksa sekali dari teriakan di Forbidden Tower.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Pergi ke Forbidden Tower dan cari tahu apa penyebabnya lalu selesaikan lah.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">毛骨悚然的声音是从Forbidden Tower顶楼传来的。因为这可怕的声音，有很多学生都睡不好觉，每晚作噩梦。你可以找出里面的问题吗？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
<SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="ep12_slayer_vendor.ntk_8_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
<SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="ep12_slayer_vendor.ntk_9_0">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Assassins dispatched to Lost City and Industry Complex have a passionate discussion about deadly venom which it put on enemy’s weapon.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="GS">I can’t understand why they are so obsessed about it, but can you collect venom samples for them?</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Para Assassin sangat tertarik dengan Lost City karena racun yang ada di senjata para musuh. Kalahkan Scouter di Lost City dan Industry Complex lalu koleksi venom nya untuk diserahkan ke mereka.</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">忍者被派到Lost City和Industry Complex，反映了敌人武器上方竟沾有剧毒的液体。 我不懂为何大家都这么喜欢毒液。可以请您帮忍者们收集这些毒液的样本吗？</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
<SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="ep12_slayer_vendor.ntk_9_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="GS">Return</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="id">Kembali</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>

